धर्मज्ञश्च कृतज्ञश्च सत्यवाक्यो दृढव्रतः॥', 'ko nv asmin sāmprataṃ loke guṇavān kaś ca vīryavān
dharmajñaś ca kṛtajñaś ca satyavākyo dṛḍhavrataḥ', null, 1001002),
('ramayana-1-1-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 3', 'चारित्रेण च को युक्तः सर्वभूतेषु को हितः।
विद्वान्कः कः समर्थश्च कश्चैकप्रियदर्शनः॥', 'cāritreṇa ca ko yuktaḥ sarvabhūteṣu ko hitaḥ
vidvān kaḥ kaḥ samarthaś ca kaś caikapriyadarśanaḥ', null, 1001003),
('ramayana-1-1-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 4', 'आत्मवान्को जितक्रोधो द्युतिमान्कोऽनसूयकः।
कस्य बिभ्यति देवाश्च जातरोषस्य संयुगे॥', 'ātmavān ko jitakrodho dyutimān ko ''nasūyakaḥ
kasya bibhyati devāś ca jātaroṣasya saṃyuge', null, 1001004),
('ramayana-1-1-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 5', 'एतदिच्छाम्यहं श्रोतुं परं कौतूहलं हि मे।
महर्षे त्वं समर्थोऽसि ज्ञातुमेवंविधं नरम्॥', 'etad icchāmy ahaṃ śrotuṃ paraṃ kautūhalaṃ hi me
maharṣe tvaṃ samartho ''si jñātum evaṃvidhaṃ naram', null, 1001005),
('ramayana-1-1-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 6', 'श्रुत्वा चैतत्त्रिलोकज्ञो वाल्मीकेर्नारदो वचः।
श्रूयतामिति चामन्त्र्य प्रहृष्टो वाक्यमब्रवीत्॥', 'śrutvā caitat trilokajño vālmīker nārado vacaḥ
śrūyatām iti cāmantrya prahṛṣṭo vākyam abravīt', null, 1001006),
('ramayana-1-1-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 7', 'बहवो दुर्लभाश्चैव ये त्वया कीर्तिता गुणाः।
मुने वक्ष्याम्यहं बुद्ध्वा तैर्युक्तः श्रूयतां नरः॥', 'bahavo durlabhāś caiva ye tvayā kīrtitā guṇāḥ
mune vakṣyāmy ahaṃ buddhvā tair yuktaḥ śrūyatāṃ naraḥ', null, 1001007),
('ramayana-1-1-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 8', 'इक्ष्वाकुवंशप्रभवो रामो नाम जनैः श्रुतः।
नियतात्मा महावीर्यो द्युतिमान्धृतिमान्वशी॥', 'ikṣvākuvaṃśaprabhavo rāmo nāma janaiḥ śrutaḥ
niyatātmā mahāvīryo dyutimān dhṛtimān vaśī', null, 1001008),
('ramayana-1-1-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 9', 'बुद्धिमान्नीतिमान्वाग्मी श्रीमाञ्शत्रुनिबर्हणः।
विपुलांसो महाबाहुः कम्बुग्रीवो महाहनुः॥', 'buddhimān nītimān vāgmī śrīmāñ śatrunibarhaṇaḥ
vipulāṃso mahābāhuḥ kambugrīvo mahāhanuḥ', null, 1001009),
('ramayana-1-1-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 10', 'महोरस्को महेष्वासो गूढजत्रुररिंदमः।
आजानुबाहुः सुशिराः सुललाटः सुविक्रमः॥', 'mahorasko maheṣvāso gūḍhajatrur ariṃdamaḥ
ājānubāhuḥ suśirāḥ sulalāṭaḥ suvikramaḥ', null, 1001010),
('ramayana-1-1-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 11', 'समः समविभक्ताङ्गः स्निग्धवर्णः प्रतापवान्।
पीनवक्षा विशालाक्षो लक्ष्मीवाञ्शुभलक्षणः॥', 'samaḥ samavibhaktāṅgaḥ snigdhavarṇaḥ pratāpavān
pīnavakṣā viśālākṣo lakṣmīvāñ śubhalakṣaṇaḥ', null, 1001011),
('ramayana-1-1-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 12', 'धर्मज्ञः सत्यसंधश्च प्रजानां च हिते रतः।
यशस्वी ज्ञानसंपन्नः शुचिर्वश्यः समाधिमान्॥', 'dharmajñaḥ satyasaṃdhaś ca prajānāṃ ca hite rataḥ
yaśasvī jñānasaṃpannaḥ śucir vaśyaḥ samādhimān', null, 1001012),
('ramayana-1-1-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 13', 'रक्षिता जीवलोकस्य धर्मस्य परिरक्षिता।
वेदवेदाङ्गतत्त्वज्ञो धनुर्वेदे च निष्ठितः॥', 'rakṣitā jīvalokasya dharmasya parirakṣitā
vedavedāṅgatattvajño dhanurvede ca niṣṭhitaḥ', null, 1001013),
('ramayana-1-1-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 14', 'सर्वशास्त्रार्थतत्त्वज्ञ स्मृतिमान्प्रतिभानवान्।
सर्वलोकप्रियः साधुरदीनात्मा विचक्षणः॥', 'sarvaśāstrārthatattvajña smṛtimān pratibhānavān
sarvalokapriyaḥ sādhur adīnātmā vicakṣaṇaḥ', null, 1001014),
('ramayana-1-1-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 15', 'सर्वदाभिगतः सद्भिः समुद्र इव सिन्धुभिः।
आर्यः सर्वसमश्चैव सदैकप्रियदर्शनः॥', 'sarvadābhigataḥ sadbhiḥ samudra iva sindhubhiḥ
āryaḥ sarvasamaś caiva sadaikapriyadarśanaḥ', null, 1001015),
('ramayana-1-1-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 16', 'स च सर्वगुणोपेतः कौसल्यानन्दवर्धनः।
समुद्र इव गाम्भीर्ये धैर्येण हिमवानिव॥', 'sa ca sarvaguṇopetaḥ kausalyānandavardhanaḥ
samudra iva gāmbhīrye dhairyeṇa himavān iva', null, 1001016),
('ramayana-1-1-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 17', 'विष्णुना सदृशो वीर्ये सोमवत्प्रियदर्शनः।
कालाग्निसदृशः क्रोधे क्षमया पृथिवीसमः॥', 'viṣṇunā sadṛśo vīrye somavat priyadarśanaḥ
kālāgnisadṛśaḥ krodhe kṣamayā pṛthivīsamaḥ', null, 1001017),
('ramayana-1-1-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 18', 'धनदेन समस्त्यागे सत्ये धर्म इवापरः।
तमेवंगुणसंपन्नं रामं सत्यपराक्रमम्॥', 'dhanadena samas tyāge satye dharma ivāparaḥ
tam evaṃguṇasaṃpannaṃ rāmaṃ satyaparākramam', null, 1001018),
('ramayana-1-1-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 19', 'ज्येष्ठं श्रेष्ठगुणैर्युक्तं प्रियं दशरथः सुतम्।
यौवराज्येन संयोक्तुमैच्छत्प्रीत्या महीपतिः॥', 'jyeṣṭhaṃ śreṣṭhaguṇair yuktaṃ priyaṃ daśarathaḥ sutam
yauvarājyena saṃyoktum aicchat prītyā mahīpatiḥ', null, 1001019),
('ramayana-1-1-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 20', 'तस्याभिषेकसंभारान्दृष्ट्वा भार्याथ कैकयी।
पूर्वं दत्तवरा देवी वरमेनमयाचत।
विवासनं च रामस्य भरतस्याभिषेचनम्॥', 'tasyābhiṣekasaṃbhārān dṛṣṭvā bhāryātha kaikayī
pūrvaṃ dattavarā devī varam enam ayācata
vivāsanaṃ ca rāmasya bharatasyābhiṣecanam', null, 1001020),
('ramayana-1-1-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 21', 'स सत्यवचनाद्राजा धर्मपाशेन संयतः।
विवासयामास सुतं रामं दशरथः प्रियम्॥', 'sa satyavacanād rājā dharmapāśena saṃyataḥ
vivāsayām āsa sutaṃ rāmaṃ daśarathaḥ priyam', null, 1001021),
('ramayana-1-1-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 22', 'स जगाम वनं वीरः प्रतिज्ञामनुपालयन्।
पितुर्वचननिर्देशात्कैकेय्याः प्रियकारणात्॥', 'sa jagāma vanaṃ vīraḥ pratijñām anupālayan
pitur vacananirdeśāt kaikeyyāḥ priyakāraṇāt', null, 1001022),
('ramayana-1-1-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 23', 'तं व्रजन्तं प्रियो भ्राता लक्ष्मणोऽनुजगाम ह।
स्नेहाद्विनयसंपन्नः सुमित्रानन्दवर्धनः॥', 'taṃ vrajantaṃ priyo bhrātā lakṣmaṇo ''nujagāma ha
snehād vinayasaṃpannaḥ sumitrānandavardhanaḥ', null, 1001023),
('ramayana-1-1-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 24', 'सर्वलक्षणसंपन्ना नारीणामुत्तमा वधूः।
सीताप्यनुगता रामं शशिनं रोहिणी यथा॥', 'sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpannā nārīṇām uttamā vadhūḥ
sītāpy anugatā rāmaṃ śaśinaṃ rohiṇī yathā', null, 1001024),
('ramayana-1-1-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 25', 'पौरैरनुगतो दूरं पित्रा दशरथेन च।
शृङ्गवेरपुरे सूतं गङ्गाकूले व्यसर्जयत्॥', 'paurair anugato dūraṃ pitrā daśarathena ca
śṛṅgaverapure sūtaṃ gaṅgākūle vyasarjayat', null, 1001025),
('ramayana-1-1-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 26', 'ते वनेन वनं गत्वा नदीस्तीर्त्वा बहूदकाः।
चित्रकूटमनुप्राप्य भरद्वाजस्य शासनात्॥', 'te vanena vanaṃ gatvā nadīs tīrtvā bahūdakāḥ
citrakūṭam anuprāpya bharadvājasya śāsanāt', null, 1001026),
('ramayana-1-1-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 27', 'रम्यमावसथं कृत्वा रममाणा वने त्रयः।
देवगन्धर्वसंकाशास्तत्र ते न्यवसन्सुखम्॥', 'ramyam āvasathaṃ kṛtvā ramamāṇā vane trayaḥ
devagandharvasaṃkāśās tatra te nyavasan sukham', null, 1001027),
('ramayana-1-1-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 28', 'चित्रकूटं गते रामे पुत्रशोकातुरस्तदा।
राजा दशरथः स्वर्गं जगाम विलपन्सुतम्॥', 'citrakūṭaṃ gate rāme putraśokāturas tadā
rājā daśarathaḥ svargaṃ jagāma vilapan sutam', null, 1001028),
('ramayana-1-1-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 29', 'मृते तु तस्मिन्भरतो वसिष्ठप्रमुखैर्द्विजैः।
नियुज्यमानो राज्याय नैच्छद्राज्यं महाबलः।
स जगाम वनं वीरो रामपादप्रसादकः॥', 'mṛte tu tasmin bharato vasiṣṭhapramukhair dvijaiḥ
niyujyamāno rājyāya naicchad rājyaṃ mahābalaḥ
sa jagāma vanaṃ vīro rāmapādaprasādakaḥ', null, 1001029),
('ramayana-1-1-30', 30, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 30', 'पादुके चास्य राज्याय न्यासं दत्त्वा पुनः पुनः।
निवर्तयामास ततो भरतं भरताग्रजः॥', 'pāduke cāsya rājyāya nyāsaṃ dattvā punaḥ punaḥ
nivartayām āsa tato bharataṃ bharatāgrajaḥ', null, 1001030),
('ramayana-1-1-31', 31, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 31', 'स काममनवाप्यैव रामपादावुपस्पृशन्।
नन्दिग्रामेऽकरोद्राज्यं रामागमनकाङ्क्षया॥', 'sa kāmam anavāpyaiva rāmapādāv upaspṛśan
nandigrāme ''karod rājyaṃ rāmāgamanakāṅkṣayā', null, 1001031),
('ramayana-1-1-32', 32, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 32', 'रामस्तु पुनरालक्ष्य नागरस्य जनस्य च।
तत्रागमनमेकाग्रे दण्डकान्प्रविवेश ह॥', 'rāmas tu punar ālakṣya nāgarasya janasya ca
tatrāgamanam ekāgre daṇḍakān praviveśa ha', null, 1001032),
('ramayana-1-1-33', 33, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 33', 'विराधं राक्षसं हत्वा शरभङ्गं ददर्श ह।
सुतीक्ष्णं चाप्यगस्त्यं च अगस्त्य भ्रातरं तथा॥', 'virādhaṃ rākṣasaṃ hatvā śarabhaṅgaṃ dadarśa ha
sutīkṣṇaṃ cāpy agastyaṃ ca agastya bhrātaraṃ tathā', null, 1001033),
('ramayana-1-1-34', 34, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 34', 'अगस्त्यवचनाच्चैव जग्राहैन्द्रं शरासनम्।
खड्गं च परमप्रीतस्तूणी चाक्षयसायकौ॥', 'agastyavacanāc caiva jagrāhaindraṃ śarāsanam
khaḍgaṃ ca paramaprītas tūṇī cākṣayasāyakau', null, 1001034),
('ramayana-1-1-35', 35, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 35', 'वसतस्तस्य रामस्य वने वनचरैः सह।
ऋषयोऽभ्यागमन्सर्वे वधायासुररक्षसाम्॥', 'vasatas tasya rāmasya vane vanacaraiḥ saha
ṛṣayo ''bhyāgaman sarve vadhāyāsurarakṣasām', null, 1001035),
('ramayana-1-1-36', 36, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 36', 'तेन तत्रैव वसता जनस्थाननिवासिनी।
विरूपिता शूर्पणखा राक्षसी कामरूपिणी॥', 'tena tatraiva vasatā janasthānanivāsinī
virūpitā śūrpaṇakhā rākṣasī kāmarūpiṇī', null, 1001036),
('ramayana-1-1-37', 37, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 37', 'ततः शूर्पणखावाक्यादुद्युक्तान्सर्वराक्षसान्।
खरं त्रिशिरसं चैव दूषणं चैव राक्षसं॥', 'tataḥ śūrpaṇakhāvākyād udyuktān sarvarākṣasān
kharaṃ triśirasaṃ caiva dūṣaṇaṃ caiva rākṣasaṃ', null, 1001037),
('ramayana-1-1-38', 38, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 38', 'निजघान रणे रामस्तेषां चैव पदानुगान्।
रक्षसां निहतान्यासन्सहस्राणि चतुर्दश॥', 'nijaghāna raṇe rāmas teṣāṃ caiva padānugān
rakṣasāṃ nihatāny āsan sahasrāṇi caturdaśa', null, 1001038),
('ramayana-1-1-39', 39, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 39', 'ततो ज्ञातिवधं श्रुत्वा रावणः क्रोधमूर्छितः।
सहायं वरयामास मारीचं नाम राक्षसं॥', 'tato jñātivadhaṃ śrutvā rāvaṇaḥ krodhamūrchitaḥ
sahāyaṃ varayām āsa mārīcaṃ nāma rākṣasaṃ', null, 1001039),
('ramayana-1-1-40', 40, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 40', 'वार्यमाणः सुबहुशो मारीचेन स रावणः।
न विरोधो बलवता क्षमो रावण तेन ते॥', 'vāryamāṇaḥ subahuśo mārīcena sa rāvaṇaḥ
na virodho balavatā kṣamo rāvaṇa tena te', null, 1001040),
('ramayana-1-1-41', 41, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 41', 'अनादृत्य तु तद्वाक्यं रावणः कालचोदितः।
जगाम सहमारीचस्तस्याश्रमपदं तदा॥', 'anādṛtya tu tad vākyaṃ rāvaṇaḥ kālacoditaḥ
jagāma sahamārīcas tasyāśramapadaṃ tadā', null, 1001041),
('ramayana-1-1-42', 42, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 42', 'तेन मायाविना दूरमपवाह्य नृपात्मजौ।
जहार भार्यां रामस्य गृध्रं हत्वा जटायुषम्॥', 'tena māyāvinā dūram apavāhya nṛpātmajau
jahāra bhāryāṃ rāmasya gṛdhraṃ hatvā jaṭāyuṣam', null, 1001042),
('ramayana-1-1-43', 43, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 43', 'गृध्रं च निहतं दृष्ट्वा हृतां श्रुत्वा च मैथिलीम्।
राघवः शोकसंतप्तो विललापाकुलेन्द्रियः॥', 'gṛdhraṃ ca nihataṃ dṛṣṭvā hṛtāṃ śrutvā ca maithilīm
rāghavaḥ śokasaṃtapto vilalāpākulendriyaḥ', null, 1001043),
('ramayana-1-1-44', 44, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 44', 'ततस्तेनैव शोकेन गृध्रं दग्ध्वा जटायुषम्।
मार्गमाणो वने सीतां राक्षसं संददर्श ह॥', 'tatas tenaiva śokena gṛdhraṃ dagdhvā jaṭāyuṣam
mārgamāṇo vane sītāṃ rākṣasaṃ saṃdadarśa ha', null, 1001044),
('ramayana-1-1-45', 45, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 45', 'कबन्धं नाम रूपेण विकृतं घोरदर्शनम्।
तं निहत्य महाबाहुर्ददाह स्वर्गतश्च सः॥', 'kabandhaṃ nāma rūpeṇa vikṛtaṃ ghoradarśanam
taṃ nihatya mahābāhur dadāha svargataś ca saḥ', null, 1001045),
('ramayana-1-1-46', 46, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 46', 'स चास्य कथयामास शबरीं धर्मचारिणीम्।
श्रमणीं धर्मनिपुणामभिगच्छेति राघव।
सोऽभ्यगच्छन्महातेजाः शबरीं शत्रुसूदनः॥', 'sa cāsya kathayām āsa śabarīṃ dharmacāriṇīm
śramaṇīṃ dharmanipuṇām abhigaccheti rāghava
so ''bhyagacchan mahātejāḥ śabarīṃ śatrusūdanaḥ', null, 1001046),
('ramayana-1-1-47', 47, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 47', 'शबर्या पूजितः सम्यग्रामो दशरथात्मजः।
पम्पातीरे हनुमता संगतो वानरेण ह॥', 'śabaryā pūjitaḥ samyag rāmo daśarathātmajaḥ
pampātīre hanumatā saṃgato vānareṇa ha', null, 1001047),
('ramayana-1-1-48', 48, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 48', 'हनुमद्वचनाच्चैव सुग्रीवेण समागतः।
सुग्रीवाय च तत्सर्वं शंसद्रामो महाबलः॥', 'hanumadvacanāc caiva sugrīveṇa samāgataḥ
sugrīvāya ca tat sarvaṃ śaṃsad rāmo mahābalaḥ', null, 1001048),
('ramayana-1-1-49', 49, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 49', 'ततो वानरराजेन वैरानुकथनं प्रति।
रामायावेदितं सर्वं प्रणयाद्दुःखितेन च।
वालिनश्च बलं तत्र कथयामास वानरः॥', 'tato vānararājena vairānukathanaṃ prati
rāmāyāveditaṃ sarvaṃ praṇayād duḥkhitena ca
vālinaś ca balaṃ tatra kathayām āsa vānaraḥ', null, 1001049),
('ramayana-1-1-50', 50, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 50', 'प्रतिज्ञातं च रामेण तदा वालिवधं प्रति।
सुग्रीवः शङ्कितश्चासीन्नित्यं वीर्येण राघवे॥', 'pratijñātaṃ ca rāmeṇa tadā vālivadhaṃ prati
sugrīvaḥ śaṅkitaś cāsīn nityaṃ vīryeṇa rāghave', null, 1001050),
('ramayana-1-1-51', 51, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 51', 'राघवः प्रत्ययार्थं तु दुन्दुभेः कायमुत्तमम्।
पादाङ्गुष्ठेन चिक्षेप संपूर्णं दशयोजनम्॥', 'rāghavaḥ pratyayārthaṃ tu dundubheḥ kāyam uttamam
pādāṅguṣṭhena cikṣepa saṃpūrṇaṃ daśayojanam', null, 1001051),
('ramayana-1-1-52', 52, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 52', 'बिभेद च पुनः सालान्सप्तैकेन महेषुणा।
गिरिं रसातलं चैव जनयन्प्रत्ययं तदा॥', 'bibheda ca punaḥ sālān saptaikena maheṣuṇā
giriṃ rasātalaṃ caiva janayan pratyayaṃ tadā', null, 1001052),
('ramayana-1-1-53', 53, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 53', 'ततः प्रीतमनास्तेन विश्वस्तः स महाकपिः।
किष्किन्धां रामसहितो जगाम च गुहां तदा॥', 'tataḥ prītamanās tena viśvastaḥ sa mahākapiḥ
kiṣkindhāṃ rāmasahito jagāma ca guhāṃ tadā', null, 1001053),
('ramayana-1-1-54', 54, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 54', 'ततोऽगर्जद्धरिवरः सुग्रीवो हेमपिङ्गलः।
तेन नादेन महता निर्जगाम हरीश्वरः॥', 'tato ''garjad dharivaraḥ sugrīvo hemapiṅgalaḥ
tena nādena mahatā nirjagāma harīśvaraḥ', null, 1001054),
('ramayana-1-1-55', 55, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 55', 'ततः सुग्रीववचनाद्धत्वा वालिनमाहवे।
सुग्रीवमेव तद्राज्ये राघवः प्रत्यपादयत्॥', 'tataḥ sugrīvavacanād dhatvā vālinam āhave
sugrīvam eva tad rājye rāghavaḥ pratyapādayat', null, 1001055),
('ramayana-1-1-56', 56, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 56', 'स च सर्वान्समानीय वानरान्वानरर्षभः।
दिशः प्रस्थापयामास दिदृक्षुर्जनकात्मजाम्॥', 'sa ca sarvān samānīya vānarān vānararṣabhaḥ
diśaḥ prasthāpayām āsa didṛkṣur janakātmajām', null, 1001056),
('ramayana-1-1-57', 57, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 57', 'ततो गृध्रस्य वचनात्संपातेर्हनुमान्बली।
शतयोजनविस्तीर्णं पुप्लुवे लवणार्णवम्॥', 'tato gṛdhrasya vacanāt saṃpāter hanumān balī
śatayojanavistīrṇaṃ pupluve lavaṇārṇavam', null, 1001057),
('ramayana-1-1-58', 58, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 58', 'तत्र लङ्कां समासाद्य पुरीं रावणपालिताम्।
ददर्श सीतां ध्यायन्तीमशोकवनिकां गताम्॥', 'tatra laṅkāṃ samāsādya purīṃ rāvaṇapālitām
dadarśa sītāṃ dhyāyantīm aśokavanikāṃ gatām', null, 1001058),
('ramayana-1-1-59', 59, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 59', 'निवेदयित्वाभिज्ञानं प्रवृत्तिं च निवेद्य च।
समाश्वास्य च वैदेहीं मर्दयामास तोरणम्॥', 'nivedayitvābhijñānaṃ pravṛttiṃ ca nivedya ca
samāśvāsya ca vaidehīṃ mardayām āsa toraṇam', null, 1001059),
('ramayana-1-1-60', 60, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 60', 'पञ्च सेनाग्रगान्हत्वा सप्त मन्त्रिसुतानपि।
शूरमक्षं च निष्पिष्य ग्रहणं समुपागमत्॥', 'pañca senāgragān hatvā sapta mantrisutān api
śūram akṣaṃ ca niṣpiṣya grahaṇaṃ samupāgamat', null, 1001060),
('ramayana-1-1-61', 61, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 61', 'अस्त्रेणोन्मुहमात्मानं ज्ञात्वा पैतामहाद्वरात्।
मर्षयन्राक्षसान्वीरो यन्त्रिणस्तान्यदृच्छया॥', 'astreṇonmuham ātmānaṃ jñātvā paitāmahād varāt
marṣayan rākṣasān vīro yantriṇas tān yadṛcchayā', null, 1001061),
('ramayana-1-1-62', 62, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 62', 'ततो दग्ध्वा पुरीं लङ्कामृते सीतां च मैथिलीम्।
रामाय प्रियमाख्यातुं पुनरायान्महाकपिः॥', 'tato dagdhvā purīṃ laṅkām ṛte sītāṃ ca maithilīm
rāmāya priyam ākhyātuṃ punar āyān mahākapiḥ', null, 1001062),
('ramayana-1-1-63', 63, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 63', 'सोऽभिगम्य महात्मानं कृत्वा रामं प्रदक्षिणम्।
न्यवेदयदमेयात्मा दृष्टा सीतेति तत्त्वतः॥', 'so ''bhigamya mahātmānaṃ kṛtvā rāmaṃ pradakṣiṇam
nyavedayad ameyātmā dṛṣṭā sīteti tattvataḥ', null, 1001063),
('ramayana-1-1-64', 64, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 64', 'ततः सुग्रीवसहितो गत्वा तीरं महोदधेः।
समुद्रं क्षोभयामास शरैरादित्यसंनिभैः॥', 'tataḥ sugrīvasahito gatvā tīraṃ mahodadheḥ
samudraṃ kṣobhayām āsa śarair ādityasaṃnibhaiḥ', null, 1001064),
('ramayana-1-1-65', 65, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 65', 'दर्शयामास चात्मानं समुद्रः सरितां पतिः।
समुद्रवचनाच्चैव नलं सेतुमकारयत्॥', 'darśayām āsa cātmānaṃ samudraḥ saritāṃ patiḥ
samudravacanāc caiva nalaṃ setum akārayat', null, 1001065),
('ramayana-1-1-66', 66, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 66', 'तेन गत्वा पुरीं लङ्कां हत्वा रावणमाहवे।
अभ्यषिञ्चत्स लङ्कायां राक्षसेन्द्रं विभीषणम्॥', 'tena gatvā purīṃ laṅkāṃ hatvā rāvaṇam āhave
abhyaṣiñcat sa laṅkāyāṃ rākṣasendraṃ vibhīṣaṇam', null, 1001066),
('ramayana-1-1-67', 67, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 67', 'कर्मणा तेन महता त्रैलोक्यं सचराचरम्।
सदेवर्षिगणं तुष्टं राघवस्य महात्मनः॥', 'karmaṇā tena mahatā trailokyaṃ sacarācaram
sadevarṣigaṇaṃ tuṣṭaṃ rāghavasya mahātmanaḥ', null, 1001067),
('ramayana-1-1-68', 68, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 68', 'तथा परमसंतुष्टैः पूजितः सर्वदैवतैः।
कृतकृत्यस्तदा रामो विज्वरः प्रमुमोद ह॥', 'tathā paramasaṃtuṣṭaiḥ pūjitaḥ sarvadaivataiḥ
kṛtakṛtyas tadā rāmo vijvaraḥ pramumoda ha', null, 1001068),
('ramayana-1-1-69', 69, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 69', 'देवताभ्यो वरान्प्राप्य समुत्थाप्य च वानरान्।
पुष्पकं तत्समारुह्य नन्दिग्रामं ययौ तदा॥', 'devatābhyo varān prāpya samutthāpya ca vānarān
puṣpakaṃ tat samāruhya nandigrāmaṃ yayau tadā', null, 1001069),
('ramayana-1-1-70', 70, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 70', 'नन्दिग्रामे जटां हित्वा भ्रातृभिः सहितोऽनघः।
रामः सीतामनुप्राप्य राज्यं पुनरवाप्तवान्॥', 'nandigrāme jaṭāṃ hitvā bhrātṛbhiḥ sahito ''naghaḥ
rāmaḥ sītām anuprāpya rājyaṃ punar avāptavān', null, 1001070),
('ramayana-1-1-71', 71, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 71', 'प्रहृष्टमुदितो लोकस्तुष्टः पुष्टः सुधार्मिकः।
निरायमो अरोगश्च दुर्भिक्षभयवर्जितः॥', 'prahṛṣṭamudito lokas tuṣṭaḥ puṣṭaḥ sudhārmikaḥ
nirāyamo arogaś ca durbhikṣabhayavarjitaḥ', null, 1001071),
('ramayana-1-1-72', 72, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 72', 'न पुत्रमरणं के चिद्द्रक्ष्यन्ति पुरुषाः क्व चित्।
नार्यश्चाविधवा नित्यं भविष्यन्ति पतिव्रताः॥', 'na putramaraṇaṃ ke cid drakṣyanti puruṣāḥ kva cit
nāryaś cāvidhavā nityaṃ bhaviṣyanti pativratāḥ', null, 1001072),
('ramayana-1-1-73', 73, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 73', 'न वातजं भयं किं चिन्नाप्सु मज्जन्ति जन्तवः।
न चाग्रिजं भयं किं चिद्यथा कृतयुगे तथा॥', 'na vātajaṃ bhayaṃ kiṃ cin nāpsu majjanti jantavaḥ
na cāgrijaṃ bhayaṃ kiṃ cid yathā kṛtayuge tathā', null, 1001073),
('ramayana-1-1-74', 74, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 74', 'अश्वमेधशतैरिष्ट्वा तथा बहुसुवर्णकैः।
गवां कोट्ययुतं दत्त्वा विद्वद्भ्यो विधिपूर्वकम्॥', 'aśvamedhaśatair iṣṭvā tathā bahusuvarṇakaiḥ
gavāṃ koṭyayutaṃ dattvā vidvadbhyo vidhipūrvakam', null, 1001074),
('ramayana-1-1-75', 75, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 75', 'राजवंशाञ्शतगुणान्स्थापयिष्यति राघवः।
चातुर्वर्ण्यं च लोकेऽस्मिन्स्वे स्वे धर्मे नियोक्ष्यति॥', 'rājavaṃśāñ śataguṇān sthāpayiṣyati rāghavaḥ
cāturvarṇyaṃ ca loke ''smin sve sve dharme niyokṣyati', null, 1001075),
('ramayana-1-1-76', 76, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 76', 'दशवर्षसहस्राणि दशवर्षशतानि च।
रामो राज्यमुपासित्वा ब्रह्मलोकं गमिष्यति॥', 'daśavarṣasahasrāṇi daśavarṣaśatāni ca
rāmo rājyam upāsitvā brahmalokaṃ gamiṣyati', null, 1001076),
('ramayana-1-1-77', 77, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 77', 'इदं पवित्रं पापघ्नं पुण्यं वेदैश्च संमितम्।
यः पठेद्रामचरितं सर्वपापैः प्रमुच्यते॥', 'idaṃ pavitraṃ pāpaghnaṃ puṇyaṃ vedaiś ca saṃmitam
yaḥ paṭhed rāmacaritaṃ sarvapāpaiḥ pramucyate', null, 1001077),
('ramayana-1-1-78', 78, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 78', 'एतदाख्यानमायुष्यं पठन्रामायणं नरः।
सपुत्रपौत्रः सगणः प्रेत्य स्वर्गे महीयते॥', 'etad ākhyānam āyuṣyaṃ paṭhan rāmāyaṇaṃ naraḥ
saputrapautraḥ sagaṇaḥ pretya svarge mahīyate', null, 1001078),
('ramayana-1-1-79', 79, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 1, Verse 79', 'पठन्द्विजो वागृषभत्वमीयात्स्यात्क्षत्रियो भूमिपतित्वमीयात्।
वणिग्जनः पण्यफलत्वमीयाज्जनश्च शूद्रोऽपि महत्त्वमीयात्॥', 'paṭhan dvijo vāgṛṣabhatvam īyāt syāt kṣatriyo bhūmipatitvam īyāt
vaṇigjanaḥ paṇyaphalatvam īyāj janaś ca śūdro ''pi mahattvam īyāt', null, 1001079)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 2 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-2-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 1', 'नारदस्य तु तद्वाक्यं श्रुत्वा वाक्यविशारदः।
पूजयामास धर्मात्मा सहशिष्यो महामुनिः॥', 'nāradasya tu tad vākyaṃ śrutvā vākyaviśāradaḥ
pūjayām āsa dharmātmā sahaśiṣyo mahāmuniḥ', null, 1002001),
('ramayana-1-2-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 2', 'यथावत्पूजितस्तेन देवर्षिर्नारदस्तदा।
आपृष्ट्वैवाभ्यनुज्ञातः स जगाम विहायसं॥', 'yathāvat pūjitas tena devarṣir nāradas tadā
āpṛṣṭvaivābhyanujñātaḥ sa jagāma vihāyasaṃ', null, 1002002),
('ramayana-1-2-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 3', 'स मुहूर्तं गते तस्मिन्देवलोकं मुनिस्तदा।
जगाम तमसातीरं जाह्नव्यास्त्वविदूरतः॥', 'sa muhūrtaṃ gate tasmin devalokaṃ munis tadā
jagāma tamasātīraṃ jāhnavyās tv avidūrataḥ', null, 1002003),
('ramayana-1-2-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 4', 'स तु तीरं समासाद्य तमसाया महामुनिः।
शिष्यमाह स्थितं पार्श्वे दृष्ट्वा तीर्थमकर्दमम्॥', 'sa tu tīraṃ samāsādya tamasāyā mahāmuniḥ
śiṣyam āha sthitaṃ pārśve dṛṣṭvā tīrtham akardamam', null, 1002004),
('ramayana-1-2-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 5', 'अकर्दममिदं तीर्थं भरद्वाज निशामय।
रमणीयं प्रसन्नाम्बु सन्मनुष्यमनो यथा॥', 'akardamam idaṃ tīrthaṃ bharadvāja niśāmaya
ramaṇīyaṃ prasannāmbu sanmanuṣyamano yathā', null, 1002005),
('ramayana-1-2-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 6', 'न्यस्यतां कलशस्तात दीयतां वल्कलं मम।
इदमेवावगाहिष्ये तमसातीर्थमुत्तमम्॥', 'nyasyatāṃ kalaśas tāta dīyatāṃ valkalaṃ mama
idam evāvagāhiṣye tamasātīrtham uttamam', null, 1002006),
('ramayana-1-2-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 7', 'एवमुक्तो भरद्वाजो वाल्मीकेन महात्मना।
प्रायच्छत मुनेस्तस्य वल्कलं नियतो गुरोः॥', 'evam ukto bharadvājo vālmīkena mahātmanā
prāyacchata munes tasya valkalaṃ niyato guroḥ', null, 1002007),
('ramayana-1-2-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 8', 'स शिष्यहस्तादादाय वल्कलं नियतेन्द्रियः।
विचचार ह पश्यंस्तत्सर्वतो विपुलं वनम्॥', 'sa śiṣyahastād ādāya valkalaṃ niyatendriyaḥ
vicacāra ha paśyaṃs tat sarvato vipulaṃ vanam', null, 1002008),
('ramayana-1-2-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 9', 'तस्याभ्याशे तु मिथुनं चरन्तमनपायिनम्।
ददर्श भगवांस्तत्र क्रौञ्चयोश्चारुनिस्वनम्॥', 'tasyābhyāśe tu mithunaṃ carantam anapāyinam
dadarśa bhagavāṃs tatra krauñcayoś cārunisvanam', null, 1002009),
('ramayana-1-2-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 10', 'तस्मात्तु मिथुनादेकं पुमांसं पापनिश्चयः।
जघान वैरनिलयो निषादस्तस्य पश्यतः॥', 'tasmāt tu mithunād ekaṃ pumāṃsaṃ pāpaniścayaḥ
jaghāna vairanilayo niṣādas tasya paśyataḥ', null, 1002010),
('ramayana-1-2-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 11', 'तं शोणितपरीताङ्गं वेष्टमानं महीतले।
भार्या तु निहतं दृष्ट्वा रुराव करुणां गिरम्॥', 'taṃ śoṇitaparītāṅgaṃ veṣṭamānaṃ mahītale
bhāryā tu nihataṃ dṛṣṭvā rurāva karuṇāṃ giram', null, 1002011),
('ramayana-1-2-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 12', 'तथा तु तं द्विजं दृष्ट्वा निषादेन निपातितम्।
ऋषेर्धर्मात्मनस्तस्य कारुण्यं समपद्यत॥', 'tathā tu taṃ dvijaṃ dṛṣṭvā niṣādena nipātitam
ṛṣer dharmātmanas tasya kāruṇyaṃ samapadyata', null, 1002012),
('ramayana-1-2-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 13', 'ततः करुणवेदित्वादधर्मोऽयमिति द्विजः।
निशाम्य रुदतीं क्रौञ्चीमिदं वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'tataḥ karuṇaveditvād adharmo ''yam iti dvijaḥ
niśāmya rudatīṃ krauñcīm idaṃ vacanam abravīt', null, 1002013),
('ramayana-1-2-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 14', 'मा निषाद प्रतिष्ठां त्वमगमः शाश्वतीः समाः।
यत्क्रौञ्चमिथुनादेकमवधीः काममोहितम्॥', 'mā niṣāda pratiṣṭhāṃ tvam agamaḥ śāśvatīḥ samāḥ
yat krauñcamithunād ekam avadhīḥ kāmamohitam', null, 1002014),
('ramayana-1-2-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 15', 'तस्यैवं ब्रुवतश्चिन्ता बभूव हृदि वीक्षतः।
शोकार्तेनास्य शकुनेः किमिदं व्याहृतं मया॥', 'tasyaivaṃ bruvataś cintā babhūva hṛdi vīkṣataḥ
śokārtenāsya śakuneḥ kim idaṃ vyāhṛtaṃ mayā', null, 1002015),
('ramayana-1-2-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 16', 'चिन्तयन्स महाप्राज्ञश्चकार मतिमान्मतिम्।
शिष्यं चैवाब्रवीद्वाक्यमिदं स मुनिपुंगवः॥', 'cintayan sa mahāprājñaś cakāra matimān matim
śiṣyaṃ caivābravīd vākyam idaṃ sa munipuṃgavaḥ', null, 1002016),
('ramayana-1-2-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 17', 'पादबद्धोऽक्षरसमस्तन्त्रीलयसमन्वितः।
शोकार्तस्य प्रवृत्तो मे श्लोको भवतु नान्यथा॥', 'pādabaddho ''kṣarasamas tantrīlayasamanvitaḥ
śokārtasya pravṛtto me śloko bhavatu nānyathā', null, 1002017),
('ramayana-1-2-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 18', 'शिष्यस्तु तस्य ब्रुवतो मुनेर्वाक्यमनुत्तमम्।
प्रतिजग्राह संहृष्टस्तस्य तुष्टोऽभवद्गुरुः॥', 'śiṣyas tu tasya bruvato muner vākyam anuttamam
pratijagrāha saṃhṛṣṭas tasya tuṣṭo ''bhavad guruḥ', null, 1002018),
('ramayana-1-2-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 19', 'सोऽभिषेकं ततः कृत्वा तीर्थे तस्मिन्यथाविधि।
तमेव चिन्तयन्नर्थमुपावर्तत वै मुनिः॥', 'so ''bhiṣekaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā tīrthe tasmin yathāvidhi
tam eva cintayann artham upāvartata vai muniḥ', null, 1002019),
('ramayana-1-2-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 20', 'भरद्वाजस्ततः शिष्यो विनीतः श्रुतवान्गुरोः।
कलशं पूर्णमादाय पृष्ठतोऽनुजगाम ह॥', 'bharadvājas tataḥ śiṣyo vinītaḥ śrutavān guroḥ
kalaśaṃ pūrṇam ādāya pṛṣṭhato ''nujagāma ha', null, 1002020),
('ramayana-1-2-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 21', 'स प्रविश्याश्रमपदं शिष्येण सह धर्मवित्।
उपविष्टः कथाश्चान्याश्चकार ध्यानमास्थितः॥', 'sa praviśyāśramapadaṃ śiṣyeṇa saha dharmavit
upaviṣṭaḥ kathāś cānyāś cakāra dhyānam āsthitaḥ', null, 1002021),
('ramayana-1-2-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 22', 'आजगाम ततो ब्रह्मा लोककर्ता स्वयं प्रभुः।
चतुर्मुखो महातेजा द्रष्टुं तं मुनिपुंगवम्॥', 'ājagāma tato brahmā lokakartā svayaṃ prabhuḥ
caturmukho mahātejā draṣṭuṃ taṃ munipuṃgavam', null, 1002022),
('ramayana-1-2-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 23', 'वाल्मीकिरथ तं दृष्ट्वा सहसोत्थाय वाग्यतः।
प्राञ्जलिः प्रयतो भूत्वा तस्थौ परमविस्मितः॥', 'vālmīkir atha taṃ dṛṣṭvā sahasotthāya vāg yataḥ
prāñjaliḥ prayato bhūtvā tasthau paramavismitaḥ', null, 1002023),
('ramayana-1-2-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 24', 'पूजयामास तं देवं पाद्यार्घ्यासनवन्दनैः।
प्रणम्य विधिवच्चैनं पृष्ट्वानामयमव्ययम्॥', 'pūjayām āsa taṃ devaṃ pādyārghyāsanavandanaiḥ
praṇamya vidhivac cainaṃ pṛṣṭvānāmayam avyayam', null, 1002024),
('ramayana-1-2-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 25', 'अथोपविश्य भगवानासने परमार्चिते।
वाल्मीकये महर्षये संदिदेशासनं ततः॥', 'athopaviśya bhagavān āsane paramārcite
vālmīkaye maharṣaye saṃdideśāsanaṃ tataḥ', null, 1002025),
('ramayana-1-2-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 26', 'उपविष्टे तदा तस्मिन्साक्षाल्लोकपितामहे।
तद्गतेनैव मनसा वाल्मीकिर्ध्यानमास्थितः॥', 'upaviṣṭe tadā tasmin sākṣāl lokapitāmahe
tad gatenaiva manasā vālmīkir dhyānam āsthitaḥ', null, 1002026),
('ramayana-1-2-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 27', 'पापात्मना कृतं कष्टं वैरग्रहणबुद्धिना।
यस्तादृशं चारुरवं क्रौञ्चं हन्यादकारणात्॥', 'pāpātmanā kṛtaṃ kaṣṭaṃ vairagrahaṇabuddhinā
yas tādṛśaṃ cāruravaṃ krauñcaṃ hanyād akāraṇāt', null, 1002027),
('ramayana-1-2-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 28', 'शोचन्नेव मुहुः क्रौञ्चीमुपश्लोकमिमं पुनः।
जगावन्तर्गतमना भूत्वा शोकपरायणः॥', 'śocann eva muhuḥ krauñcīm upaślokam imaṃ punaḥ
jagāv antargatamanā bhūtvā śokaparāyaṇaḥ', null, 1002028),
('ramayana-1-2-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 29', 'तमुवाच ततो ब्रह्मा प्रहसन्मुनिपुंगवम्।
श्लोक एव त्वया बद्धो नात्र कार्या विचारणा॥', 'tam uvāca tato brahmā prahasan munipuṃgavam
śloka eva tvayā baddho nātra kāryā vicāraṇā', null, 1002029),
('ramayana-1-2-30', 30, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 30', 'मच्छन्दादेव ते ब्रह्मन्प्रवृत्तेयं सरस्वती।
रामस्य चरितं सर्वं कुरु त्वमृषिसत्तम॥', 'macchandād eva te brahman pravṛtteyaṃ sarasvatī
rāmasya caritaṃ sarvaṃ kuru tvam ṛṣisattama', null, 1002030),
('ramayana-1-2-31', 31, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 31', 'धर्मात्मनो गुणवतो लोके रामस्य धीमतः।
वृत्तं कथय धीरस्य यथा ते नारदाच्छ्रुतम्॥', 'dharmātmano guṇavato loke rāmasya dhīmataḥ
vṛttaṃ kathaya dhīrasya yathā te nāradāc chrutam', null, 1002031),
('ramayana-1-2-32', 32, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 32', 'रहस्यं च प्रकाशं च यद्वृत्तं तस्य धीमतः।
रामस्य सह सौमित्रे राक्षसानां च सर्वशः॥', 'rahasyaṃ ca prakāśaṃ ca yad vṛttaṃ tasya dhīmataḥ
rāmasya saha saumitre rākṣasānāṃ ca sarvaśaḥ', null, 1002032),
('ramayana-1-2-33', 33, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 33', 'वैदेह्याश्चैव यद्वृत्तं प्रकाशं यदि वा रहः।
तच्चाप्यविदितं सर्वं विदितं ते भविष्यति॥', 'vaidehyāś caiva yad vṛttaṃ prakāśaṃ yadi vā rahaḥ
tac cāpy aviditaṃ sarvaṃ viditaṃ te bhaviṣyati', null, 1002033),
('ramayana-1-2-34', 34, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 34', 'न ते वागनृता काव्ये का चिदत्र भविष्यति।
कुरु रामकथां पुण्यां श्लोकबद्धां मनोरमाम्॥', 'na te vāg anṛtā kāvye kā cid atra bhaviṣyati
kuru rāmakathāṃ puṇyāṃ ślokabaddhāṃ manoramām', null, 1002034),
('ramayana-1-2-35', 35, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 35', 'यावत्स्थास्यन्ति गिरयः सरितश्च महीतले।
तावद्रामायणकथा लोकेषु प्रचरिष्यति॥', 'yāvat sthāsyanti girayaḥ saritaś ca mahītale
tāvad rāmāyaṇakathā lokeṣu pracariṣyati', null, 1002035),
('ramayana-1-2-36', 36, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 36', 'यावद्रामस्य च कथा त्वत्कृता प्रचरिष्यति।
तावदूर्ध्वमधश्च त्वं मल्लोकेषु निवत्स्यसि॥', 'yāvad rāmasya ca kathā tvatkṛtā pracariṣyati
tāvad ūrdhvam adhaś ca tvaṃ mallokeṣu nivatsyasi', null, 1002036),
('ramayana-1-2-37', 37, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 37', 'इत्युक्त्वा भगवान्ब्रह्मा तत्रैवान्तरधीयत।
ततः सशिष्यो वाल्मीकिर्मुनिर्विस्मयमाययौ॥', 'ity uktvā bhagavān brahmā tatraivāntaradhīyata
tataḥ saśiṣyo vālmīkir munir vismayam āyayau', null, 1002037),
('ramayana-1-2-38', 38, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 38', 'तस्य शिष्यास्ततः सर्वे जगुः श्लोकमिमं पुनः।
मुहुर्मुहुः प्रीयमाणाः प्राहुश्च भृशविस्मिताः॥', 'tasya śiṣyās tataḥ sarve jaguḥ ślokam imaṃ punaḥ
muhur muhuḥ prīyamāṇāḥ prāhuś ca bhṛśavismitāḥ', null, 1002038),
('ramayana-1-2-39', 39, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 39', 'समाक्षरैश्चतुर्भिर्यः पादैर्गीतो महर्षिणा।
सोऽनुव्याहरणाद्भूयः शोकः श्लोकत्वमागतः॥', 'samākṣaraiś caturbhir yaḥ pādair gīto maharṣiṇā
so ''nuvyāharaṇād bhūyaḥ śokaḥ ślokatvam āgataḥ', null, 1002039),
('ramayana-1-2-40', 40, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 40', 'तस्य बुद्धिरियं जाता वाल्मीकेर्भावितात्मनः।
कृत्स्नं रामायणं काव्यमीदृशैः करवाण्यहम्॥', 'tasya buddhir iyaṃ jātā vālmīker bhāvitātmanaḥ
kṛtsnaṃ rāmāyaṇaṃ kāvyam īdṛśaiḥ karavāṇy aham', null, 1002040),
('ramayana-1-2-41', 41, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 2, Verse 41', 'उदारवृत्तार्थपदैर्मनोरमैस्तदास्य रामस्य चकार कीर्तिमान्।
समाक्षरैः श्लोकशतैर्यशस्विनो यशस्करं काव्यमुदारधीर्मुनिः॥', 'udāravṛttārthapadair manoramais tadāsya rāmasya cakāra kīrtimān
samākṣaraiḥ ślokaśatair yaśasvino yaśaskaraṃ kāvyam udāradhīr muniḥ', null, 1002041)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 3 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-3-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 1', 'श्रुत्वा वस्तु समग्रं तद्धर्मात्मा धर्मसंहितम्।
व्यक्तमन्वेषते भूयो यद्वृत्तं तस्य धीमतः॥', 'śrutvā vas tu samagraṃ tad dharmātmā dharmasaṃhitam
vyaktam anveṣate bhūyo yad vṛttaṃ tasya dhīmataḥ', null, 1003001),
('ramayana-1-3-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 2', 'उपस्पृश्योदकं संयन्मुनिः स्थित्वा कृताञ्जलिः।
प्राचीनाग्रेषु दर्भेषु धर्मेणान्वेषते गतिम्॥', 'upaspṛśyodakaṃ saṃyan muniḥ sthitvā kṛtāñjaliḥ
prācīnāgreṣu darbheṣu dharmeṇānveṣate gatim', null, 1003002),
('ramayana-1-3-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 3', 'जन्म रामस्य सुमहद्वीर्यं सर्वानुकूलताम्।
लोकस्य प्रियतां क्षान्तिं सौम्यतां सत्यशीलताम्॥', 'janma rāmasya sumahad vīryaṃ sarvānukūlatām
lokasya priyatāṃ kṣāntiṃ saumyatāṃ satyaśīlatām', null, 1003003),
('ramayana-1-3-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 4', 'नानाचित्राः कथाश्चान्या विश्वामित्रसहायने।
जानक्याश्च विवाहं च धनुषश्च विभेदनम्॥', 'nānācitrāḥ kathāś cānyā viśvāmitrasahāyane
jānakyāś ca vivāhaṃ ca dhanuṣaś ca vibhedanam', null, 1003004),
('ramayana-1-3-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 5', 'रामरामविवादं च गुणान्दाशरथेस्तथा।
तथाभिषेकं रामस्य कैकेय्या दुष्टभावताम्॥', 'rāmarāmavivādaṃ ca guṇān dāśarathes tathā
tathābhiṣekaṃ rāmasya kaikeyyā duṣṭabhāvatām', null, 1003005),
('ramayana-1-3-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 6', 'व्याघातं चाभिषेकस्य रामस्य च विवासनम्।
राज्ञः शोकविलापं च परलोकस्य चाश्रयम्॥', 'vyāghātaṃ cābhiṣekasya rāmasya ca vivāsanam
rājñaḥ śokavilāpaṃ ca paralokasya cāśrayam', null, 1003006),
('ramayana-1-3-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 7', 'प्रकृतीनां विषादं च प्रकृतीनां विसर्जनम्।
निषादाधिपसंवादं सूतोपावर्तनं तथा॥', 'prakṛtīnāṃ viṣādaṃ ca prakṛtīnāṃ visarjanam
niṣādādhipasaṃvādaṃ sūtopāvartanaṃ tathā', null, 1003007),
('ramayana-1-3-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 8', 'गङ्गायाश्चापि संतारं भरद्वाजस्य दर्शनम्।
भरद्वाजाभ्यनुज्ञानाच्चित्रकूटस्य दर्शनम्॥', 'gaṅgāyāś cāpi saṃtāraṃ bharadvājasya darśanam
bharadvājābhyanujñānāc citrakūṭasya darśanam', null, 1003008),
('ramayana-1-3-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 9', 'वास्तुकर्मनिवेशं च भरतागमनं तथा।
प्रसादनं च रामस्य पितुश्च सलिलक्रियाम्॥', 'vāstukarmaniveśaṃ ca bharatāgamanaṃ tathā
prasādanaṃ ca rāmasya pituś ca salilakriyām', null, 1003009),
('ramayana-1-3-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 10', 'पादुकाग्र्याभिषेकं च नन्दिग्राम निवासनम्।
दण्डकारण्यगमनं सुतीक्ष्णेन समागमम्॥', 'pādukāgryābhiṣekaṃ ca nandigrāma nivāsanam
daṇḍakāraṇyagamanaṃ sutīkṣṇena samāgamam', null, 1003010),
('ramayana-1-3-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 11', 'अनसूयासमस्यां च अङ्गरागस्य चार्पणम्।
शूर्पणख्याश्च संवादं विरूपकरणं तथा॥', 'anasūyāsamasyāṃ ca aṅgarāgasya cārpaṇam
śūrpaṇakhyāś ca saṃvādaṃ virūpakaraṇaṃ tathā', null, 1003011),
('ramayana-1-3-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 12', 'वधं खरत्रिशिरसोरुत्थानं रावणस्य च।
मारीचस्य वधं चैव वैदेह्या हरणं तथा॥', 'vadhaṃ kharatriśirasor utthānaṃ rāvaṇasya ca
mārīcasya vadhaṃ caiva vaidehyā haraṇaṃ tathā', null, 1003012),
('ramayana-1-3-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 13', 'राघवस्य विलापं च गृध्रराजनिबर्हणम्।
कबन्धदर्शनं चैव पम्पायाश्चापि दर्शनम्॥', 'rāghavasya vilāpaṃ ca gṛdhrarājanibarhaṇam
kabandhadarśanaṃ caiva pampāyāś cāpi darśanam', null, 1003013),
('ramayana-1-3-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 14', 'शर्बर्या दर्शनं चैव हनूमद्दर्शनं तथा।
विलापं चैव पम्पायां राघवस्य महात्मनः॥', 'śarbaryā darśanaṃ caiva hanūmaddarśanaṃ tathā
vilāpaṃ caiva pampāyāṃ rāghavasya mahātmanaḥ', null, 1003014),
('ramayana-1-3-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 15', 'ऋष्यमूकस्य गमनं सुग्रीवेण समागमम्।
प्रत्ययोत्पादनं सख्यं वालिसुग्रीवविग्रहम्॥', 'ṛṣyamūkasya gamanaṃ sugrīveṇa samāgamam
pratyayotpādanaṃ sakhyaṃ vālisugrīvavigraham', null, 1003015),
('ramayana-1-3-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 16', 'वालिप्रमथनं चैव सुग्रीवप्रतिपादनम्।
ताराविलापसमयं वर्षरात्रिनिवासनम्॥', 'vālipramathanaṃ caiva sugrīvapratipādanam
tārāvilāpasamayaṃ varṣarātrinivāsanam', null, 1003016),
('ramayana-1-3-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 17', 'कोपं राघवसिंहस्य बलानामुपसंग्रहम्।
दिशः प्रस्थापनं चैव पृथिव्याश्च निवेदनम्॥', 'kopaṃ rāghavasiṃhasya balānām upasaṃgraham
diśaḥ prasthāpanaṃ caiva pṛthivyāś ca nivedanam', null, 1003017),
('ramayana-1-3-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 18', 'अङ्गुलीयकदानं च ऋक्षस्य बिलदर्शनम्।
प्रायोपवेशनं चैव संपातेश्चापि दर्शनम्॥', 'aṅgulīyakadānaṃ ca ṛkṣasya biladarśanam
prāyopaveśanaṃ caiva saṃpāteś cāpi darśanam', null, 1003018),
('ramayana-1-3-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 19', 'पर्वतारोहणं चैव सागरस्य च लङ्घनम्।
रात्रौ लङ्काप्रवेशं च एकस्यापि विचिन्तनम्॥', 'parvatārohaṇaṃ caiva sāgarasya ca laṅghanam
rātrau laṅkāpraveśaṃ ca ekasyāpi vicintanam', null, 1003019),
('ramayana-1-3-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 20', 'आपानभूमिगमनमवरोधस्य दर्शनम्।
अशोकवनिकायानं सीतायाश्चापि दर्शनम्॥', 'āpānabhūmigamanam avarodhasya darśanam
aśokavanikāyānaṃ sītāyāś cāpi darśanam', null, 1003020),
('ramayana-1-3-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 21', 'अभिज्ञानप्रदानं च सीतायाश्चापि भाषणम्।
राक्षसीतर्जनं चैव त्रिजटास्वप्नदर्शनम्॥', 'abhijñānapradānaṃ ca sītāyāś cāpi bhāṣaṇam
rākṣasītarjanaṃ caiva trijaṭāsvapnadarśanam', null, 1003021),
('ramayana-1-3-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 22', 'मणिप्रदानं सीताया वृक्षभङ्गं तथैव च।
राक्षसीविद्रवं चैव किंकराणां निबर्हणम्॥', 'maṇipradānaṃ sītāyā vṛkṣabhaṅgaṃ tathaiva ca
rākṣasīvidravaṃ caiva kiṃkarāṇāṃ nibarhaṇam', null, 1003022),
('ramayana-1-3-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 23', 'ग्रहणं वायुसूनोश्च लङ्कादाहाभिगर्जनम्।
प्रतिप्लवनमेवाथ मधूनां हरणं तथा॥', 'grahaṇaṃ vāyusūnoś ca laṅkādāhābhigarjanam
pratiplavanam evātha madhūnāṃ haraṇaṃ tathā', null, 1003023),
('ramayana-1-3-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 24', 'राघवाश्वासनं चैव मणिनिर्यातनं तथा।
संगमं च समुद्रस्य नलसेतोश्च बन्धनम्॥', 'rāghavāśvāsanaṃ caiva maṇiniryātanaṃ tathā
saṃgamaṃ ca samudrasya nalasetoś ca bandhanam', null, 1003024),
('ramayana-1-3-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 25', 'प्रतारं च समुद्रस्य रात्रौ लङ्कावरोधनम्।
विभीषणेन संसर्गं वधोपायनिवेदनम्॥', 'pratāraṃ ca samudrasya rātrau laṅkāvarodhanam
vibhīṣaṇena saṃsargaṃ vadhopāyanivedanam', null, 1003025),
('ramayana-1-3-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 26', 'कुम्भकर्णस्य निधनं मेघनादनिबर्हणम्।
रावणस्य विनाशं च सीतावाप्तिमरेः पुरे॥', 'kumbhakarṇasya nidhanaṃ meghanādanibarhaṇam
rāvaṇasya vināśaṃ ca sītāvāptim areḥ pure', null, 1003026),
('ramayana-1-3-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 27', 'बिभीषणाभिषेकं च पुष्पकस्य च दर्शनम्।
अयोध्यायाश्च गमनं भरतेन समागमम्॥', 'bibhīṣaṇābhiṣekaṃ ca puṣpakasya ca darśanam
ayodhyāyāś ca gamanaṃ bharatena samāgamam', null, 1003027),
('ramayana-1-3-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 28', 'रामाभिषेकाभ्युदयं सर्वसैन्यविसर्जनम्।
स्वराष्ट्ररञ्जनं चैव वैदेह्याश्च विसर्जनम्॥', 'rāmābhiṣekābhyudayaṃ sarvasainyavisarjanam
svarāṣṭrarañjanaṃ caiva vaidehyāś ca visarjanam', null, 1003028),
('ramayana-1-3-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 3, Verse 29', 'अनागतं च यत्किं चिद्रामस्य वसुधातले।
तच्चकारोत्तरे काव्ये वाल्मीकिर्भगवानृषिः॥', 'anāgataṃ ca yat kiṃ cid rāmasya vasudhātale
tac cakārottare kāvye vālmīkir bhagavān ṛṣiḥ', null, 1003029)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 4 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-4-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 1', 'प्राप्तराज्यस्य रामस्य वाल्मीकिर्भगवानृषिः।
चकार चरितं कृत्स्नं विचित्रपदमात्मवान्॥', 'prāptarājyasya rāmasya vālmīkir bhagavān ṛṣiḥ
cakāra caritaṃ kṛtsnaṃ vicitrapadam ātmavān', null, 1004001),
('ramayana-1-4-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 2', 'कृत्वा तु तन्महाप्राज्ञः सभविष्यं सहोत्तरम्।
चिन्तयामास को न्वेतत्प्रयुञ्जीयादिति प्रभुः॥', 'kṛtvā tu tan mahāprājñaḥ sabhaviṣyaṃ sahottaram
cintayām āsa ko nv etat prayuñjīyād iti prabhuḥ', null, 1004002),
('ramayana-1-4-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 3', 'तस्य चिन्तयमानस्य महर्षेर्भावितात्मनः।
अगृह्णीतां ततः पादौ मुनिवेषौ कुशीलवौ॥', 'tasya cintayamānasya maharṣer bhāvitātmanaḥ
agṛhṇītāṃ tataḥ pādau muniveṣau kuśīlavau', null, 1004003),
('ramayana-1-4-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 4', 'कुशीलवौ तु धर्मज्ञौ राजपुत्रौ यशस्विनौ।
भ्रातरौ स्वरसंपन्नौ ददर्शाश्रमवासिनौ॥', 'kuśīlavau tu dharmajñau rājaputrau yaśasvinau
bhrātarau svarasaṃpannau dadarśāśramavāsinau', null, 1004004),
('ramayana-1-4-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 5', 'स तु मेधाविनौ दृष्ट्वा वेदेषु परिनिष्ठितौ।
वेदोपबृह्मणार्थाय तावग्राहयत प्रभुः॥', 'sa tu medhāvinau dṛṣṭvā vedeṣu pariniṣṭhitau
vedopabṛhmaṇārthāya tāv agrāhayata prabhuḥ', null, 1004005),
('ramayana-1-4-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 6', 'काव्यं रामायणं कृत्स्नं सीतायाश्चरितं महत्।
पौलस्त्य वधमित्येव चकार चरितव्रतः॥', 'kāvyaṃ rāmāyaṇaṃ kṛtsnaṃ sītāyāś caritaṃ mahat
paulastya vadham ity eva cakāra caritavrataḥ', null, 1004006),
('ramayana-1-4-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 7', 'पाठ्ये गेये च मधुरं प्रमाणैस्त्रिभिरन्वितम्।
जातिभिः सप्तभिर्बद्धं तन्त्रीलयसमन्वितम्॥', 'pāṭhye geye ca madhuraṃ pramāṇais tribhir anvitam
jātibhiḥ saptabhir baddhaṃ tantrīlayasamanvitam', null, 1004007),
('ramayana-1-4-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 8', 'हास्यशृङ्गारकारुण्यरौद्रवीरभयानकैः।
बीभत्सादिरसैर्युक्तं काव्यमेतदगायताम्॥', 'hāsyaśṛṅgārakāruṇyaraudravīrabhayānakaiḥ
bībhatsādirasair yuktaṃ kāvyam etad agāyatām', null, 1004008),
('ramayana-1-4-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 9', 'तौ तु गान्धर्वतत्त्वज्ञौ मूर्च्छनास्थानकोविदौ।
भ्रातरौ स्वरसंपन्नौ गन्धर्वाविव रूपिणौ॥', 'tau tu gāndharvatattvajñau mūrcchanāsthānakovidau
bhrātarau svarasaṃpannau gandharvāv iva rūpiṇau', null, 1004009),
('ramayana-1-4-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 10', 'रूपलक्षणसंपन्नौ मधुरस्वरभाषिणौ।
बिम्बादिवोद्धृतौ बिम्बौ रामदेहात्तथापरौ॥', 'rūpalakṣaṇasaṃpannau madhurasvarabhāṣiṇau
bimbād ivoddhṛtau bimbau rāmadehāt tathāparau', null, 1004010),
('ramayana-1-4-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 11', 'तौ राजपुत्रौ कार्त्स्न्येन धर्म्यमाख्यानमुत्तमम्।
वाचो विधेयं तत्सर्वं कृत्वा काव्यमनिन्दितौ॥', 'tau rājaputrau kārtsnyena dharmyam ākhyānam uttamam
vāco vidheyaṃ tat sarvaṃ kṛtvā kāvyam aninditau', null, 1004011),
('ramayana-1-4-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 12', 'ऋषीणां च द्विजातीनां साधूनां च समागमे।
यथोपदेशं तत्त्वज्ञौ जगतुस्तौ समाहितौ।
महात्मानौ महाभागौ सर्वलक्षणलक्षितौ॥', 'ṛṣīṇāṃ ca dvijātīnāṃ sādhūnāṃ ca samāgame
yathopadeśaṃ tattvajñau jagatus tau samāhitau
mahātmānau mahābhāgau sarvalakṣaṇalakṣitau', null, 1004012),
('ramayana-1-4-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 13', 'तौ कदा चित्समेतानामृषीणां भावितात्मनाम्।
आसीनानां समीपस्थाविदं काव्यमगायताम्॥', 'tau kadā cit sametānām ṛṣīṇāṃ bhāvitātmanām
āsīnānāṃ samīpasthāv idaṃ kāvyam agāyatām', null, 1004013),
('ramayana-1-4-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 14', 'तच्छ्रुत्वा मुनयः सर्वे बाष्पपर्याकुलेक्षणाः।
साधु साध्वित्य्तावूचतुः परं विस्मयमागताः॥', 'tac chrutvā munayaḥ sarve bāṣpaparyākulekṣaṇāḥ
sādhu sādhv ity tāv ūcatuḥ paraṃ vismayam āgatāḥ', null, 1004014),
('ramayana-1-4-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 15', 'ते प्रीतमनसः सर्वे मुनयो धर्मवत्सलाः।
प्रशशंसुः प्रशस्तव्यौ गायमानौ कुशीलवौ॥', 'te prītamanasaḥ sarve munayo dharmavatsalāḥ
praśaśaṃsuḥ praśastavyau gāyamānau kuśīlavau', null, 1004015),
('ramayana-1-4-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 16', 'अहो गीतस्य माधुर्यं श्लोकानां च विशेषतः।
चिरनिर्वृत्तमप्येतत्प्रत्यक्षमिव दर्शितम्॥', 'aho gītasya mādhuryaṃ ślokānāṃ ca viśeṣataḥ
ciranirvṛttam apy etat pratyakṣam iva darśitam', null, 1004016),
('ramayana-1-4-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 17', 'प्रविश्य तावुभौ सुष्ठु तदा भावमगायताम्।
सहितौ मधुरं रक्तं संपन्नं स्वरसंपदा॥', 'praviśya tāv ubhau suṣṭhu tadā bhāvam agāyatām
sahitau madhuraṃ raktaṃ saṃpannaṃ svarasaṃpadā', null, 1004017),
('ramayana-1-4-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 18', 'एवं प्रशस्यमानौ तौ तपःश्लाघ्यैर्महर्षिभिः।
संरक्ततरमत्यर्थं मधुरं तावगायताम्॥', 'evaṃ praśasyamānau tau tapaḥślāghyair maharṣibhiḥ
saṃraktataram atyarthaṃ madhuraṃ tāv agāyatām', null, 1004018),
('ramayana-1-4-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 19', 'प्रीतः कश्चिन्मुनिस्ताभ्यां संस्थितः कलशं ददौ।
प्रसन्नो वल्कलं कश्चिद्ददौ ताभ्यां महायशाः॥', 'prītaḥ kaś cin munis tābhyāṃ saṃsthitaḥ kalaśaṃ dadau
prasanno valkalaṃ kaś cid dadau tābhyāṃ mahāyaśāḥ', null, 1004019),
('ramayana-1-4-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 20', 'आश्चर्यमिदमाख्यानं मुनिना संप्रकीर्तितम्।
परं कवीनामाधारं समाप्तं च यथाक्रमम्॥', 'āścaryam idam ākhyānaṃ muninā saṃprakīrtitam
paraṃ kavīnām ādhāraṃ samāptaṃ ca yathākramam', null, 1004020),
('ramayana-1-4-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 21', 'प्रशस्यमानौ सर्वत्र कदा चित्तत्र गायकौ।
रथ्यासु राजमार्गेषु ददर्श भरताग्रजः॥', 'praśasyamānau sarvatra kadā cit tatra gāyakau
rathyāsu rājamārgeṣu dadarśa bharatāgrajaḥ', null, 1004021),
('ramayana-1-4-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 22', 'स्ववेश्म चानीय ततो भ्रातरौ सकुशीलवौ।
पूजयामास पूजार्हौ रामः शत्रुनिबर्हणः॥', 'svaveśma cānīya tato bhrātarau sakuśīlavau
pūjayām āsa pūjārhau rāmaḥ śatrunibarhaṇaḥ', null, 1004022),
('ramayana-1-4-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 23', 'आसीनः काञ्चने दिव्ये स च सिंहासने प्रभुः।
उपोपविष्टैः सचिवैर्भ्रातृभिश्च परंतपः॥', 'āsīnaḥ kāñcane divye sa ca siṃhāsane prabhuḥ
upopaviṣṭaiḥ sacivair bhrātṛbhiś ca paraṃtapaḥ', null, 1004023),
('ramayana-1-4-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 24', 'दृष्ट्वा तु रूपसंपन्नौ तावुभौ वीणिनौ ततः।
उवाच लक्ष्मणं रामः शत्रुघ्नं भरतं तथा॥', 'dṛṣṭvā tu rūpasaṃpannau tāv ubhau vīṇinau tataḥ
uvāca lakṣmaṇaṃ rāmaḥ śatrughnaṃ bharataṃ tathā', null, 1004024),
('ramayana-1-4-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 25', 'श्रूयतामिदमाख्यानमनयोर्देववर्चसोः।
विचित्रार्थपदं सम्यग्गायतोर्मधुरस्वरम्॥', 'śrūyatām idam ākhyānam anayor devavarcasoḥ
vicitrārthapadaṃ samyag gāyator madhurasvaram', null, 1004025),
('ramayana-1-4-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 26', 'इमौ मुनी पार्थिवलक्ष्मणान्वितौ कुशीलवौ चैव महातपस्विनौ।
ममापि तद्भूतिकरं प्रचक्षते महानुभावं चरितं निबोधत॥', 'imau munī pārthivalakṣmaṇānvitau kuśīlavau caiva mahātapasvinau
mamāpi tad bhūtikaraṃ pracakṣate mahānubhāvaṃ caritaṃ nibodhata', null, 1004026),
('ramayana-1-4-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 4, Verse 27', 'ततस्तु तौ रामवचः प्रचोदितावगायतां मार्गविधानसंपदा।
स चापि रामः परिषद्गतः शनैर्बुभूषयासक्तमना बभूव ह॥', 'tatas tu tau rāmavacaḥ pracoditāv agāyatāṃ mārgavidhānasaṃpadā
sa cāpi rāmaḥ pariṣadgataḥ śanair bubhūṣayāsaktamanā babhūva ha', null, 1004027)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 5 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-5-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 1', 'सर्वापूर्वमियं येषामासीत्कृत्स्ना वसुंधरा।
प्रजापतिमुपादाय नृपाणां जयशालिनाम्॥', 'sarvāpūrvam iyaṃ yeṣām āsīt kṛtsnā vasuṃdharā
prajāpatim upādāya nṛpāṇāṃ jayaśālinām', null, 1005001),
('ramayana-1-5-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 2', 'येषां स सगरो नाम सागरो येन खानितः।
षष्टिः पुत्रसहस्राणि यं यान्तं पर्यवारयन्॥', 'yeṣāṃ sa sagaro nāma sāgaro yena khānitaḥ
ṣaṣṭiḥ putrasahasrāṇi yaṃ yāntaṃ paryavārayan', null, 1005002),
('ramayana-1-5-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 3', 'इक्ष्वाकूणामिदं तेषां राज्ञां वंशे महात्मनाम्।
महदुत्पन्नमाख्यानं रामायणमिति श्रुतम्॥', 'ikṣvākūṇām idaṃ teṣāṃ rājñāṃ vaṃśe mahātmanām
mahad utpannam ākhyānaṃ rāmāyaṇam iti śrutam', null, 1005003),
('ramayana-1-5-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 4', 'तदिदं वर्तयिष्यामि सर्वं निखिलमादितः।
धर्मकामार्थसहितं श्रोतव्यमनसूयया॥', 'tad idaṃ vartayiṣyāmi sarvaṃ nikhilam āditaḥ
dharmakāmārthasahitaṃ śrotavyam anasūyayā', null, 1005004),
('ramayana-1-5-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 5', 'कोसलो नाम मुदितः स्फीतो जनपदो महान्।
निविष्टः सरयूतीरे प्रभूतधनधान्यवान्॥', 'kosalo nāma muditaḥ sphīto janapado mahān
niviṣṭaḥ sarayūtīre prabhūtadhanadhānyavān', null, 1005005),
('ramayana-1-5-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 6', 'अयोध्या नाम नगरी तत्रासील्लोकविश्रुता।
मनुना मानवेन्द्रेण या पुरी निर्मिता स्वयम्॥', 'ayodhyā nāma nagarī tatrāsīl lokaviśrutā
manunā mānavendreṇa yā purī nirmitā svayam', null, 1005006),
('ramayana-1-5-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 7', 'आयता दश च द्वे च योजनानि महापुरी।
श्रीमती त्रीणि विस्तीर्णा सुविभक्तमहापथा॥', 'āyatā daśa ca dve ca yojanāni mahāpurī
śrīmatī trīṇi vistīrṇā suvibhaktamahāpathā', null, 1005007),
('ramayana-1-5-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 8', 'राजमार्गेण महता सुविभक्तेन शोभिता।
मुक्तपुष्पावकीर्णेन जलसिक्तेन नित्यशः॥', 'rājamārgeṇa mahatā suvibhaktena śobhitā
muktapuṣpāvakīrṇena jalasiktena nityaśaḥ', null, 1005008),
('ramayana-1-5-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 9', 'तां तु राजा दशरथो महाराष्ट्रविवर्धनः।
पुरीमावासयामास दिवि देवपतिर्यथा॥', 'tāṃ tu rājā daśaratho mahārāṣṭravivardhanaḥ
purīm āvāsayām āsa divi devapatir yathā', null, 1005009),
('ramayana-1-5-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 10', 'कपाटतोरणवतीं सुविभक्तान्तरापणाम्।
सर्वयन्त्रायुधवतीमुपेतां सर्वशिल्पिभिः॥', 'kapāṭatoraṇavatīṃ suvibhaktāntarāpaṇām
sarvayantrāyudhavatīm upetāṃ sarvaśilpibhiḥ', null, 1005010),
('ramayana-1-5-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 11', 'सूतमागधसंबाधां श्रीमतीमतुलप्रभाम्।
उच्चाट्टालध्वजवतीं शतघ्नीशतसंकुलाम्॥', 'sūtamāgadhasaṃbādhāṃ śrīmatīm atulaprabhām
uccāṭṭāladhvajavatīṃ śataghnīśatasaṃkulām', null, 1005011),
('ramayana-1-5-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 12', 'वधूनाटकसङ्घैश्च संयुक्तां सर्वतः पुरीम्।
उद्यानाम्रवणोपेतां महतीं सालमेखलाम्॥', 'vadhūnāṭakasaṅghaiś ca saṃyuktāṃ sarvataḥ purīm
udyānāmravaṇopetāṃ mahatīṃ sālamekhalām', null, 1005012),
('ramayana-1-5-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 13', 'दुर्गगम्भीरपरिखां दुर्गामन्यैर्दुरासदाम्।
वाजिवारणसंपूर्णां गोभिरुष्ट्रैः खरैस्तथा॥', 'durgagambhīraparikhāṃ durgām anyair durāsadām
vājivāraṇasaṃpūrṇāṃ gobhir uṣṭraiḥ kharais tathā', null, 1005013),
('ramayana-1-5-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 14', 'सामन्तराजसङ्घैश्च बलिकर्मभिरावृताम्।
नानादेशनिवासैश्च वणिग्भिरुपशोभिताम्॥', 'sāmantarājasaṅghaiś ca balikarmabhir āvṛtām
nānādeśanivāsaiś ca vaṇigbhir upaśobhitām', null, 1005014),
('ramayana-1-5-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 15', 'प्रसादै रत्नविकृतैः पर्वतैरुपशोभिताम्।
कूटागारैश्च संपूर्णामिन्द्रस्येवामरावतीम्॥', 'prasādai ratnavikṛtaiḥ parvatair upaśobhitām
kūṭāgāraiś ca saṃpūrṇām indrasyevāmarāvatīm', null, 1005015),
('ramayana-1-5-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 16', 'चित्रामष्टापदाकारां वरनारीगणैर्युताम्।
सर्वरत्नसमाकीर्णां विमानगृहशोभिताम्॥', 'citrām aṣṭāpadākārāṃ varanārīgaṇair yutām
sarvaratnasamākīrṇāṃ vimānagṛhaśobhitām', null, 1005016),
('ramayana-1-5-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 17', 'गृहगाढामविच्छिद्रां समभूमौ निवेशिताम्।
शालितण्डुलसंपूर्णामिक्षुकाण्डरसोदकाम्॥', 'gṛhagāḍhām avicchidrāṃ samabhūmau niveśitām
śālitaṇḍulasaṃpūrṇām ikṣukāṇḍarasodakām', null, 1005017),
('ramayana-1-5-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 18', 'दुन्दुभीभिर्मृदङ्गैश्च वीणाभिः पणवैस्तथा।
नादितां भृशमत्यर्थं पृथिव्यां तामनुत्तमाम्॥', 'dundubhībhir mṛdaṅgaiś ca vīṇābhiḥ paṇavais tathā
nāditāṃ bhṛśam atyarthaṃ pṛthivyāṃ tām anuttamām', null, 1005018),
('ramayana-1-5-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 19', 'विमानमिव सिद्धानां तपसाधिगतं दिवि।
सुनिवेशितवेश्मान्तां नरोत्तमसमावृताम्॥', 'vimānam iva siddhānāṃ tapasādhigataṃ divi
suniveśitaveśmāntāṃ narottamasamāvṛtām', null, 1005019),
('ramayana-1-5-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 20', 'ये च बाणैर्न विध्यन्ति विविक्तमपरापरम्।
शब्दवेध्यं च विततं लघुहस्ता विशारदाः॥', 'ye ca bāṇair na vidhyanti viviktam aparāparam
śabdavedhyaṃ ca vitataṃ laghuhastā viśāradāḥ', null, 1005020),
('ramayana-1-5-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 21', 'सिंहव्याघ्रवराहाणां मत्तानां नदतां वने।
हन्तारो निशितैः शस्त्रैर्बलाद्बाहुबलैरपि॥', 'siṃhavyāghravarāhāṇāṃ mattānāṃ nadatāṃ vane
hantāro niśitaiḥ śastrair balād bāhubalair api', null, 1005021),
('ramayana-1-5-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 22', 'तादृशानां सहस्रैस्तामभिपूर्णां महारथैः।
पुरीमावासयामास राजा दशरथस्तदा॥', 'tādṛśānāṃ sahasrais tām abhipūrṇāṃ mahārathaiḥ
purīm āvāsayām āsa rājā daśarathas tadā', null, 1005022),
('ramayana-1-5-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 5, Verse 23', 'तामग्निमद्भिर्गुणवद्भिरावृतां द्विजोत्तमैर्वेदषडङ्गपारगैः।
सहस्रदैः सत्यरतैर्महात्मभिर्महर्षिकल्पैरृषिभिश्च केवलैः॥', 'tām agnimadbhir guṇavadbhir āvṛtāṃ dvijottamair vedaṣaḍaṅgapāragaiḥ
sahasradaiḥ satyaratair mahātmabhir maharṣikalpair ṛṣibhiś ca kevalaiḥ', null, 1005023)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 6 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-6-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 1', 'पुर्यां तस्यामयोध्यायां वेदवित्सर्वसंग्रहः।
दीर्घदर्शी महातेजाः पौरजानपदप्रियः॥', 'puryāṃ tasyām ayodhyāyāṃ vedavit sarvasaṃgrahaḥ
dīrghadarśī mahātejāḥ paurajānapadapriyaḥ', null, 1006001),
('ramayana-1-6-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 2', 'इक्ष्वाकूणामतिरथो यज्वा धर्मरतो वशी।
महर्षिकल्पो राजर्षिस्त्रिषु लोकृषु विश्रुतः॥', 'ikṣvākūṇām atiratho yajvā dharmarato vaśī
maharṣikalpo rājarṣis triṣu lokṛṣu viśrutaḥ', null, 1006002),
('ramayana-1-6-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 3', 'बलवान्निहतामित्रो मित्रवान्विजितेन्द्रियः।
धनैश्च संचयैश्चान्यैः शक्रवैश्रवणोपमः॥', 'balavān nihatāmitro mitravān vijitendriyaḥ
dhanaiś ca saṃcayaiś cānyaiḥ śakravaiśravaṇopamaḥ', null, 1006003),
('ramayana-1-6-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 4', 'यथा मनुर्महातेजा लोकस्य परिरक्षिता।
तथा दशरथो राजा वसञ्जगदपालयत्॥', 'yathā manur mahātejā lokasya parirakṣitā
tathā daśaratho rājā vasañ jagad apālayat', null, 1006004),
('ramayana-1-6-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 5', 'तेन सत्याभिसंधेन त्रिवर्गमनुतिष्ठता।
पालिता सा पुरी श्रेष्ठेन्द्रेण इवामरावती॥', 'tena satyābhisaṃdhena trivargam anutiṣṭhatā
pālitā sā purī śreṣṭhendreṇa ivāmarāvatī', null, 1006005),
('ramayana-1-6-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 6', 'तस्मिन्पुरवरे हृष्टा धर्मात्मना बहुश्रुताः।
नरास्तुष्टाधनैः स्वैः स्वैरलुब्धाः सत्यवादिनः॥', 'tasmin puravare hṛṣṭā dharmātmanā bahuśrutāḥ
narās tuṣṭādhanaiḥ svaiḥ svair alubdhāḥ satyavādinaḥ', null, 1006006),
('ramayana-1-6-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 7', 'नाल्पसंनिचयः कश्चिदासीत्तस्मिन्पुरोत्तमे।
कुटुम्बी यो ह्यसिद्धार्थोऽगवाश्वधनधान्यवान्॥', 'nālpasaṃnicayaḥ kaś cid āsīt tasmin purottame
kuṭumbī yo hy asiddhārtho ''gavāśvadhanadhānyavān', null, 1006007),
('ramayana-1-6-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 8', 'कामी वा न कदर्यो वा नृशंसः पुरुषः क्व चित्।
द्रष्टुं शक्यमयोध्यायां नाविद्वान्न च नास्तिकः॥', 'kāmī vā na kadaryo vā nṛśaṃsaḥ puruṣaḥ kva cit
draṣṭuṃ śakyam ayodhyāyāṃ nāvidvān na ca nāstikaḥ', null, 1006008),
('ramayana-1-6-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 9', 'सर्वे नराश्च नार्यश्च धर्मशीलाः सुसंयताः।
मुदिताः शीलवृत्ताभ्यां महर्षय इवामलाः॥', 'sarve narāś ca nāryaś ca dharmaśīlāḥ susaṃyatāḥ
muditāḥ śīlavṛttābhyāṃ maharṣaya ivāmalāḥ', null, 1006009),
('ramayana-1-6-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 10', 'नाकुण्डली नामुकुटी नास्रग्वी नाल्पभोगवान्।
नामृष्टो नानुलिप्ताङ्गो नासुगन्धश्च विद्यते॥', 'nākuṇḍalī nāmukuṭī nāsragvī nālpabhogavān
nāmṛṣṭo nānuliptāṅgo nāsugandhaś ca vidyate', null, 1006010),
('ramayana-1-6-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 11', 'नामृष्टभोजी नादाता नाप्यनङ्गदनिष्कधृक्।
नाहस्ताभरणो वापि दृश्यते नाप्यनात्मवान्॥', 'nāmṛṣṭabhojī nādātā nāpy anaṅgadaniṣkadhṛk
nāhastābharaṇo vāpi dṛśyate nāpy anātmavān', null, 1006011),
('ramayana-1-6-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 12', 'नानाहिताग्निर्नायज्वा विप्रो नाप्यसहस्रदः।
कश्चिदासीदयोध्यायां न च निर्वृत्तसंकरः॥', 'nānāhitāgnir nāyajvā vipro nāpy asahasradaḥ
kaś cid āsīd ayodhyāyāṃ na ca nirvṛttasaṃkaraḥ', null, 1006012),
('ramayana-1-6-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 13', 'स्वकर्मनिरता नित्यं ब्राह्मणा विजितेन्द्रियाः।
दानाध्ययनशीलाश्च संयताश्च प्रतिग्रहे॥', 'svakarmaniratā nityaṃ brāhmaṇā vijitendriyāḥ
dānādhyayanaśīlāś ca saṃyatāś ca pratigrahe', null, 1006013),
('ramayana-1-6-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 14', 'न नास्तिको नानृतको न कश्चिदबहुश्रुतः।
नासूयको न चाशक्तो नाविद्वान्विद्यते तदा॥', 'na nāstiko nānṛtako na kaś cid abahuśrutaḥ
nāsūyako na cāśakto nāvidvān vidyate tadā', null, 1006014),
('ramayana-1-6-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 15', 'न दीनः क्षिप्तचित्तो वा व्यथितो वापि कश्चन।
कश्चिन्नरो वा नारी वा नाश्रीमान्नाप्यरूपवान्।
द्रष्टुं शक्यमयोध्यायां नापि राजन्यभक्तिमान्॥', 'na dīnaḥ kṣiptacitto vā vyathito vāpi kaś cana
kaś cin naro vā nārī vā nāśrīmān nāpy arūpavān
draṣṭuṃ śakyam ayodhyāyāṃ nāpi rājanyabhaktimān', null, 1006015),
('ramayana-1-6-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 16', 'वर्णेष्वग्र्यचतुर्थेषु देवतातिथिपूजकाः।
दीर्घायुषो नराः सर्वे धर्मं सत्यं च संश्रिताः॥', 'varṇeṣv agryacaturtheṣu devatātithipūjakāḥ
dīrghāyuṣo narāḥ sarve dharmaṃ satyaṃ ca saṃśritāḥ', null, 1006016),
('ramayana-1-6-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 17', 'क्षत्रं ब्रह्ममुखं चासीद्वैश्याः क्षत्रमनुव्रताः।
शूद्राः स्वधर्मनिरतास्त्रीन्वर्णानुपचारिणः॥', 'kṣatraṃ brahmamukhaṃ cāsīd vaiśyāḥ kṣatram anuvratāḥ
śūdrāḥ svadharmaniratās trīn varṇān upacāriṇaḥ', null, 1006017),
('ramayana-1-6-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 18', 'सा तेनेक्ष्वाकुनाथेन पुरी सुपरिरक्षिता।
यथा पुरस्तान्मनुना मानवेन्द्रेण धीमता॥', 'sā tenekṣvākunāthena purī suparirakṣitā
yathā purastān manunā mānavendreṇa dhīmatā', null, 1006018),
('ramayana-1-6-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 19', 'योधानामग्निकल्पानां पेशलानाममर्षिणाम्।
संपूर्णाकृतविद्यानां गुहाकेसरिणामिव॥', 'yodhānām agnikalpānāṃ peśalānām amarṣiṇām
saṃpūrṇākṛtavidyānāṃ guhākesariṇām iva', null, 1006019),
('ramayana-1-6-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 20', 'काम्बोजविषये जातैर्बाह्लीकैश्च हयोत्तमैः।
वनायुजैर्नदीजैश्च पूर्णाहरिहयोपमैः॥', 'kāmbojaviṣaye jātair bāhlīkaiś ca hayottamaiḥ
vanāyujair nadījaiś ca pūrṇāharihayopamaiḥ', null, 1006020),
('ramayana-1-6-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 21', 'विन्ध्यपर्वतजैर्मत्तैः पूर्णा हैमवतैरपि।
मदान्वितैरतिबलैर्मातङ्गैः पर्वतोपमैः॥', 'vindhyaparvatajair mattaiḥ pūrṇā haimavatair api
madānvitair atibalair mātaṅgaiḥ parvatopamaiḥ', null, 1006021),
('ramayana-1-6-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 22', 'अञ्जनादपि निष्क्रान्तैर्वामनादपि च द्विपैः।
भद्रमन्द्रैर्भद्रमृगैर्मृगमन्द्रैश्च सा पुरी॥', 'añjanād api niṣkrāntair vāmanād api ca dvipaiḥ
bhadramandrair bhadramṛgair mṛgamandraiś ca sā purī', null, 1006022),
('ramayana-1-6-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 23', 'नित्यमत्तैः सदा पूर्णा नागैरचलसंनिभैः।
सा योजने च द्वे भूयः सत्यनामा प्रकाशते॥', 'nityamattaiḥ sadā pūrṇā nāgair acalasaṃnibhaiḥ
sā yojane ca dve bhūyaḥ satyanāmā prakāśate', null, 1006023),
('ramayana-1-6-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 6, Verse 24', 'तां सत्यनामां दृढतोरणार्गलाम्गृहैर्विचित्रैरुपशोभितां शिवाम्।
पुरीमयोध्यां नृसहस्रसंकुलां शशास वै शक्रसमो महीपतिः॥', 'tāṃ satyanāmāṃ dṛḍhatoraṇārgalām gṛhair vicitrair upaśobhitāṃ śivām
purīm ayodhyāṃ nṛsahasrasaṃkulāṃ śaśāsa vai śakrasamo mahīpatiḥ', null, 1006024)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 7 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-7-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 1', 'अष्टौ बभूवुर्वीरस्य तस्यामात्या यशस्विनः।
शुचयश्चानुरक्ताश्च राजकृत्येषु नित्यशः॥', 'aṣṭau babhūvur vīrasya tasyāmātyā yaśasvinaḥ
śucayaś cānuraktāś ca rājakṛtyeṣu nityaśaḥ', null, 1007001),
('ramayana-1-7-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 2', 'धृष्टिर्जयन्तो विजयः सिद्धार्थो अर्थसाधकः।
अशोको मन्त्रपालश्च सुमन्त्रश्चाष्टमोऽभवत्॥', 'dhṛṣṭir jayanto vijayaḥ siddhārtho arthasādhakaḥ
aśoko mantrapālaś ca sumantraś cāṣṭamo ''bhavat', null, 1007002),
('ramayana-1-7-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 3', 'ऋत्विजौ द्वावभिमतौ तस्यास्तामृषिसत्तमौ।
वसिष्ठो वामदेवश्च मन्त्रिणश्च तथापरे॥', 'ṛtvijau dvāv abhimatau tasyāstām ṛṣisattamau
vasiṣṭho vāmadevaś ca mantriṇaś ca tathāpare', null, 1007003),
('ramayana-1-7-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 4', 'श्रीमन्तश्च महात्मानः शास्त्रज्ञा दृढविक्रमाः।
कीर्तिमन्तः प्रणिहिता यथावचनकारिणः॥', 'śrīmantaś ca mahātmānaḥ śāstrajñā dṛḍhavikramāḥ
kīrtimantaḥ praṇihitā yathāvacanakāriṇaḥ', null, 1007004),
('ramayana-1-7-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 5', 'तेजःक्षमायशःप्राप्ताः स्मितपूर्वाभिभाषिणः।
क्रोधात्कामार्थहेतोर्वा न ब्रूयुरनृतं वचः॥', 'tejaḥkṣamāyaśaḥprāptāḥ smitapūrvābhibhāṣiṇaḥ
krodhāt kāmārthahetor vā na brūyur anṛtaṃ vacaḥ', null, 1007005),
('ramayana-1-7-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 6', 'तेषामविदितं किं चित्स्वेषु नास्ति परेषु वा।
क्रियमाणं कृतं वापि चारेणापि चिकीर्षितम्॥', 'teṣām aviditaṃ kiṃ cit sveṣu nāsti pareṣu vā
kriyamāṇaṃ kṛtaṃ vāpi cāreṇāpi cikīrṣitam', null, 1007006),
('ramayana-1-7-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 7', 'कुशला व्यवहारेषु सौहृदेषु परीक्षिताः।
प्राप्तकालं यथा दण्डं धारयेयुः सुतेष्वपि॥', 'kuśalā vyavahāreṣu sauhṛdeṣu parīkṣitāḥ
prāptakālaṃ yathā daṇḍaṃ dhārayeyuḥ suteṣv api', null, 1007007),
('ramayana-1-7-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 8', 'कोशसंग्रहणे युक्ता बलस्य च परिग्रहे।
अहितं चापि पुरुषं न विहिंस्युरदूषकम्॥', 'kośasaṃgrahaṇe yuktā balasya ca parigrahe
ahitaṃ cāpi puruṣaṃ na vihiṃsyur adūṣakam', null, 1007008),
('ramayana-1-7-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 9', 'वीराश्च नियतोत्साहा राजशास्त्रमनुष्ठिताः।
शुचीनां रक्षितारश्च नित्यं विषयवासिनाम्॥', 'vīrāś ca niyatotsāhā rājaśāstram anuṣṭhitāḥ
śucīnāṃ rakṣitāraś ca nityaṃ viṣayavāsinām', null, 1007009),
('ramayana-1-7-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 10', 'ब्रह्मक्षत्रमहिंसन्तस्ते कोशं समपूरयन्।
सुतीक्ष्णदण्डाः संप्रेक्ष्य पुरुषस्य बलाबलम्॥', 'brahmakṣatram ahiṃsantas te kośaṃ samapūrayan
sutīkṣṇadaṇḍāḥ saṃprekṣya puruṣasya balābalam', null, 1007010),
('ramayana-1-7-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 11', 'शुचीनामेकबुद्धीनां सर्वेषां संप्रजानताम्।
नासीत्पुरे वा राष्ट्रे वा मृषावादी नरः क्व चित्॥', 'śucīnām ekabuddhīnāṃ sarveṣāṃ saṃprajānatām
nāsīt pure vā rāṣṭre vā mṛṣāvādī naraḥ kva cit', null, 1007011),
('ramayana-1-7-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 12', 'कश्चिन्न दुष्टस्तत्रासीत्परदाररतिर्नरः।
प्रशान्तं सर्वमेवासीद्राष्ट्रं पुरवरं च तत्॥', 'kaś cin na duṣṭas tatrāsīt paradāraratir naraḥ
praśāntaṃ sarvam evāsīd rāṣṭraṃ puravaraṃ ca tat', null, 1007012),
('ramayana-1-7-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 13', 'सुवाससः सुवेशाश्च ते च सर्वे सुशीलिनः।
हितार्थं च नरेन्द्रस्य जाग्रतो नयचक्षुषा॥', 'suvāsasaḥ suveśāś ca te ca sarve suśīlinaḥ
hitārthaṃ ca narendrasya jāgrato nayacakṣuṣā', null, 1007013),
('ramayana-1-7-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 14', 'गुरौ गुणगृहीताश्च प्रख्याताश्च पराक्रमैः।
विदेशेष्वपि विज्ञाताः सर्वतो बुद्धिनिश्चयात्॥', 'gurau guṇagṛhītāś ca prakhyātāś ca parākramaiḥ
videśeṣv api vijñātāḥ sarvato buddhiniścayāt', null, 1007014),
('ramayana-1-7-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 15', 'ईदृशैस्तैरमात्यैस्तु राजा दशरथोऽनघः।
उपपन्नो गुणोपेतैरन्वशासद्वसुंधराम्॥', 'īdṛśais tair amātyais tu rājā daśaratho ''naghaḥ
upapanno guṇopetair anvaśāsad vasuṃdharām', null, 1007015),
('ramayana-1-7-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 16', 'अवेक्षमाणश्चारेण प्रजा धर्मेण रञ्जयन्।
नाध्यगच्छद्विशिष्टं वा तुल्यं वा शत्रुमात्मनः॥', 'avekṣamāṇaś cāreṇa prajā dharmeṇa rañjayan
nādhyagacchad viśiṣṭaṃ vā tulyaṃ vā śatrum ātmanaḥ', null, 1007016),
('ramayana-1-7-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 7, Verse 17', 'तैर्मन्त्रिभिर्मन्त्रहितैर्निविष्टैर्वृतोऽनुरक्तैः कुशलैः समर्थैः।
स पार्थिवो दीप्तिमवाप युक्तस्तेजोमयैर्गोभिरिवोदितोऽर्कः॥', 'tair mantribhir mantrahitair niviṣṭair vṛto ''nuraktaiḥ kuśalaiḥ samarthaiḥ
sa pārthivo dīptim avāpa yuktas tejomayair gobhir ivodito ''rkaḥ', null, 1007017)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 8 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-8-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 1', 'तस्य त्वेवं प्रभावस्य धर्मज्ञस्य महात्मनः।
सुतार्थं तप्यमानस्य नासीद्वंशकरः सुतः॥', 'tasya tv evaṃ prabhāvasya dharmajñasya mahātmanaḥ
sutārthaṃ tapyamānasya nāsīd vaṃśakaraḥ sutaḥ', null, 1008001),
('ramayana-1-8-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 2', 'चिन्तयानस्य तस्यैवं बुद्धिरासीन्महात्मनः।
सुतार्थं वाजिमेधेन किमर्थं न यजाम्यहम्॥', 'cintayānasya tasyaivaṃ buddhir āsīn mahātmanaḥ
sutārthaṃ vājimedhena kimarthaṃ na yajāmy aham', null, 1008002),
('ramayana-1-8-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 3', 'स निश्चितां मतिं कृत्वा यष्टव्यमिति बुद्धिमान्।
मन्त्रिभिः सह धर्मात्मा सर्वैरेव कृतात्मभिः॥', 'sa niścitāṃ matiṃ kṛtvā yaṣṭavyam iti buddhimān
mantribhiḥ saha dharmātmā sarvair eva kṛtātmabhiḥ', null, 1008003),
('ramayana-1-8-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 4', 'ततोऽब्रवीदिदं राजा सुमन्त्रं मन्त्रिसत्तमम्।
शीघ्रमानय मे सर्वान्गुरूंस्तान्सपुरोहितान्॥', 'tato ''bravīd idaṃ rājā sumantraṃ mantrisattamam
śīghram ānaya me sarvān gurūṃs tān sapurohitān', null, 1008004),
('ramayana-1-8-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 5', 'एतच्छ्रुत्वा रहः सूतो राजानमिदमब्रवीत्।
ऋत्विग्भिरुपदिष्टोऽयं पुरावृत्तो मया श्रुतः॥', 'etac chrutvā rahaḥ sūto rājānam idam abravīt
ṛtvigbhir upadiṣṭo ''yaṃ purāvṛtto mayā śrutaḥ', null, 1008005),
('ramayana-1-8-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 6', 'सनत्कुमारो भगवान्पूर्वं कथितवान्कथाम्।
ऋषीणां संनिधौ राजंस्तव पुत्रागमं प्रति॥', 'sanatkumāro bhagavān pūrvaṃ kathitavān kathām
ṛṣīṇāṃ saṃnidhau rājaṃs tava putrāgamaṃ prati', null, 1008006),
('ramayana-1-8-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 7', 'काश्यपस्य तु पुत्रोऽस्ति विभाण्डक इति श्रुतः।
ऋश्यशृङ्ग इति ख्यातस्तस्य पुत्रो भविष्यति॥', 'kāśyapasya tu putro ''sti vibhāṇḍaka iti śrutaḥ
ṛśyaśṛṅga iti khyātas tasya putro bhaviṣyati', null, 1008007),
('ramayana-1-8-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 8', 'स वने नित्यसंवृद्धो मुनिर्वनचरः सदा।
नान्यं जानाति विप्रेन्द्रो नित्यं पित्रनुवर्तनात्॥', 'sa vane nityasaṃvṛddho munir vanacaraḥ sadā
nānyaṃ jānāti viprendro nityaṃ pitranuvartanāt', null, 1008008),
('ramayana-1-8-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 9', 'द्वैविध्यं ब्रह्मचर्यस्य भविष्यति महात्मनः।
लोकेषु प्रथितं राजन्विप्रैश्च कथितं सदा॥', 'dvaividhyaṃ brahmacaryasya bhaviṣyati mahātmanaḥ
lokeṣu prathitaṃ rājan vipraiś ca kathitaṃ sadā', null, 1008009),
('ramayana-1-8-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 10', 'तस्यैवं वर्तमानस्य कालः समभिवर्तत।
अग्निं शुश्रूषमाणस्य पितरं च यशस्विनम्॥', 'tasyaivaṃ vartamānasya kālaḥ samabhivartata
agniṃ śuśrūṣamāṇasya pitaraṃ ca yaśasvinam', null, 1008010),
('ramayana-1-8-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 11', 'एतस्मिन्नेव काले तु लोमपादः प्रतापवान्।
अङ्गेषु प्रथितो राजा भविष्यति महाबलः॥', 'etasminn eva kāle tu lomapādaḥ pratāpavān
aṅgeṣu prathito rājā bhaviṣyati mahābalaḥ', null, 1008011),
('ramayana-1-8-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 12', 'तस्य व्यतिक्रमाद्राज्ञो भविष्यति सुदारुणा।
अनावृष्टिः सुघोरा वै सर्वभूतभयावहा॥', 'tasya vyatikramād rājño bhaviṣyati sudāruṇā
anāvṛṣṭiḥ sughorā vai sarvabhūtabhayāvahā', null, 1008012),
('ramayana-1-8-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 13', 'अनावृष्ट्यां तु वृत्तायां राजा दुःखसमन्वितः।
ब्राह्मणाञ्श्रुतवृद्धांश्च समानीय प्रवक्ष्यति॥', 'anāvṛṣṭyāṃ tu vṛttāyāṃ rājā duḥkhasamanvitaḥ
brāhmaṇāñ śrutavṛddhāṃś ca samānīya pravakṣyati', null, 1008013),
('ramayana-1-8-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 14', 'भवन्तः श्रुतधर्माणो लोकचारित्रवेदिनः।
समादिशन्तु नियमं प्रायश्चित्तं यथा भवेत्॥', 'bhavantaḥ śrutadharmāṇo lokacāritravedinaḥ
samādiśantu niyamaṃ prāyaścittaṃ yathā bhavet', null, 1008014),
('ramayana-1-8-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 15', 'वक्ष्यन्ति ते महीपालं ब्राह्मणा वेदपारगाः।
विभाण्डकसुतं राजन्सर्वोपायैरिहानय॥', 'vakṣyanti te mahīpālaṃ brāhmaṇā vedapāragāḥ
vibhāṇḍakasutaṃ rājan sarvopāyair ihānaya', null, 1008015),
('ramayana-1-8-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 16', 'आनाय्य च महीपाल ऋश्यशृङ्गं सुसत्कृतम्।
प्रयच्छ कन्यां शान्तां वै विधिना सुसमाहितः॥', 'ānāyya ca mahīpāla ṛśyaśṛṅgaṃ susatkṛtam
prayaccha kanyāṃ śāntāṃ vai vidhinā susamāhitaḥ', null, 1008016),
('ramayana-1-8-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 17', 'तेषां तु वचनं श्रुत्वा राजा चिन्तां प्रपत्स्यते।
केनोपायेन वै शक्यमिहानेतुं स वीर्यवान्॥', 'teṣāṃ tu vacanaṃ śrutvā rājā cintāṃ prapatsyate
kenopāyena vai śakyam ihānetuṃ sa vīryavān', null, 1008017),
('ramayana-1-8-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 18', 'ततो राजा विनिश्चित्य सह मन्त्रिभिरात्मवान्।
पुरोहितममात्यांश्च प्रेषयिष्यति सत्कृतान्॥', 'tato rājā viniścitya saha mantribhir ātmavān
purohitam amātyāṃś ca preṣayiṣyati satkṛtān', null, 1008018),
('ramayana-1-8-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 19', 'ते तु राज्ञो वचः श्रुत्वा व्यथिता वनताननाः।
न गच्छेम ऋषेर्भीता अनुनेष्यन्ति तं नृपम्॥', 'te tu rājño vacaḥ śrutvā vyathitā vanatānanāḥ
na gacchema ṛṣer bhītā anuneṣyanti taṃ nṛpam', null, 1008019),
('ramayana-1-8-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 20', 'वक्ष्यन्ति चिन्तयित्वा ते तस्योपायांश्च तान्क्षमान्।
आनेष्यामो वयं विप्रं न च दोषो भविष्यति॥', 'vakṣyanti cintayitvā te tasyopāyāṃś ca tān kṣamān
āneṣyāmo vayaṃ vipraṃ na ca doṣo bhaviṣyati', null, 1008020),
('ramayana-1-8-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 21', 'एवमङ्गाधिपेनैव गणिकाभिरृषेः सुतः।
आनीतोऽवर्षयद्देवः शान्ता चास्मै प्रदीयते॥', 'evam aṅgādhipenaiva gaṇikābhir ṛṣeḥ sutaḥ
ānīto ''varṣayad devaḥ śāntā cāsmai pradīyate', null, 1008021),
('ramayana-1-8-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 22', 'ऋश्यशृङ्गस्तु जामाता पुत्रांस्तव विधास्यति।
सनत्कुमारकथितमेतावद्व्याहृतं मया॥', 'ṛśyaśṛṅgas tu jāmātā putrāṃs tava vidhāsyati
sanatkumārakathitam etāvad vyāhṛtaṃ mayā', null, 1008022),
('ramayana-1-8-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 8, Verse 23', 'अथ हृष्टो दशरथः सुमन्त्रं प्रत्यभाषत।
यथर्ष्यशृङ्गस्त्वानीतो विस्तरेण त्वयोच्यताम्॥', 'atha hṛṣṭo daśarathaḥ sumantraṃ pratyabhāṣata
yatharṣyaśṛṅgas tv ānīto vistareṇa tvayocyatām', null, 1008023)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 9 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-9-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 1', 'सुमन्त्रश्चोदितो राज्ञा प्रोवाचेदं वचस्तदा।
यथर्ष्यशृङ्गस्त्वानीतः शृणु मे मन्त्रिभिः सह॥', 'sumantraś codito rājñā provācedaṃ vacas tadā
yatharṣyaśṛṅgas tv ānītaḥ śṛṇu me mantribhiḥ saha', null, 1009001),
('ramayana-1-9-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 2', 'लोमपादमुवाचेदं सहामात्यः पुरोहितः।
उपायो निरपायोऽयमस्माभिरभिचिन्तितः॥', 'lomapādam uvācedaṃ sahāmātyaḥ purohitaḥ
upāyo nirapāyo ''yam asmābhir abhicintitaḥ', null, 1009002),
('ramayana-1-9-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 3', 'ऋश्यशृङ्गो वनचरस्तपःस्वाध्यायने रतः।
अनभिज्ञः स नारीणां विषयाणां सुखस्य च॥', 'ṛśyaśṛṅgo vanacaras tapaḥsvādhyāyane rataḥ
anabhijñaḥ sa nārīṇāṃ viṣayāṇāṃ sukhasya ca', null, 1009003),
('ramayana-1-9-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 4', 'इन्द्रियार्थैरभिमतैर्नरचित्तप्रमाथिभिः।
पुरमानाययिष्यामः क्षिप्रं चाध्यवसीयताम्॥', 'indriyārthair abhimatair naracittapramāthibhiḥ
puram ānāyayiṣyāmaḥ kṣipraṃ cādhyavasīyatām', null, 1009004),
('ramayana-1-9-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 5', 'गणिकास्तत्र गच्छन्तु रूपवत्यः स्वलंकृताः।
प्रलोभ्य विविधोपायैरानेष्यन्तीह सत्कृताः॥', 'gaṇikās tatra gacchantu rūpavatyaḥ svalaṃkṛtāḥ
pralobhya vividhopāyair āneṣyantīha satkṛtāḥ', null, 1009005),
('ramayana-1-9-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 6', 'श्रुत्वा तथेति राजा च प्रत्युवाच पुरोहितम्।
पुरोहितो मन्त्रिणश्च तथा चक्रुश्च ते तदा॥', 'śrutvā tatheti rājā ca pratyuvāca purohitam
purohito mantriṇaś ca tathā cakruś ca te tadā', null, 1009006),
('ramayana-1-9-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 7', 'वारमुख्यास्तु तच्छ्रुत्वा वनं प्रविविशुर्महत्।
आश्रमस्याविदूरेऽस्मिन्यत्नं कुर्वन्ति दर्शने।
ऋषिपुत्रस्य घोरस्य नित्यमाश्रमवासिनः॥', 'vāramukhyās tu tac chrutvā vanaṃ praviviśur mahat
āśramasyāvidūre ''smin yatnaṃ kurvanti darśane
ṛṣiputrasya ghorasya nityam āśramavāsinaḥ', null, 1009007),
('ramayana-1-9-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 8', 'पितुः स नित्यसंतुष्टो नातिचक्राम चाश्रमात्॥', 'pituḥ sa nityasaṃtuṣṭo nāticakrāma cāśramāt', null, 1009008),
('ramayana-1-9-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 9', 'न तेन जन्मप्रभृति दृष्टपूर्वं तपस्विना।
स्त्री वा पुमान्वा यच्चान्यत्सत्त्वं नगरराष्ट्रजम्॥', 'na tena janmaprabhṛti dṛṣṭapūrvaṃ tapasvinā
strī vā pumān vā yac cānyat sattvaṃ nagararāṣṭrajam', null, 1009009),
('ramayana-1-9-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 10', 'ततः कदा चित्तं देशमाजगाम यदृच्छया।
विभाण्डकसुतस्तत्र ताश्चापश्यद्वराङ्गनाः॥', 'tataḥ kadā cit taṃ deśam ājagāma yadṛcchayā
vibhāṇḍakasutas tatra tāś cāpaśyad varāṅganāḥ', null, 1009010),
('ramayana-1-9-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 11', 'ताश्चित्रवेषाः प्रमदा गायन्त्यो मधुरस्वरैः।
ऋषिपुत्रमुपागम्य सर्वा वचनमब्रुवन्॥', 'tāś citraveṣāḥ pramadā gāyantyo madhurasvaraiḥ
ṛṣiputram upāgamya sarvā vacanam abruvan', null, 1009011),
('ramayana-1-9-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 12', 'कस्त्वं किं वर्तसे ब्रह्मञ्ज्ञातुमिच्छामहे वयम्।
एकस्त्वं विजने घोरे वने चरसि शंस नः॥', 'kas tvaṃ kiṃ vartase brahmañ jñātum icchāmahe vayam
ekas tvaṃ vijane ghore vane carasi śaṃsa naḥ', null, 1009012),
('ramayana-1-9-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 13', 'अदृष्टरूपास्तास्तेन काम्यरूपा वने स्त्रियः।
हार्दात्तस्य मतिर्जाता आख्यातुं पितरं स्वकम्॥', 'adṛṣṭarūpās tās tena kāmyarūpā vane striyaḥ
hārdāt tasya matir jātā ākhyātuṃ pitaraṃ svakam', null, 1009013),
('ramayana-1-9-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 14', 'पिता विभाण्डकोऽस्माकं तस्याहं सुत औरसः।
ऋश्यशृङ्ग इति ख्यातं नाम कर्म च मे भुवि॥', 'pitā vibhāṇḍako ''smākaṃ tasyāhaṃ suta aurasaḥ
ṛśyaśṛṅga iti khyātaṃ nāma karma ca me bhuvi', null, 1009014),
('ramayana-1-9-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 15', 'इहाश्रमपदोऽस्माकं समीपे शुभदर्शनाः।
करिष्ये वोऽत्र पूजां वै सर्वेषां विधिपूर्वकम्॥', 'ihāśramapado ''smākaṃ samīpe śubhadarśanāḥ
kariṣye vo ''tra pūjāṃ vai sarveṣāṃ vidhipūrvakam', null, 1009015),
('ramayana-1-9-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 16', 'ऋषिपुत्रवचः श्रुत्वा सर्वासां मतिरास वै।
तदाश्रमपदं द्रष्टुं जग्मुः सर्वाश्च तेन ह॥', 'ṛṣiputravacaḥ śrutvā sarvāsāṃ matir āsa vai
tad āśramapadaṃ draṣṭuṃ jagmuḥ sarvāś ca tena ha', null, 1009016),
('ramayana-1-9-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 17', 'गतानां तु ततः पूजामृषिपुत्रश्चकार ह।
इदमर्घ्यमिदं पाद्यमिदं मूलं फलं च नः॥', 'gatānāṃ tu tataḥ pūjām ṛṣiputraś cakāra ha
idam arghyam idaṃ pādyam idaṃ mūlaṃ phalaṃ ca naḥ', null, 1009017),
('ramayana-1-9-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 18', 'प्रतिगृह्य तु तां पूजां सर्वा एव समुत्सुकाः।
ऋषेर्भीताश्च शीघ्रं तु गमनाय मतिं दधुः॥', 'pratigṛhya tu tāṃ pūjāṃ sarvā eva samutsukāḥ
ṛṣer bhītāś ca śīghraṃ tu gamanāya matiṃ dadhuḥ', null, 1009018),
('ramayana-1-9-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 19', 'अस्माकमपि मुख्यानि फलानीमानि वै द्विज।
गृहाण प्रति भद्रं ते भक्षयस्व च मा चिरम्॥', 'asmākam api mukhyāni phalānīmāni vai dvija
gṛhāṇa prati bhadraṃ te bhakṣayasva ca mā ciram', null, 1009019),
('ramayana-1-9-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 20', 'ततस्तास्तं समालिङ्ग्य सर्वा हर्षसमन्विताः।
मोदकान्प्रददुस्तस्मै भक्ष्यांश्च विविधाञ्शुभान्॥', 'tatas tās taṃ samāliṅgya sarvā harṣasamanvitāḥ
modakān pradadus tasmai bhakṣyāṃś ca vividhāñ śubhān', null, 1009020),
('ramayana-1-9-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 21', 'तानि चास्वाद्य तेजस्वी फलानीति स्म मन्यते।
अनास्वादितपूर्वाणि वने नित्यनिवासिना॥', 'tāni cāsvādya tejasvī phalānīti sma manyate
anāsvāditapūrvāṇi vane nityanivāsinā', null, 1009021),
('ramayana-1-9-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 22', 'आपृच्छ्य च तदा विप्रं व्रतचर्यां निवेद्य च।
गच्छन्ति स्मापदेशात्ता भीतास्तस्य पितुः स्त्रियः॥', 'āpṛcchya ca tadā vipraṃ vratacaryāṃ nivedya ca
gacchanti smāpadeśāt tā bhītās tasya pituḥ striyaḥ', null, 1009022),
('ramayana-1-9-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 23', 'गतासु तासु सर्वासु काश्यपस्यात्मजो द्विजः।
अस्वस्थहृदयश्चासीद्दुःखं स्म परिवर्तते॥', 'gatāsu tāsu sarvāsu kāśyapasyātmajo dvijaḥ
asvasthahṛdayaś cāsīd duḥkhaṃ sma parivartate', null, 1009023),
('ramayana-1-9-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 24', 'ततोऽपरेद्युस्तं देशमाजगाम स वीर्यवान्।
मनोज्ञा यत्र ता दृष्टा वारमुख्याः स्वलंकृताः॥', 'tato ''paredyus taṃ deśam ājagāma sa vīryavān
manojñā yatra tā dṛṣṭā vāramukhyāḥ svalaṃkṛtāḥ', null, 1009024),
('ramayana-1-9-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 25', 'दृष्ट्वैव च तदा विप्रमायान्तं हृष्टमानसाः।
उपसृत्य ततः सर्वास्तास्तमूचुरिदं वचः॥', 'dṛṣṭvaiva ca tadā vipram āyāntaṃ hṛṣṭamānasāḥ
upasṛtya tataḥ sarvās tās tam ūcur idaṃ vacaḥ', null, 1009025),
('ramayana-1-9-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 26', 'एह्याश्रमपदं सौम्य अस्माकमिति चाब्रुवन्।
तत्राप्येष विधिः श्रीमान्विशेषेण भविष्यति॥', 'ehy āśramapadaṃ saumya asmākam iti cābruvan
tatrāpy eṣa vidhiḥ śrīmān viśeṣeṇa bhaviṣyati', null, 1009026),
('ramayana-1-9-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 27', 'श्रुत्वा तु वचनं तासां सर्वासां हृदयंगमम्।
गमनाय मतिं चक्रे तं च निन्युस्तदा स्त्रियः॥', 'śrutvā tu vacanaṃ tāsāṃ sarvāsāṃ hṛdayaṃgamam
gamanāya matiṃ cakre taṃ ca ninyus tadā striyaḥ', null, 1009027),
('ramayana-1-9-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 28', 'तत्र चानीयमाने तु विप्रे तस्मिन्महात्मनि।
ववर्ष सहसा देवो जगत्प्रह्लादयंस्तदा॥', 'tatra cānīyamāne tu vipre tasmin mahātmani
vavarṣa sahasā devo jagat prahlādayaṃs tadā', null, 1009028),
('ramayana-1-9-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 29', 'वर्षेणैवागतं विप्रं विषयं स्वं नराधिपः।
प्रत्युद्गम्य मुनिं प्रह्वः शिरसा च महीं गतः॥', 'varṣeṇaivāgataṃ vipraṃ viṣayaṃ svaṃ narādhipaḥ
pratyudgamya muniṃ prahvaḥ śirasā ca mahīṃ gataḥ', null, 1009029),
('ramayana-1-9-30', 30, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 30', 'अर्घ्यं च प्रददौ तस्मै न्यायतः सुसमाहितः।
वव्रे प्रसादं विप्रेन्द्रान्मा विप्रं मन्युराविशेत्॥', 'arghyaṃ ca pradadau tasmai nyāyataḥ susamāhitaḥ
vavre prasādaṃ viprendrān mā vipraṃ manyur āviśet', null, 1009030),
('ramayana-1-9-31', 31, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 31', 'अन्तःपुरं प्रविश्यास्मै कन्यां दत्त्वा यथाविधि।
शान्तां शान्तेन मनसा राजा हर्षमवाप सः॥', 'antaḥpuraṃ praviśyāsmai kanyāṃ dattvā yathāvidhi
śāntāṃ śāntena manasā rājā harṣam avāpa saḥ', null, 1009031),
('ramayana-1-9-32', 32, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 9, Verse 32', 'एवं स न्यवसत्तत्र सर्वकामैः सुपूजितः।
ऋश्यशृङ्गो महातेजाः शान्तया सह भार्यया॥', 'evaṃ sa nyavasat tatra sarvakāmaiḥ supūjitaḥ
ṛśyaśṛṅgo mahātejāḥ śāntayā saha bhāryayā', null, 1009032)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 10 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-10-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 1', 'भूय एव च राजेन्द्र शृणु मे वचनं हितम्।
यथा स देवप्रवरः कथायामेवमब्रवीत्॥', 'bhūya eva ca rājendra śṛṇu me vacanaṃ hitam
yathā sa devapravaraḥ kathāyām evam abravīt', null, 1010001),
('ramayana-1-10-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 2', 'इक्ष्वाकूणां कुले जातो भविष्यति सुधार्मिकः।
राजा दशरथो नाम्ना श्रीमान्सत्यप्रतिश्रवः॥', 'ikṣvākūṇāṃ kule jāto bhaviṣyati sudhārmikaḥ
rājā daśaratho nāmnā śrīmān satyapratiśravaḥ', null, 1010002),
('ramayana-1-10-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 3', 'अङ्गराजेन सख्यं च तस्य राज्ञो भविष्यति।
कन्या चास्य महाभागा शान्ता नाम भविष्यति॥', 'aṅgarājena sakhyaṃ ca tasya rājño bhaviṣyati
kanyā cāsya mahābhāgā śāntā nāma bhaviṣyati', null, 1010003),
('ramayana-1-10-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 4', 'पुत्रस्त्वङ्गस्य राज्ञस्तु लोमपाद इति श्रुतः।
तं स राजा दशरथो गमिष्यति महायशाः॥', 'putras tv aṅgasya rājñas tu lomapāda iti śrutaḥ
taṃ sa rājā daśaratho gamiṣyati mahāyaśāḥ', null, 1010004),
('ramayana-1-10-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 5', 'अनपत्योऽस्मि धर्मात्मञ्शान्ताभर्ता मम क्रतुम्।
आहरेत त्वयाज्ञप्तः संतानार्थं कुलस्य च॥', 'anapatyo ''smi dharmātmañ śāntābhartā mama kratum
āhareta tvayājñaptaḥ saṃtānārthaṃ kulasya ca', null, 1010005),
('ramayana-1-10-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 6', 'श्रुत्वा राज्ञोऽथ तद्वाक्यं मनसा स विचिन्त्य च।
प्रदास्यते पुत्रवन्तं शान्ता भर्तारमात्मवान्॥', 'śrutvā rājño ''tha tad vākyaṃ manasā sa vicintya ca
pradāsyate putravantaṃ śāntā bhartāram ātmavān', null, 1010006),
('ramayana-1-10-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 7', 'प्रतिगृह्य च तं विप्रं स राजा विगतज्वरः।
आहरिष्यति तं यज्ञं प्रहृष्टेनान्तरात्मना॥', 'pratigṛhya ca taṃ vipraṃ sa rājā vigatajvaraḥ
āhariṣyati taṃ yajñaṃ prahṛṣṭenāntarātmanā', null, 1010007),
('ramayana-1-10-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 8', 'तं च राजा दशरथो यष्टुकामः कृताञ्जलिः।
ऋश्यशृङ्गं द्विजश्रेष्ठं वरयिष्यति धर्मवित्॥', 'taṃ ca rājā daśaratho yaṣṭukāmaḥ kṛtāñjaliḥ
ṛśyaśṛṅgaṃ dvijaśreṣṭhaṃ varayiṣyati dharmavit', null, 1010008),
('ramayana-1-10-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 9', 'यज्ञार्थं प्रसवार्थं च स्वर्गार्थं च नरेश्वरः।
लभते च स तं कामं द्विजमुख्याद्विशां पतिः॥', 'yajñārthaṃ prasavārthaṃ ca svargārthaṃ ca nareśvaraḥ
labhate ca sa taṃ kāmaṃ dvijamukhyād viśāṃ patiḥ', null, 1010009),
('ramayana-1-10-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 10', 'पुत्राश्चास्य भविष्यन्ति चत्वारोऽमितविक्रमाः।
वंशप्रतिष्ठानकराः सर्वलोकेषु विश्रुताः॥', 'putrāś cāsya bhaviṣyanti catvāro ''mitavikramāḥ
vaṃśapratiṣṭhānakarāḥ sarvalokeṣu viśrutāḥ', null, 1010010),
('ramayana-1-10-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 11', 'एवं स देवप्रवरः पूर्वं कथितवान्कथाम्।
सनत्कुमारो भगवान्पुरा देवयुगे प्रभुः॥', 'evaṃ sa devapravaraḥ pūrvaṃ kathitavān kathām
sanatkumāro bhagavān purā devayuge prabhuḥ', null, 1010011),
('ramayana-1-10-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 12', 'स त्वं पुरुषशार्दूल तमानय सुसत्कृतम्।
स्वयमेव महाराज गत्वा सबलवाहनः॥', 'sa tvaṃ puruṣaśārdūla tam ānaya susatkṛtam
svayam eva mahārāja gatvā sabalavāhanaḥ', null, 1010012),
('ramayana-1-10-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 13', 'अनुमान्य वसिष्ठं च सूतवाक्यं निशम्य च।
सान्तःपुरः सहामात्यः प्रययौ यत्र स द्विजः॥', 'anumānya vasiṣṭhaṃ ca sūtavākyaṃ niśamya ca
sāntaḥpuraḥ sahāmātyaḥ prayayau yatra sa dvijaḥ', null, 1010013),
('ramayana-1-10-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 14', 'वनानि सरितश्चैव व्यतिक्रम्य शनैः शनैः।
अभिचक्राम तं देशं यत्र वै मुनिपुंगवः॥', 'vanāni saritaś caiva vyatikramya śanaiḥ śanaiḥ
abhicakrāma taṃ deśaṃ yatra vai munipuṃgavaḥ', null, 1010014),
('ramayana-1-10-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 15', 'आसाद्य तं द्विजश्रेष्ठं लोमपादसमीपगम्।
ऋषिपुत्रं ददर्शादौ दीप्यमानमिवानलम्॥', 'āsādya taṃ dvijaśreṣṭhaṃ lomapādasamīpagam
ṛṣiputraṃ dadarśādau dīpyamānam ivānalam', null, 1010015),
('ramayana-1-10-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 16', 'ततो राजा यथान्यायं पूजां चक्रे विशेषतः।
सखित्वात्तस्य वै राज्ञः प्रहृष्टेनान्तरात्मना॥', 'tato rājā yathānyāyaṃ pūjāṃ cakre viśeṣataḥ
sakhitvāt tasya vai rājñaḥ prahṛṣṭenāntarātmanā', null, 1010016),
('ramayana-1-10-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 17', 'लोमपादेन चाख्यातमृषिपुत्राय धीमते।
सख्यं संबन्धकं चैव तदा तं प्रत्यपूजयत्॥', 'lomapādena cākhyātam ṛṣiputrāya dhīmate
sakhyaṃ saṃbandhakaṃ caiva tadā taṃ pratyapūjayat', null, 1010017),
('ramayana-1-10-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 18', 'एवं सुसत्कृतस्तेन सहोषित्वा नरर्षभः।
सप्ताष्टदिवसान्राजा राजानमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'evaṃ susatkṛtas tena sahoṣitvā nararṣabhaḥ
saptāṣṭadivasān rājā rājānam idam abravīt', null, 1010018),
('ramayana-1-10-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 19', 'शान्ता तव सुता राजन्सह भर्त्रा विशाम्पते।
मदीयं नगरं यातु कार्यं हि महदुद्यतम्॥', 'śāntā tava sutā rājan saha bhartrā viśāmpate
madīyaṃ nagaraṃ yātu kāryaṃ hi mahad udyatam', null, 1010019),
('ramayana-1-10-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 20', 'तथेति राजा संश्रुत्य गमनं तस्य धीमतः।
उवाच वचनं विप्रं गच्छ त्वं सह भार्यया॥', 'tatheti rājā saṃśrutya gamanaṃ tasya dhīmataḥ
uvāca vacanaṃ vipraṃ gaccha tvaṃ saha bhāryayā', null, 1010020),
('ramayana-1-10-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 21', 'ऋषिपुत्रः प्रतिश्रुत्य तथेत्याह नृपं तदा।
स नृपेणाभ्यनुज्ञातः प्रययौ सह भार्यया॥', 'ṛṣiputraḥ pratiśrutya tathety āha nṛpaṃ tadā
sa nṛpeṇābhyanujñātaḥ prayayau saha bhāryayā', null, 1010021),
('ramayana-1-10-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 22', 'तावन्योन्याञ्जलिं कृत्वा स्नेहात्संश्लिष्य चोरसा।
ननन्दतुर्दशरथो लोमपादश्च वीर्यवान्॥', 'tāv anyonyāñjaliṃ kṛtvā snehāt saṃśliṣya corasā
nanandatur daśaratho lomapādaś ca vīryavān', null, 1010022),
('ramayana-1-10-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 23', 'ततः सुहृदमापृच्छ्य प्रस्थितो रघुनन्दनः।
पौरेभ्यः प्रेषयामास दूतान्वै शीघ्रगामिनः।
क्रियतां नगरं सर्वं क्षिप्रमेव स्वलंकृतम्॥', 'tataḥ suhṛdam āpṛcchya prasthito raghunandanaḥ
paurebhyaḥ preṣayām āsa dūtān vai śīghragāminaḥ
kriyatāṃ nagaraṃ sarvaṃ kṣipram eva svalaṃkṛtam', null, 1010023),
('ramayana-1-10-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 24', 'ततः प्रहृष्टाः पौरास्ते श्रुत्वा राजानमागतम्।
तथा प्रचक्रुस्तत्सर्वं राज्ञा यत्प्रेषितं तदा॥', 'tataḥ prahṛṣṭāḥ paurās te śrutvā rājānam āgatam
tathā pracakrus tat sarvaṃ rājñā yat preṣitaṃ tadā', null, 1010024),
('ramayana-1-10-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 25', 'ततः स्वलंकृतं राजा नगरं प्रविवेश ह।
शङ्खदुन्दुभिनिर्घोषैः पुरस्कृत्य द्विजर्षभम्॥', 'tataḥ svalaṃkṛtaṃ rājā nagaraṃ praviveśa ha
śaṅkhadundubhinirghoṣaiḥ puraskṛtya dvijarṣabham', null, 1010025),
('ramayana-1-10-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 26', 'ततः प्रमुदिताः सर्वे दृष्ट्वा तं नागरा द्विजम्।
प्रवेश्यमानं सत्कृत्य नरेन्द्रेणेन्द्रकर्मणा॥', 'tataḥ pramuditāḥ sarve dṛṣṭvā taṃ nāgarā dvijam
praveśyamānaṃ satkṛtya narendreṇendrakarmaṇā', null, 1010026),
('ramayana-1-10-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 27', 'अन्तःपुरं प्रवेश्यैनं पूजां कृत्वा तु शास्त्रतः।
कृतकृत्यं तदात्मानं मेने तस्योपवाहनात्॥', 'antaḥpuraṃ praveśyainaṃ pūjāṃ kṛtvā tu śāstrataḥ
kṛtakṛtyaṃ tadātmānaṃ mene tasyopavāhanāt', null, 1010027),
('ramayana-1-10-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 28', 'अन्तःपुराणि सर्वाणि शान्तां दृष्ट्वा तथागताम्।
सह भर्त्रा विशालाक्षीं प्रीत्यानन्दमुपागमन्॥', 'antaḥpurāṇi sarvāṇi śāntāṃ dṛṣṭvā tathāgatām
saha bhartrā viśālākṣīṃ prītyānandam upāgaman', null, 1010028),
('ramayana-1-10-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 10, Verse 29', 'पूज्यमाना च ताभिः सा राज्ञा चैव विशेषतः।
उवास तत्र सुखिता कं चित्कालं सह द्विजा॥', 'pūjyamānā ca tābhiḥ sā rājñā caiva viśeṣataḥ
uvāsa tatra sukhitā kaṃ cit kālaṃ saha dvijā', null, 1010029)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 11 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-11-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 1', 'ततः काले बहुतिथे कस्मिंश्चित्सुमनोहरे।
वसन्ते समनुप्राप्ते राज्ञो यष्टुं मनोऽभवत्॥', 'tataḥ kāle bahutithe kasmiṃś cit sumanohare
vasante samanuprāpte rājño yaṣṭuṃ mano ''bhavat', null, 1011001),
('ramayana-1-11-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 2', 'ततः प्रसाद्य शिरसा तं विप्रं देववर्णिनम्।
यज्ञाय वरयामास संतानार्थं कुलस्य वै॥', 'tataḥ prasādya śirasā taṃ vipraṃ devavarṇinam
yajñāya varayām āsa saṃtānārthaṃ kulasya vai', null, 1011002),
('ramayana-1-11-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 3', 'तथेति च स राजानमुवाच च सुसत्कृतः।
संभाराः संभ्रियन्तां ते तुरगश्च विमुच्यताम्॥', 'tatheti ca sa rājānam uvāca ca susatkṛtaḥ
saṃbhārāḥ saṃbhriyantāṃ te turagaś ca vimucyatām', null, 1011003),
('ramayana-1-11-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 4', 'ततो राजाब्रवीद्वाक्यं सुमन्त्रं मन्त्रिसत्तमम्।
सुमन्त्रावाहय क्षिप्रमृत्विजो ब्रह्मवादिनः॥', 'tato rājābravīd vākyaṃ sumantraṃ mantrisattamam
sumantrāvāhaya kṣipram ṛtvijo brahmavādinaḥ', null, 1011004),
('ramayana-1-11-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 5', 'ततः सुमन्त्रस्त्वरितं गत्वा त्वरितविक्रमः।
समानयत्स तान्विप्रान्समस्तान्वेदपारगान्॥', 'tataḥ sumantras tvaritaṃ gatvā tvaritavikramaḥ
samānayat sa tān viprān samastān vedapāragān', null, 1011005),
('ramayana-1-11-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 6', 'सुयज्ञं वामदेवं च जाबालिमथ काश्यपम्।
पुरोहितं वसिष्ठं च ये चान्ये द्विजसत्तमाः॥', 'suyajñaṃ vāmadevaṃ ca jābālim atha kāśyapam
purohitaṃ vasiṣṭhaṃ ca ye cānye dvijasattamāḥ', null, 1011006),
('ramayana-1-11-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 7', 'तान्पूजयित्वा धर्मात्मा राजा दशरथस्तदा।
इदं धर्मार्थसहितं श्लक्ष्णं वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'tān pūjayitvā dharmātmā rājā daśarathas tadā
idaṃ dharmārthasahitaṃ ślakṣṇaṃ vacanam abravīt', null, 1011007),
('ramayana-1-11-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 8', 'मम लालप्यमानस्य पुत्रार्थं नास्ति वै सुखम्।
तदर्थं हयमेधेन यक्ष्यामीति मतिर्मम॥', 'mama lālapyamānasya putrārthaṃ nāsti vai sukham
tadarthaṃ hayamedhena yakṣyāmīti matir mama', null, 1011008),
('ramayana-1-11-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 9', 'तदहं यष्टुमिच्छामि शास्त्रदृष्टेन कर्मणा।
ऋषिपुत्रप्रभावेन कामान्प्राप्स्यामि चाप्यहम्॥', 'tad ahaṃ yaṣṭum icchāmi śāstradṛṣṭena karmaṇā
ṛṣiputraprabhāvena kāmān prāpsyāmi cāpy aham', null, 1011009),
('ramayana-1-11-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 10', 'ततः साध्विति तद्वाक्यं ब्राह्मणाः प्रत्यपूजयन्।
वसिष्ठप्रमुखाः सर्वे पार्थिवस्य मुखाच्च्युतम्॥', 'tataḥ sādhv iti tad vākyaṃ brāhmaṇāḥ pratyapūjayan
vasiṣṭhapramukhāḥ sarve pārthivasya mukhāc cyutam', null, 1011010),
('ramayana-1-11-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 11', 'ऋश्यशृङ्गपुरोगाश्च प्रत्यूचुर्नृपतिं तदा।
संभाराः संभ्रियन्तां ते तुरगश्च विमुच्यताम्॥', 'ṛśyaśṛṅgapurogāś ca pratyūcur nṛpatiṃ tadā
saṃbhārāḥ saṃbhriyantāṃ te turagaś ca vimucyatām', null, 1011011),
('ramayana-1-11-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 12', 'सर्वथा प्राप्यसे पुत्रांश्चतुरोऽमितविक्रमान्।
यस्य ते धार्मिकी बुद्धिरियं पुत्रार्थमागता॥', 'sarvathā prāpyase putrāṃś caturo ''mitavikramān
yasya te dhārmikī buddhir iyaṃ putrārtham āgatā', null, 1011012),
('ramayana-1-11-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 13', 'ततः प्रीतोऽभवद्राजा श्रुत्वा तद्द्विजभाषितम्।
अमात्यांश्चाब्रवीद्राजा हर्षेणेदं शुभाक्षरम्॥', 'tataḥ prīto ''bhavad rājā śrutvā tad dvijabhāṣitam
amātyāṃś cābravīd rājā harṣeṇedaṃ śubhākṣaram', null, 1011013),
('ramayana-1-11-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 14', 'गुरूणां वचनाच्छीघ्रं संभाराः संभ्रियन्तु मे।
समर्थाधिष्ठितश्चाश्वः सोपाध्यायो विमुच्यताम्॥', 'gurūṇāṃ vacanāc chīghraṃ saṃbhārāḥ saṃbhriyantu me
samarthādhiṣṭhitaś cāśvaḥ sopādhyāyo vimucyatām', null, 1011014),
('ramayana-1-11-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 15', 'सरय्वाश्चोत्तरे तीरे यज्ञभूमिर्विधीयताम्।
शान्तयश्चाभिवर्धन्तां यथाकल्पं यथाविधि॥', 'sarayvāś cottare tīre yajñabhūmir vidhīyatām
śāntayaś cābhivardhantāṃ yathākalpaṃ yathāvidhi', null, 1011015),
('ramayana-1-11-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 16', 'शक्यः कर्तुमयं यज्ञः सर्वेणापि महीक्षिता।
नापराधो भवेत्कष्टो यद्यस्मिन्क्रतुसत्तमे॥', 'śakyaḥ kartum ayaṃ yajñaḥ sarveṇāpi mahīkṣitā
nāparādho bhavet kaṣṭo yady asmin kratusattame', null, 1011016),
('ramayana-1-11-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 17', 'छिद्रं हि मृगयन्तेऽत्र विद्वांसो ब्रह्मराक्षसाः।
विधिहीनस्य यज्ञस्य सद्यः कर्ता विनश्यति॥', 'chidraṃ hi mṛgayante ''tra vidvāṃso brahmarākṣasāḥ
vidhihīnasya yajñasya sadyaḥ kartā vinaśyati', null, 1011017),
('ramayana-1-11-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 18', 'तद्यथा विधिपूर्वं मे क्रतुरेष समाप्यते।
तथाविधानं क्रियतां समर्थाः करणेष्विह॥', 'tad yathā vidhipūrvaṃ me kratur eṣa samāpyate
tathāvidhānaṃ kriyatāṃ samarthāḥ karaṇeṣv iha', null, 1011018),
('ramayana-1-11-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 19', 'तथेति च ततः सर्वे मन्त्रिणः प्रत्यपूजयन्।
पार्थिवेन्द्रस्य तद्वाक्यं यथाज्ञप्तमकुर्वत॥', 'tatheti ca tataḥ sarve mantriṇaḥ pratyapūjayan
pārthivendrasya tad vākyaṃ yathājñaptam akurvata', null, 1011019),
('ramayana-1-11-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 20', 'ततो द्विजास्ते धर्मज्ञमस्तुवन्पार्थिवर्षभम्।
अनुज्ञातास्ततः सर्वे पुनर्जग्मुर्यथागतम्॥', 'tato dvijās te dharmajñam astuvan pārthivarṣabham
anujñātās tataḥ sarve punar jagmur yathāgatam', null, 1011020),
('ramayana-1-11-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 11, Verse 21', 'गतानां तु द्विजातीनां मन्त्रिणस्तान्नराधिपः।
विसर्जयित्वा स्वं वेश्म प्रविवेश महाद्युतिः॥', 'gatānāṃ tu dvijātīnāṃ mantriṇas tān narādhipaḥ
visarjayitvā svaṃ veśma praviveśa mahādyutiḥ', null, 1011021)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 12 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-12-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 1', 'पुनः प्राप्ते वसन्ते तु पूर्णः संवत्सरोऽभवत्।
अभिवाद्य वसिष्ठं च न्यायतः प्रतिपूज्य च॥', 'punaḥ prāpte vasante tu pūrṇaḥ saṃvatsaro ''bhavat
abhivādya vasiṣṭhaṃ ca nyāyataḥ pratipūjya ca', null, 1012001),
('ramayana-1-12-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 2', 'अब्रवीत्प्रश्रितं वाक्यं प्रसवार्थं द्विजोत्तमम्।
यज्ञो मे क्रियतां विप्र यथोक्तं मुनिपुंगव॥', 'abravīt praśritaṃ vākyaṃ prasavārthaṃ dvijottamam
yajño me kriyatāṃ vipra yathoktaṃ munipuṃgava', null, 1012002),
('ramayana-1-12-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 3', 'यथा न विघ्नः क्रियते यज्ञाङ्गेषु विधीयताम्।
भवान्स्निग्धः सुहृन्मह्यं गुरुश्च परमो महान्॥', 'yathā na vighnaḥ kriyate yajñāṅgeṣu vidhīyatām
bhavān snigdhaḥ suhṛn mahyaṃ guruś ca paramo mahān', null, 1012003),
('ramayana-1-12-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 4', 'वोढव्यो भवता चैव भारो यज्ञस्य चोद्यतः।
तथेति च स राजानमब्रवीद्द्विजसत्तमः॥', 'voḍhavyo bhavatā caiva bhāro yajñasya codyataḥ
tatheti ca sa rājānam abravīd dvijasattamaḥ', null, 1012004),
('ramayana-1-12-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 5', 'करिष्ये सर्वमेवैतद्भवता यत्समर्थितम्।
ततोऽब्रवीद्द्विजान्वृद्धान्यज्ञकर्मसु निष्ठितान्॥', 'kariṣye sarvam evaitad bhavatā yat samarthitam
tato ''bravīd dvijān vṛddhān yajñakarmasu niṣṭhitān', null, 1012005),
('ramayana-1-12-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 6', 'स्थापत्ये निष्ठितांश्चैव वृद्धान्परमधार्मिकान्।
कर्मान्तिकाञ्शिल्पकारान्वर्धकीन्खनकानपि॥', 'sthāpatye niṣṭhitāṃś caiva vṛddhān paramadhārmikān
karmāntikāñ śilpakārān vardhakīn khanakān api', null, 1012006),
('ramayana-1-12-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 7', 'गणकाञ्शिल्पिनश्चैव तथैव नटनर्तकान्।
तथा शुचीञ्शास्त्रविदः पुरुषान्सुबहुश्रुतान्॥', 'gaṇakāñ śilpinaś caiva tathaiva naṭanartakān
tathā śucīñ śāstravidaḥ puruṣān subahuśrutān', null, 1012007),
('ramayana-1-12-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 8', 'यज्ञकर्म समीहन्तां भवन्तो राजशासनात्।
इष्टका बहुसाहस्री शीघ्रमानीयतामिति॥', 'yajñakarma samīhantāṃ bhavanto rājaśāsanāt
iṣṭakā bahusāhasrī śīghram ānīyatām iti', null, 1012008),
('ramayana-1-12-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 9', 'औपकार्याः क्रियन्तां च राज्ञां बहुगुणान्विताः।
ब्राह्मणावसथाश्चैव कर्तव्याः शतशः शुभाः॥', 'aupakāryāḥ kriyantāṃ ca rājñāṃ bahuguṇānvitāḥ
brāhmaṇāvasathāś caiva kartavyāḥ śataśaḥ śubhāḥ', null, 1012009),
('ramayana-1-12-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 10', 'भक्ष्यान्नपानैर्बहुभिः समुपेताः सुनिष्ठिताः।
तथा पौरजनस्यापि कर्तव्या बहुविस्तराः॥', 'bhakṣyānnapānair bahubhiḥ samupetāḥ suniṣṭhitāḥ
tathā paurajanasyāpi kartavyā bahuvistarāḥ', null, 1012010),
('ramayana-1-12-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 11', 'आवासा बहुभक्ष्या वै सर्वकामैरुपस्थिताः।
तथा जानपदस्यापि जनस्य बहुशोभनम्॥', 'āvāsā bahubhakṣyā vai sarvakāmair upasthitāḥ
tathā jānapadasyāpi janasya bahuśobhanam', null, 1012011),
('ramayana-1-12-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 12', 'दातव्यमन्नं विधिवत्सत्कृत्य न तु लीलया।
सर्वे वर्णा यथा पूजां प्राप्नुवन्ति सुसत्कृताः॥', 'dātavyam annaṃ vidhivat satkṛtya na tu līlayā
sarve varṇā yathā pūjāṃ prāpnuvanti susatkṛtāḥ', null, 1012012),
('ramayana-1-12-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 13', 'न चावज्ञा प्रयोक्तव्या कामक्रोधवशादपि।
यज्ञकर्मसु येऽव्यग्राः पुरुषाः शिल्पिनस्तथा॥', 'na cāvajñā prayoktavyā kāmakrodhavaśād api
yajñakarmasu ye ''vyagrāḥ puruṣāḥ śilpinas tathā', null, 1012013),
('ramayana-1-12-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 14', 'तेषामपि विशेषेण पूजा कार्या यथाक्रमम्।
यथा सर्वं सुविहितं न किं चित्परिहीयते॥', 'teṣām api viśeṣeṇa pūjā kāryā yathākramam
yathā sarvaṃ suvihitaṃ na kiṃ cit parihīyate', null, 1012014),
('ramayana-1-12-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 15', 'तथा भवन्तः कुर्वन्तु प्रीतिस्निग्धेन चेतसा।
ततः सर्वे समागम्य वसिष्ठमिदमब्रुवन्॥', 'tathā bhavantaḥ kurvantu prītisnigdhena cetasā
tataḥ sarve samāgamya vasiṣṭham idam abruvan', null, 1012015),
('ramayana-1-12-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 16', 'यथोक्तं तत्करिष्यामो न किं चित्परिहास्यते।
ततः सुमन्त्रमाहूय वसिष्ठो वाक्यमब्रवीत्॥', 'yathoktaṃ tat kariṣyāmo na kiṃ cit parihāsyate
tataḥ sumantram āhūya vasiṣṭho vākyam abravīt', null, 1012016),
('ramayana-1-12-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 17', 'निमन्त्रयस्य नृपतीन्पृथिव्यां ये च धार्मिकाः।
ब्राह्मणान्क्षत्रियान्वैश्याञ्शूद्रांश्चैव सहस्रशः॥', 'nimantrayasya nṛpatīn pṛthivyāṃ ye ca dhārmikāḥ
brāhmaṇān kṣatriyān vaiśyāñ śūdrāṃś caiva sahasraśaḥ', null, 1012017),
('ramayana-1-12-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 18', 'समानयस्व सत्कृत्य सर्वदेशेषु मानवान्।
मिथिलाधिपतिं शूरं जनकं सत्यविक्रमम्॥', 'samānayasva satkṛtya sarvadeśeṣu mānavān
mithilādhipatiṃ śūraṃ janakaṃ satyavikramam', null, 1012018),
('ramayana-1-12-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 19', 'निष्ठितं सर्वशास्त्रेषु तथा वेदेषु निष्ठितम्।
तमानय महाभागं स्वयमेव सुसत्कृतम्।
पूर्वसंबन्धिनं ज्ञात्वा ततः पूर्वं ब्रवीमि ते॥', 'niṣṭhitaṃ sarvaśāstreṣu tathā vedeṣu niṣṭhitam
tam ānaya mahābhāgaṃ svayam eva susatkṛtam
pūrvasaṃbandhinaṃ jñātvā tataḥ pūrvaṃ bravīmi te', null, 1012019),
('ramayana-1-12-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 20', 'तथा काशिपतिं स्निग्धं सततं प्रियवादिनम्।
सद्वृत्तं देवसंकाशं स्वयमेवानयस्व ह॥', 'tathā kāśipatiṃ snigdhaṃ satataṃ priyavādinam
sadvṛttaṃ devasaṃkāśaṃ svayam evānayasva ha', null, 1012020),
('ramayana-1-12-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 21', 'तथा केकयराजानं वृद्धं परमधार्मिकम्।
श्वशुरं राजसिंहस्य सपुत्रं तमिहानय॥', 'tathā kekayarājānaṃ vṛddhaṃ paramadhārmikam
śvaśuraṃ rājasiṃhasya saputraṃ tam ihānaya', null, 1012021),
('ramayana-1-12-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 22', 'अङ्गेश्वरं महाभागं लोमपादं सुसत्कृतम्।
वयस्यं राजसिंहस्य तमानय यशस्विनम्॥', 'aṅgeśvaraṃ mahābhāgaṃ lomapādaṃ susatkṛtam
vayasyaṃ rājasiṃhasya tam ānaya yaśasvinam', null, 1012022),
('ramayana-1-12-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 23', 'प्राचीनान्सिन्धुसौवीरान्सौराष्ठ्रेयांश्च पार्थिवान्।
दाक्षिणात्यान्नरेन्द्रांश्च समस्तानानयस्व ह॥', 'prācīnān sindhusauvīrān saurāṣṭhreyāṃś ca pārthivān
dākṣiṇātyān narendrāṃś ca samastān ānayasva ha', null, 1012023),
('ramayana-1-12-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 24', 'सन्ति स्निग्धाश्च ये चान्ये राजानः पृथिवीतले।
तानानय यथाक्षिप्रं सानुगान्सहबान्धवान्॥', 'santi snigdhāś ca ye cānye rājānaḥ pṛthivītale
tān ānaya yathākṣipraṃ sānugān sahabāndhavān', null, 1012024),
('ramayana-1-12-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 25', 'वसिष्ठवाक्यं तच्छ्रुत्वा सुमन्त्रस्त्वरितस्तदा।
व्यादिशत्पुरुषांस्तत्र राज्ञामानयने शुभान्॥', 'vasiṣṭhavākyaṃ tac chrutvā sumantras tvaritas tadā
vyādiśat puruṣāṃs tatra rājñām ānayane śubhān', null, 1012025),
('ramayana-1-12-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 26', 'स्वयमेव हि धर्मात्मा प्रययौ मुनिशासनात्।
सुमन्त्रस्त्वरितो भूत्वा समानेतुं महीक्षितः॥', 'svayam eva hi dharmātmā prayayau muniśāsanāt
sumantras tvarito bhūtvā samānetuṃ mahīkṣitaḥ', null, 1012026),
('ramayana-1-12-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 27', 'ते च कर्मान्तिकाः सर्वे वसिष्ठाय च धीमते।
सर्वं निवेदयन्ति स्म यज्ञे यदुपकल्पितम्॥', 'te ca karmāntikāḥ sarve vasiṣṭhāya ca dhīmate
sarvaṃ nivedayanti sma yajñe yad upakalpitam', null, 1012027),
('ramayana-1-12-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 28', 'ततः प्रीतो द्विजश्रेष्ठस्तान्सर्वान्पुनरब्रवीत्।
अवज्ञया न दातव्यं कस्य चिल्लीलयापि वा।
अवज्ञया कृतं हन्याद्दातारं नात्र संशयः॥', 'tataḥ prīto dvijaśreṣṭhas tān sarvān punar abravīt
avajñayā na dātavyaṃ kasya cil līlayāpi vā
avajñayā kṛtaṃ hanyād dātāraṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ', null, 1012028),
('ramayana-1-12-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 29', 'ततः कैश्चिदहोरात्रैरुपयाता महीक्षितः।
बहूनि रत्नान्यादाय राज्ञो दशरथस्य ह॥', 'tataḥ kaiś cid ahorātrair upayātā mahīkṣitaḥ
bahūni ratnāny ādāya rājño daśarathasya ha', null, 1012029),
('ramayana-1-12-30', 30, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 30', 'ततो वसिष्ठः सुप्रीतो राजानमिदमब्रवीत्।
उपयाता नरव्याघ्र राजानस्तव शासनात्॥', 'tato vasiṣṭhaḥ suprīto rājānam idam abravīt
upayātā naravyāghra rājānas tava śāsanāt', null, 1012030),
('ramayana-1-12-31', 31, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 31', 'मयापि सत्कृताः सर्वे यथार्हं राजसत्तमाः।
यज्ञियं च कृतं राजन्पुरुषैः सुसमाहितैः॥', 'mayāpi satkṛtāḥ sarve yathārhaṃ rājasattamāḥ
yajñiyaṃ ca kṛtaṃ rājan puruṣaiḥ susamāhitaiḥ', null, 1012031),
('ramayana-1-12-32', 32, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 32', 'निर्यातु च भवान्यष्टुं यज्ञायतनमन्तिकात्।
सर्वकामैरुपहृतैरुपेतं वै समन्ततः॥', 'niryātu ca bhavān yaṣṭuṃ yajñāyatanam antikāt
sarvakāmair upahṛtair upetaṃ vai samantataḥ', null, 1012032),
('ramayana-1-12-33', 33, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 33', 'तथा वसिष्ठवचनादृश्यशृङ्गस्य चोभयोः।
शुभे दिवस नक्षत्रे निर्यातो जगतीपतिः॥', 'tathā vasiṣṭhavacanād ṛśyaśṛṅgasya cobhayoḥ
śubhe divasa nakṣatre niryāto jagatīpatiḥ', null, 1012033),
('ramayana-1-12-34', 34, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 12, Verse 34', 'ततो वसिष्ठप्रमुखाः सर्व एव द्विजोत्तमाः।
ऋश्यशृङ्गं पुरस्कृत्य यज्ञकर्मारभंस्तदा॥', 'tato vasiṣṭhapramukhāḥ sarva eva dvijottamāḥ
ṛśyaśṛṅgaṃ puraskṛtya yajñakarmārabhaṃs tadā', null, 1012034)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 13 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-13-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 1', 'अथ संवत्सरे पूर्णे तस्मिन्प्राप्ते तुरङ्गमे।
सरय्वाश्चोत्तरे तीरे राज्ञो यज्ञोऽभ्यवर्तत॥', 'atha saṃvatsare pūrṇe tasmin prāpte turaṅgame
sarayvāś cottare tīre rājño yajño ''bhyavartata', null, 1013001),
('ramayana-1-13-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 2', 'ऋश्यशृङ्गं पुरस्कृत्य कर्म चक्रुर्द्विजर्षभाः।
अश्वमेधे महायज्ञे राज्ञोऽस्य सुमहात्मनः॥', 'ṛśyaśṛṅgaṃ puraskṛtya karma cakrur dvijarṣabhāḥ
aśvamedhe mahāyajñe rājño ''sya sumahātmanaḥ', null, 1013002),
('ramayana-1-13-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 3', 'कर्म कुर्वन्ति विधिवद्याजका वेदपारगाः।
यथाविधि यथान्यायं परिक्रामन्ति शास्त्रतः॥', 'karma kurvanti vidhivad yājakā vedapāragāḥ
yathāvidhi yathānyāyaṃ parikrāmanti śāstrataḥ', null, 1013003),
('ramayana-1-13-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 4', 'प्रवर्ग्यं शास्त्रतः कृत्वा तथैवोपसदं द्विजाः।
चक्रुश्च विधिवत्सर्वमधिकं कर्म शास्त्रतः॥', 'pravargyaṃ śāstrataḥ kṛtvā tathaivopasadaṃ dvijāḥ
cakruś ca vidhivat sarvam adhikaṃ karma śāstrataḥ', null, 1013004),
('ramayana-1-13-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 5', 'अभिपूज्य ततो हृष्टाः सर्वे चक्रुर्यथाविधि।
प्रातःसवनपूर्वाणि कर्माणि मुनिपुंगवाः॥', 'abhipūjya tato hṛṣṭāḥ sarve cakrur yathāvidhi
prātaḥsavanapūrvāṇi karmāṇi munipuṃgavāḥ', null, 1013005),
('ramayana-1-13-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 6', 'न चाहुतमभूत्तत्र स्खलितं वापि किं चन।
दृश्यते ब्रह्मवत्सर्वं क्षेमयुक्तं हि चक्रिरे॥', 'na cāhutam abhūt tatra skhalitaṃ vāpi kiṃ cana
dṛśyate brahmavat sarvaṃ kṣemayuktaṃ hi cakrire', null, 1013006),
('ramayana-1-13-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 7', 'न तेष्वहःसु श्रान्तो वा क्षुधितो वापि दृश्यते।
नाविद्वान्ब्राह्मणस्तत्र नाशतानुचरस्तथा॥', 'na teṣv ahaḥsu śrānto vā kṣudhito vāpi dṛśyate
nāvidvān brāhmaṇas tatra nāśatānucaras tathā', null, 1013007),
('ramayana-1-13-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 8', 'ब्राह्मणा भुञ्जते नित्यं नाथवन्तश्च भुञ्जते।
तापसा भुञ्जते चापि श्रमणा भुञ्जते तथा॥', 'brāhmaṇā bhuñjate nityaṃ nāthavantaś ca bhuñjate
tāpasā bhuñjate cāpi śramaṇā bhuñjate tathā', null, 1013008),
('ramayana-1-13-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 9', 'वृद्धाश्च व्याधिताश्चैव स्त्रियो बालास्तथैव च।
अनिशं भुञ्जमानानां न तृप्तिरुपलभ्यते॥', 'vṛddhāś ca vyādhitāś caiva striyo bālās tathaiva ca
aniśaṃ bhuñjamānānāṃ na tṛptir upalabhyate', null, 1013009),
('ramayana-1-13-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 10', 'दीयतां दीयतामन्नं वासांसि विविधानि च।
इति संचोदितास्तत्र तथा चक्रुरनेकशः॥', 'dīyatāṃ dīyatām annaṃ vāsāṃsi vividhāni ca
iti saṃcoditās tatra tathā cakrur anekaśaḥ', null, 1013010),
('ramayana-1-13-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 11', 'अन्नकूटाश्च बहवो दृश्यन्ते पर्वतोपमाः।
दिवसे दिवसे तत्र सिद्धस्य विधिवत्तदा॥', 'annakūṭāś ca bahavo dṛśyante parvatopamāḥ
divase divase tatra siddhasya vidhivat tadā', null, 1013011),
('ramayana-1-13-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 12', 'अन्नं हि विधिवत्स्वादु प्रशंसन्ति द्विजर्षभाः।
अहो तृप्ताः स्म भद्रं ते इति शुश्राव राघवः॥', 'annaṃ hi vidhivat svādu praśaṃsanti dvijarṣabhāḥ
aho tṛptāḥ sma bhadraṃ te iti śuśrāva rāghavaḥ', null, 1013012),
('ramayana-1-13-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 13', 'स्वलंकृताश्च पुरुषा ब्राह्मणान्पर्यवेषयन्।
उपासते च तानन्ये सुमृष्टमणिकुण्डलाः॥', 'svalaṃkṛtāś ca puruṣā brāhmaṇān paryaveṣayan
upāsate ca tān anye sumṛṣṭamaṇikuṇḍalāḥ', null, 1013013),
('ramayana-1-13-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 14', 'कर्मान्तरे तदा विप्रा हेतुवादान्बहूनपि।
प्राहुः सुवाग्मिनो धीराः परस्परजिगीषया॥', 'karmāntare tadā viprā hetuvādān bahūn api
prāhuḥ suvāgmino dhīrāḥ parasparajigīṣayā', null, 1013014),
('ramayana-1-13-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 15', 'दिवसे दिवसे तत्र संस्तरे कुशला द्विजाः।
सर्वकर्माणि चक्रुस्ते यथाशास्त्रं प्रचोदिताः॥', 'divase divase tatra saṃstare kuśalā dvijāḥ
sarvakarmāṇi cakrus te yathāśāstraṃ pracoditāḥ', null, 1013015),
('ramayana-1-13-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 16', 'नाषडङ्गविदत्रासीन्नाव्रतो नाबहुश्रुतः।
सदस्यस्तस्य वै राज्ञो नावादकुशलो द्विजः॥', 'nāṣaḍaṅgavid atrāsīn nāvrato nābahuśrutaḥ
sadasyas tasya vai rājño nāvādakuśalo dvijaḥ', null, 1013016),
('ramayana-1-13-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 17', 'प्राप्ते यूपोच्छ्रये तस्मिन्षड्बैल्वाः खादिरास्तथा।
तावन्तो बिल्वसहिताः पर्णिनश्च तथापरे॥', 'prāpte yūpocchraye tasmin ṣaḍ bailvāḥ khādirās tathā
tāvanto bilvasahitāḥ parṇinaś ca tathāpare', null, 1013017),
('ramayana-1-13-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 18', 'श्लेष्मातकमयो दिष्टो देवदारुमयस्तथा।
द्वावेव तत्र विहितौ बाहुव्यस्तपरिग्रहौ॥', 'śleṣmātakamayo diṣṭo devadārumayas tathā
dvāv eva tatra vihitau bāhuvyastaparigrahau', null, 1013018),
('ramayana-1-13-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 19', 'कारिताः सर्व एवैते शास्त्रज्ञैर्यज्ञकोविदैः।
शोभार्थं तस्य यज्ञस्य काञ्चनालंकृता भवन्॥', 'kāritāḥ sarva evaite śāstrajñair yajñakovidaiḥ
śobhārthaṃ tasya yajñasya kāñcanālaṃkṛtā bhavan', null, 1013019),
('ramayana-1-13-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 20', 'विन्यस्ता विधिवत्सर्वे शिल्पिभिः सुकृता दृढाः।
अष्टाश्रयः सर्व एव श्लक्ष्णरूपसमन्विताः॥', 'vinyastā vidhivat sarve śilpibhiḥ sukṛtā dṛḍhāḥ
aṣṭāśrayaḥ sarva eva ślakṣṇarūpasamanvitāḥ', null, 1013020),
('ramayana-1-13-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 21', 'आच्छादितास्ते वासोभिः पुष्पैर्गन्धैश्च भूषिताः।
सप्तर्षयो दीप्तिमन्तो विराजन्ते यथा दिवि॥', 'ācchāditās te vāsobhiḥ puṣpair gandhaiś ca bhūṣitāḥ
saptarṣayo dīptimanto virājante yathā divi', null, 1013021),
('ramayana-1-13-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 22', 'इष्टकाश्च यथान्यायं कारिताश्च प्रमाणतः।
चितोऽग्निर्ब्राह्मणैस्तत्र कुशलैः शुल्बकर्मणि॥', 'iṣṭakāś ca yathānyāyaṃ kāritāś ca pramāṇataḥ
cito ''gnir brāhmaṇais tatra kuśalaiḥ śulbakarmaṇi', null, 1013022),
('ramayana-1-13-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 23', 'स चित्यो राजसिंहस्य संचितः कुशलैर्द्विजैः।
गरुडो रुक्मपक्षो वै त्रिगुणोऽष्टादशात्मकः॥', 'sa cityo rājasiṃhasya saṃcitaḥ kuśalair dvijaiḥ
garuḍo rukmapakṣo vai triguṇo ''ṣṭādaśātmakaḥ', null, 1013023),
('ramayana-1-13-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 24', 'नियुक्तास्तत्र पशवस्तत्तदुद्दिश्य दैवतम्।
उरगाः पक्षिणश्चैव यथाशास्त्रं प्रचोदिताः।
शामित्रे तु हयस्तत्र तथा जल चराश्च ये॥', 'niyuktās tatra paśavas tat tad uddiśya daivatam
uragāḥ pakṣiṇaś caiva yathāśāstraṃ pracoditāḥ
śāmitre tu hayas tatra tathā jala carāś ca ye', null, 1013024),
('ramayana-1-13-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 25', 'ऋत्विग्भिः सर्वमेवैतन्नियुक्तं शास्त्रतस्तदा।
पशूनां त्रिशतं तत्र यूपेषु नियतं तदा।
अश्वरत्नोत्तमं तस्य राज्ञो दशरथस्य ह॥', 'ṛtvigbhiḥ sarvam evaitan niyuktaṃ śāstratas tadā
paśūnāṃ triśataṃ tatra yūpeṣu niyataṃ tadā
aśvaratnottamaṃ tasya rājño daśarathasya ha', null, 1013025),
('ramayana-1-13-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 26', 'कौसल्या तं हयं तत्र परिचर्य समन्ततः।
कृपाणैर्विशशासैनं त्रिभिः परमया मुदा॥', 'kausalyā taṃ hayaṃ tatra paricarya samantataḥ
kṛpāṇair viśaśāsainaṃ tribhiḥ paramayā mudā', null, 1013026),
('ramayana-1-13-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 27', 'पतत्रिणा तदा सार्धं सुस्थितेन च चेतसा।
अवसद्रजनीमेकां कौसल्या धर्मकाम्यया॥', 'patatriṇā tadā sārdhaṃ susthitena ca cetasā
avasad rajanīm ekāṃ kausalyā dharmakāmyayā', null, 1013027),
('ramayana-1-13-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 28', 'होताध्वर्युस्तथोद्गाता हयेन समयोजयन्।
महिष्या परिवृक्त्याथ वावातामपरां तथा॥', 'hotādhvaryus tathodgātā hayena samayojayan
mahiṣyā parivṛktyātha vāvātām aparāṃ tathā', null, 1013028),
('ramayana-1-13-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 29', 'पतत्रिणस्तस्य वपामुद्धृत्य नियतेन्द्रियः।
ऋत्विक्परम संपन्नः श्रपयामास शास्त्रतः॥', 'patatriṇas tasya vapām uddhṛtya niyatendriyaḥ
ṛtvik parama saṃpannaḥ śrapayām āsa śāstrataḥ', null, 1013029),
('ramayana-1-13-30', 30, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 30', 'धूमगन्धं वपायास्तु जिघ्रति स्म नराधिपः।
यथाकालं यथान्यायं निर्णुदन्पापमात्मनः॥', 'dhūmagandhaṃ vapāyās tu jighrati sma narādhipaḥ
yathākālaṃ yathānyāyaṃ nirṇudan pāpam ātmanaḥ', null, 1013030),
('ramayana-1-13-31', 31, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 31', 'हयस्य यानि चाङ्गानि तानि सर्वाणि ब्राह्मणाः।
अग्नौ प्रास्यन्ति विधिवत्समस्ताः षोडशर्त्विजः॥', 'hayasya yāni cāṅgāni tāni sarvāṇi brāhmaṇāḥ
agnau prāsyanti vidhivat samastāḥ ṣoḍaśartvijaḥ', null, 1013031),
('ramayana-1-13-32', 32, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 32', 'प्लक्षशाखासु यज्ञानामन्येषां क्रियते हविः।
अश्वमेधस्य चैकस्य वैतसो भाग इष्यते॥', 'plakṣaśākhāsu yajñānām anyeṣāṃ kriyate haviḥ
aśvamedhasya caikasya vaitaso bhāga iṣyate', null, 1013032),
('ramayana-1-13-33', 33, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 33', 'त्र्यहोऽश्वमेधः संख्यातः कल्पसूत्रेण ब्राह्मणैः।
चतुष्टोममहस्तस्य प्रथमं परिकल्पितम्॥', 'tryaho ''śvamedhaḥ saṃkhyātaḥ kalpasūtreṇa brāhmaṇaiḥ
catuṣṭomam ahas tasya prathamaṃ parikalpitam', null, 1013033),
('ramayana-1-13-34', 34, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 34', 'उक्थ्यं द्वितीयं संख्यातमतिरात्रं तथोत्तरम्।
कारितास्तत्र बहवो विहिताः शास्त्रदर्शनात्॥', 'ukthyaṃ dvitīyaṃ saṃkhyātam atirātraṃ tathottaram
kāritās tatra bahavo vihitāḥ śāstradarśanāt', null, 1013034),
('ramayana-1-13-35', 35, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 35', 'ज्योतिष्टोमायुषी चैव अतिरात्रौ च निर्मितौ।
अभिजिद्विश्वजिच्चैव अप्तोर्यामो महाक्रतुः॥', 'jyotiṣṭomāyuṣī caiva atirātrau ca nirmitau
abhijid viśvajic caiva aptoryāmo mahākratuḥ', null, 1013035),
('ramayana-1-13-36', 36, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 36', 'प्राचीं होत्रे ददौ राजा दिशं स्वकुलवर्धनः।
अध्वर्यवे प्रतीचीं तु ब्रह्मणे दक्षिणां दिशम्॥', 'prācīṃ hotre dadau rājā diśaṃ svakulavardhanaḥ
adhvaryave pratīcīṃ tu brahmaṇe dakṣiṇāṃ diśam', null, 1013036),
('ramayana-1-13-37', 37, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 37', 'उद्गात्रे तु तथोदीचीं दक्षिणैषा विनिर्मिता।
अश्वमेधे महायज्ञे स्वयम्भुविहिते पुरा॥', 'udgātre tu tathodīcīṃ dakṣiṇaiṣā vinirmitā
aśvamedhe mahāyajñe svayambhuvihite purā', null, 1013037),
('ramayana-1-13-38', 38, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 38', 'क्रतुं समाप्य तु तदा न्यायतः पुरुषर्षभः।
ऋत्विग्भ्यो हि ददौ राजा धरां तां क्रतुवर्धनः॥', 'kratuṃ samāpya tu tadā nyāyataḥ puruṣarṣabhaḥ
ṛtvigbhyo hi dadau rājā dharāṃ tāṃ kratuvardhanaḥ', null, 1013038),
('ramayana-1-13-39', 39, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 39', 'ऋत्विजस्त्वब्रुवन्सर्वे राजानं गतकल्मषम्।
भवानेव महीं कृत्स्नामेको रक्षितुमर्हति॥', 'ṛtvijas tv abruvan sarve rājānaṃ gatakalmaṣam
bhavān eva mahīṃ kṛtsnām eko rakṣitum arhati', null, 1013039),
('ramayana-1-13-40', 40, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 40', 'न भूम्या कार्यमस्माकं न हि शक्ताः स्म पालने।
रताः स्वाध्यायकरणे वयं नित्यं हि भूमिप।
निष्क्रयं किं चिदेवेह प्रयच्छतु भवानिति॥', 'na bhūmyā kāryam asmākaṃ na hi śaktāḥ sma pālane
ratāḥ svādhyāyakaraṇe vayaṃ nityaṃ hi bhūmipa
niṣkrayaṃ kiṃ cid eveha prayacchatu bhavān iti', null, 1013040),
('ramayana-1-13-41', 41, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 41', 'गवां शतसहस्राणि दश तेभ्यो ददौ नृपः।
दशकोटिं सुवर्णस्य रजतस्य चतुर्गुणम्॥', 'gavāṃ śatasahasrāṇi daśa tebhyo dadau nṛpaḥ
daśakoṭiṃ suvarṇasya rajatasya caturguṇam', null, 1013041),
('ramayana-1-13-42', 42, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 42', 'ऋत्विजस्तु ततः सर्वे प्रददुः सहिता वसु।
ऋश्यशृङ्गाय मुनये वसिष्ठाय च धीमते॥', 'ṛtvijas tu tataḥ sarve pradaduḥ sahitā vasu
ṛśyaśṛṅgāya munaye vasiṣṭhāya ca dhīmate', null, 1013042),
('ramayana-1-13-43', 43, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 43', 'ततस्ते न्यायतः कृत्वा प्रविभागं द्विजोत्तमाः।
सुप्रीतमनसः सर्वे प्रत्यूचुर्मुदिता भृशम्॥', 'tatas te nyāyataḥ kṛtvā pravibhāgaṃ dvijottamāḥ
suprītamanasaḥ sarve pratyūcur muditā bhṛśam', null, 1013043),
('ramayana-1-13-44', 44, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 44', 'ततः प्रीतमना राजा प्राप्य यज्ञमनुत्तमम्।
पापापहं स्वर्नयनं दुस्तरं पार्थिवर्षभैः॥', 'tataḥ prītamanā rājā prāpya yajñam anuttamam
pāpāpahaṃ svarnayanaṃ dustaraṃ pārthivarṣabhaiḥ', null, 1013044),
('ramayana-1-13-45', 45, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 45', 'ततोऽब्रवीदृश्यशृङ्गं राजा दशरथस्तदा।
कुलस्य वर्धनं तत्तु कर्तुमर्हसि सुव्रत॥', 'tato ''bravīd ṛśyaśṛṅgaṃ rājā daśarathas tadā
kulasya vardhanaṃ tat tu kartum arhasi suvrata', null, 1013045),
('ramayana-1-13-46', 46, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 13, Verse 46', 'तथेति च स राजानमुवाच द्विजसत्तमः।
भविष्यन्ति सुता राजंश्चत्वारस्ते कुलोद्वहाः॥', 'tatheti ca sa rājānam uvāca dvijasattamaḥ
bhaviṣyanti sutā rājaṃś catvāras te kulodvahāḥ', null, 1013046)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 14 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-14-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 1', 'मेधावी तु ततो ध्यात्वा स किं चिदिदमुत्तमम्।
लब्धसंज्ञस्ततस्तं तु वेदज्ञो नृपमब्रवीत्॥', 'medhāvī tu tato dhyātvā sa kiṃ cid idam uttamam
labdhasaṃjñas tatas taṃ tu vedajño nṛpam abravīt', null, 1014001),
('ramayana-1-14-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 2', 'इष्टिं तेऽहं करिष्यामि पुत्रीयां पुत्रकारणात्।
अथर्वशिरसि प्रोक्तैर्मन्त्रैः सिद्धां विधानतः॥', 'iṣṭiṃ te ''haṃ kariṣyāmi putrīyāṃ putrakāraṇāt
atharvaśirasi proktair mantraiḥ siddhāṃ vidhānataḥ', null, 1014002),
('ramayana-1-14-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 3', 'ततः प्राक्रमदिष्टिं तां पुत्रीयां पुत्र कारणात्।
जुहाव चाग्नौ तेजस्वी मन्त्रदृष्टेन कर्मणा॥', 'tataḥ prākramad iṣṭiṃ tāṃ putrīyāṃ putra kāraṇāt
juhāva cāgnau tejasvī mantradṛṣṭena karmaṇā', null, 1014003),
('ramayana-1-14-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 4', 'ततो देवाः सगन्धर्वाः सिद्धाश्च परमर्षयः।
भागप्रतिग्रहार्थं वै समवेता यथाविधि॥', 'tato devāḥ sagandharvāḥ siddhāś ca paramarṣayaḥ
bhāgapratigrahārthaṃ vai samavetā yathāvidhi', null, 1014004),
('ramayana-1-14-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 5', 'ताः समेत्य यथान्यायं तस्मिन्सदसि देवताः।
अब्रुवंल्लोककर्तारं ब्रह्माणं वचनं महत्॥', 'tāḥ sametya yathānyāyaṃ tasmin sadasi devatāḥ
abruvaṃl lokakartāraṃ brahmāṇaṃ vacanaṃ mahat', null, 1014005),
('ramayana-1-14-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 6', 'भगवंस्त्वत्प्रसादेन रावणो नाम राक्षसः।
सर्वान्नो बाधते वीर्याच्छासितुं तं न शक्नुमः॥', 'bhagavaṃs tvatprasādena rāvaṇo nāma rākṣasaḥ
sarvānno bādhate vīryāc chāsituṃ taṃ na śaknumaḥ', null, 1014006),
('ramayana-1-14-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 7', 'त्वया तस्मै वरो दत्तः प्रीतेन भगवन्पुरा।
मानयन्तश्च तं नित्यं सर्वं तस्य क्षमामहे॥', 'tvayā tasmai varo dattaḥ prītena bhagavan purā
mānayantaś ca taṃ nityaṃ sarvaṃ tasya kṣamāmahe', null, 1014007),
('ramayana-1-14-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 8', 'उद्वेजयति लोकांस्त्रीनुच्छ्रितान्द्वेष्टि दुर्मतिः।
शक्रं त्रिदशराजानं प्रधर्षयितुमिच्छति॥', 'udvejayati lokāṃs trīn ucchritān dveṣṭi durmatiḥ
śakraṃ tridaśarājānaṃ pradharṣayitum icchati', null, 1014008),
('ramayana-1-14-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 9', 'ऋषीन्यक्षान्सगन्धर्वानसुरान्ब्राह्मणांस्तथा।
अतिक्रामति दुर्धर्षो वरदानेन मोहितः॥', 'ṛṣīn yakṣān sagandharvān asurān brāhmaṇāṃs tathā
atikrāmati durdharṣo varadānena mohitaḥ', null, 1014009),
('ramayana-1-14-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 10', 'नैनं सूर्यः प्रतपति पार्श्वे वाति न मारुतः।
चलोर्मिमाली तं दृष्ट्वा समुद्रोऽपि न कम्पते॥', 'nainaṃ sūryaḥ pratapati pārśve vāti na mārutaḥ
calormimālī taṃ dṛṣṭvā samudro ''pi na kampate', null, 1014010),
('ramayana-1-14-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 11', 'तन्मनन्नो भयं तस्माद्राक्षसाद्घोरदर्शनात्।
वधार्थं तस्य भगवन्नुपायं कर्तुमर्हसि॥', 'tan manan no bhayaṃ tasmād rākṣasād ghoradarśanāt
vadhārthaṃ tasya bhagavann upāyaṃ kartum arhasi', null, 1014011),
('ramayana-1-14-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 12', 'एवमुक्तः सुरैः सर्वैश्चिन्तयित्वा ततोऽब्रवीत्।
हन्तायं विहितस्तस्य वधोपायो दुरात्मनः॥', 'evam uktaḥ suraiḥ sarvaiś cintayitvā tato ''bravīt
hantāyaṃ vihitas tasya vadhopāyo durātmanaḥ', null, 1014012),
('ramayana-1-14-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 13', 'तेन गन्धर्वयक्षाणां देवदानवरक्षसाम्।
अवध्योऽस्मीति वागुक्ता तथेत्युक्तं च तन्मया॥', 'tena gandharvayakṣāṇāṃ devadānavarakṣasām
avadhyo ''smīti vāg uktā tathety uktaṃ ca tan mayā', null, 1014013),
('ramayana-1-14-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 14', 'नाकीर्तयदवज्ञानात्तद्रक्षो मानुषांस्तदा।
तस्मात्स मानुषाद्वध्यो मृतुर्नान्योऽस्य विद्यते॥', 'nākīrtayad avajñānāt tad rakṣo mānuṣāṃs tadā
tasmāt sa mānuṣād vadhyo mṛtur nānyo ''sya vidyate', null, 1014014),
('ramayana-1-14-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 15', 'एतच्छ्रुत्वा प्रियं वाक्यं ब्रह्मणा समुदाहृतम्।
देवा महर्षयः सर्वे प्रहृष्टास्तेऽभवंस्तदा॥', 'etac chrutvā priyaṃ vākyaṃ brahmaṇā samudāhṛtam
devā maharṣayaḥ sarve prahṛṣṭās te ''bhavaṃs tadā', null, 1014015),
('ramayana-1-14-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 16', 'एतस्मिन्नन्तरे विष्णुरुपयातो महाद्युतिः।
ब्रह्मणा च समागम्य तत्र तस्थौ समाहितः॥', 'etasminn antare viṣṇur upayāto mahādyutiḥ
brahmaṇā ca samāgamya tatra tasthau samāhitaḥ', null, 1014016),
('ramayana-1-14-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 17', 'तमब्रुवन्सुराः सर्वे समभिष्टूय संनताः।
त्वां नियोक्ष्यामहे विष्णो लोकानां हितकाम्यया॥', 'tam abruvan surāḥ sarve samabhiṣṭūya saṃnatāḥ
tvāṃ niyokṣyāmahe viṣṇo lokānāṃ hitakāmyayā', null, 1014017),
('ramayana-1-14-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 18', 'राज्ञो दशरथस्य त्वमयोध्याधिपतेर्विभो।
धर्मज्ञस्य वदान्यस्य महर्षिसमतेजसः।
तस्य भार्यासु तिसृषु ह्रीश्रीकीर्त्युपमासु च।
विष्णो पुत्रत्वमागच्छ कृत्वात्मानं चतुर्विधम्॥', 'rājño daśarathasya tvam ayodhyādhipater vibho
dharmajñasya vadānyasya maharṣisamatejasaḥ
tasya bhāryāsu tisṛṣu hrīśrīkīrtyupamāsu ca
viṣṇo putratvam āgaccha kṛtvātmānaṃ caturvidham', null, 1014018),
('ramayana-1-14-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 19', 'तत्र त्वं मानुषो भूत्वा प्रवृद्धं लोककण्टकम्।
अवध्यं दैवतैर्विष्णो समरे जहि रावणम्॥', 'tatra tvaṃ mānuṣo bhūtvā pravṛddhaṃ lokakaṇṭakam
avadhyaṃ daivatair viṣṇo samare jahi rāvaṇam', null, 1014019),
('ramayana-1-14-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 20', 'स हि देवान्सगन्धर्वान्सिद्धांश्च ऋषिसत्तमान्।
राक्षसो रावणो मूर्खो वीर्योत्सेकेन बाधते॥', 'sa hi devān sagandharvān siddhāṃś ca ṛṣisattamān
rākṣaso rāvaṇo mūrkho vīryotsekena bādhate', null, 1014020),
('ramayana-1-14-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 14, Verse 21', 'तदुद्धतं रावणमृद्धतेजसं प्रवृद्धदर्पं त्रिदशेश्वरद्विषम्।
विरावणं साधु तपस्विकण्टकं तपस्विनामुद्धर तं भयावहम्॥', 'tad uddhataṃ rāvaṇam ṛddhatejasaṃ pravṛddhadarpaṃ tridaśeśvaradviṣam
virāvaṇaṃ sādhu tapasvikaṇṭakaṃ tapasvinām uddhara taṃ bhayāvaham', null, 1014021)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 15 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-15-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 1', 'ततो नारायणो विष्णुर्नियुक्तः सुरसत्तमैः।
जानन्नपि सुरानेवं श्लक्ष्णं वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'tato nārāyaṇo viṣṇur niyuktaḥ surasattamaiḥ
jānann api surān evaṃ ślakṣṇaṃ vacanam abravīt', null, 1015001),
('ramayana-1-15-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 2', 'उपायः को वधे तस्य राक्षसाधिपतेः सुराः।
यमहं तं समास्थाय निहन्यामृषिकण्टकम्॥', 'upāyaḥ ko vadhe tasya rākṣasādhipateḥ surāḥ
yam ahaṃ taṃ samāsthāya nihanyām ṛṣikaṇṭakam', null, 1015002),
('ramayana-1-15-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 3', 'एवमुक्ताः सुराः सर्वे प्रत्यूचुर्विष्णुमव्ययम्।
मानुषीं तनुमास्थाय रावणं जहि संयुगे॥', 'evam uktāḥ surāḥ sarve pratyūcur viṣṇum avyayam
mānuṣīṃ tanum āsthāya rāvaṇaṃ jahi saṃyuge', null, 1015003),
('ramayana-1-15-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 4', 'स हि तेपे तपस्तीव्रं दीर्घकालमरिंदम।
येन तुष्टोऽभवद्ब्रह्मा लोककृल्लोकपूजितः॥', 'sa hi tepe tapas tīvraṃ dīrghakālam ariṃdama
yena tuṣṭo ''bhavad brahmā lokakṛl lokapūjitaḥ', null, 1015004),
('ramayana-1-15-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 5', 'संतुष्टः प्रददौ तस्मै राक्षसाय वरं प्रभुः।
नानाविधेभ्यो भूतेभ्यो भयं नान्यत्र मानुषात्॥', 'saṃtuṣṭaḥ pradadau tasmai rākṣasāya varaṃ prabhuḥ
nānāvidhebhyo bhūtebhyo bhayaṃ nānyatra mānuṣāt', null, 1015005),
('ramayana-1-15-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 6', 'अवज्ञाताः पुरा तेन वरदानेन मानवाः।
तस्मात्तस्य वधो दृष्टो मानुषेभ्यः परंतप॥', 'avajñātāḥ purā tena varadānena mānavāḥ
tasmāt tasya vadho dṛṣṭo mānuṣebhyaḥ paraṃtapa', null, 1015006),
('ramayana-1-15-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 7', 'इत्येतद्वचनं श्रुत्वा सुराणां विष्णुरात्मवान्।
पितरं रोचयामास तदा दशरथं नृपम्॥', 'ity etad vacanaṃ śrutvā surāṇāṃ viṣṇur ātmavān
pitaraṃ rocayām āsa tadā daśarathaṃ nṛpam', null, 1015007),
('ramayana-1-15-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 8', 'स चाप्यपुत्रो नृपतिस्तस्मिन्काले महाद्युतिः।
अयजत्पुत्रियामिष्टिं पुत्रेप्सुररिसूदनः॥', 'sa cāpy aputro nṛpatis tasmin kāle mahādyutiḥ
ayajat putriyām iṣṭiṃ putrepsur arisūdanaḥ', null, 1015008),
('ramayana-1-15-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 9', 'ततो वै यजमानस्य पावकादतुलप्रभम्।
प्रादुर्भूतं महद्भूतं महावीर्यं महाबलम्॥', 'tato vai yajamānasya pāvakād atulaprabham
prādurbhūtaṃ mahad bhūtaṃ mahāvīryaṃ mahābalam', null, 1015009),
('ramayana-1-15-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 10', 'कृष्णं रक्ताम्बरधरं रक्तास्यं दुन्दुभिस्वनम्।
स्निग्धहर्यक्षतनुजश्मश्रुप्रवरमूर्धजम्॥', 'kṛṣṇaṃ raktāmbaradharaṃ raktāsyaṃ dundubhisvanam
snigdhaharyakṣatanujaśmaśrupravaramūrdhajam', null, 1015010),
('ramayana-1-15-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 11', 'शुभलक्षणसंपन्नं दिव्याभरणभूषितम्।
शैलशृङ्गसमुत्सेधं दृप्तशार्दूलविक्रमम्॥', 'śubhalakṣaṇasaṃpannaṃ divyābharaṇabhūṣitam
śailaśṛṅgasamutsedhaṃ dṛptaśārdūlavikramam', null, 1015011),
('ramayana-1-15-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 12', 'दिवाकरसमाकारं दीप्तानलशिखोपमम्।
तप्तजाम्बूनदमयीं राजतान्तपरिच्छदाम्॥', 'divākarasamākāraṃ dīptānalaśikhopamam
taptajāmbūnadamayīṃ rājatāntaparicchadām', null, 1015012),
('ramayana-1-15-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 13', 'दिव्यपायससंपूर्णां पात्रीं पत्नीमिव प्रियाम्।
प्रगृह्य विपुलां दोर्भ्यां स्वयं मायामयीमिव॥', 'divyapāyasasaṃpūrṇāṃ pātrīṃ patnīm iva priyām
pragṛhya vipulāṃ dorbhyāṃ svayaṃ māyāmayīm iva', null, 1015013),
('ramayana-1-15-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 14', 'समवेक्ष्याब्रवीद्वाक्यमिदं दशरथं नृपम्।
प्राजापत्यं नरं विद्धि मामिहाभ्यागतं नृप॥', 'samavekṣyābravīd vākyam idaṃ daśarathaṃ nṛpam
prājāpatyaṃ naraṃ viddhi mām ihābhyāgataṃ nṛpa', null, 1015014),
('ramayana-1-15-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 15', 'ततः परं तदा राजा प्रत्युवाच कृताञ्जलिः।
भगवन्स्वागतं तेऽस्तु किमहं करवाणि ते॥', 'tataḥ paraṃ tadā rājā pratyuvāca kṛtāñjaliḥ
bhagavan svāgataṃ te ''stu kim ahaṃ karavāṇi te', null, 1015015),
('ramayana-1-15-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 16', 'अथो पुनरिदं वाक्यं प्राजापत्यो नरोऽब्रवीत्।
राजन्नर्चयता देवानद्य प्राप्तमिदं त्वया॥', 'atho punar idaṃ vākyaṃ prājāpatyo naro ''bravīt
rājann arcayatā devān adya prāptam idaṃ tvayā', null, 1015016),
('ramayana-1-15-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 17', 'इदं तु नरशार्दूल पायसं देवनिर्मितम्।
प्रजाकरं गृहाण त्वं धन्यमारोग्यवर्धनम्॥', 'idaṃ tu naraśārdūla pāyasaṃ devanirmitam
prajākaraṃ gṛhāṇa tvaṃ dhanyam ārogyavardhanam', null, 1015017),
('ramayana-1-15-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 18', 'भार्याणामनुरूपाणामश्नीतेति प्रयच्छ वै।
तासु त्वं लप्स्यसे पुत्रान्यदर्थं यजसे नृप॥', 'bhāryāṇām anurūpāṇām aśnīteti prayaccha vai
tāsu tvaṃ lapsyase putrān yadarthaṃ yajase nṛpa', null, 1015018),
('ramayana-1-15-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 19', 'तथेति नृपतिः प्रीतः शिरसा प्रतिगृह्य ताम्।
पात्रीं देवान्नसंपूर्णां देवदत्तां हिरण्मयीम्॥', 'tatheti nṛpatiḥ prītaḥ śirasā pratigṛhya tām
pātrīṃ devānnasaṃpūrṇāṃ devadattāṃ hiraṇmayīm', null, 1015019),
('ramayana-1-15-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 20', 'अभिवाद्य च तद्भूतमद्भुतं प्रियदर्शनम्।
मुदा परमया युक्तश्चकाराभिप्रदक्षिणम्॥', 'abhivādya ca tad bhūtam adbhutaṃ priyadarśanam
mudā paramayā yuktaś cakārābhipradakṣiṇam', null, 1015020),
('ramayana-1-15-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 21', 'ततो दशरथः प्राप्य पायसं देवनिर्मितम्।
बभूव परमप्रीतः प्राप्य वित्तमिवाधनः॥', 'tato daśarathaḥ prāpya pāyasaṃ devanirmitam
babhūva paramaprītaḥ prāpya vittam ivādhanaḥ', null, 1015021),
('ramayana-1-15-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 22', 'ततस्तदद्भुतप्रख्यं भूतं परमभास्वरम्।
संवर्तयित्वा तत्कर्म तत्रैवान्तरधीयत॥', 'tatas tad adbhutaprakhyaṃ bhūtaṃ paramabhāsvaram
saṃvartayitvā tat karma tatraivāntaradhīyata', null, 1015022),
('ramayana-1-15-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 23', 'हर्षरश्मिभिरुद्योतं तस्यान्तःपुरमाबभौ।
शारदस्याभिरामस्य चन्द्रस्येव नभोऽंशुभिः॥', 'harṣaraśmibhir udyotaṃ tasyāntaḥpuram ābabhau
śāradasyābhirāmasya candrasyeva nabho''ṃśubhiḥ', null, 1015023),
('ramayana-1-15-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 24', 'सोऽन्तःपुरं प्रविश्यैव कौसल्यामिदमब्रवीत्।
पायसं प्रतिगृह्णीष्व पुत्रीयं त्विदमात्मनः॥', 'so ''ntaḥpuraṃ praviśyaiva kausalyām idam abravīt
pāyasaṃ pratigṛhṇīṣva putrīyaṃ tv idam ātmanaḥ', null, 1015024),
('ramayana-1-15-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 25', 'कौसल्यायै नरपतिः पायसार्धं ददौ तदा।
अर्धादर्धं ददौ चापि सुमित्रायै नराधिपः।
कैकेय्यै चावशिष्टार्धं ददौ पुत्रार्थकारणात्॥', 'kausalyāyai narapatiḥ pāyasārdhaṃ dadau tadā
ardhād ardhaṃ dadau cāpi sumitrāyai narādhipaḥ
kaikeyyai cāvaśiṣṭārdhaṃ dadau putrārthakāraṇāt', null, 1015025),
('ramayana-1-15-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 26', 'प्रददौ चावशिष्टार्धं पायसस्यामृतोपमम्।
अनुचिन्त्य सुमित्रायै पुनरेव महीपतिः॥', 'pradadau cāvaśiṣṭārdhaṃ pāyasasyāmṛtopamam
anucintya sumitrāyai punar eva mahīpatiḥ', null, 1015026),
('ramayana-1-15-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 27', 'एवं तासां ददौ राजा भार्याणां पायसं पृथक्॥', 'evaṃ tāsāṃ dadau rājā bhāryāṇāṃ pāyasaṃ pṛthak', null, 1015027),
('ramayana-1-15-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 15, Verse 28', 'तास्त्वेतत्पायसं प्राप्य नरेन्द्रस्योत्तमाः स्त्रियः।
संमानं मेनिरे सर्वाः प्रहर्षोदितचेतसः॥', 'tās tv etat pāyasaṃ prāpya narendrasyottamāḥ striyaḥ
saṃmānaṃ menire sarvāḥ praharṣoditacetasaḥ', null, 1015028)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 16 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-16-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 1', 'पुत्रत्वं तु गते विष्णौ राज्ञस्तस्य महात्मनः।
उवाच देवताः सर्वाः स्वयम्भूर्भगवानिदम्॥', 'putratvaṃ tu gate viṣṇau rājñas tasya mahātmanaḥ
uvāca devatāḥ sarvāḥ svayambhūr bhagavān idam', null, 1016001),
('ramayana-1-16-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 2', 'सत्यसंधस्य वीरस्य सर्वेषां नो हितैषिणः।
विष्णोः सहायान्बलिनः सृजध्वं कामरूपिणः॥', 'satyasaṃdhasya vīrasya sarveṣāṃ no hitaiṣiṇaḥ
viṣṇoḥ sahāyān balinaḥ sṛjadhvaṃ kāmarūpiṇaḥ', null, 1016002),
('ramayana-1-16-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 3', 'मायाविदश्च शूरांश्च वायुवेगसमाञ्जवे।
नयज्ञान्बुद्धिसंपन्नान्विष्णुतुल्यपराक्रमान्॥', 'māyāvidaś ca śūrāṃś ca vāyuvegasamāñjave
nayajñān buddhisaṃpannān viṣṇutulyaparākramān', null, 1016003),
('ramayana-1-16-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 4', 'असंहार्यानुपायज्ञान्दिव्यसंहननान्वितान्।
सर्वास्त्रगुणसंपन्नानमृतप्राशनानिव॥', 'asaṃhāryān upāyajñān divyasaṃhananānvitān
sarvāstraguṇasaṃpannān amṛtaprāśanān iva', null, 1016004),
('ramayana-1-16-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 5', 'अप्सरःसु च मुख्यासु गन्धर्वीणां तनूषु च।
यक्षपन्नगकन्यासु ऋष्कविद्याधरीषु च॥', 'apsaraḥsu ca mukhyāsu gandharvīṇāṃ tanūṣu ca
yakṣapannagakanyāsu ṛṣkavidyādharīṣu ca', null, 1016005),
('ramayana-1-16-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 6', 'किंनरीणां च गात्रेषु वानरीणां तनूषु च।
सृजध्वं हरिरूपेण पुत्रांस्तुल्यपराक्रमान्॥', 'kiṃnarīṇāṃ ca gātreṣu vānarīṇāṃ tanūṣu ca
sṛjadhvaṃ harirūpeṇa putrāṃs tulyaparākramān', null, 1016006),
('ramayana-1-16-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 7', 'ते तथोक्ता भगवता तत्प्रतिश्रुत्य शासनम्।
जनयामासुरेवं ते पुत्रान्वानररूपिणः॥', 'te tathoktā bhagavatā tat pratiśrutya śāsanam
janayām āsur evaṃ te putrān vānararūpiṇaḥ', null, 1016007),
('ramayana-1-16-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 8', 'ऋषयश्च महात्मानः सिद्धविद्याधरोरगाः।
चारणाश्च सुतान्वीरान्ससृजुर्वनचारिणः॥', 'ṛṣayaś ca mahātmānaḥ siddhavidyādharoragāḥ
cāraṇāś ca sutān vīrān sasṛjur vanacāriṇaḥ', null, 1016008),
('ramayana-1-16-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 9', 'ते सृष्टा बहुसाहस्रा दशग्रीववधोद्यताः।
अप्रमेयबला वीरा विक्रान्ताः कामरूपिणः॥', 'te sṛṣṭā bahusāhasrā daśagrīvavadhodyatāḥ
aprameyabalā vīrā vikrāntāḥ kāmarūpiṇaḥ', null, 1016009),
('ramayana-1-16-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 10', 'ते गजाचलसंकाशा वपुष्मन्तो महाबलाः।
ऋक्षवानरगोपुच्छाः क्षिप्रमेवाभिजज्ञिरे॥', 'te gajācalasaṃkāśā vapuṣmanto mahābalāḥ
ṛkṣavānaragopucchāḥ kṣipram evābhijajñire', null, 1016010),
('ramayana-1-16-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 11', 'यस्य देवस्य यद्रूपं वेषो यश्च पराक्रमः।
अजायत समस्तेन तस्य तस्य सुतः पृथक्॥', 'yasya devasya yad rūpaṃ veṣo yaś ca parākramaḥ
ajāyata samastena tasya tasya sutaḥ pṛthak', null, 1016011),
('ramayana-1-16-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 12', 'गोलाङ्गूलीषु चोत्पन्नाः के चित्संमतविक्रमाः।
ऋक्षीषु च तथा जाता वानराः किंनरीषु च॥', 'golāṅgūlīṣu cotpannāḥ ke cit saṃmatavikramāḥ
ṛkṣīṣu ca tathā jātā vānarāḥ kiṃnarīṣu ca', null, 1016012),
('ramayana-1-16-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 13', 'शिलाप्रहरणाः सर्वे सर्वे पादपयोधिनः।
नखदंष्ट्रायुधाः सर्वे सर्वे सर्वास्त्रकोविदाः॥', 'śilāpraharaṇāḥ sarve sarve pādapayodhinaḥ
nakhadaṃṣṭrāyudhāḥ sarve sarve sarvāstrakovidāḥ', null, 1016013),
('ramayana-1-16-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 14', 'विचालयेयुः शैलेन्द्रान्भेदयेयुः स्थिरान्द्रुमान्।
क्षोभयेयुश्च वेगेन समुद्रं सरितां पतिम्॥', 'vicālayeyuḥ śailendrān bhedayeyuḥ sthirān drumān
kṣobhayeyuś ca vegena samudraṃ saritāṃ patim', null, 1016014),
('ramayana-1-16-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 15', 'दारयेयुः क्षितिं पद्भ्यामाप्लवेयुर्महार्णवम्।
नभस्तलं विशेयुश्च गृह्णीयुरपि तोयदान्॥', 'dārayeyuḥ kṣitiṃ padbhyām āplaveyur mahārṇavam
nabhastalaṃ viśeyuś ca gṛhṇīyur api toyadān', null, 1016015),
('ramayana-1-16-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 16', 'गृह्णीयुरपि मातङ्गान्मत्तान्प्रव्रजतो वने।
नर्दमानांश्च नादेन पातयेयुर्विहंगमान्॥', 'gṛhṇīyur api mātaṅgān mattān pravrajato vane
nardamānāṃś ca nādena pātayeyur vihaṃgamān', null, 1016016),
('ramayana-1-16-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 17', 'ईदृशानां प्रसूतानि हरीणां कामरूपिणाम्।
शतं शतसहस्राणि यूथपानां महात्मनाम्।
बभूवुर्यूथपश्रेष्ठा वीरांश्चाजनयन्हरीन्॥', 'īdṛśānāṃ prasūtāni harīṇāṃ kāmarūpiṇām
śataṃ śatasahasrāṇi yūthapānāṃ mahātmanām
babhūvur yūthapaśreṣṭhā vīrāṃś cājanayan harīn', null, 1016017),
('ramayana-1-16-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 18', 'अन्ये ऋक्षवतः प्रस्थानुपतस्थुः सहस्रशः।
अन्ये नानाविधाञ्शैलान्काननानि च भेजिरे॥', 'anye ṛkṣavataḥ prasthān upatasthuḥ sahasraśaḥ
anye nānāvidhāñ śailān kānanāni ca bhejire', null, 1016018),
('ramayana-1-16-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 19', 'सूर्यपुत्रं च सुग्रीवं शक्रपुत्रं च वालिनम्।
भ्रातरावुपतस्थुस्ते सर्व एव हरीश्वराः॥', 'sūryaputraṃ ca sugrīvaṃ śakraputraṃ ca vālinam
bhrātarāv upatasthus te sarva eva harīśvarāḥ', null, 1016019),
('ramayana-1-16-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 16, Verse 20', 'तैर्मेघवृन्दाचलकूटकल्पैर्महाबलैर्वानरयूथपालैः।
बभूव भूर्भीमशरीररूपैः समावृता रामसहायहेतोः॥', 'tair meghavṛndācalakūṭakalpair mahābalair vānarayūthapālaiḥ
babhūva bhūr bhīmaśarīrarūpaiḥ samāvṛtā rāmasahāyahetoḥ', null, 1016020)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 17 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-17-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 1', 'निर्वृत्ते तु क्रतौ तस्मिन्हयमेधे महात्मनः।
प्रतिगृह्य सुरा भागान्प्रतिजग्मुर्यथागतम्॥', 'nirvṛtte tu kratau tasmin hayamedhe mahātmanaḥ
pratigṛhya surā bhāgān pratijagmur yathāgatam', null, 1017001),
('ramayana-1-17-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 2', 'समाप्तदीक्षानियमः पत्नीगणसमन्वितः।
प्रविवेश पुरीं राजा सभृत्यबलवाहनः॥', 'samāptadīkṣāniyamaḥ patnīgaṇasamanvitaḥ
praviveśa purīṃ rājā sabhṛtyabalavāhanaḥ', null, 1017002),
('ramayana-1-17-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 3', 'यथार्हं पूजितास्तेन राज्ञा वै पृथिवीश्वराः।
मुदिताः प्रययुर्देशान्प्रणम्य मुनिपुंगवम्॥', 'yathārhaṃ pūjitās tena rājñā vai pṛthivīśvarāḥ
muditāḥ prayayur deśān praṇamya munipuṃgavam', null, 1017003),
('ramayana-1-17-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 4', 'गतेषु पृथिवीशेषु राजा दशरथः पुनः।
प्रविवेश पुरीं श्रीमान्पुरस्कृत्य द्विजोत्तमान्॥', 'gateṣu pṛthivīśeṣu rājā daśarathaḥ punaḥ
praviveśa purīṃ śrīmān puraskṛtya dvijottamān', null, 1017004),
('ramayana-1-17-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 5', 'शान्तया प्रययौ सार्धमृश्यशृङ्गः सुपूजितः।
अन्वीयमानो राज्ञाथ सानुयात्रेण धीमता॥', 'śāntayā prayayau sārdham ṛśyaśṛṅgaḥ supūjitaḥ
anvīyamāno rājñātha sānuyātreṇa dhīmatā', null, 1017005),
('ramayana-1-17-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 6', 'कौसल्याजनयद्रामं दिव्यलक्षणसंयुतम्।
विष्णोरर्धं महाभागं पुत्रमिक्ष्वाकुनन्दनम्॥', 'kausalyājanayad rāmaṃ divyalakṣaṇasaṃyutam
viṣṇor ardhaṃ mahābhāgaṃ putram ikṣvākunandanam', null, 1017006),
('ramayana-1-17-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 7', 'कौसल्या शुशुभे तेन पुत्रेणामिततेजसा।
यथा वरेण देवानामदितिर्वज्रपाणिना॥', 'kausalyā śuśubhe tena putreṇāmitatejasā
yathā vareṇa devānām aditir vajrapāṇinā', null, 1017007),
('ramayana-1-17-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 8', 'भरतो नाम कैकेय्यां जज्ञे सत्यपराक्रमः।
साक्षाद्विष्णोश्चतुर्भागः सर्वैः समुदितो गुणैः॥', 'bharato nāma kaikeyyāṃ jajñe satyaparākramaḥ
sākṣād viṣṇoś caturbhāgaḥ sarvaiḥ samudito guṇaiḥ', null, 1017008),
('ramayana-1-17-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 9', 'अथ लक्ष्मणशत्रुघ्नौ सुमित्राजनयत्सुतौ।
वीरौ सर्वास्त्रकुशलौ विष्णोरर्धसमन्वितौ॥', 'atha lakṣmaṇaśatrughnau sumitrājanayat sutau
vīrau sarvāstrakuśalau viṣṇor ardhasamanvitau', null, 1017009),
('ramayana-1-17-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 10', 'राज्ञः पुत्रा महात्मानश्चत्वारो जज्ञिरे पृथक्।
गुणवन्तोऽनुरूपाश्च रुच्या प्रोष्ठपदोपमाः॥', 'rājñaḥ putrā mahātmānaś catvāro jajñire pṛthak
guṇavanto ''nurūpāś ca rucyā proṣṭhapadopamāḥ', null, 1017010),
('ramayana-1-17-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 11', 'अतीत्यैकादशाहं तु नाम कर्म तथाकरोत्।
ज्येष्ठं रामं महात्मानं भरतं कैकयीसुतम्॥', 'atītyaikādaśāhaṃ tu nāma karma tathākarot
jyeṣṭhaṃ rāmaṃ mahātmānaṃ bharataṃ kaikayīsutam', null, 1017011),
('ramayana-1-17-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 12', 'सौमित्रिं लक्ष्मणमिति शत्रुघ्नमपरं तथा।
वसिष्ठः परमप्रीतो नामानि कृतवांस्तदा।
तेषां जन्मक्रियादीनि सर्वकर्माण्यकारयत्॥', 'saumitriṃ lakṣmaṇam iti śatrughnam aparaṃ tathā
vasiṣṭhaḥ paramaprīto nāmāni kṛtavāṃs tadā
teṣāṃ janmakriyādīni sarvakarmāṇy akārayat', null, 1017012),
('ramayana-1-17-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 13', 'तेषां केतुरिव ज्येष्ठो रामो रतिकरः पितुः।
बभूव भूयो भूतानां स्वयम्भूरिव संमतः॥', 'teṣāṃ ketur iva jyeṣṭho rāmo ratikaraḥ pituḥ
babhūva bhūyo bhūtānāṃ svayambhūr iva saṃmataḥ', null, 1017013),
('ramayana-1-17-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 14', 'सर्वे वेदविदः शूराः सर्वे लोकहिते रताः।
सर्वे ज्ञानोपसंपन्नाः सर्वे समुदिता गुणैः॥', 'sarve vedavidaḥ śūrāḥ sarve lokahite ratāḥ
sarve jñānopasaṃpannāḥ sarve samuditā guṇaiḥ', null, 1017014),
('ramayana-1-17-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 15', 'तेषामपि महातेजा रामः सत्यपराक्रमः।
बाल्यात्प्रभृति सुस्निग्धो लक्ष्मणो लक्ष्मिवर्धनः॥', 'teṣām api mahātejā rāmaḥ satyaparākramaḥ
bālyāt prabhṛti susnigdho lakṣmaṇo lakṣmivardhanaḥ', null, 1017015),
('ramayana-1-17-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 16', 'रामस्य लोकरामस्य भ्रातुर्ज्येष्ठस्य नित्यशः।
सर्वप्रियकरस्तस्य रामस्यापि शरीरतः॥', 'rāmasya lokarāmasya bhrātur jyeṣṭhasya nityaśaḥ
sarvapriyakaras tasya rāmasyāpi śarīrataḥ', null, 1017016),
('ramayana-1-17-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 17', 'लक्ष्मणो लक्ष्मिसंपन्नो बहिःप्राण इवापरः।
न च तेन विना निद्रां लभते पुरुषोत्तमः।
मृष्टमन्नमुपानीतमश्नाति न हि तं विना॥', 'lakṣmaṇo lakṣmisaṃpanno bahiḥprāṇa ivāparaḥ
na ca tena vinā nidrāṃ labhate puruṣottamaḥ
mṛṣṭam annam upānītam aśnāti na hi taṃ vinā', null, 1017017),
('ramayana-1-17-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 18', 'यदा हि हयमारूढो मृगयां याति राघवः।
तदैनं पृष्ठतोऽभ्येति सधनुः परिपालयन्॥', 'yadā hi hayam ārūḍho mṛgayāṃ yāti rāghavaḥ
tadainaṃ pṛṣṭhato ''bhyeti sadhanuḥ paripālayan', null, 1017018),
('ramayana-1-17-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 19', 'भरतस्यापि शत्रुघ्नो लक्ष्मणावरजो हि सः।
प्राणैः प्रियतरो नित्यं तस्य चासीत्तथा प्रियः॥', 'bharatasyāpi śatrughno lakṣmaṇāvarajo hi saḥ
prāṇaiḥ priyataro nityaṃ tasya cāsīt tathā priyaḥ', null, 1017019),
('ramayana-1-17-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 20', 'स चतुर्भिर्महाभागैः पुत्रैर्दशरथः प्रियैः।
बभूव परमप्रीतो देवैरिव पितामहः॥', 'sa caturbhir mahābhāgaiḥ putrair daśarathaḥ priyaiḥ
babhūva paramaprīto devair iva pitāmahaḥ', null, 1017020),
('ramayana-1-17-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 21', 'ते यदा ज्ञानसंपन्नाः सर्वे समुदिता गुणैः।
ह्रीमन्तः कीर्तिमन्तश्च सर्वज्ञा दीर्घदर्शिनः॥', 'te yadā jñānasaṃpannāḥ sarve samuditā guṇaiḥ
hrīmantaḥ kīrtimantaś ca sarvajñā dīrghadarśinaḥ', null, 1017021),
('ramayana-1-17-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 22', 'अथ राजा दशरथस्तेषां दारक्रियां प्रति।
चिन्तयामास धर्मात्मा सोपाध्यायः सबान्धवः॥', 'atha rājā daśarathas teṣāṃ dārakriyāṃ prati
cintayām āsa dharmātmā sopādhyāyaḥ sabāndhavaḥ', null, 1017022),
('ramayana-1-17-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 23', 'तस्य चिन्तयमानस्य मन्त्रिमध्ये महात्मनः।
अभ्यागच्छन्महातेजो विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः॥', 'tasya cintayamānasya mantrimadhye mahātmanaḥ
abhyāgacchan mahātejo viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ', null, 1017023),
('ramayana-1-17-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 24', 'स राज्ञो दर्शनाकाङ्क्षी द्वाराध्यक्षानुवाच ह।
शीघ्रमाख्यात मां प्राप्तं कौशिकं गाधिनः सुतम्॥', 'sa rājño darśanākāṅkṣī dvārādhyakṣān uvāca ha
śīghram ākhyāta māṃ prāptaṃ kauśikaṃ gādhinaḥ sutam', null, 1017024),
('ramayana-1-17-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 25', 'तच्छ्रुत्वा वचनं तस्य राजवेश्म प्रदुद्रुवुः।
संभ्रान्तमनसः सर्वे तेन वाक्येन चोदिताः॥', 'tac chrutvā vacanaṃ tasya rājaveśma pradudruvuḥ
saṃbhrāntamanasaḥ sarve tena vākyena coditāḥ', null, 1017025),
('ramayana-1-17-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 26', 'ते गत्वा राजभवनं विश्वामित्रमृषिं तदा।
प्राप्तमावेदयामासुर्नृपायेक्ष्वाकवे तदा॥', 'te gatvā rājabhavanaṃ viśvāmitram ṛṣiṃ tadā
prāptam āvedayām āsur nṛpāyekṣvākave tadā', null, 1017026),
('ramayana-1-17-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 27', 'तेषां तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा सपुरोधाः समाहितः।
प्रत्युज्जगाम संहृष्टो ब्रह्माणमिव वासवः॥', 'teṣāṃ tad vacanaṃ śrutvā sapurodhāḥ samāhitaḥ
pratyujjagāma saṃhṛṣṭo brahmāṇam iva vāsavaḥ', null, 1017027),
('ramayana-1-17-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 28', 'स दृष्ट्वा ज्वलितं दीप्त्या तापसं संशितव्रतम्।
प्रहृष्टवदनो राजा ततोऽर्घ्यमुपहारयत्॥', 'sa dṛṣṭvā jvalitaṃ dīptyā tāpasaṃ saṃśitavratam
prahṛṣṭavadano rājā tato ''rghyam upahārayat', null, 1017028),
('ramayana-1-17-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 29', 'स राज्ञः प्रतिगृह्यार्घ्यं शास्त्रदृष्ट्तेन कर्मणा।
कुशलं चाव्ययं चैव पर्यपृच्छन्नराधिपम्॥', 'sa rājñaḥ pratigṛhyārghyaṃ śāstradṛṣṭtena karmaṇā
kuśalaṃ cāvyayaṃ caiva paryapṛcchan narādhipam', null, 1017029),
('ramayana-1-17-30', 30, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 30', 'वसिष्ठं च समागम्य कुशलं मुनिपुंगवः।
ऋषींश्च तान्यथा न्यायं महाभागानुवाच ह॥', 'vasiṣṭhaṃ ca samāgamya kuśalaṃ munipuṃgavaḥ
ṛṣīṃś ca tān yathā nyāyaṃ mahābhāgān uvāca ha', null, 1017030),
('ramayana-1-17-31', 31, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 31', 'ते सर्वे हृष्टमनसस्तस्य राज्ञो निवेशनम्।
विविशुः पूजितास्तत्र निषेदुश्च यथार्थतः॥', 'te sarve hṛṣṭamanasas tasya rājño niveśanam
viviśuḥ pūjitās tatra niṣeduś ca yathārthataḥ', null, 1017031),
('ramayana-1-17-32', 32, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 32', 'अथ हृष्टमना राजा विश्वामित्रं महामुनिम्।
उवाच परमोदारो हृष्टस्तमभिपूजयन्॥', 'atha hṛṣṭamanā rājā viśvāmitraṃ mahāmunim
uvāca paramodāro hṛṣṭas tam abhipūjayan', null, 1017032),
('ramayana-1-17-33', 33, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 33', 'यथामृतस्य संप्राप्तिर्यथा वर्षमनूदके।
यथा सदृशदारेषु पुत्रजन्माप्रजस्य च।
प्रनष्टस्य यथा लाभो यथा हर्षो महोदये।
तथैवागमनं मन्ये स्वागतं ते महामुने॥', 'yathāmṛtasya saṃprāptir yathā varṣam anūdake
yathā sadṛśadāreṣu putrajanmāprajasya ca
pranaṣṭasya yathā lābho yathā harṣo mahodaye
tathaivāgamanaṃ manye svāgataṃ te mahāmune', null, 1017033),
('ramayana-1-17-34', 34, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 34', 'कं च ते परमं कामं करोमि किमु हर्षितः।
पात्रभूतोऽसि मे विप्र दिष्ट्या प्राप्तोऽसि धार्मिक।
अद्य मे सफलं जन्म जीवितं च सुजीवितम्॥', 'kaṃ ca te paramaṃ kāmaṃ karomi kim u harṣitaḥ
pātrabhūto ''si me vipra diṣṭyā prāpto ''si dhārmika
adya me saphalaṃ janma jīvitaṃ ca sujīvitam', null, 1017034),
('ramayana-1-17-35', 35, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 35', 'पूर्वं राजर्षिशब्देन तपसा द्योतितप्रभः।
ब्रह्मर्षित्वमनुप्राप्तः पूज्योऽसि बहुधा मया॥', 'pūrvaṃ rājarṣiśabdena tapasā dyotitaprabhaḥ
brahmarṣitvam anuprāptaḥ pūjyo ''si bahudhā mayā', null, 1017035),
('ramayana-1-17-36', 36, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 36', 'तदद्भुतमिदं विप्र पवित्रं परमं मम।
शुभक्षेत्रगतश्चाहं तव संदर्शनात्प्रभो॥', 'tad adbhutam idaṃ vipra pavitraṃ paramaṃ mama
śubhakṣetragataś cāhaṃ tava saṃdarśanāt prabho', null, 1017036),
('ramayana-1-17-37', 37, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 37', 'ब्रूहि यत्प्रार्थितं तुभ्यं कार्यमागमनं प्रति।
इच्छाम्यनुगृहीतोऽहं त्वदर्थपरिवृद्धये॥', 'brūhi yat prārthitaṃ tubhyaṃ kāryam āgamanaṃ prati
icchāmy anugṛhīto ''haṃ tvadarthaparivṛddhaye', null, 1017037),
('ramayana-1-17-38', 38, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 38', 'कार्यस्य न विमर्शं च गन्तुमर्हसि कौशिक।
कर्ता चाहमशेषेण दैवतं हि भवान्मम॥', 'kāryasya na vimarśaṃ ca gantum arhasi kauśika
kartā cāham aśeṣeṇa daivataṃ hi bhavān mama', null, 1017038),
('ramayana-1-17-39', 39, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 17, Verse 39', 'इति हृदयसुखं निशम्य वाक्यं श्रुतिसुखमात्मवता विनीतमुक्तम्।
प्रथितगुणयशा गुणैर्विशिष्टः परम ऋषिः परमं जगाम हर्षम्॥', 'iti hṛdayasukhaṃ niśamya vākyaṃ śrutisukham ātmavatā vinītam uktam
prathitaguṇayaśā guṇair viśiṣṭaḥ parama ṛṣiḥ paramaṃ jagāma harṣam', null, 1017039)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 18 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-18-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 1', 'तच्छ्रुत्वा राजसिंहस्य वाक्यमद्भुतविस्तरम्।
हृष्टरोमा महातेजा विश्वामित्रोऽभ्यभाषत॥', 'tac chrutvā rājasiṃhasya vākyam adbhutavistaram
hṛṣṭaromā mahātejā viśvāmitro ''bhyabhāṣata', null, 1018001),
('ramayana-1-18-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 2', 'सदृशं राजशार्दूल तवैतद्भुवि नान्यतः।
महावंशप्रसूतस्य वसिष्ठव्यपदेशिनः॥', 'sadṛśaṃ rājaśārdūla tavaitad bhuvi nānyataḥ
mahāvaṃśaprasūtasya vasiṣṭhavyapadeśinaḥ', null, 1018002),
('ramayana-1-18-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 3', 'यत्तु मे हृद्गतं वाक्यं तस्य कार्यस्य निश्चयम्।
कुरुष्व राजशार्दूल भव सत्यप्रतिश्रवः॥', 'yat tu me hṛdgataṃ vākyaṃ tasya kāryasya niścayam
kuruṣva rājaśārdūla bhava satyapratiśravaḥ', null, 1018003),
('ramayana-1-18-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 4', 'अहं नियममातिष्ठ सिद्ध्यर्थं पुरुषर्षभ।
तस्य विघ्नकरौ द्वौ तु राक्षसौ कामरूपिणौ॥', 'ahaṃ niyamam ātiṣṭha siddhyarthaṃ puruṣarṣabha
tasya vighnakarau dvau tu rākṣasau kāmarūpiṇau', null, 1018004),
('ramayana-1-18-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 5', 'व्रते मे बहुशश्चीर्णे समाप्त्यां राक्षसाविमौ।
मारीचश्च सुबाहुश्च वीर्यवन्तौ सुशिक्षितौ।
तौ मांसरुधिरौघेण वेदिं तामभ्यवर्षताम्॥', 'vrate me bahuśaś cīrṇe samāptyāṃ rākṣasāv imau
mārīcaś ca subāhuś ca vīryavantau suśikṣitau
tau māṃsarudhiraugheṇa vediṃ tām abhyavarṣatām', null, 1018005),
('ramayana-1-18-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 6', 'अवधूते तथा भूते तस्मिन्नियमनिश्चये।
कृतश्रमो निरुत्साहस्तस्माद्देशादपाक्रमे॥', 'avadhūte tathā bhūte tasmin niyamaniścaye
kṛtaśramo nirutsāhas tasmād deśād apākrame', null, 1018006),
('ramayana-1-18-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 7', 'न च मे क्रोधमुत्स्रष्टुं बुद्धिर्भवति पार्थिव।
तथाभूता हि सा चर्या न शापस्तत्र मुच्यते॥', 'na ca me krodham utsraṣṭuṃ buddhir bhavati pārthiva
tathābhūtā hi sā caryā na śāpas tatra mucyate', null, 1018007),
('ramayana-1-18-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 8', 'स्वपुत्रं राजशार्दूल रामं सत्यपराक्रमम्।
काकपक्षधरं शूरं ज्येष्ठं मे दातुमर्हसि॥', 'svaputraṃ rājaśārdūla rāmaṃ satyaparākramam
kākapakṣadharaṃ śūraṃ jyeṣṭhaṃ me dātum arhasi', null, 1018008),
('ramayana-1-18-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 9', 'शक्तो ह्येष मया गुप्तो दिव्येन स्वेन तेजसा।
राक्षसा ये विकर्तारस्तेषामपि विनाशने॥', 'śakto hy eṣa mayā gupto divyena svena tejasā
rākṣasā ye vikartāras teṣām api vināśane', null, 1018009),
('ramayana-1-18-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 10', 'श्रेयश्चास्मै प्रदास्यामि बहुरूपं न संशयः।
त्रयाणामपि लोकानां येन ख्यातिं गमिष्यति॥', 'śreyaś cāsmai pradāsyāmi bahurūpaṃ na saṃśayaḥ
trayāṇām api lokānāṃ yena khyātiṃ gamiṣyati', null, 1018010),
('ramayana-1-18-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 11', 'न च तौ राममासाद्य शक्तौ स्थातुं कथं चन।
न च तौ राघवादन्यो हन्तुमुत्सहते पुमान्॥', 'na ca tau rāmam āsādya śaktau sthātuṃ kathaṃ cana
na ca tau rāghavād anyo hantum utsahate pumān', null, 1018011),
('ramayana-1-18-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 12', 'वीर्योत्सिक्तौ हि तौ पापौ कालपाशवशं गतौ।
रामस्य राजशार्दूल न पर्याप्तौ महात्मनः॥', 'vīryotsiktau hi tau pāpau kālapāśavaśaṃ gatau
rāmasya rājaśārdūla na paryāptau mahātmanaḥ', null, 1018012),
('ramayana-1-18-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 13', 'न च पुत्रकृतं स्नेहं कर्तुमर्हसि पार्थिव।
अहं ते प्रतिजानामि हतौ तौ विद्धि राक्षसौ॥', 'na ca putrakṛtaṃ snehaṃ kartum arhasi pārthiva
ahaṃ te pratijānāmi hatau tau viddhi rākṣasau', null, 1018013),
('ramayana-1-18-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 14', 'अहं वेद्मि महात्मानं रामं सत्यपराक्रमम्।
वसिष्ठोऽपि महातेजा ये चेमे तपसि स्थिताः॥', 'ahaṃ vedmi mahātmānaṃ rāmaṃ satyaparākramam
vasiṣṭho ''pi mahātejā ye ceme tapasi sthitāḥ', null, 1018014),
('ramayana-1-18-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 15', 'यदि ते धर्मलाभं च यशश्च परमं भुवि।
स्थिरमिच्छसि राजेन्द्र रामं मे दातुमर्हसि॥', 'yadi te dharmalābhaṃ ca yaśaś ca paramaṃ bhuvi
sthiram icchasi rājendra rāmaṃ me dātum arhasi', null, 1018015),
('ramayana-1-18-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 16', 'यद्यभ्यनुज्ञां काकुत्स्थ ददते तव मन्त्रिणः।
वसिष्ठ प्रमुखाः सर्वे ततो रामं विसर्जय॥', 'yady abhyanujñāṃ kākutstha dadate tava mantriṇaḥ
vasiṣṭha pramukhāḥ sarve tato rāmaṃ visarjaya', null, 1018016),
('ramayana-1-18-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 17', 'अभिप्रेतमसंसक्तमात्मजं दातुमर्हसि।
दशरात्रं हि यज्ञस्य रामं राजीवलोचनम्॥', 'abhipretam asaṃsaktam ātmajaṃ dātum arhasi
daśarātraṃ hi yajñasya rāmaṃ rājīvalocanam', null, 1018017),
('ramayana-1-18-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 18', 'नात्येति कालो यज्ञस्य यथायं मम राघव।
तथा कुरुष्व भद्रं ते मा च शोके मनः कृथाः॥', 'nātyeti kālo yajñasya yathāyaṃ mama rāghava
tathā kuruṣva bhadraṃ te mā ca śoke manaḥ kṛthāḥ', null, 1018018),
('ramayana-1-18-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 19', 'इत्येवमुक्त्वा धर्मात्मा धर्मार्थसहितं वचः।
विरराम महातेजा विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः॥', 'ity evam uktvā dharmātmā dharmārthasahitaṃ vacaḥ
virarāma mahātejā viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ', null, 1018019),
('ramayana-1-18-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 18, Verse 20', 'इति हृदयमनोविदारणं मुनिवचनं तदतीव शुश्रुवान्।
नरपतिरगमद्भयं महद्व्यथितमनाः प्रचचाल चासनात्॥', 'iti hṛdayamanovidāraṇaṃ munivacanaṃ tad atīva śuśruvān
narapatir agamad bhayaṃ mahad vyathitamanāḥ pracacāla cāsanāt', null, 1018020)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 19 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-19-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 1', 'तच्छ्रुत्वा राजशार्दूल विश्वामित्रस्य भाषितम्।
मुहूर्तमिव निःसंज्ञः संज्ञावानिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'tac chrutvā rājaśārdūla viśvāmitrasya bhāṣitam
muhūrtam iva niḥsaṃjñaḥ saṃjñāvān idam abravīt', null, 1019001),
('ramayana-1-19-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 2', 'ऊनषोडशवर्षो मे रामो राजीवलोचनः।
न युद्धयोग्यतामस्य पश्यामि सह राक्षसैः॥', 'ūnaṣoḍaśavarṣo me rāmo rājīvalocanaḥ
na yuddhayogyatām asya paśyāmi saha rākṣasaiḥ', null, 1019002),
('ramayana-1-19-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 3', 'इयमक्षौहिणी पूर्णा यस्याहं पतिरीश्वरः।
अनया संवृतो गत्वा योधाहं तैर्निशाचरैः॥', 'iyam akṣauhiṇī pūrṇā yasyāhaṃ patir īśvaraḥ
anayā saṃvṛto gatvā yodhāhaṃ tair niśācaraiḥ', null, 1019003),
('ramayana-1-19-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 4', 'इमे शूराश्च विक्रान्ता भृत्या मेऽस्त्रविशारदाः।
योग्या रक्षोगणैर्योद्धुं न रामं नेतुमर्हसि॥', 'ime śūrāś ca vikrāntā bhṛtyā me ''straviśāradāḥ
yogyā rakṣogaṇair yoddhuṃ na rāmaṃ netum arhasi', null, 1019004),
('ramayana-1-19-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 5', 'अहमेव धनुष्पाणिर्गोप्ता समरमूर्धनि।
यावत्प्राणान्धरिष्यामि तावद्योत्स्ये निशाचरैः॥', 'aham eva dhanuṣpāṇir goptā samaramūrdhani
yāvat prāṇān dhariṣyāmi tāvad yotsye niśācaraiḥ', null, 1019005),
('ramayana-1-19-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 6', 'निर्विघ्ना व्रतचर्या सा भविष्यति सुरक्षिता।
अहं तत्र गमिष्यामि न राम नेतुमर्हसि॥', 'nirvighnā vratacaryā sā bhaviṣyati surakṣitā
ahaṃ tatra gamiṣyāmi na rāma netum arhasi', null, 1019006),
('ramayana-1-19-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 7', 'बालो ह्यकृतविद्यश्च न च वेत्ति बलाबलम्।
न चास्त्रबलसंयुक्तो न च युद्धविशारदः।
न चासौ रक्षसां योग्यः कूटयुद्धा हि ते ध्रुवम्॥', 'bālo hy akṛtavidyaś ca na ca vetti balābalam
na cāstrabalasaṃyukto na ca yuddhaviśāradaḥ
na cāsau rakṣasāṃ yogyaḥ kūṭayuddhā hi te dhruvam', null, 1019007),
('ramayana-1-19-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 8', 'विप्रयुक्तो हि रामेण मुहूर्तमपि नोत्सहे।
जीवितुं मुनिशार्दूल न रामं नेतुमर्हसि॥', 'viprayukto hi rāmeṇa muhūrtam api notsahe
jīvituṃ muniśārdūla na rāmaṃ netum arhasi', null, 1019008),
('ramayana-1-19-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 9', 'यदि वा राघवं ब्रह्मन्नेतुमिच्छसि सुव्रत।
चतुरङ्गसमायुक्तं मया सह च तं नय॥', 'yadi vā rāghavaṃ brahman netum icchasi suvrata
caturaṅgasamāyuktaṃ mayā saha ca taṃ naya', null, 1019009),
('ramayana-1-19-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 10', 'षष्टिर्वर्षसहस्राणि जातस्य मम कौशिक।
दुःखेनोत्पादितश्चायं न रामं नेतुमर्हसि॥', 'ṣaṣṭir varṣasahasrāṇi jātasya mama kauśika
duḥkhenotpāditaś cāyaṃ na rāmaṃ netum arhasi', null, 1019010),
('ramayana-1-19-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 11', 'चतुर्णामात्मजानां हि प्रीतिः परमिका मम।
ज्येष्ठं धर्मप्रधानं च न रामं नेतुमर्हसि॥', 'caturṇām ātmajānāṃ hi prītiḥ paramikā mama
jyeṣṭhaṃ dharmapradhānaṃ ca na rāmaṃ netum arhasi', null, 1019011),
('ramayana-1-19-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 12', 'किं वीर्या राक्षसास्ते च कस्य पुत्राश्च के च ते।
कथं प्रमाणाः के चैतान्रक्षन्ति मुनिपुंगव॥', 'kiṃ vīryā rākṣasās te ca kasya putrāś ca ke ca te
kathaṃ pramāṇāḥ ke caitān rakṣanti munipuṃgava', null, 1019012),
('ramayana-1-19-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 13', 'कथं च प्रतिकर्तव्यं तेषां रामेण रक्षसाम्।
मामकैर्वा बलैर्ब्रह्मन्मया वा कूटयोधिनाम्॥', 'kathaṃ ca pratikartavyaṃ teṣāṃ rāmeṇa rakṣasām
māmakair vā balair brahman mayā vā kūṭayodhinām', null, 1019013),
('ramayana-1-19-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 14', 'सर्वं मे शंस भगवन्कथं तेषां मया रणे।
स्थातव्यं दुष्टभावानां वीर्योत्सिक्ता हि राक्षसाः॥', 'sarvaṃ me śaṃsa bhagavan kathaṃ teṣāṃ mayā raṇe
sthātavyaṃ duṣṭabhāvānāṃ vīryotsiktā hi rākṣasāḥ', null, 1019014),
('ramayana-1-19-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 15', 'तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा विश्वामित्रोऽभ्यभाषत।
पौलस्त्यवंशप्रभवो रावणो नाम राक्षसः॥', 'tasya tad vacanaṃ śrutvā viśvāmitro ''bhyabhāṣata
paulastyavaṃśaprabhavo rāvaṇo nāma rākṣasaḥ', null, 1019015),
('ramayana-1-19-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 16', 'स ब्रह्मणा दत्तवरस्त्रैलोक्यं बाधते भृशम्।
महाबलो महावीर्यो राक्षसैर्बहुभिर्वृतः॥', 'sa brahmaṇā dattavaras trailokyaṃ bādhate bhṛśam
mahābalo mahāvīryo rākṣasair bahubhir vṛtaḥ', null, 1019016),
('ramayana-1-19-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 17', 'श्रूयते हि महावीर्यो रावणो राक्षसाधिपः।
साक्षाद्वैश्रवणभ्राता पुत्रो विश्रवसो मुनेः॥', 'śrūyate hi mahāvīryo rāvaṇo rākṣasādhipaḥ
sākṣād vaiśravaṇabhrātā putro viśravaso muneḥ', null, 1019017),
('ramayana-1-19-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 18', 'यदा स्वयं न यज्ञस्य विघ्नकर्ता महाबलः।
तेन संचोदितौ तौ तु राक्षसौ सुमहा बलौ।
मारीचश्च सुबाहुश्च यज्ञविघ्नं करिष्यतः॥', 'yadā svayaṃ na yajñasya vighnakartā mahābalaḥ
tena saṃcoditau tau tu rākṣasau sumahā balau
mārīcaś ca subāhuś ca yajñavighnaṃ kariṣyataḥ', null, 1019018),
('ramayana-1-19-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 19', 'इत्युक्तो मुनिना तेन राजोवाच मुनिं तदा।
न हि शक्तोऽस्मि संग्रामे स्थातुं तस्य दुरात्मनः॥', 'ity ukto muninā tena rājovāca muniṃ tadā
na hi śakto ''smi saṃgrāme sthātuṃ tasya durātmanaḥ', null, 1019019),
('ramayana-1-19-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 20', 'स त्वं प्रसादं धर्मज्ञ कुरुष्व मम पुत्रके।
देवदानवगन्धर्वा यक्षाः पतग पन्नगाः॥', 'sa tvaṃ prasādaṃ dharmajña kuruṣva mama putrake
devadānavagandharvā yakṣāḥ pataga pannagāḥ', null, 1019020),
('ramayana-1-19-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 21', 'न शक्ता रावणं सोढुं किं पुनर्मानवा युधि।
स हि वीर्यवतां वीर्यमादत्ते युधि राक्षसः॥', 'na śaktā rāvaṇaṃ soḍhuṃ kiṃ punar mānavā yudhi
sa hi vīryavatāṃ vīryam ādatte yudhi rākṣasaḥ', null, 1019021),
('ramayana-1-19-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 22', 'तेन चाहं न शक्तोऽस्मि संयोद्धुं तस्य वा बलैः।
सबलो वा मुनिश्रेष्ठ सहितो वा ममात्मजैः॥', 'tena cāhaṃ na śakto ''smi saṃyoddhuṃ tasya vā balaiḥ
sabalo vā muniśreṣṭha sahito vā mamātmajaiḥ', null, 1019022),
('ramayana-1-19-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 23', 'कथमप्यमरप्रख्यं संग्रामाणामकोविदम्।
बालं मे तनयं ब्रह्मन्नैव दास्यामि पुत्रकम्॥', 'katham apy amaraprakhyaṃ saṃgrāmāṇām akovidam
bālaṃ me tanayaṃ brahman naiva dāsyāmi putrakam', null, 1019023),
('ramayana-1-19-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 24', 'अथ कालोपमौ युद्धे सुतौ सुन्दोपसुन्दयोः।
यज्ञविघ्नकरौ तौ ते नैव दास्यामि पुत्रकम्॥', 'atha kālopamau yuddhe sutau sundopasundayoḥ
yajñavighnakarau tau te naiva dāsyāmi putrakam', null, 1019024),
('ramayana-1-19-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 19, Verse 25', 'मारीचश्च सुबाहुश्च वीर्यवन्तौ सुशिक्षितौ।
तयोरन्यतरेणाहं योद्धा स्यां ससुहृद्गणः॥', 'mārīcaś ca subāhuś ca vīryavantau suśikṣitau
tayor anyatareṇāhaṃ yoddhā syāṃ sasuhṛdgaṇaḥ', null, 1019025)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 20 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-20-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 1', 'तच्छ्रुत्वा वचनं तस्य स्नेहपर्याकुलाक्षरम्।
समन्युः कौशिको वाक्यं प्रत्युवच महीपतिम्॥', 'tac chrutvā vacanaṃ tasya snehaparyākulākṣaram
samanyuḥ kauśiko vākyaṃ pratyuvaca mahīpatim', null, 1020001),
('ramayana-1-20-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 2', 'पूर्वमर्थं प्रतिश्रुत्य प्रतिज्ञां हातुमिच्छसि।
रागवाणामयुक्तोऽयं कुलस्यास्य विपर्ययः॥', 'pūrvam arthaṃ pratiśrutya pratijñāṃ hātum icchasi
rāgavāṇām ayukto ''yaṃ kulasyāsya viparyayaḥ', null, 1020002),
('ramayana-1-20-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 3', 'यदिदं ते क्षमं राजन्गमिष्यामि यथागतम्।
मिथ्याप्रतिज्ञः काकुत्स्थ सुखी भव सबान्धवः॥', 'yad idaṃ te kṣamaṃ rājan gamiṣyāmi yathāgatam
mithyāpratijñaḥ kākutstha sukhī bhava sabāndhavaḥ', null, 1020003),
('ramayana-1-20-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 4', 'तस्य रोषपरीतस्य विश्वामित्रस्य धीमतः।
चचाल वसुधा कृत्स्ना विवेश च भयं सुरान्॥', 'tasya roṣaparītasya viśvāmitrasya dhīmataḥ
cacāla vasudhā kṛtsnā viveśa ca bhayaṃ surān', null, 1020004),
('ramayana-1-20-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 5', 'त्रस्तरूपं तु विज्ञाय जगत्सर्वं महानृषिः।
नृपतिं सुव्रतो धीरो वसिष्ठो वाक्यमब्रवीत्॥', 'trastarūpaṃ tu vijñāya jagat sarvaṃ mahān ṛṣiḥ
nṛpatiṃ suvrato dhīro vasiṣṭho vākyam abravīt', null, 1020005),
('ramayana-1-20-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 6', 'इक्ष्वाकूणां कुले जातः साक्षाद्धर्म इवापरः।
धृतिमान्सुव्रतः श्रीमान्न धर्मं हातुमर्हसि॥', 'ikṣvākūṇāṃ kule jātaḥ sākṣād dharma ivāparaḥ
dhṛtimānsuvrataḥ śrīmān na dharmaṃ hātum arhasi', null, 1020006),
('ramayana-1-20-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 7', 'त्रिषु लोकेषु विख्यातो धर्मात्मा इति राघवः।
स्वधर्मं प्रतिपद्यस्व नाधर्मं वोढुमर्हसि॥', 'triṣu lokeṣu vikhyāto dharmātmā iti rāghavaḥ
svadharmaṃ pratipadyasva nādharmaṃ voḍhum arhasi', null, 1020007),
('ramayana-1-20-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 8', 'संश्रुत्यैवं करिष्यामीत्यकुर्वाणस्य राघव।
इष्टापूर्तवधो भूयात्तस्माद्रामं विसर्जय॥', 'saṃśrutyaivaṃ kariṣyāmīty akurvāṇasya rāghava
iṣṭāpūrtavadho bhūyāt tasmād rāmaṃ visarjaya', null, 1020008),
('ramayana-1-20-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 9', 'कृतास्त्रमकृतास्त्रं वा नैनं शक्ष्यन्ति राक्षसाः।
गुप्तं कुशिकपुत्रेण ज्वलनेनामृतं यथा॥', 'kṛtāstram akṛtāstraṃ vā nainaṃ śakṣyanti rākṣasāḥ
guptaṃ kuśikaputreṇa jvalanenāmṛtaṃ yathā', null, 1020009),
('ramayana-1-20-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 10', 'एष विग्रहवान्धर्म एष वीर्यवतां वरः।
एष बुद्ध्याधिको लोके तपसश्च परायणम्॥', 'eṣa vigrahavān dharma eṣa vīryavatāṃ varaḥ
eṣa buddhyādhiko loke tapasaś ca parāyaṇam', null, 1020010),
('ramayana-1-20-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 11', 'एषोऽस्त्रान्विविधान्वेत्ति त्रैलोक्ये सचराचरे।
नैनमन्यः पुमान्वेत्ति न च वेत्स्यन्ति के चन॥', 'eṣo ''strān vividhān vetti trailokye sacarācare
nainam anyaḥ pumān vetti na ca vetsyanti ke cana', null, 1020011),
('ramayana-1-20-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 12', 'न देवा नर्षयः के चिन्नासुरा न च राक्षसाः।
गन्धर्वयक्षप्रवराः सकिंनरमहोरगाः॥', 'na devā narṣayaḥ ke cin nāsurā na ca rākṣasāḥ
gandharvayakṣapravarāḥ sakiṃnaramahoragāḥ', null, 1020012),
('ramayana-1-20-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 13', 'सर्वास्त्राणि कृशाश्वस्य पुत्राः परमधार्मिकाः।
कौशिकाय पुरा दत्ता यदा राज्यं प्रशासति॥', 'sarvāstrāṇi kṛśāśvasya putrāḥ paramadhārmikāḥ
kauśikāya purā dattā yadā rājyaṃ praśāsati', null, 1020013),
('ramayana-1-20-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 14', 'तेऽपि पुत्राः कृशाश्वस्य प्रजापतिसुतासुताः।
नैकरूपा महावीर्या दीप्तिमन्तो जयावहाः॥', 'te ''pi putrāḥ kṛśāśvasya prajāpatisutāsutāḥ
naikarūpā mahāvīryā dīptimanto jayāvahāḥ', null, 1020014),
('ramayana-1-20-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 15', 'जया च सुप्रभा चैव दक्षकन्ये सुमध्यमे।
ते सुवातेऽस्त्रशस्त्राणि शतं परम भास्वरम्॥', 'jayā ca suprabhā caiva dakṣakanye sumadhyame
te suvāte ''straśastrāṇi śataṃ parama bhāsvaram', null, 1020015),
('ramayana-1-20-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 16', 'पञ्चाशतं सुतांल्लेभे जया नाम वरान्पुरा।
वधायासुरसैन्यानाममेयान्कामरूपिणः॥', 'pañcāśataṃ sutāṃl lebhe jayā nāma varān purā
vadhāyāsurasainyānām ameyān kāmarūpiṇaḥ', null, 1020016),
('ramayana-1-20-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 17', 'सुप्रभाजनयच्चापि पुत्रान्पञ्चाशतं पुनः।
संहारान्नाम दुर्धर्षान्दुराक्रामान्बलीयसः॥', 'suprabhājanayac cāpi putrān pañcāśataṃ punaḥ
saṃhārān nāma durdharṣān durākrāmān balīyasaḥ', null, 1020017),
('ramayana-1-20-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 18', 'तानि चास्त्राणि वेत्त्येष यथावत्कुशिकात्मजः।
अपूर्वाणां च जनने शक्तो भूयश्च धर्मवित्॥', 'tāni cāstrāṇi vetty eṣa yathāvat kuśikātmajaḥ
apūrvāṇāṃ ca janane śakto bhūyaś ca dharmavit', null, 1020018),
('ramayana-1-20-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 20, Verse 19', 'एवं वीर्यो महातेजा विश्वामित्रो महातपाः।
न रामगमने राजन्संशयं गन्तुमर्हसि॥', 'evaṃ vīryo mahātejā viśvāmitro mahātapāḥ
na rāmagamane rājan saṃśayaṃ gantum arhasi', null, 1020019)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 21 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-21-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 1', 'तथा वसिष्ठे ब्रुवति राजा दशरथः सुतम्।
प्रहृष्टवदनो राममाजुहाव सलक्ष्मणम्॥', 'tathā vasiṣṭhe bruvati rājā daśarathaḥ sutam
prahṛṣṭavadano rāmam ājuhāva salakṣmaṇam', null, 1021001),
('ramayana-1-21-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 2', 'कृतस्वस्त्ययनं मात्रा पित्रा दशरथेन च।
पुरोधसा वसिष्ठेन मङ्गलैरभिमन्त्रितम्॥', 'kṛtasvastyayanaṃ mātrā pitrā daśarathena ca
purodhasā vasiṣṭhena maṅgalair abhimantritam', null, 1021002),
('ramayana-1-21-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 3', 'स पुत्रं मूर्ध्न्युपाघ्राय राजा दशरथः प्रियम्।
ददौ कुशिकपुत्राय सुप्रीतेनान्तरात्मना॥', 'sa putraṃ mūrdhny upāghrāya rājā daśarathaḥ priyam
dadau kuśikaputrāya suprītenāntarātmanā', null, 1021003),
('ramayana-1-21-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 4', 'ततो वायुः सुखस्पर्शो विरजस्को ववौ तदा।
विश्वामित्रगतं रामं दृष्ट्वा राजीवलोचनम्॥', 'tato vāyuḥ sukhasparśo virajasko vavau tadā
viśvāmitragataṃ rāmaṃ dṛṣṭvā rājīvalocanam', null, 1021004),
('ramayana-1-21-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 5', 'पुष्पवृष्टिर्महत्यासीद्देवदुन्दुभिनिस्वनः।
शङ्खदुन्दुभिनिर्घोषः प्रयाते तु महात्मनि॥', 'puṣpavṛṣṭir mahaty āsīd devadundubhinisvanaḥ
śaṅkhadundubhinirghoṣaḥ prayāte tu mahātmani', null, 1021005),
('ramayana-1-21-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 6', 'विश्वामित्रो ययावग्रे ततो रामो महायशाः।
काकपक्षधरो धन्वी तं च सौमित्रिरन्वगात्॥', 'viśvāmitro yayāv agre tato rāmo mahāyaśāḥ
kākapakṣadharo dhanvī taṃ ca saumitrir anvagāt', null, 1021006),
('ramayana-1-21-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 7', 'कलापिनौ धनुष्पाणी शोभयानौ दिशो दश।
विश्वामित्रं महात्मानं त्रिशीर्षाविव पन्नगौ।
अनुजग्मतुरक्षुद्रौ पितामहमिवाश्विनौ॥', 'kalāpinau dhanuṣpāṇī śobhayānau diśo daśa
viśvāmitraṃ mahātmānaṃ triśīrṣāv iva pannagau
anujagmatur akṣudrau pitāmaham ivāśvinau', null, 1021007),
('ramayana-1-21-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 8', 'बद्धगोधाङ्गुलित्राणौ खड्गवन्तौ महाद्युती।
स्थाणुं देवमिवाचिन्त्यं कुमाराविव पावकी॥', 'baddhagodhāṅgulitrāṇau khaḍgavantau mahādyutī
sthāṇuṃ devam ivācintyaṃ kumārāv iva pāvakī', null, 1021008),
('ramayana-1-21-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 9', 'अध्यर्धयोजनं गत्वा सरय्वा दक्षिणे तटे।
रामेति मधुरा वाणीं विश्वामित्रोऽभ्यभाषत॥', 'adhyardhayojanaṃ gatvā sarayvā dakṣiṇe taṭe
rāmeti madhurā vāṇīṃ viśvāmitro ''bhyabhāṣata', null, 1021009),
('ramayana-1-21-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 10', 'गृहाण वत्स सलिलं मा भूत्कालस्य पर्ययः।
मन्त्रग्रामं गृहाण त्वं बलामतिबलां तथा॥', 'gṛhāṇa vatsa salilaṃ mā bhūt kālasya paryayaḥ
mantragrāmaṃ gṛhāṇa tvaṃ balām atibalāṃ tathā', null, 1021010),
('ramayana-1-21-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 11', 'न श्रमो न ज्वरो वा ते न रूपस्य विपर्ययः।
न च सुप्तं प्रमत्तं वा धर्षयिष्यन्ति नैरृताः॥', 'na śramo na jvaro vā te na rūpasya viparyayaḥ
na ca suptaṃ pramattaṃ vā dharṣayiṣyanti nairṛtāḥ', null, 1021011),
('ramayana-1-21-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 12', 'न बाह्वोः सदृशो वीर्ये पृथिव्यामस्ति कश्चन।
त्रिषु लोकेषु वा राम न भवेत्सदृशस्तव॥', 'na bāhvoḥ sadṛśo vīrye pṛthivyām asti kaś cana
triṣu lokeṣu vā rāma na bhavet sadṛśas tava', null, 1021012),
('ramayana-1-21-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 13', 'न सौभाग्ये न दाक्षिण्ये न ज्ञाने बुद्धिनिश्चये।
नोत्तरे प्रतिपत्तव्यो समो लोके तवानघ॥', 'na saubhāgye na dākṣiṇye na jñāne buddhiniścaye
nottare pratipattavyo samo loke tavānagha', null, 1021013),
('ramayana-1-21-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 14', 'एतद्विद्याद्वये लब्धे भविता नास्ति ते समः।
बला चातिबला चैव सर्वज्ञानस्य मातरौ॥', 'etadvidyādvaye labdhe bhavitā nāsti te samaḥ
balā cātibalā caiva sarvajñānasya mātarau', null, 1021014),
('ramayana-1-21-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 15', 'क्षुत्पिपासे न ते राम भविष्येते नरोत्तम।
बलामतिबलां चैव पठतः पथि राघव।
विद्याद्वयमधीयाने यशश्चाप्यतुलं भुवि॥', 'kṣutpipāse na te rāma bhaviṣyete narottama
balām atibalāṃ caiva paṭhataḥ pathi rāghava
vidyādvayam adhīyāne yaśaś cāpy atulaṃ bhuvi', null, 1021015),
('ramayana-1-21-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 16', 'पितामहसुते ह्येते विद्ये तेजःसमन्विते।
प्रदातुं तव काकुत्स्थ सदृशस्त्वं हि धार्मिक॥', 'pitāmahasute hy ete vidye tejaḥsamanvite
pradātuṃ tava kākutstha sadṛśas tvaṃ hi dhārmika', null, 1021016),
('ramayana-1-21-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 17', 'कामं बहुगुणाः सर्वे त्वय्येते नात्र संशयः।
तपसा संभृते चैते बहुरूपे भविष्यतः॥', 'kāmaṃ bahuguṇāḥ sarve tvayy ete nātra saṃśayaḥ
tapasā saṃbhṛte caite bahurūpe bhaviṣyataḥ', null, 1021017),
('ramayana-1-21-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 18', 'ततो रामो जलं स्पृष्ट्वा प्रहृष्टवदनः शुचिः।
प्रतिजग्राह ते विद्ये महर्षेर्भावितात्मनः।
विद्यासमुदितो रामः शुशुभे भूरिविक्रमः॥', 'tato rāmo jalaṃ spṛṣṭvā prahṛṣṭavadanaḥ śuciḥ
pratijagrāha te vidye maharṣer bhāvitātmanaḥ
vidyāsamudito rāmaḥ śuśubhe bhūrivikramaḥ', null, 1021018),
('ramayana-1-21-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 21, Verse 19', 'गुरुकार्याणि सर्वाणि नियुज्य कुशिकात्मजे।
ऊषुस्तां रजनीं तत्र सरय्वां सुसुखं त्रयः॥', 'gurukāryāṇi sarvāṇi niyujya kuśikātmaje
ūṣus tāṃ rajanīṃ tatra sarayvāṃ susukhaṃ trayaḥ', null, 1021019)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 22 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-22-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 1', 'प्रभातायां तु शर्वर्यां विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
अभ्यभाषत काकुत्स्थं शयानं पर्णसंस्तरे॥', 'prabhātāyāṃ tu śarvaryāṃ viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
abhyabhāṣata kākutsthaṃ śayānaṃ parṇasaṃstare', null, 1022001),
('ramayana-1-22-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 2', 'कौसल्या सुप्रजा राम पूर्वा संध्या प्रवर्तते।
उत्तिष्ठ नरशार्दूल कर्तव्यं दैवमाह्निकम्॥', 'kausalyā suprajā rāma pūrvā saṃdhyā pravartate
uttiṣṭha naraśārdūla kartavyaṃ daivam āhnikam', null, 1022002),
('ramayana-1-22-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 3', 'तस्यर्षेः परमोदारं वचः श्रुत्वा नृपात्मजौ।
स्नात्वा कृतोदकौ वीरौ जेपतुः परमं जपम्॥', 'tasyarṣeḥ paramodāraṃ vacaḥ śrutvā nṛpātmajau
snātvā kṛtodakau vīrau jepatuḥ paramaṃ japam', null, 1022003),
('ramayana-1-22-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 4', 'कृताह्निकौ महावीर्यौ विश्वामित्रं तपोधनम्।
अभिवाद्याभिसंहृष्टौ गमनायोपतस्थतुः॥', 'kṛtāhnikau mahāvīryau viśvāmitraṃ tapodhanam
abhivādyābhisaṃhṛṣṭau gamanāyopatasthatuḥ', null, 1022004),
('ramayana-1-22-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 5', 'तौ प्रयाते महावीर्यौ दिव्यं त्रिपथगां नदीम्।
ददृशाते ततस्तत्र सरय्वाः संगमे शुभे॥', 'tau prayāte mahāvīryau divyaṃ tripathagāṃ nadīm
dadṛśāte tatas tatra sarayvāḥ saṃgame śubhe', null, 1022005),
('ramayana-1-22-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 6', 'तत्राश्रमपदं पुण्यमृषीणामुग्रतेजसाम्।
बहुवर्षसहस्राणि तप्यतां परमं तपः॥', 'tatrāśramapadaṃ puṇyam ṛṣīṇām ugratejasām
bahuvarṣasahasrāṇi tapyatāṃ paramaṃ tapaḥ', null, 1022006),
('ramayana-1-22-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 7', 'तं दृष्ट्वा परमप्रीतौ राघवौ पुण्यमाश्रमम्।
ऊचतुस्तं महात्मानं विश्वामित्रमिदं वचः॥', 'taṃ dṛṣṭvā paramaprītau rāghavau puṇyam āśramam
ūcatus taṃ mahātmānaṃ viśvāmitram idaṃ vacaḥ', null, 1022007),
('ramayana-1-22-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 8', 'कस्यायमाश्रमः पुण्यः को न्वस्मिन्वसते पुमान्।
भगवञ्श्रोतुमिच्छावः परं कौतूहलं हि नौ॥', 'kasyāyam āśramaḥ puṇyaḥ ko nv asmin vasate pumān
bhagavañ śrotum icchāvaḥ paraṃ kautūhalaṃ hi nau', null, 1022008),
('ramayana-1-22-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 9', 'तयोस्तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा प्रहस्य मुनिपुंगवः।
अब्रवीच्छ्रूयतां राम यस्यायं पूर्व आश्रमः॥', 'tayos tad vacanaṃ śrutvā prahasya munipuṃgavaḥ
abravīc chrūyatāṃ rāma yasyāyaṃ pūrva āśramaḥ', null, 1022009),
('ramayana-1-22-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 10', 'कन्दर्पो मूर्तिमानासीत्काम इत्युच्यते बुधैः॥', 'kandarpo mūrtimān āsīt kāma ity ucyate budhaiḥ', null, 1022010),
('ramayana-1-22-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 11', 'तपस्यन्तमिह स्थाणुं नियमेन समाहितम्।
कृतोद्वाहं तु देवेशं गच्छन्तं समरुद्गणम्।
धर्षयामास दुर्मेधा हुंकृतश्च महात्मना॥', 'tapasyantam iha sthāṇuṃ niyamena samāhitam
kṛtodvāhaṃ tu deveśaṃ gacchantaṃ samarudgaṇam
dharṣayām āsa durmedhā huṃkṛtaś ca mahātmanā', null, 1022011),
('ramayana-1-22-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 12', 'दग्धस्य तस्य रौद्रेण चक्षुषा रघुनन्दन।
व्यशीर्यन्त शरीरात्स्वात्सर्वगात्राणि दुर्मतेः॥', 'dagdhasya tasya raudreṇa cakṣuṣā raghunandana
vyaśīryanta śarīrāt svāt sarvagātrāṇi durmateḥ', null, 1022012),
('ramayana-1-22-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 13', 'तस्य गात्रं हतं तत्र निर्दग्धस्य महात्मना।
अशरीरः कृतः कामः क्रोधाद्देवेश्वरेण ह॥', 'tasya gātraṃ hataṃ tatra nirdagdhasya mahātmanā
aśarīraḥ kṛtaḥ kāmaḥ krodhād deveśvareṇa ha', null, 1022013),
('ramayana-1-22-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 14', 'अनङ्ग इति विख्यातस्तदा प्रभृति राघव।
स चाङ्गविषयः श्रीमान्यत्राङ्गं स मुमोच ह॥', 'anaṅga iti vikhyātas tadā prabhṛti rāghava
sa cāṅgaviṣayaḥ śrīmān yatrāṅgaṃ sa mumoca ha', null, 1022014),
('ramayana-1-22-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 15', 'तस्यायमाश्रमः पुण्यस्तस्येमे मुनयः पुरा।
शिष्या धर्मपरा वीर तेषां पापं न विद्यते॥', 'tasyāyam āśramaḥ puṇyas tasyeme munayaḥ purā
śiṣyā dharmaparā vīra teṣāṃ pāpaṃ na vidyate', null, 1022015),
('ramayana-1-22-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 16', 'इहाद्य रजनीं राम वसेम शुभदर्शन।
पुण्ययोः सरितोर्मध्ये श्वस्तरिष्यामहे वयम्॥', 'ihādya rajanīṃ rāma vasema śubhadarśana
puṇyayoḥ saritor madhye śvas tariṣyāmahe vayam', null, 1022016),
('ramayana-1-22-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 17', 'तेषां संवदतां तत्र तपो दीर्घेण चक्षुषा।
विज्ञाय परमप्रीता मुनयो हर्षमागमन्॥', 'teṣāṃ saṃvadatāṃ tatra tapo dīrgheṇa cakṣuṣā
vijñāya paramaprītā munayo harṣam āgaman', null, 1022017),
('ramayana-1-22-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 18', 'अर्घ्यं पाद्यं तथातिथ्यं निवेद्यकुशिकात्मजे।
रामलक्ष्मणयोः पश्चादकुर्वन्नतिथिक्रियाम्॥', 'arghyaṃ pādyaṃ tathātithyaṃ nivedyakuśikātmaje
rāmalakṣmaṇayoḥ paścād akurvann atithikriyām', null, 1022018),
('ramayana-1-22-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 22, Verse 19', 'सत्कारं समनुप्राप्य कथाभिरभिरञ्जयन्।
न्यवसन्सुसुखं तत्र कामाश्रमपदे तदा॥', 'satkāraṃ samanuprāpya kathābhir abhirañjayan
nyavasan susukhaṃ tatra kāmāśramapade tadā', null, 1022019)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 23 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-23-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 1', 'ततः प्रभाते विमले कृताह्निकमरिंदमौ।
विश्वामित्रं पुरस्कृत्य नद्यास्तीरमुपागतौ॥', 'tataḥ prabhāte vimale kṛtāhnikam ariṃdamau
viśvāmitraṃ puraskṛtya nadyās tīram upāgatau', null, 1023001),
('ramayana-1-23-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 2', 'ते च सर्वे महात्मानो मुनयः संशितव्रताः।
उपस्थाप्य शुभां नावं विश्वामित्रमथाब्रुवन्॥', 'te ca sarve mahātmāno munayaḥ saṃśitavratāḥ
upasthāpya śubhāṃ nāvaṃ viśvāmitram athābruvan', null, 1023002),
('ramayana-1-23-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 3', 'आरोहतु भवान्नावं राजपुत्रपुरस्कृतः।
अरिष्टं गच्छ पन्थानं मा भूत्कालस्य पर्ययः॥', 'ārohatu bhavān nāvaṃ rājaputrapuraskṛtaḥ
ariṣṭaṃ gaccha panthānaṃ mā bhūt kālasya paryayaḥ', null, 1023003),
('ramayana-1-23-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 4', 'विश्वामित्रस्तथेत्युक्त्वा तानृषीनभिपूज्य च।
ततार सहितस्ताभ्यां सरितं सागरं गमाम्॥', 'viśvāmitras tathety uktvā tān ṛṣīn abhipūjya ca
tatāra sahitas tābhyāṃ saritaṃ sāgaraṃ gamām', null, 1023004),
('ramayana-1-23-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 5', 'अथ रामः सरिन्मध्ये पप्रच्छ मुनिपुङ्गवम्।
वारिणो भिद्यमानस्य किमयं तुमुलो ध्वनिः॥', 'atha rāmaḥ sarinmadhye papraccha munipuṅgavam
vāriṇo bhidyamānasya kim ayaṃ tumulo dhvaniḥ', null, 1023005),
('ramayana-1-23-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 6', 'राघवस्य वचः श्रुत्वा कौतूहल समन्वितम्।
कथयामास धर्मात्मा तस्य शब्दस्य निश्चयम्॥', 'rāghavasya vacaḥ śrutvā kautūhala samanvitam
kathayām āsa dharmātmā tasya śabdasya niścayam', null, 1023006),
('ramayana-1-23-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 7', 'कैलासपर्वते राम मनसा निर्मितं सरः।
ब्रह्मणा नरशार्दूल तेनेदं मानसं सरः॥', 'kailāsaparvate rāma manasā nirmitaṃ saraḥ
brahmaṇā naraśārdūla tenedaṃ mānasaṃ saraḥ', null, 1023007),
('ramayana-1-23-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 8', 'तस्मात्सुस्राव सरसः सायोध्यामुपगूहते।
सरःप्रवृत्ता सरयूः पुण्या ब्रह्मसरश्च्युता॥', 'tasmāt susrāva sarasaḥ sāyodhyām upagūhate
saraḥpravṛttā sarayūḥ puṇyā brahmasaraścyutā', null, 1023008),
('ramayana-1-23-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 9', 'तस्यायमतुलः शब्दो जाह्नवीमभिवर्तते।
वारिसंक्षोभजो राम प्रणामं नियतः कुरु॥', 'tasyāyam atulaḥ śabdo jāhnavīm abhivartate
vārisaṃkṣobhajo rāma praṇāmaṃ niyataḥ kuru', null, 1023009),
('ramayana-1-23-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 10', 'ताभ्यां तु तावुभौ कृत्वा प्रणाममतिधार्मिकौ।
तीरं दक्षिणमासाद्य जग्मतुर्लघुविक्रमौ॥', 'tābhyāṃ tu tāv ubhau kṛtvā praṇāmam atidhārmikau
tīraṃ dakṣiṇam āsādya jagmatur laghuvikramau', null, 1023010),
('ramayana-1-23-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 11', 'स वनं घोरसंकाशं दृष्ट्वा नृपवरात्मजः।
अविप्रहतमैक्ष्वाकः पप्रच्छ मुनिपुंगवम्॥', 'sa vanaṃ ghorasaṃkāśaṃ dṛṣṭvā nṛpavarātmajaḥ
aviprahatam aikṣvākaḥ papraccha munipuṃgavam', null, 1023011),
('ramayana-1-23-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 12', 'अहो वनमिदं दुर्गं झिल्लिकागणनादितम्।
भैरवैः श्वापदैः कीर्णं शकुन्तैर्दारुणारुतैः॥', 'aho vanam idaṃ durgaṃ jhillikāgaṇanāditam
bhairavaiḥ śvāpadaiḥ kīrṇaṃ śakuntair dāruṇārutaiḥ', null, 1023012),
('ramayana-1-23-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 13', 'नानाप्रकारैः शकुनैर्वाश्यद्भिर्भैरवस्वनैः।
सिंहव्याघ्रवराहैश्च वारणैश्चापि शोभितम्॥', 'nānāprakāraiḥ śakunair vāśyadbhir bhairavasvanaiḥ
siṃhavyāghravarāhaiś ca vāraṇaiś cāpi śobhitam', null, 1023013),
('ramayana-1-23-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 14', 'धवाश्वकर्णककुभैर्बिल्वतिन्दुकपाटलैः।
संकीर्णं बदरीभिश्च किं न्विदं दारुणं वनम्॥', 'dhavāśvakarṇakakubhair bilvatindukapāṭalaiḥ
saṃkīrṇaṃ badarībhiś ca kiṃ nv idaṃ dāruṇaṃ vanam', null, 1023014),
('ramayana-1-23-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 15', 'तमुवाच महातेजा विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
श्रूयतां वत्स काकुत्स्थ यस्यैतद्दारुणं वनम्॥', 'tam uvāca mahātejā viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
śrūyatāṃ vatsa kākutstha yasyaitad dāruṇaṃ vanam', null, 1023015),
('ramayana-1-23-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 16', 'एतौ जनपदौ स्फीतौ पूर्वमास्तां नरोत्तम।
मलदाश्च करूषाश्च देवनिर्माण निर्मितौ॥', 'etau janapadau sphītau pūrvam āstāṃ narottama
maladāś ca karūṣāś ca devanirmāṇa nirmitau', null, 1023016),
('ramayana-1-23-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 17', 'पुरा वृत्रवधे राम मलेन समभिप्लुतम्।
क्षुधा चैव सहस्राक्षं ब्रह्महत्या यदाविशत्॥', 'purā vṛtravadhe rāma malena samabhiplutam
kṣudhā caiva sahasrākṣaṃ brahmahatyā yadāviśat', null, 1023017),
('ramayana-1-23-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 18', 'तमिन्द्रं स्नापयन्देवा ऋषयश्च तपोधनाः।
कलशैः स्नापयामासुर्मलं चास्य प्रमोचयन्॥', 'tam indraṃ snāpayan devā ṛṣayaś ca tapodhanāḥ
kalaśaiḥ snāpayām āsur malaṃ cāsya pramocayan', null, 1023018),
('ramayana-1-23-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 19', 'इह भूम्यां मलं दत्त्वा दत्त्वा कारुषमेव च।
शरीरजं महेन्द्रस्य ततो हर्षं प्रपेदिरे॥', 'iha bhūmyāṃ malaṃ dattvā dattvā kāruṣam eva ca
śarīrajaṃ mahendrasya tato harṣaṃ prapedire', null, 1023019),
('ramayana-1-23-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 20', 'निर्मलो निष्करूषश्च शुचिरिन्द्रो यदाभवत्।
ददौ देशस्य सुप्रीतो वरं प्रभुरनुत्तमम्॥', 'nirmalo niṣkarūṣaś ca śucir indro yadābhavat
dadau deśasya suprīto varaṃ prabhur anuttamam', null, 1023020),
('ramayana-1-23-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 21', 'इमौ जनपदौ स्थीतौ ख्यातिं लोके गमिष्यतः।
मलदाश्च करूषाश्च ममाङ्गमलधारिणौ॥', 'imau janapadau sthītau khyātiṃ loke gamiṣyataḥ
maladāś ca karūṣāś ca mamāṅgamaladhāriṇau', null, 1023021),
('ramayana-1-23-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 22', 'साधु साध्विति तं देवाः पाकशासनमब्रुवन्।
देशस्य पूजां तां दृष्ट्वा कृतां शक्रेण धीमता॥', 'sādhu sādhv iti taṃ devāḥ pākaśāsanam abruvan
deśasya pūjāṃ tāṃ dṛṣṭvā kṛtāṃ śakreṇa dhīmatā', null, 1023022),
('ramayana-1-23-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 23', 'एतौ जनपदौ स्थीतौ दीर्घकालमरिंदम।
मलदाश्च करूषाश्च मुदितौ धनधान्यतः॥', 'etau janapadau sthītau dīrghakālam ariṃdama
maladāś ca karūṣāś ca muditau dhanadhānyataḥ', null, 1023023),
('ramayana-1-23-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 24', 'कस्य चित्त्वथ कालस्य यक्षी वै कामरूपिणी।
बलं नागसहस्रस्य धारयन्ती तदा ह्यभूत्॥', 'kasya cit tv atha kālasya yakṣī vai kāmarūpiṇī
balaṃ nāgasahasrasya dhārayantī tadā hy abhūt', null, 1023024),
('ramayana-1-23-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 25', 'ताटका नाम भद्रं ते भार्या सुन्दस्य धीमतः।
मारीचो राक्षसः पुत्रो यस्याः शक्रपराक्रमः॥', 'tāṭakā nāma bhadraṃ te bhāryā sundasya dhīmataḥ
mārīco rākṣasaḥ putro yasyāḥ śakraparākramaḥ', null, 1023025),
('ramayana-1-23-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 26', 'इमौ जनपदौ नित्यं विनाशयति राघव।
मलदांश्च करूषांश्च ताटका दुष्टचारिणी॥', 'imau janapadau nityaṃ vināśayati rāghava
maladāṃś ca karūṣāṃś ca tāṭakā duṣṭacāriṇī', null, 1023026),
('ramayana-1-23-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 27', 'सेयं पन्थानमावार्य वसत्यत्यर्धयोजने।
अत एव च गन्तव्यं ताटकाया वनं यतः॥', 'seyaṃ panthānam āvārya vasaty atyardhayojane
ata eva ca gantavyaṃ tāṭakāyā vanaṃ yataḥ', null, 1023027),
('ramayana-1-23-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 28', 'स्वबाहुबलमाश्रित्य जहीमां दुष्टचारिणीम्।
मन्नियोगादिमं देशं कुरु निष्कण्टकं पुनः॥', 'svabāhubalam āśritya jahīmāṃ duṣṭacāriṇīm
manniyogād imaṃ deśaṃ kuru niṣkaṇṭakaṃ punaḥ', null, 1023028),
('ramayana-1-23-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 29', 'न हि कश्चिदिमं देशं शक्रोत्यागन्तुमीदृशम्।
यक्षिण्या घोरया राम उत्सादितमसह्यया॥', 'na hi kaś cid imaṃ deśaṃ śakroty āgantum īdṛśam
yakṣiṇyā ghorayā rāma utsāditam asahyayā', null, 1023029),
('ramayana-1-23-30', 30, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 23, Verse 30', 'एतत्ते सर्वमाख्यातं यथैतद्दरुणं वनम्।
यक्ष्या चोत्सादितं सर्वमद्यापि न निवर्तते॥', 'etat te sarvam ākhyātaṃ yathaitad daruṇaṃ vanam
yakṣyā cotsāditaṃ sarvam adyāpi na nivartate', null, 1023030)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 24 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-24-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 1', 'अथ तस्याप्रमेयस्य मुनेर्वचनमुत्तमम्।
श्रुत्वा पुरुषशार्दूलः प्रत्युवाच शुभां गिरम्॥', 'atha tasyāprameyasya muner vacanam uttamam
śrutvā puruṣaśārdūlaḥ pratyuvāca śubhāṃ giram', null, 1024001),
('ramayana-1-24-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 2', 'अल्पवीर्या यदा यक्षाः श्रूयन्ते मुनिपुंगव।
कथं नागसहस्रस्य धारयत्यबला बलम्॥', 'alpavīryā yadā yakṣāḥ śrūyante munipuṃgava
kathaṃ nāgasahasrasya dhārayaty abalā balam', null, 1024002),
('ramayana-1-24-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 3', 'विश्वामित्रोऽब्रवीद्वाक्यं शृणु येन बलोत्तरा।
वरदानकृतं वीर्यं धारयत्यबला बलम्॥', 'viśvāmitro ''bravīd vākyaṃ śṛṇu yena balottarā
varadānakṛtaṃ vīryaṃ dhārayaty abalā balam', null, 1024003),
('ramayana-1-24-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 4', 'पूर्वमासीन्महायक्षः सुकेतुर्नाम वीर्यवान्।
अनपत्यः शुभाचारः स च तेपे महत्तपः॥', 'pūrvam āsīn mahāyakṣaḥ suketur nāma vīryavān
anapatyaḥ śubhācāraḥ sa ca tepe mahat tapaḥ', null, 1024004),
('ramayana-1-24-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 5', 'पितामहस्तु सुप्रीतस्तस्य यक्षपतेस्तदा।
कन्यारत्नं ददौ राम ताटकां नाम नामतः॥', 'pitāmahas tu suprītas tasya yakṣapates tadā
kanyāratnaṃ dadau rāma tāṭakāṃ nāma nāmataḥ', null, 1024005),
('ramayana-1-24-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 6', 'ददौ नागसहस्रस्य बलं चास्याः पितामहः।
न त्वेव पुत्रं यक्षाय ददौ ब्रह्मा महायशाः॥', 'dadau nāgasahasrasya balaṃ cāsyāḥ pitāmahaḥ
na tv eva putraṃ yakṣāya dadau brahmā mahāyaśāḥ', null, 1024006),
('ramayana-1-24-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 7', 'तां तु जातां विवर्धन्तीं रूपयौवनशालिनीम्।
जम्भपुत्राय सुन्दाय ददौ भार्यां यशस्विनीम्॥', 'tāṃ tu jātāṃ vivardhantīṃ rūpayauvanaśālinīm
jambhaputrāya sundāya dadau bhāryāṃ yaśasvinīm', null, 1024007),
('ramayana-1-24-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 8', 'कस्य चित्त्वथ कालल्स्य यक्षी पुत्रं व्यजायत।
मारीचं नाम दुर्धर्षं यः शापाद्राक्षसोऽभवत्॥', 'kasya cit tv atha kālalsya yakṣī putraṃ vyajāyata
mārīcaṃ nāma durdharṣaṃ yaḥ śāpād rākṣaso ''bhavat', null, 1024008),
('ramayana-1-24-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 9', 'सुन्दे तु निहते राम अगस्त्यमृषिसत्तमम्।
ताटका सह पुत्रेण प्रधर्षयितुमिच्छति॥', 'sunde tu nihate rāma agastyam ṛṣisattamam
tāṭakā saha putreṇa pradharṣayitum icchati', null, 1024009),
('ramayana-1-24-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 10', 'राक्षसत्वं भजस्वेति मारीचं व्याजहार सः।
अगस्त्यः परमक्रुद्धस्ताटकामपि शप्तवान्॥', 'rākṣasatvaṃ bhajasveti mārīcaṃ vyājahāra saḥ
agastyaḥ paramakruddhas tāṭakām api śaptavān', null, 1024010),
('ramayana-1-24-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 11', 'पुरुषादी महायक्षी विरूपा विकृतानना।
इदं रूपमपहाय दारुणं रूपमस्तु ते॥', 'puruṣādī mahāyakṣī virūpā vikṛtānanā
idaṃ rūpam apahāya dāruṇaṃ rūpam astu te', null, 1024011),
('ramayana-1-24-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 12', 'सैषा शापकृतामर्षा ताटका क्रोधमूर्छिता।
देशमुत्सादयत्येनमगस्त्यचरितं शुभम्॥', 'saiṣā śāpakṛtāmarṣā tāṭakā krodhamūrchitā
deśam utsādayaty enam agastyacaritaṃ śubham', null, 1024012),
('ramayana-1-24-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 13', 'एनां राघव दुर्वृत्तां यक्षीं परमदारुणाम्।
गोब्राह्मणहितार्थाय जहि दुष्टपराक्रमाम्॥', 'enāṃ rāghava durvṛttāṃ yakṣīṃ paramadāruṇām
gobrāhmaṇahitārthāya jahi duṣṭaparākramām', null, 1024013),
('ramayana-1-24-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 14', 'न ह्येनां शापसंसृष्टां कश्चिदुत्सहते पुमान्।
निहन्तुं त्रिषु लोकेषु त्वामृते रघुनन्दन॥', 'na hy enāṃ śāpasaṃsṛṣṭāṃ kaś cid utsahate pumān
nihantuṃ triṣu lokeṣu tvām ṛte raghunandana', null, 1024014),
('ramayana-1-24-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 15', 'न हि ते स्त्रीवधकृते घृणा कार्या नरोत्तम।
चातुर्वर्ण्यहितार्थाय कर्तव्यं राजसूनुना॥', 'na hi te strīvadhakṛte ghṛṇā kāryā narottama
cāturvarṇyahitārthāya kartavyaṃ rājasūnunā', null, 1024015),
('ramayana-1-24-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 16', 'राज्यभारनियुक्तानामेष धर्मः सनातनः।
अधर्म्यां जहि काकुत्स्थ धर्मो ह्यस्या न विद्यते॥', 'rājyabhāraniyuktānām eṣa dharmaḥ sanātanaḥ
adharmyāṃ jahi kākutstha dharmo hy asyā na vidyate', null, 1024016),
('ramayana-1-24-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 17', 'श्रूयते हि पुरा शक्रो विरोचनसुतां नृप।
पृथिवीं हन्तुमिच्छन्तीं मन्थरामभ्यसूदयत्॥', 'śrūyate hi purā śakro virocanasutāṃ nṛpa
pṛthivīṃ hantum icchantīṃ mantharām abhyasūdayat', null, 1024017),
('ramayana-1-24-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 18', 'विष्णुना च पुरा राम भृगुपत्नी दृढव्रता।
अनिन्द्रं लोकमिच्छन्ती काव्यमाता निषूदिता॥', 'viṣṇunā ca purā rāma bhṛgupatnī dṛḍhavratā
anindraṃ lokam icchantī kāvyamātā niṣūditā', null, 1024018),
('ramayana-1-24-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 24, Verse 19', 'एतैश्चान्यैश्च बहुभी राजपुत्रमहात्मभिः।
अधर्मनिरता नार्यो हताः पुरुषसत्तमैः॥', 'etaiś cānyaiś ca bahubhī rājaputramahātmabhiḥ
adharmaniratā nāryo hatāḥ puruṣasattamaiḥ', null, 1024019)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 25 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-25-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 1', 'मुनेर्वचनमक्लीबं श्रुत्वा नरवरात्मजः।
राघवः प्राञ्जलिर्भूत्वा प्रत्युवाच दृढव्रतः॥', 'muner vacanam aklībaṃ śrutvā naravarātmajaḥ
rāghavaḥ prāñjalir bhūtvā pratyuvāca dṛḍhavrataḥ', null, 1025001),
('ramayana-1-25-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 2', 'पितुर्वचननिर्देशात्पितुर्वचनगौरवात्।
वचनं कौशिकस्येति कर्तव्यमविशङ्कया॥', 'pitur vacananirdeśāt pitur vacanagauravāt
vacanaṃ kauśikasyeti kartavyam aviśaṅkayā', null, 1025002),
('ramayana-1-25-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 3', 'अनुशिष्टोऽस्म्ययोध्यायां गुरुमध्ये महात्मना।
पित्रा दशरथेनाहं नावज्ञेयं च तद्वचः॥', 'anuśiṣṭo ''smy ayodhyāyāṃ gurumadhye mahātmanā
pitrā daśarathenāhaṃ nāvajñeyaṃ ca tad vacaḥ', null, 1025003),
('ramayana-1-25-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 4', 'सोऽहं पितुर्वचः श्रुत्वा शासनाद्ब्रह्म वादिनः।
करिष्यामि न संदेहस्ताटकावधमुत्तमम्॥', 'so ''haṃ pitur vacaḥ śrutvā śāsanād brahma vādinaḥ
kariṣyāmi na saṃdehas tāṭakāvadham uttamam', null, 1025004),
('ramayana-1-25-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 5', 'गोब्राह्मणहितार्थाय देशस्यास्य सुखाय च।
तव चैवाप्रमेयस्य वचनं कर्तुमुद्यतः॥', 'gobrāhmaṇahitārthāya deśasyāsya sukhāya ca
tava caivāprameyasya vacanaṃ kartum udyataḥ', null, 1025005),
('ramayana-1-25-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 6', 'एवमुक्त्वा धनुर्मध्ये बद्ध्वा मुष्टिमरिंदमः।
ज्याशब्दमकरोत्तीव्रं दिशः शब्देन पूरयन्॥', 'evam uktvā dhanurmadhye baddhvā muṣṭim ariṃdamaḥ
jyāśabdam akarot tīvraṃ diśaḥ śabdena pūrayan', null, 1025006),
('ramayana-1-25-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 7', 'तेन शब्देन वित्रस्तास्ताटका वनवासिनः।
ताटका च सुसंक्रुद्धा तेन शब्देन मोहिता॥', 'tena śabdena vitrastās tāṭakā vanavāsinaḥ
tāṭakā ca susaṃkruddhā tena śabdena mohitā', null, 1025007),
('ramayana-1-25-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 8', 'तं शब्दमभिनिध्याय राक्षसी क्रोधमूर्छिता।
श्रुत्वा चाभ्यद्रवद्वेगाद्यतः शब्दो विनिःसृतः॥', 'taṃ śabdam abhinidhyāya rākṣasī krodhamūrchitā
śrutvā cābhyadravad vegād yataḥ śabdo viniḥsṛtaḥ', null, 1025008),
('ramayana-1-25-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 9', 'तां दृष्ट्वा राघवः क्रुद्धां विकृतां विकृताननाम्।
प्रमाणेनातिवृद्धां च लक्ष्मणं सोऽभ्यभाषत॥', 'tāṃ dṛṣṭvā rāghavaḥ kruddhāṃ vikṛtāṃ vikṛtānanām
pramāṇenātivṛddhāṃ ca lakṣmaṇaṃ so ''bhyabhāṣata', null, 1025009),
('ramayana-1-25-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 10', 'पश्य लक्ष्मण यक्षिण्या भैरवं दारुणं वपुः।
भिद्येरन्दर्शनादस्या भीरूणां हृदयानि च॥', 'paśya lakṣmaṇa yakṣiṇyā bhairavaṃ dāruṇaṃ vapuḥ
bhidyeran darśanād asyā bhīrūṇāṃ hṛdayāni ca', null, 1025010),
('ramayana-1-25-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 11', 'एनां पश्य दुराधर्षां माया बलसमन्विताम्।
विनिवृत्तां करोम्यद्य हृतकर्णाग्रनासिकाम्॥', 'enāṃ paśya durādharṣāṃ māyā balasamanvitām
vinivṛttāṃ karomy adya hṛtakarṇāgranāsikām', null, 1025011),
('ramayana-1-25-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 12', 'न ह्येनामुत्सहे हन्तुं स्त्रीस्वभावेन रक्षिताम्।
वीर्यं चास्या गतिं चापि हनिष्यामीति मे मतिः॥', 'na hy enām utsahe hantuṃ strīsvabhāvena rakṣitām
vīryaṃ cāsyā gatiṃ cāpi haniṣyāmīti me matiḥ', null, 1025012),
('ramayana-1-25-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 13', 'एवं ब्रुवाणे रामे तु ताटका क्रोधमूर्छिता।
उद्यम्य बाहू गर्जन्ती राममेवाभ्यधावत॥', 'evaṃ bruvāṇe rāme tu tāṭakā krodhamūrchitā
udyamya bāhū garjantī rāmam evābhyadhāvata', null, 1025013),
('ramayana-1-25-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 14', 'तामापतन्तीं वेगेन विक्रान्तामशनीमिव।
शरेणोरसि विव्याध सा पपात ममार च॥', 'tām āpatantīṃ vegena vikrāntām aśanīm iva
śareṇorasi vivyādha sā papāta mamāra ca', null, 1025014),
('ramayana-1-25-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 15', 'तां हतां भीमसंकाशां दृष्ट्वा सुरपतिस्तदा।
साधु साध्विति काकुत्स्थं सुराश्च समपूजयन्॥', 'tāṃ hatāṃ bhīmasaṃkāśāṃ dṛṣṭvā surapatis tadā
sādhu sādhv iti kākutsthaṃ surāś ca samapūjayan', null, 1025015),
('ramayana-1-25-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 16', 'उवाच परमप्रीतः सहस्राक्षः पुरंदरः।
सुराश्च सर्वे संहृष्टा विश्वामित्रमथाब्रुवन्॥', 'uvāca paramaprītaḥ sahasrākṣaḥ puraṃdaraḥ
surāś ca sarve saṃhṛṣṭā viśvāmitram athābruvan', null, 1025016),
('ramayana-1-25-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 17', 'मुने कौशिके भद्रं ते सेन्द्राः सर्वे मरुद्गणाः।
तोषिताः कर्मणानेन स्नेहं दर्शय राघवे॥', 'mune kauśike bhadraṃ te sendrāḥ sarve marudgaṇāḥ
toṣitāḥ karmaṇānena snehaṃ darśaya rāghave', null, 1025017),
('ramayana-1-25-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 18', 'प्रजापतेर्कृशाश्वस्य पुत्रान्सत्यपराक्रमान्।
तपोबलभृतान्ब्रह्मन्राघवाय निवेदय॥', 'prajāpater kṛśāśvasya putrān satyaparākramān
tapobalabhṛtān brahman rāghavāya nivedaya', null, 1025018),
('ramayana-1-25-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 19', 'पात्रभूतश्च ते ब्रह्मंस्तवानुगमने धृतः।
कर्तव्यं च महत्कर्म सुराणां राजसूनुना॥', 'pātrabhūtaś ca te brahmaṃs tavānugamane dhṛtaḥ
kartavyaṃ ca mahat karma surāṇāṃ rājasūnunā', null, 1025019),
('ramayana-1-25-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 20', 'एवमुक्त्वा सुराः सर्वे हृष्टा जग्मुर्यथागतम्।
विश्वामित्रं पूजयित्वा ततः संध्या प्रवर्तते॥', 'evam uktvā surāḥ sarve hṛṣṭā jagmur yathāgatam
viśvāmitraṃ pūjayitvā tataḥ saṃdhyā pravartate', null, 1025020),
('ramayana-1-25-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 21', 'ततो मुनिवरः प्रीतिस्ताटका वधतोषितः।
मूर्ध्नि राममुपाघ्राय इदं वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'tato munivaraḥ prītis tāṭakā vadhatoṣitaḥ
mūrdhni rāmam upāghrāya idaṃ vacanam abravīt', null, 1025021),
('ramayana-1-25-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 25, Verse 22', 'इहाद्य रजनीं राम वसेम शुभदर्शन।
श्वः प्रभाते गमिष्यामस्तदाश्रमपदं मम॥', 'ihādya rajanīṃ rāma vasema śubhadarśana
śvaḥ prabhāte gamiṣyāmas tad āśramapadaṃ mama', null, 1025022)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 26 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-26-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 1', 'अथ तां रजनीमुष्य विश्वामिरो महायशाः।
प्रहस्य राघवं वाक्यमुवाच मधुराक्षरम्॥', 'atha tāṃ rajanīm uṣya viśvāmiro mahāyaśāḥ
prahasya rāghavaṃ vākyam uvāca madhurākṣaram', null, 1026001),
('ramayana-1-26-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 2', 'पतितुष्टोऽस्मि भद्रं ते राजपुत्र महायशः।
प्रीत्या परमया युक्तो ददाम्यस्त्राणि सर्वशः॥', 'patituṣṭo ''smi bhadraṃ te rājaputra mahāyaśaḥ
prītyā paramayā yukto dadāmy astrāṇi sarvaśaḥ', null, 1026002),
('ramayana-1-26-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 3', 'देवासुरगणान्वापि सगन्धर्वोरगानपि।
यैरमित्रान्प्रसह्याजौ वशीकृत्य जयिष्यसि॥', 'devāsuragaṇān vāpi sagandharvoragān api
yair amitrān prasahyājau vaśīkṛtya jayiṣyasi', null, 1026003),
('ramayana-1-26-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 4', 'तानि दिव्यानि भद्रं ते ददाम्यस्त्राणि सर्वशः।
दण्डचक्रं महद्दिव्यं तव दास्यामि राघव॥', 'tāni divyāni bhadraṃ te dadāmy astrāṇi sarvaśaḥ
daṇḍacakraṃ mahad divyaṃ tava dāsyāmi rāghava', null, 1026004),
('ramayana-1-26-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 5', 'धर्मचक्रं ततो वीर कालचक्रं तथैव च।
विष्णुचक्रं तथात्युग्रमैन्द्रं चक्रं तथैव च॥', 'dharmacakraṃ tato vīra kālacakraṃ tathaiva ca
viṣṇucakraṃ tathātyugram aindraṃ cakraṃ tathaiva ca', null, 1026005),
('ramayana-1-26-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 6', 'वज्रमस्त्रं नरश्रेष्ठ शैवं शूलवरं तथा।
अस्त्रं ब्रह्मशिरश्चैव ऐषीकमपि राघव।
ददामि ते महाबाहो ब्राह्ममस्त्रमनुत्तमम्॥', 'vajram astraṃ naraśreṣṭha śaivaṃ śūlavaraṃ tathā
astraṃ brahmaśiraś caiva aiṣīkam api rāghava
dadāmi te mahābāho brāhmam astram anuttamam', null, 1026006),
('ramayana-1-26-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 7', 'गदे द्वे चैव काकुत्स्थ मोदकी शिखरी उभे।
प्रदीप्ते नरशार्दूल प्रयच्छामि नृपात्मज॥', 'gade dve caiva kākutstha modakī śikharī ubhe
pradīpte naraśārdūla prayacchāmi nṛpātmaja', null, 1026007),
('ramayana-1-26-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 8', 'धर्मपाशमहं राम कालपाशं तथैव च।
वारुणं पाशमस्त्रं च ददान्यहमनुत्तमम्॥', 'dharmapāśam ahaṃ rāma kālapāśaṃ tathaiva ca
vāruṇaṃ pāśam astraṃ ca dadāny aham anuttamam', null, 1026008),
('ramayana-1-26-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 9', 'अशनी द्वे प्रयच्छामि शुष्कार्द्रे रघुनन्दन॥', 'aśanī dve prayacchāmi śuṣkārdre raghunandana', null, 1026009),
('ramayana-1-26-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 10', 'ददामि चास्त्रं पैनाकमस्त्रं नारायणं तथा।
आग्नेयमस्त्र दयितं शिखरं नाम नामतः॥', 'dadāmi cāstraṃ painākam astraṃ nārāyaṇaṃ tathā
āgneyam astra dayitaṃ śikharaṃ nāma nāmataḥ', null, 1026010),
('ramayana-1-26-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 11', 'वायव्यं प्रथमं नाम ददामि तव राघव।
अस्त्रं हयशिरो नाम क्रौञ्चमस्त्रं तथैव च॥', 'vāyavyaṃ prathamaṃ nāma dadāmi tava rāghava
astraṃ hayaśiro nāma krauñcam astraṃ tathaiva ca', null, 1026011),
('ramayana-1-26-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 12', 'शक्ति द्वयं च काकुत्स्थ ददामि तव चानघ।
कङ्कालं मुसलं घोरं कापालमथ कङ्कणम्॥', 'śakti dvayaṃ ca kākutstha dadāmi tava cānagha
kaṅkālaṃ musalaṃ ghoraṃ kāpālam atha kaṅkaṇam', null, 1026012),
('ramayana-1-26-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 13', 'धारयन्त्यसुरा यानि ददाम्येतानि सर्वशः।
वैद्याधरं महास्त्रं च नन्दनं नाम नामतः॥', 'dhārayanty asurā yāni dadāmy etāni sarvaśaḥ
vaidyādharaṃ mahāstraṃ ca nandanaṃ nāma nāmataḥ', null, 1026013),
('ramayana-1-26-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 14', 'असिरत्नं महाबाहो ददामि नृवरात्मज।
गान्धर्वमस्त्रं दयितं मानवं नाम नामतः॥', 'asiratnaṃ mahābāho dadāmi nṛvarātmaja
gāndharvam astraṃ dayitaṃ mānavaṃ nāma nāmataḥ', null, 1026014),
('ramayana-1-26-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 15', 'प्रस्वापनप्रशमने दद्मि सौरं च राघव।
दर्पणं शोषणं चैव संतापनविलापने॥', 'prasvāpanapraśamane dadmi sauraṃ ca rāghava
darpaṇaṃ śoṣaṇaṃ caiva saṃtāpanavilāpane', null, 1026015),
('ramayana-1-26-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 16', 'मदनं चैव दुर्धर्षं कन्दर्पदयितं तथा।
पैशाचमस्त्रं दयितं मोहनं नाम नामतः।
प्रतीच्छ नरशार्दूल राजपुत्र महायशः॥', 'madanaṃ caiva durdharṣaṃ kandarpadayitaṃ tathā
paiśācam astraṃ dayitaṃ mohanaṃ nāma nāmataḥ
pratīccha naraśārdūla rājaputra mahāyaśaḥ', null, 1026016),
('ramayana-1-26-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 17', 'तामसं नरशार्दूल सौमनं च महाबलम्।
संवर्तं चैव दुर्धर्षं मौसलं च नृपात्मज॥', 'tāmasaṃ naraśārdūla saumanaṃ ca mahābalam
saṃvartaṃ caiva durdharṣaṃ mausalaṃ ca nṛpātmaja', null, 1026017),
('ramayana-1-26-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 18', 'सत्यमस्त्रं महाबाहो तथा मायाधरं परम्।
घोरं तेजःप्रभं नाम परतेजोऽपकर्षणम्॥', 'satyam astraṃ mahābāho tathā māyādharaṃ param
ghoraṃ tejaḥprabhaṃ nāma paratejo''pakarṣaṇam', null, 1026018),
('ramayana-1-26-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 19', 'सोमास्त्रं शिशिरं नाम त्वाष्ट्रमस्त्रं सुदामनम्।
दारुणं च भगस्यापि शीतेषुमथ मानवम्॥', 'somāstraṃ śiśiraṃ nāma tvāṣṭram astraṃ sudāmanam
dāruṇaṃ ca bhagasyāpi śīteṣum atha mānavam', null, 1026019),
('ramayana-1-26-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 20', 'एतान्नाम महाबाहो कामरूपान्महाबलान्।
गृहाण परमोदारान्क्षिप्रमेव नृपात्मज॥', 'etān nāma mahābāho kāmarūpān mahābalān
gṛhāṇa paramodārān kṣipram eva nṛpātmaja', null, 1026020),
('ramayana-1-26-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 21', 'स्थितस्तु प्राङ्मुखो भूत्वा शुचिर्निवरतस्तदा।
ददौ रामाय सुप्रीतो मन्त्रग्राममनुत्तमम्॥', 'sthitas tu prāṅmukho bhūtvā śucir nivaratas tadā
dadau rāmāya suprīto mantragrāmam anuttamam', null, 1026021),
('ramayana-1-26-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 22', 'जपतस्तु मुनेस्तस्य विश्वामित्रस्य धीमतः।
उपतस्थुर्महार्हाणि सर्वाण्यस्त्राणि राघवम्॥', 'japatas tu munes tasya viśvāmitrasya dhīmataḥ
upatasthur mahārhāṇi sarvāṇy astrāṇi rāghavam', null, 1026022),
('ramayana-1-26-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 23', 'ऊचुश्च मुदिता रामं सर्वे प्राञ्जलयस्तदा।
इमे स्म परमोदार किंकरास्तव राघव॥', 'ūcuś ca muditā rāmaṃ sarve prāñjalayas tadā
ime sma paramodāra kiṃkarās tava rāghava', null, 1026023),
('ramayana-1-26-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 24', 'प्रतिगृह्य च काकुत्स्थः समालभ्य च पाणिना।
मनसा मे भविष्यध्वमिति तान्यभ्यचोदयत्॥', 'pratigṛhya ca kākutsthaḥ samālabhya ca pāṇinā
manasā me bhaviṣyadhvam iti tāny abhyacodayat', null, 1026024),
('ramayana-1-26-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 26, Verse 25', 'ततः प्रीतमना रामो विश्वामित्रं महामुनिम्।
अभिवाद्य महातेजा गमनायोपचक्रमे॥', 'tataḥ prītamanā rāmo viśvāmitraṃ mahāmunim
abhivādya mahātejā gamanāyopacakrame', null, 1026025)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 27 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-27-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 1', 'प्रतिगृह्य ततोऽस्त्राणि प्रहृष्टवदनः शुचिः।
गच्छन्नेव च काकुत्स्थो विश्वामित्रमथाब्रवीत्॥', 'pratigṛhya tato ''strāṇi prahṛṣṭavadanaḥ śuciḥ
gacchann eva ca kākutstho viśvāmitram athābravīt', null, 1027001),
('ramayana-1-27-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 2', 'गृहीतास्त्रोऽस्मि भगवन्दुराधर्षः सुरैरपि।
अस्त्राणां त्वहमिच्छामि संहारं मुनिपुंगव॥', 'gṛhītāstro ''smi bhagavan durādharṣaḥ surair api
astrāṇāṃ tv aham icchāmi saṃhāraṃ munipuṃgava', null, 1027002),
('ramayana-1-27-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 3', 'एवं ब्रुवति काकुत्स्थे विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
संहारं व्याजहाराथ धृतिमान्सुव्रतः शुचिः॥', 'evaṃ bruvati kākutsthe viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
saṃhāraṃ vyājahārātha dhṛtimān suvrataḥ śuciḥ', null, 1027003),
('ramayana-1-27-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 4', 'सत्यवन्तं सत्यकीर्तिं धृष्टं रभसमेव च।
प्रतिहारतरं नाम पराङ्मुखमवाङ्मुखम्॥', 'satyavantaṃ satyakīrtiṃ dhṛṣṭaṃ rabhasam eva ca
pratihārataraṃ nāma parāṅmukham avāṅmukham', null, 1027004),
('ramayana-1-27-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 5', 'लक्षाक्षविषमौ चैव दृढनाभसुनाभकौ।
दशाक्षशतवक्त्रौ च दशशीर्षशतोदरौ॥', 'lakṣākṣaviṣamau caiva dṛḍhanābhasunābhakau
daśākṣaśatavaktrau ca daśaśīrṣaśatodarau', null, 1027005),
('ramayana-1-27-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 6', 'पद्मनाभमहानाभौ दुन्दुनाभसुनाभकौ।
ज्योतिषं कृशनं चैव नैराश्य विमलावुभौ॥', 'padmanābhamahānābhau dundunābhasunābhakau
jyotiṣaṃ kṛśanaṃ caiva nairāśya vimalāv ubhau', null, 1027006),
('ramayana-1-27-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 7', 'यौगन्धरहरिद्रौ च दैत्यप्रमथनौ तथा।
पित्र्यं सौमनसं चैव विधूतमकरावुभौ॥', 'yaugandharaharidrau ca daityapramathanau tathā
pitryaṃ saumanasaṃ caiva vidhūtamakarāv ubhau', null, 1027007),
('ramayana-1-27-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 8', 'करवीरकरं चैव धनधान्यौ च राघव।
कामरूपं कामरुचिं मोहमावरणं तथा॥', 'karavīrakaraṃ caiva dhanadhānyau ca rāghava
kāmarūpaṃ kāmaruciṃ moham āvaraṇaṃ tathā', null, 1027008),
('ramayana-1-27-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 9', 'जृम्भकं सर्वनाभं च सन्तानवरणौ तथा।
कृशाश्वतनयान्राम भास्वरान्कामरूपिणः॥', 'jṛmbhakaṃ sarvanābhaṃ ca santānavaraṇau tathā
kṛśāśvatanayān rāma bhāsvarān kāmarūpiṇaḥ', null, 1027009),
('ramayana-1-27-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 10', 'प्रतीच्छ मम भद्रं ते पात्रभूतोऽसि राघव।
दिव्यभास्वरदेहाश्च मूर्तिमन्तः सुखप्रदाः॥', 'pratīccha mama bhadraṃ te pātrabhūto ''si rāghava
divyabhāsvaradehāś ca mūrtimantaḥ sukhapradāḥ', null, 1027010),
('ramayana-1-27-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 11', 'रामं प्राञ्जलयो भूत्वाब्रुवन्मधुरभाषिणः।
इमे स्म नरशार्दूल शाधि किं करवाम ते॥', 'rāmaṃ prāñjalayo bhūtvābruvan madhurabhāṣiṇaḥ
ime sma naraśārdūla śādhi kiṃ karavāma te', null, 1027011),
('ramayana-1-27-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 12', 'गम्यतामिति तानाह यथेष्टं रघुनन्दनः।
मानसाः कार्यकालेषु साहाय्यं मे करिष्यथ॥', 'gamyatām iti tān āha yatheṣṭaṃ raghunandanaḥ
mānasāḥ kāryakāleṣu sāhāyyaṃ me kariṣyatha', null, 1027012),
('ramayana-1-27-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 13', 'अथ ते राममामन्त्र्य कृत्वा चापि प्रदक्षिणम्।
एवमस्त्विति काकुत्स्थमुक्त्वा जग्मुर्यथागतम्॥', 'atha te rāmam āmantrya kṛtvā cāpi pradakṣiṇam
evam astv iti kākutstham uktvā jagmur yathāgatam', null, 1027013),
('ramayana-1-27-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 14', 'स च तान्राघवो ज्ञात्वा विश्वामित्रं महामुनिम्।
गच्छन्नेवाथ मधुरं श्लक्ष्णं वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'sa ca tān rāghavo jñātvā viśvāmitraṃ mahāmunim
gacchann evātha madhuraṃ ślakṣṇaṃ vacanam abravīt', null, 1027014),
('ramayana-1-27-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 15', 'किं न्वेतन्मेघसंकाशं पर्वतस्याविदूरतः।
वृक्षषण्डमितो भाति परं कौतूहलं हि मे॥', 'kiṃ nv etan meghasaṃkāśaṃ parvatasyāvidūrataḥ
vṛkṣaṣaṇḍam ito bhāti paraṃ kautūhalaṃ hi me', null, 1027015),
('ramayana-1-27-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 16', 'दर्शनीयं मृगाकीर्णं मनोहरमतीव च।
नानाप्रकारैः शकुनैर्वल्गुभाषैरलंकृतम्॥', 'darśanīyaṃ mṛgākīrṇaṃ manoharam atīva ca
nānāprakāraiḥ śakunair valgubhāṣair alaṃkṛtam', null, 1027016),
('ramayana-1-27-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 17', 'निःसृताः स्म मुनिश्रेष्ठ कान्ताराद्रोमहर्षणात्।
अनया त्ववगच्छामि देशस्य सुखवत्तया॥', 'niḥsṛtāḥ sma muniśreṣṭha kāntārād romaharṣaṇāt
anayā tv avagacchāmi deśasya sukhavattayā', null, 1027017),
('ramayana-1-27-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 27, Verse 18', 'सर्वं मे शंस भगवन्कस्याश्रमपदं त्विदम्।
संप्राप्ता यत्र ते पापा ब्रह्मघ्ना दुष्टचारिणः॥', 'sarvaṃ me śaṃsa bhagavan kasyāśramapadaṃ tv idam
saṃprāptā yatra te pāpā brahmaghnā duṣṭacāriṇaḥ', null, 1027018)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 28 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-28-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 1', 'अथ तस्याप्रमेयस्य तद्वनं परिपृच्छतः।
विश्वामित्रो महातेजा व्याख्यातुमुपचक्रमे॥', 'atha tasyāprameyasya tad vanaṃ paripṛcchataḥ
viśvāmitro mahātejā vyākhyātum upacakrame', null, 1028001),
('ramayana-1-28-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 2', 'एष पूर्वाश्रमो राम वामनस्य महात्मनः।
सिद्धाश्रम इति ख्यातः सिद्धो ह्यत्र महातपाः॥', 'eṣa pūrvāśramo rāma vāmanasya mahātmanaḥ
siddhāśrama iti khyātaḥ siddho hy atra mahātapāḥ', null, 1028002),
('ramayana-1-28-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 3', 'एतस्मिन्नेव काले तु राजा वैरोचनिर्बलिः।
निर्जित्य दैवतगणान्सेन्द्रांश्च समरुद्गणान्।
कारयामास तद्राज्यं त्रिषु लोकेषु विश्रुतः॥', 'etasminn eva kāle tu rājā vairocanir baliḥ
nirjitya daivatagaṇān sendrāṃś ca samarudgaṇān
kārayām āsa tad rājyaṃ triṣu lokeṣu viśrutaḥ', null, 1028003),
('ramayana-1-28-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 4', 'बलेस्तु यजमानस्य देवाः साग्निपुरोगमाः।
समागम्य स्वयं चैव विष्णुमूचुरिहाश्रमे॥', 'bales tu yajamānasya devāḥ sāgnipurogamāḥ
samāgamya svayaṃ caiva viṣṇum ūcur ihāśrame', null, 1028004),
('ramayana-1-28-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 5', 'बलिर्वैरोचनिर्विष्णो यजते यज्ञमुत्तमम्।
असमाप्ते क्रतौ तस्मिन्स्वकार्यमभिपद्यताम्॥', 'balir vairocanir viṣṇo yajate yajñam uttamam
asamāpte kratau tasmin svakāryam abhipadyatām', null, 1028005),
('ramayana-1-28-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 6', 'ये चैनमभिवर्तन्ते याचितार इतस्ततः।
यच्च यत्र यथावच्च सर्वं तेभ्यः प्रयच्छति॥', 'ye cainam abhivartante yācitāra itas tataḥ
yac ca yatra yathāvac ca sarvaṃ tebhyaḥ prayacchati', null, 1028006),
('ramayana-1-28-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 7', 'स त्वं सुरहितार्थाय मायायोगमुपाश्रितः।
वामनत्वं गतो विष्णो कुरु कल्याणमुत्तमम्॥', 'sa tvaṃ surahitārthāya māyāyogam upāśritaḥ
vāmanatvaṃ gato viṣṇo kuru kalyāṇam uttamam', null, 1028007),
('ramayana-1-28-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 8', 'अयं सिद्धाश्रमो नाम प्रसादात्ते भविष्यति।
सिद्धे कर्मणि देवेश उत्तिष्ठ भगवन्नितः॥', 'ayaṃ siddhāśramo nāma prasādāt te bhaviṣyati
siddhe karmaṇi deveśa uttiṣṭha bhagavann itaḥ', null, 1028008),
('ramayana-1-28-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 9', 'अथ विष्णुर्महातेजा अदित्यां समजायत।
वामनं रूपमास्थाय वैरोचनिमुपागमत्॥', 'atha viṣṇur mahātejā adityāṃ samajāyata
vāmanaṃ rūpam āsthāya vairocanim upāgamat', null, 1028009),
('ramayana-1-28-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 10', 'त्रीन्क्रमानथ भिक्षित्वा प्रतिगृह्य च मानतः।
आक्रम्य लोकांल्लोकात्मा सर्वभूतहिते रतः॥', 'trīn kramān atha bhikṣitvā pratigṛhya ca mānataḥ
ākramya lokāṃl lokātmā sarvabhūtahite rataḥ', null, 1028010),
('ramayana-1-28-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 11', 'महेन्द्राय पुनः प्रादान्नियम्य बलिमोजसा।
त्रैलोक्यं स महातेजाश्चक्रे शक्रवशं पुनः॥', 'mahendrāya punaḥ prādān niyamya balim ojasā
trailokyaṃ sa mahātejāś cakre śakravaśaṃ punaḥ', null, 1028011),
('ramayana-1-28-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 12', 'तेनैष पूर्वमाक्रान्त आश्रमः श्रमनाशनः।
मयापि भक्त्या तस्यैष वामनस्योपभुज्यते॥', 'tenaiṣa pūrvam ākrānta āśramaḥ śramanāśanaḥ
mayāpi bhaktyā tasyaiṣa vāmanasyopabhujyate', null, 1028012),
('ramayana-1-28-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 13', 'एतमाश्रममायान्ति राक्षसा विघ्नकारिणः।
अत्र ते पुरुषव्याघ्र हन्तव्या दुष्टचारिणः॥', 'etam āśramam āyānti rākṣasā vighnakāriṇaḥ
atra te puruṣavyāghra hantavyā duṣṭacāriṇaḥ', null, 1028013),
('ramayana-1-28-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 14', 'अद्य गच्छामहे राम सिद्धाश्रममनुत्तमम्।
तदाश्रमपदं तात तवाप्येतद्यथा मम॥', 'adya gacchāmahe rāma siddhāśramam anuttamam
tad āśramapadaṃ tāta tavāpy etad yathā mama', null, 1028014),
('ramayana-1-28-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 15', 'तं दृष्ट्वा मुनयः सर्वे सिद्धाश्रमनिवासिनः।
उत्पत्योत्पत्य सहसा विश्वामित्रमपूजयन्॥', 'taṃ dṛṣṭvā munayaḥ sarve siddhāśramanivāsinaḥ
utpatyotpatya sahasā viśvāmitram apūjayan', null, 1028015),
('ramayana-1-28-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 16', 'यथार्हं चक्रिरे पूजां विश्वामित्राय धीमते।
तथैव राजपुत्राभ्यामकुर्वन्नतिथिक्रियाम्॥', 'yathārhaṃ cakrire pūjāṃ viśvāmitrāya dhīmate
tathaiva rājaputrābhyām akurvann atithikriyām', null, 1028016),
('ramayana-1-28-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 17', 'मुहूर्तमथ विश्रान्तौ राजपुत्रावरिंदमौ।
प्राञ्जली मुनिशार्दूलमूचतू रघुनन्दनौ॥', 'muhūrtam atha viśrāntau rājaputrāv ariṃdamau
prāñjalī muniśārdūlam ūcatū raghunandanau', null, 1028017),
('ramayana-1-28-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 18', 'अद्यैव दीक्षां प्रविश भद्रं ते मुनिपुंगव।
सिद्धाश्रमोऽयं सिद्धः स्यात्सत्यमस्तु वचस्तव॥', 'adyaiva dīkṣāṃ praviśa bhadraṃ te munipuṃgava
siddhāśramo ''yaṃ siddhaḥ syāt satyam astu vacas tava', null, 1028018),
('ramayana-1-28-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 19', 'एवमुक्तो महातेजा विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
प्रविवेश तदा दीक्षां नियतो नियतेन्द्रियः॥', 'evam ukto mahātejā viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
praviveśa tadā dīkṣāṃ niyato niyatendriyaḥ', null, 1028019),
('ramayana-1-28-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 28, Verse 20', 'कुमारावपि तां रात्रिमुषित्वा सुसमाहितौ।
प्रभातकाले चोत्थाय विश्वामित्रमवन्दताम्॥', 'kumārāv api tāṃ rātrim uṣitvā susamāhitau
prabhātakāle cotthāya viśvāmitram avandatām', null, 1028020)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 29 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-29-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 1', 'अथ तौ देशकालज्ञौ राजपुत्रावरिंदमौ।
देशे काले च वाक्यज्ञावब्रूतां कौशिकं वचः॥', 'atha tau deśakālajñau rājaputrāv ariṃdamau
deśe kāle ca vākyajñāv abrūtāṃ kauśikaṃ vacaḥ', null, 1029001),
('ramayana-1-29-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 2', 'भगवञ्श्रोतुमिच्छावो यस्मिन्काले निशाचरौ।
संरक्षणीयौ तौ ब्रह्मन्नातिवर्तेत तत्क्षणम्॥', 'bhagavañ śrotum icchāvo yasmin kāle niśācarau
saṃrakṣaṇīyau tau brahman nātivarteta tatkṣaṇam', null, 1029002),
('ramayana-1-29-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 3', 'एवं ब्रुवाणौ काकुत्स्थौ त्वरमाणौ युयुत्सया।
सर्वे ते मुनयः प्रीताः प्रशशंसुर्नृपात्मजौ॥', 'evaṃ bruvāṇau kākutsthau tvaramāṇau yuyutsayā
sarve te munayaḥ prītāḥ praśaśaṃsur nṛpātmajau', null, 1029003),
('ramayana-1-29-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 4', 'अद्य प्रभृति षड्रात्रं रक्षतं राघवौ युवाम्।
दीक्षां गतो ह्येष मुनिर्मौनित्वं च गमिष्यति॥', 'adya prabhṛti ṣaḍrātraṃ rakṣataṃ rāghavau yuvām
dīkṣāṃ gato hy eṣa munir maunitvaṃ ca gamiṣyati', null, 1029004),
('ramayana-1-29-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 5', 'तौ तु तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा राजपुत्रौ यशस्विनौ।
अनिद्रौ षडहोरात्रं तपोवनमरक्षताम्॥', 'tau tu tad vacanaṃ śrutvā rājaputrau yaśasvinau
anidrau ṣaḍahorātraṃ tapovanam arakṣatām', null, 1029005),
('ramayana-1-29-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 6', 'उपासां चक्रतुर्वीरौ यत्तौ परमधन्विनौ।
ररक्षतुर्मुनिवरं विश्वामित्रमरिंदमौ॥', 'upāsāṃ cakratur vīrau yattau paramadhanvinau
rarakṣatur munivaraṃ viśvāmitram ariṃdamau', null, 1029006),
('ramayana-1-29-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 7', 'अथ काले गते तस्मिन्षष्ठेऽहनि समागते।
सौमित्रमब्रवीद्रामो यत्तो भव समाहितः॥', 'atha kāle gate tasmin ṣaṣṭhe ''hani samāgate
saumitram abravīd rāmo yatto bhava samāhitaḥ', null, 1029007),
('ramayana-1-29-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 8', 'रामस्यैवं ब्रुवाणस्य त्वरितस्य युयुत्सया।
प्रजज्वाल ततो वेदिः सोपाध्यायपुरोहिता॥', 'rāmasyaivaṃ bruvāṇasya tvaritasya yuyutsayā
prajajvāla tato vediḥ sopādhyāyapurohitā', null, 1029008),
('ramayana-1-29-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 9', 'मन्त्रवच्च यथान्यायं यज्ञोऽसौ संप्रवर्तते।
आकाशे च महाञ्शब्दः प्रादुरासीद्भयानकः॥', 'mantravac ca yathānyāyaṃ yajño ''sau saṃpravartate
ākāśe ca mahāñ śabdaḥ prādur āsīd bhayānakaḥ', null, 1029009),
('ramayana-1-29-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 10', 'आवार्य गगनं मेघो यथा प्रावृषि निर्गतः।
तथा मायां विकुर्वाणौ राक्षसावभ्यधावताम्॥', 'āvārya gaganaṃ megho yathā prāvṛṣi nirgataḥ
tathā māyāṃ vikurvāṇau rākṣasāv abhyadhāvatām', null, 1029010),
('ramayana-1-29-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 11', 'मारीचश्च सुबाहुश्च तयोरनुचरास्तथा।
आगम्य भीमसंकाशा रुधिरौघानवासृजन्॥', 'mārīcaś ca subāhuś ca tayor anucarās tathā
āgamya bhīmasaṃkāśā rudhiraughān avāsṛjan', null, 1029011),
('ramayana-1-29-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 12', 'तावापतन्तौ सहसा दृष्ट्वा राजीवलोचनः।
लक्ष्मणं त्वभिसंप्रेक्ष्य रामो वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'tāv āpatantau sahasā dṛṣṭvā rājīvalocanaḥ
lakṣmaṇaṃ tv abhisaṃprekṣya rāmo vacanam abravīt', null, 1029012),
('ramayana-1-29-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 13', 'पश्य लक्ष्मण दुर्वृत्तान्राक्षसान्पिशिताशनान्।
मानवास्त्रसमाधूताननिलेन यथाघनान्॥', 'paśya lakṣmaṇa durvṛttān rākṣasān piśitāśanān
mānavāstrasamādhūtān anilena yathāghanān', null, 1029013),
('ramayana-1-29-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 14', 'मानवं परमोदारमस्त्रं परमभास्वरम्।
चिक्षेप परमक्रुद्धो मारीचोरसि राघवः॥', 'mānavaṃ paramodāram astraṃ paramabhāsvaram
cikṣepa paramakruddho mārīcor asi rāghavaḥ', null, 1029014),
('ramayana-1-29-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 15', 'स तेन परमास्त्रेण मानवेन समाहितः।
संपूर्णं योजनशतं क्षिप्तः सागरसंप्लवे॥', 'sa tena paramāstreṇa mānavena samāhitaḥ
saṃpūrṇaṃ yojanaśataṃ kṣiptaḥ sāgarasaṃplave', null, 1029015),
('ramayana-1-29-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 16', 'विचेतनं विघूर्णन्तं शीतेषुबलपीडितम्।
निरस्तं दृश्य मारीचं रामो लक्ष्मणमब्रवीत्॥', 'vicetanaṃ vighūrṇantaṃ śīteṣubalapīḍitam
nirastaṃ dṛśya mārīcaṃ rāmo lakṣmaṇam abravīt', null, 1029016),
('ramayana-1-29-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 17', 'पश्य लक्ष्मण शीतेषुं मानवं धर्मसंहितम्।
मोहयित्वा नयत्येनं न च प्राणैर्वियुज्यते॥', 'paśya lakṣmaṇa śīteṣuṃ mānavaṃ dharmasaṃhitam
mohayitvā nayaty enaṃ na ca prāṇair viyujyate', null, 1029017),
('ramayana-1-29-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 18', 'इमानपि वधिष्यामि निर्घृणान्दुष्टचारिणः।
राक्षसान्पापकर्मस्थान्यज्ञघ्नान्रुधिराशनान्॥', 'imān api vadhiṣyāmi nirghṛṇān duṣṭacāriṇaḥ
rākṣasān pāpakarmasthān yajñaghnān rudhirāśanān', null, 1029018),
('ramayana-1-29-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 19', 'विगृह्य सुमहच्चास्त्रमाग्नेयं रघुनन्दनः।
सुबाहुरसि चिक्षेप स विद्धः प्रापतद्भुवि॥', 'vigṛhya sumahac cāstram āgneyaṃ raghunandanaḥ
subāhur asi cikṣepa sa viddhaḥ prāpatad bhuvi', null, 1029019),
('ramayana-1-29-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 20', 'शेषान्वायव्यमादाय निजघान महायशाः।
राघवः परमोदारो मुनीनां मुदमावहन्॥', 'śeṣān vāyavyam ādāya nijaghāna mahāyaśāḥ
rāghavaḥ paramodāro munīnāṃ mudam āvahan', null, 1029020),
('ramayana-1-29-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 21', 'स हत्वा राक्षसान्सर्वान्यज्ञघ्नान्रघुनन्दनः।
ऋषिभिः पूजितस्तत्र यथेन्द्रो विजये पुरा॥', 'sa hatvā rākṣasān sarvān yajñaghnān raghunandanaḥ
ṛṣibhiḥ pūjitas tatra yathendro vijaye purā', null, 1029021),
('ramayana-1-29-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 22', 'अथ यज्ञे समाप्ते तु विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
निरीतिका दिशो दृष्ट्वा काकुत्स्थमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'atha yajñe samāpte tu viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
nirītikā diśo dṛṣṭvā kākutstham idam abravīt', null, 1029022),
('ramayana-1-29-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 29, Verse 23', 'कृतार्थोऽस्मि महाबाहो कृतं गुरुवचस्त्वया।
सिद्धाश्रममिदं सत्यं कृतं राम महायशः॥', 'kṛtārtho ''smi mahābāho kṛtaṃ guruvacas tvayā
siddhāśramam idaṃ satyaṃ kṛtaṃ rāma mahāyaśaḥ', null, 1029023)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 30 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-30-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 1', 'अथ तां रजनीं तत्र कृतार्थौ रामलक्षणौ।
ऊषतुर्मुदितौ वीरौ प्रहृष्टेनान्तरात्मना॥', 'atha tāṃ rajanīṃ tatra kṛtārthau rāmalakṣaṇau
ūṣatur muditau vīrau prahṛṣṭenāntarātmanā', null, 1030001),
('ramayana-1-30-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 2', 'प्रभातायां तु शर्वर्यां कृतपौर्वाह्णिकक्रियौ।
विश्वामित्रमृषींश्चान्यान्सहितावभिजग्मतुः॥', 'prabhātāyāṃ tu śarvaryāṃ kṛtapaurvāhṇikakriyau
viśvāmitram ṛṣīṃś cānyān sahitāv abhijagmatuḥ', null, 1030002),
('ramayana-1-30-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 3', 'अभिवाद्य मुनिश्रेष्ठं ज्वलन्तमिव पावकम्।
ऊचतुर्मधुरोदारं वाक्यं मधुरभाषिणौ॥', 'abhivādya muniśreṣṭhaṃ jvalantam iva pāvakam
ūcatur madhurodāraṃ vākyaṃ madhurabhāṣiṇau', null, 1030003),
('ramayana-1-30-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 4', 'इमौ स्वो मुनिशार्दूल किंकरौ समुपस्थितौ।
आज्ञापय यथेष्टं वै शासनं करवाव किम्॥', 'imau svo muniśārdūla kiṃkarau samupasthitau
ājñāpaya yatheṣṭaṃ vai śāsanaṃ karavāva kim', null, 1030004),
('ramayana-1-30-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 5', 'एवमुक्ते ततस्ताभ्यां सर्व एव महर्षयः।
विश्वामित्रं पुरस्कृत्य रामं वचनमब्रुवन्॥', 'evam ukte tatas tābhyāṃ sarva eva maharṣayaḥ
viśvāmitraṃ puraskṛtya rāmaṃ vacanam abruvan', null, 1030005),
('ramayana-1-30-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 6', 'मैथिलस्य नरश्रेष्ठ जनकस्य भविष्यति।
यज्ञः परमधर्मिष्ठस्तत्र यास्यामहे वयम्॥', 'maithilasya naraśreṣṭha janakasya bhaviṣyati
yajñaḥ paramadharmiṣṭhas tatra yāsyāmahe vayam', null, 1030006),
('ramayana-1-30-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 7', 'त्वं चैव नरशार्दूल सहास्माभिर्गमिष्यसि।
अद्भुतं च धनूरत्नं तत्र त्वं द्रष्टुमर्हसि॥', 'tvaṃ caiva naraśārdūla sahāsmābhir gamiṣyasi
adbhutaṃ ca dhanūratnaṃ tatra tvaṃ draṣṭum arhasi', null, 1030007),
('ramayana-1-30-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 8', 'तद्धि पूर्वं नरश्रेष्ठ दत्तं सदसि दैवतैः।
अप्रमेयबलं घोरं मखे परमभास्वरम्॥', 'tad dhi pūrvaṃ naraśreṣṭha dattaṃ sadasi daivataiḥ
aprameyabalaṃ ghoraṃ makhe paramabhāsvaram', null, 1030008),
('ramayana-1-30-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 9', 'नास्य देवा न गन्धर्वा नासुरा न च राक्षसाः।
कर्तुमारोपणं शक्ता न कथं चन मानुषाः॥', 'nāsya devā na gandharvā nāsurā na ca rākṣasāḥ
kartum āropaṇaṃ śaktā na kathaṃ cana mānuṣāḥ', null, 1030009),
('ramayana-1-30-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 10', 'धनुषस्तस्य वीर्यं हि जिज्ञासन्तो महीक्षितः।
न शेकुरारोपयितुं राजपुत्रा महाबलाः॥', 'dhanuṣas tasya vīryaṃ hi jijñāsanto mahīkṣitaḥ
na śekur āropayituṃ rājaputrā mahābalāḥ', null, 1030010),
('ramayana-1-30-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 11', 'तद्धनुर्नरशार्दूल मैथिलस्य महात्मनः।
तत्र द्रक्ष्यसि काकुत्स्थ यज्ञं चाद्भुतदर्शनम्॥', 'tad dhanur naraśārdūla maithilasya mahātmanaḥ
tatra drakṣyasi kākutstha yajñaṃ cādbhutadarśanam', null, 1030011),
('ramayana-1-30-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 12', 'तद्धि यज्ञफलं तेन मैथिलेनोत्तमं धनुः।
याचितं नरशार्दूल सुनाभं सर्वदैवतैः॥', 'tad dhi yajñaphalaṃ tena maithilenottamaṃ dhanuḥ
yācitaṃ naraśārdūla sunābhaṃ sarvadaivataiḥ', null, 1030012),
('ramayana-1-30-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 13', 'एवमुक्त्वा मुनिवरः प्रस्थानमकरोत्तदा।
सर्षिसंघः सकाकुत्स्थ आमन्त्र्य वनदेवताः॥', 'evam uktvā munivaraḥ prasthānam akarot tadā
sarṣisaṃghaḥ sakākutstha āmantrya vanadevatāḥ', null, 1030013),
('ramayana-1-30-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 14', 'स्वस्ति वोऽस्तु गमिष्यामि सिद्धः सिद्धाश्रमादहम्।
उत्तरे जाह्नवीतीरे हिमवन्तं शिलोच्चयम्॥', 'svasti vo ''stu gamiṣyāmi siddhaḥ siddhāśramād aham
uttare jāhnavītīre himavantaṃ śiloccayam', null, 1030014),
('ramayana-1-30-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 15', 'प्रदक्षिणं ततः कृत्वा सिद्धाश्रममनुत्तमम्।
उत्तरां दिशमुद्दिश्य प्रस्थातुमुपचक्रमे॥', 'pradakṣiṇaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā siddhāśramam anuttamam
uttarāṃ diśam uddiśya prasthātum upacakrame', null, 1030015),
('ramayana-1-30-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 16', 'तं व्रजन्तं मुनिवरमन्वगादनुसारिणाम्।
शकटी शतमात्रं तु प्रयाणे ब्रह्मवादिनाम्॥', 'taṃ vrajantaṃ munivaram anvagād anusāriṇām
śakaṭī śatamātraṃ tu prayāṇe brahmavādinām', null, 1030016),
('ramayana-1-30-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 17', 'मृगपक्षिगणाश्चैव सिद्धाश्रमनिवासिनः।
अनुजग्मुर्महात्मानं विश्वामित्रं महामुनिम्॥', 'mṛgapakṣigaṇāś caiva siddhāśramanivāsinaḥ
anujagmur mahātmānaṃ viśvāmitraṃ mahāmunim', null, 1030017),
('ramayana-1-30-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 18', 'ते गत्वा दूरमध्वानं लम्बमाने दिवाकरे।
वासं चक्रुर्मुनिगणाः शोणाकूले समाहिताः॥', 'te gatvā dūram adhvānaṃ lambamāne divākare
vāsaṃ cakrur munigaṇāḥ śoṇākūle samāhitāḥ', null, 1030018),
('ramayana-1-30-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 19', 'तेऽस्तं गते दिनकरे स्नात्वा हुतहुताशनाः।
विश्वामित्रं पुरस्कृत्य निषेदुरमितौजसः॥', 'te ''staṃ gate dinakare snātvā hutahutāśanāḥ
viśvāmitraṃ puraskṛtya niṣedur amitaujasaḥ', null, 1030019),
('ramayana-1-30-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 20', 'रामोऽपि सहसौमित्रिर्मुनींस्तानभिपूज्य च।
अग्रतो निषसादाथ विश्वामित्रस्य धीमतः॥', 'rāmo ''pi sahasaumitrir munīṃs tān abhipūjya ca
agrato niṣasādātha viśvāmitrasya dhīmataḥ', null, 1030020),
('ramayana-1-30-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 21', 'अथ रामो महातेजा विश्वामित्रं महामुनिम्।
पप्रच्छ मुनिशार्दूलं कौतूहलसमन्वितः॥', 'atha rāmo mahātejā viśvāmitraṃ mahāmunim
papraccha muniśārdūlaṃ kautūhalasamanvitaḥ', null, 1030021),
('ramayana-1-30-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 22', 'भगवन्को न्वयं देशः समृद्धवनशोभितः।
श्रोतुमिच्छामि भद्रं ते वक्तुमर्हसि तत्त्वतः॥', 'bhagavan ko nv ayaṃ deśaḥ samṛddhavanaśobhitaḥ
śrotum icchāmi bhadraṃ te vaktum arhasi tattvataḥ', null, 1030022),
('ramayana-1-30-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 30, Verse 23', 'चोदितो रामवाक्येन कथयामास सुव्रतः।
तस्य देशस्य निखिलमृषिमध्ये महातपाः॥', 'codito rāmavākyena kathayām āsa suvrataḥ
tasya deśasya nikhilam ṛṣimadhye mahātapāḥ', null, 1030023)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 31 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-31-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 1', 'ब्रह्मयोनिर्महानासीत्कुशो नाम महातपाः।
वैदर्भ्यां जनयामास चतुरः सदृशान्सुतान्।
कुशाम्बं कुशनाभं च आधूर्तरजसं वसुम्॥', 'brahmayonir mahān āsīt kuśo nāma mahātapāḥ
vaidarbhyāṃ janayām āsa caturaḥ sadṛśān sutān
kuśāmbaṃ kuśanābhaṃ ca ādhūrtarajasaṃ vasum', null, 1031001),
('ramayana-1-31-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 2', 'दीप्तियुक्तान्महोत्साहान्क्षत्रधर्मचिकीर्षया।
तानुवाच कुशः पुत्रान्धर्मिष्ठान्सत्यवादिनः।
क्रियतां पालनं पुत्रा धर्मं प्राप्स्यथ पुष्कलम्॥', 'dīptiyuktān mahotsāhān kṣatradharmacikīrṣayā
tān uvāca kuśaḥ putrān dharmiṣṭhān satyavādinaḥ
kriyatāṃ pālanaṃ putrā dharmaṃ prāpsyatha puṣkalam', null, 1031002),
('ramayana-1-31-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 3', 'कुशस्य वचनं श्रुत्वा चत्वारो लोकसंमताः।
निवेशं चक्रिरे सर्वे पुराणां नृवरास्तदा॥', 'kuśasya vacanaṃ śrutvā catvāro lokasaṃmatāḥ
niveśaṃ cakrire sarve purāṇāṃ nṛvarās tadā', null, 1031003),
('ramayana-1-31-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 4', 'कुशाम्बस्तु महातेजाः कौशाम्बीमकरोत्पुरीम्।
कुशनाभस्तु धर्मात्मा परं चक्रे महोदयम्॥', 'kuśāmbas tu mahātejāḥ kauśāmbīm akarot purīm
kuśanābhas tu dharmātmā paraṃ cakre mahodayam', null, 1031004),
('ramayana-1-31-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 5', 'आधूर्तरजसो राम धर्मारण्यं महीपतिः।
चक्रे पुरवरं राजा वसुश्चक्रे गिरिव्रजम्॥', 'ādhūrtarajaso rāma dharmāraṇyaṃ mahīpatiḥ
cakre puravaraṃ rājā vasuś cakre girivrajam', null, 1031005),
('ramayana-1-31-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 6', 'एषा वसुमती राम वसोस्तस्य महात्मनः।
एते शैलवराः पञ्च प्रकाशन्ते समन्ततः॥', 'eṣā vasumatī rāma vasos tasya mahātmanaḥ
ete śailavarāḥ pañca prakāśante samantataḥ', null, 1031006),
('ramayana-1-31-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 7', 'सुमागधी नदी रम्या मागधान्विश्रुताययौ।
पञ्चानां शैलमुख्यानां मध्ये मालेव शोभते॥', 'sumāgadhī nadī ramyā māgadhān viśrutāyayau
pañcānāṃ śailamukhyānāṃ madhye māleva śobhate', null, 1031007),
('ramayana-1-31-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 8', 'सैषा हि मागधी राम वसोस्तस्य महात्मनः।
पूर्वाभिचरिता राम सुक्षेत्रा सस्यमालिनी॥', 'saiṣā hi māgadhī rāma vasos tasya mahātmanaḥ
pūrvābhicaritā rāma sukṣetrā sasyamālinī', null, 1031008),
('ramayana-1-31-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 9', 'कुशनाभस्तु राजर्षिः कन्याशतमनुत्तमम्।
जनयामास धर्मात्मा घृताच्यां रघुनन्दन॥', 'kuśanābhas tu rājarṣiḥ kanyāśatam anuttamam
janayām āsa dharmātmā ghṛtācyāṃ raghunandana', null, 1031009),
('ramayana-1-31-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 10', 'तास्तु यौवनशालिन्यो रूपवत्यः स्वलंकृताः।
उद्यानभूमिमागम्य प्रावृषीव शतह्रदाः॥', 'tās tu yauvanaśālinyo rūpavatyaḥ svalaṃkṛtāḥ
udyānabhūmim āgamya prāvṛṣīva śatahradāḥ', null, 1031010),
('ramayana-1-31-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 11', 'गायन्त्यो नृत्यमानाश्च वादयन्त्यश्च राघव।
आमोदं परमं जग्मुर्वराभरणभूषिताः॥', 'gāyantyo nṛtyamānāś ca vādayantyaś ca rāghava
āmodaṃ paramaṃ jagmur varābharaṇabhūṣitāḥ', null, 1031011),
('ramayana-1-31-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 12', 'अथ ताश्चारुसर्वाङ्ग्यो रूपेणाप्रतिमा भुवि।
उद्यानभूमिमागम्य तारा इव घनान्तरे॥', 'atha tāś cārusarvāṅgyo rūpeṇāpratimā bhuvi
udyānabhūmim āgamya tārā iva ghanāntare', null, 1031012),
('ramayana-1-31-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 13', 'ताः सर्वगुणसंपन्ना रूपयौवनसंयुताः।
दृष्ट्वा सर्वात्मको वायुरिदं वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'tāḥ sarvaguṇasaṃpannā rūpayauvanasaṃyutāḥ
dṛṣṭvā sarvātmako vāyur idaṃ vacanam abravīt', null, 1031013),
('ramayana-1-31-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 14', 'अहं वः कामये सर्वा भार्या मम भविष्यथ।
मानुषस्त्यज्यतां भावो दीर्घमायुरवाप्स्यथ॥', 'ahaṃ vaḥ kāmaye sarvā bhāryā mama bhaviṣyatha
mānuṣas tyajyatāṃ bhāvo dīrgham āyur avāpsyatha', null, 1031014),
('ramayana-1-31-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 15', 'तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा वायोरक्लिष्टकर्मणः।
अपहास्य ततो वाक्यं कन्याशतमथाब्रवीत्॥', 'tasya tad vacanaṃ śrutvā vāyor akliṣṭakarmaṇaḥ
apahāsya tato vākyaṃ kanyāśatam athābravīt', null, 1031015),
('ramayana-1-31-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 16', 'अन्तश्चरसि भूतानां सर्वेषां त्वं सुरोत्तम।
प्रभावज्ञाश्च ते सर्वाः किमस्मानवमन्यसे॥', 'antaś carasi bhūtānāṃ sarveṣāṃ tvaṃ surottama
prabhāvajñāś ca te sarvāḥ kim asmān avamanyase', null, 1031016),
('ramayana-1-31-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 17', 'कुशनाभसुताः सर्वाः समर्थास्त्वां सुरोत्तम।
स्थानाच्च्यावयितुं देवं रक्षामस्तु तपो वयम्॥', 'kuśanābhasutāḥ sarvāḥ samarthās tvāṃ surottama
sthānāc cyāvayituṃ devaṃ rakṣāmas tu tapo vayam', null, 1031017),
('ramayana-1-31-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 18', 'मा भूत्स कालो दुर्मेधः पितरं सत्यवादिनम्।
नावमन्यस्व धर्मेण स्वयं वरमुपास्महे॥', 'mā bhūt sa kālo durmedhaḥ pitaraṃ satyavādinam
nāvamanyasva dharmeṇa svayaṃ varam upāsmahe', null, 1031018),
('ramayana-1-31-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 19', 'पिता हि प्रभुरस्माकं दैवतं परमं हि सः।
यस्य नो दास्यति पिता स नो भर्ता भविष्यति॥', 'pitā hi prabhur asmākaṃ daivataṃ paramaṃ hi saḥ
yasya no dāsyati pitā sa no bhartā bhaviṣyati', null, 1031019),
('ramayana-1-31-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 20', 'तासां तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा वायुः परमकोपनः।
प्रविश्य सर्वगात्राणि बभञ्ज भगवान्प्रभुः॥', 'tāsāṃ tad vacanaṃ śrutvā vāyuḥ paramakopanaḥ
praviśya sarvagātrāṇi babhañja bhagavān prabhuḥ', null, 1031020),
('ramayana-1-31-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 21', 'ताः कन्या वायुना भग्ना विविशुर्नृपतेर्गृहम्।
दृष्ट्वा भग्नास्तदा राजा संभ्रान्त इदमब्रवीत्॥', 'tāḥ kanyā vāyunā bhagnā viviśur nṛpater gṛham
dṛṣṭvā bhagnās tadā rājā saṃbhrānta idam abravīt', null, 1031021),
('ramayana-1-31-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 31, Verse 22', 'किमिदं कथ्यतां पुत्र्यः को धर्ममवमन्यते।
कुब्जाः केन कृताः सर्वा वेष्टन्त्यो नाभिभाषथ॥', 'kim idaṃ kathyatāṃ putryaḥ ko dharmam avamanyate
kubjāḥ kena kṛtāḥ sarvā veṣṭantyo nābhibhāṣatha', null, 1031022)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 32 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-32-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 1', 'तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा कुशनाभस्य धीमतः।
शिरोभिश्चरणौ स्पृष्ट्वा कन्याशतमभाषत॥', 'tasya tad vacanaṃ śrutvā kuśanābhasya dhīmataḥ
śirobhiś caraṇau spṛṣṭvā kanyāśatam abhāṣata', null, 1032001),
('ramayana-1-32-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 2', 'वायुः सर्वात्मको राजन्प्रधर्षयितुमिच्छति।
अशुभं मार्गमास्थाय न धर्मं प्रत्यवेक्षते॥', 'vāyuḥ sarvātmako rājan pradharṣayitum icchati
aśubhaṃ mārgam āsthāya na dharmaṃ pratyavekṣate', null, 1032002),
('ramayana-1-32-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 3', 'पितृमत्यः स्म भद्रं ते स्वच्छन्दे न वयं स्थिताः।
पितरं नो वृणीष्व त्वं यदि नो दास्यते तव॥', 'pitṛmatyaḥ sma bhadraṃ te svacchande na vayaṃ sthitāḥ
pitaraṃ no vṛṇīṣva tvaṃ yadi no dāsyate tava', null, 1032003),
('ramayana-1-32-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 4', 'तेन पापानुबन्धेन वचनं न प्रतीच्छता।
एवं ब्रुवन्त्यः सर्वाः स्म वायुना निहता भृषम्॥', 'tena pāpānubandhena vacanaṃ na pratīcchatā
evaṃ bruvantyaḥ sarvāḥ sma vāyunā nihatā bhṛṣam', null, 1032004),
('ramayana-1-32-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 5', 'तासां तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा राजा परमधार्मिकः।
प्रत्युवाच महातेजाः कन्याशतमनुत्तमम्॥', 'tāsāṃ tad vacanaṃ śrutvā rājā paramadhārmikaḥ
pratyuvāca mahātejāḥ kanyāśatam anuttamam', null, 1032005),
('ramayana-1-32-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 6', 'क्षान्तं क्षमावतां पुत्र्यः कर्तव्यं सुमहत्कृतम्।
ऐकमत्यमुपागम्य कुलं चावेक्षितं मम॥', 'kṣāntaṃ kṣamāvatāṃ putryaḥ kartavyaṃ sumahat kṛtam
aikamatyam upāgamya kulaṃ cāvekṣitaṃ mama', null, 1032006),
('ramayana-1-32-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 7', 'अलंकारो हि नारीणां क्षमा तु पुरुषस्य वा।
दुष्करं तच्च वः क्षान्तं त्रिदशेषु विशेषतः॥', 'alaṃkāro hi nārīṇāṃ kṣamā tu puruṣasya vā
duṣkaraṃ tac ca vaḥ kṣāntaṃ tridaśeṣu viśeṣataḥ', null, 1032007),
('ramayana-1-32-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 8', 'यादृशीर्वः क्षमा पुत्र्यः सर्वासामविशेषतः।
क्षमा दानं क्षमा यज्ञः क्षमा सत्यं च पुत्रिकाः॥', 'yādṛśīr vaḥ kṣamā putryaḥ sarvāsām aviśeṣataḥ
kṣamā dānaṃ kṣamā yajñaḥ kṣamā satyaṃ ca putrikāḥ', null, 1032008),
('ramayana-1-32-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 9', 'क्षमा यशः क्षमा धर्मः क्षमायां विष्ठितं जगत्।
विसृज्य कन्याः काकुत्स्थ राजा त्रिदशविक्रमः॥', 'kṣamā yaśaḥ kṣamā dharmaḥ kṣamāyāṃ viṣṭhitaṃ jagat
visṛjya kanyāḥ kākutstha rājā tridaśavikramaḥ', null, 1032009),
('ramayana-1-32-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 10', 'मन्त्रज्ञो मन्त्रयामास प्रदानं सह मन्त्रिभिः।
देशे काले प्रदानस्य सदृशे प्रतिपादनम्॥', 'mantrajño mantrayām āsa pradānaṃ saha mantribhiḥ
deśe kāle pradānasya sadṛśe pratipādanam', null, 1032010),
('ramayana-1-32-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 11', 'एतस्मिन्नेव काले तु चूली नाम महामुनिः।
ऊर्ध्वरेताः शुभाचारो ब्राह्मं तप उपागमत्॥', 'etasminn eva kāle tu cūlī nāma mahāmuniḥ
ūrdhvaretāḥ śubhācāro brāhmaṃ tapa upāgamat', null, 1032011),
('ramayana-1-32-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 12', 'तप्यन्तं तमृषिं तत्र गन्धर्वी पर्युपासते।
सोमदा नाम भद्रं ते ऊर्मिला तनया तदा॥', 'tapyantaṃ tam ṛṣiṃ tatra gandharvī paryupāsate
somadā nāma bhadraṃ te ūrmilā tanayā tadā', null, 1032012),
('ramayana-1-32-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 13', 'सा च तं प्रणता भूत्वा शुश्रूषणपरायणा।
उवास काले धर्मिष्ठा तस्यास्तुष्टोऽभवद्गुरुः॥', 'sā ca taṃ praṇatā bhūtvā śuśrūṣaṇaparāyaṇā
uvāsa kāle dharmiṣṭhā tasyās tuṣṭo ''bhavad guruḥ', null, 1032013),
('ramayana-1-32-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 14', 'स च तां कालयोगेन प्रोवाच रघुनन्दन।
परितुष्टोऽस्मि भद्रं ते किं करोमि तव प्रियम्॥', 'sa ca tāṃ kālayogena provāca raghunandana
parituṣṭo ''smi bhadraṃ te kiṃ karomi tava priyam', null, 1032014),
('ramayana-1-32-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 15', 'परितुष्टं मुनिं ज्ञात्वा गन्धर्वी मधुरस्वरम्।
उवाच परमप्रीता वाक्यज्ञा वाक्यकोविदम्॥', 'parituṣṭaṃ muniṃ jñātvā gandharvī madhurasvaram
uvāca paramaprītā vākyajñā vākyakovidam', null, 1032015),
('ramayana-1-32-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 16', 'लक्ष्म्या समुदितो ब्राह्म्या ब्रह्मभूतो महातपाः।
ब्राह्मेण तपसा युक्तं पुत्रमिच्छामि धार्मिकम्॥', 'lakṣmyā samudito brāhmyā brahmabhūto mahātapāḥ
brāhmeṇa tapasā yuktaṃ putram icchāmi dhārmikam', null, 1032016),
('ramayana-1-32-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 17', 'अपतिश्चास्मि भद्रं ते भार्या चास्मि न कस्य चित्।
ब्राह्मेणोपगतायाश्च दातुमर्हसि मे सुतम्॥', 'apatiś cāsmi bhadraṃ te bhāryā cāsmi na kasya cit
brāhmeṇopagatāyāś ca dātum arhasi me sutam', null, 1032017),
('ramayana-1-32-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 18', 'तस्याः प्रसन्नो ब्रह्मर्षिर्ददौ पुत्रमनुत्तमम्।
ब्रह्मदत्त इति ख्यातं मानसं चूलिनः सुतम्॥', 'tasyāḥ prasanno brahmarṣir dadau putram anuttamam
brahmadatta iti khyātaṃ mānasaṃ cūlinaḥ sutam', null, 1032018),
('ramayana-1-32-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 19', 'स राजा ब्रह्मदत्तस्तु पुरीमध्यवसत्तदा।
काम्पिल्यां परया लक्ष्म्या देवराजो यथा दिवम्॥', 'sa rājā brahmadattas tu purīm adhyavasat tadā
kāmpilyāṃ parayā lakṣmyā devarājo yathā divam', null, 1032019),
('ramayana-1-32-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 20', 'स बुद्धिं कृतवान्राजा कुशनाभः सुधार्मिकः।
ब्रह्मदत्ताय काकुत्स्थ दातुं कन्याशतं तदा॥', 'sa buddhiṃ kṛtavān rājā kuśanābhaḥ sudhārmikaḥ
brahmadattāya kākutstha dātuṃ kanyāśataṃ tadā', null, 1032020),
('ramayana-1-32-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 21', 'तमाहूय महातेजा ब्रह्मदत्तं महीपतिः।
ददौ कन्याशतं राजा सुप्रीतेनान्तरात्मना॥', 'tam āhūya mahātejā brahmadattaṃ mahīpatiḥ
dadau kanyāśataṃ rājā suprītenāntarātmanā', null, 1032021),
('ramayana-1-32-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 22', 'यथाक्रमं ततः पाणिं जग्राह रघुनन्दन।
ब्रह्मदत्तो मही पालस्तासां देवपतिर्यथा॥', 'yathākramaṃ tataḥ pāṇiṃ jagrāha raghunandana
brahmadatto mahī pālas tāsāṃ devapatir yathā', null, 1032022),
('ramayana-1-32-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 23', 'स्पृष्टमात्रे ततः पाणौ विकुब्जा विगतज्वराः।
युक्ताः परमया लक्ष्म्या बभुः कन्याशतं तदा॥', 'spṛṣṭamātre tataḥ pāṇau vikubjā vigatajvarāḥ
yuktāḥ paramayā lakṣmyā babhuḥ kanyāśataṃ tadā', null, 1032023),
('ramayana-1-32-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 24', 'स दृष्ट्वा वायुना मुक्ताः कुशनाभो महीपतिः।
बभूव परमप्रीतो हर्षं लेभे पुनः पुनः॥', 'sa dṛṣṭvā vāyunā muktāḥ kuśanābho mahīpatiḥ
babhūva paramaprīto harṣaṃ lebhe punaḥ punaḥ', null, 1032024),
('ramayana-1-32-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 25', 'कृतोद्वाहं तु राजानं ब्रह्मदत्तं महीपतिः।
सदारं प्रेषयामास सोपाध्याय गणं तदा॥', 'kṛtodvāhaṃ tu rājānaṃ brahmadattaṃ mahīpatiḥ
sadāraṃ preṣayām āsa sopādhyāya gaṇaṃ tadā', null, 1032025),
('ramayana-1-32-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 32, Verse 26', 'सोमदापि सुसंहृष्टा पुत्रस्य सदृशीं क्रियाम्।
यथान्यायं च गन्धर्वी स्नुषास्ताः प्रत्यनन्दत॥', 'somadāpi susaṃhṛṣṭā putrasya sadṛśīṃ kriyām
yathānyāyaṃ ca gandharvī snuṣās tāḥ pratyanandata', null, 1032026)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 33 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-33-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 1', 'कृतोद्वाहे गते तस्मिन्ब्रह्मदत्ते च राघव।
अपुत्रः पुत्रलाभाय पौत्रीमिष्टिमकल्पयत्॥', 'kṛtodvāhe gate tasmin brahmadatte ca rāghava
aputraḥ putralābhāya pautrīm iṣṭim akalpayat', null, 1033001),
('ramayana-1-33-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 2', 'इष्ट्यां तु वर्तमानायां कुशनाभं महीपतिम्।
उवाच परमप्रीतः कुशो ब्रह्मसुतस्तदा॥', 'iṣṭyāṃ tu vartamānāyāṃ kuśanābhaṃ mahīpatim
uvāca paramaprītaḥ kuśo brahmasutas tadā', null, 1033002),
('ramayana-1-33-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 3', 'पुत्रस्ते सदृशः पुत्र भविष्यति सुधार्मिकः।
गाधिं प्राप्स्यसि तेन त्वं कीर्तिं लोके च शाश्वतीम्॥', 'putras te sadṛśaḥ putra bhaviṣyati sudhārmikaḥ
gādhiṃ prāpsyasi tena tvaṃ kīrtiṃ loke ca śāśvatīm', null, 1033003),
('ramayana-1-33-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 4', 'एवमुक्त्वा कुशो राम कुशनाभं महीपतिम्।
जगामाकाशमाविश्य ब्रह्मलोकं सनातनम्॥', 'evam uktvā kuśo rāma kuśanābhaṃ mahīpatim
jagāmākāśam āviśya brahmalokaṃ sanātanam', null, 1033004),
('ramayana-1-33-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 5', 'कस्य चित्त्वथ कालस्य कुशनाभस्य धीमतः।
जज्ञे परमधर्मिष्ठो गाधिरित्येव नामतः॥', 'kasya cit tv atha kālasya kuśanābhasya dhīmataḥ
jajñe paramadharmiṣṭho gādhir ity eva nāmataḥ', null, 1033005),
('ramayana-1-33-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 6', 'स पिता मम काकुत्स्थ गाधिः परमधार्मिकः।
कुशवंशप्रसूतोऽस्मि कौशिको रघुनन्दन॥', 'sa pitā mama kākutstha gādhiḥ paramadhārmikaḥ
kuśavaṃśaprasūto ''smi kauśiko raghunandana', null, 1033006),
('ramayana-1-33-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 7', 'पूर्वजा भगिनी चापि मम राघव सुव्रता।
नाम्ना सत्यवती नाम ऋचीके प्रतिपादिता॥', 'pūrvajā bhaginī cāpi mama rāghava suvratā
nāmnā satyavatī nāma ṛcīke pratipāditā', null, 1033007),
('ramayana-1-33-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 8', 'सशरीरा गता स्वर्गं भर्तारमनुवर्तिनी।
कौशिकी परमोदारा सा प्रवृत्ता महानदी॥', 'saśarīrā gatā svargaṃ bhartāram anuvartinī
kauśikī paramodārā sā pravṛttā mahānadī', null, 1033008),
('ramayana-1-33-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 9', 'दिव्या पुण्योदका रम्या हिमवन्तमुपाश्रिता।
लोकस्य हितकामार्थं प्रवृत्ता भगिनी मम॥', 'divyā puṇyodakā ramyā himavantam upāśritā
lokasya hitakāmārthaṃ pravṛttā bhaginī mama', null, 1033009),
('ramayana-1-33-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 10', 'ततोऽहं हिमवत्पार्श्वे वसामि नियतः सुखम्।
भगिन्याः स्नेहसंयुक्तः कौशिक्या रघुनन्दन॥', 'tato ''haṃ himavatpārśve vasāmi niyataḥ sukham
bhaginyāḥ snehasaṃyuktaḥ kauśikyā raghunandana', null, 1033010),
('ramayana-1-33-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 11', 'सा तु सत्यवती पुण्या सत्ये धर्मे प्रतिष्ठिता।
पतिव्रता महाभागा कौशिकी सरितां वरा॥', 'sā tu satyavatī puṇyā satye dharme pratiṣṭhitā
pativratā mahābhāgā kauśikī saritāṃ varā', null, 1033011),
('ramayana-1-33-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 12', 'अहं हि नियमाद्राम हित्वा तां समुपागतः।
सिद्धाश्रममनुप्राप्य सिद्धोऽस्मि तव तेजसा॥', 'ahaṃ hi niyamād rāma hitvā tāṃ samupāgataḥ
siddhāśramam anuprāpya siddho ''smi tava tejasā', null, 1033012),
('ramayana-1-33-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 13', 'एषा राम ममोत्पत्तिः स्वस्य वंशस्य कीर्तिता।
देशस्य च महाबाहो यन्मां त्वं परिपृच्छसि॥', 'eṣā rāma mamotpattiḥ svasya vaṃśasya kīrtitā
deśasya ca mahābāho yan māṃ tvaṃ paripṛcchasi', null, 1033013),
('ramayana-1-33-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 14', 'गतोऽर्धरात्रः काकुत्स्थ कथाः कथयतो मम।
निद्रामभ्येहि भद्रं ते मा भूद्विघ्नोऽध्वनीह नः॥', 'gato ''rdharātraḥ kākutstha kathāḥ kathayato mama
nidrām abhyehi bhadraṃ te mā bhūd vighno ''dhvanīha naḥ', null, 1033014),
('ramayana-1-33-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 15', 'निष्पन्दास्तरवः सर्वे निलीना मृगपक्षिणः।
नैशेन तमसा व्याप्ता दिशश्च रघुनन्दन॥', 'niṣpandās taravaḥ sarve nilīnā mṛgapakṣiṇaḥ
naiśena tamasā vyāptā diśaś ca raghunandana', null, 1033015),
('ramayana-1-33-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 16', 'शनैर्वियुज्यते संध्या नभो नेत्रैरिवावृतम्।
नक्षत्रतारागहनं ज्योतिर्भिरवभासते॥', 'śanair viyujyate saṃdhyā nabho netrair ivāvṛtam
nakṣatratārāgahanaṃ jyotirbhir avabhāsate', null, 1033016),
('ramayana-1-33-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 17', 'उत्तिष्ठति च शीतांशुः शशी लोकतमोनुदः।
ह्लादयन्प्राणिनां लोके मनांसि प्रभया विभो॥', 'uttiṣṭhati ca śītāṃśuḥ śaśī lokatamonudaḥ
hlādayan prāṇināṃ loke manāṃsi prabhayā vibho', null, 1033017),
('ramayana-1-33-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 18', 'नैशानि सर्वभूतानि प्रचरन्ति ततस्ततः।
यक्षराक्षससंघाश्च रौद्राश्च पिशिताशनाः॥', 'naiśāni sarvabhūtāni pracaranti tatas tataḥ
yakṣarākṣasasaṃghāś ca raudrāś ca piśitāśanāḥ', null, 1033018),
('ramayana-1-33-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 19', 'एवमुक्त्वा महातेजा विरराम महामुनिः।
साधु साध्विति तं सर्वे मुनयो ह्यभ्यपूजयन्॥', 'evam uktvā mahātejā virarāma mahāmuniḥ
sādhu sādhv iti taṃ sarve munayo hy abhyapūjayan', null, 1033019),
('ramayana-1-33-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 33, Verse 20', 'रामोऽपि सह सौमित्रिः किं चिदागतविस्मयः।
प्रशस्य मुनिशार्दूलं निद्रां समुपसेवते॥', 'rāmo ''pi saha saumitriḥ kiṃ cid āgatavismayaḥ
praśasya muniśārdūlaṃ nidrāṃ samupasevate', null, 1033020)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 34 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-34-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 1', 'उपास्य रात्रिशेषं तु शोणाकूले महर्षिभिः।
निशायां सुप्रभातायां विश्वामित्रोऽभ्यभाषत॥', 'upāsya rātriśeṣaṃ tu śoṇākūle maharṣibhiḥ
niśāyāṃ suprabhātāyāṃ viśvāmitro ''bhyabhāṣata', null, 1034001),
('ramayana-1-34-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 2', 'सुप्रभाता निशा राम पूर्वा संध्या प्रवर्तते।
उत्तिष्ठोत्तिष्ठ भद्रं ते गमनायाभिरोचय॥', 'suprabhātā niśā rāma pūrvā saṃdhyā pravartate
uttiṣṭhottiṣṭha bhadraṃ te gamanāyābhirocaya', null, 1034002),
('ramayana-1-34-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 3', 'तच्छ्रुत्वा वचनं तस्य कृत्वा पौर्वाह्णिकीं क्रियाम्।
गमनं रोचयामास वाक्यं चेदमुवाच ह॥', 'tac chrutvā vacanaṃ tasya kṛtvā paurvāhṇikīṃ kriyām
gamanaṃ rocayām āsa vākyaṃ cedam uvāca ha', null, 1034003),
('ramayana-1-34-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 4', 'अयं शोणः शुभजलो गाधः पुलिनमण्डितः।
कतरेण पथा ब्रह्मन्संतरिष्यामहे वयम्॥', 'ayaṃ śoṇaḥ śubhajalo gādhaḥ pulinamaṇḍitaḥ
katareṇa pathā brahman saṃtariṣyāmahe vayam', null, 1034004),
('ramayana-1-34-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 5', 'एवमुक्तस्तु रामेण विश्वामित्रोऽब्रवीदिदम्।
एष पन्था मयोद्दिष्टो येन यान्ति महर्षयः॥', 'evam uktas tu rāmeṇa viśvāmitro ''bravīd idam
eṣa panthā mayoddiṣṭo yena yānti maharṣayaḥ', null, 1034005),
('ramayana-1-34-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 6', 'ते गत्वा दूरमध्वानं गतेऽर्धदिवसे तदा।
जाह्नवीं सरितां श्रेष्ठां ददृशुर्मुनिसेविताम्॥', 'te gatvā dūram adhvānaṃ gate ''rdhadivase tadā
jāhnavīṃ saritāṃ śreṣṭhāṃ dadṛśur munisevitām', null, 1034006),
('ramayana-1-34-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 7', 'तां दृष्ट्वा पुण्यसलिलां हंससारससेविताम्।
बभूवुर्मुदिताः सर्वे मुनयः सहराघवाः।
तस्यास्तीरे ततश्चक्रुस्ते आवासपरिग्रहम्॥', 'tāṃ dṛṣṭvā puṇyasalilāṃ haṃsasārasasevitām
babhūvur muditāḥ sarve munayaḥ saharāghavāḥ
tasyās tīre tataś cakrus te āvāsaparigraham', null, 1034007),
('ramayana-1-34-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 8', 'ततः स्नात्वा यथान्यायं संतर्प्य पितृदेवताः।
हुत्वा चैवाग्निहोत्राणि प्राश्य चामृतवद्धविः॥', 'tataḥ snātvā yathānyāyaṃ saṃtarpya pitṛdevatāḥ
hutvā caivāgnihotrāṇi prāśya cāmṛtavad dhaviḥ', null, 1034008),
('ramayana-1-34-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 9', 'विविशुर्जाह्नवीतीरे शुचौ मुदितमानसाः।
विश्वामित्रं महात्मानं परिवार्य समन्ततः॥', 'viviśur jāhnavītīre śucau muditamānasāḥ
viśvāmitraṃ mahātmānaṃ parivārya samantataḥ', null, 1034009),
('ramayana-1-34-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 10', 'संप्रहृष्टमना रामो विश्वामित्रमथाब्रवीत्।
भगवञ्श्रोतुमिच्छामि गङ्गां त्रिपथगां नदीम्।
त्रैलोक्यं कथमाक्रम्य गता नदनदीपतिम्॥', 'saṃprahṛṣṭamanā rāmo viśvāmitram athābravīt
bhagavañ śrotum icchāmi gaṅgāṃ tripathagāṃ nadīm
trailokyaṃ katham ākramya gatā nadanadīpatim', null, 1034010),
('ramayana-1-34-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 11', 'चोदितो राम वाक्येन विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
वृद्धिं जन्म च गङ्गाया वक्तुमेवोपचक्रमे॥', 'codito rāma vākyena viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
vṛddhiṃ janma ca gaṅgāyā vaktum evopacakrame', null, 1034011),
('ramayana-1-34-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 12', 'शैलेन्द्रो हिमवान्नाम धातूनामाकरो महान्।
तस्य कन्या द्वयं राम रूपेणाप्रतिमं भुवि॥', 'śailendro himavān nāma dhātūnām ākaro mahān
tasya kanyā dvayaṃ rāma rūpeṇāpratimaṃ bhuvi', null, 1034012),
('ramayana-1-34-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 13', 'या मेरुदुहिता राम तयोर्माता सुमध्यमा।
नाम्ना मेना मनोज्ञा वै पत्नी हिमवतः प्रिया॥', 'yā meruduhitā rāma tayor mātā sumadhyamā
nāmnā menā manojñā vai patnī himavataḥ priyā', null, 1034013),
('ramayana-1-34-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 14', 'तस्यां गङ्गेयमभवज्ज्येष्ठा हिमवतः सुता।
उमा नाम द्वितीयाभूत्कन्या तस्यैव राघव॥', 'tasyāṃ gaṅgeyam abhavaj jyeṣṭhā himavataḥ sutā
umā nāma dvitīyābhūt kanyā tasyaiva rāghava', null, 1034014),
('ramayana-1-34-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 15', 'अथ ज्येष्ठां सुराः सर्वे देवतार्थचिकीर्षया।
शैलेन्द्रं वरयामासुर्गङ्गां त्रिपथगां नदीम्॥', 'atha jyeṣṭhāṃ surāḥ sarve devatārthacikīrṣayā
śailendraṃ varayām āsur gaṅgāṃ tripathagāṃ nadīm', null, 1034015),
('ramayana-1-34-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 16', 'ददौ धर्मेण हिमवांस्तनयां लोकपावनीम्।
स्वच्छन्दपथगां गङ्गां त्रैलोक्यहितकाम्यया॥', 'dadau dharmeṇa himavāṃs tanayāṃ lokapāvanīm
svacchandapathagāṃ gaṅgāṃ trailokyahitakāmyayā', null, 1034016),
('ramayana-1-34-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 17', 'प्रतिगृह्य त्रिलोकार्थं त्रिलोकहितकारिणः।
गङ्गामादाय तेऽगच्छन्कृतार्थेनान्तरात्मना॥', 'pratigṛhya trilokārthaṃ trilokahitakāriṇaḥ
gaṅgām ādāya te ''gacchan kṛtārthenāntarātmanā', null, 1034017),
('ramayana-1-34-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 18', 'या चान्या शैलदुहिता कन्यासीद्रघुनन्दन।
उग्रं सा व्रतमास्थाय तपस्तेपे तपोधना॥', 'yā cānyā śailaduhitā kanyāsīd raghunandana
ugraṃ sā vratam āsthāya tapas tepe tapodhanā', null, 1034018),
('ramayana-1-34-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 19', 'उग्रेण तपसा युक्तां ददौ शैलवरः सुताम्।
रुद्रायाप्रतिरूपाय उमां लोकनमस्कृताम्॥', 'ugreṇa tapasā yuktāṃ dadau śailavaraḥ sutām
rudrāyāpratirūpāya umāṃ lokanamaskṛtām', null, 1034019),
('ramayana-1-34-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 20', 'एते ते शैल राजस्य सुते लोकनमस्कृते।
गङ्गा च सरितां श्रेष्ठा उमा देवी च राघव॥', 'ete te śaila rājasya sute lokanamaskṛte
gaṅgā ca saritāṃ śreṣṭhā umā devī ca rāghava', null, 1034020),
('ramayana-1-34-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 34, Verse 21', 'एतत्ते धर्ममाख्यातं यथा त्रिपथगा नदी।
खं गता प्रथमं तात गतिं गतिमतां वर॥', 'etat te dharmam ākhyātaṃ yathā tripathagā nadī
khaṃ gatā prathamaṃ tāta gatiṃ gatimatāṃ vara', null, 1034021)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 35 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-35-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 1', 'उक्त वाक्ये मुनौ तस्मिन्नुभौ राघवलक्ष्मणौ।
प्रतिनन्द्य कथां वीरावूचतुर्मुनिपुंगवम्॥', 'ukta vākye munau tasminn ubhau rāghavalakṣmaṇau
pratinandya kathāṃ vīrāv ūcatur munipuṃgavam', null, 1035001),
('ramayana-1-35-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 2', 'धर्मयुक्तमिदं ब्रह्मन्कथितं परमं त्वया।
दुहितुः शैलराजस्य ज्येष्ठाय वक्तुमर्हसि॥', 'dharmayuktam idaṃ brahman kathitaṃ paramaṃ tvayā
duhituḥ śailarājasya jyeṣṭhāya vaktum arhasi', null, 1035002),
('ramayana-1-35-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 3', 'विस्तरं विस्तरज्ञोऽसि दिव्यमानुषसंभवम्।
त्रीन्पथो हेतुना केन पावयेल्लोकपावनी॥', 'vistaraṃ vistarajño ''si divyamānuṣasaṃbhavam
trīn patho hetunā kena pāvayel lokapāvanī', null, 1035003),
('ramayana-1-35-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 4', 'कथं गङ्गां त्रिपथगा विश्रुता सरिदुत्तमा।
त्रिषु लोकेषु धर्मज्ञ कर्मभिः कैः समन्विता॥', 'kathaṃ gaṅgāṃ tripathagā viśrutā sariduttamā
triṣu lokeṣu dharmajña karmabhiḥ kaiḥ samanvitā', null, 1035004),
('ramayana-1-35-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 5', 'तथा ब्रुवति काकुत्स्थे विश्वामित्रस्तपोधनः।
निखिलेन कथां सर्वामृषिमध्ये न्यवेदयत्॥', 'tathā bruvati kākutsthe viśvāmitras tapodhanaḥ
nikhilena kathāṃ sarvām ṛṣimadhye nyavedayat', null, 1035005),
('ramayana-1-35-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 6', 'पुरा राम कृतोद्वाहः शितिकण्ठो महातपाः।
दृष्ट्वा च स्पृहया देवीं मैथुनायोपचक्रमे॥', 'purā rāma kṛtodvāhaḥ śitikaṇṭho mahātapāḥ
dṛṣṭvā ca spṛhayā devīṃ maithunāyopacakrame', null, 1035006),
('ramayana-1-35-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 7', 'शितिकण्ठस्य देवस्य दिव्यं वर्षशतं गतम्।
न चापि तनयो राम तस्यामासीत्परंतप॥', 'śitikaṇṭhasya devasya divyaṃ varṣaśataṃ gatam
na cāpi tanayo rāma tasyām āsīt paraṃtapa', null, 1035007),
('ramayana-1-35-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 8', 'ततो देवाः समुद्विग्नाः पितामहपुरोगमाः।
यदिहोत्पद्यते भूतं कस्तत्प्रतिसहिष्यते॥', 'tato devāḥ samudvignāḥ pitāmahapurogamāḥ
yad ihotpadyate bhūtaṃ kas tat pratisahiṣyate', null, 1035008),
('ramayana-1-35-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 9', 'अभिगम्य सुराः सर्वे प्रणिपत्येदमब्रुवन्।
देवदेव महादेव लोकस्यास्य हिते रत।
सुराणां प्रणिपातेन प्रसादं कर्तुमर्हसि॥', 'abhigamya surāḥ sarve praṇipatyedam abruvan
devadeva mahādeva lokasyāsya hite rata
surāṇāṃ praṇipātena prasādaṃ kartum arhasi', null, 1035009),
('ramayana-1-35-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 10', 'न लोका धारयिष्यन्ति तव तेजः सुरोत्तम।
ब्राह्मेण तपसा युक्तो देव्या सह तपश्चर॥', 'na lokā dhārayiṣyanti tava tejaḥ surottama
brāhmeṇa tapasā yukto devyā saha tapaś cara', null, 1035010),
('ramayana-1-35-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 11', 'त्रैलोक्यहितकामार्थं तेजस्तेजसि धारय।
रक्ष सर्वानिमांल्लोकान्नालोकं कर्तुमर्हसि॥', 'trailokyahitakāmārthaṃ tejas tejasi dhāraya
rakṣa sarvān imāṃl lokān nālokaṃ kartum arhasi', null, 1035011),
('ramayana-1-35-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 12', 'देवतानां वचः श्रुत्वा सर्वलोकमहेश्वरः।
बाढमित्यब्रवीत्सर्वान्पुनश्चेदमुवाच ह॥', 'devatānāṃ vacaḥ śrutvā sarvalokamaheśvaraḥ
bāḍham ity abravīt sarvān punaś cedam uvāca ha', null, 1035012),
('ramayana-1-35-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 13', 'धारयिष्याम्यहं तेजस्तेजस्येव सहोमया।
त्रिदशाः पृथिवी चैव निर्वाणमधिगच्छतु॥', 'dhārayiṣyāmy ahaṃ tejas tejasy eva sahomayā
tridaśāḥ pṛthivī caiva nirvāṇam adhigacchatu', null, 1035013),
('ramayana-1-35-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 14', 'यदिदं क्षुभितं स्थानान्मम तेजो ह्यनुत्तमम्।
धारयिष्यति कस्तन्मे ब्रुवन्तु सुरसत्तमाः॥', 'yad idaṃ kṣubhitaṃ sthānān mama tejo hy anuttamam
dhārayiṣyati kas tan me bruvantu surasattamāḥ', null, 1035014),
('ramayana-1-35-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 15', 'एवमुक्तास्ततो देवाः प्रत्यूचुर्वृषभध्वजम्।
यत्तेजः क्षुभितं ह्येतत्तद्धरा धारयिष्यति॥', 'evam uktās tato devāḥ pratyūcur vṛṣabhadhvajam
yat tejaḥ kṣubhitaṃ hy etat tad dharā dhārayiṣyati', null, 1035015),
('ramayana-1-35-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 16', 'एवमुक्तः सुरपतिः प्रमुमोच महीतले।
तेजसा पृथिवी येन व्याप्ता सगिरिकानना॥', 'evam uktaḥ surapatiḥ pramumoca mahītale
tejasā pṛthivī yena vyāptā sagirikānanā', null, 1035016),
('ramayana-1-35-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 17', 'ततो देवाः पुनरिदमूचुश्चाथ हुताशनम्।
प्रविश त्वं महातेजो रौद्रं वायुसमन्वितः॥', 'tato devāḥ punar idam ūcuś cātha hutāśanam
praviśa tvaṃ mahātejo raudraṃ vāyusamanvitaḥ', null, 1035017),
('ramayana-1-35-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 18', 'तदग्निना पुनर्व्याप्तं संजातः श्वेतपर्वतः।
दिव्यं शरवणं चैव पावकादित्यसंनिभम्।
यत्र जातो महातेजाः कार्तिकेयोऽग्निसंभवः॥', 'tad agninā punar vyāptaṃ saṃjātaḥ śvetaparvataḥ
divyaṃ śaravaṇaṃ caiva pāvakādityasaṃnibham
yatra jāto mahātejāḥ kārtikeyo ''gnisaṃbhavaḥ', null, 1035018),
('ramayana-1-35-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 19', 'अथोमां च शिवं चैव देवाः सर्षि गणास्तदा।
पूजयामासुरत्यर्थं सुप्रीतमनसस्ततः॥', 'athomāṃ ca śivaṃ caiva devāḥ sarṣi gaṇās tadā
pūjayām āsur atyarthaṃ suprītamanasas tataḥ', null, 1035019),
('ramayana-1-35-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 20', 'अथ शैल सुता राम त्रिदशानिदमब्रवीत्।
समन्युरशपत्सर्वान्क्रोधसंरक्तलोचना॥', 'atha śaila sutā rāma tridaśān idam abravīt
samanyur aśapat sarvān krodhasaṃraktalocanā', null, 1035020),
('ramayana-1-35-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 21', 'यस्मान्निवारिता चैव संगता पुत्रकाम्यया।
अपत्यं स्वेषु दारेषु नोत्पादयितुमर्हथ।
अद्य प्रभृति युष्माकमप्रजाः सन्तु पत्नयः॥', 'yasmān nivāritā caiva saṃgatā putrakāmyayā
apatyaṃ sveṣu dāreṣu notpādayitum arhatha
adya prabhṛti yuṣmākam aprajāḥ santu patnayaḥ', null, 1035021),
('ramayana-1-35-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 22', 'एवमुक्त्वा सुरान्सर्वाञ्शशाप पृथिवीमपि।
अवने नैकरूपा त्वं बहुभार्या भविष्यसि॥', 'evam uktvā surān sarvāñ śaśāpa pṛthivīm api
avane naikarūpā tvaṃ bahubhāryā bhaviṣyasi', null, 1035022),
('ramayana-1-35-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 23', 'न च पुत्रकृतां प्रीतिं मत्क्रोधकलुषी कृता।
प्राप्स्यसि त्वं सुदुर्मेधे मम पुत्रमनिच्छती॥', 'na ca putrakṛtāṃ prītiṃ matkrodhakaluṣī kṛtā
prāpsyasi tvaṃ sudurmedhe mama putram anicchatī', null, 1035023),
('ramayana-1-35-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 24', 'तान्सर्वान्व्रीडितान्दृष्ट्वा सुरान्सुरपतिस्तदा।
गमनायोपचक्राम दिशं वरुणपालिताम्॥', 'tān sarvān vrīḍitān dṛṣṭvā surān surapatis tadā
gamanāyopacakrāma diśaṃ varuṇapālitām', null, 1035024),
('ramayana-1-35-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 25', 'स गत्वा तप आतिष्ठत्पार्श्वे तस्योत्तरे गिरेः।
हिमवत्प्रभवे शृङ्गे सह देव्या महेश्वरः॥', 'sa gatvā tapa ātiṣṭhat pārśve tasyottare gireḥ
himavatprabhave śṛṅge saha devyā maheśvaraḥ', null, 1035025),
('ramayana-1-35-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 35, Verse 26', 'एष ते विस्तरो राम शैलपुत्र्या निवेदितः।
गङ्गायाः प्रभवं चैव शृणु मे सहलक्ष्मणः॥', 'eṣa te vistaro rāma śailaputryā niveditaḥ
gaṅgāyāḥ prabhavaṃ caiva śṛṇu me sahalakṣmaṇaḥ', null, 1035026)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 36 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-36-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 1', 'तप्यमाने तपो देवे देवाः सर्षिगणाः पुरा।
सेनापतिमभीप्सन्तः पितामहमुपागमन्॥', 'tapyamāne tapo deve devāḥ sarṣigaṇāḥ purā
senāpatim abhīpsantaḥ pitāmaham upāgaman', null, 1036001),
('ramayana-1-36-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 2', 'ततोऽब्रुवन्सुराः सर्वे भगवन्तं पितामहम्।
प्रणिपत्य शुभं वाक्यं सेन्द्राः साग्निपुरोगमाः॥', 'tato ''bruvan surāḥ sarve bhagavantaṃ pitāmaham
praṇipatya śubhaṃ vākyaṃ sendrāḥ sāgnipurogamāḥ', null, 1036002),
('ramayana-1-36-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 3', 'यो नः सेनापतिर्देव दत्तो भगवता पुरा।
स तपः परमास्थाय तप्यते स्म सहोमया॥', 'yo naḥ senāpatir deva datto bhagavatā purā
sa tapaḥ param āsthāya tapyate sma sahomayā', null, 1036003),
('ramayana-1-36-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 4', 'यदत्रानन्तरं कार्यं लोकानां हितकाम्यया।
संविधत्स्व विधानज्ञ त्वं हि नः परमा गतिः॥', 'yad atrānantaraṃ kāryaṃ lokānāṃ hitakāmyayā
saṃvidhatsva vidhānajña tvaṃ hi naḥ paramā gatiḥ', null, 1036004),
('ramayana-1-36-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 5', 'देवतानां वचः श्रुत्वा सर्वलोकपितामहः।
सान्त्वयन्मधुरैर्वाक्यैस्त्रिदशानिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'devatānāṃ vacaḥ śrutvā sarvalokapitāmahaḥ
sāntvayan madhurair vākyais tridaśān idam abravīt', null, 1036005),
('ramayana-1-36-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 6', 'शैलपुत्र्या यदुक्तं तन्न प्रजास्यथ पत्निषु।
तस्या वचनमक्लिष्टं सत्यमेव न संशयः॥', 'śailaputryā yad uktaṃ tan na prajāsyatha patniṣu
tasyā vacanam akliṣṭaṃ satyam eva na saṃśayaḥ', null, 1036006),
('ramayana-1-36-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 7', 'इयमाकाशगा गङ्गा यस्यां पुत्रं हुताशनः।
जनयिष्यति देवानां सेनापतिमरिंदमम्॥', 'iyam ākāśagā gaṅgā yasyāṃ putraṃ hutāśanaḥ
janayiṣyati devānāṃ senāpatim ariṃdamam', null, 1036007),
('ramayana-1-36-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 8', 'ज्येष्ठा शैलेन्द्रदुहिता मानयिष्यति तं सुतम्।
उमायास्तद्बहुमतं भविष्यति न संशयः॥', 'jyeṣṭhā śailendraduhitā mānayiṣyati taṃ sutam
umāyās tad bahumataṃ bhaviṣyati na saṃśayaḥ', null, 1036008),
('ramayana-1-36-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 9', 'तच्छ्रुत्वा वचनं तस्य कृतार्था रघुनन्दन।
प्रणिपत्य सुराः सर्वे पितामहमपूजयन्॥', 'tac chrutvā vacanaṃ tasya kṛtārthā raghunandana
praṇipatya surāḥ sarve pitāmaham apūjayan', null, 1036009),
('ramayana-1-36-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 10', 'ते गत्वा पर्वतं राम कैलासं धातुमण्डितम्।
अग्निं नियोजयामासुः पुत्रार्थं सर्वदेवताः॥', 'te gatvā parvataṃ rāma kailāsaṃ dhātumaṇḍitam
agniṃ niyojayām āsuḥ putrārthaṃ sarvadevatāḥ', null, 1036010),
('ramayana-1-36-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 11', 'देवकार्यमिदं देव समाधत्स्व हुताशन।
शैलपुत्र्यां महातेजो गङ्गायां तेज उत्सृज॥', 'devakāryam idaṃ deva samādhatsva hutāśana
śailaputryāṃ mahātejo gaṅgāyāṃ teja utsṛja', null, 1036011),
('ramayana-1-36-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 12', 'देवतानां प्रतिज्ञाय गङ्गामभ्येत्य पावकः।
गर्भं धारय वै देवि देवतानामिदं प्रियम्॥', 'devatānāṃ pratijñāya gaṅgām abhyetya pāvakaḥ
garbhaṃ dhāraya vai devi devatānām idaṃ priyam', null, 1036012),
('ramayana-1-36-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 13', 'इत्येतद्वचनं श्रुत्वा दिव्यं रूपमधारयत्।
स तस्या महिमां दृष्ट्वा समन्तादवकीर्यत॥', 'ity etad vacanaṃ śrutvā divyaṃ rūpam adhārayat
sa tasyā mahimāṃ dṛṣṭvā samantād avakīryata', null, 1036013),
('ramayana-1-36-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 14', 'समन्ततस्तदा देवीमभ्यषिञ्चत पावकः।
सर्वस्रोतांसि पूर्णानि गङ्गाया रघुनन्दन॥', 'samantatas tadā devīm abhyaṣiñcata pāvakaḥ
sarvasrotāṃsi pūrṇāni gaṅgāyā raghunandana', null, 1036014),
('ramayana-1-36-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 15', 'तमुवाच ततो गङ्गा सर्वदेवपुरोहितम्।
अशक्ता धारणे देव तव तेजः समुद्धतम्।
दह्यमानाग्निना तेन संप्रव्यथितचेतना॥', 'tam uvāca tato gaṅgā sarvadevapurohitam
aśaktā dhāraṇe deva tava tejaḥ samuddhatam
dahyamānāgninā tena saṃpravyathitacetanā', null, 1036015),
('ramayana-1-36-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 16', 'अथाब्रवीदिदं गङ्गां सर्वदेवहुताशनः।
इह हैमवते पादे गर्भोऽयं संनिवेश्यताम्॥', 'athābravīd idaṃ gaṅgāṃ sarvadevahutāśanaḥ
iha haimavate pāde garbho ''yaṃ saṃniveśyatām', null, 1036016),
('ramayana-1-36-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 17', 'श्रुत्वा त्वग्निवचो गङ्गा तं गर्भमतिभास्वरम्।
उत्ससर्ज महातेजाः स्रोतोभ्यो हि तदानघ॥', 'śrutvā tv agnivaco gaṅgā taṃ garbham atibhāsvaram
utsasarja mahātejāḥ srotobhyo hi tadānagha', null, 1036017),
('ramayana-1-36-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 18', 'यदस्या निर्गतं तस्मात्तप्तजाम्बूनदप्रभम्।
काञ्चनं धरणीं प्राप्तं हिरण्यममलं शुभम्॥', 'yad asyā nirgataṃ tasmāt taptajāmbūnadaprabham
kāñcanaṃ dharaṇīṃ prāptaṃ hiraṇyam amalaṃ śubham', null, 1036018),
('ramayana-1-36-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 19', 'ताम्रं कार्ष्णायसं चैव तैक्ष्ण्यादेवाभिजायत।
मलं तस्याभवत्तत्र त्रपुसीसकमेव च॥', 'tāmraṃ kārṣṇāyasaṃ caiva taikṣṇyād evābhijāyata
malaṃ tasyābhavat tatra trapusīsakam eva ca', null, 1036019),
('ramayana-1-36-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 20', 'तदेतद्धरणीं प्राप्य नानाधातुरवर्धत॥', 'tad etad dharaṇīṃ prāpya nānādhātur avardhata', null, 1036020),
('ramayana-1-36-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 21', 'निक्षिप्तमात्रे गर्भे तु तेजोभिरभिरञ्जितम्।
सर्वं पर्वतसंनद्धं सौवर्णमभवद्वनम्॥', 'nikṣiptamātre garbhe tu tejobhir abhirañjitam
sarvaṃ parvatasaṃnaddhaṃ sauvarṇam abhavad vanam', null, 1036021),
('ramayana-1-36-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 22', 'जातरूपमिति ख्यातं तदा प्रभृति राघव।
सुवर्णं पुरुषव्याघ्र हुताशनसमप्रभम्॥', 'jātarūpam iti khyātaṃ tadā prabhṛti rāghava
suvarṇaṃ puruṣavyāghra hutāśanasamaprabham', null, 1036022),
('ramayana-1-36-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 23', 'तं कुमारं ततो जातं सेन्द्राः सहमरुद्गणाः।
क्षीरसंभावनार्थाय कृत्तिकाः समयोजयन्॥', 'taṃ kumāraṃ tato jātaṃ sendrāḥ sahamarudgaṇāḥ
kṣīrasaṃbhāvanārthāya kṛttikāḥ samayojayan', null, 1036023),
('ramayana-1-36-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 24', 'ताः क्षीरं जातमात्रस्य कृत्वा समयमुत्तमम्।
ददुः पुत्रोऽयमस्माकं सर्वासामिति निश्चिताः॥', 'tāḥ kṣīraṃ jātamātrasya kṛtvā samayam uttamam
daduḥ putro ''yam asmākaṃ sarvāsām iti niścitāḥ', null, 1036024),
('ramayana-1-36-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 25', 'ततस्तु देवताः सर्वाः कार्तिकेय इति ब्रुवन्।
पुत्रस्त्रैलोक्य विख्यातो भविष्यति न संशयः॥', 'tatas tu devatāḥ sarvāḥ kārtikeya iti bruvan
putras trailokya vikhyāto bhaviṣyati na saṃśayaḥ', null, 1036025),
('ramayana-1-36-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 26', 'तेषां तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा स्कन्नं गर्भपरिस्रवे।
स्नापयन्परया लक्ष्म्या दीप्यमानमिवानलम्॥', 'teṣāṃ tad vacanaṃ śrutvā skannaṃ garbhaparisrave
snāpayan parayā lakṣmyā dīpyamānam ivānalam', null, 1036026),
('ramayana-1-36-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 27', 'स्कन्द इत्यब्रुवन्देवाः स्कन्नं गर्भपरिस्रवात्।
कार्तिकेयं महाभागं काकुत्स्थज्वलनोपमम्॥', 'skanda ity abruvan devāḥ skannaṃ garbhaparisravāt
kārtikeyaṃ mahābhāgaṃ kākutsthajvalanopamam', null, 1036027),
('ramayana-1-36-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 28', 'प्रादुर्भूतं ततः क्षीरं कृत्तिकानामनुत्तमम्।
षण्णां षडाननो भूत्वा जग्राह स्तनजं पयः॥', 'prādurbhūtaṃ tataḥ kṣīraṃ kṛttikānām anuttamam
ṣaṇṇāṃ ṣaḍānano bhūtvā jagrāha stanajaṃ payaḥ', null, 1036028),
('ramayana-1-36-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 29', 'गृहीत्वा क्षीरमेकाह्ना सुकुमार वपुस्तदा।
अजयत्स्वेन वीर्येण दैत्यसैन्यगणान्विभुः॥', 'gṛhītvā kṣīram ekāhnā sukumāra vapus tadā
ajayat svena vīryeṇa daityasainyagaṇān vibhuḥ', null, 1036029),
('ramayana-1-36-30', 30, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 30', 'सुरसेनागणपतिं ततस्तममलद्युतिम्।
अभ्यषिञ्चन्सुरगणाः समेत्याग्निपुरोगमाः॥', 'surasenāgaṇapatiṃ tatas tam amaladyutim
abhyaṣiñcan suragaṇāḥ sametyāgnipurogamāḥ', null, 1036030),
('ramayana-1-36-31', 31, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 36, Verse 31', 'एष ते राम गङ्गाया विस्तरोऽभिहितो मया।
कुमारसंभवश्चैव धन्यः पुण्यस्तथैव च॥', 'eṣa te rāma gaṅgāyā vistaro ''bhihito mayā
kumārasaṃbhavaś caiva dhanyaḥ puṇyas tathaiva ca', null, 1036031)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 37 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-37-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 1', 'तां कथां कौशिको रामे निवेद्य मधुराक्षरम्।
पुनरेवापरं वाक्यं काकुत्स्थमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'tāṃ kathāṃ kauśiko rāme nivedya madhurākṣaram
punar evāparaṃ vākyaṃ kākutstham idam abravīt', null, 1037001),
('ramayana-1-37-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 2', 'अयोध्याधिपतिः शूरः पूर्वमासीन्नराधिपः।
सगरो नाम धर्मात्मा प्रजाकामः स चाप्रजः॥', 'ayodhyādhipatiḥ śūraḥ pūrvam āsīn narādhipaḥ
sagaro nāma dharmātmā prajākāmaḥ sa cāprajaḥ', null, 1037002),
('ramayana-1-37-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 3', 'वैदर्भदुहिता राम केशिनी नाम नामतः।
ज्येष्ठा सगरपत्नी सा धर्मिष्ठा सत्यवादिनी॥', 'vaidarbhaduhitā rāma keśinī nāma nāmataḥ
jyeṣṭhā sagarapatnī sā dharmiṣṭhā satyavādinī', null, 1037003),
('ramayana-1-37-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 4', 'अरिष्टनेमिदुहिता रूपेणाप्रतिमा भुवि।
द्वितीया सगरस्यासीत्पत्नी सुमतिसंज्ञिता॥', 'ariṣṭanemiduhitā rūpeṇāpratimā bhuvi
dvitīyā sagarasyāsīt patnī sumatisaṃjñitā', null, 1037004),
('ramayana-1-37-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 5', 'ताभ्यां सह तदा राजा पत्नीभ्यां तप्तवांस्तपः।
हिमवन्तं समासाद्य भृगुप्रस्रवणे गिरौ॥', 'tābhyāṃ saha tadā rājā patnībhyāṃ taptavāṃs tapaḥ
himavantaṃ samāsādya bhṛguprasravaṇe girau', null, 1037005),
('ramayana-1-37-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 6', 'अथ वर्ष शते पूर्णे तपसाराधितो मुनिः।
सगराय वरं प्रादाद्भृगुः सत्यवतां वरः॥', 'atha varṣa śate pūrṇe tapasārādhito muniḥ
sagarāya varaṃ prādād bhṛguḥ satyavatāṃ varaḥ', null, 1037006),
('ramayana-1-37-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 7', 'अपत्यलाभः सुमहान्भविष्यति तवानघ।
कीर्तिं चाप्रतिमां लोके प्राप्स्यसे पुरुषर्षभ॥', 'apatyalābhaḥ sumahān bhaviṣyati tavānagha
kīrtiṃ cāpratimāṃ loke prāpsyase puruṣarṣabha', null, 1037007),
('ramayana-1-37-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 8', 'एका जनयिता तात पुत्रं वंशकरं तव।
षष्टिं पुत्रसहस्राणि अपरा जनयिष्यति॥', 'ekā janayitā tāta putraṃ vaṃśakaraṃ tava
ṣaṣṭiṃ putrasahasrāṇi aparā janayiṣyati', null, 1037008),
('ramayana-1-37-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 9', 'भाषमाणं नरव्याघ्रं राजपत्न्यौ प्रसाद्य तम्।
ऊचतुः परमप्रीते कृताञ्जलिपुटे तदा॥', 'bhāṣamāṇaṃ naravyāghraṃ rājapatnyau prasādya tam
ūcatuḥ paramaprīte kṛtāñjalipuṭe tadā', null, 1037009),
('ramayana-1-37-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 10', 'एकः कस्याः सुतो ब्रह्मन्का बहूञ्जनयिष्यति।
श्रोतुमिच्छावहे ब्रह्मन्सत्यमस्तु वचस्तव॥', 'ekaḥ kasyāḥ suto brahman kā bahūñ janayiṣyati
śrotum icchāvahe brahman satyam astu vacas tava', null, 1037010),
('ramayana-1-37-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 11', 'तयोस्तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा भृगुः परम धार्मिकः।
उवाच परमां वाणीं स्वच्छन्दोऽत्र विधीयताम्॥', 'tayos tad vacanaṃ śrutvā bhṛguḥ parama dhārmikaḥ
uvāca paramāṃ vāṇīṃ svacchando ''tra vidhīyatām', null, 1037011),
('ramayana-1-37-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 12', 'एको वंशकरो वास्तु बहवो वा महाबलाः।
कीर्तिमन्तो महोत्साहाः का वा कं वरमिच्छति॥', 'eko vaṃśakaro vāstu bahavo vā mahābalāḥ
kīrtimanto mahotsāhāḥ kā vā kaṃ varam icchati', null, 1037012),
('ramayana-1-37-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 13', 'मुनेस्तु वचनं श्रुत्वा केशिनी रघुनन्दन।
पुत्रं वंशकरं राम जग्राह नृपसंनिधौ॥', 'munes tu vacanaṃ śrutvā keśinī raghunandana
putraṃ vaṃśakaraṃ rāma jagrāha nṛpasaṃnidhau', null, 1037013),
('ramayana-1-37-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 14', 'षष्टिं पुत्रसहस्राणि सुपर्णभगिनी तदा।
महोत्साहान्कीर्तिमतो जग्राह सुमतिः सुतान्॥', 'ṣaṣṭiṃ putrasahasrāṇi suparṇabhaginī tadā
mahotsāhān kīrtimato jagrāha sumatiḥ sutān', null, 1037014),
('ramayana-1-37-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 15', 'प्रदक्षिणमृषिं कृत्वा शिरसाभिप्रणम्य च।
जगाम स्वपुरं राजा सभार्या रघुनन्दन॥', 'pradakṣiṇam ṛṣiṃ kṛtvā śirasābhipraṇamya ca
jagāma svapuraṃ rājā sabhāryā raghunandana', null, 1037015),
('ramayana-1-37-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 16', 'अथ काले गते तस्मिञ्ज्येष्ठा पुत्रं व्यजायत।
असमञ्ज इति ख्यातं केशिनी सगरात्मजम्॥', 'atha kāle gate tasmiñ jyeṣṭhā putraṃ vyajāyata
asamañja iti khyātaṃ keśinī sagarātmajam', null, 1037016),
('ramayana-1-37-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 17', 'सुमतिस्तु नरव्याघ्र गर्भतुम्बं व्यजायत।
षष्टिः पुत्रसहस्राणि तुम्बभेदाद्विनिःसृताः॥', 'sumatis tu naravyāghra garbhatumbaṃ vyajāyata
ṣaṣṭiḥ putrasahasrāṇi tumbabhedād viniḥsṛtāḥ', null, 1037017),
('ramayana-1-37-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 18', 'घृतपूर्णेषु कुम्भेषु धात्र्यस्तान्समवर्धयन्।
कालेन महता सर्वे यौवनं प्रतिपेदिरे॥', 'ghṛtapūrṇeṣu kumbheṣu dhātryas tān samavardhayan
kālena mahatā sarve yauvanaṃ pratipedire', null, 1037018),
('ramayana-1-37-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 19', 'अथ दीर्घेण कालेन रूपयौवनशालिनः।
षष्टिः पुत्रसहस्राणि सगरस्याभवंस्तदा॥', 'atha dīrgheṇa kālena rūpayauvanaśālinaḥ
ṣaṣṭiḥ putrasahasrāṇi sagarasyābhavaṃs tadā', null, 1037019),
('ramayana-1-37-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 20', 'स च ज्येष्ठो नरश्रेष्ठ सगरस्यात्मसंभवः।
बालान्गृहीत्वा तु जले सरय्वा रघुनन्दन।
प्रक्षिप्य प्रहसन्नित्यं मज्जतस्तान्निरीक्ष्य वै॥', 'sa ca jyeṣṭho naraśreṣṭha sagarasyātmasaṃbhavaḥ
bālān gṛhītvā tu jale sarayvā raghunandana
prakṣipya prahasan nityaṃ majjatas tān nirīkṣya vai', null, 1037020),
('ramayana-1-37-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 21', 'पौराणामहिते युक्तः पित्रा निर्वासितः पुरात्॥', 'paurāṇām ahite yuktaḥ pitrā nirvāsitaḥ purāt', null, 1037021),
('ramayana-1-37-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 22', 'तस्य पुत्रोऽंशुमान्नाम असमञ्जस्य वीर्यवान्।
संमतः सर्वलोकस्य सर्वस्यापि प्रियंवदः॥', 'tasya putro ''ṃśumān nāma asamañjasya vīryavān
saṃmataḥ sarvalokasya sarvasyāpi priyaṃvadaḥ', null, 1037022),
('ramayana-1-37-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 23', 'ततः कालेन महता मतिः समभिजायत।
सगरस्य नरश्रेष्ठ यजेयमिति निश्चिता॥', 'tataḥ kālena mahatā matiḥ samabhijāyata
sagarasya naraśreṣṭha yajeyam iti niścitā', null, 1037023),
('ramayana-1-37-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 37, Verse 24', 'स कृत्वा निश्चयं राजा सोपाध्यायगणस्तदा।
यज्ञकर्मणि वेदज्ञो यष्टुं समुपचक्रमे॥', 'sa kṛtvā niścayaṃ rājā sopādhyāyagaṇas tadā
yajñakarmaṇi vedajño yaṣṭuṃ samupacakrame', null, 1037024)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 38 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-38-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 1', 'विश्वामित्रवचः श्रुत्वा कथान्ते रघुनन्दन।
उवाच परमप्रीतो मुनिं दीप्तमिवानलम्॥', 'viśvāmitravacaḥ śrutvā kathānte raghunandana
uvāca paramaprīto muniṃ dīptam ivānalam', null, 1038001),
('ramayana-1-38-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 2', 'श्रोतुमिछामि भद्रं ते विस्तरेण कथामिमाम्।
पूर्वको मे कथं ब्रह्मन्यज्ञं वै समुपाहरत्॥', 'śrotum ichāmi bhadraṃ te vistareṇa kathām imām
pūrvako me kathaṃ brahman yajñaṃ vai samupāharat', null, 1038002),
('ramayana-1-38-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 3', 'विश्वामित्रस्तु काकुत्स्थमुवाच प्रहसन्निव।
श्रूयतां विस्तरो राम सगरस्य महात्मनः॥', 'viśvāmitras tu kākutstham uvāca prahasann iva
śrūyatāṃ vistaro rāma sagarasya mahātmanaḥ', null, 1038003),
('ramayana-1-38-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 4', 'शंकरश्वशुरो नाम हिमवानचलोत्तमः।
विन्ध्यपर्वतमासाद्य निरीक्षेते परस्परम्॥', 'śaṃkaraśvaśuro nāma himavān acalottamaḥ
vindhyaparvatam āsādya nirīkṣete parasparam', null, 1038004),
('ramayana-1-38-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 5', 'तयोर्मध्ये प्रवृत्तोऽभूद्यज्ञः स पुरुषोत्तम।
स हि देशो नरव्याघ्र प्रशस्तो यज्ञकर्मणि॥', 'tayor madhye pravṛtto ''bhūd yajñaḥ sa puruṣottama
sa hi deśo naravyāghra praśasto yajñakarmaṇi', null, 1038005),
('ramayana-1-38-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 6', 'तस्याश्वचर्यां काकुत्स्थ दृढधन्वा महारथः।
अंशुमानकरोत्तात सगरस्य मते स्थितः॥', 'tasyāśvacaryāṃ kākutstha dṛḍhadhanvā mahārathaḥ
aṃśumān akarot tāta sagarasya mate sthitaḥ', null, 1038006),
('ramayana-1-38-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 7', 'तस्य पर्वणि तं यज्ञं यजमानस्य वासवः।
राक्षसीं तनुमास्थाय यज्ञियाश्वमपाहरत्॥', 'tasya parvaṇi taṃ yajñaṃ yajamānasya vāsavaḥ
rākṣasīṃ tanum āsthāya yajñiyāśvam apāharat', null, 1038007),
('ramayana-1-38-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 8', 'ह्रियमाणे तु काकुत्स्थ तस्मिन्नश्वे महात्मनः।
उपाध्याय गणाः सर्वे यजमानमथाब्रुवन्॥', 'hriyamāṇe tu kākutstha tasminn aśve mahātmanaḥ
upādhyāya gaṇāḥ sarve yajamānam athābruvan', null, 1038008),
('ramayana-1-38-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 9', 'अयं पर्वणि वेगेन यज्ञियाश्वोऽपनीयते।
हर्तारं जहि काकुत्स्थ हयश्चैवोपनीयताम्॥', 'ayaṃ parvaṇi vegena yajñiyāśvo ''panīyate
hartāraṃ jahi kākutstha hayaś caivopanīyatām', null, 1038009),
('ramayana-1-38-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 10', 'यज्ञच्छिद्रं भवत्येतत्सर्वेषामशिवाय नः।
तत्तथा क्रियतां राजन्यथाछिद्रः क्रतुर्भवेत्॥', 'yajñac chidraṃ bhavaty etat sarveṣām aśivāya naḥ
tat tathā kriyatāṃ rājan yathāchidraḥ kratur bhavet', null, 1038010),
('ramayana-1-38-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 11', 'उपाध्याय वचः श्रुत्वा तस्मिन्सदसि पार्थिवः।
षष्टिं पुत्रसहस्राणि वाक्यमेतदुवाच ह॥', 'upādhyāya vacaḥ śrutvā tasmin sadasi pārthivaḥ
ṣaṣṭiṃ putrasahasrāṇi vākyam etad uvāca ha', null, 1038011),
('ramayana-1-38-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 12', 'गतिं पुत्रा न पश्यामि रक्षसां पुरुषर्षभाः।
मन्त्रपूतैर्महाभागैरास्थितो हि महाक्रतुः॥', 'gatiṃ putrā na paśyāmi rakṣasāṃ puruṣarṣabhāḥ
mantrapūtair mahābhāgair āsthito hi mahākratuḥ', null, 1038012),
('ramayana-1-38-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 13', 'तद्गच्छत विचिन्वध्वं पुत्रका भद्रमस्तु वः।
समुद्रमालिनीं सर्वां पृथिवीमनुगच्छत॥', 'tad gacchata vicinvadhvaṃ putrakā bhadram astu vaḥ
samudramālinīṃ sarvāṃ pṛthivīm anugacchata', null, 1038013),
('ramayana-1-38-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 14', 'एकैकं योजनं पुत्रा विस्तारमभिगच्छत॥', 'ekaikaṃ yojanaṃ putrā vistāram abhigacchata', null, 1038014),
('ramayana-1-38-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 15', 'यावत्तुरगसंदर्शस्तावत्खनत मेदिनीम्।
तमेव हयहर्तारं मार्गमाणा ममाज्ञया॥', 'yāvat turagasaṃdarśas tāvat khanata medinīm
tam eva hayahartāraṃ mārgamāṇā mamājñayā', null, 1038015),
('ramayana-1-38-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 16', 'दीक्षितः पौत्रसहितः सोपाध्यायगणो ह्यहम्।
इह स्थास्यामि भद्रं वो यावत्तुरगदर्शनम्॥', 'dīkṣitaḥ pautrasahitaḥ sopādhyāyagaṇo hy aham
iha sthāsyāmi bhadraṃ vo yāvat turagadarśanam', null, 1038016),
('ramayana-1-38-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 17', 'इत्युक्त्वा हृष्टमनसो राजपुत्रा महाबलाः।
जग्मुर्महीतलं राम पितुर्वचनयन्त्रिताः॥', 'ity uktvā hṛṣṭamanaso rājaputrā mahābalāḥ
jagmur mahītalaṃ rāma pitur vacanayantritāḥ', null, 1038017),
('ramayana-1-38-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 18', 'योजनायामविस्तारमेकैको धरणीतलम्।
बिभिदुः पुरुषव्याघ्र वज्रस्पर्शसमैर्भुजैः॥', 'yojanāyām avistāram ekaiko dharaṇītalam
bibhiduḥ puruṣavyāghra vajrasparśasamair bhujaiḥ', null, 1038018),
('ramayana-1-38-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 19', 'शूलैरशनिकल्पैश्च हलैश्चापि सुदारुणैः।
भिद्यमाना वसुमती ननाद रघुनन्दन॥', 'śūlair aśanikalpaiś ca halaiś cāpi sudāruṇaiḥ
bhidyamānā vasumatī nanāda raghunandana', null, 1038019),
('ramayana-1-38-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 20', 'नागानां वध्यमानानामसुराणां च राघव।
राक्षसानां च दुर्धर्षः सत्त्वानां निनदोऽभवत्॥', 'nāgānāṃ vadhyamānānām asurāṇāṃ ca rāghava
rākṣasānāṃ ca durdharṣaḥ sattvānāṃ ninado ''bhavat', null, 1038020),
('ramayana-1-38-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 21', 'योजनानां सहस्राणि षष्टिं तु रघुनन्दन।
बिभिदुर्धरणीं वीरा रसातलमनुत्तमम्॥', 'yojanānāṃ sahasrāṇi ṣaṣṭiṃ tu raghunandana
bibhidur dharaṇīṃ vīrā rasātalam anuttamam', null, 1038021),
('ramayana-1-38-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 22', 'एवं पर्वतसंबाधं जम्बूद्वीपं नृपात्मजाः।
खनन्तो नृपशार्दूल सर्वतः परिचक्रमुः॥', 'evaṃ parvatasaṃbādhaṃ jambūdvīpaṃ nṛpātmajāḥ
khananto nṛpaśārdūla sarvataḥ paricakramuḥ', null, 1038022),
('ramayana-1-38-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 23', 'ततो देवाः सगन्धर्वाः सासुराः सहपन्नगाः।
संभ्रान्तमनसः सर्वे पितामहमुपागमन्॥', 'tato devāḥ sagandharvāḥ sāsurāḥ sahapannagāḥ
saṃbhrāntamanasaḥ sarve pitāmaham upāgaman', null, 1038023),
('ramayana-1-38-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 24', 'ते प्रसाद्य महात्मानं विषण्णवदनास्तदा।
ऊचुः परमसंत्रस्ताः पितामहमिदं वचः॥', 'te prasādya mahātmānaṃ viṣaṇṇavadanās tadā
ūcuḥ paramasaṃtrastāḥ pitāmaham idaṃ vacaḥ', null, 1038024),
('ramayana-1-38-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 25', 'भगवन्पृथिवी सर्वा खन्यते सगरात्मजैः।
बहवश्च महात्मानो वध्यन्ते जलचारिणः॥', 'bhagavan pṛthivī sarvā khanyate sagarātmajaiḥ
bahavaś ca mahātmāno vadhyante jalacāriṇaḥ', null, 1038025),
('ramayana-1-38-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 38, Verse 26', 'अयं यज्ञहनोऽस्माकमनेनाश्वोऽपनीयते।
इति ते सर्वभूतानि निघ्नन्ति सगरात्मजः॥', 'ayaṃ yajñahano ''smākam anenāśvo ''panīyate
iti te sarvabhūtāni nighnanti sagarātmajaḥ', null, 1038026)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 39 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-39-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 1', 'देवतानां वचः श्रुत्वा भगवान्वै पितामहः।
प्रत्युवाच सुसंत्रस्तान्कृतान्तबलमोहितान्॥', 'devatānāṃ vacaḥ śrutvā bhagavān vai pitāmahaḥ
pratyuvāca susaṃtrastān kṛtāntabalamohitān', null, 1039001),
('ramayana-1-39-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 2', 'यस्येयं वसुधा कृत्स्ना वासुदेवस्य धीमतः।
कापिलं रूपमास्थाय धारयत्यनिशं धराम्॥', 'yasyeyaṃ vasudhā kṛtsnā vāsudevasya dhīmataḥ
kāpilaṃ rūpam āsthāya dhārayaty aniśaṃ dharām', null, 1039002),
('ramayana-1-39-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 3', 'पृथिव्याश्चापि निर्भेदो दृष्ट एव सनातनः।
सगरस्य च पुत्राणां विनाशोऽदीर्घजीविनाम्॥', 'pṛthivyāś cāpi nirbhedo dṛṣṭa eva sanātanaḥ
sagarasya ca putrāṇāṃ vināśo ''dīrghajīvinām', null, 1039003),
('ramayana-1-39-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 4', 'पितामहवचः श्रुत्वा त्रयस्त्रिंशदरिंदमः।
देवाः परमसंहृष्टाः पुनर्जग्मुर्यथागतम्॥', 'pitāmahavacaḥ śrutvā trayas triṃśad ariṃdamaḥ
devāḥ paramasaṃhṛṣṭāḥ punar jagmur yathāgatam', null, 1039004),
('ramayana-1-39-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 5', 'सगरस्य च पुत्राणां प्रादुरासीन्महात्मनाम्।
पृथिव्यां भिद्यमानायां निर्घातसमनिस्वनः॥', 'sagarasya ca putrāṇāṃ prādur āsīn mahātmanām
pṛthivyāṃ bhidyamānāyāṃ nirghātasamanisvanaḥ', null, 1039005),
('ramayana-1-39-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 6', 'ततो भित्त्वा महीं सर्वां कृत्वा चापि प्रदक्षिणम्।
सहिताः सगराः सर्वे पितरं वाक्यमब्रुवन्॥', 'tato bhittvā mahīṃ sarvāṃ kṛtvā cāpi pradakṣiṇam
sahitāḥ sagarāḥ sarve pitaraṃ vākyam abruvan', null, 1039006),
('ramayana-1-39-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 7', 'परिक्रान्ता मही सर्वा सत्त्ववन्तश्च सूदिताः।
देवदानवरक्षांसि पिशाचोरगकिंनराः॥', 'parikrāntā mahī sarvā sattvavantaś ca sūditāḥ
devadānavarakṣāṃsi piśācoragakiṃnarāḥ', null, 1039007),
('ramayana-1-39-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 8', 'न च पश्यामहेऽश्वं तमश्वहर्तारमेव च।
किं करिष्याम भद्रं ते बुद्धिरत्र विचार्यताम्॥', 'na ca paśyāmahe ''śvaṃ tam aśvahartāram eva ca
kiṃ kariṣyāma bhadraṃ te buddhir atra vicāryatām', null, 1039008),
('ramayana-1-39-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 9', 'तेषां तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा पुत्राणां राजसत्तमः।
समन्युरब्रवीद्वाक्यं सगरो रघुनन्दन॥', 'teṣāṃ tad vacanaṃ śrutvā putrāṇāṃ rājasattamaḥ
samanyur abravīd vākyaṃ sagaro raghunandana', null, 1039009),
('ramayana-1-39-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 10', 'भूयः खनत भद्रं वो निर्भिद्य वसुधातलम्।
अश्वहर्तारमासाद्य कृतार्थाश्च निवर्तथ॥', 'bhūyaḥ khanata bhadraṃ vo nirbhidya vasudhātalam
aśvahartāram āsādya kṛtārthāś ca nivartatha', null, 1039010),
('ramayana-1-39-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 11', 'पितुर्वचनमास्थाय सगरस्य महात्मनः।
षष्टिः पुत्रसहस्राणि रसातलमभिद्रवन्॥', 'pitur vacanam āsthāya sagarasya mahātmanaḥ
ṣaṣṭiḥ putrasahasrāṇi rasātalam abhidravan', null, 1039011),
('ramayana-1-39-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 12', 'खन्यमाने ततस्तस्मिन्ददृशुः पर्वतोपमम्।
दिशागजं विरूपाक्षं धारयन्तं महीतलम्॥', 'khanyamāne tatas tasmin dadṛśuḥ parvatopamam
diśāgajaṃ virūpākṣaṃ dhārayantaṃ mahītalam', null, 1039012),
('ramayana-1-39-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 13', 'सपर्वतवनां कृत्स्नां पृथिवीं रघुनन्दन।
शिरसा धारयामास विरूपाक्षो महागजः॥', 'saparvatavanāṃ kṛtsnāṃ pṛthivīṃ raghunandana
śirasā dhārayām āsa virūpākṣo mahāgajaḥ', null, 1039013),
('ramayana-1-39-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 14', 'यदा पर्वणि काकुत्स्थ विश्रमार्थं महागजः।
खेदाच्चालयते शीर्षं भूमिकम्पस्तधा भवेत्॥', 'yadā parvaṇi kākutstha viśramārthaṃ mahāgajaḥ
khedāc cālayate śīrṣaṃ bhūmikampas tadhā bhavet', null, 1039014),
('ramayana-1-39-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 15', 'तं ते प्रदक्षिणं कृत्वा दिशापालं महागजम्।
मानयन्तो हि ते राम जग्मुर्भित्त्वा रसातलम्॥', 'taṃ te pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā diśāpālaṃ mahāgajam
mānayanto hi te rāma jagmur bhittvā rasātalam', null, 1039015),
('ramayana-1-39-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 16', 'ततः पूर्वां दिशं भित्त्वा दक्षिणां बिभिदुः पुनः।
दक्षिणस्यामपि दिशि ददृशुस्ते महागजम्॥', 'tataḥ pūrvāṃ diśaṃ bhittvā dakṣiṇāṃ bibhiduḥ punaḥ
dakṣiṇasyām api diśi dadṛśus te mahāgajam', null, 1039016),
('ramayana-1-39-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 17', 'महापद्मं महात्मानं सुमहापर्वतोपमम्।
शिरसा धारयन्तं ते विस्मयं जग्मुरुत्तमम्॥', 'mahāpadmaṃ mahātmānaṃ sumahāparvatopamam
śirasā dhārayantaṃ te vismayaṃ jagmur uttamam', null, 1039017),
('ramayana-1-39-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 18', 'ततः प्रदक्षिणं कृत्वा सगरस्य महात्मनः।
षष्टिः पुत्रसहस्राणि पश्चिमां बिभिदुर्दिशम्॥', 'tataḥ pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā sagarasya mahātmanaḥ
ṣaṣṭiḥ putrasahasrāṇi paścimāṃ bibhidur diśam', null, 1039018),
('ramayana-1-39-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 19', 'पश्चिमायामपि दिशि महान्तमचलोपमम्।
दिशागजं सौमनसं ददृशुस्ते महाबलाः॥', 'paścimāyām api diśi mahāntam acalopamam
diśāgajaṃ saumanasaṃ dadṛśus te mahābalāḥ', null, 1039019),
('ramayana-1-39-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 20', 'तं ते प्रदक्षिणं कृत्वा पृष्ट्वा चापि निरामयम्।
खनन्तः समुपक्रान्ता दिशं सोमवतीं तदा॥', 'taṃ te pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā pṛṣṭvā cāpi nirāmayam
khanantaḥ samupakrāntā diśaṃ somavatīṃ tadā', null, 1039020),
('ramayana-1-39-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 21', 'उत्तरस्यां रघुश्रेष्ठ ददृशुर्हिमपाण्डुरम्।
भद्रं भद्रेण वपुषा धारयन्तं महीमिमाम्॥', 'uttarasyāṃ raghuśreṣṭha dadṛśur himapāṇḍuram
bhadraṃ bhadreṇa vapuṣā dhārayantaṃ mahīm imām', null, 1039021),
('ramayana-1-39-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 22', 'समालभ्य ततः सर्वे कृत्वा चैनं प्रदक्षिणम्।
षष्टिः पुत्रसहस्राणि बिभिदुर्वसुधातलम्॥', 'samālabhya tataḥ sarve kṛtvā cainaṃ pradakṣiṇam
ṣaṣṭiḥ putrasahasrāṇi bibhidur vasudhātalam', null, 1039022),
('ramayana-1-39-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 23', 'ततः प्रागुत्तरां गत्वा सागराः प्रथितां दिशम्।
रोषादभ्यखनन्सर्वे पृथिवीं सगरात्मजाः॥', 'tataḥ prāguttarāṃ gatvā sāgarāḥ prathitāṃ diśam
roṣād abhyakhanan sarve pṛthivīṃ sagarātmajāḥ', null, 1039023),
('ramayana-1-39-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 24', 'ददृशुः कपिलं तत्र वासुदेवं सनातनम्।
हयं च तस्य देवस्य चरन्तमविदूरतः॥', 'dadṛśuḥ kapilaṃ tatra vāsudevaṃ sanātanam
hayaṃ ca tasya devasya carantam avidūrataḥ', null, 1039024),
('ramayana-1-39-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 25', 'ते तं यज्ञहनं ज्ञात्वा क्रोधपर्याकुलेक्षणाः।
अभ्यधावन्त संक्रुद्धास्तिष्ठ तिष्ठेति चाब्रुवन्॥', 'te taṃ yajñahanaṃ jñātvā krodhaparyākulekṣaṇāḥ
abhyadhāvanta saṃkruddhās tiṣṭha tiṣṭheti cābruvan', null, 1039025),
('ramayana-1-39-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 26', 'अस्माकं त्वं हि तुरगं यज्ञियं हृतवानसि।
दुर्मेधस्त्वं हि संप्राप्तान्विद्धि नः सगरात्मजान्॥', 'asmākaṃ tvaṃ hi turagaṃ yajñiyaṃ hṛtavān asi
durmedhas tvaṃ hi saṃprāptān viddhi naḥ sagarātmajān', null, 1039026),
('ramayana-1-39-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 27', 'श्रुत्वा तद्वचनं तेषां कपिलो रघुनन्दन।
रोषेण महताविष्टो हुंकारमकरोत्तदा॥', 'śrutvā tad vacanaṃ teṣāṃ kapilo raghunandana
roṣeṇa mahatāviṣṭo huṃkāram akarot tadā', null, 1039027),
('ramayana-1-39-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 39, Verse 28', 'ततस्तेनाप्रमेयेन कपिलेन महात्मना।
भस्मराशीकृताः सर्वे काकुत्स्थ सगरात्मजाः॥', 'tatas tenāprameyena kapilena mahātmanā
bhasmarāśīkṛtāḥ sarve kākutstha sagarātmajāḥ', null, 1039028)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 40 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-40-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 1', 'पुत्रांश्चिरगताञ्ज्ञात्वा सगरो रघुनन्दन।
नप्तारमब्रवीद्राजा दीप्यमानं स्वतेजसा॥', 'putrāṃś ciragatāñ jñātvā sagaro raghunandana
naptāram abravīd rājā dīpyamānaṃ svatejasā', null, 1040001),
('ramayana-1-40-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 2', 'शूरश्च कृतविद्यश्च पूर्वैस्तुल्योऽसि तेजसा।
पितॄणां गतिमन्विच्छ येन चाश्वोऽपहारितः॥', 'śūraś ca kṛtavidyaś ca pūrvais tulyo ''si tejasā
pitṝṇāṃ gatim anviccha yena cāśvo ''pahāritaḥ', null, 1040002),
('ramayana-1-40-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 3', 'अन्तर्भौमानि सत्त्वानि वीर्यवन्ति महान्ति च।
तेषां त्वं प्रतिघातार्थं सासिं गृह्णीष्व कार्मुकम्॥', 'antarbhaumāni sattvāni vīryavanti mahānti ca
teṣāṃ tvaṃ pratighātārthaṃ sāsiṃ gṛhṇīṣva kārmukam', null, 1040003),
('ramayana-1-40-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 4', 'अभिवाद्याभिवाद्यांस्त्वं हत्वा विघ्नकरानपि।
सिद्धार्थः संनिवर्तस्व मम यज्ञस्य पारगः॥', 'abhivādyābhivādyāṃs tvaṃ hatvā vighnakarān api
siddhārthaḥ saṃnivartasva mama yajñasya pāragaḥ', null, 1040004),
('ramayana-1-40-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 5', 'एवमुक्तोऽंशुमान्सम्यक्सगरेण महात्मना।
धनुरादाय खड्गं च जगाम लघुविक्रमः॥', 'evam ukto ''ṃśumān samyak sagareṇa mahātmanā
dhanur ādāya khaḍgaṃ ca jagāma laghuvikramaḥ', null, 1040005),
('ramayana-1-40-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 6', 'स खातं पितृभिर्मार्गमन्तर्भौमं महात्मभिः।
प्रापद्यत नरश्रेष्ठ तेन राज्ञाभिचोदितः॥', 'sa khātaṃ pitṛbhir mārgam antarbhaumaṃ mahātmabhiḥ
prāpadyata naraśreṣṭha tena rājñābhicoditaḥ', null, 1040006),
('ramayana-1-40-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 7', 'दैत्यदानवरक्षोभिः पिशाचपतगोरगैः।
पूज्यमानं महातेजा दिशागजमपश्यत॥', 'daityadānavarakṣobhiḥ piśācapatagoragaiḥ
pūjyamānaṃ mahātejā diśāgajam apaśyata', null, 1040007),
('ramayana-1-40-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 8', 'स तं प्रदक्षिणं कृत्वा पृष्ट्वा चैव निरामयम्।
पितॄन्स परिपप्रच्छ वाजिहर्तारमेव च॥', 'sa taṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā pṛṣṭvā caiva nirāmayam
pitṝn sa paripapraccha vājihartāram eva ca', null, 1040008),
('ramayana-1-40-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 9', 'दिशागजस्तु तच्छ्रुत्वा प्रीत्याहांशुमतो वचः।
आसमञ्जकृतार्थस्त्वं सहाश्वः शीघ्रमेष्यसि॥', 'diśāgajas tu tac chrutvā prītyāhāṃśumato vacaḥ
āsamañjakṛtārthas tvaṃ sahāśvaḥ śīghram eṣyasi', null, 1040009),
('ramayana-1-40-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 10', 'तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा सर्वानेव दिशागजान्।
यथाक्रमं यथान्यायं प्रष्टुं समुपचक्रमे॥', 'tasya tad vacanaṃ śrutvā sarvān eva diśāgajān
yathākramaṃ yathānyāyaṃ praṣṭuṃ samupacakrame', null, 1040010),
('ramayana-1-40-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 11', 'तैश्च सर्वैर्दिशापालैर्वाक्यज्ञैर्वाक्यकोविदैः।
पूजितः सहयश्चैव गन्तासीत्यभिचोदितः॥', 'taiś ca sarvair diśāpālair vākyajñair vākyakovidaiḥ
pūjitaḥ sahayaś caiva gantāsīty abhicoditaḥ', null, 1040011),
('ramayana-1-40-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 12', 'तेषां तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा जगाम लघुविक्रमः।
भस्मराशीकृता यत्र पितरस्तस्य सागराः॥', 'teṣāṃ tad vacanaṃ śrutvā jagāma laghuvikramaḥ
bhasmarāśīkṛtā yatra pitaras tasya sāgarāḥ', null, 1040012),
('ramayana-1-40-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 13', 'स दुःखवशमापन्नस्त्वसमञ्जसुतस्तदा।
चुक्रोश परमार्तस्तु वधात्तेषां सुदुःखितः॥', 'sa duḥkhavaśam āpannas tv asamañjasutas tadā
cukrośa paramārtas tu vadhāt teṣāṃ suduḥkhitaḥ', null, 1040013),
('ramayana-1-40-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 14', 'यज्ञियं च हयं तत्र चरन्तमविदूरतः।
ददर्श पुरुषव्याघ्रो दुःखशोकसमन्वितः॥', 'yajñiyaṃ ca hayaṃ tatra carantam avidūrataḥ
dadarśa puruṣavyāghro duḥkhaśokasamanvitaḥ', null, 1040014),
('ramayana-1-40-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 15', 'ददर्श पुरुषव्याघ्रो कर्तुकामो जलक्रियाम्।
सलिलार्थी महातेजा न चापश्यज्जलाशयम्॥', 'dadarśa puruṣavyāghro kartukāmo jalakriyām
salilārthī mahātejā na cāpaśyaj jalāśayam', null, 1040015),
('ramayana-1-40-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 16', 'विसार्य निपुणां दृष्टिं ततोऽपश्यत्खगाधिपम्।
पितॄणां मातुलं राम सुपर्णमनिलोपमम्॥', 'visārya nipuṇāṃ dṛṣṭiṃ tato ''paśyat khagādhipam
pitṝṇāṃ mātulaṃ rāma suparṇam anilopamam', null, 1040016),
('ramayana-1-40-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 17', 'स चैनमब्रवीद्वाक्यं वैनतेयो महाबलः।
मा शुचः पुरुषव्याघ्र वधोऽयं लोकसंमतः॥', 'sa cainam abravīd vākyaṃ vainateyo mahābalaḥ
mā śucaḥ puruṣavyāghra vadho ''yaṃ lokasaṃmataḥ', null, 1040017),
('ramayana-1-40-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 18', 'कपिलेनाप्रमेयेन दग्धा हीमे महाबलाः।
सलिलं नार्हसि प्राज्ञ दातुमेषां हि लौकिकम्॥', 'kapilenāprameyena dagdhā hīme mahābalāḥ
salilaṃ nārhasi prājña dātum eṣāṃ hi laukikam', null, 1040018),
('ramayana-1-40-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 19', 'गङ्गा हिमवतो ज्येष्ठा दुहिता पुरुषर्षभ।
भस्मराशीकृतानेतान्पावयेल्लोकपावनी॥', 'gaṅgā himavato jyeṣṭhā duhitā puruṣarṣabha
bhasmarāśīkṛtān etān pāvayel lokapāvanī', null, 1040019),
('ramayana-1-40-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 20', 'तया क्लिन्नमिदं भस्म गङ्गया लोककान्तया।
षष्टिं पुत्रसहस्राणि स्वर्गलोकं नयिष्यति॥', 'tayā klinnam idaṃ bhasma gaṅgayā lokakāntayā
ṣaṣṭiṃ putrasahasrāṇi svargalokaṃ nayiṣyati', null, 1040020),
('ramayana-1-40-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 21', 'गच्छ चाश्वं महाभाग संगृह्य पुरुषर्षभ।
यज्ञं पैतामहं वीर निर्वर्तयितुमर्हसि॥', 'gaccha cāśvaṃ mahābhāga saṃgṛhya puruṣarṣabha
yajñaṃ paitāmahaṃ vīra nirvartayitum arhasi', null, 1040021),
('ramayana-1-40-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 22', 'सुपर्णवचनं श्रुत्वा सोऽंशुमानतिवीर्यवान्।
त्वरितं हयमादाय पुनरायान्महायशाः॥', 'suparṇavacanaṃ śrutvā so ''ṃśumān ativīryavān
tvaritaṃ hayam ādāya punar āyān mahāyaśāḥ', null, 1040022),
('ramayana-1-40-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 23', 'ततो राजानमासाद्य दीक्षितं रघुनन्दन।
न्यवेदयद्यथावृत्तं सुपर्णवचनं तथा॥', 'tato rājānam āsādya dīkṣitaṃ raghunandana
nyavedayad yathāvṛttaṃ suparṇavacanaṃ tathā', null, 1040023),
('ramayana-1-40-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 24', 'तच्छ्रुत्वा घोरसंकाशं वाक्यमंशुमतो नृपः।
यज्ञं निर्वर्तयामास यथाकल्पं यथाविधि॥', 'tac chrutvā ghorasaṃkāśaṃ vākyam aṃśumato nṛpaḥ
yajñaṃ nirvartayām āsa yathākalpaṃ yathāvidhi', null, 1040024),
('ramayana-1-40-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 25', 'स्वपुरं चागमच्छ्रीमानिष्टयज्ञो महीपतिः।
गङ्गायाश्चागमे राजा निश्चयं नाध्यगच्छत॥', 'svapuraṃ cāgamac chrīmān iṣṭayajño mahīpatiḥ
gaṅgāyāś cāgame rājā niścayaṃ nādhyagacchata', null, 1040025),
('ramayana-1-40-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 40, Verse 26', 'अगत्वा निश्चयं राजा कालेन महता महान्।
त्रिंशद्वर्षसहस्राणि राज्यं कृत्वा दिवं गतः॥', 'agatvā niścayaṃ rājā kālena mahatā mahān
triṃśadvarṣasahasrāṇi rājyaṃ kṛtvā divaṃ gataḥ', null, 1040026)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 41 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-41-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 1', 'कालधर्मं गते राम सगरे प्रकृतीजनाः।
राजानं रोचयामासुरंशुमन्तं सुधार्मिकम्॥', 'kāladharmaṃ gate rāma sagare prakṛtījanāḥ
rājānaṃ rocayām āsur aṃśumantaṃ sudhārmikam', null, 1041001),
('ramayana-1-41-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 2', 'स राजा सुमहानासीदंशुमान्रघुनन्दन।
तस्य पुत्रो महानासीद्दिलीप इति विश्रुतः॥', 'sa rājā sumahān āsīd aṃśumān raghunandana
tasya putro mahān āsīd dilīpa iti viśrutaḥ', null, 1041002),
('ramayana-1-41-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 3', 'तस्मिन्राज्यं समावेश्य दिलीपे रघुनन्दन।
हिमवच्छिखरे रम्ये तपस्तेपे सुदारुणम्॥', 'tasmin rājyaṃ samāveśya dilīpe raghunandana
himavacchikhare ramye tapas tepe sudāruṇam', null, 1041003),
('ramayana-1-41-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 4', 'द्वात्रिंशच्च सहस्राणि वर्षाणि सुमहायशाः।
तपोवनगतो राजा स्वर्गं लेभे तपोधनः॥', 'dvātriṃśac ca sahasrāṇi varṣāṇi sumahāyaśāḥ
tapovanagato rājā svargaṃ lebhe tapodhanaḥ', null, 1041004),
('ramayana-1-41-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 5', 'दिलीपस्तु महातेजाः श्रुत्वा पैतामहं वधम्।
दुःखोपहतया बुद्ध्या निश्चयं नाध्यगच्छत॥', 'dilīpas tu mahātejāḥ śrutvā paitāmahaṃ vadham
duḥkhopahatayā buddhyā niścayaṃ nādhyagacchata', null, 1041005),
('ramayana-1-41-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 6', 'कथं गङ्गावतरणं कथं तेषां जलक्रिया।
तारयेयं कथं चैतानिति चिन्ता परोऽभवत्॥', 'kathaṃ gaṅgāvataraṇaṃ kathaṃ teṣāṃ jalakriyā
tārayeyaṃ kathaṃ caitān iti cintā paro ''bhavat', null, 1041006),
('ramayana-1-41-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 7', 'तस्य चिन्तयतो नित्यं धर्मेण विदितात्मनः।
पुत्रो भगीरथो नाम जज्ञे परमधार्मिकः॥', 'tasya cintayato nityaṃ dharmeṇa viditātmanaḥ
putro bhagīratho nāma jajñe paramadhārmikaḥ', null, 1041007),
('ramayana-1-41-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 8', 'दिलीपस्तु महातेजा यज्ञैर्बहुभिरिष्टवान्।
त्रिंशद्वर्षसहस्राणि राजा राज्यमकारयत्॥', 'dilīpas tu mahātejā yajñair bahubhir iṣṭavān
triṃśadvarṣasahasrāṇi rājā rājyam akārayat', null, 1041008),
('ramayana-1-41-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 9', 'अगत्वा निश्चयं राजा तेषामुद्धरणं प्रति।
व्याधिना नरशार्दूल कालधर्ममुपेयिवान्॥', 'agatvā niścayaṃ rājā teṣām uddharaṇaṃ prati
vyādhinā naraśārdūla kāladharmam upeyivān', null, 1041009),
('ramayana-1-41-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 10', 'इन्द्रलोकं गतो राजा स्वार्जितेनैव कर्मणा।
राज्ये भगीरथं पुत्रमभिषिच्य नरर्षभः॥', 'indralokaṃ gato rājā svārjitenaiva karmaṇā
rājye bhagīrathaṃ putram abhiṣicya nararṣabhaḥ', null, 1041010),
('ramayana-1-41-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 11', 'भगीरथस्तु राजर्षिर्धार्मिको रघुनन्दन।
अनपत्यो महातेजाः प्रजाकामः स चाप्रजः॥', 'bhagīrathas tu rājarṣir dhārmiko raghunandana
anapatyo mahātejāḥ prajākāmaḥ sa cāprajaḥ', null, 1041011),
('ramayana-1-41-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 12', 'स तपो दीर्घमातिष्ठद्गोकर्णे रघुनन्दन।
ऊर्ध्वबाहुः पञ्चतपा मासाहारो जितेन्द्रियः॥', 'sa tapo dīrgham ātiṣṭhad gokarṇe raghunandana
ūrdhvabāhuḥ pañcatapā māsāhāro jitendriyaḥ', null, 1041012),
('ramayana-1-41-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 13', 'तस्य वर्षसहस्राणि घोरे तपसि तिष्ठतः।
सुप्रीतो भगवान्ब्रह्मा प्रजानां पतिरीश्वरः॥', 'tasya varṣasahasrāṇi ghore tapasi tiṣṭhataḥ
suprīto bhagavān brahmā prajānāṃ patir īśvaraḥ', null, 1041013),
('ramayana-1-41-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 14', 'ततः सुरगणैः सार्धमुपागम्य पितामहः।
भगीरथं महात्मानं तप्यमानमथाब्रवीत्॥', 'tataḥ suragaṇaiḥ sārdham upāgamya pitāmahaḥ
bhagīrathaṃ mahātmānaṃ tapyamānam athābravīt', null, 1041014),
('ramayana-1-41-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 15', 'भगीरथ महाभाग प्रीतस्तेऽहं जनेश्वर।
तपसा च सुतप्तेन वरं वरय सुव्रत॥', 'bhagīratha mahābhāga prītas te ''haṃ janeśvara
tapasā ca sutaptena varaṃ varaya suvrata', null, 1041015),
('ramayana-1-41-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 16', 'तमुवाच महातेजाः सर्वलोकपितामहम्।
भगीरथो महाभागः कृताञ्जलिरवस्थितः॥', 'tam uvāca mahātejāḥ sarvalokapitāmaham
bhagīratho mahābhāgaḥ kṛtāñjalir avasthitaḥ', null, 1041016),
('ramayana-1-41-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 17', 'यदि मे भगवान्प्रीतो यद्यस्ति तपसः फलम्।
सगरस्यात्मजाः सर्वे मत्तः सलिलमाप्नुयुः॥', 'yadi me bhagavān prīto yady asti tapasaḥ phalam
sagarasyātmajāḥ sarve mattaḥ salilam āpnuyuḥ', null, 1041017),
('ramayana-1-41-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 18', 'गङ्गायाः सलिलक्लिन्ने भस्मन्येषां महात्मनाम्।
स्वर्गं गच्छेयुरत्यन्तं सर्वे मे प्रपितामहाः॥', 'gaṅgāyāḥ salilaklinne bhasmany eṣāṃ mahātmanām
svargaṃ gaccheyur atyantaṃ sarve me prapitāmahāḥ', null, 1041018),
('ramayana-1-41-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 19', 'देया च संततिर्देव नावसीदेत्कुलं च नः।
इक्ष्वाकूणां कुले देव एष मेऽस्तु वरः परः॥', 'deyā ca saṃtatir deva nāvasīdet kulaṃ ca naḥ
ikṣvākūṇāṃ kule deva eṣa me ''stu varaḥ paraḥ', null, 1041019),
('ramayana-1-41-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 20', 'उक्तवाक्यं तु राजानं सर्वलोकपितामहः।
प्रत्युवाच शुभां वाणीं मधुरां मधुराक्षराम्॥', 'uktavākyaṃ tu rājānaṃ sarvalokapitāmahaḥ
pratyuvāca śubhāṃ vāṇīṃ madhurāṃ madhurākṣarām', null, 1041020),
('ramayana-1-41-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 21', 'मनोरथो महानेष भगीरथ महारथ।
एवं भवतु भद्रं ते इक्ष्वाकुकुलवर्धन॥', 'manoratho mahān eṣa bhagīratha mahāratha
evaṃ bhavatu bhadraṃ te ikṣvākukulavardhana', null, 1041021),
('ramayana-1-41-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 22', 'इयं हैमवती गङ्गा ज्येष्ठा हिमवतः सुता।
तां वै धारयितुं राजन्हरस्तत्र नियुज्यताम्॥', 'iyaṃ haimavatī gaṅgā jyeṣṭhā himavataḥ sutā
tāṃ vai dhārayituṃ rājan haras tatra niyujyatām', null, 1041022),
('ramayana-1-41-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 23', 'गङ्गायाः पतनं राजन्पृथिवी न सहिष्यते।
तां वै धारयितुं वीर नान्यं पश्यामि शूलिनः॥', 'gaṅgāyāḥ patanaṃ rājan pṛthivī na sahiṣyate
tāṃ vai dhārayituṃ vīra nānyaṃ paśyāmi śūlinaḥ', null, 1041023),
('ramayana-1-41-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 41, Verse 24', 'तमेवमुक्त्वा राजानं गङ्गां चाभाष्य लोककृत्।
जगाम त्रिदिवं देवः सह सर्वैर्मरुद्गणैः॥', 'tam evam uktvā rājānaṃ gaṅgāṃ cābhāṣya lokakṛt
jagāma tridivaṃ devaḥ saha sarvair marudgaṇaiḥ', null, 1041024)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 42 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-42-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 1', 'देवदेवे गते तस्मिन्सोऽङ्गुष्ठाग्रनिपीडिताम्।
कृत्वा वसुमतीं राम संवत्सरमुपासत॥', 'devadeve gate tasmin so ''ṅguṣṭhāgranipīḍitām
kṛtvā vasumatīṃ rāma saṃvatsaram upāsata', null, 1042001),
('ramayana-1-42-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 2', 'अथ संवत्सरे पूर्णे सर्वलोकनमस्कृतः।
उमापतिः पशुपती राजानमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'atha saṃvatsare pūrṇe sarvalokanamaskṛtaḥ
umāpatiḥ paśupatī rājānam idam abravīt', null, 1042002),
('ramayana-1-42-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 3', 'प्रीतस्तेऽहं नरश्रेष्ठ करिष्यामि तव प्रियम्।
शिरसा धारयिष्यामि शैलराजसुतामहम्॥', 'prītas te ''haṃ naraśreṣṭha kariṣyāmi tava priyam
śirasā dhārayiṣyāmi śailarājasutām aham', null, 1042003),
('ramayana-1-42-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 4', 'ततो हैमवती ज्येष्ठा सर्वलोकनमस्कृता।
तदा सातिमहद्रूपं कृत्वा वेगं च दुःसहम्।
आकाशादपतद्राम शिवे शिवशिरस्युत॥', 'tato haimavatī jyeṣṭhā sarvalokanamaskṛtā
tadā sātimahad rūpaṃ kṛtvā vegaṃ ca duḥsaham
ākāśād apatad rāma śive śivaśirasy uta', null, 1042004),
('ramayana-1-42-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 5', 'नैव सा निर्गमं लेभे जटामण्डलमोहिता।
तत्रैवाबभ्रमद्देवी संवत्सरगणान्बहून्॥', 'naiva sā nirgamaṃ lebhe jaṭāmaṇḍalamohitā
tatraivābabhramad devī saṃvatsaragaṇān bahūn', null, 1042005),
('ramayana-1-42-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 6', 'अनेन तोषितश्चासीदत्यर्थं रघुनन्दन।
विससर्ज ततो गङ्गां हरो बिन्दुसरः प्रति॥', 'anena toṣitaś cāsīd atyarthaṃ raghunandana
visasarja tato gaṅgāṃ haro bindusaraḥ prati', null, 1042006),
('ramayana-1-42-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 7', 'गगनाच्छंकरशिरस्ततो धरणिमागता।
व्यसर्पत जलं तत्र तीव्रशब्दपुरस्कृतम्॥', 'gaganāc chaṃkaraśiras tato dharaṇim āgatā
vyasarpata jalaṃ tatra tīvraśabdapuraskṛtam', null, 1042007),
('ramayana-1-42-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 8', 'ततो देवर्षिगन्धर्वा यक्षाः सिद्धगणास्तथा।
व्यलोकयन्त ते तत्र गगनाद्गां गतां तदा॥', 'tato devarṣigandharvā yakṣāḥ siddhagaṇās tathā
vyalokayanta te tatra gaganād gāṃ gatāṃ tadā', null, 1042008),
('ramayana-1-42-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 9', 'विमानैर्नगराकारैर्हयैर्गजवरैस्तथा।
पारिप्लवगताश्चापि देवतास्तत्र विष्ठिताः॥', 'vimānair nagarākārair hayair gajavarais tathā
pāriplavagatāś cāpi devatās tatra viṣṭhitāḥ', null, 1042009),
('ramayana-1-42-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 10', 'तदद्भुततमं लोके गङ्गापतनमुत्तमम्।
दिदृक्षवो देवगणाः समेयुरमितौजसः॥', 'tad adbhutatamaṃ loke gaṅgāpatanam uttamam
didṛkṣavo devagaṇāḥ sameyur amitaujasaḥ', null, 1042010),
('ramayana-1-42-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 11', 'संपतद्भिः सुरगणैस्तेषां चाभरणौजसा।
शतादित्यमिवाभाति गगनं गततोयदम्॥', 'saṃpatadbhiḥ suragaṇais teṣāṃ cābharaṇaujasā
śatādityam ivābhāti gaganaṃ gatatoyadam', null, 1042011),
('ramayana-1-42-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 12', 'शिंशुमारोरगगणैर्मीनैरपि च चञ्चलैः।
विद्युद्भिरिव विक्षिप्तैराकाशमभवत्तदा॥', 'śiṃśumāroragagaṇair mīnair api ca cañcalaiḥ
vidyudbhir iva vikṣiptair ākāśam abhavat tadā', null, 1042012),
('ramayana-1-42-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 13', 'पाण्डुरैः सलिलोत्पीडैः कीर्यमाणैः सहस्रधा।
शारदाभ्रैरिवाकीर्णं गगनं हंससंप्लवैः॥', 'pāṇḍuraiḥ salilotpīḍaiḥ kīryamāṇaiḥ sahasradhā
śāradābhrair ivākīrṇaṃ gaganaṃ haṃsasaṃplavaiḥ', null, 1042013),
('ramayana-1-42-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 14', 'क्व चिद्द्रुततरं याति कुटिलं क्व चिदायतम्।
विनतं क्व चिदुद्धूतं क्व चिद्याति शनैः शनैः॥', 'kva cid drutataraṃ yāti kuṭilaṃ kva cid āyatam
vinataṃ kva cid uddhūtaṃ kva cid yāti śanaiḥ śanaiḥ', null, 1042014),
('ramayana-1-42-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 15', 'सलिलेनैव सलिलं क्व चिदभ्याहतं पुनः।
मुहुरूर्ध्वपथं गत्वा पपात वसुधां पुनः॥', 'salilenaiva salilaṃ kva cid abhyāhataṃ punaḥ
muhur ūrdhvapathaṃ gatvā papāta vasudhāṃ punaḥ', null, 1042015),
('ramayana-1-42-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 16', 'तच्छंकरशिरोभ्रष्टं भ्रष्टं भूमितले पुनः।
व्यरोचत तदा तोयं निर्मलं गतकल्मषम्॥', 'tac chaṃkaraśirobhraṣṭaṃ bhraṣṭaṃ bhūmitale punaḥ
vyarocata tadā toyaṃ nirmalaṃ gatakalmaṣam', null, 1042016),
('ramayana-1-42-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 17', 'तत्रर्षिगणगन्धर्वा वसुधातलवासिनः।
भवाङ्गपतितं तोयं पवित्रमिति पस्पृशुः॥', 'tatrarṣigaṇagandharvā vasudhātalavāsinaḥ
bhavāṅgapatitaṃ toyaṃ pavitram iti paspṛśuḥ', null, 1042017),
('ramayana-1-42-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 18', 'शापात्प्रपतिता ये च गगनाद्वसुधातलम्।
कृत्वा तत्राभिषेकं ते बभूवुर्गतकल्मषाः॥', 'śāpāt prapatitā ye ca gaganād vasudhātalam
kṛtvā tatrābhiṣekaṃ te babhūvur gatakalmaṣāḥ', null, 1042018),
('ramayana-1-42-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 19', 'धूपपापाः पुनस्तेन तोयेनाथ सुभास्वता।
पुनराकाशमाविश्य स्वांल्लोकान्प्रतिपेदिरे॥', 'dhūpapāpāḥ punas tena toyenātha subhāsvatā
punar ākāśam āviśya svāṃl lokān pratipedire', null, 1042019),
('ramayana-1-42-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 20', 'मुमुदे मुदितो लोकस्तेन तोयेन भास्वता।
कृताभिषेको गङ्गायां बभूव विगतक्लमः॥', 'mumude mudito lokas tena toyena bhāsvatā
kṛtābhiṣeko gaṅgāyāṃ babhūva vigataklamaḥ', null, 1042020),
('ramayana-1-42-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 21', 'भगीरथोऽपि राजर्षिर्दिव्यं स्यन्दनमास्थितः।
प्रायादग्रे महातेजास्तं गङ्गा पृष्ठतोऽन्वगात्॥', 'bhagīratho ''pi rājarṣir divyaṃ syandanam āsthitaḥ
prāyād agre mahātejās taṃ gaṅgā pṛṣṭhato ''nvagāt', null, 1042021),
('ramayana-1-42-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 22', 'देवाः सर्षिगणाः सर्वे दैत्यदानवराक्षसाः।
गन्धर्वयक्षप्रवराः सकिंनरमहोरगाः॥', 'devāḥ sarṣigaṇāḥ sarve daityadānavarākṣasāḥ
gandharvayakṣapravarāḥ sakiṃnaramahoragāḥ', null, 1042022),
('ramayana-1-42-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 23', 'सर्वाश्चाप्सरसो राम भगीरथरथानुगाः।
गङ्गामन्वगमन्प्रीताः सर्वे जलचराश्च ये॥', 'sarvāś cāpsaraso rāma bhagīratharathānugāḥ
gaṅgām anvagaman prītāḥ sarve jalacarāś ca ye', null, 1042023),
('ramayana-1-42-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 42, Verse 24', 'यतो भगीरथो राजा ततो गङ्गा यशस्विनी।
जगाम सरितां श्रेष्ठा सर्वपापविनाशिनी॥', 'yato bhagīratho rājā tato gaṅgā yaśasvinī
jagāma saritāṃ śreṣṭhā sarvapāpavināśinī', null, 1042024)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 43 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-43-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 1', 'स गत्वा सागरं राजा गङ्गयानुगतस्तदा।
प्रविवेश तलं भूमेर्यत्र ते भस्मसात्कृताः॥', 'sa gatvā sāgaraṃ rājā gaṅgayānugatas tadā
praviveśa talaṃ bhūmer yatra te bhasmasātkṛtāḥ', null, 1043001),
('ramayana-1-43-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 2', 'भस्मन्यथाप्लुते राम गङ्गायाः सलिलेन वै।
सर्व लोकप्रभुर्ब्रह्मा राजानमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'bhasmany athāplute rāma gaṅgāyāḥ salilena vai
sarva lokaprabhur brahmā rājānam idam abravīt', null, 1043002),
('ramayana-1-43-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 3', 'तारिता नरशार्दूल दिवं याताश्च देववत्।
षष्टिः पुत्रसहस्राणि सगरस्य महात्मनः॥', 'tāritā naraśārdūla divaṃ yātāś ca devavat
ṣaṣṭiḥ putrasahasrāṇi sagarasya mahātmanaḥ', null, 1043003),
('ramayana-1-43-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 4', 'सागरस्य जलं लोके यावत्स्थास्यति पार्थिव।
सगरस्यात्मजास्तावत्स्वर्गे स्थास्यन्ति देववत्॥', 'sāgarasya jalaṃ loke yāvat sthāsyati pārthiva
sagarasyātmajās tāvat svarge sthāsyanti devavat', null, 1043004),
('ramayana-1-43-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 5', 'इयं च दुहिता ज्येष्ठा तव गङ्गा भविष्यति।
त्वत्कृतेन च नाम्ना वै लोके स्थास्यति विश्रुता॥', 'iyaṃ ca duhitā jyeṣṭhā tava gaṅgā bhaviṣyati
tvatkṛtena ca nāmnā vai loke sthāsyati viśrutā', null, 1043005),
('ramayana-1-43-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 6', 'गङ्गा त्रिपथगा नाम दिव्या भागीरथीति च।
त्रिपथो भावयन्तीति ततस्त्रिपथगा स्मृता॥', 'gaṅgā tripathagā nāma divyā bhāgīrathīti ca
tripatho bhāvayantīti tatas tripathagā smṛtā', null, 1043006),
('ramayana-1-43-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 7', 'पितामहानां सर्वेषां त्वमत्र मनुजाधिप।
कुरुष्व सलिलं राजन्प्रतिज्ञामपवर्जय॥', 'pitāmahānāṃ sarveṣāṃ tvam atra manujādhipa
kuruṣva salilaṃ rājan pratijñām apavarjaya', null, 1043007),
('ramayana-1-43-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 8', 'पूर्वकेण हि ते राजंस्तेनातियशसा तदा।
धर्मिणां प्रवरेणाथ नैष प्राप्तो मनोरथः॥', 'pūrvakeṇa hi te rājaṃs tenātiyaśasā tadā
dharmiṇāṃ pravareṇātha naiṣa prāpto manorathaḥ', null, 1043008),
('ramayana-1-43-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 9', 'तथैवांशुमता तात लोकेऽप्रतिमतेजसा।
गङ्गां प्रार्थयता नेतुं प्रतिज्ञा नापवर्जिता॥', 'tathaivāṃśumatā tāta loke ''pratimatejasā
gaṅgāṃ prārthayatā netuṃ pratijñā nāpavarjitā', null, 1043009),
('ramayana-1-43-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 10', 'राजर्षिणा गुणवता महर्षिसमतेजसा।
मत्तुल्यतपसा चैव क्षत्रधर्मस्थितेन च॥', 'rājarṣiṇā guṇavatā maharṣisamatejasā
mattulyatapasā caiva kṣatradharmasthitena ca', null, 1043010),
('ramayana-1-43-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 11', 'दिलीपेन महाभाग तव पित्रातितेजसा।
पुनर्न शङ्किता नेतुं गङ्गां प्रार्थयतानघ॥', 'dilīpena mahābhāga tava pitrātitejasā
punar na śaṅkitā netuṃ gaṅgāṃ prārthayatānagha', null, 1043011),
('ramayana-1-43-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 12', 'सा त्वया समतिक्रान्ता प्रतिज्ञा पुरुषर्षभ।
प्राप्तोऽसि परमं लोके यशः परमसंमतम्॥', 'sā tvayā samatikrāntā pratijñā puruṣarṣabha
prāpto ''si paramaṃ loke yaśaḥ paramasaṃmatam', null, 1043012),
('ramayana-1-43-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 13', 'यच्च गङ्गावतरणं त्वया कृतमरिंदम।
अनेन च भवान्प्राप्तो धर्मस्यायतनं महत्॥', 'yac ca gaṅgāvataraṇaṃ tvayā kṛtam ariṃdama
anena ca bhavān prāpto dharmasyāyatanaṃ mahat', null, 1043013),
('ramayana-1-43-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 14', 'प्लावयस्व त्वमात्मानं नरोत्तम सदोचिते।
सलिले पुरुषव्याघ्र शुचिः पुण्यफलो भव॥', 'plāvayasva tvam ātmānaṃ narottama sadocite
salile puruṣavyāghra śuciḥ puṇyaphalo bhava', null, 1043014),
('ramayana-1-43-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 15', 'पितामहानां सर्वेषां कुरुष्व सलिलक्रियाम्।
स्वस्ति तेऽस्तु गमिष्यामि स्वं लोकं गम्यतां नृप॥', 'pitāmahānāṃ sarveṣāṃ kuruṣva salilakriyām
svasti te ''stu gamiṣyāmi svaṃ lokaṃ gamyatāṃ nṛpa', null, 1043015),
('ramayana-1-43-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 16', 'इत्येवमुक्त्वा देवेशः सर्वलोकपितामहः।
यथागतं तथागच्छद्देवलोकं महायशाः॥', 'ity evam uktvā deveśaḥ sarvalokapitāmahaḥ
yathāgataṃ tathāgacchad devalokaṃ mahāyaśāḥ', null, 1043016),
('ramayana-1-43-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 17', 'भगीरथोऽपि राजर्षिः कृत्वा सलिलमुत्तमम्।
यथाक्रमं यथान्यायं सागराणां महायशाः।
कृतोदकः शुची राजा स्वपुरं प्रविवेश ह॥', 'bhagīratho ''pi rājarṣiḥ kṛtvā salilam uttamam
yathākramaṃ yathānyāyaṃ sāgarāṇāṃ mahāyaśāḥ
kṛtodakaḥ śucī rājā svapuraṃ praviveśa ha', null, 1043017),
('ramayana-1-43-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 18', 'समृद्धार्थो नरश्रेष्ठ स्वराज्यं प्रशशास ह।
प्रमुमोद च लोकस्तं नृपमासाद्य राघव।
नष्टशोकः समृद्धार्थो बभूव विगतज्वरः॥', 'samṛddhārtho naraśreṣṭha svarājyaṃ praśaśāsa ha
pramumoda ca lokas taṃ nṛpam āsādya rāghava
naṣṭaśokaḥ samṛddhārtho babhūva vigatajvaraḥ', null, 1043018),
('ramayana-1-43-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 19', 'एष ते राम गङ्गाया विस्तरोऽभिहितो मया।
स्वस्ति प्राप्नुहि भद्रं ते संध्याकालोऽतिवर्तते॥', 'eṣa te rāma gaṅgāyā vistaro ''bhihito mayā
svasti prāpnuhi bhadraṃ te saṃdhyākālo ''tivartate', null, 1043019),
('ramayana-1-43-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 43, Verse 20', 'धन्यं यशस्यमायुष्यं स्वर्ग्यं पुत्र्यमथापि च।
इदमाख्यानमाख्यातं गङ्गावतरणं मया॥', 'dhanyaṃ yaśasyam āyuṣyaṃ svargyaṃ putryam athāpi ca
idam ākhyānam ākhyātaṃ gaṅgāvataraṇaṃ mayā', null, 1043020)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 44 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-44-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 1', 'विश्वामित्रवचः श्रुत्वा राघवः सहलक्ष्मणः।
विस्मयं परमं गत्वा विश्वामित्रमथाब्रवीत्॥', 'viśvāmitravacaḥ śrutvā rāghavaḥ sahalakṣmaṇaḥ
vismayaṃ paramaṃ gatvā viśvāmitram athābravīt', null, 1044001),
('ramayana-1-44-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 2', 'अत्यद्भुतमिदं ब्रह्मन्कथितं परमं त्वया।
गङ्गावतरणं पुण्यं सागरस्य च पूरणम्॥', 'atyadbhutam idaṃ brahman kathitaṃ paramaṃ tvayā
gaṅgāvataraṇaṃ puṇyaṃ sāgarasya ca pūraṇam', null, 1044002),
('ramayana-1-44-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 3', 'तस्य सा शर्वरी सर्वा सह सौमित्रिणा तदा।
जगाम चिन्तयानस्य विश्वामित्रकथां शुभाम्॥', 'tasya sā śarvarī sarvā saha saumitriṇā tadā
jagāma cintayānasya viśvāmitrakathāṃ śubhām', null, 1044003),
('ramayana-1-44-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 4', 'ततः प्रभाते विमले विश्वामित्रं महामुनिम्।
उवाच राघवो वाक्यं कृताह्निकमरिंदमः॥', 'tataḥ prabhāte vimale viśvāmitraṃ mahāmunim
uvāca rāghavo vākyaṃ kṛtāhnikam ariṃdamaḥ', null, 1044004),
('ramayana-1-44-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 5', 'गता भगवती रात्रिः श्रोतव्यं परमं श्रुतम्।
क्षणभूतेव सा रात्रिः संवृत्तेयं महातपः।
इमां चिन्तयतः सर्वां निखिलेन कथां तव॥', 'gatā bhagavatī rātriḥ śrotavyaṃ paramaṃ śrutam
kṣaṇabhūteva sā rātriḥ saṃvṛtteyaṃ mahātapaḥ
imāṃ cintayataḥ sarvāṃ nikhilena kathāṃ tava', null, 1044005),
('ramayana-1-44-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 6', 'तराम सरितां श्रेष्ठां पुण्यां त्रिपथगां नदीम्।
नौरेषा हि सुखास्तीर्णा ऋषीणां पुण्यकर्मणाम्।
भगवन्तमिह प्राप्तं ज्ञात्वा त्वरितमागता॥', 'tarāma saritāṃ śreṣṭhāṃ puṇyāṃ tripathagāṃ nadīm
naur eṣā hi sukhāstīrṇā ṛṣīṇāṃ puṇyakarmaṇām
bhagavantam iha prāptaṃ jñātvā tvaritam āgatā', null, 1044006),
('ramayana-1-44-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 7', 'तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा राघवस्य महात्मनः।
संतारं कारयामास सर्षिसंघः सराघवः॥', 'tasya tad vacanaṃ śrutvā rāghavasya mahātmanaḥ
saṃtāraṃ kārayām āsa sarṣisaṃghaḥ sarāghavaḥ', null, 1044007),
('ramayana-1-44-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 8', 'उत्तरं तीरमासाद्य संपूज्यर्षिगणं तथ।
गङ्गाकूले निविष्टास्ते विशालां ददृशुः पुरीम्॥', 'uttaraṃ tīram āsādya saṃpūjyarṣigaṇaṃ tatha
gaṅgākūle niviṣṭās te viśālāṃ dadṛśuḥ purīm', null, 1044008),
('ramayana-1-44-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 9', 'ततो मुनिवरस्तूर्णं जगाम सहराघवः।
विशालां नगरीं रम्यां दिव्यां स्वर्गोपमां तदा॥', 'tato munivaras tūrṇaṃ jagāma saharāghavaḥ
viśālāṃ nagarīṃ ramyāṃ divyāṃ svargopamāṃ tadā', null, 1044009),
('ramayana-1-44-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 10', 'अथ रामो महाप्राज्ञो विश्वामित्रं महामुनिम्।
पप्रच्छ प्राञ्जलिर्भूत्वा विशालामुत्तमां पुरीम्॥', 'atha rāmo mahāprājño viśvāmitraṃ mahāmunim
papraccha prāñjalir bhūtvā viśālām uttamāṃ purīm', null, 1044010),
('ramayana-1-44-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 11', 'कतरो राजवंशोऽयं विशालायां महामुने।
श्रोतुमिच्छामि भद्रं ते परं कौतूहलं हि मे॥', 'kataro rājavaṃśo ''yaṃ viśālāyāṃ mahāmune
śrotum icchāmi bhadraṃ te paraṃ kautūhalaṃ hi me', null, 1044011),
('ramayana-1-44-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 12', 'तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा रामस्य मुनिपुंगवः।
आख्यातुं तत्समारेभे विशालस्य पुरातनम्॥', 'tasya tad vacanaṃ śrutvā rāmasya munipuṃgavaḥ
ākhyātuṃ tat samārebhe viśālasya purātanam', null, 1044012),
('ramayana-1-44-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 13', 'श्रूयतां राम शक्रस्य कथां कथयतः शुभाम्।
अस्मिन्देशे हि यद्वृत्तं शृणु तत्त्वेन राघव॥', 'śrūyatāṃ rāma śakrasya kathāṃ kathayataḥ śubhām
asmin deśe hi yad vṛttaṃ śṛṇu tattvena rāghava', null, 1044013),
('ramayana-1-44-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 14', 'पूर्वं कृतयुगे राम दितेः पुत्रा महाबलाः।
अदितेश्च महाभागा वीर्यवन्तः सुधार्मिकाः॥', 'pūrvaṃ kṛtayuge rāma diteḥ putrā mahābalāḥ
aditeś ca mahābhāgā vīryavantaḥ sudhārmikāḥ', null, 1044014),
('ramayana-1-44-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 15', 'ततस्तेषां नरश्रेष्ठ बुद्धिरासीन्महात्मनाम्।
अमरा निर्जराश्चैव कथं स्याम निरामयाः॥', 'tatas teṣāṃ naraśreṣṭha buddhir āsīn mahātmanām
amarā nirjarāś caiva kathaṃ syāma nirāmayāḥ', null, 1044015),
('ramayana-1-44-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 16', 'तेषां चिन्तयतां राम बुद्धिरासीद्विपश्चिताम्।
क्षीरोदमथनं कृत्वा रसं प्राप्स्याम तत्र वै॥', 'teṣāṃ cintayatāṃ rāma buddhir āsīd vipaścitām
kṣīrodamathanaṃ kṛtvā rasaṃ prāpsyāma tatra vai', null, 1044016),
('ramayana-1-44-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 17', 'ततो निश्चित्य मथनं योक्त्रं कृत्वा च वासुकिम्।
मन्थानं मन्दरं कृत्वा ममन्थुरमितौजसः॥', 'tato niścitya mathanaṃ yoktraṃ kṛtvā ca vāsukim
manthānaṃ mandaraṃ kṛtvā mamanthur amitaujasaḥ', null, 1044017),
('ramayana-1-44-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 18', 'अथ धन्वन्तरिर्नाम अप्सराश्च सुवर्चसः।
अप्सु निर्मथनादेव रसात्तस्माद्वरस्त्रियः।
उत्पेतुर्मनुजश्रेष्ठ तस्मादप्सरसोऽभवन्॥', 'atha dhanvantarir nāma apsarāś ca suvarcasaḥ
apsu nirmathanād eva rasāt tasmād varastriyaḥ
utpetur manujaśreṣṭha tasmād apsaraso ''bhavan', null, 1044018),
('ramayana-1-44-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 19', 'षष्टिः कोट्योऽभवंस्तासामप्सराणां सुवर्चसाम्।
असंख्येयास्तु काकुत्स्थ यास्तासां परिचारिकाः॥', 'ṣaṣṭiḥ koṭyo ''bhavaṃs tāsām apsarāṇāṃ suvarcasām
asaṃkhyeyās tu kākutstha yās tāsāṃ paricārikāḥ', null, 1044019),
('ramayana-1-44-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 20', 'न ताः स्म प्रतिगृह्णन्ति सर्वे ते देवदानवाः।
अप्रतिग्रहणाच्चैव तेन साधारणाः स्मृताः॥', 'na tāḥ sma pratigṛhṇanti sarve te devadānavāḥ
apratigrahaṇāc caiva tena sādhāraṇāḥ smṛtāḥ', null, 1044020),
('ramayana-1-44-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 21', 'वरुणस्य ततः कन्या वारुणी रघुनन्दन।
उत्पपात महाभागा मार्गमाणा परिग्रहम्॥', 'varuṇasya tataḥ kanyā vāruṇī raghunandana
utpapāta mahābhāgā mārgamāṇā parigraham', null, 1044021),
('ramayana-1-44-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 22', 'दितेः पुत्रा न तां राम जगृहुर्वरुणात्मजाम्।
अदितेस्तु सुता वीर जगृहुस्तामनिन्दिताम्॥', 'diteḥ putrā na tāṃ rāma jagṛhur varuṇātmajām
adites tu sutā vīra jagṛhus tām aninditām', null, 1044022),
('ramayana-1-44-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 23', 'असुरास्तेन दैतेयाः सुरास्तेनादितेः सुताः।
हृष्टाः प्रमुदिताश्चासन्वारुणी ग्रहणात्सुराः॥', 'asurās tena daiteyāḥ surās tenāditeḥ sutāḥ
hṛṣṭāḥ pramuditāś cāsan vāruṇī grahaṇāt surāḥ', null, 1044023),
('ramayana-1-44-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 24', 'उच्चैःश्रवा हयश्रेष्ठो मणिरत्नं च कौस्तुभम्।
उदतिष्ठन्नरश्रेष्ठ तथैवामृतमुत्तमम्॥', 'uccaiḥśravā hayaśreṣṭho maṇiratnaṃ ca kaustubham
udatiṣṭhan naraśreṣṭha tathaivāmṛtam uttamam', null, 1044024),
('ramayana-1-44-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 25', 'अथ तस्य कृते राम महानासीत्कुलक्षयः।
अदितेस्तु ततः पुत्रा दितेः पुत्राण सूदयन्॥', 'atha tasya kṛte rāma mahān āsīt kulakṣayaḥ
adites tu tataḥ putrā diteḥ putrāṇa sūdayan', null, 1044025),
('ramayana-1-44-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 26', 'अदितेरात्मजा वीरा दितेः पुत्रान्निजघ्निरे।
तस्मिन्घोरे महायुद्धे दैतेयादित्ययोर्भृशम्॥', 'aditer ātmajā vīrā diteḥ putrān nijaghnire
tasmin ghore mahāyuddhe daiteyādityayor bhṛśam', null, 1044026),
('ramayana-1-44-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 44, Verse 27', 'निहत्य दितिपुत्रांस्तु राज्यं प्राप्य पुरंदरः।
शशास मुदितो लोकान्सर्षिसंघान्सचारणान्॥', 'nihatya ditiputrāṃs tu rājyaṃ prāpya puraṃdaraḥ
śaśāsa mudito lokān sarṣisaṃghān sacāraṇān', null, 1044027)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 45 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-45-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 1', 'हतेषु तेषु पुत्रेषु दितिः परमदुःखिता।
मारीचं काश्यपं राम भर्तारमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'hateṣu teṣu putreṣu ditiḥ paramaduḥkhitā
mārīcaṃ kāśyapaṃ rāma bhartāram idam abravīt', null, 1045001),
('ramayana-1-45-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 2', 'हतपुत्रास्मि भगवंस्तव पुत्रैर्महाबलैः।
शक्रहन्तारमिच्छामि पुत्रं दीर्घतपोऽर्जितम्॥', 'hataputrāsmi bhagavaṃs tava putrair mahābalaiḥ
śakrahantāram icchāmi putraṃ dīrghatapo''rjitam', null, 1045002),
('ramayana-1-45-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 3', 'साहं तपश्चरिष्यामि गर्भं मे दातुमर्हसि।
ईदृशं शक्रहन्तारं त्वमनुज्ञातुमर्हसि॥', 'sāhaṃ tapaś cariṣyāmi garbhaṃ me dātum arhasi
īdṛśaṃ śakrahantāraṃ tvam anujñātum arhasi', null, 1045003),
('ramayana-1-45-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 4', 'तस्यास्तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा मारीचः काश्यपस्तदा।
प्रत्युवाच महातेजा दितिं परमदुःखिताम्॥', 'tasyās tad vacanaṃ śrutvā mārīcaḥ kāśyapas tadā
pratyuvāca mahātejā ditiṃ paramaduḥkhitām', null, 1045004),
('ramayana-1-45-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 5', 'एवं भवतु भद्रं ते शुचिर्भव तपोधने।
जनयिष्यसि पुत्रं त्वं शक्र हन्तारमाहवे॥', 'evaṃ bhavatu bhadraṃ te śucir bhava tapodhane
janayiṣyasi putraṃ tvaṃ śakra hantāram āhave', null, 1045005),
('ramayana-1-45-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 6', 'पूर्णे वर्षसहस्रे तु शुचिर्यदि भविष्यसि।
पुत्रं त्रैलोक्य हन्तारं मत्तस्त्वं जनयिष्यसि॥', 'pūrṇe varṣasahasre tu śucir yadi bhaviṣyasi
putraṃ trailokya hantāraṃ mattas tvaṃ janayiṣyasi', null, 1045006),
('ramayana-1-45-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 7', 'एवमुक्त्वा महातेजाः पाणिना स ममार्ज ताम्।
समालभ्य ततः स्वस्तीत्युक्त्वा स तपसे ययौ॥', 'evam uktvā mahātejāḥ pāṇinā sa mamārja tām
samālabhya tataḥ svastīty uktvā sa tapase yayau', null, 1045007),
('ramayana-1-45-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 8', 'गते तस्मिन्नरश्रेष्ठ दितिः परमहर्षिता।
कुशप्लवनमासाद्य तपस्तेपे सुदारुणम्॥', 'gate tasmin naraśreṣṭha ditiḥ paramaharṣitā
kuśaplavanam āsādya tapas tepe sudāruṇam', null, 1045008),
('ramayana-1-45-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 9', 'तपस्तस्यां हि कुर्वत्यां परिचर्यां चकार ह।
सहस्राक्षो नरश्रेष्ठ परया गुणसंपदा॥', 'tapas tasyāṃ hi kurvatyāṃ paricaryāṃ cakāra ha
sahasrākṣo naraśreṣṭha parayā guṇasaṃpadā', null, 1045009),
('ramayana-1-45-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 10', 'अग्निं कुशान्काष्ठमपः फलं मूलं तथैव च।
न्यवेदयत्सहस्राक्षो यच्चान्यदपि काङ्क्षितम्॥', 'agniṃ kuśān kāṣṭham apaḥ phalaṃ mūlaṃ tathaiva ca
nyavedayat sahasrākṣo yac cānyad api kāṅkṣitam', null, 1045010),
('ramayana-1-45-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 11', 'गात्रसंवाहनैश्चैव श्रमापनयनैस्तथा।
शक्रः सर्वेषु कालेषु दितिं परिचचार ह॥', 'gātrasaṃvāhanaiś caiva śramāpanayanais tathā
śakraḥ sarveṣu kāleṣu ditiṃ paricacāra ha', null, 1045011),
('ramayana-1-45-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 12', 'अथ वर्षसहस्रेतु दशोने रघु नन्दन।
दितिः परमसंप्रीता सहस्राक्षमथाब्रवीत्॥', 'atha varṣasahasretu daśone raghu nandana
ditiḥ paramasaṃprītā sahasrākṣam athābravīt', null, 1045012),
('ramayana-1-45-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 13', 'तपश्चरन्त्या वर्षाणि दश वीर्यवतां वर।
अवशिष्टानि भद्रं ते भ्रातरं द्रक्ष्यसे ततः॥', 'tapaś carantyā varṣāṇi daśa vīryavatāṃ vara
avaśiṣṭāni bhadraṃ te bhrātaraṃ drakṣyase tataḥ', null, 1045013),
('ramayana-1-45-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 14', 'तमहं त्वत्कृते पुत्र समाधास्ये जयोत्सुकम्।
त्रैलोक्यविजयं पुत्र सह भोक्ष्यसि विज्वरः॥', 'tam ahaṃ tvatkṛte putra samādhāsye jayotsukam
trailokyavijayaṃ putra saha bhokṣyasi vijvaraḥ', null, 1045014),
('ramayana-1-45-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 15', 'एवमुक्त्वा दितिः शक्रं प्राप्ते मध्यं दिवाकरे।
निद्रयापहृता देवी पादौ कृत्वाथ शीर्षतः॥', 'evam uktvā ditiḥ śakraṃ prāpte madhyaṃ divākare
nidrayāpahṛtā devī pādau kṛtvātha śīrṣataḥ', null, 1045015),
('ramayana-1-45-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 16', 'दृष्ट्वा तामशुचिं शक्रः पादतः कृतमूर्धजाम्।
शिरःस्थाने कृतौ पादौ जहास च मुमोद च॥', 'dṛṣṭvā tām aśuciṃ śakraḥ pādataḥ kṛtamūrdhajām
śiraḥsthāne kṛtau pādau jahāsa ca mumoda ca', null, 1045016),
('ramayana-1-45-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 17', 'तस्याः शरीरविवरं विवेश च पुरंदरः।
गर्भं च सप्तधा राम बिभेद परमात्मवान्॥', 'tasyāḥ śarīravivaraṃ viveśa ca puraṃdaraḥ
garbhaṃ ca saptadhā rāma bibheda paramātmavān', null, 1045017),
('ramayana-1-45-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 18', 'बिध्यमानस्ततो गर्भो वज्रेण शतपर्वणा।
रुरोद सुस्वरं राम ततो दितिरबुध्यत॥', 'bidhyamānas tato garbho vajreṇa śataparvaṇā
ruroda susvaraṃ rāma tato ditir abudhyata', null, 1045018),
('ramayana-1-45-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 19', 'मा रुदो मा रुदश्चेति गर्भं शक्रोऽभ्यभाषत।
बिभेद च महातेजा रुदन्तमपि वासवः॥', 'mā rudo mā rudaś ceti garbhaṃ śakro ''bhyabhāṣata
bibheda ca mahātejā rudantam api vāsavaḥ', null, 1045019),
('ramayana-1-45-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 20', 'न हन्तव्यो न हन्तव्य इत्येवं दितिरब्रवीत्।
निष्पपात ततः शक्रो मातुर्वचनगौरवात्॥', 'na hantavyo na hantavya ity evaṃ ditir abravīt
niṣpapāta tataḥ śakro mātur vacanagauravāt', null, 1045020),
('ramayana-1-45-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 21', 'प्राञ्जलिर्वज्रसहितो दितिं शक्रोऽभ्यभाषत।
अशुचिर्देवि सुप्तासि पादयोः कृतमूर्धजा॥', 'prāñjalir vajrasahito ditiṃ śakro ''bhyabhāṣata
aśucir devi suptāsi pādayoḥ kṛtamūrdhajā', null, 1045021),
('ramayana-1-45-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 45, Verse 22', 'तदन्तरमहं लब्ध्वा शक्रहन्तारमाहवे।
अभिन्दं सप्तधा देवि तन्मे त्वं क्षन्तुमर्हसि॥', 'tadantaram ahaṃ labdhvā śakrahantāram āhave
abhindaṃ saptadhā devi tan me tvaṃ kṣantum arhasi', null, 1045022)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 46 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-46-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 1', 'सप्तधा तु कृते गर्भे दितिः परमदुःखिता।
सहस्राक्षं दुराधर्षं वाक्यं सानुनयाब्रवीत्॥', 'saptadhā tu kṛte garbhe ditiḥ paramaduḥkhitā
sahasrākṣaṃ durādharṣaṃ vākyaṃ sānunayābravīt', null, 1046001),
('ramayana-1-46-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 2', 'ममापराधाद्गर्भोऽयं सप्तधा विफलीकृतः।
नापराधोऽस्ति देवेश तवात्र बलसूदन॥', 'mamāparādhād garbho ''yaṃ saptadhā viphalīkṛtaḥ
nāparādho ''sti deveśa tavātra balasūdana', null, 1046002),
('ramayana-1-46-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 3', 'प्रियं तु कृतमिच्छामि मम गर्भविपर्यये।
मरुतां सप्तं सप्तानां स्थानपाला भवन्त्विमे॥', 'priyaṃ tu kṛtam icchāmi mama garbhaviparyaye
marutāṃ saptaṃ saptānāṃ sthānapālā bhavantv ime', null, 1046003),
('ramayana-1-46-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 4', 'वातस्कन्धा इमे सप्त चरन्तु दिवि पुत्रकाः।
मारुता इति विख्याता दिव्यरूपा ममात्मजाः॥', 'vātaskandhā ime sapta carantu divi putrakāḥ
mārutā iti vikhyātā divyarūpā mamātmajāḥ', null, 1046004),
('ramayana-1-46-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 5', 'ब्रह्मलोकं चरत्वेक इन्द्रलोकं तथापरः।
दिवि वायुरिति ख्यातस्तृतीयोऽपि महायशाः॥', 'brahmalokaṃ caratv eka indralokaṃ tathāparaḥ
divi vāyur iti khyātas tṛtīyo ''pi mahāyaśāḥ', null, 1046005),
('ramayana-1-46-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 6', 'चत्वारस्तु सुरश्रेष्ठ दिशो वै तव शासनात्।
संचरिष्यन्ति भद्रं ते देवभूता ममात्मजाः।
त्वत्कृतेनैव नाम्ना च मारुता इति विश्रुताः॥', 'catvāras tu suraśreṣṭha diśo vai tava śāsanāt
saṃcariṣyanti bhadraṃ te devabhūtā mamātmajāḥ
tvatkṛtenaiva nāmnā ca mārutā iti viśrutāḥ', null, 1046006),
('ramayana-1-46-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 7', 'तस्यास्तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा सहस्राक्षः पुरंदरः।
उवाच प्राञ्जलिर्वाक्यं दितिं बलनिषूदनः॥', 'tasyās tad vacanaṃ śrutvā sahasrākṣaḥ puraṃdaraḥ
uvāca prāñjalir vākyaṃ ditiṃ balaniṣūdanaḥ', null, 1046007),
('ramayana-1-46-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 8', 'सर्वमेतद्यथोक्तं ते भविष्यति न संशयः।
विचरिष्यन्ति भद्रं ते देवभूतास्तवात्मजाः॥', 'sarvam etad yathoktaṃ te bhaviṣyati na saṃśayaḥ
vicariṣyanti bhadraṃ te devabhūtās tavātmajāḥ', null, 1046008),
('ramayana-1-46-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 9', 'एवं तौ निश्चयं कृत्वा मातापुत्रौ तपोवने।
जग्मतुस्त्रिदिवं राम कृतार्थाविति नः श्रुतम्॥', 'evaṃ tau niścayaṃ kṛtvā mātāputrau tapovane
jagmatus tridivaṃ rāma kṛtārthāv iti naḥ śrutam', null, 1046009),
('ramayana-1-46-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 10', 'एष देशः स काकुत्स्थ महेन्द्राध्युषितः पुरा।
दितिं यत्र तपः सिद्धामेवं परिचचार सः॥', 'eṣa deśaḥ sa kākutstha mahendrādhyuṣitaḥ purā
ditiṃ yatra tapaḥ siddhām evaṃ paricacāra saḥ', null, 1046010),
('ramayana-1-46-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 11', 'इक्ष्वाकोस्तु नरव्याघ्र पुत्रः परमधार्मिकः।
अलम्बुषायामुत्पन्नो विशाल इति विश्रुतः॥', 'ikṣvākos tu naravyāghra putraḥ paramadhārmikaḥ
alambuṣāyām utpanno viśāla iti viśrutaḥ', null, 1046011),
('ramayana-1-46-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 12', 'तेन चासीदिह स्थाने विशालेति पुरी कृता॥', 'tena cāsīd iha sthāne viśāleti purī kṛtā', null, 1046012),
('ramayana-1-46-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 13', 'विशालस्य सुतो राम हेमचन्द्रो महाबलः।
सुचन्द्र इति विख्यातो हेमचन्द्रादनन्तरः॥', 'viśālasya suto rāma hemacandro mahābalaḥ
sucandra iti vikhyāto hemacandrād anantaraḥ', null, 1046013),
('ramayana-1-46-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 14', 'सुचन्द्रतनयो राम धूम्राश्व इति विश्रुतः।
धूम्राश्वतनयश्चापि सृञ्जयः समपद्यत॥', 'sucandratanayo rāma dhūmrāśva iti viśrutaḥ
dhūmrāśvatanayaś cāpi sṛñjayaḥ samapadyata', null, 1046014),
('ramayana-1-46-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 15', 'सृञ्जयस्य सुतः श्रीमान्सहदेवः प्रतापवान्।
कुशाश्वः सहदेवस्य पुत्रः परमधार्मिकः॥', 'sṛñjayasya sutaḥ śrīmān sahadevaḥ pratāpavān
kuśāśvaḥ sahadevasya putraḥ paramadhārmikaḥ', null, 1046015),
('ramayana-1-46-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 16', 'कुशाश्वस्य महातेजाः सोमदत्तः प्रतापवान्।
सोमदत्तस्य पुत्रस्तु काकुत्स्थ इति विश्रुतः॥', 'kuśāśvasya mahātejāḥ somadattaḥ pratāpavān
somadattasya putras tu kākutstha iti viśrutaḥ', null, 1046016),
('ramayana-1-46-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 17', 'तस्य पुत्रो महातेजाः संप्रत्येष पुरीमिमाम्।
आवसत्यमरप्रख्यः सुमतिर्नाम दुर्जयः॥', 'tasya putro mahātejāḥ saṃpraty eṣa purīm imām
āvasaty amaraprakhyaḥ sumatir nāma durjayaḥ', null, 1046017),
('ramayana-1-46-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 18', 'इक्ष्वाकोस्तु प्रसादेन सर्वे वैशालिका नृपाः।
दीर्घायुषो महात्मानो वीर्यवन्तः सुधार्मिकाः॥', 'ikṣvākos tu prasādena sarve vaiśālikā nṛpāḥ
dīrghāyuṣo mahātmāno vīryavantaḥ sudhārmikāḥ', null, 1046018),
('ramayana-1-46-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 19', 'इहाद्य रजनीं राम सुखं वत्स्यामहे वयम्।
श्वः प्रभाते नरश्रेष्ठ जनकं द्रष्टुमर्हसि॥', 'ihādya rajanīṃ rāma sukhaṃ vatsyāmahe vayam
śvaḥ prabhāte naraśreṣṭha janakaṃ draṣṭum arhasi', null, 1046019),
('ramayana-1-46-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 20', 'सुमतिस्तु महातेजा विश्वामित्रमुपागतम्।
श्रुत्वा नरवरश्रेष्ठः प्रत्युद्गच्छन्महायशाः॥', 'sumatis tu mahātejā viśvāmitram upāgatam
śrutvā naravaraśreṣṭhaḥ pratyudgacchan mahāyaśāḥ', null, 1046020),
('ramayana-1-46-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 21', 'पूजां च परमां कृत्वा सोपाध्यायः सबान्धवः।
प्राञ्जलिः कुशलं पृष्ट्वा विश्वामित्रमथाब्रवीत्॥', 'pūjāṃ ca paramāṃ kṛtvā sopādhyāyaḥ sabāndhavaḥ
prāñjaliḥ kuśalaṃ pṛṣṭvā viśvāmitram athābravīt', null, 1046021),
('ramayana-1-46-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 46, Verse 22', 'धन्योऽस्म्यनुगृहीतोऽस्मि यस्य मे विषयं मुने।
संप्राप्तो दर्शनं चैव नास्ति धन्यतरो मम॥', 'dhanyo ''smy anugṛhīto ''smi yasya me viṣayaṃ mune
saṃprāpto darśanaṃ caiva nāsti dhanyataro mama', null, 1046022)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 47 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-47-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 1', 'पृष्ट्वा तु कुशलं तत्र परस्परसमागमे।
कथान्ते सुमतिर्वाक्यं व्याजहार महामुनिम्॥', 'pṛṣṭvā tu kuśalaṃ tatra parasparasamāgame
kathānte sumatir vākyaṃ vyājahāra mahāmunim', null, 1047001),
('ramayana-1-47-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 2', 'इमौ कुमारौ भद्रं ते देवतुल्यपराक्रमौ।
गजसिंहगती वीरौ शार्दूलवृषभोपमौ॥', 'imau kumārau bhadraṃ te devatulyaparākramau
gajasiṃhagatī vīrau śārdūlavṛṣabhopamau', null, 1047002),
('ramayana-1-47-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 3', 'पद्मपत्रविशालाक्षौ खड्गतूणीधनुर्धरौ।
अश्विनाविव रूपेण समुपस्थितयौवनौ॥', 'padmapatraviśālākṣau khaḍgatūṇīdhanurdharau
aśvināv iva rūpeṇa samupasthitayauvanau', null, 1047003),
('ramayana-1-47-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 4', 'यदृच्छयैव गां प्राप्तौ देवलोकादिवामरौ।
कथं पद्भ्यामिह प्राप्तौ किमर्थं कस्य वा मुने॥', 'yadṛcchayaiva gāṃ prāptau devalokād ivāmarau
kathaṃ padbhyām iha prāptau kimarthaṃ kasya vā mune', null, 1047004),
('ramayana-1-47-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 5', 'भूषयन्ताविमं देशं चन्द्रसूर्याविवाम्बरम्।
परस्परस्य सदृशौ प्रमाणेङ्गितचेष्टितैः॥', 'bhūṣayantāv imaṃ deśaṃ candrasūryāv ivāmbaram
parasparasya sadṛśau pramāṇeṅgitaceṣṭitaiḥ', null, 1047005),
('ramayana-1-47-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 6', 'किमर्थं च नरश्रेष्ठौ संप्राप्तौ दुर्गमे पथि।
वरायुधधरौ वीरौ श्रोतुमिच्छामि तत्त्वतः॥', 'kimarthaṃ ca naraśreṣṭhau saṃprāptau durgame pathi
varāyudhadharau vīrau śrotum icchāmi tattvataḥ', null, 1047006),
('ramayana-1-47-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 7', 'तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा यथावृत्तं न्यवेदयत्।
सिद्धाश्रमनिवासं च राक्षसानां वधं तथा॥', 'tasya tad vacanaṃ śrutvā yathāvṛttaṃ nyavedayat
siddhāśramanivāsaṃ ca rākṣasānāṃ vadhaṃ tathā', null, 1047007),
('ramayana-1-47-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 8', 'विश्वामित्रवचः श्रुत्वा राजा परमहर्षितः।
अतिथी परमौ प्राप्तौ पुत्रौ दशरथस्य तौ।
पूजयामास विधिवत्सत्कारार्हौ महाबलौ॥', 'viśvāmitravacaḥ śrutvā rājā paramaharṣitaḥ
atithī paramau prāptau putrau daśarathasya tau
pūjayām āsa vidhivat satkārārhau mahābalau', null, 1047008),
('ramayana-1-47-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 9', 'ततः परमसत्कारं सुमतेः प्राप्य राघवौ।
उष्य तत्र निशामेकां जग्मतुर्मिथिलां ततः॥', 'tataḥ paramasatkāraṃ sumateḥ prāpya rāghavau
uṣya tatra niśām ekāṃ jagmatur mithilāṃ tataḥ', null, 1047009),
('ramayana-1-47-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 10', 'तां दृष्ट्वा मुनयः सर्वे जनकस्य पुरीं शुभाम्।
साधु साध्विति शंसन्तो मिथिलां समपूजयन्॥', 'tāṃ dṛṣṭvā munayaḥ sarve janakasya purīṃ śubhām
sādhu sādhv iti śaṃsanto mithilāṃ samapūjayan', null, 1047010),
('ramayana-1-47-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 11', 'मिथिलोपवने तत्र आश्रमं दृश्य राघवः।
पुराणं निर्जनं रम्यं पप्रच्छ मुनिपुंगवम्॥', 'mithilopavane tatra āśramaṃ dṛśya rāghavaḥ
purāṇaṃ nirjanaṃ ramyaṃ papraccha munipuṃgavam', null, 1047011),
('ramayana-1-47-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 12', 'श्रीमदाश्रमसंकाशं किं न्विदं मुनिवर्जितम्।
श्रोतुमिच्छामि भगवन्कस्यायं पूर्व आश्रमः॥', 'śrīmadāśramasaṃkāśaṃ kiṃ nv idaṃ munivarjitam
śrotum icchāmi bhagavan kasyāyaṃ pūrva āśramaḥ', null, 1047012),
('ramayana-1-47-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 13', 'तच्छ्रुता राघवेणोक्तं वाक्यं वाक्यविशारदः।
प्रत्युवाच महातेजा विश्वमित्रो महामुनिः॥', 'tac chrutā rāghaveṇoktaṃ vākyaṃ vākyaviśāradaḥ
pratyuvāca mahātejā viśvamitro mahāmuniḥ', null, 1047013),
('ramayana-1-47-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 14', 'हन्त ते कथयिष्यामि शृणु तत्त्वेन राघव।
यस्यैतदाश्रमपदं शप्तं कोपान्महात्मना॥', 'hanta te kathayiṣyāmi śṛṇu tattvena rāghava
yasyaitad āśramapadaṃ śaptaṃ kopān mahātmanā', null, 1047014),
('ramayana-1-47-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 15', 'गौतमस्य नरश्रेष्ठ पूर्वमासीन्महात्मनः।
आश्रमो दिव्यसंकाशः सुरैरपि सुपूजितः॥', 'gautamasya naraśreṣṭha pūrvam āsīn mahātmanaḥ
āśramo divyasaṃkāśaḥ surair api supūjitaḥ', null, 1047015),
('ramayana-1-47-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 16', 'स चेह तप आतिष्ठदहल्यासहितः पुरा।
वर्षपूगान्यनेकानि राजपुत्र महायशः॥', 'sa ceha tapa ātiṣṭhad ahalyāsahitaḥ purā
varṣapūgāny anekāni rājaputra mahāyaśaḥ', null, 1047016),
('ramayana-1-47-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 17', 'तस्यान्तरं विदित्वा तु सहस्राक्षः शचीपतिः।
मुनिवेषधरोऽहल्यामिदं वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'tasyāntaraṃ viditvā tu sahasrākṣaḥ śacīpatiḥ
muniveṣadharo ''halyām idaṃ vacanam abravīt', null, 1047017),
('ramayana-1-47-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 18', 'ऋतुकालं प्रतीक्षन्ते नार्थिनः सुसमाहिते।
संगमं त्वहमिच्छामि त्वया सह सुमध्यमे॥', 'ṛtukālaṃ pratīkṣante nārthinaḥ susamāhite
saṃgamaṃ tv aham icchāmi tvayā saha sumadhyame', null, 1047018),
('ramayana-1-47-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 19', 'मुनिवेषं सहस्राक्षं विज्ञाय रघुनन्दन।
मतिं चकार दुर्मेधा देवराजकुतूहलात्॥', 'muniveṣaṃ sahasrākṣaṃ vijñāya raghunandana
matiṃ cakāra durmedhā devarājakutūhalāt', null, 1047019),
('ramayana-1-47-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 20', 'अथाब्रवीत्सुरश्रेष्ठं कृतार्थेनान्तरात्मना।
कृतार्थोऽसि सुरश्रेष्ठ गच्छ शीघ्रमितः प्रभो।
आत्मानं मां च देवेश सर्वदा रक्ष मानदः॥', 'athābravīt suraśreṣṭhaṃ kṛtārthenāntarātmanā
kṛtārtho ''si suraśreṣṭha gaccha śīghram itaḥ prabho
ātmānaṃ māṃ ca deveśa sarvadā rakṣa mānadaḥ', null, 1047020),
('ramayana-1-47-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 21', 'इन्द्रस्तु प्रहसन्वाक्यमहल्यामिदमब्रवीत्।
सुश्रोणि परितुष्टोऽस्मि गमिष्यामि यथागतम्॥', 'indras tu prahasan vākyam ahalyām idam abravīt
suśroṇi parituṣṭo ''smi gamiṣyāmi yathāgatam', null, 1047021),
('ramayana-1-47-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 22', 'एवं संगम्य तु तया निश्चक्रामोटजात्ततः।
स संभ्रमात्त्वरन्राम शङ्कितो गौतमं प्रति॥', 'evaṃ saṃgamya tu tayā niścakrāmoṭajāt tataḥ
sa saṃbhramāt tvaran rāma śaṅkito gautamaṃ prati', null, 1047022),
('ramayana-1-47-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 23', 'गौतमं स ददर्शाथ प्रविशन्तं महामुनिम्।
देवदानवदुर्धर्षं तपोबलसमन्वितम्।
तीर्थोदकपरिक्लिन्नं दीप्यमानमिवानलम्।
गृहीतसमिधं तत्र सकुशं मुनिपुङ्गवम्॥', 'gautamaṃ sa dadarśātha praviśantaṃ mahāmunim
devadānavadurdharṣaṃ tapobalasamanvitam
tīrthodakapariklinnaṃ dīpyamānam ivānalam
gṛhītasamidhaṃ tatra sakuśaṃ munipuṅgavam', null, 1047023),
('ramayana-1-47-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 24', 'दृष्ट्वा सुरपतिस्त्रस्तो विषण्णवदनोऽभवत्॥', 'dṛṣṭvā surapatis trasto viṣaṇṇavadano ''bhavat', null, 1047024),
('ramayana-1-47-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 25', 'अथ दृष्ट्वा सहस्राक्षं मुनिवेषधरं मुनिः।
दुर्वृत्तं वृत्तसंपन्नो रोषाद्वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'atha dṛṣṭvā sahasrākṣaṃ muniveṣadharaṃ muniḥ
durvṛttaṃ vṛttasaṃpanno roṣād vacanam abravīt', null, 1047025),
('ramayana-1-47-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 26', 'मम रूपं समास्थाय कृतवानसि दुर्मते।
अकर्तव्यमिदं यस्माद्विफलस्त्वं भविष्यति॥', 'mama rūpaṃ samāsthāya kṛtavān asi durmate
akartavyam idaṃ yasmād viphalas tvaṃ bhaviṣyati', null, 1047026),
('ramayana-1-47-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 27', 'गौतमेनैवमुक्तस्य सरोषेण महात्मना।
पेततुर्वृषणौ भूमौ सहस्राक्षस्य तत्क्षणात्॥', 'gautamenaivam uktasya saroṣeṇa mahātmanā
petatur vṛṣaṇau bhūmau sahasrākṣasya tatkṣaṇāt', null, 1047027),
('ramayana-1-47-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 28', 'तथा शप्त्वा स वै शक्रं भार्यामपि च शप्तवान्।
इह वर्षसहस्राणि बहूनि त्वं निवत्स्यसि॥', 'tathā śaptvā sa vai śakraṃ bhāryām api ca śaptavān
iha varṣasahasrāṇi bahūni tvaṃ nivatsyasi', null, 1047028),
('ramayana-1-47-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 29', 'वायुभक्षा निराहारा तप्यन्ती भस्मशायिनी।
अदृश्या सर्वभूतानामाश्रमेऽस्मिन्निवत्स्यसि॥', 'vāyubhakṣā nirāhārā tapyantī bhasmaśāyinī
adṛśyā sarvabhūtānām āśrame ''smin nivatsyasi', null, 1047029),
('ramayana-1-47-30', 30, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 30', 'यदा चैतद्वनं घोरं रामो दशरथात्मजः।
आगमिष्यति दुर्धर्षस्तदा पूता भविष्यसि॥', 'yadā caitad vanaṃ ghoraṃ rāmo daśarathātmajaḥ
āgamiṣyati durdharṣas tadā pūtā bhaviṣyasi', null, 1047030),
('ramayana-1-47-31', 31, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 31', 'तस्यातिथ्येन दुर्वृत्ते लोभमोहविवर्जिता।
मत्सकाशे मुदा युक्ता स्वं वपुर्धारयिष्यसि॥', 'tasyātithyena durvṛtte lobhamohavivarjitā
matsakāśe mudā yuktā svaṃ vapur dhārayiṣyasi', null, 1047031),
('ramayana-1-47-32', 32, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 47, Verse 32', 'एवमुक्त्वा महातेजा गौतमो दुष्टचारिणीम्।
इममाश्रममुत्सृज्य सिद्धचारणसेविते।
हिमवच्छिखरे रम्ये तपस्तेपे महातपाः॥', 'evam uktvā mahātejā gautamo duṣṭacāriṇīm
imam āśramam utsṛjya siddhacāraṇasevite
himavacchikhare ramye tapas tepe mahātapāḥ', null, 1047032)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 48 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-48-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 1', 'अफलस्तु ततः शक्रो देवानग्निपुरोगमान्।
अब्रवीत्त्रस्तवदनः सर्षिसंघान्सचारणान्॥', 'aphalas tu tataḥ śakro devān agnipurogamān
abravīt trastavadanaḥ sarṣisaṃghān sacāraṇān', null, 1048001),
('ramayana-1-48-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 2', 'कुर्वता तपसो विघ्नं गौतमस्य महात्मनः।
क्रोधमुत्पाद्य हि मया सुरकार्यमिदं कृतम्॥', 'kurvatā tapaso vighnaṃ gautamasya mahātmanaḥ
krodham utpādya hi mayā surakāryam idaṃ kṛtam', null, 1048002),
('ramayana-1-48-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 3', 'अफलोऽस्मि कृतस्तेन क्रोधात्सा च निराकृता।
शापमोक्षेण महता तपोऽस्यापहृतं मया॥', 'aphalo ''smi kṛtas tena krodhāt sā ca nirākṛtā
śāpamokṣeṇa mahatā tapo ''syāpahṛtaṃ mayā', null, 1048003),
('ramayana-1-48-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 4', 'तन्मां सुरवराः सर्वे सर्षिसंघाः सचारणाः।
सुरसाह्यकरं सर्वे सफलं कर्तुमर्हथ॥', 'tan māṃ suravarāḥ sarve sarṣisaṃghāḥ sacāraṇāḥ
surasāhyakaraṃ sarve saphalaṃ kartum arhatha', null, 1048004),
('ramayana-1-48-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 5', 'शतक्रतोर्वचः श्रुत्वा देवाः साग्निपुरोगमाः।
पितृदेवानुपेत्याहुः सह सर्वैर्मरुद्गणैः॥', 'śatakrator vacaḥ śrutvā devāḥ sāgnipurogamāḥ
pitṛdevān upetyāhuḥ saha sarvair marudgaṇaiḥ', null, 1048005),
('ramayana-1-48-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 6', 'अयं मेषः सवृषणः शक्रो ह्यवृषणः कृतः।
मेषस्य वृषणौ गृह्य शक्रायाशु प्रयच्छत॥', 'ayaṃ meṣaḥ savṛṣaṇaḥ śakro hy avṛṣaṇaḥ kṛtaḥ
meṣasya vṛṣaṇau gṛhya śakrāyāśu prayacchata', null, 1048006),
('ramayana-1-48-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 7', 'अफलस्तु कृतो मेषः परां तुष्टिं प्रदास्यति।
भवतां हर्षणार्थाय ये च दास्यन्ति मानवाः॥', 'aphalas tu kṛto meṣaḥ parāṃ tuṣṭiṃ pradāsyati
bhavatāṃ harṣaṇārthāya ye ca dāsyanti mānavāḥ', null, 1048007),
('ramayana-1-48-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 8', 'अग्नेस्तु वचनं श्रुत्वा पितृदेवाः समागताः।
उत्पाट्य मेषवृषणौ सहस्राक्षे न्यवेदयन्॥', 'agnes tu vacanaṃ śrutvā pitṛdevāḥ samāgatāḥ
utpāṭya meṣavṛṣaṇau sahasrākṣe nyavedayan', null, 1048008),
('ramayana-1-48-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 9', 'तदा प्रभृति काकुत्स्थ पितृदेवाः समागताः।
अफलान्भुञ्जते मेषान्फलैस्तेषामयोजयन्॥', 'tadā prabhṛti kākutstha pitṛdevāḥ samāgatāḥ
aphalān bhuñjate meṣān phalais teṣām ayojayan', null, 1048009),
('ramayana-1-48-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 10', 'इन्द्रस्तु मेषवृषणस्तदा प्रभृति राघव।
गौतमस्य प्रभावेन तपसश्च महात्मनः॥', 'indras tu meṣavṛṣaṇas tadā prabhṛti rāghava
gautamasya prabhāvena tapasaś ca mahātmanaḥ', null, 1048010),
('ramayana-1-48-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 11', 'तदागच्छ महातेज आश्रमं पुण्यकर्मणः।
तारयैनां महाभागामहल्यां देवरूपिणीम्॥', 'tadāgaccha mahāteja āśramaṃ puṇyakarmaṇaḥ
tārayaināṃ mahābhāgām ahalyāṃ devarūpiṇīm', null, 1048011),
('ramayana-1-48-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 12', 'विश्वामित्रवचः श्रुत्वा राघवः सहलक्ष्मणः।
विश्वामित्रं पुरस्कृत्य आश्रमं प्रविवेश ह॥', 'viśvāmitravacaḥ śrutvā rāghavaḥ sahalakṣmaṇaḥ
viśvāmitraṃ puraskṛtya āśramaṃ praviveśa ha', null, 1048012),
('ramayana-1-48-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 13', 'ददर्श च महाभागां तपसा द्योतितप्रभाम्।
लोकैरपि समागम्य दुर्निरीक्ष्यां सुरासुरैः॥', 'dadarśa ca mahābhāgāṃ tapasā dyotitaprabhām
lokair api samāgamya durnirīkṣyāṃ surāsuraiḥ', null, 1048013),
('ramayana-1-48-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 14', 'प्रयत्नान्निर्मितां धात्रा दिव्यां मायामयीमिव।
धूमेनाभिपरीताङ्गीं पूर्णचन्द्रप्रभामिव॥', 'prayatnān nirmitāṃ dhātrā divyāṃ māyāmayīm iva
dhūmenābhiparītāṅgīṃ pūrṇacandraprabhām iva', null, 1048014),
('ramayana-1-48-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 15', 'सतुषारावृतां साभ्रां पूर्णचन्द्रप्रभामिव।
मध्येऽम्भसो दुराधर्षां दीप्तां सूर्यप्रभामिव॥', 'satuṣārāvṛtāṃ sābhrāṃ pūrṇacandraprabhām iva
madhye ''mbhaso durādharṣāṃ dīptāṃ sūryaprabhām iva', null, 1048015),
('ramayana-1-48-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 16', 'स हि गौतमवाक्येन दुर्निरीक्ष्या बभूव ह।
त्रयाणामपि लोकानां यावद्रामस्य दर्शनम्॥', 'sa hi gautamavākyena durnirīkṣyā babhūva ha
trayāṇām api lokānāṃ yāvad rāmasya darśanam', null, 1048016),
('ramayana-1-48-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 17', 'राघवौ तु ततस्तस्याः पादौ जगृहतुस्तदा।
स्मरन्ती गौतमवचः प्रतिजग्राह सा च तौ॥', 'rāghavau tu tatas tasyāḥ pādau jagṛhatus tadā
smarantī gautamavacaḥ pratijagrāha sā ca tau', null, 1048017),
('ramayana-1-48-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 18', 'पाद्यमर्घ्यं तथातिथ्यं चकार सुसमाहिता।
प्रतिजग्राह काकुत्स्थो विधिदृष्टेन कर्मणा॥', 'pādyam arghyaṃ tathātithyaṃ cakāra susamāhitā
pratijagrāha kākutstho vidhidṛṣṭena karmaṇā', null, 1048018),
('ramayana-1-48-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 19', 'पुष्पवृष्टिर्महत्यासीद्देवदुन्दुभिनिस्वनैः।
गन्धर्वाप्सरसां चापि महानासीत्समागमः॥', 'puṣpavṛṣṭir mahaty āsīd devadundubhinisvanaiḥ
gandharvāpsarasāṃ cāpi mahān āsīt samāgamaḥ', null, 1048019),
('ramayana-1-48-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 20', 'साधु साध्विति देवास्तामहल्यां समपूजयन्।
तपोबलविशुद्धाङ्गीं गौतमस्य वशानुगाम्॥', 'sādhu sādhv iti devās tām ahalyāṃ samapūjayan
tapobalaviśuddhāṅgīṃ gautamasya vaśānugām', null, 1048020),
('ramayana-1-48-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 21', 'गौतमोऽपि महातेजा अहल्यासहितः सुखी।
रामं संपूज्य विधिवत्तपस्तेपे महातपाः॥', 'gautamo ''pi mahātejā ahalyāsahitaḥ sukhī
rāmaṃ saṃpūjya vidhivat tapas tepe mahātapāḥ', null, 1048021),
('ramayana-1-48-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 48, Verse 22', 'रामोऽपि परमां पूजां गौतमस्य महामुनेः।
सकाशाद्विधिवत्प्राप्य जगाम मिथिलां ततः॥', 'rāmo ''pi paramāṃ pūjāṃ gautamasya mahāmuneḥ
sakāśād vidhivat prāpya jagāma mithilāṃ tataḥ', null, 1048022)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 49 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-49-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 1', 'ततः प्रागुत्तरां गत्वा रामः सौमित्रिणा सह।
विश्वामित्रं पुरस्कृत्य यज्ञवाटमुपागमत्॥', 'tataḥ prāguttarāṃ gatvā rāmaḥ saumitriṇā saha
viśvāmitraṃ puraskṛtya yajñavāṭam upāgamat', null, 1049001),
('ramayana-1-49-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 2', 'रामस्तु मुनिशार्दूलमुवाच सहलक्ष्मणः।
साध्वी यज्ञसमृद्धिर्हि जनकस्य महात्मनः॥', 'rāmas tu muniśārdūlam uvāca sahalakṣmaṇaḥ
sādhvī yajñasamṛddhir hi janakasya mahātmanaḥ', null, 1049002),
('ramayana-1-49-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 3', 'बहूनीह सहस्राणि नानादेशनिवासिनाम्।
ब्राह्मणानां महाभाग वेदाध्ययनशालिनाम्॥', 'bahūnīha sahasrāṇi nānādeśanivāsinām
brāhmaṇānāṃ mahābhāga vedādhyayanaśālinām', null, 1049003),
('ramayana-1-49-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 4', 'ऋषिवाटाश्च दृश्यन्ते शकटीशतसंकुलाः।
देशो विधीयतां ब्रह्मन्यत्र वत्स्यामहे वयम्॥', 'ṛṣivāṭāś ca dṛśyante śakaṭīśatasaṃkulāḥ
deśo vidhīyatāṃ brahman yatra vatsyāmahe vayam', null, 1049004),
('ramayana-1-49-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 5', 'रामस्य वचनं श्रुत्वा विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
निवेशमकरोद्देशे विविक्ते सलिलायुते॥', 'rāmasya vacanaṃ śrutvā viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
niveśam akarod deśe vivikte salilāyute', null, 1049005),
('ramayana-1-49-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 6', 'विश्वामित्रं मुनिश्रेष्ठं श्रुत्वा स नृपतिस्तदा।
शतानन्दं पुरस्कृत्य पुरोहितमनिन्दितम्॥', 'viśvāmitraṃ muniśreṣṭhaṃ śrutvā sa nṛpatis tadā
śatānandaṃ puraskṛtya purohitam aninditam', null, 1049006),
('ramayana-1-49-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 7', 'ऋत्विजोऽपि महात्मानस्त्वर्घ्यमादाय सत्वरम्।
विश्वामित्राय धर्मेण ददुर्मन्त्रपुरस्कृतम्॥', 'ṛtvijo ''pi mahātmānas tv arghyam ādāya satvaram
viśvāmitrāya dharmeṇa dadur mantrapuraskṛtam', null, 1049007),
('ramayana-1-49-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 8', 'प्रतिगृह्य तु तां पूजां जनकस्य महात्मनः।
पप्रच्छ कुशलं राज्ञो यज्ञस्य च निरामयम्॥', 'pratigṛhya tu tāṃ pūjāṃ janakasya mahātmanaḥ
papraccha kuśalaṃ rājño yajñasya ca nirāmayam', null, 1049008),
('ramayana-1-49-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 9', 'स तांश्चापि मुनीन्पृष्ट्वा सोपाध्याय पुरोधसः।
यथान्यायं ततः सर्वैः समागच्छत्प्रहृष्टवान्॥', 'sa tāṃś cāpi munīn pṛṣṭvā sopādhyāya purodhasaḥ
yathānyāyaṃ tataḥ sarvaiḥ samāgacchat prahṛṣṭavān', null, 1049009),
('ramayana-1-49-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 10', 'अथ राजा मुनिश्रेष्ठं कृताञ्जलिरभाषत।
आसने भगवानास्तां सहैभिर्मुनिसत्तमैः॥', 'atha rājā muniśreṣṭhaṃ kṛtāñjalir abhāṣata
āsane bhagavān āstāṃ sahaibhir munisattamaiḥ', null, 1049010),
('ramayana-1-49-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 11', 'जनकस्य वचः श्रुत्वा निषसाद महामुनिः।
पुरोधा ऋत्विजश्चैव राजा च सह मन्त्रिभिः॥', 'janakasya vacaḥ śrutvā niṣasāda mahāmuniḥ
purodhā ṛtvijaś caiva rājā ca saha mantribhiḥ', null, 1049011),
('ramayana-1-49-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 12', 'आसनेषु यथान्यायमुपविष्टान्समन्ततः।
दृष्ट्वा स नृपतिस्तत्र विश्वामित्रमथाब्रवीत्॥', 'āsaneṣu yathānyāyam upaviṣṭān samantataḥ
dṛṣṭvā sa nṛpatis tatra viśvāmitram athābravīt', null, 1049012),
('ramayana-1-49-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 13', 'अद्य यज्ञसमृद्धिर्मे सफला दैवतैः कृता।
अद्य यज्ञफलं प्राप्तं भगवद्दर्शनान्मया॥', 'adya yajñasamṛddhir me saphalā daivataiḥ kṛtā
adya yajñaphalaṃ prāptaṃ bhagavaddarśanān mayā', null, 1049013),
('ramayana-1-49-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 14', 'धन्योऽस्म्यनुगृहीतोऽस्मि यस्य मे मुनिपुंगव।
यज्ञोपसदनं ब्रह्मन्प्राप्तोऽसि मुनिभिः सह॥', 'dhanyo ''smy anugṛhīto ''smi yasya me munipuṃgava
yajñopasadanaṃ brahman prāpto ''si munibhiḥ saha', null, 1049014),
('ramayana-1-49-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 15', 'द्वादशाहं तु ब्रह्मर्षे शेषमाहुर्मनीषिणः।
ततो भागार्थिनो देवान्द्रष्टुमर्हसि कौशिक॥', 'dvādaśāhaṃ tu brahmarṣe śeṣam āhur manīṣiṇaḥ
tato bhāgārthino devān draṣṭum arhasi kauśika', null, 1049015),
('ramayana-1-49-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 16', 'इत्युक्त्वा मुनिशार्दूलं प्रहृष्टवदनस्तदा।
पुनस्तं परिपप्रच्छ प्राञ्जलिः प्रयतो नृपः॥', 'ity uktvā muniśārdūlaṃ prahṛṣṭavadanas tadā
punas taṃ paripapraccha prāñjaliḥ prayato nṛpaḥ', null, 1049016),
('ramayana-1-49-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 17', 'इमौ कुमारौ भद्रं ते देवतुल्यपराक्रमौ।
गजसिंहगती वीरौ शार्दूलवृषभोपमौ॥', 'imau kumārau bhadraṃ te devatulyaparākramau
gajasiṃhagatī vīrau śārdūlavṛṣabhopamau', null, 1049017),
('ramayana-1-49-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 18', 'पद्मपत्रविशालाक्षौ खड्गतूणीधनुर्धरौ।
अश्विनाविव रूपेण समुपस्थितयौवनौ॥', 'padmapatraviśālākṣau khaḍgatūṇīdhanurdharau
aśvināv iva rūpeṇa samupasthitayauvanau', null, 1049018),
('ramayana-1-49-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 19', 'यदृच्छयैव गां प्राप्तौ देवलोकादिवामरौ।
कथं पद्भ्यामिह प्राप्तौ किमर्थं कस्य वा मुने॥', 'yadṛcchayaiva gāṃ prāptau devalokād ivāmarau
kathaṃ padbhyām iha prāptau kimarthaṃ kasya vā mune', null, 1049019),
('ramayana-1-49-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 20', 'वरायुधधरौ वीरौ कस्य पुत्रौ महामुने।
भूषयन्ताविमं देशं चन्द्रसूर्याविवाम्बरम्॥', 'varāyudhadharau vīrau kasya putrau mahāmune
bhūṣayantāv imaṃ deśaṃ candrasūryāv ivāmbaram', null, 1049020),
('ramayana-1-49-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 21', 'परस्परस्य सदृशौ प्रमाणेङ्गितचेष्टितैः।
काकपक्षधरौ वीरौ श्रोतुमिच्छामि तत्त्वतः॥', 'parasparasya sadṛśau pramāṇeṅgitaceṣṭitaiḥ
kākapakṣadharau vīrau śrotum icchāmi tattvataḥ', null, 1049021),
('ramayana-1-49-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 22', 'तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा जनकस्य महात्मनः।
न्यवेदयन्महात्मानौ पुत्रौ दशरथस्य तौ॥', 'tasya tad vacanaṃ śrutvā janakasya mahātmanaḥ
nyavedayan mahātmānau putrau daśarathasya tau', null, 1049022),
('ramayana-1-49-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 23', 'सिद्धाश्रमनिवासं च राक्षसानां वधं तथा।
तच्चागमनमव्यग्रं विशालायाश्च दर्शनम्॥', 'siddhāśramanivāsaṃ ca rākṣasānāṃ vadhaṃ tathā
tac cāgamanam avyagraṃ viśālāyāś ca darśanam', null, 1049023),
('ramayana-1-49-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 24', 'अहल्यादर्शनं चैव गौतमेन समागमम्।
महाधनुषि जिज्ञासां कर्तुमागमनं तथा॥', 'ahalyādarśanaṃ caiva gautamena samāgamam
mahādhanuṣi jijñāsāṃ kartum āgamanaṃ tathā', null, 1049024),
('ramayana-1-49-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 49, Verse 25', 'एतत्सर्वं महातेजा जनकाय महात्मने।
निवेद्य विररामाथ विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः॥', 'etat sarvaṃ mahātejā janakāya mahātmane
nivedya virarāmātha viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ', null, 1049025)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 50 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-50-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 1', 'तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा विश्वामित्रस्य धीमतः।
हृष्टरोमा महातेजाः शतानन्दो महातपाः॥', 'tasya tad vacanaṃ śrutvā viśvāmitrasya dhīmataḥ
hṛṣṭaromā mahātejāḥ śatānando mahātapāḥ', null, 1050001),
('ramayana-1-50-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 2', 'गौतमस्य सुतो ज्येष्ठस्तपसा द्योतितप्रभः।
रामसंदर्शनादेव परं विस्मयमागतः॥', 'gautamasya suto jyeṣṭhas tapasā dyotitaprabhaḥ
rāmasaṃdarśanād eva paraṃ vismayam āgataḥ', null, 1050002),
('ramayana-1-50-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 3', 'स तौ निषण्णौ संप्रेक्ष्य सुखासीनौ नृपात्मजौ।
शतानन्दो मुनिश्रेष्ठं विश्वामित्रमथाब्रवीत्॥', 'sa tau niṣaṇṇau saṃprekṣya sukhāsīnau nṛpātmajau
śatānando muniśreṣṭhaṃ viśvāmitram athābravīt', null, 1050003),
('ramayana-1-50-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 4', 'अपि ते मुनिशार्दूल मम माता यशस्विनी।
दर्शिता राजपुत्राय तपो दीर्घमुपागता॥', 'api te muniśārdūla mama mātā yaśasvinī
darśitā rājaputrāya tapo dīrgham upāgatā', null, 1050004),
('ramayana-1-50-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 5', 'अपि रामे महातेजो मम माता यशस्विनी।
वन्यैरुपाहरत्पूजां पूजार्हे सर्वदेहिनाम्॥', 'api rāme mahātejo mama mātā yaśasvinī
vanyair upāharat pūjāṃ pūjārhe sarvadehinām', null, 1050005),
('ramayana-1-50-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 6', 'अपि रामाय कथितं यथावृत्तं पुरातनम्।
मम मातुर्महातेजो देवेन दुरनुष्ठितम्॥', 'api rāmāya kathitaṃ yathāvṛttaṃ purātanam
mama mātur mahātejo devena duranuṣṭhitam', null, 1050006),
('ramayana-1-50-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 7', 'अपि कौशिक भद्रं ते गुरुणा मम संगता।
माता मम मुनिश्रेष्ठ रामसंदर्शनादितः॥', 'api kauśika bhadraṃ te guruṇā mama saṃgatā
mātā mama muniśreṣṭha rāmasaṃdarśanād itaḥ', null, 1050007),
('ramayana-1-50-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 8', 'अपि मे गुरुणा रामः पूजितः कुशिकात्मज।
इहागतो महातेजाः पूजां प्राप्य महात्मनः॥', 'api me guruṇā rāmaḥ pūjitaḥ kuśikātmaja
ihāgato mahātejāḥ pūjāṃ prāpya mahātmanaḥ', null, 1050008),
('ramayana-1-50-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 9', 'अपि शान्तेन मनसा गुरुर्मे कुशिकात्मज।
इहागतेन रामेण प्रयतेनाभिवादितः॥', 'api śāntena manasā gurur me kuśikātmaja
ihāgatena rāmeṇa prayatenābhivāditaḥ', null, 1050009),
('ramayana-1-50-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 10', 'तच्छ्रुत्वा वचनं तस्य विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
प्रत्युवाच शतानन्दं वाक्यज्ञो वाक्यकोविदम्॥', 'tac chrutvā vacanaṃ tasya viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
pratyuvāca śatānandaṃ vākyajño vākyakovidam', null, 1050010),
('ramayana-1-50-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 11', 'नातिक्रान्तं मुनिश्रेष्ठ यत्कर्तव्यं कृतं मया।
संगता मुनिना पत्नी भार्गवेणेव रेणुका॥', 'nātikrāntaṃ muniśreṣṭha yat kartavyaṃ kṛtaṃ mayā
saṃgatā muninā patnī bhārgaveṇeva reṇukā', null, 1050011),
('ramayana-1-50-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 12', 'तच्छ्रुत्वा वचनं तस्य विश्वामित्रस्य धीमतः।
शतानन्दो महातेजा रामं वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'tac chrutvā vacanaṃ tasya viśvāmitrasya dhīmataḥ
śatānando mahātejā rāmaṃ vacanam abravīt', null, 1050012),
('ramayana-1-50-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 13', 'स्वागतं ते नरश्रेष्ठ दिष्ट्या प्राप्तोऽसि राघव।
विश्वामित्रं पुरस्कृत्य महर्षिमपराजितम्॥', 'svāgataṃ te naraśreṣṭha diṣṭyā prāpto ''si rāghava
viśvāmitraṃ puraskṛtya maharṣim aparājitam', null, 1050013),
('ramayana-1-50-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 14', 'अचिन्त्यकर्मा तपसा ब्रह्मर्षिरमितप्रभः।
विश्वामित्रो महातेजा वेत्स्येनं परमां गतिम्॥', 'acintyakarmā tapasā brahmarṣir amitaprabhaḥ
viśvāmitro mahātejā vetsy enaṃ paramāṃ gatim', null, 1050014),
('ramayana-1-50-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 15', 'नास्ति धन्यतरो राम त्वत्तोऽन्यो भुवि कश्चन।
गोप्ता कुशिकपुत्रस्ते येन तप्तं महत्तपः॥', 'nāsti dhanyataro rāma tvatto ''nyo bhuvi kaś cana
goptā kuśikaputras te yena taptaṃ mahat tapaḥ', null, 1050015),
('ramayana-1-50-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 16', 'श्रूयतां चाभिदास्यामि कौशिकस्य महात्मनः।
यथाबलं यथावृत्तं तन्मे निगदतः शृणु॥', 'śrūyatāṃ cābhidāsyāmi kauśikasya mahātmanaḥ
yathābalaṃ yathāvṛttaṃ tan me nigadataḥ śṛṇu', null, 1050016),
('ramayana-1-50-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 17', 'राजाभूदेष धर्मात्मा दीर्घ कालमरिंदमः।
धर्मज्ञः कृतविद्यश्च प्रजानां च हिते रतः॥', 'rājābhūd eṣa dharmātmā dīrgha kālam ariṃdamaḥ
dharmajñaḥ kṛtavidyaś ca prajānāṃ ca hite rataḥ', null, 1050017),
('ramayana-1-50-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 18', 'प्रजापतिसुतस्त्वासीत्कुशो नाम महीपतिः।
कुशस्य पुत्रो बलवान्कुशनाभः सुधार्मिकः॥', 'prajāpatisutas tv āsīt kuśo nāma mahīpatiḥ
kuśasya putro balavān kuśanābhaḥ sudhārmikaḥ', null, 1050018),
('ramayana-1-50-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 19', 'कुशनाभसुतस्त्वासीद्गाधिरित्येव विश्रुतः।
गाधेः पुत्रो महातेजा विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः॥', 'kuśanābhasutas tv āsīd gādhir ity eva viśrutaḥ
gādheḥ putro mahātejā viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ', null, 1050019),
('ramayana-1-50-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 20', 'विश्वमित्रो महातेजाः पालयामास मेदिनीम्।
बहुवर्षसहस्राणि राजा राज्यमकारयत्॥', 'viśvamitro mahātejāḥ pālayām āsa medinīm
bahuvarṣasahasrāṇi rājā rājyam akārayat', null, 1050020),
('ramayana-1-50-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 21', 'कदा चित्तु महातेजा योजयित्वा वरूथिनीम्।
अक्षौहिणीपरिवृतः परिचक्राम मेदिनीम्॥', 'kadā cit tu mahātejā yojayitvā varūthinīm
akṣauhiṇīparivṛtaḥ paricakrāma medinīm', null, 1050021),
('ramayana-1-50-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 22', 'नगराणि च राष्ट्राणि सरितश्च तथा गिरीन्।
आश्रमान्क्रमशो राजा विचरन्नाजगामह॥', 'nagarāṇi ca rāṣṭrāṇi saritaś ca tathā girīn
āśramān kramaśo rājā vicarann ājagāmaha', null, 1050022),
('ramayana-1-50-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 23', 'वसिष्ठस्याश्रमपदं नानापुष्पफलद्रुमम्।
नानामृगगणाकीर्णं सिद्धचारणसेवितम्॥', 'vasiṣṭhasyāśramapadaṃ nānāpuṣpaphaladrumam
nānāmṛgagaṇākīrṇaṃ siddhacāraṇasevitam', null, 1050023),
('ramayana-1-50-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 24', 'देवदानवगन्धर्वैः किंनरैरुपशोभितम्।
प्रशान्तहरिणाकीर्णं द्विजसंघनिषेवितम्॥', 'devadānavagandharvaiḥ kiṃnarair upaśobhitam
praśāntahariṇākīrṇaṃ dvijasaṃghaniṣevitam', null, 1050024),
('ramayana-1-50-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 25', 'ब्रह्मर्षिगणसंकीर्णं देवर्षिगणसेवितम्।
तपश्चरणसंसिद्धैरग्निकल्पैर्महात्मभिः॥', 'brahmarṣigaṇasaṃkīrṇaṃ devarṣigaṇasevitam
tapaścaraṇasaṃsiddhair agnikalpair mahātmabhiḥ', null, 1050025),
('ramayana-1-50-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 26', 'सततं संकुलं श्रीमद्ब्रह्मकल्पैर्महात्मभिः।
अब्भक्षैर्वायुभक्षैश्च शीर्णपर्णाशनैस्तथा॥', 'satataṃ saṃkulaṃ śrīmad brahmakalpair mahātmabhiḥ
abbhakṣair vāyubhakṣaiś ca śīrṇaparṇāśanais tathā', null, 1050026),
('ramayana-1-50-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 27', 'फलमूलाशनैर्दान्तैर्जितरोषैर्जितेन्द्रियैः।
ऋषिभिर्वालखिल्यैश्च जपहोमपरायणैः॥', 'phalamūlāśanair dāntair jitaroṣair jitendriyaiḥ
ṛṣibhir vālakhilyaiś ca japahomaparāyaṇaiḥ', null, 1050027),
('ramayana-1-50-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 50, Verse 28', 'वसिष्ठस्याश्रमपदं ब्रह्मलोकमिवापरम्।
ददर्श जयतां श्रेष्ठ विश्वामित्रो महाबलः॥', 'vasiṣṭhasyāśramapadaṃ brahmalokam ivāparam
dadarśa jayatāṃ śreṣṭha viśvāmitro mahābalaḥ', null, 1050028)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 51 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-51-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 1', 'स दृष्ट्वा परमप्रीतो विश्वामित्रो महाबलः।
प्रणतो विनयाद्वीरो वसिष्ठं जपतां वरम्॥', 'sa dṛṣṭvā paramaprīto viśvāmitro mahābalaḥ
praṇato vinayād vīro vasiṣṭhaṃ japatāṃ varam', null, 1051001),
('ramayana-1-51-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 2', 'स्वागतं तव चेत्युक्तो वसिष्ठेन महात्मना।
आसनं चास्य भगवान्वसिष्ठो व्यादिदेश ह॥', 'svāgataṃ tava cety ukto vasiṣṭhena mahātmanā
āsanaṃ cāsya bhagavān vasiṣṭho vyādideśa ha', null, 1051002),
('ramayana-1-51-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 3', 'उपविष्टाय च तदा विश्वामित्राय धीमते।
यथान्यायं मुनिवरः फलमूलमुपाहरत्॥', 'upaviṣṭāya ca tadā viśvāmitrāya dhīmate
yathānyāyaṃ munivaraḥ phalamūlam upāharat', null, 1051003),
('ramayana-1-51-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 4', 'प्रतिगृह्य च तां पूजां वसिष्ठाद्राजसत्तमः।
तपोऽग्निहोत्रशिष्येषु कुशलं पर्यपृच्छत॥', 'pratigṛhya ca tāṃ pūjāṃ vasiṣṭhād rājasattamaḥ
tapo''gnihotraśiṣyeṣu kuśalaṃ paryapṛcchata', null, 1051004),
('ramayana-1-51-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 5', 'विश्वामित्रो महातेजा वनस्पतिगणे तथा।
सर्वत्र कुशलं चाह वसिष्ठो राजसत्तमम्॥', 'viśvāmitro mahātejā vanaspatigaṇe tathā
sarvatra kuśalaṃ cāha vasiṣṭho rājasattamam', null, 1051005),
('ramayana-1-51-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 6', 'सुखोपविष्टं राजानं विश्वामित्रं महातपाः।
पप्रच्छ जपतां श्रेष्ठो वसिष्ठो ब्रह्मणः सुतः॥', 'sukhopaviṣṭaṃ rājānaṃ viśvāmitraṃ mahātapāḥ
papraccha japatāṃ śreṣṭho vasiṣṭho brahmaṇaḥ sutaḥ', null, 1051006),
('ramayana-1-51-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 7', 'कच्चित्ते कुशलं राजन्कच्चिद्धर्मेण रञ्जयन्।
प्रजाः पालयसे राजन्राजवृत्तेन धार्मिक॥', 'kaccit te kuśalaṃ rājan kaccid dharmeṇa rañjayan
prajāḥ pālayase rājan rājavṛttena dhārmika', null, 1051007),
('ramayana-1-51-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 8', 'कच्चित्ते सुभृता भृत्याः कच्चित्तिष्ठन्ति शासने।
कच्चित्ते विजिताः सर्वे रिपवो रिपुसूदन॥', 'kaccit te subhṛtā bhṛtyāḥ kaccit tiṣṭhanti śāsane
kaccit te vijitāḥ sarve ripavo ripusūdana', null, 1051008),
('ramayana-1-51-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 9', 'कच्चिद्बले च कोशे च मित्रेषु च परंतप।
कुशलं ते नरव्याघ्र पुत्रपौत्रे तथानघ॥', 'kaccid bale ca kośe ca mitreṣu ca paraṃtapa
kuśalaṃ te naravyāghra putrapautre tathānagha', null, 1051009),
('ramayana-1-51-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 10', 'सर्वत्र कुशलं राजा वसिष्ठं प्रत्युदाहरत्।
विश्वामित्रो महातेजा वसिष्ठं विनयान्वितः॥', 'sarvatra kuśalaṃ rājā vasiṣṭhaṃ pratyudāharat
viśvāmitro mahātejā vasiṣṭhaṃ vinayānvitaḥ', null, 1051010),
('ramayana-1-51-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 11', 'कृत्वोभौ सुचिरं कालं धर्मिष्ठौ ताः कथाः शुभाः।
मुदा परमया युक्तौ प्रीयेतां तौ परस्परम्॥', 'kṛtvobhau suciraṃ kālaṃ dharmiṣṭhau tāḥ kathāḥ śubhāḥ
mudā paramayā yuktau prīyetāṃ tau parasparam', null, 1051011),
('ramayana-1-51-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 12', 'ततो वसिष्ठो भगवान्कथान्ते रघुनन्दन।
विश्वामित्रमिदं वाक्यमुवाच प्रहसन्निव॥', 'tato vasiṣṭho bhagavān kathānte raghunandana
viśvāmitram idaṃ vākyam uvāca prahasann iva', null, 1051012),
('ramayana-1-51-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 13', 'आतिथ्यं कर्तुमिच्छामि बलस्यास्य महाबल।
तव चैवाप्रमेयस्य यथार्हं संप्रतीच्छ मे॥', 'ātithyaṃ kartum icchāmi balasyāsya mahābala
tava caivāprameyasya yathārhaṃ saṃpratīccha me', null, 1051013),
('ramayana-1-51-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 14', 'सत्क्रियां तु भवानेतां प्रतीच्छतु मयोद्यताम्।
राजंस्त्वमतिथिश्रेष्ठः पूजनीयः प्रयत्नतः॥', 'satkriyāṃ tu bhavān etāṃ pratīcchatu mayodyatām
rājaṃs tvam atithiśreṣṭhaḥ pūjanīyaḥ prayatnataḥ', null, 1051014),
('ramayana-1-51-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 15', 'एवमुक्तो वसिष्ठेन विश्वामित्रो महामतिः।
कृतमित्यब्रवीद्राजा पूजावाक्येन मे त्वया॥', 'evam ukto vasiṣṭhena viśvāmitro mahāmatiḥ
kṛtam ity abravīd rājā pūjāvākyena me tvayā', null, 1051015),
('ramayana-1-51-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 16', 'फलमूलेन भगवन्विद्यते यत्तवाश्रमे।
पाद्येनाचमनीयेन भगवद्दर्शनेन च॥', 'phalamūlena bhagavan vidyate yat tavāśrame
pādyenācamanīyena bhagavaddarśanena ca', null, 1051016),
('ramayana-1-51-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 17', 'सर्वथा च महाप्राज्ञ पूजार्हेण सुपूजितः।
गमिष्यामि नमस्तेऽस्तु मैत्रेणेक्षस्व चक्षुषा॥', 'sarvathā ca mahāprājña pūjārheṇa supūjitaḥ
gamiṣyāmi namas te ''stu maitreṇekṣasva cakṣuṣā', null, 1051017),
('ramayana-1-51-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 18', 'एवं ब्रुवन्तं राजानं वसिष्ठः पुनरेव हि।
न्यमन्त्रयत धर्मात्मा पुनः पुनरुदारधीः॥', 'evaṃ bruvantaṃ rājānaṃ vasiṣṭhaḥ punar eva hi
nyamantrayata dharmātmā punaḥ punar udāradhīḥ', null, 1051018),
('ramayana-1-51-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 19', 'बाढमित्येव गाधेयो वसिष्ठं प्रत्युवाच ह।
यथा प्रियं भगवतस्तथास्तु मुनिसत्तम॥', 'bāḍham ity eva gādheyo vasiṣṭhaṃ pratyuvāca ha
yathā priyaṃ bhagavatas tathāstu munisattama', null, 1051019),
('ramayana-1-51-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 20', 'एवमुक्तो महातेजा वसिष्ठो जपतां वरः।
आजुहाव ततः प्रीतः कल्माषीं धूतकल्मषः॥', 'evam ukto mahātejā vasiṣṭho japatāṃ varaḥ
ājuhāva tataḥ prītaḥ kalmāṣīṃ dhūtakalmaṣaḥ', null, 1051020),
('ramayana-1-51-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 21', 'एह्येहि शबले क्षिप्रं शृणु चापि वचो मम।
सबलस्यास्य राजर्षेः कर्तुं व्यवसितोऽस्म्यहम्।
भोजनेन महार्हेण सत्कारं संविधत्स्व मे॥', 'ehy ehi śabale kṣipraṃ śṛṇu cāpi vaco mama
sabalasyāsya rājarṣeḥ kartuṃ vyavasito ''smy aham
bhojanena mahārheṇa satkāraṃ saṃvidhatsva me', null, 1051021),
('ramayana-1-51-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 22', 'यस्य यस्य यथाकामं षड्रसेष्वभिपूजितम्।
तत्सर्वं कामधुग्दिव्ये अभिवर्षकृते मम॥', 'yasya yasya yathākāmaṃ ṣaḍraseṣv abhipūjitam
tat sarvaṃ kāmadhug divye abhivarṣakṛte mama', null, 1051022),
('ramayana-1-51-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 51, Verse 23', 'रसेनान्नेन पानेन लेह्यचोष्येण संयुतम्।
अन्नानां निचयं सर्वं सृजस्व शबले त्वर॥', 'rasenānnena pānena lehyacoṣyeṇa saṃyutam
annānāṃ nicayaṃ sarvaṃ sṛjasva śabale tvara', null, 1051023)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 52 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-52-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 1', 'एवमुक्ता वसिष्ठेन शबला शत्रुसूदन।
विदधे कामधुक्कामान्यस्य यस्य यथेप्सितम्॥', 'evam uktā vasiṣṭhena śabalā śatrusūdana
vidadhe kāmadhuk kāmān yasya yasya yathepsitam', null, 1052001),
('ramayana-1-52-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 2', 'इक्षून्मधूंस्तथा लाजान्मैरेयांश्च वरासवान्।
पानानि च महार्हाणि भक्ष्यांश्चोच्चावचांस्तथा॥', 'ikṣūn madhūṃs tathā lājān maireyāṃś ca varāsavān
pānāni ca mahārhāṇi bhakṣyāṃś coccāvacāṃs tathā', null, 1052002),
('ramayana-1-52-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 3', 'उष्णाढ्यस्यौदनस्यापि राशयः पर्वतोपमाः।
मृष्टान्नानि च सूपाश्च दधिकुल्यास्तथैव च॥', 'uṣṇāḍhyasyaudanasyāpi rāśayaḥ parvatopamāḥ
mṛṣṭānnāni ca sūpāś ca dadhikulyās tathaiva ca', null, 1052003),
('ramayana-1-52-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 4', 'नानास्वादुरसानां च षाडवानां तथैव च।
भाजनानि सुपूर्णानि गौडानि च सहस्रशः॥', 'nānāsvādurasānāṃ ca ṣāḍavānāṃ tathaiva ca
bhājanāni supūrṇāni gauḍāni ca sahasraśaḥ', null, 1052004),
('ramayana-1-52-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 5', 'सर्वमासीत्सुसंतुष्टं हृष्टपुष्टजनाकुलम्।
विश्वामित्रबलं राम वसिष्ठेनाभितर्पितम्॥', 'sarvam āsīt susaṃtuṣṭaṃ hṛṣṭapuṣṭajanākulam
viśvāmitrabalaṃ rāma vasiṣṭhenābhitarpitam', null, 1052005),
('ramayana-1-52-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 6', 'विश्वामित्रोऽपि राजर्षिर्हृष्टपुष्टस्तदाभवत्।
सान्तः पुरवरो राजा सब्राह्मणपुरोहितः॥', 'viśvāmitro ''pi rājarṣir hṛṣṭapuṣṭas tadābhavat
sāntaḥ puravaro rājā sabrāhmaṇapurohitaḥ', null, 1052006),
('ramayana-1-52-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 7', 'सामात्यो मन्त्रिसहितः सभृत्यः पूजितस्तदा।
युक्तः परेण हर्षेण वसिष्ठमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'sāmātyo mantrisahitaḥ sabhṛtyaḥ pūjitas tadā
yuktaḥ pareṇa harṣeṇa vasiṣṭham idam abravīt', null, 1052007),
('ramayana-1-52-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 8', 'पूजितोऽहं त्वया ब्रह्मन्पूजार्हेण सुसत्कृतः।
श्रूयतामभिधास्यामि वाक्यं वाक्यविशारद॥', 'pūjito ''haṃ tvayā brahman pūjārheṇa susatkṛtaḥ
śrūyatām abhidhāsyāmi vākyaṃ vākyaviśārada', null, 1052008),
('ramayana-1-52-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 9', 'गवां शतसहस्रेण दीयतां शबला मम।
रत्नं हि भगवन्नेतद्रत्नहारी च पार्थिवः।
तस्मान्मे शबलां देहि ममैषा धर्मतो द्विज॥', 'gavāṃ śatasahasreṇa dīyatāṃ śabalā mama
ratnaṃ hi bhagavann etad ratnahārī ca pārthivaḥ
tasmān me śabalāṃ dehi mamaiṣā dharmato dvija', null, 1052009),
('ramayana-1-52-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 10', 'एवमुक्तस्तु भगवान्वसिष्ठो मुनिसत्तमः।
विश्वामित्रेण धर्मात्मा प्रत्युवाच महीपतिम्॥', 'evam uktas tu bhagavān vasiṣṭho munisattamaḥ
viśvāmitreṇa dharmātmā pratyuvāca mahīpatim', null, 1052010),
('ramayana-1-52-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 11', 'नाहं शतसहस्रेण नापि कोटिशतैर्गवाम्।
राजन्दास्यामि शबलां राशिभी रजतस्य वा॥', 'nāhaṃ śatasahasreṇa nāpi koṭiśatair gavām
rājan dāsyāmi śabalāṃ rāśibhī rajatasya vā', null, 1052011),
('ramayana-1-52-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 12', 'न परित्यागमर्हेयं मत्सकाशादरिंदम।
शाश्वती शबला मह्यं कीर्तिरात्मवतो यथा॥', 'na parityāgam arheyaṃ matsakāśād ariṃdama
śāśvatī śabalā mahyaṃ kīrtir ātmavato yathā', null, 1052012),
('ramayana-1-52-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 13', 'अस्यां हव्यं च कव्यं च प्राणयात्रा तथैव च।
आयत्तमग्निहोत्रं च बलिर्होमस्तथैव च॥', 'asyāṃ havyaṃ ca kavyaṃ ca prāṇayātrā tathaiva ca
āyattam agnihotraṃ ca balir homas tathaiva ca', null, 1052013),
('ramayana-1-52-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 14', 'स्वाहाकारवषट्कारौ विद्याश्च विविधास्तथा।
आयत्तमत्र राजर्षे सर्वमेतन्न संशयः॥', 'svāhākāravaṣaṭkārau vidyāś ca vividhās tathā
āyattam atra rājarṣe sarvam etan na saṃśayaḥ', null, 1052014),
('ramayana-1-52-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 15', 'सर्व स्वमेतत्सत्येन मम तुष्टिकरी सदा।
कारणैर्बहुभी राजन्न दास्ये शबलां तव॥', 'sarva svam etat satyena mama tuṣṭikarī sadā
kāraṇair bahubhī rājan na dāsye śabalāṃ tava', null, 1052015),
('ramayana-1-52-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 16', 'वसिष्ठेनैवमुक्तस्तु विश्वामित्रोऽब्रवीत्ततः।
संरब्धतरमत्यर्थं वाक्यं वाक्यविशारदः॥', 'vasiṣṭhenaivam uktas tu viśvāmitro ''bravīt tataḥ
saṃrabdhataram atyarthaṃ vākyaṃ vākyaviśāradaḥ', null, 1052016),
('ramayana-1-52-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 17', 'हैरण्यकक्ष्याग्रैवेयान्सुवर्णाङ्कुशभूषितान्।
ददामि कुञ्जराणां ते सहस्राणि चतुर्दश॥', 'hairaṇyakakṣyāgraiveyān suvarṇāṅkuśabhūṣitān
dadāmi kuñjarāṇāṃ te sahasrāṇi caturdaśa', null, 1052017),
('ramayana-1-52-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 18', 'हैरण्यानां रथानां च श्वेताश्वानां चतुर्युजाम्।
ददामि ते शतान्यष्टौ किङ्किणीकविभूषितान्॥', 'hairaṇyānāṃ rathānāṃ ca śvetāśvānāṃ caturyujām
dadāmi te śatāny aṣṭau kiṅkiṇīkavibhūṣitān', null, 1052018),
('ramayana-1-52-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 19', 'हयानां देशजातानां कुलजानां महौजसाम्।
सहस्रमेकं दश च ददामि तव सुव्रत॥', 'hayānāṃ deśajātānāṃ kulajānāṃ mahaujasām
sahasram ekaṃ daśa ca dadāmi tava suvrata', null, 1052019),
('ramayana-1-52-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 20', 'नानावर्णविभक्तानां वयःस्थानां तथैव च।
ददाम्येकां गवां कोटिं शबला दीयतां मम॥', 'nānāvarṇavibhaktānāṃ vayaḥsthānāṃ tathaiva ca
dadāmy ekāṃ gavāṃ koṭiṃ śabalā dīyatāṃ mama', null, 1052020),
('ramayana-1-52-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 21', 'एवमुक्तस्तु भगवान्विश्वामित्रेण धीमता।
न दास्यामीति शबलां प्राह राजन्कथं चन॥', 'evam uktas tu bhagavān viśvāmitreṇa dhīmatā
na dāsyāmīti śabalāṃ prāha rājan kathaṃ cana', null, 1052021),
('ramayana-1-52-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 22', 'एतदेव हि मे रत्नमेतदेव हि मे धनम्।
एतदेव हि सर्वस्वमेतदेव हि जीवितम्॥', 'etad eva hi me ratnam etad eva hi me dhanam
etad eva hi sarvasvam etad eva hi jīvitam', null, 1052022),
('ramayana-1-52-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 23', 'दर्शश्च पूर्णमासश्च यज्ञाश्चैवाप्तदक्षिणाः।
एतदेव हि मे राजन्विविधाश्च क्रियास्तथा॥', 'darśaś ca pūrṇamāsaś ca yajñāś caivāptadakṣiṇāḥ
etad eva hi me rājan vividhāś ca kriyās tathā', null, 1052023),
('ramayana-1-52-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 52, Verse 24', 'अदोमूलाः क्रियाः सर्वा मम राजन्न संशयः।
बहूनां किं प्रलापेन न दास्ये कामदोहिनीम्॥', 'adomūlāḥ kriyāḥ sarvā mama rājan na saṃśayaḥ
bahūnāṃ kiṃ pralāpena na dāsye kāmadohinīm', null, 1052024)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 53 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-53-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 1', 'कामधेनुं वसिष्ठोऽपि यदा न त्यजते मुनिः।
तदास्य शबलां राम विश्वामित्रोऽन्वकर्षत॥', 'kāmadhenuṃ vasiṣṭho ''pi yadā na tyajate muniḥ
tadāsya śabalāṃ rāma viśvāmitro ''nvakarṣata', null, 1053001),
('ramayana-1-53-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 2', 'नीयमाना तु शबला राम राज्ञा महात्मना।
दुःखिता चिन्तयामास रुदन्ती शोककर्शिता॥', 'nīyamānā tu śabalā rāma rājñā mahātmanā
duḥkhitā cintayām āsa rudantī śokakarśitā', null, 1053002),
('ramayana-1-53-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 3', 'परित्यक्ता वसिष्ठेन किमहं सुमहात्मना।
याहं राजभृतैर्दीना ह्रियेयं भृशदुःखिता॥', 'parityaktā vasiṣṭhena kim ahaṃ sumahātmanā
yāhaṃ rājabhṛtair dīnā hriyeyaṃ bhṛśaduḥkhitā', null, 1053003),
('ramayana-1-53-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 4', 'किं मयापकृतं तस्य महर्षेर्भावितात्मनः।
यन्मामनागसं भक्तामिष्टां त्यजति धार्मिकः॥', 'kiṃ mayāpakṛtaṃ tasya maharṣer bhāvitātmanaḥ
yan mām anāgasaṃ bhaktām iṣṭāṃ tyajati dhārmikaḥ', null, 1053004),
('ramayana-1-53-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 5', 'इति सा चिन्तयित्वा तु निःश्वस्य च पुनः पुनः।
जगाम वेगेन तदा वसिष्ठं परमौजसं॥', 'iti sā cintayitvā tu niḥśvasya ca punaḥ punaḥ
jagāma vegena tadā vasiṣṭhaṃ paramaujasaṃ', null, 1053005),
('ramayana-1-53-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 6', 'निर्धूय तांस्तदा भृत्याञ्शतशः शत्रुसूदन।
जगामानिलवेगेन पादमूलं महात्मनः॥', 'nirdhūya tāṃs tadā bhṛtyāñ śataśaḥ śatrusūdana
jagāmānilavegena pādamūlaṃ mahātmanaḥ', null, 1053006),
('ramayana-1-53-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 7', 'शबला सा रुदन्ती च क्रोशन्ती चेदमब्रवीत्।
वसिष्ठस्याग्रतः स्थित्वा मेघदुन्दुभिराविणी॥', 'śabalā sā rudantī ca krośantī cedam abravīt
vasiṣṭhasyāgrataḥ sthitvā meghadundubhirāviṇī', null, 1053007),
('ramayana-1-53-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 8', 'भगवन्किं परित्यक्ता त्वयाहं ब्रह्मणः सुत।
यस्माद्राजभृता मां हि नयन्ते त्वत्सकाशतः॥', 'bhagavan kiṃ parityaktā tvayāhaṃ brahmaṇaḥ suta
yasmād rājabhṛtā māṃ hi nayante tvatsakāśataḥ', null, 1053008),
('ramayana-1-53-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 9', 'एवमुक्तस्तु ब्रह्मर्षिरिदं वचनमब्रवीत्।
शोकसंतप्तहृदयां स्वसारमिव दुःखिताम्॥', 'evam uktas tu brahmarṣir idaṃ vacanam abravīt
śokasaṃtaptahṛdayāṃ svasāram iva duḥkhitām', null, 1053009),
('ramayana-1-53-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 10', 'न त्वां त्यजामि शबले नापि मेऽपकृतं त्वया।
एष त्वां नयते राजा बलान्मत्तो महाबलः॥', 'na tvāṃ tyajāmi śabale nāpi me ''pakṛtaṃ tvayā
eṣa tvāṃ nayate rājā balān matto mahābalaḥ', null, 1053010),
('ramayana-1-53-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 11', 'न हि तुल्यं बलं मह्यं राजा त्वद्य विशेषतः।
बली राजा क्षत्रियश्च पृथिव्याः पतिरेव च॥', 'na hi tulyaṃ balaṃ mahyaṃ rājā tv adya viśeṣataḥ
balī rājā kṣatriyaś ca pṛthivyāḥ patir eva ca', null, 1053011),
('ramayana-1-53-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 12', 'इयमक्षौहिणीपूर्णा सवाजिरथसंकुला।
हस्तिध्वजसमाकीर्णा तेनासौ बलवत्तरः॥', 'iyam akṣauhiṇīpūrṇā savājirathasaṃkulā
hastidhvajasamākīrṇā tenāsau balavattaraḥ', null, 1053012),
('ramayana-1-53-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 13', 'एवमुक्ता वसिष्ठेन प्रत्युवाच विनीतवत्।
वचनं वचनज्ञा सा ब्रह्मर्षिममितप्रभम्॥', 'evam uktā vasiṣṭhena pratyuvāca vinītavat
vacanaṃ vacanajñā sā brahmarṣim amitaprabham', null, 1053013),
('ramayana-1-53-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 14', 'न बलं क्षत्रियस्याहुर्ब्राह्मणो बलवत्तरः।
ब्रह्मन्ब्रह्मबलं दिव्यं क्षत्रात्तु बलवत्तरम्॥', 'na balaṃ kṣatriyasyāhur brāhmaṇo balavattaraḥ
brahman brahmabalaṃ divyaṃ kṣatrāt tu balavattaram', null, 1053014),
('ramayana-1-53-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 15', 'अप्रमेयबलं तुभ्यं न त्वया बलवत्तरः।
विश्वामित्रो महावीर्यस्तेजस्तव दुरासदम्॥', 'aprameyabalaṃ tubhyaṃ na tvayā balavattaraḥ
viśvāmitro mahāvīryas tejas tava durāsadam', null, 1053015),
('ramayana-1-53-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 16', 'नियुङ्क्ष्व मां महातेजस्त्वद्ब्रह्मबलसंभृताम्।
तस्य दर्पं बलं यत्तन्नाशयामि दुरात्मनः॥', 'niyuṅkṣva māṃ mahātejas tvadbrahmabalasaṃbhṛtām
tasya darpaṃ balaṃ yat tan nāśayāmi durātmanaḥ', null, 1053016),
('ramayana-1-53-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 17', 'इत्युक्तस्तु तया राम वसिष्ठः सुमहायशाः।
सृजस्वेति तदोवाच बलं परबलारुजम्॥', 'ity uktas tu tayā rāma vasiṣṭhaḥ sumahāyaśāḥ
sṛjasveti tadovāca balaṃ parabalārujam', null, 1053017),
('ramayana-1-53-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 18', 'तस्या हुम्भारवोत्सृष्टाः पह्लवाः शतशो नृप।
नाशयन्ति बलं सर्वं विश्वामित्रस्य पश्यतः॥', 'tasyā humbhāravotsṛṣṭāḥ pahlavāḥ śataśo nṛpa
nāśayanti balaṃ sarvaṃ viśvāmitrasya paśyataḥ', null, 1053018),
('ramayana-1-53-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 19', 'स राजा परमक्रुद्धः क्रोधविस्फारितेक्षणः।
पह्लवान्नाशयामास शस्त्रैरुच्चावचैरपि॥', 'sa rājā paramakruddhaḥ krodhavisphāritekṣaṇaḥ
pahlavān nāśayām āsa śastrair uccāvacair api', null, 1053019),
('ramayana-1-53-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 20', 'विश्वामित्रार्दितान्दृष्ट्वा पह्लवाञ्शतशस्तदा।
भूय एवासृजद्घोराञ्शकान्यवनमिश्रितान्॥', 'viśvāmitrārditān dṛṣṭvā pahlavāñ śataśas tadā
bhūya evāsṛjad ghorāñ śakān yavanamiśritān', null, 1053020),
('ramayana-1-53-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 21', 'तैरासीत्संवृता भूमिः शकैर्यवनमिश्रितैः।
प्रभावद्भिर्महावीर्यैर्हेमकिञ्जल्कसंनिभैः॥', 'tair āsīt saṃvṛtā bhūmiḥ śakair yavanamiśritaiḥ
prabhāvadbhir mahāvīryair hemakiñjalkasaṃnibhaiḥ', null, 1053021),
('ramayana-1-53-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 22', 'दीर्घासिपट्टिशधरैर्हेमवर्णाम्बरावृतैः।
निर्दग्धं तद्बलं सर्वं प्रदीप्तैरिव पावकैः॥', 'dīrghāsipaṭṭiśadharair hemavarṇāmbarāvṛtaiḥ
nirdagdhaṃ tad balaṃ sarvaṃ pradīptair iva pāvakaiḥ', null, 1053022),
('ramayana-1-53-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 53, Verse 23', 'ततोऽस्त्राणि महातेजा विश्वामित्रो मुमोच ह॥', 'tato ''strāṇi mahātejā viśvāmitro mumoca ha', null, 1053023)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 54 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-54-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 1', 'ततस्तानाकुलान्दृष्ट्वा विश्वामित्रास्त्रमोहितान्।
वसिष्ठश्चोदयामास कामधुक्सृज योगतः॥', 'tatas tān ākulān dṛṣṭvā viśvāmitrāstramohitān
vasiṣṭhaś codayām āsa kāmadhuk sṛja yogataḥ', null, 1054001),
('ramayana-1-54-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 2', 'तस्या हुम्भारवाज्जाताः काम्बोजा रविसंनिभाः।
ऊधसस्त्वथ संजाताः पह्लवाः शस्त्रपाणयः॥', 'tasyā humbhāravāj jātāḥ kāmbojā ravisaṃnibhāḥ
ūdhasas tv atha saṃjātāḥ pahlavāḥ śastrapāṇayaḥ', null, 1054002),
('ramayana-1-54-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 3', 'योनिदेशाच्च यवनः शकृद्देशाच्छकास्तथा।
रोमकूपेषु मेच्छाश्च हरीताः सकिरातकाः॥', 'yonideśāc ca yavanaḥ śakṛddeśāc chakās tathā
romakūpeṣu mecchāś ca harītāḥ sakirātakāḥ', null, 1054003),
('ramayana-1-54-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 4', 'तैस्तन्निषूदितं सैन्यं विश्वमित्रस्य तत्क्षणात्।
सपदातिगजं साश्वं सरथं रघुनन्दन॥', 'tais tan niṣūditaṃ sainyaṃ viśvamitrasya tatkṣaṇāt
sapadātigajaṃ sāśvaṃ sarathaṃ raghunandana', null, 1054004),
('ramayana-1-54-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 5', 'दृष्ट्वा निषूदितं सैन्यं वसिष्ठेन महात्मना।
विश्वामित्रसुतानां तु शतं नानाविधायुधम्॥', 'dṛṣṭvā niṣūditaṃ sainyaṃ vasiṣṭhena mahātmanā
viśvāmitrasutānāṃ tu śataṃ nānāvidhāyudham', null, 1054005),
('ramayana-1-54-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 6', 'अभ्यधावत्सुसंक्रुद्धं वसिष्ठं जपतां वरम्।
हुंकारेणैव तान्सर्वान्निर्ददाह महानृषिः॥', 'abhyadhāvat susaṃkruddhaṃ vasiṣṭhaṃ japatāṃ varam
huṃkāreṇaiva tān sarvān nirdadāha mahān ṛṣiḥ', null, 1054006),
('ramayana-1-54-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 7', 'ते साश्वरथपादाता वसिष्ठेन महात्मना।
भस्मीकृता मुहूर्तेन विश्वामित्रसुतास्तदा॥', 'te sāśvarathapādātā vasiṣṭhena mahātmanā
bhasmīkṛtā muhūrtena viśvāmitrasutās tadā', null, 1054007),
('ramayana-1-54-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 8', 'दृष्ट्वा विनाशितान्पुत्रान्बलं च सुमहायशाः।
सव्रीडश्चिन्तयाविष्टो विश्वामित्रोऽभवत्तदा॥', 'dṛṣṭvā vināśitān putrān balaṃ ca sumahāyaśāḥ
savrīḍaś cintayāviṣṭo viśvāmitro ''bhavat tadā', null, 1054008),
('ramayana-1-54-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 9', 'संदुर इव निर्वेगो भग्नदंष्ट्र इवोरगः।
उपरक्त इवादित्यः सद्यो निष्प्रभतां गतः॥', 'saṃdura iva nirvego bhagnadaṃṣṭra ivoragaḥ
uparakta ivādityaḥ sadyo niṣprabhatāṃ gataḥ', null, 1054009),
('ramayana-1-54-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 10', 'हतपुत्रबलो दीनो लूनपक्ष इव द्विजः।
हतदर्पो हतोत्साहो निर्वेदं समपद्यत॥', 'hataputrabalo dīno lūnapakṣa iva dvijaḥ
hatadarpo hatotsāho nirvedaṃ samapadyata', null, 1054010),
('ramayana-1-54-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 11', 'स पुत्रमेकं राज्याय पालयेति नियुज्य च।
पृथिवीं क्षत्रधर्मेण वनमेवान्वपद्यत॥', 'sa putram ekaṃ rājyāya pālayeti niyujya ca
pṛthivīṃ kṣatradharmeṇa vanam evānvapadyata', null, 1054011),
('ramayana-1-54-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 12', 'स गत्वा हिमवत्पार्श्वं किंनरोरगसेवितम्।
महादेवप्रसादार्थं तपस्तेपे महातपाः॥', 'sa gatvā himavatpārśvaṃ kiṃnaroragasevitam
mahādevaprasādārthaṃ tapas tepe mahātapāḥ', null, 1054012),
('ramayana-1-54-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 13', 'केन चित्त्वथ कालेन देवेशो वृषभध्वजः।
दर्शयामास वरदो विश्वामित्रं महामुनिम्॥', 'kena cit tv atha kālena deveśo vṛṣabhadhvajaḥ
darśayām āsa varado viśvāmitraṃ mahāmunim', null, 1054013),
('ramayana-1-54-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 14', 'किमर्थं तप्यसे राजन्ब्रूहि यत्ते विवक्षितम्।
वरदोऽस्मि वरो यस्ते काङ्क्षितः सोऽभिधीयताम्॥', 'kimarthaṃ tapyase rājan brūhi yat te vivakṣitam
varado ''smi varo yas te kāṅkṣitaḥ so ''bhidhīyatām', null, 1054014),
('ramayana-1-54-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 15', 'एवमुक्तस्तु देवेन विश्वामित्रो महातपाः।
प्रणिपत्य महादेवमिदं वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'evam uktas tu devena viśvāmitro mahātapāḥ
praṇipatya mahādevam idaṃ vacanam abravīt', null, 1054015),
('ramayana-1-54-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 16', 'यदि तुष्टो महादेव धनुर्वेदो ममानघ।
साङ्गोपाङ्गोपनिषदः सरहस्यः प्रदीयताम्॥', 'yadi tuṣṭo mahādeva dhanurvedo mamānagha
sāṅgopāṅgopaniṣadaḥ sarahasyaḥ pradīyatām', null, 1054016),
('ramayana-1-54-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 17', 'यानि देवेषु चास्त्राणि दानवेषु महर्षिषु।
गन्धर्वयक्षरक्षःसु प्रतिभान्तु ममानघ॥', 'yāni deveṣu cāstrāṇi dānaveṣu maharṣiṣu
gandharvayakṣarakṣaḥsu pratibhāntu mamānagha', null, 1054017),
('ramayana-1-54-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 18', 'तव प्रसादाद्भवतु देवदेव ममेप्सितम्।
एवमस्त्विति देवेशो वाक्यमुक्त्वा दिवं गतः॥', 'tava prasādād bhavatu devadeva mamepsitam
evam astv iti deveśo vākyam uktvā divaṃ gataḥ', null, 1054018),
('ramayana-1-54-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 19', 'प्राप्य चास्त्राणि राजर्षिर्विश्वामित्रो महाबलः।
दर्पेण महता युक्तो दर्पपूर्णोऽभवत्तदा॥', 'prāpya cāstrāṇi rājarṣir viśvāmitro mahābalaḥ
darpeṇa mahatā yukto darpapūrṇo ''bhavat tadā', null, 1054019),
('ramayana-1-54-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 20', 'विवर्धमानो वीर्येण समुद्र इव पर्वणि।
हतमेव तदा मेने वसिष्ठमृषिसत्तमम्॥', 'vivardhamāno vīryeṇa samudra iva parvaṇi
hatam eva tadā mene vasiṣṭham ṛṣisattamam', null, 1054020),
('ramayana-1-54-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 21', 'ततो गत्वाश्रमपदं मुमोचास्त्राणि पार्थिवः।
यैस्तत्तपोवनं सर्वं निर्दग्धं चास्त्रतेजसा॥', 'tato gatvāśramapadaṃ mumocāstrāṇi pārthivaḥ
yais tat tapovanaṃ sarvaṃ nirdagdhaṃ cāstratejasā', null, 1054021),
('ramayana-1-54-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 22', 'उदीर्यमाणमस्त्रं तद्विश्वामित्रस्य धीमतः।
दृष्ट्वा विप्रद्रुता भीता मुनयः शतशो दिशः॥', 'udīryamāṇam astraṃ tad viśvāmitrasya dhīmataḥ
dṛṣṭvā vipradrutā bhītā munayaḥ śataśo diśaḥ', null, 1054022),
('ramayana-1-54-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 23', 'वसिष्ठस्य च ये शिष्यास्तथैव मृगपक्षिणः।
विद्रवन्ति भयाद्भीता नानादिग्भ्यः सहस्रशः॥', 'vasiṣṭhasya ca ye śiṣyās tathaiva mṛgapakṣiṇaḥ
vidravanti bhayād bhītā nānādigbhyaḥ sahasraśaḥ', null, 1054023),
('ramayana-1-54-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 24', 'वसिष्ठस्याश्रमपदं शून्यमासीन्महात्मनः।
मुहूर्तमिव निःशब्दमासीदीरिणसंनिभम्॥', 'vasiṣṭhasyāśramapadaṃ śūnyam āsīn mahātmanaḥ
muhūrtam iva niḥśabdam āsīd īriṇasaṃnibham', null, 1054024),
('ramayana-1-54-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 25', 'वदतो वै वसिष्ठस्य मा भैष्टेति मुहुर्मुहुः।
नाशयाम्यद्य गाधेयं नीहारमिव भास्करः॥', 'vadato vai vasiṣṭhasya mā bhaiṣṭeti muhur muhuḥ
nāśayāmy adya gādheyaṃ nīhāram iva bhāskaraḥ', null, 1054025),
('ramayana-1-54-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 26', 'एवमुक्त्वा महातेजा वसिष्ठो जपतां वरः।
विश्वामित्रं तदा वाक्यं सरोषमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'evam uktvā mahātejā vasiṣṭho japatāṃ varaḥ
viśvāmitraṃ tadā vākyaṃ saroṣam idam abravīt', null, 1054026),
('ramayana-1-54-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 27', 'आश्रमं चिरसंवृद्धं यद्विनाशितवानसि।
दुराचारोऽसि यन्मूढ तस्मात्त्वं न भविष्यसि॥', 'āśramaṃ cirasaṃvṛddhaṃ yad vināśitavān asi
durācāro ''si yan mūḍha tasmāt tvaṃ na bhaviṣyasi', null, 1054027),
('ramayana-1-54-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 54, Verse 28', 'इत्युक्त्वा परमक्रुद्धो दण्डमुद्यम्य सत्वरः।
विधूम इव कालाग्निर्यमदण्डमिवापरम्॥', 'ity uktvā paramakruddho daṇḍam udyamya satvaraḥ
vidhūma iva kālāgnir yamadaṇḍam ivāparam', null, 1054028)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 55 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-55-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 1', 'एवमुक्तो वसिष्ठेन विश्वामित्रो महाबलः।
आग्नेयमस्त्रमुत्क्षिप्य तिष्ठ तिष्ठेति चाब्रवीत्॥', 'evam ukto vasiṣṭhena viśvāmitro mahābalaḥ
āgneyam astram utkṣipya tiṣṭha tiṣṭheti cābravīt', null, 1055001),
('ramayana-1-55-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 2', 'वसिष्ठो भगवान्क्रोधादिदं वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'vasiṣṭho bhagavān krodhād idaṃ vacanam abravīt', null, 1055002),
('ramayana-1-55-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 3', 'क्षत्रबन्धो स्थितोऽस्म्येष यद्बलं तद्विदर्शय।
नाशयाम्येष ते दर्पं शस्त्रस्य तव गाधिज॥', 'kṣatrabandho sthito ''smy eṣa yad balaṃ tad vidarśaya
nāśayāmy eṣa te darpaṃ śastrasya tava gādhija', null, 1055003),
('ramayana-1-55-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 4', 'क्व च ते क्षत्रियबलं क्व च ब्रह्मबलं महत्।
पश्य ब्रह्मबलं दिव्यं मम क्षत्रियपांसन॥', 'kva ca te kṣatriyabalaṃ kva ca brahmabalaṃ mahat
paśya brahmabalaṃ divyaṃ mama kṣatriyapāṃsana', null, 1055004),
('ramayana-1-55-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 5', 'तस्यास्त्रं गाधिपुत्रस्य घोरमाग्नेयमुत्तमम्।
ब्रह्मदण्डेन तच्छान्तमग्नेर्वेग इवाम्भसा॥', 'tasyāstraṃ gādhiputrasya ghoram āgneyam uttamam
brahmadaṇḍena tac chāntam agner vega ivāmbhasā', null, 1055005),
('ramayana-1-55-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 6', 'वारुणं चैव रौद्रं च ऐन्द्रं पाशुपतं तथा।
ऐषीकं चापि चिक्षेप रुषितो गाधिनन्दनः॥', 'vāruṇaṃ caiva raudraṃ ca aindraṃ pāśupataṃ tathā
aiṣīkaṃ cāpi cikṣepa ruṣito gādhinandanaḥ', null, 1055006),
('ramayana-1-55-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 7', 'मानवं मोहनं चैव गान्धर्वं स्वापनं तथा।
जृम्भणं मोहनं चैव संतापनविलापने॥', 'mānavaṃ mohanaṃ caiva gāndharvaṃ svāpanaṃ tathā
jṛmbhaṇaṃ mohanaṃ caiva saṃtāpanavilāpane', null, 1055007),
('ramayana-1-55-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 8', 'शोषणं दारणं चैव वज्रमस्त्रं सुदुर्जयम्।
ब्रह्मपाशं कालपाशं वारुणं पाशमेव च॥', 'śoṣaṇaṃ dāraṇaṃ caiva vajram astraṃ sudurjayam
brahmapāśaṃ kālapāśaṃ vāruṇaṃ pāśam eva ca', null, 1055008),
('ramayana-1-55-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 9', 'पिनाकास्त्रं च दयितं शुष्कार्द्रे अशनी तथा।
दण्डास्त्रमथ पैशाचं क्रौञ्चमस्त्रं तथैव च॥', 'pinākāstraṃ ca dayitaṃ śuṣkārdre aśanī tathā
daṇḍāstram atha paiśācaṃ krauñcam astraṃ tathaiva ca', null, 1055009),
('ramayana-1-55-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 10', 'धर्मचक्रं कालचक्रं विष्णुचक्रं तथैव च।
वायव्यं मथनं चैव अस्त्रं हयशिरस्तथा॥', 'dharmacakraṃ kālacakraṃ viṣṇucakraṃ tathaiva ca
vāyavyaṃ mathanaṃ caiva astraṃ hayaśiras tathā', null, 1055010),
('ramayana-1-55-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 11', 'शक्तिद्वयं च चिक्षेप कङ्कालं मुसलं तथा।
वैद्याधरं महास्त्रं च कालास्त्रमथ दारुणम्॥', 'śaktidvayaṃ ca cikṣepa kaṅkālaṃ musalaṃ tathā
vaidyādharaṃ mahāstraṃ ca kālāstram atha dāruṇam', null, 1055011),
('ramayana-1-55-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 12', 'त्रिशूलमस्त्रं घोरं च कापालमथ कङ्कणम्।
एतान्यस्त्राणि चिक्षेप सर्वाणि रघुनन्दन॥', 'triśūlam astraṃ ghoraṃ ca kāpālam atha kaṅkaṇam
etāny astrāṇi cikṣepa sarvāṇi raghunandana', null, 1055012),
('ramayana-1-55-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 13', 'वसिष्ठे जपतां श्रेष्ठे तदद्भुतमिवाभवत्।
तानि सर्वाणि दण्डेन ग्रसते ब्रह्मणः सुतः॥', 'vasiṣṭhe japatāṃ śreṣṭhe tad adbhutam ivābhavat
tāni sarvāṇi daṇḍena grasate brahmaṇaḥ sutaḥ', null, 1055013),
('ramayana-1-55-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 14', 'तेषु शान्तेषु ब्रह्मास्त्रं क्षिप्तवान्गाधिनन्दनः।
तदस्त्रमुद्यतं दृष्ट्वा देवाः साग्निपुरोगमाः॥', 'teṣu śānteṣu brahmāstraṃ kṣiptavān gādhinandanaḥ
tad astram udyataṃ dṛṣṭvā devāḥ sāgnipurogamāḥ', null, 1055014),
('ramayana-1-55-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 15', 'देवर्षयश्च संभ्रान्ता गन्धर्वाः समहोरगाः।
त्रैलोक्यमासीत्संत्रस्तं ब्रह्मास्त्रे समुदीरिते॥', 'devarṣayaś ca saṃbhrāntā gandharvāḥ samahoragāḥ
trailokyam āsīt saṃtrastaṃ brahmāstre samudīrite', null, 1055015),
('ramayana-1-55-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 16', 'तदप्यस्त्रं महाघोरं ब्राह्मं ब्राह्मेण तेजसा।
वसिष्ठो ग्रसते सर्वं ब्रह्मदण्डेन राघव॥', 'tad apy astraṃ mahāghoraṃ brāhmaṃ brāhmeṇa tejasā
vasiṣṭho grasate sarvaṃ brahmadaṇḍena rāghava', null, 1055016),
('ramayana-1-55-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 17', 'ब्रह्मास्त्रं ग्रसमानस्य वसिष्ठस्य महात्मनः।
त्रैलोक्यमोहनं रौद्रं रूपमासीत्सुदारुणम्॥', 'brahmāstraṃ grasamānasya vasiṣṭhasya mahātmanaḥ
trailokyamohanaṃ raudraṃ rūpam āsīt sudāruṇam', null, 1055017),
('ramayana-1-55-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 18', 'रोमकूपेषु सर्वेषु वसिष्ठस्य महात्मनः।
मरीच्य इव निष्पेतुरग्नेर्धूमाकुलार्चिषः॥', 'romakūpeṣu sarveṣu vasiṣṭhasya mahātmanaḥ
marīcya iva niṣpetur agner dhūmākulārciṣaḥ', null, 1055018),
('ramayana-1-55-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 19', 'प्राज्वलद्ब्रह्मदण्डश्च वसिष्ठस्य करोद्यतः।
विधूम इव कालाग्निर्यमदण्ड इवापरः॥', 'prājvalad brahmadaṇḍaś ca vasiṣṭhasya karodyataḥ
vidhūma iva kālāgnir yamadaṇḍa ivāparaḥ', null, 1055019),
('ramayana-1-55-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 20', 'ततोऽस्तुवन्मुनिगणा वसिष्ठं जपतां वरम्।
अमोघं ते बलं ब्रह्मंस्तेजो धारय तेजसा॥', 'tato ''stuvan munigaṇā vasiṣṭhaṃ japatāṃ varam
amoghaṃ te balaṃ brahmaṃs tejo dhāraya tejasā', null, 1055020),
('ramayana-1-55-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 21', 'निगृहीतस्त्वया ब्रह्मन्विश्वामित्रो महातपाः।
प्रसीद जपतां श्रेष्ठ लोकाः सन्तु गतव्यथाः॥', 'nigṛhītas tvayā brahman viśvāmitro mahātapāḥ
prasīda japatāṃ śreṣṭha lokāḥ santu gatavyathāḥ', null, 1055021),
('ramayana-1-55-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 22', 'एवमुक्तो महातेजाः शमं चक्रे महातपाः।
विश्वामित्रोऽपि निकृतो विनिःश्वस्येदमब्रवीत्॥', 'evam ukto mahātejāḥ śamaṃ cakre mahātapāḥ
viśvāmitro ''pi nikṛto viniḥśvasyedam abravīt', null, 1055022),
('ramayana-1-55-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 23', 'धिग्बलं क्षत्रियबलं ब्रह्मतेजोबलं बलम्।
एकेन ब्रह्मदण्डेन सर्वास्त्राणि हतानि मे॥', 'dhig balaṃ kṣatriyabalaṃ brahmatejobalaṃ balam
ekena brahmadaṇḍena sarvāstrāṇi hatāni me', null, 1055023),
('ramayana-1-55-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 55, Verse 24', 'तदेतत्समवेक्ष्याहं प्रसन्नेन्द्रियमानसः।
तपो महत्समास्थास्ये यद्वै ब्रह्मत्वकारकम्॥', 'tad etat samavekṣyāhaṃ prasannendriyamānasaḥ
tapo mahat samāsthāsye yad vai brahmatvakārakam', null, 1055024)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 56 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-56-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 1', 'ततः संतप्तहृदयः स्मरन्निग्रहमात्मनः।
विनिःश्वस्य विनिःश्वस्य कृतवैरो महात्मना॥', 'tataḥ saṃtaptahṛdayaḥ smaran nigraham ātmanaḥ
viniḥśvasya viniḥśvasya kṛtavairo mahātmanā', null, 1056001),
('ramayana-1-56-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 2', 'स दक्षिणां दिशं गत्वा महिष्या सह राघव।
तताप परमं घोरं विश्वामित्रो महातपाः।
फलमूलाशनो दान्तश्चचार परमं तपः॥', 'sa dakṣiṇāṃ diśaṃ gatvā mahiṣyā saha rāghava
tatāpa paramaṃ ghoraṃ viśvāmitro mahātapāḥ
phalamūlāśano dāntaś cacāra paramaṃ tapaḥ', null, 1056002),
('ramayana-1-56-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 3', 'अथास्य जज्ञिरे पुत्राः सत्यधर्मपरायणाः।
हविष्पन्दो मधुष्पन्दो दृढनेत्रो महारथः॥', 'athāsya jajñire putrāḥ satyadharmaparāyaṇāḥ
haviṣpando madhuṣpando dṛḍhanetro mahārathaḥ', null, 1056003),
('ramayana-1-56-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 4', 'पूर्णे वर्षसहस्रे तु ब्रह्मा लोकपितामहः।
अब्रवीन्मधुरं वाक्यं विश्वामित्रं तपोधनम्॥', 'pūrṇe varṣasahasre tu brahmā lokapitāmahaḥ
abravīn madhuraṃ vākyaṃ viśvāmitraṃ tapodhanam', null, 1056004),
('ramayana-1-56-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 5', 'जिता राजर्षिलोकास्ते तपसा कुशिकात्मज।
अनेन तपसा त्वां हि राजर्षिरिति विद्महे॥', 'jitā rājarṣilokās te tapasā kuśikātmaja
anena tapasā tvāṃ hi rājarṣir iti vidmahe', null, 1056005),
('ramayana-1-56-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 6', 'एवमुक्त्वा महातेजा जगाम सह दैवतैः।
त्रिविष्टपं ब्रह्मलोकं लोकानां परमेश्वरः॥', 'evam uktvā mahātejā jagāma saha daivataiḥ
triviṣṭapaṃ brahmalokaṃ lokānāṃ parameśvaraḥ', null, 1056006),
('ramayana-1-56-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 7', 'विश्वामित्रोऽपि तच्छ्रुत्वा ह्रिया किं चिदवाङ्मुखः।
दुःखेन महताविष्टः समन्युरिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'viśvāmitro ''pi tac chrutvā hriyā kiṃ cid avāṅmukhaḥ
duḥkhena mahatāviṣṭaḥ samanyur idam abravīt', null, 1056007),
('ramayana-1-56-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 8', 'तपश्च सुमहत्तप्तं राजर्षिरिति मां विदुः।
देवाः सर्षिगणाः सर्वे नास्ति मन्ये तपःफलम्॥', 'tapaś ca sumahat taptaṃ rājarṣir iti māṃ viduḥ
devāḥ sarṣigaṇāḥ sarve nāsti manye tapaḥphalam', null, 1056008),
('ramayana-1-56-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 9', 'एवं निश्चित्य मनसा भूय एव महातपाः।
तपश्चचार काकुत्स्थ परमं परमात्मवान्॥', 'evaṃ niścitya manasā bhūya eva mahātapāḥ
tapaś cacāra kākutstha paramaṃ paramātmavān', null, 1056009),
('ramayana-1-56-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 10', 'एतस्मिन्नेव काले तु सत्यवादी जितेन्द्रियः।
त्रिशङ्कुरिति विख्यात इक्ष्वाकु कुलनन्दनः॥', 'etasminn eva kāle tu satyavādī jitendriyaḥ
triśaṅkur iti vikhyāta ikṣvāku kulanandanaḥ', null, 1056010),
('ramayana-1-56-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 11', 'तस्य बुद्धिः समुत्पन्ना यजेयमिति राघव।
गच्छेयं स्वशरीरेण देवानां परमां गतिम्॥', 'tasya buddhiḥ samutpannā yajeyam iti rāghava
gaccheyaṃ svaśarīreṇa devānāṃ paramāṃ gatim', null, 1056011),
('ramayana-1-56-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 12', 'स वसिष्ठं समाहूय कथयामास चिन्तितम्।
अशक्यमिति चाप्युक्तो वसिष्ठेन महात्मना॥', 'sa vasiṣṭhaṃ samāhūya kathayām āsa cintitam
aśakyam iti cāpy ukto vasiṣṭhena mahātmanā', null, 1056012),
('ramayana-1-56-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 13', 'प्रत्याख्यातो वसिष्ठेन स ययौ दक्षिणां दिशम्।
वसिष्ठा दीर्घ तपसस्तपो यत्र हि तेपिरे॥', 'pratyākhyāto vasiṣṭhena sa yayau dakṣiṇāṃ diśam
vasiṣṭhā dīrgha tapasas tapo yatra hi tepire', null, 1056013),
('ramayana-1-56-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 14', 'त्रिशङ्कुः सुमहातेजाः शतं परमभास्वरम्।
वसिष्ठपुत्रान्ददृशे तप्यमानान्यशस्विनः॥', 'triśaṅkuḥ sumahātejāḥ śataṃ paramabhāsvaram
vasiṣṭhaputrān dadṛśe tapyamānān yaśasvinaḥ', null, 1056014),
('ramayana-1-56-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 15', 'सोऽभिगम्य महात्मानः सर्वानेव गुरोः सुतान्।
अभिवाद्यानुपूर्व्येण ह्रिया किं चिदवाङ्मुखः।
अब्रवीत्सुमहातेजाः सर्वानेव कृताञ्जलिः॥', 'so ''bhigamya mahātmānaḥ sarvān eva guroḥ sutān
abhivādyānupūrvyeṇa hriyā kiṃ cid avāṅmukhaḥ
abravīt sumahātejāḥ sarvān eva kṛtāñjaliḥ', null, 1056015),
('ramayana-1-56-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 16', 'शरणं वः प्रपद्येऽहं शरण्याञ्शरणागतः।
प्रत्याख्यातोऽस्मि भद्रं वो वसिष्ठेन महात्मना॥', 'śaraṇaṃ vaḥ prapadye ''haṃ śaraṇyāñ śaraṇāgataḥ
pratyākhyāto ''smi bhadraṃ vo vasiṣṭhena mahātmanā', null, 1056016),
('ramayana-1-56-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 17', 'यष्टुकामो महायज्ञं तदनुज्ञातुमर्थथ।
गुरुपुत्रानहं सर्वान्नमस्कृत्य प्रसादये॥', 'yaṣṭukāmo mahāyajñaṃ tad anujñātum arthatha
guruputrān ahaṃ sarvān namaskṛtya prasādaye', null, 1056017),
('ramayana-1-56-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 18', 'शिरसा प्रणतो याचे ब्राह्मणांस्तपसि स्थितान्।
ते मां भवन्तः सिद्ध्यर्थं याजयन्तु समाहिताः।
सशरीरो यथाहं हि देवलोकमवाप्नुयाम्॥', 'śirasā praṇato yāce brāhmaṇāṃs tapasi sthitān
te māṃ bhavantaḥ siddhyarthaṃ yājayantu samāhitāḥ
saśarīro yathāhaṃ hi devalokam avāpnuyām', null, 1056018),
('ramayana-1-56-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 19', 'प्रत्याख्यातो वसिष्ठेन गतिमन्यां तपोधनाः।
गुरुपुत्रानृते सर्वान्नाहं पश्यामि कां चन॥', 'pratyākhyāto vasiṣṭhena gatim anyāṃ tapodhanāḥ
guruputrān ṛte sarvān nāhaṃ paśyāmi kāṃ cana', null, 1056019),
('ramayana-1-56-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 56, Verse 20', 'इक्ष्वाकूणां हि सर्वेषां पुरोधाः परमा गतिः।
तस्मादनन्तरं सर्वे भवन्तो दैवतं मम॥', 'ikṣvākūṇāṃ hi sarveṣāṃ purodhāḥ paramā gatiḥ
tasmād anantaraṃ sarve bhavanto daivataṃ mama', null, 1056020)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 57 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-57-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 1', 'ततस्त्रिशङ्कोर्वचनं श्रुत्वा क्रोधसमन्वितम्।
ऋषिपुत्रशतं राम राजानमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'tatas triśaṅkor vacanaṃ śrutvā krodhasamanvitam
ṛṣiputraśataṃ rāma rājānam idam abravīt', null, 1057001),
('ramayana-1-57-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 2', 'प्रत्याख्यातोऽसि दुर्बुद्धे गुरुणा सत्यवादिना।
तं कथं समतिक्रम्य शाखान्तरमुपेयिवान्॥', 'pratyākhyāto ''si durbuddhe guruṇā satyavādinā
taṃ kathaṃ samatikramya śākhāntaram upeyivān', null, 1057002),
('ramayana-1-57-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 3', 'इक्ष्वाकूणां हि सर्वेषां पुरोधाः परमा गतिः।
न चातिक्रमितुं शक्यं वचनं सत्यवादिनः॥', 'ikṣvākūṇāṃ hi sarveṣāṃ purodhāḥ paramā gatiḥ
na cātikramituṃ śakyaṃ vacanaṃ satyavādinaḥ', null, 1057003),
('ramayana-1-57-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 4', 'अशक्यमिति चोवाच वसिष्ठो भगवानृषिः।
तं वयं वै समाहर्तुं क्रतुं शक्ताः कथं तव॥', 'aśakyam iti covāca vasiṣṭho bhagavān ṛṣiḥ
taṃ vayaṃ vai samāhartuṃ kratuṃ śaktāḥ kathaṃ tava', null, 1057004),
('ramayana-1-57-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 5', 'बालिशस्त्वं नरश्रेष्ठ गम्यतां स्वपुरं पुनः।
याजने भगवाञ्शक्तस्त्रैलोक्यस्यापि पार्थिव॥', 'bāliśas tvaṃ naraśreṣṭha gamyatāṃ svapuraṃ punaḥ
yājane bhagavāñ śaktas trailokyasyāpi pārthiva', null, 1057005),
('ramayana-1-57-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 6', 'तेषां तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा क्रोधपर्याकुलाक्षरम्।
स राजा पुनरेवैतानिदं वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'teṣāṃ tad vacanaṃ śrutvā krodhaparyākulākṣaram
sa rājā punar evaitān idaṃ vacanam abravīt', null, 1057006),
('ramayana-1-57-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 7', 'प्रत्याख्यातोऽस्मि गुरुणा गुरुपुत्रैस्तथैव च।
अन्यां गतिं गमिष्यामि स्वस्ति वोऽस्तु तपोधनाः॥', 'pratyākhyāto ''smi guruṇā guruputrais tathaiva ca
anyāṃ gatiṃ gamiṣyāmi svasti vo ''stu tapodhanāḥ', null, 1057007),
('ramayana-1-57-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 8', 'ऋषिपुत्रास्तु तच्छ्रुत्वा वाक्यं घोराभिसंहितम्।
शेपुः परमसंक्रुद्धाश्चण्डालत्वं गमिष्यसि।
एवमुक्त्वा महात्मानो विविशुस्ते स्वमाश्रमम्॥', 'ṛṣiputrās tu tac chrutvā vākyaṃ ghorābhisaṃhitam
śepuḥ paramasaṃkruddhāś caṇḍālatvaṃ gamiṣyasi
evam uktvā mahātmāno viviśus te svam āśramam', null, 1057008),
('ramayana-1-57-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 9', 'अथ रात्र्यां व्यतीतायां राजा चण्डालतां गतः।
नीलवस्त्रधरो नीलः परुषो ध्वस्तमूर्धजः।
चित्यमाल्यानुलेपश्च आयसाभरणोऽभवत्॥', 'atha rātryāṃ vyatītāyāṃ rājā caṇḍālatāṃ gataḥ
nīlavastradharo nīlaḥ paruṣo dhvastamūrdhajaḥ
cityamālyānulepaś ca āyasābharaṇo ''bhavat', null, 1057009),
('ramayana-1-57-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 10', 'तं दृष्ट्वा मन्त्रिणः सर्वे त्यक्त्वा चण्डालरूपिणम्।
प्राद्रवन्सहिता राम पौरा येऽस्यानुगामिनः॥', 'taṃ dṛṣṭvā mantriṇaḥ sarve tyaktvā caṇḍālarūpiṇam
prādravan sahitā rāma paurā ye ''syānugāminaḥ', null, 1057010),
('ramayana-1-57-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 11', 'एको हि राजा काकुत्स्थ जगाम परमात्मवान्।
दह्यमानो दिवारात्रं विश्वामित्रं तपोधनम्॥', 'eko hi rājā kākutstha jagāma paramātmavān
dahyamāno divārātraṃ viśvāmitraṃ tapodhanam', null, 1057011),
('ramayana-1-57-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 12', 'विश्वामित्रस्तु तं दृष्ट्वा राजानं विफलीकृतम्।
चण्डालरूपिणं राम मुनिः कारुण्यमागतः॥', 'viśvāmitras tu taṃ dṛṣṭvā rājānaṃ viphalīkṛtam
caṇḍālarūpiṇaṃ rāma muniḥ kāruṇyam āgataḥ', null, 1057012),
('ramayana-1-57-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 13', 'कारुण्यात्स महातेजा वाक्यं परम धार्मिकः।
इदं जगाद भद्रं ते राजानं घोरदर्शनम्॥', 'kāruṇyāt sa mahātejā vākyaṃ parama dhārmikaḥ
idaṃ jagāda bhadraṃ te rājānaṃ ghoradarśanam', null, 1057013),
('ramayana-1-57-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 14', 'किमागमनकार्यं ते राजपुत्र महाबल।
अयोध्याधिपते वीर शापाच्चण्डालतां गतः॥', 'kim āgamanakāryaṃ te rājaputra mahābala
ayodhyādhipate vīra śāpāc caṇḍālatāṃ gataḥ', null, 1057014),
('ramayana-1-57-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 15', 'अथ तद्वाक्यमाकर्ण्य राजा चण्डालतां गतः।
अब्रवीत्प्राञ्जलिर्वाक्यं वाक्यज्ञो वाक्यकोविदम्॥', 'atha tad vākyam ākarṇya rājā caṇḍālatāṃ gataḥ
abravīt prāñjalir vākyaṃ vākyajño vākyakovidam', null, 1057015),
('ramayana-1-57-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 16', 'प्रत्याख्यातोऽस्मि गुरुणा गुरुपुत्रैस्तथैव च।
अनवाप्यैव तं कामं मया प्राप्तो विपर्ययः॥', 'pratyākhyāto ''smi guruṇā guruputrais tathaiva ca
anavāpyaiva taṃ kāmaṃ mayā prāpto viparyayaḥ', null, 1057016),
('ramayana-1-57-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 17', 'सशरीरो दिवं यायामिति मे सौम्यदर्शनम्।
मया चेष्टं क्रतुशतं तच्च नावाप्यते फलम्॥', 'saśarīro divaṃ yāyām iti me saumyadarśanam
mayā ceṣṭaṃ kratuśataṃ tac ca nāvāpyate phalam', null, 1057017),
('ramayana-1-57-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 18', 'अनृतं नोक्त पूर्वं मे न च वक्ष्ये कदा चन।
कृच्छ्रेष्वपि गतः सौम्य क्षत्रधर्मेण ते शपे॥', 'anṛtaṃ nokta pūrvaṃ me na ca vakṣye kadā cana
kṛcchreṣv api gataḥ saumya kṣatradharmeṇa te śape', null, 1057018),
('ramayana-1-57-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 19', 'यज्ञैर्बहुविधैरिष्टं प्रजा धर्मेण पालिताः।
गुरवश्च महात्मानः शीलवृत्तेन तोषिताः॥', 'yajñair bahuvidhair iṣṭaṃ prajā dharmeṇa pālitāḥ
guravaś ca mahātmānaḥ śīlavṛttena toṣitāḥ', null, 1057019),
('ramayana-1-57-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 20', 'धर्मे प्रयतमानस्य यज्ञं चाहर्तुमिच्छतः।
परितोषं न गच्छन्ति गुरवो मुनिपुंगव॥', 'dharme prayatamānasya yajñaṃ cāhartum icchataḥ
paritoṣaṃ na gacchanti guravo munipuṃgava', null, 1057020),
('ramayana-1-57-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 21', 'दैवमेव परं मन्ये पौरुषं तु निरर्थकम्।
दैवेनाक्रम्यते सर्वं दैवं हि परमा गतिः॥', 'daivam eva paraṃ manye pauruṣaṃ tu nirarthakam
daivenākramyate sarvaṃ daivaṃ hi paramā gatiḥ', null, 1057021),
('ramayana-1-57-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 22', 'तस्य मे परमार्तस्य प्रसादमभिकाङ्क्षतः।
कर्तुमर्हसि भद्रं ते दैवोपहतकर्मणः॥', 'tasya me paramārtasya prasādam abhikāṅkṣataḥ
kartum arhasi bhadraṃ te daivopahatakarmaṇaḥ', null, 1057022),
('ramayana-1-57-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 57, Verse 23', 'नान्यां गतिं गमिष्यामि नान्यः शरणमस्ति मे।
दैवं पुरुषकारेण निवर्तयितुमर्हसि॥', 'nānyāṃ gatiṃ gamiṣyāmi nānyaḥ śaraṇam asti me
daivaṃ puruṣakāreṇa nivartayitum arhasi', null, 1057023)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 58 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-58-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 1', 'उक्तवाक्यं तु राजानं कृपया कुशिकात्मजः।
अब्रवीन्मधुरं वाक्यं साक्षाच्चण्डालरूपिणम्॥', 'uktavākyaṃ tu rājānaṃ kṛpayā kuśikātmajaḥ
abravīn madhuraṃ vākyaṃ sākṣāc caṇḍālarūpiṇam', null, 1058001),
('ramayana-1-58-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 2', 'इक्ष्वाको स्वागतं वत्स जानामि त्वां सुधार्मिकम्।
शरणं ते भविष्यामि मा भैषीर्नृपपुंगव॥', 'ikṣvāko svāgataṃ vatsa jānāmi tvāṃ sudhārmikam
śaraṇaṃ te bhaviṣyāmi mā bhaiṣīr nṛpapuṃgava', null, 1058002),
('ramayana-1-58-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 3', 'अहमामन्त्रये सर्वान्महर्षीन्पुण्यकर्मणः।
यज्ञसाह्यकरान्राजंस्ततो यक्ष्यसि निर्वृतः॥', 'aham āmantraye sarvān maharṣīn puṇyakarmaṇaḥ
yajñasāhyakarān rājaṃs tato yakṣyasi nirvṛtaḥ', null, 1058003),
('ramayana-1-58-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 4', 'गुरुशापकृतं रूपं यदिदं त्वयि वर्तते।
अनेन सह रूपेण सशरीरो गमिष्यसि॥', 'guruśāpakṛtaṃ rūpaṃ yad idaṃ tvayi vartate
anena saha rūpeṇa saśarīro gamiṣyasi', null, 1058004),
('ramayana-1-58-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 5', 'हस्तप्राप्तमहं मन्ये स्वर्गं तव नरेश्वर।
यस्त्वं कौशिकमागम्य शरण्यं शरणं गतः॥', 'hastaprāptam ahaṃ manye svargaṃ tava nareśvara
yas tvaṃ kauśikam āgamya śaraṇyaṃ śaraṇaṃ gataḥ', null, 1058005),
('ramayana-1-58-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 6', 'एवमुक्त्वा महातेजाः पुत्रान्परमधार्मिकान्।
व्यादिदेश महाप्राज्ञान्यज्ञसंभारकारणात्॥', 'evam uktvā mahātejāḥ putrān paramadhārmikān
vyādideśa mahāprājñān yajñasaṃbhārakāraṇāt', null, 1058006),
('ramayana-1-58-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 7', 'सर्वाञ्शिष्यान्समाहूय वाक्यमेतदुवाच ह॥', 'sarvāñ śiṣyān samāhūya vākyam etad uvāca ha', null, 1058007),
('ramayana-1-58-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 8', 'सर्वानृषिवरान्वत्सा आनयध्वं ममाज्ञया।
सशिष्यान्सुहृदश्चैव सर्त्विजः सुबहुश्रुतान्॥', 'sarvān ṛṣivarān vatsā ānayadhvaṃ mamājñayā
saśiṣyān suhṛdaś caiva sartvijaḥ subahuśrutān', null, 1058008),
('ramayana-1-58-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 9', 'यदन्यो वचनं ब्रूयान्मद्वाक्यबलचोदितः।
तत्सर्वमखिलेनोक्तं ममाख्येयमनादृतम्॥', 'yad anyo vacanaṃ brūyān madvākyabalacoditaḥ
tat sarvam akhilenoktaṃ mamākhyeyam anādṛtam', null, 1058009),
('ramayana-1-58-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 10', 'तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा दिशो जग्मुस्तदाज्ञया।
आजग्मुरथ देशेभ्यः सर्वेभ्यो ब्रह्मवादिनः॥', 'tasya tad vacanaṃ śrutvā diśo jagmus tadājñayā
ājagmur atha deśebhyaḥ sarvebhyo brahmavādinaḥ', null, 1058010),
('ramayana-1-58-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 11', 'ते च शिष्याः समागम्य मुनिं ज्वलिततेजसं।
ऊचुश्च वचनं सर्वे सर्वेषां ब्रह्मवादिनाम्॥', 'te ca śiṣyāḥ samāgamya muniṃ jvalitatejasaṃ
ūcuś ca vacanaṃ sarve sarveṣāṃ brahmavādinām', null, 1058011),
('ramayana-1-58-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 12', 'श्रुत्वा ते वचनं सर्वे समायान्ति द्विजातयः।
सर्वदेशेषु चागच्छन्वर्जयित्वा महोदयम्॥', 'śrutvā te vacanaṃ sarve samāyānti dvijātayaḥ
sarvadeśeṣu cāgacchan varjayitvā mahodayam', null, 1058012),
('ramayana-1-58-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 13', 'वासिष्ठं तच्छतं सर्वं क्रोधपर्याकुलाक्षरम्।
यदाह वचनं सर्वं शृणु त्वं मुनिपुंगव॥', 'vāsiṣṭhaṃ tac chataṃ sarvaṃ krodhaparyākulākṣaram
yad āha vacanaṃ sarvaṃ śṛṇu tvaṃ munipuṃgava', null, 1058013),
('ramayana-1-58-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 14', 'क्षत्रियो याजको यस्य चण्डालस्य विशेषतः।
कथं सदसि भोक्तारो हविस्तस्य सुरर्षयः॥', 'kṣatriyo yājako yasya caṇḍālasya viśeṣataḥ
kathaṃ sadasi bhoktāro havis tasya surarṣayaḥ', null, 1058014),
('ramayana-1-58-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 15', 'ब्राह्मणा वा महात्मानो भुक्त्वा चण्डालभोजनम्।
कथं स्वर्गं गमिष्यन्ति विश्वामित्रेण पालिताः॥', 'brāhmaṇā vā mahātmāno bhuktvā caṇḍālabhojanam
kathaṃ svargaṃ gamiṣyanti viśvāmitreṇa pālitāḥ', null, 1058015),
('ramayana-1-58-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 16', 'एतद्वचनं नैष्ठुर्यमूचुः संरक्तलोचनाः।
वासिष्ठा मुनिशार्दूल सर्वे ते समहोदयाः॥', 'etad vacanaṃ naiṣṭhuryam ūcuḥ saṃraktalocanāḥ
vāsiṣṭhā muniśārdūla sarve te samahodayāḥ', null, 1058016),
('ramayana-1-58-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 17', 'तेषां तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा सर्वेषां मुनिपुंगवः।
क्रोधसंरक्तनयनः सरोषमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'teṣāṃ tad vacanaṃ śrutvā sarveṣāṃ munipuṃgavaḥ
krodhasaṃraktanayanaḥ saroṣam idam abravīt', null, 1058017),
('ramayana-1-58-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 18', 'यद्दूषयन्त्यदुष्टं मां तप उग्रं समास्थितम्।
भस्मीभूता दुरात्मानो भविष्यन्ति न संशयः॥', 'yad dūṣayanty aduṣṭaṃ māṃ tapa ugraṃ samāsthitam
bhasmībhūtā durātmāno bhaviṣyanti na saṃśayaḥ', null, 1058018),
('ramayana-1-58-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 19', 'अद्य ते कालपाशेन नीता वैवस्वतक्षयम्।
सप्तजातिशतान्येव मृतपाः सन्तु सर्वशः॥', 'adya te kālapāśena nītā vaivasvatakṣayam
saptajātiśatāny eva mṛtapāḥ santu sarvaśaḥ', null, 1058019),
('ramayana-1-58-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 20', 'श्वमांसनियताहारा मुष्टिका नाम निर्घृणाः।
विकृताश्च विरूपाश्च लोकाननुचरन्त्विमान्॥', 'śvamāṃsaniyatāhārā muṣṭikā nāma nirghṛṇāḥ
vikṛtāś ca virūpāś ca lokān anucarantv imān', null, 1058020),
('ramayana-1-58-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 21', 'महोदयश्च दुर्बुद्धिर्मामदूष्यं ह्यदूषयत्।
दूषिटः सर्वलोकेषु निषादत्वं गमिष्यति॥', 'mahodayaś ca durbuddhir mām adūṣyaṃ hy adūṣayat
dūṣiṭaḥ sarvalokeṣu niṣādatvaṃ gamiṣyati', null, 1058021),
('ramayana-1-58-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 22', 'प्राणातिपातनिरतो निरनुक्रोशतां गतः।
दीर्घकालं मम क्रोधाद्दुर्गतिं वर्तयिष्यति॥', 'prāṇātipātanirato niranukrośatāṃ gataḥ
dīrghakālaṃ mama krodhād durgatiṃ vartayiṣyati', null, 1058022),
('ramayana-1-58-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 58, Verse 23', 'एतावदुक्त्वा वचनं विश्वामित्रो महातपाः।
विरराम महातेजा ऋषिमध्ये महामुनिः॥', 'etāvad uktvā vacanaṃ viśvāmitro mahātapāḥ
virarāma mahātejā ṛṣimadhye mahāmuniḥ', null, 1058023)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 59 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-59-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 1', 'तपोबलहतान्कृत्वा वासिष्ठान्समहोदयान्।
ऋषिमध्ये महातेजा विश्वामित्रोऽभ्यभाषत॥', 'tapobalahatān kṛtvā vāsiṣṭhān samahodayān
ṛṣimadhye mahātejā viśvāmitro ''bhyabhāṣata', null, 1059001),
('ramayana-1-59-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 2', 'अयमिक्ष्वाकुदायादस्त्रिशङ्कुरिति विश्रुतः।
धर्मिष्ठश्च वदान्यश्च मां चैव शरणं गतः।
स्वेनानेन शरीरेण देवलोकजिगीषया॥', 'ayam ikṣvākudāyādas triśaṅkur iti viśrutaḥ
dharmiṣṭhaś ca vadānyaś ca māṃ caiva śaraṇaṃ gataḥ
svenānena śarīreṇa devalokajigīṣayā', null, 1059002),
('ramayana-1-59-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 3', 'यथायं स्वशरीरेण देवलोकं गमिष्यति।
तथा प्रवर्त्यतां यज्ञो भवद्भिश्च मया सह॥', 'yathāyaṃ svaśarīreṇa devalokaṃ gamiṣyati
tathā pravartyatāṃ yajño bhavadbhiś ca mayā saha', null, 1059003),
('ramayana-1-59-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 4', 'विश्वामित्रवचः श्रुत्वा सर्व एव महर्षयः।
ऊचुः समेत्य सहिता धर्मज्ञा धर्मसंहितम्॥', 'viśvāmitravacaḥ śrutvā sarva eva maharṣayaḥ
ūcuḥ sametya sahitā dharmajñā dharmasaṃhitam', null, 1059004),
('ramayana-1-59-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 5', 'अयं कुशिकदायादो मुनिः परमकोपनः।
यदाह वचनं सम्यगेतत्कार्यं न संशयः॥', 'ayaṃ kuśikadāyādo muniḥ paramakopanaḥ
yad āha vacanaṃ samyag etat kāryaṃ na saṃśayaḥ', null, 1059005),
('ramayana-1-59-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 6', 'अग्निकल्पो हि भगवाञ्शापं दास्यति रोषितः।
तस्मात्प्रवर्त्यतां यज्ञः सशरीरो यथा दिवम्।
गच्छेदिक्ष्वाकुदायादो विश्वामित्रस्य तेजसा॥', 'agnikalpo hi bhagavāñ śāpaṃ dāsyati roṣitaḥ
tasmāt pravartyatāṃ yajñaḥ saśarīro yathā divam
gacched ikṣvākudāyādo viśvāmitrasya tejasā', null, 1059006),
('ramayana-1-59-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 7', 'ततः प्रवर्त्यतां यज्ञः सर्वे समधितिष्ठते॥', 'tataḥ pravartyatāṃ yajñaḥ sarve samadhitiṣṭhate', null, 1059007),
('ramayana-1-59-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 8', 'एवमुक्त्वा महर्षयः संजह्रुस्ताः क्रियास्तदा।
याजकाश्च महातेजा विश्वामित्रोऽभवत्क्रतौ॥', 'evam uktvā maharṣayaḥ saṃjahrus tāḥ kriyās tadā
yājakāś ca mahātejā viśvāmitro ''bhavat kratau', null, 1059008),
('ramayana-1-59-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 9', 'ऋत्विजश्चानुपूर्व्येण मन्त्रवन्मन्त्रकोविदाः।
चक्रुः सर्वाणि कर्माणि यथाकल्पं यथाविधि॥', 'ṛtvijaś cānupūrvyeṇa mantravan mantrakovidāḥ
cakruḥ sarvāṇi karmāṇi yathākalpaṃ yathāvidhi', null, 1059009),
('ramayana-1-59-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 10', 'ततः कालेन महता विश्वामित्रो महातपाः।
चकारावाहनं तत्र भागार्थं सर्वदेवताः॥', 'tataḥ kālena mahatā viśvāmitro mahātapāḥ
cakārāvāhanaṃ tatra bhāgārthaṃ sarvadevatāḥ', null, 1059010),
('ramayana-1-59-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 11', 'नाह्यागमंस्तदाहूता भागार्थं सर्वदेवताः।
ततः क्रोधसमाविष्टो विश्वमित्रो महामुनिः॥', 'nāhyāgamaṃs tadāhūtā bhāgārthaṃ sarvadevatāḥ
tataḥ krodhasamāviṣṭo viśvamitro mahāmuniḥ', null, 1059011),
('ramayana-1-59-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 12', 'स्रुवमुद्यम्य सक्रोधस्त्रिशङ्कुमिदमब्रवीत्।
पश्य मे तपसो वीर्यं स्वार्जितस्य नरेश्वर॥', 'sruvam udyamya sakrodhas triśaṅkum idam abravīt
paśya me tapaso vīryaṃ svārjitasya nareśvara', null, 1059012),
('ramayana-1-59-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 13', 'एष त्वां स्वशरीरेण नयामि स्वर्गमोजसा।
दुष्प्रापं स्वशरीरेण दिवं गच्छ नराधिप॥', 'eṣa tvāṃ svaśarīreṇa nayāmi svargam ojasā
duṣprāpaṃ svaśarīreṇa divaṃ gaccha narādhipa', null, 1059013),
('ramayana-1-59-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 14', 'स्वार्जितं किं चिदप्यस्ति मया हि तपसः फलम्।
राजंस्त्वं तेजसा तस्य सशरीरो दिवं व्रज॥', 'svārjitaṃ kiṃ cid apy asti mayā hi tapasaḥ phalam
rājaṃs tvaṃ tejasā tasya saśarīro divaṃ vraja', null, 1059014),
('ramayana-1-59-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 15', 'उक्तवाक्ये मुनौ तस्मिन्सशरीरो नरेश्वरः।
दिवं जगाम काकुत्स्थ मुनीनां पश्यतां तदा॥', 'uktavākye munau tasmin saśarīro nareśvaraḥ
divaṃ jagāma kākutstha munīnāṃ paśyatāṃ tadā', null, 1059015),
('ramayana-1-59-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 16', 'देवलोकगतं दृष्ट्वा त्रिशङ्कुं पाकशासनः।
सह सर्वैः सुरगणैरिदं वचनमब्रवीत्॥', 'devalokagataṃ dṛṣṭvā triśaṅkuṃ pākaśāsanaḥ
saha sarvaiḥ suragaṇair idaṃ vacanam abravīt', null, 1059016),
('ramayana-1-59-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 17', 'त्रिशङ्को गच्छ भूयस्त्वं नासि स्वर्गकृतालयः।
गुरुशापहतो मूढ पत भूमिमवाक्शिराः॥', 'triśaṅko gaccha bhūyas tvaṃ nāsi svargakṛtālayaḥ
guruśāpahato mūḍha pata bhūmim avākśirāḥ', null, 1059017),
('ramayana-1-59-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 18', 'एवमुक्तो महेन्द्रेण त्रिशङ्कुरपतत्पुनः।
विक्रोशमानस्त्राहीति विश्वामित्रं तपोधनम्॥', 'evam ukto mahendreṇa triśaṅkur apatat punaḥ
vikrośamānas trāhīti viśvāmitraṃ tapodhanam', null, 1059018),
('ramayana-1-59-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 19', 'तच्छ्रुत्वा वचनं तस्य क्रोशमानस्य कौशिकः।
रोषमाहारयत्तीव्रं तिष्ठ तिष्ठेति चाब्रवीत्॥', 'tac chrutvā vacanaṃ tasya krośamānasya kauśikaḥ
roṣam āhārayat tīvraṃ tiṣṭha tiṣṭheti cābravīt', null, 1059019),
('ramayana-1-59-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 20', 'ऋषिमध्ये स तेजस्वी प्रजापतिरिवापरः।
सृजन्दक्षिणमार्गस्थान्सप्तर्षीनपरान्पुनः॥', 'ṛṣimadhye sa tejasvī prajāpatir ivāparaḥ
sṛjan dakṣiṇamārgasthān saptarṣīn aparān punaḥ', null, 1059020),
('ramayana-1-59-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 21', 'नक्षत्रमालामपरामसृजत्क्रोधमूर्छितः।
दक्षिणां दिशमास्थाय मुनिमध्ये महायशाः॥', 'nakṣatramālām aparām asṛjat krodhamūrchitaḥ
dakṣiṇāṃ diśam āsthāya munimadhye mahāyaśāḥ', null, 1059021),
('ramayana-1-59-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 22', 'सृष्ट्वा नक्षत्रवंशं च क्रोधेन कलुषीकृतः।
अन्यमिन्द्रं करिष्यामि लोको वा स्यादनिन्द्रकः।
दैवतान्यपि स क्रोधात्स्रष्टुं समुपचक्रमे॥', 'sṛṣṭvā nakṣatravaṃśaṃ ca krodhena kaluṣīkṛtaḥ
anyam indraṃ kariṣyāmi loko vā syād anindrakaḥ
daivatāny api sa krodhāt sraṣṭuṃ samupacakrame', null, 1059022),
('ramayana-1-59-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 23', 'ततः परमसंभ्रान्ताः सर्षिसंघाः सुरर्षभाः।
विश्वामित्रं महात्मानमूचुः सानुनयं वचः॥', 'tataḥ paramasaṃbhrāntāḥ sarṣisaṃghāḥ surarṣabhāḥ
viśvāmitraṃ mahātmānam ūcuḥ sānunayaṃ vacaḥ', null, 1059023),
('ramayana-1-59-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 24', 'अयं राजा महाभाग गुरुशापपरिक्षतः।
सशरीरो दिवं यातुं नार्हत्येव तपोधन॥', 'ayaṃ rājā mahābhāga guruśāpaparikṣataḥ
saśarīro divaṃ yātuṃ nārhaty eva tapodhana', null, 1059024),
('ramayana-1-59-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 25', 'तेषां तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा देवानां मुनिपुंगवः।
अब्रवीत्सुमहद्वाक्यं कौशिकः सर्वदेवताः॥', 'teṣāṃ tad vacanaṃ śrutvā devānāṃ munipuṃgavaḥ
abravīt sumahad vākyaṃ kauśikaḥ sarvadevatāḥ', null, 1059025),
('ramayana-1-59-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 26', 'सशरीरस्य भद्रं वस्त्रिशङ्कोरस्य भूपतेः।
आरोहणं प्रतिज्ञाय नानृतं कर्तुमुत्सहे॥', 'saśarīrasya bhadraṃ vas triśaṅkor asya bhūpateḥ
ārohaṇaṃ pratijñāya nānṛtaṃ kartum utsahe', null, 1059026),
('ramayana-1-59-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 27', 'सर्गोऽस्तु सशरीरस्य त्रिशङ्कोरस्य शाश्वतः।
नक्षत्राणि च सर्वाणि मामकानि ध्रुवाण्यथ॥', 'sargo ''stu saśarīrasya triśaṅkor asya śāśvataḥ
nakṣatrāṇi ca sarvāṇi māmakāni dhruvāṇy atha', null, 1059027),
('ramayana-1-59-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 28', 'यावल्लोका धरिष्यन्ति तिष्ठन्त्वेतानि सर्वशः।
मत्कृतानि सुराः सर्वे तदनुज्ञातुमर्हथ॥', 'yāval lokā dhariṣyanti tiṣṭhantv etāni sarvaśaḥ
matkṛtāni surāḥ sarve tad anujñātum arhatha', null, 1059028),
('ramayana-1-59-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 29', 'एवमुक्ताः सुराः सर्वे प्रत्यूचुर्मुनिपुंगवम्॥', 'evam uktāḥ surāḥ sarve pratyūcur munipuṃgavam', null, 1059029),
('ramayana-1-59-30', 30, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 30', 'एवं भवतु भद्रं ते तिष्ठन्त्वेतानि सर्वशः।
गगने तान्यनेकानि वैश्वानरपथाद्बहिः॥', 'evaṃ bhavatu bhadraṃ te tiṣṭhantv etāni sarvaśaḥ
gagane tāny anekāni vaiśvānarapathād bahiḥ', null, 1059030),
('ramayana-1-59-31', 31, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 31', 'नक्षत्राणि मुनिश्रेष्ठ तेषु ज्योतिःषु जाज्वलन्।
अवाक्शिरास्त्रिशङ्कुश्च तिष्ठत्वमरसंनिभः॥', 'nakṣatrāṇi muniśreṣṭha teṣu jyotiḥṣu jājvalan
avākśirās triśaṅkuś ca tiṣṭhatv amarasaṃnibhaḥ', null, 1059031),
('ramayana-1-59-32', 32, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 32', 'विश्वामित्रस्तु धर्मात्मा सर्वदेवैरभिष्टुतः।
ऋषिभिश्च महातेजा बाढमित्याह देवताः॥', 'viśvāmitras tu dharmātmā sarvadevair abhiṣṭutaḥ
ṛṣibhiś ca mahātejā bāḍham ity āha devatāḥ', null, 1059032),
('ramayana-1-59-33', 33, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 59, Verse 33', 'ततो देवा महात्मानो मुनयश्च तपोधनाः।
जग्मुर्यथागतं सर्वे यज्ञस्यान्ते नरोत्तम॥', 'tato devā mahātmāno munayaś ca tapodhanāḥ
jagmur yathāgataṃ sarve yajñasyānte narottama', null, 1059033)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 60 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-60-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 1', 'विश्वामित्रो महात्माथ प्रस्थितान्प्रेक्ष्य तानृषीन्।
अब्रवीन्नरशार्दूल सर्वांस्तान्वनवासिनः॥', 'viśvāmitro mahātmātha prasthitān prekṣya tān ṛṣīn
abravīn naraśārdūla sarvāṃs tān vanavāsinaḥ', null, 1060001),
('ramayana-1-60-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 2', 'महाविघ्नः प्रवृत्तोऽयं दक्षिणामास्थितो दिशम्।
दिशमन्यां प्रपत्स्यामस्तत्र तप्स्यामहे तपः॥', 'mahāvighnaḥ pravṛtto ''yaṃ dakṣiṇām āsthito diśam
diśam anyāṃ prapatsyāmas tatra tapsyāmahe tapaḥ', null, 1060002),
('ramayana-1-60-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 3', 'पश्चिमायां विशालायां पुष्करेषु महात्मनः।
सुखं तपश्चरिष्यामः परं तद्धि तपोवनम्॥', 'paścimāyāṃ viśālāyāṃ puṣkareṣu mahātmanaḥ
sukhaṃ tapaś cariṣyāmaḥ paraṃ tad dhi tapovanam', null, 1060003),
('ramayana-1-60-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 4', 'एवमुक्त्वा महातेजाः पुष्करेषु महामुनिः।
तप उग्रं दुराधर्षं तेपे मूलफलाशनः॥', 'evam uktvā mahātejāḥ puṣkareṣu mahāmuniḥ
tapa ugraṃ durādharṣaṃ tepe mūlaphalāśanaḥ', null, 1060004),
('ramayana-1-60-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 5', 'एतस्मिन्नेव काले तु अयोध्याधिपतिर्नृपः।
अम्बरीष इति ख्यातो यष्टुं समुपचक्रमे॥', 'etasminn eva kāle tu ayodhyādhipatir nṛpaḥ
ambarīṣa iti khyāto yaṣṭuṃ samupacakrame', null, 1060005),
('ramayana-1-60-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 6', 'तस्य वै यजमानस्य पशुमिन्द्रो जहार ह।
प्रनष्टे तु पशौ विप्रो राजानमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'tasya vai yajamānasya paśum indro jahāra ha
pranaṣṭe tu paśau vipro rājānam idam abravīt', null, 1060006),
('ramayana-1-60-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 7', 'पशुरद्य हृतो राजन्प्रनष्टस्तव दुर्नयात्।
अरक्षितारं राजानं घ्नन्ति दोषा नरेश्वर॥', 'paśur adya hṛto rājan pranaṣṭas tava durnayāt
arakṣitāraṃ rājānaṃ ghnanti doṣā nareśvara', null, 1060007),
('ramayana-1-60-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 8', 'प्रायश्चित्तं महद्ध्येतन्नरं वा पुरुषर्षभ।
आनयस्व पशुं शीघ्रं यावत्कर्म प्रवर्तते॥', 'prāyaścittaṃ mahad dhy etan naraṃ vā puruṣarṣabha
ānayasva paśuṃ śīghraṃ yāvat karma pravartate', null, 1060008),
('ramayana-1-60-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 9', 'उपाध्याय वचः श्रुत्वा स राजा पुरुषर्षभ।
अन्वियेष महाबुद्धिः पशुं गोभिः सहस्रशः॥', 'upādhyāya vacaḥ śrutvā sa rājā puruṣarṣabha
anviyeṣa mahābuddhiḥ paśuṃ gobhiḥ sahasraśaḥ', null, 1060009),
('ramayana-1-60-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 10', 'देशाञ्जनपदांस्तांस्तान्नगराणि वनानि च।
आश्रमाणि च पुण्यानि मार्गमाणो महीपतिः॥', 'deśāñ janapadāṃs tāṃs tān nagarāṇi vanāni ca
āśramāṇi ca puṇyāni mārgamāṇo mahīpatiḥ', null, 1060010),
('ramayana-1-60-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 11', 'स पुत्रसहितं तात सभार्यं रघुनन्दन।
भृगुतुङ्गे समासीनमृचीकं संददर्श ह॥', 'sa putrasahitaṃ tāta sabhāryaṃ raghunandana
bhṛgutuṅge samāsīnam ṛcīkaṃ saṃdadarśa ha', null, 1060011),
('ramayana-1-60-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 12', 'तमुवाच महातेजाः प्रणम्याभिप्रसाद्य च।
ब्रह्मर्षिं तपसा दीप्तं राजर्षिरमितप्रभः।
पृष्ट्वा सर्वत्र कुशलमृचीकं तमिदं वचः॥', 'tam uvāca mahātejāḥ praṇamyābhiprasādya ca
brahmarṣiṃ tapasā dīptaṃ rājarṣir amitaprabhaḥ
pṛṣṭvā sarvatra kuśalam ṛcīkaṃ tam idaṃ vacaḥ', null, 1060012),
('ramayana-1-60-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 13', 'गवां शतसहस्रेण विक्रिणीषे सुतं यदि।
पशोरर्थे महाभाग कृतकृत्योऽस्मि भार्गव॥', 'gavāṃ śatasahasreṇa vikriṇīṣe sutaṃ yadi
paśor arthe mahābhāga kṛtakṛtyo ''smi bhārgava', null, 1060013),
('ramayana-1-60-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 14', 'सर्वे परिसृता देशा यज्ञियं न लभे पशुम्।
दातुमर्हसि मूल्येन सुतमेकमितो मम॥', 'sarve parisṛtā deśā yajñiyaṃ na labhe paśum
dātum arhasi mūlyena sutam ekam ito mama', null, 1060014),
('ramayana-1-60-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 15', 'एवमुक्तो महातेजा ऋचीकस्त्वब्रवीद्वचः।
नाहं ज्येष्ठं नरश्रेष्ठं विक्रीणीयां कथं चन॥', 'evam ukto mahātejā ṛcīkas tv abravīd vacaḥ
nāhaṃ jyeṣṭhaṃ naraśreṣṭhaṃ vikrīṇīyāṃ kathaṃ cana', null, 1060015),
('ramayana-1-60-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 16', 'ऋचीकस्य वचः श्रुत्वा तेषां माता महात्मनाम्।
उवाच नरशार्दूलमम्बरीषं तपस्विनी॥', 'ṛcīkasya vacaḥ śrutvā teṣāṃ mātā mahātmanām
uvāca naraśārdūlam ambarīṣaṃ tapasvinī', null, 1060016),
('ramayana-1-60-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 17', 'ममापि दयितं विद्धि कनिष्ठं शुनकं नृप॥', 'mamāpi dayitaṃ viddhi kaniṣṭhaṃ śunakaṃ nṛpa', null, 1060017),
('ramayana-1-60-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 18', 'प्रायेण हि नरश्रेष्ठ ज्येष्ठाः पितृषु वल्लभाः।
मातॄणां च कनीयांसस्तस्माद्रक्षे कनीयसं॥', 'prāyeṇa hi naraśreṣṭha jyeṣṭhāḥ pitṛṣu vallabhāḥ
mātṝṇāṃ ca kanīyāṃsas tasmād rakṣe kanīyasaṃ', null, 1060018),
('ramayana-1-60-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 19', 'उक्तवाक्ये मुनौ तस्मिन्मुनिपत्न्यां तथैव च।
शुनःशेपः स्वयं राम मध्यमो वाक्यमब्रवीत्॥', 'uktavākye munau tasmin munipatnyāṃ tathaiva ca
śunaḥśepaḥ svayaṃ rāma madhyamo vākyam abravīt', null, 1060019),
('ramayana-1-60-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 20', 'पिता ज्येष्ठमविक्रेयं माता चाह कनीयसं।
विक्रीतं मध्यमं मन्ये राजन्पुत्रं नयस्व माम्॥', 'pitā jyeṣṭham avikreyaṃ mātā cāha kanīyasaṃ
vikrītaṃ madhyamaṃ manye rājan putraṃ nayasva mām', null, 1060020),
('ramayana-1-60-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 21', 'गवां शतसहस्रेण शुनःशेपं नरेश्वरः।
गृहीत्वा परमप्रीतो जगाम रघुनन्दन॥', 'gavāṃ śatasahasreṇa śunaḥśepaṃ nareśvaraḥ
gṛhītvā paramaprīto jagāma raghunandana', null, 1060021),
('ramayana-1-60-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 60, Verse 22', 'अम्बरीषस्तु राजर्षी रथमारोप्य सत्वरः।
शुनःशेपं महातेजा जगामाशु महायशाः॥', 'ambarīṣas tu rājarṣī ratham āropya satvaraḥ
śunaḥśepaṃ mahātejā jagāmāśu mahāyaśāḥ', null, 1060022)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 61 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-61-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 1', 'शुनःशेपं नरश्रेष्ठ गृहीत्वा तु महायशाः।
व्यश्राम्यत्पुष्करे राजा मध्याह्ने रघुनन्दन॥', 'śunaḥśepaṃ naraśreṣṭha gṛhītvā tu mahāyaśāḥ
vyaśrāmyat puṣkare rājā madhyāhne raghunandana', null, 1061001),
('ramayana-1-61-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 2', 'तस्य विश्रममाणस्य शुनःशेपो महायशाः।
पुष्करं श्रेष्ठमागम्य विश्वामित्रं ददर्श ह॥', 'tasya viśramamāṇasya śunaḥśepo mahāyaśāḥ
puṣkaraṃ śreṣṭham āgamya viśvāmitraṃ dadarśa ha', null, 1061002),
('ramayana-1-61-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 3', 'विषण्णवदनो दीनस्तृष्णया च श्रमेण च।
पपाताङ्के मुने राम वाक्यं चेदमुवाच ह॥', 'viṣaṇṇavadano dīnas tṛṣṇayā ca śrameṇa ca
papātāṅke mune rāma vākyaṃ cedam uvāca ha', null, 1061003),
('ramayana-1-61-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 4', 'न मेऽस्ति माता न पिता ज्ञातयो बान्धवाः कुतः।
त्रातुमर्हसि मां सौम्य धर्मेण मुनिपुंगव॥', 'na me ''sti mātā na pitā jñātayo bāndhavāḥ kutaḥ
trātum arhasi māṃ saumya dharmeṇa munipuṃgava', null, 1061004),
('ramayana-1-61-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 5', 'त्राता त्वं हि मुनिश्रेष्ठ सर्वेषां त्वं हि भावनः।
राजा च कृतकार्यः स्यादहं दीर्घायुरव्ययः॥', 'trātā tvaṃ hi muniśreṣṭha sarveṣāṃ tvaṃ hi bhāvanaḥ
rājā ca kṛtakāryaḥ syād ahaṃ dīrghāyur avyayaḥ', null, 1061005),
('ramayana-1-61-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 6', 'स्वर्गलोकमुपाश्नीयां तपस्तप्त्वा ह्यनुत्तमम्।
स मे नाथो ह्यनाथस्य भव भव्येन चेतसा।
पितेव पुत्रं धर्मात्मंस्त्रातुमर्हसि किल्बिषात्॥', 'svargalokam upāśnīyāṃ tapas taptvā hy anuttamam
sa me nātho hy anāthasya bhava bhavyena cetasā
piteva putraṃ dharmātmaṃs trātum arhasi kilbiṣāt', null, 1061006),
('ramayana-1-61-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 7', 'तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा विश्वामित्रो महातपाः।
सान्त्वयित्वा बहुविधं पुत्रानिदमुवाच ह॥', 'tasya tad vacanaṃ śrutvā viśvāmitro mahātapāḥ
sāntvayitvā bahuvidhaṃ putrān idam uvāca ha', null, 1061007),
('ramayana-1-61-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 8', 'यत्कृते पितरः पुत्राञ्जनयन्ति शुभार्थिनः।
परलोकहितार्थाय तस्य कालोऽयमागतः॥', 'yatkṛte pitaraḥ putrāñ janayanti śubhārthinaḥ
paralokahitārthāya tasya kālo ''yam āgataḥ', null, 1061008),
('ramayana-1-61-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 9', 'अयं मुनिसुतो बालो मत्तः शरणमिच्छति।
अस्य जीवितमात्रेण प्रियं कुरुत पुत्रकाः॥', 'ayaṃ munisuto bālo mattaḥ śaraṇam icchati
asya jīvitamātreṇa priyaṃ kuruta putrakāḥ', null, 1061009),
('ramayana-1-61-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 10', 'सर्वे सुकृतकर्माणः सर्वे धर्मपरायणाः।
पशुभूता नरेन्द्रस्य तृप्तिमग्नेः प्रयच्छत॥', 'sarve sukṛtakarmāṇaḥ sarve dharmaparāyaṇāḥ
paśubhūtā narendrasya tṛptim agneḥ prayacchata', null, 1061010),
('ramayana-1-61-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 11', 'नाथवांश्च शुनःशेपो यज्ञश्चाविघ्नतो भवेत्।
देवतास्तर्पिताश्च स्युर्मम चापि कृतं वचः॥', 'nāthavāṃś ca śunaḥśepo yajñaś cāvighnato bhavet
devatās tarpitāś ca syur mama cāpi kṛtaṃ vacaḥ', null, 1061011),
('ramayana-1-61-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 12', 'मुनेस्तु वचनं श्रुत्वा मधुष्यन्दादयः सुताः।
साभिमानं नरश्रेष्ठ सलीलमिदमब्रुवन्॥', 'munes tu vacanaṃ śrutvā madhuṣyandādayaḥ sutāḥ
sābhimānaṃ naraśreṣṭha salīlam idam abruvan', null, 1061012),
('ramayana-1-61-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 13', 'कथमात्मसुतान्हित्वा त्रायसेऽन्यसुतं विभो।
अकार्यमिव पश्यामः श्वमांसमिव भोजने॥', 'katham ātmasutān hitvā trāyase ''nyasutaṃ vibho
akāryam iva paśyāmaḥ śvamāṃsam iva bhojane', null, 1061013),
('ramayana-1-61-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 14', 'तेषां तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा पुत्राणां मुनिपुंगवः।
क्रोधसंरक्तनयनो व्याहर्तुमुपचक्रमे॥', 'teṣāṃ tad vacanaṃ śrutvā putrāṇāṃ munipuṃgavaḥ
krodhasaṃraktanayano vyāhartum upacakrame', null, 1061014),
('ramayana-1-61-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 15', 'निःसाध्वसमिदं प्रोक्तं धर्मादपि विगर्हितम्।
अतिक्रम्य तु मद्वाक्यं दारुणं रोमहर्षणम्॥', 'niḥsādhvasam idaṃ proktaṃ dharmād api vigarhitam
atikramya tu madvākyaṃ dāruṇaṃ romaharṣaṇam', null, 1061015),
('ramayana-1-61-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 16', 'श्वमांसभोजिनः सर्वे वासिष्ठा इव जातिषु।
पूर्णं वर्षसहस्रं तु पृथिव्यामनुवत्स्यथ॥', 'śvamāṃsabhojinaḥ sarve vāsiṣṭhā iva jātiṣu
pūrṇaṃ varṣasahasraṃ tu pṛthivyām anuvatsyatha', null, 1061016),
('ramayana-1-61-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 17', 'कृत्वा शापसमायुक्तान्पुत्रान्मुनिवरस्तदा।
शुनःशेपमुवाचार्तं कृत्वा रक्षां निरामयाम्॥', 'kṛtvā śāpasamāyuktān putrān munivaras tadā
śunaḥśepam uvācārtaṃ kṛtvā rakṣāṃ nirāmayām', null, 1061017),
('ramayana-1-61-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 18', 'पवित्रपाशैरासक्तो रक्तमाल्यानुलेपनः।
वैष्णवं यूपमासाद्य वाग्भिरग्निमुदाहर॥', 'pavitrapāśair āsakto raktamālyānulepanaḥ
vaiṣṇavaṃ yūpam āsādya vāgbhir agnim udāhara', null, 1061018),
('ramayana-1-61-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 19', 'इमे तु गाथे द्वे दिव्ये गायेथा मुनिपुत्रक।
अम्बरीषस्य यज्ञेऽस्मिंस्ततः सिद्धिमवाप्स्यसि॥', 'ime tu gāthe dve divye gāyethā muniputraka
ambarīṣasya yajñe ''smiṃs tataḥ siddhim avāpsyasi', null, 1061019),
('ramayana-1-61-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 20', 'शुनःशेपो गृहीत्वा ते द्वे गाथे सुसमाहितः।
त्वरया राजसिंहं तमम्बरीषमुवाच ह॥', 'śunaḥśepo gṛhītvā te dve gāthe susamāhitaḥ
tvarayā rājasiṃhaṃ tam ambarīṣam uvāca ha', null, 1061020),
('ramayana-1-61-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 21', 'राजसिंह महासत्त्व शीघ्रं गच्छावहे सदः।
निवर्तयस्व राजेन्द्र दीक्षां च समुपाहर॥', 'rājasiṃha mahāsattva śīghraṃ gacchāvahe sadaḥ
nivartayasva rājendra dīkṣāṃ ca samupāhara', null, 1061021),
('ramayana-1-61-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 22', 'तद्वाक्यमृषिपुत्रस्य श्रुत्वा हर्षं समुत्सुकः।
जगाम नृपतिः शीघ्रं यज्ञवाटमतन्द्रितः॥', 'tad vākyam ṛṣiputrasya śrutvā harṣaṃ samutsukaḥ
jagāma nṛpatiḥ śīghraṃ yajñavāṭam atandritaḥ', null, 1061022),
('ramayana-1-61-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 23', 'सदस्यानुमते राजा पवित्रकृतलक्षणम्।
पशुं रक्ताम्बरं कृत्वा यूपे तं समबन्धयत्॥', 'sadasyānumate rājā pavitrakṛtalakṣaṇam
paśuṃ raktāmbaraṃ kṛtvā yūpe taṃ samabandhayat', null, 1061023),
('ramayana-1-61-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 24', 'स बद्धो वाग्भिरग्र्याभिरभितुष्टाव वै सुरौ।
इन्द्रमिन्द्रानुजं चैव यथावन्मुनिपुत्रकः॥', 'sa baddho vāgbhir agryābhir abhituṣṭāva vai surau
indram indrānujaṃ caiva yathāvan muniputrakaḥ', null, 1061024),
('ramayana-1-61-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 25', 'ततः प्रीतः सहस्राक्षो रहस्यस्तुतितर्पितः।
दीर्घमायुस्तदा प्रादाच्छुनःशेपाय राघव॥', 'tataḥ prītaḥ sahasrākṣo rahasyastutitarpitaḥ
dīrgham āyus tadā prādāc chunaḥśepāya rāghava', null, 1061025),
('ramayana-1-61-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 26', 'स च राजा नरश्रेष्ठ यज्ञस्य च समाप्तवान्।
फलं बहुगुणं राम सहस्राक्षप्रसादजम्॥', 'sa ca rājā naraśreṣṭha yajñasya ca samāptavān
phalaṃ bahuguṇaṃ rāma sahasrākṣaprasādajam', null, 1061026),
('ramayana-1-61-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 61, Verse 27', 'विश्वामित्रोऽपि धर्मात्मा भूयस्तेपे महातपाः।
पुष्करेषु नरश्रेष्ठ दशवर्षशतानि च॥', 'viśvāmitro ''pi dharmātmā bhūyas tepe mahātapāḥ
puṣkareṣu naraśreṣṭha daśavarṣaśatāni ca', null, 1061027)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 62 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-62-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 1', 'पूर्णे वर्षसहस्रे तु व्रतस्नातं महामुनिम्।
अभ्यागच्छन्सुराः सर्वे तपःफलचिकीर्षवः॥', 'pūrṇe varṣasahasre tu vratasnātaṃ mahāmunim
abhyāgacchan surāḥ sarve tapaḥphalacikīrṣavaḥ', null, 1062001),
('ramayana-1-62-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 2', 'अब्रवीत्सुमहातेजा ब्रह्मा सुरुचिरं वचः।
ऋषिस्त्वमसि भद्रं ते स्वार्जितैः कर्मभिः शुभैः॥', 'abravīt sumahātejā brahmā suruciraṃ vacaḥ
ṛṣis tvam asi bhadraṃ te svārjitaiḥ karmabhiḥ śubhaiḥ', null, 1062002),
('ramayana-1-62-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 3', 'तमेवमुक्त्वा देवेशस्त्रिदिवं पुनरभ्यगात्।
विश्वामित्रो महातेजा भूयस्तेपे महत्तपः॥', 'tam evam uktvā deveśas tridivaṃ punar abhyagāt
viśvāmitro mahātejā bhūyas tepe mahat tapaḥ', null, 1062003),
('ramayana-1-62-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 4', 'ततः कालेन महता मेनका परमाप्सराः।
पुष्करेषु नरश्रेष्ठ स्नातुं समुपचक्रमे॥', 'tataḥ kālena mahatā menakā paramāpsarāḥ
puṣkareṣu naraśreṣṭha snātuṃ samupacakrame', null, 1062004),
('ramayana-1-62-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 5', 'तां ददर्श महातेजा मेनकां कुशिकात्मजः।
रूपेणाप्रतिमां तत्र विद्युतं जलदे यथा॥', 'tāṃ dadarśa mahātejā menakāṃ kuśikātmajaḥ
rūpeṇāpratimāṃ tatra vidyutaṃ jalade yathā', null, 1062005),
('ramayana-1-62-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 6', 'दृष्ट्वा कन्दर्पवशगो मुनिस्तामिदमब्रवीत्।
अप्सरः स्वागतं तेऽस्तु वस चेह ममाश्रमे।
अनुगृह्णीष्व भद्रं ते मदनेन सुमोहितम्॥', 'dṛṣṭvā kandarpavaśago munis tām idam abravīt
apsaraḥ svāgataṃ te ''stu vasa ceha mamāśrame
anugṛhṇīṣva bhadraṃ te madanena sumohitam', null, 1062006),
('ramayana-1-62-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 7', 'इत्युक्ता सा वरारोहा तत्रावासमथाकरोत्।
तपसो हि महाविघ्नो विश्वामित्रमुपागतः॥', 'ity uktā sā varārohā tatrāvāsam athākarot
tapaso hi mahāvighno viśvāmitram upāgataḥ', null, 1062007),
('ramayana-1-62-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 8', 'तस्यां वसन्त्यां वर्षाणि पञ्च पञ्च च राघव।
विश्वामित्राश्रमे सौम्य सुखेन व्यतिचक्रमुः॥', 'tasyāṃ vasantyāṃ varṣāṇi pañca pañca ca rāghava
viśvāmitrāśrame saumya sukhena vyaticakramuḥ', null, 1062008),
('ramayana-1-62-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 9', 'अथ काले गते तस्मिन्विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
सव्रीड इव संवृत्तश्चिन्ताशोकपरायणः॥', 'atha kāle gate tasmin viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
savrīḍa iva saṃvṛttaś cintāśokaparāyaṇaḥ', null, 1062009),
('ramayana-1-62-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 10', 'बुद्धिर्मुनेः समुत्पन्ना सामर्षा रघुनन्दन।
सर्वं सुराणां कर्मैतत्तपोऽपहरणं महत्॥', 'buddhir muneḥ samutpannā sāmarṣā raghunandana
sarvaṃ surāṇāṃ karmaitat tapo''paharaṇaṃ mahat', null, 1062010),
('ramayana-1-62-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 11', 'अहोरात्रापदेशेन गताः संवत्सरा दश।
काममोहाभिभूतस्य विघ्नोऽयं प्रत्युपस्थितः॥', 'ahorātrāpadeśena gatāḥ saṃvatsarā daśa
kāmamohābhibhūtasya vighno ''yaṃ pratyupasthitaḥ', null, 1062011),
('ramayana-1-62-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 12', 'विनिःश्वसन्मुनिवरः पश्चात्तापेन दुःखितः॥', 'viniḥśvasan munivaraḥ paścāttāpena duḥkhitaḥ', null, 1062012),
('ramayana-1-62-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 13', 'भीतामप्सरसं दृष्ट्वा वेपन्तीं प्राञ्जलिं स्थिताम्।
मेनकां मधुरैर्वाक्यैर्विसृज्य कुशिकात्मजः।
उत्तरं पर्वतं राम विश्वामित्रो जगाम ह॥', 'bhītām apsarasaṃ dṛṣṭvā vepantīṃ prāñjaliṃ sthitām
menakāṃ madhurair vākyair visṛjya kuśikātmajaḥ
uttaraṃ parvataṃ rāma viśvāmitro jagāma ha', null, 1062013),
('ramayana-1-62-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 14', 'स कृत्वा नैष्ठिकीं बुद्धिं जेतुकामो महायशाः।
कौशिकीतीरमासाद्य तपस्तेपे सुदारुणम्॥', 'sa kṛtvā naiṣṭhikīṃ buddhiṃ jetukāmo mahāyaśāḥ
kauśikītīram āsādya tapas tepe sudāruṇam', null, 1062014),
('ramayana-1-62-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 15', 'तस्य वर्षसहस्रं तु घोरं तप उपासतः।
उत्तरे पर्वते राम देवतानामभूद्भयम्॥', 'tasya varṣasahasraṃ tu ghoraṃ tapa upāsataḥ
uttare parvate rāma devatānām abhūd bhayam', null, 1062015),
('ramayana-1-62-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 16', 'अमन्त्रयन्समागम्य सर्वे सर्षिगणाः सुराः।
महर्षिशब्दं लभतां साध्वयं कुशिकात्मजः॥', 'amantrayan samāgamya sarve sarṣigaṇāḥ surāḥ
maharṣiśabdaṃ labhatāṃ sādhv ayaṃ kuśikātmajaḥ', null, 1062016),
('ramayana-1-62-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 17', 'देवतानां वचः श्रुत्वा सर्वलोकपितामहः।
अब्रवीन्मधुरं वाक्यं विश्वामित्रं तपोधनम्॥', 'devatānāṃ vacaḥ śrutvā sarvalokapitāmahaḥ
abravīn madhuraṃ vākyaṃ viśvāmitraṃ tapodhanam', null, 1062017),
('ramayana-1-62-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 18', 'महर्षे स्वागतं वत्स तपसोग्रेण तोषितः।
महत्त्वमृषिमुख्यत्वं ददामि तव कौशिक॥', 'maharṣe svāgataṃ vatsa tapasogreṇa toṣitaḥ
mahattvam ṛṣimukhyatvaṃ dadāmi tava kauśika', null, 1062018),
('ramayana-1-62-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 19', 'ब्रह्मणः स वचः श्रुत्वा विश्वामित्रस्तपोधनः।
प्राञ्जलिः प्रणतो भूत्वा प्रत्युवाच पितामहम्॥', 'brahmaṇaḥ sa vacaḥ śrutvā viśvāmitras tapodhanaḥ
prāñjaliḥ praṇato bhūtvā pratyuvāca pitāmaham', null, 1062019),
('ramayana-1-62-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 20', 'ब्रह्मर्षि शब्दमतुलं स्वार्जितैः कर्मभिः शुभैः।
यदि मे भगवानाह ततोऽहं विजितेन्द्रियः॥', 'brahmarṣi śabdam atulaṃ svārjitaiḥ karmabhiḥ śubhaiḥ
yadi me bhagavān āha tato ''haṃ vijitendriyaḥ', null, 1062020),
('ramayana-1-62-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 21', 'तमुवाच ततो ब्रह्मा न तावत्त्वं जितेन्द्रियः।
यतस्व मुनिशार्दूल इत्युक्त्वा त्रिदिवं गतः॥', 'tam uvāca tato brahmā na tāvat tvaṃ jitendriyaḥ
yatasva muniśārdūla ity uktvā tridivaṃ gataḥ', null, 1062021),
('ramayana-1-62-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 22', 'विप्रस्थितेषु देवेषु विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
ऊर्ध्वबाहुर्निरालम्बो वायुभक्षस्तपश्चरन्॥', 'viprasthiteṣu deveṣu viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
ūrdhvabāhur nirālambo vāyubhakṣas tapaś caran', null, 1062022),
('ramayana-1-62-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 23', 'धर्मे पञ्चतपा भूत्वा वर्षास्वाकाशसंश्रयः।
शिशिरे सलिलस्थायी रात्र्यहानि तपोधनः॥', 'dharme pañcatapā bhūtvā varṣāsv ākāśasaṃśrayaḥ
śiśire salilasthāyī rātryahāni tapodhanaḥ', null, 1062023),
('ramayana-1-62-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 24', 'एवं वर्षसहस्रं हि तपो घोरमुपागमत्॥', 'evaṃ varṣasahasraṃ hi tapo ghoram upāgamat', null, 1062024),
('ramayana-1-62-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 25', 'तस्मिन्संतप्यमाने तु विश्वामित्रे महामुनौ।
संभ्रमः सुमहानासीत्सुराणां वासवस्य च॥', 'tasmin saṃtapyamāne tu viśvāmitre mahāmunau
saṃbhramaḥ sumahān āsīt surāṇāṃ vāsavasya ca', null, 1062025),
('ramayana-1-62-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 62, Verse 26', 'रम्भामप्सरसं शक्रः सह सर्वैर्मरुद्गणैः।
उवाचात्महितं वाक्यमहितं कौशिकस्य च॥', 'rambhām apsarasaṃ śakraḥ saha sarvair marudgaṇaiḥ
uvācātmahitaṃ vākyam ahitaṃ kauśikasya ca', null, 1062026)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 63 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-63-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 1', 'सुरकार्यमिदं रम्भे कर्तव्यं सुमहत्त्वया।
लोभनं कौशिकस्येह काममोहसमन्वितम्॥', 'surakāryam idaṃ rambhe kartavyaṃ sumahat tvayā
lobhanaṃ kauśikasyeha kāmamohasamanvitam', null, 1063001),
('ramayana-1-63-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 2', 'तथोक्ता साप्सरा राम सहस्राक्षेण धीमता।
व्रीडिता प्राञ्जलिर्भूत्वा प्रत्युवाच सुरेश्वरम्॥', 'tathoktā sāpsarā rāma sahasrākṣeṇa dhīmatā
vrīḍitā prāñjalir bhūtvā pratyuvāca sureśvaram', null, 1063002),
('ramayana-1-63-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 3', 'अयं सुरपते घोरो विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
क्रोधमुत्स्रक्ष्यते घोरं मयि देव न संशयः।
ततो हि मे भयं देव प्रसादं कर्तुमर्हसि॥', 'ayaṃ surapate ghoro viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
krodham utsrakṣyate ghoraṃ mayi deva na saṃśayaḥ
tato hi me bhayaṃ deva prasādaṃ kartum arhasi', null, 1063003),
('ramayana-1-63-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 4', 'तामुवाच सहस्राक्षो वेपमानां कृताञ्जलिम्।
मा भैषि रम्भे भद्रं ते कुरुष्व मम शासनम्॥', 'tām uvāca sahasrākṣo vepamānāṃ kṛtāñjalim
mā bhaiṣi rambhe bhadraṃ te kuruṣva mama śāsanam', null, 1063004),
('ramayana-1-63-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 5', 'कोकिलो हृदयग्राही माधवे रुचिरद्रुमे।
अहं कन्दर्पसहितः स्थास्यामि तव पार्श्वतः॥', 'kokilo hṛdayagrāhī mādhave ruciradrume
ahaṃ kandarpasahitaḥ sthāsyāmi tava pārśvataḥ', null, 1063005),
('ramayana-1-63-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 6', 'त्वं हि रूपं बहुगुणं कृत्वा परमभास्वरम्।
तमृषिं कौशिकं रम्भे भेदयस्व तपस्विनम्॥', 'tvaṃ hi rūpaṃ bahuguṇaṃ kṛtvā paramabhāsvaram
tam ṛṣiṃ kauśikaṃ rambhe bhedayasva tapasvinam', null, 1063006),
('ramayana-1-63-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 7', 'सा श्रुत्वा वचनं तस्य कृत्वा रूपमनुत्तमम्।
लोभयामास ललिता विश्वामित्रं शुचिस्मिता॥', 'sā śrutvā vacanaṃ tasya kṛtvā rūpam anuttamam
lobhayām āsa lalitā viśvāmitraṃ śucismitā', null, 1063007),
('ramayana-1-63-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 8', 'कोकिलस्य तु शुश्राव वल्गु व्याहरतः स्वनम्।
संप्रहृष्टेन मनसा तत एनामुदैक्षत॥', 'kokilasya tu śuśrāva valgu vyāharataḥ svanam
saṃprahṛṣṭena manasā tata enām udaikṣata', null, 1063008),
('ramayana-1-63-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 9', 'अथ तस्य च शब्देन गीतेनाप्रतिमेन च।
दर्शनेन च रम्भाया मुनिः संदेहमागतः॥', 'atha tasya ca śabdena gītenāpratimena ca
darśanena ca rambhāyā muniḥ saṃdeham āgataḥ', null, 1063009),
('ramayana-1-63-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 10', 'सहस्राक्षस्य तत्कर्म विज्ञाय मुनिपुंगवः।
रम्भां क्रोधसमाविष्टः शशाप कुशिकात्मजः॥', 'sahasrākṣasya tat karma vijñāya munipuṃgavaḥ
rambhāṃ krodhasamāviṣṭaḥ śaśāpa kuśikātmajaḥ', null, 1063010),
('ramayana-1-63-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 11', 'यन्मां लोभयसे रम्भे कामक्रोधजयैषिणम्।
दशवर्षसहस्राणि शैली स्थास्यसि दुर्भगे॥', 'yan māṃ lobhayase rambhe kāmakrodhajayaiṣiṇam
daśavarṣasahasrāṇi śailī sthāsyasi durbhage', null, 1063011),
('ramayana-1-63-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 12', 'ब्राह्मणः सुमहातेजास्तपोबलसमन्वितः।
उद्धरिष्यति रम्भे त्वां मत्क्रोधकलुषीकृताम्॥', 'brāhmaṇaḥ sumahātejās tapobalasamanvitaḥ
uddhariṣyati rambhe tvāṃ matkrodhakaluṣīkṛtām', null, 1063012),
('ramayana-1-63-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 13', 'एवमुक्त्वा महातेजा विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
अशक्नुवन्धारयितुं कोपं संतापमागतः॥', 'evam uktvā mahātejā viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
aśaknuvan dhārayituṃ kopaṃ saṃtāpam āgataḥ', null, 1063013),
('ramayana-1-63-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 14', 'तस्य शापेन महता रम्भा शैली तदाभवत्।
वचः श्रुत्वा च कन्दर्पो महर्षेः स च निर्गतः॥', 'tasya śāpena mahatā rambhā śailī tadābhavat
vacaḥ śrutvā ca kandarpo maharṣeḥ sa ca nirgataḥ', null, 1063014),
('ramayana-1-63-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 63, Verse 15', 'कोपेन स महातेजास्तपोऽपहरणे कृते।
इन्द्रियैरजितै राम न लेभे शान्तिमात्मनः॥', 'kopena sa mahātejās tapo ''paharaṇe kṛte
indriyair ajitai rāma na lebhe śāntim ātmanaḥ', null, 1063015)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 64 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-64-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 1', 'अथ हैमवतीं राम दिशं त्यक्त्वा महामुनिः।
पूर्वां दिशमनुप्राप्य तपस्तेपे सुदारुणम्॥', 'atha haimavatīṃ rāma diśaṃ tyaktvā mahāmuniḥ
pūrvāṃ diśam anuprāpya tapas tepe sudāruṇam', null, 1064001),
('ramayana-1-64-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 2', 'मौनं वर्षसहस्रस्य कृत्वा व्रतमनुत्तमम्।
चकाराप्रतिमं राम तपः परमदुष्करम्॥', 'maunaṃ varṣasahasrasya kṛtvā vratam anuttamam
cakārāpratimaṃ rāma tapaḥ paramaduṣkaram', null, 1064002),
('ramayana-1-64-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 3', 'पूर्णे वर्षसहस्रे तु काष्ठभूतं महामुनिम्।
विघ्नैर्बहुभिराधूतं क्रोधो नान्तरमाविशत्॥', 'pūrṇe varṣasahasre tu kāṣṭhabhūtaṃ mahāmunim
vighnair bahubhir ādhūtaṃ krodho nāntaram āviśat', null, 1064003),
('ramayana-1-64-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 4', 'ततो देवाः सगन्धर्वाः पन्नगासुरराक्षसाः।
मोहितास्तेजसा तस्य तपसा मन्दरश्मयः।
कश्मलोपहताः सर्वे पितामहमथाब्रुवन्॥', 'tato devāḥ sagandharvāḥ pannagāsurarākṣasāḥ
mohitās tejasā tasya tapasā mandaraśmayaḥ
kaśmalopahatāḥ sarve pitāmaham athābruvan', null, 1064004),
('ramayana-1-64-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 5', 'बहुभिः कारणैर्देव विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
लोभितः क्रोधितश्चैव तपसा चाभिवर्धते॥', 'bahubhiḥ kāraṇair deva viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
lobhitaḥ krodhitaś caiva tapasā cābhivardhate', null, 1064005),
('ramayana-1-64-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 6', 'न ह्यस्य वृजिनं किं चिद्दृश्यते सूक्ष्ममप्यथ।
न दीयते यदि त्वस्य मनसा यदभीप्सितम्।
विनाशयति त्रैलोक्यं तपसा सचराचरम्।
व्याकुलाश्च दिशः सर्वा न च किं चित्प्रकाशते॥', 'na hy asya vṛjinaṃ kiṃ cid dṛśyate sūkṣmam apy atha
na dīyate yadi tv asya manasā yad abhīpsitam
vināśayati trailokyaṃ tapasā sacarācaram
vyākulāś ca diśaḥ sarvā na ca kiṃ cit prakāśate', null, 1064006),
('ramayana-1-64-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 7', 'सागराः क्षुभिताः सर्वे विशीर्यन्ते च पर्वताः।
प्रकम्पते च पृथिवी वायुर्वाति भृशाकुलः॥', 'sāgarāḥ kṣubhitāḥ sarve viśīryante ca parvatāḥ
prakampate ca pṛthivī vāyur vāti bhṛśākulaḥ', null, 1064007),
('ramayana-1-64-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 8', 'बुद्धिं न कुरुते यावन्नाशे देव महामुनिः।
तावत्प्रसाद्यो भगवानग्निरूपो महाद्युतिः॥', 'buddhiṃ na kurute yāvan nāśe deva mahāmuniḥ
tāvat prasādyo bhagavān agnirūpo mahādyutiḥ', null, 1064008),
('ramayana-1-64-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 9', 'कालाग्निना यथा पूर्वं त्रैलोक्यं दह्यतेऽखिलम्।
देवराज्ये चिकीर्षेत दीयतामस्य यन्मतम्॥', 'kālāgninā yathā pūrvaṃ trailokyaṃ dahyate ''khilam
devarājye cikīrṣeta dīyatām asya yan matam', null, 1064009),
('ramayana-1-64-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 10', 'ततः सुरगणाः सर्वे पितामहपुरोगमाः।
विश्वामित्रं महात्मानं वाक्यं मधुरमब्रुवन्॥', 'tataḥ suragaṇāḥ sarve pitāmahapurogamāḥ
viśvāmitraṃ mahātmānaṃ vākyaṃ madhuram abruvan', null, 1064010),
('ramayana-1-64-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 11', 'ब्रह्मर्षे स्वागतं तेऽस्तु तपसा स्म सुतोषिताः।
ब्राह्मण्यं तपसोग्रेण प्राप्तवानसि कौशिक॥', 'brahmarṣe svāgataṃ te ''stu tapasā sma sutoṣitāḥ
brāhmaṇyaṃ tapasogreṇa prāptavān asi kauśika', null, 1064011),
('ramayana-1-64-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 12', 'दीर्घमायुश्च ते ब्रह्मन्ददामि समरुद्गणः।
स्वस्ति प्राप्नुहि भद्रं ते गच्छ सौम्य यथासुखम्॥', 'dīrgham āyuś ca te brahman dadāmi samarudgaṇaḥ
svasti prāpnuhi bhadraṃ te gaccha saumya yathāsukham', null, 1064012),
('ramayana-1-64-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 13', 'पितामहवचः श्रुत्वा सर्वेषां च दिवौकसाम्।
कृत्वा प्रणामं मुदितो व्याजहार महामुनिः॥', 'pitāmahavacaḥ śrutvā sarveṣāṃ ca divaukasām
kṛtvā praṇāmaṃ mudito vyājahāra mahāmuniḥ', null, 1064013),
('ramayana-1-64-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 14', 'ब्राह्मण्यं यदि मे प्राप्तं दीर्घमायुस्तथैव च।
ओंकारोऽथ वषट्कारो वेदाश्च वरयन्तु माम्॥', 'brāhmaṇyaṃ yadi me prāptaṃ dīrgham āyus tathaiva ca
oṃkāro ''tha vaṣaṭkāro vedāś ca varayantu mām', null, 1064014),
('ramayana-1-64-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 15', 'क्षत्रवेदविदां श्रेष्ठो ब्रह्मवेदविदामपि।
ब्रह्मपुत्रो वसिष्ठो मामेवं वदतु देवताः।
यद्ययं परमः कामः कृतो यान्तु सुरर्षभाः॥', 'kṣatravedavidāṃ śreṣṭho brahmavedavidām api
brahmaputro vasiṣṭho mām evaṃ vadatu devatāḥ
yady ayaṃ paramaḥ kāmaḥ kṛto yāntu surarṣabhāḥ', null, 1064015),
('ramayana-1-64-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 16', 'ततः प्रसादितो देवैर्वसिष्ठो जपतां वरः।
सख्यं चकार ब्रह्मर्षिरेवमस्त्विति चाब्रवीत्॥', 'tataḥ prasādito devair vasiṣṭho japatāṃ varaḥ
sakhyaṃ cakāra brahmarṣir evam astv iti cābravīt', null, 1064016),
('ramayana-1-64-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 17', 'ब्रह्मर्षित्वं न संदेहः सर्वं संपत्स्यते तव।
इत्युक्त्वा देवताश्चापि सर्वा जग्मुर्यथागतम्॥', 'brahmarṣitvaṃ na saṃdehaḥ sarvaṃ saṃpatsyate tava
ity uktvā devatāś cāpi sarvā jagmur yathāgatam', null, 1064017),
('ramayana-1-64-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 18', 'विश्वामित्रोऽपि धर्मात्मा लब्ध्वा ब्राह्मण्यमुत्तमम्।
पूजयामास ब्रह्मर्षिं वसिष्ठं जपतां वरम्॥', 'viśvāmitro ''pi dharmātmā labdhvā brāhmaṇyam uttamam
pūjayām āsa brahmarṣiṃ vasiṣṭhaṃ japatāṃ varam', null, 1064018),
('ramayana-1-64-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 19', 'कृतकामो महीं सर्वां चचार तपसि स्थितः।
एवं त्वनेन ब्राह्मण्यं प्राप्तं राम महात्मना॥', 'kṛtakāmo mahīṃ sarvāṃ cacāra tapasi sthitaḥ
evaṃ tv anena brāhmaṇyaṃ prāptaṃ rāma mahātmanā', null, 1064019),
('ramayana-1-64-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 20', 'एष राम मुनिश्रेष्ठ एष विग्रहवांस्तपः।
एष धर्मः परो नित्यं वीर्यस्यैष परायणम्॥', 'eṣa rāma muniśreṣṭha eṣa vigrahavāṃs tapaḥ
eṣa dharmaḥ paro nityaṃ vīryasyaiṣa parāyaṇam', null, 1064020),
('ramayana-1-64-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 21', 'शतानन्दवचः श्रुत्वा रामलक्ष्मणसंनिधौ।
जनकः प्राञ्जलिर्वाक्यमुवाच कुशिकात्मजम्॥', 'śatānandavacaḥ śrutvā rāmalakṣmaṇasaṃnidhau
janakaḥ prāñjalir vākyam uvāca kuśikātmajam', null, 1064021),
('ramayana-1-64-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 22', 'धन्योऽस्म्यनुगृहीतोऽस्मि यस्य मे मुनिपुंगव।
यज्ञं काकुत्स्थ सहितः प्राप्तवानसि धार्मिक॥', 'dhanyo ''smy anugṛhīto ''smi yasya me munipuṃgava
yajñaṃ kākutstha sahitaḥ prāptavān asi dhārmika', null, 1064022),
('ramayana-1-64-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 23', 'पावितोऽहं त्वया ब्रह्मन्दर्शनेन महामुने।
गुणा बहुविधाः प्राप्तास्तव संदर्शनान्मया॥', 'pāvito ''haṃ tvayā brahman darśanena mahāmune
guṇā bahuvidhāḥ prāptās tava saṃdarśanān mayā', null, 1064023),
('ramayana-1-64-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 24', 'विस्तरेण च ते ब्रह्मन्कीर्त्यमानं महत्तपः।
श्रुतं मया महातेजो रामेण च महात्मना॥', 'vistareṇa ca te brahman kīrtyamānaṃ mahat tapaḥ
śrutaṃ mayā mahātejo rāmeṇa ca mahātmanā', null, 1064024),
('ramayana-1-64-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 25', 'सदस्यैः प्राप्य च सदः श्रुतास्ते बहवो गुणाः॥', 'sadasyaiḥ prāpya ca sadaḥ śrutās te bahavo guṇāḥ', null, 1064025),
('ramayana-1-64-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 26', 'अप्रमेयं तपस्तुभ्यमप्रमेयं च ते बलम्।
अप्रमेया गुणाश्चैव नित्यं ते कुशिकात्मज॥', 'aprameyaṃ tapas tubhyam aprameyaṃ ca te balam
aprameyā guṇāś caiva nityaṃ te kuśikātmaja', null, 1064026),
('ramayana-1-64-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 27', 'तृप्तिराश्चर्यभूतानां कथानां नास्ति मे विभो।
कर्मकालो मुनिश्रेष्ठ लम्बते रविमण्डलम्॥', 'tṛptir āścaryabhūtānāṃ kathānāṃ nāsti me vibho
karmakālo muniśreṣṭha lambate ravimaṇḍalam', null, 1064027),
('ramayana-1-64-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 28', 'श्वः प्रभाते महातेजो द्रष्टुमर्हसि मां पुनः।
स्वागतं तपसां श्रेष्ठ मामनुज्ञातुमर्हसि॥', 'śvaḥ prabhāte mahātejo draṣṭum arhasi māṃ punaḥ
svāgataṃ tapasāṃ śreṣṭha mām anujñātum arhasi', null, 1064028),
('ramayana-1-64-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 29', 'एवमुक्त्वा मुनिश्रेष्ठं वैदेहो मिथिलाधिपः।
प्रदक्षिणं चकाराशु सोपाध्यायः सबान्धवः॥', 'evam uktvā muniśreṣṭhaṃ vaideho mithilādhipaḥ
pradakṣiṇaṃ cakārāśu sopādhyāyaḥ sabāndhavaḥ', null, 1064029),
('ramayana-1-64-30', 30, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 64, Verse 30', 'विश्वामित्रोऽपि धर्मात्मा सहरामः सलक्ष्मणः।
स्वं वाटमभिचक्राम पूज्यमानो महर्षिभिः॥', 'viśvāmitro ''pi dharmātmā saharāmaḥ salakṣmaṇaḥ
svaṃ vāṭam abhicakrāma pūjyamāno maharṣibhiḥ', null, 1064030)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 65 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-65-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 1', 'ततः प्रभाते विमले कृतकर्मा नराधिपः।
विश्वामित्रं महात्मानमाजुहाव सराघवम्॥', 'tataḥ prabhāte vimale kṛtakarmā narādhipaḥ
viśvāmitraṃ mahātmānam ājuhāva sarāghavam', null, 1065001),
('ramayana-1-65-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 2', 'तमर्चयित्वा धर्मात्मा शास्त्रदृष्ट्तेन कर्मणा।
राघवौ च महात्मानौ तदा वाक्यमुवाच ह॥', 'tam arcayitvā dharmātmā śāstradṛṣṭtena karmaṇā
rāghavau ca mahātmānau tadā vākyam uvāca ha', null, 1065002),
('ramayana-1-65-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 3', 'भगवन्स्वागतं तेऽस्तु किं करोमि तवानघ।
भवानाज्ञापयतु मामाज्ञाप्यो भवता ह्यहम्॥', 'bhagavan svāgataṃ te ''stu kiṃ karomi tavānagha
bhavān ājñāpayatu mām ājñāpyo bhavatā hy aham', null, 1065003),
('ramayana-1-65-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 4', 'एवमुक्तः स धर्मात्मा जनकेन महात्मना।
प्रत्युवाच मुनिर्वीरं वाक्यं वाक्यविशारदः॥', 'evam uktaḥ sa dharmātmā janakena mahātmanā
pratyuvāca munir vīraṃ vākyaṃ vākyaviśāradaḥ', null, 1065004),
('ramayana-1-65-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 5', 'पुत्रौ दशरथस्येमौ क्षत्रियौ लोकविश्रुतौ।
द्रष्टुकामौ धनुः श्रेष्ठं यदेतत्त्वयि तिष्ठति॥', 'putrau daśarathasyemau kṣatriyau lokaviśrutau
draṣṭukāmau dhanuḥ śreṣṭhaṃ yad etat tvayi tiṣṭhati', null, 1065005),
('ramayana-1-65-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 6', 'एतद्दर्शय भद्रं ते कृतकामौ नृपात्मजौ।
दर्शनादस्य धनुषो यथेष्टं प्रतियास्यतः॥', 'etad darśaya bhadraṃ te kṛtakāmau nṛpātmajau
darśanād asya dhanuṣo yatheṣṭaṃ pratiyāsyataḥ', null, 1065006),
('ramayana-1-65-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 7', 'एवमुक्तस्तु जनकः प्रत्युवाच महामुनिम्।
श्रूयतामस्य धनुषो यदर्थमिह तिष्ठति॥', 'evam uktas tu janakaḥ pratyuvāca mahāmunim
śrūyatām asya dhanuṣo yad artham iha tiṣṭhati', null, 1065007),
('ramayana-1-65-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 8', 'देवरात इति ख्यातो निमेः षष्ठो महीपतिः।
न्यासोऽयं तस्य भगवन्हस्ते दत्तो महात्मना॥', 'devarāta iti khyāto nimeḥ ṣaṣṭho mahīpatiḥ
nyāso ''yaṃ tasya bhagavan haste datto mahātmanā', null, 1065008),
('ramayana-1-65-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 9', 'दक्षयज्ञवधे पूर्वं धनुरायम्य वीर्यवान्।
रुद्रस्तु त्रिदशान्रोषात्सलीलमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'dakṣayajñavadhe pūrvaṃ dhanur āyamya vīryavān
rudras tu tridaśān roṣāt salīlam idam abravīt', null, 1065009),
('ramayana-1-65-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 10', 'यस्माद्भागार्थिनो भागान्नाकल्पयत मे सुराः।
वराङ्गानि महार्हाणि धनुषा शातयामि वः॥', 'yasmād bhāgārthino bhāgān nākalpayata me surāḥ
varāṅgāni mahārhāṇi dhanuṣā śātayāmi vaḥ', null, 1065010),
('ramayana-1-65-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 11', 'ततो विमनसः सर्वे देवा वै मुनिपुंगव।
प्रसादयन्ति देवेशं तेषां प्रीतोऽभवद्भवः॥', 'tato vimanasaḥ sarve devā vai munipuṃgava
prasādayanti deveśaṃ teṣāṃ prīto ''bhavad bhavaḥ', null, 1065011),
('ramayana-1-65-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 12', 'प्रीतियुक्तः स सर्वेषां ददौ तेषां महात्मनाम्॥', 'prītiyuktaḥ sa sarveṣāṃ dadau teṣāṃ mahātmanām', null, 1065012),
('ramayana-1-65-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 13', 'तदेतद्देवदेवस्य धनूरत्नं महात्मनः।
न्यासभूतं तदा न्यस्तमस्माकं पूर्वके विभो॥', 'tad etad devadevasya dhanūratnaṃ mahātmanaḥ
nyāsabhūtaṃ tadā nyastam asmākaṃ pūrvake vibho', null, 1065013),
('ramayana-1-65-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 14', 'अथ मे कृषतः क्षेत्रं लाङ्गलादुत्थिता मम।
क्षेत्रं शोधयता लब्ध्वा नाम्ना सीतेति विश्रुता॥', 'atha me kṛṣataḥ kṣetraṃ lāṅgalād utthitā mama
kṣetraṃ śodhayatā labdhvā nāmnā sīteti viśrutā', null, 1065014),
('ramayana-1-65-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 15', 'भूतलादुत्थिता सा तु व्यवर्धत ममात्मजा।
वीर्यशुल्केति मे कन्या स्थापितेयमयोनिजा॥', 'bhūtalād utthitā sā tu vyavardhata mamātmajā
vīryaśulketi me kanyā sthāpiteyam ayonijā', null, 1065015),
('ramayana-1-65-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 16', 'भूतलादुत्थितां तां तु वर्धमानां ममात्मजाम्।
वरयामासुरागम्य राजानो मुनिपुंगव॥', 'bhūtalād utthitāṃ tāṃ tu vardhamānāṃ mamātmajām
varayām āsur āgamya rājāno munipuṃgava', null, 1065016),
('ramayana-1-65-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 17', 'तेषां वरयतां कन्यां सर्वेषां पृथिवीक्षिताम्।
वीर्यशुल्केति भगवन्न ददामि सुतामहम्॥', 'teṣāṃ varayatāṃ kanyāṃ sarveṣāṃ pṛthivīkṣitām
vīryaśulketi bhagavan na dadāmi sutām aham', null, 1065017),
('ramayana-1-65-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 18', 'ततः सर्वे नृपतयः समेत्य मुनिपुंगव।
मिथिलामभ्युपागम्य वीर्यं जिज्ञासवस्तदा॥', 'tataḥ sarve nṛpatayaḥ sametya munipuṃgava
mithilām abhyupāgamya vīryaṃ jijñāsavas tadā', null, 1065018),
('ramayana-1-65-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 19', 'तेषां जिज्ञासमानानां वीर्यं धनुरुपाहृतम्।
न शेकुर्ग्रहणे तस्य धनुषस्तोलनेऽपि वा॥', 'teṣāṃ jijñāsamānānāṃ vīryaṃ dhanur upāhṛtam
na śekur grahaṇe tasya dhanuṣas tolane ''pi vā', null, 1065019),
('ramayana-1-65-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 20', 'तेषां वीर्यवतां वीर्यमल्पं ज्ञात्वा महामुने।
प्रत्याख्याता नृपतयस्तन्निबोध तपोधन॥', 'teṣāṃ vīryavatāṃ vīryam alpaṃ jñātvā mahāmune
pratyākhyātā nṛpatayas tan nibodha tapodhana', null, 1065020),
('ramayana-1-65-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 21', 'ततः परमकोपेन राजानो मुनिपुंगव।
अरुन्धन्मिथिलां सर्वे वीर्यसंदेहमागताः॥', 'tataḥ paramakopena rājāno munipuṃgava
arundhan mithilāṃ sarve vīryasaṃdeham āgatāḥ', null, 1065021),
('ramayana-1-65-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 22', 'आत्मानमवधूतं ते विज्ञाय मुनिपुंगव।
रोषेण महताविष्टाः पीडयन्मिथिलां पुरीम्॥', 'ātmānam avadhūtaṃ te vijñāya munipuṃgava
roṣeṇa mahatāviṣṭāḥ pīḍayan mithilāṃ purīm', null, 1065022),
('ramayana-1-65-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 23', 'ततः संवत्सरे पूर्णे क्षयं यातानि सर्वशः।
साधनानि मुनिरेष्ठ ततोऽहं भृशदुःखितः॥', 'tataḥ saṃvatsare pūrṇe kṣayaṃ yātāni sarvaśaḥ
sādhanāni munireṣṭha tato ''haṃ bhṛśaduḥkhitaḥ', null, 1065023),
('ramayana-1-65-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 24', 'ततो देवगणान्सर्वांस्तपसाहं प्रसादयम्।
ददुश्च परमप्रीताश्चतुरङ्गबलं सुराः॥', 'tato devagaṇān sarvāṃs tapasāhaṃ prasādayam
daduś ca paramaprītāś caturaṅgabalaṃ surāḥ', null, 1065024),
('ramayana-1-65-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 25', 'ततो भग्ना नृपतयो हन्यमाना दिशो ययुः।
अवीर्या वीर्यसंदिग्धा सामात्याः पापकारिणः॥', 'tato bhagnā nṛpatayo hanyamānā diśo yayuḥ
avīryā vīryasaṃdigdhā sāmātyāḥ pāpakāriṇaḥ', null, 1065025),
('ramayana-1-65-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 26', 'तदेतन्मुनिशार्दूल धनुः परमभास्वरम्।
रामलक्ष्मणयोश्चापि दर्शयिष्यामि सुव्रत॥', 'tad etan muniśārdūla dhanuḥ paramabhāsvaram
rāmalakṣmaṇayoś cāpi darśayiṣyāmi suvrata', null, 1065026),
('ramayana-1-65-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 65, Verse 27', 'यद्यस्य धनुषो रामः कुर्यादारोपणं मुने।
सुतामयोनिजां सीतां दद्यां दाशरथेरहम्॥', 'yady asya dhanuṣo rāmaḥ kuryād āropaṇaṃ mune
sutām ayonijāṃ sītāṃ dadyāṃ dāśarather aham', null, 1065027)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 66 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-66-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 1', 'जनकस्य वचः श्रुत्वा विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
धनुर्दर्शय रामाय इति होवाच पार्थिवम्॥', 'janakasya vacaḥ śrutvā viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
dhanur darśaya rāmāya iti hovāca pārthivam', null, 1066001),
('ramayana-1-66-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 2', 'ततः स राजा जनकः सचिवान्व्यादिदेश ह।
धनुरानीयतां दिव्यं गन्धमाल्यविभूषितम्॥', 'tataḥ sa rājā janakaḥ sacivān vyādideśa ha
dhanur ānīyatāṃ divyaṃ gandhamālyavibhūṣitam', null, 1066002),
('ramayana-1-66-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 3', 'जनकेन समादिष्ठाः सचिवाः प्राविशन्पुरीम्।
तद्धनुः पुरतः कृत्वा निर्जग्मुः पार्थिवाज्ञया॥', 'janakena samādiṣṭhāḥ sacivāḥ prāviśan purīm
tad dhanuḥ purataḥ kṛtvā nirjagmuḥ pārthivājñayā', null, 1066003),
('ramayana-1-66-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 4', 'नृपां शतानि पञ्चाशद्व्यायतानां महात्मनाम्।
मञ्जूषामष्टचक्रां तां समूहुस्ते कथं चन॥', 'nṛpāṃ śatāni pañcāśad vyāyatānāṃ mahātmanām
mañjūṣām aṣṭacakrāṃ tāṃ samūhus te kathaṃ cana', null, 1066004),
('ramayana-1-66-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 5', 'तामादाय तु मञ्जूषामायतीं यत्र तद्धनुः।
सुरोपमं ते जनकमूचुर्नृपतिमन्त्रिणः॥', 'tām ādāya tu mañjūṣām āyatīṃ yatra tad dhanuḥ
suropamaṃ te janakam ūcur nṛpatimantriṇaḥ', null, 1066005),
('ramayana-1-66-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 6', 'इदं धनुर्वरं राजन्पूजितं सर्वराजभिः।
मिथिलाधिप राजेन्द्र दर्शनीयं यदीच्छसि॥', 'idaṃ dhanurvaraṃ rājan pūjitaṃ sarvarājabhiḥ
mithilādhipa rājendra darśanīyaṃ yadīcchasi', null, 1066006),
('ramayana-1-66-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 7', 'तेषां नृपो वचः श्रुत्वा कृताञ्जलिरभाषत।
विश्वामित्रं महात्मानं तौ चोभौ रामलक्ष्मणौ॥', 'teṣāṃ nṛpo vacaḥ śrutvā kṛtāñjalir abhāṣata
viśvāmitraṃ mahātmānaṃ tau cobhau rāmalakṣmaṇau', null, 1066007),
('ramayana-1-66-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 8', 'इदं धनुर्वरं ब्रह्मञ्जनकैरभिपूजितम्।
राजभिश्च महावीर्यैरशक्यं पूरितुं तदा॥', 'idaṃ dhanurvaraṃ brahmañ janakair abhipūjitam
rājabhiś ca mahāvīryair aśakyaṃ pūrituṃ tadā', null, 1066008),
('ramayana-1-66-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 9', 'नैतत्सुरगणाः सर्वे नासुरा न च राक्षसाः।
गन्धर्वयक्षप्रवराः सकिंनरमहोरगाः॥', 'naitat suragaṇāḥ sarve nāsurā na ca rākṣasāḥ
gandharvayakṣapravarāḥ sakiṃnaramahoragāḥ', null, 1066009),
('ramayana-1-66-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 10', 'क्व गतिर्मानुषाणां च धनुषोऽस्य प्रपूरणे।
आरोपणे समायोगे वेपने तोलनेऽपि वा॥', 'kva gatir mānuṣāṇāṃ ca dhanuṣo ''sya prapūraṇe
āropaṇe samāyoge vepane tolane ''pi vā', null, 1066010),
('ramayana-1-66-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 11', 'तदेतद्धनुषां श्रेष्ठमानीतं मुनिपुंगव।
दर्शयैतन्महाभाग अनयो राजपुत्रयोः॥', 'tad etad dhanuṣāṃ śreṣṭham ānītaṃ munipuṃgava
darśayaitan mahābhāga anayo rājaputrayoḥ', null, 1066011),
('ramayana-1-66-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 12', 'विश्वामित्रस्तु धर्मात्मा श्रुत्वा जनकभाषितम्।
वत्स राम धनुः पश्य इति राघवमब्रवीत्॥', 'viśvāmitras tu dharmātmā śrutvā janakabhāṣitam
vatsa rāma dhanuḥ paśya iti rāghavam abravīt', null, 1066012),
('ramayana-1-66-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 13', 'महर्षेर्वचनाद्रामो यत्र तिष्ठति तद्धनुः।
मञ्जूषां तामपावृत्य दृष्ट्वा धनुरथाब्रवीत्॥', 'maharṣer vacanād rāmo yatra tiṣṭhati tad dhanuḥ
mañjūṣāṃ tām apāvṛtya dṛṣṭvā dhanur athābravīt', null, 1066013),
('ramayana-1-66-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 14', 'इदं धनुर्वरं ब्रह्मन्संस्पृशामीह पाणिना।
यत्नवांश्च भविष्यामि तोलने पूरणेऽपि वा॥', 'idaṃ dhanurvaraṃ brahman saṃspṛśāmīha pāṇinā
yatnavāṃś ca bhaviṣyāmi tolane pūraṇe ''pi vā', null, 1066014),
('ramayana-1-66-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 15', 'बाढमित्येव तं राजा मुनिश्च समभाषत।
लीलया स धनुर्मध्ये जग्राह वचनान्मुनेः॥', 'bāḍham ity eva taṃ rājā muniś ca samabhāṣata
līlayā sa dhanur madhye jagrāha vacanān muneḥ', null, 1066015),
('ramayana-1-66-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 16', 'पश्यतां नृषहस्राणां बहूनां रघुनन्दनः।
आरोपयत्स धर्मात्मा सलीलमिव तद्धनुः॥', 'paśyatāṃ nṛṣahasrāṇāṃ bahūnāṃ raghunandanaḥ
āropayat sa dharmātmā salīlam iva tad dhanuḥ', null, 1066016),
('ramayana-1-66-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 17', 'आरोपयित्वा मौर्वीं च पूरयामास वीर्यवान्।
तद्बभञ्ज धनुर्मध्ये नरश्रेष्ठो महायशाः॥', 'āropayitvā maurvīṃ ca pūrayām āsa vīryavān
tad babhañja dhanur madhye naraśreṣṭho mahāyaśāḥ', null, 1066017),
('ramayana-1-66-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 18', 'तस्य शब्दो महानासीन्निर्घातसमनिस्वनः।
भूमिकम्पश्च सुमहान्पर्वतस्येव दीर्यतः॥', 'tasya śabdo mahān āsīn nirghātasamanisvanaḥ
bhūmikampaś ca sumahān parvatasyeva dīryataḥ', null, 1066018),
('ramayana-1-66-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 19', 'निपेतुश्च नराः सर्वे तेन शब्देन मोहिताः।
वर्जयित्वा मुनिवरं राजानं तौ च राघवौ॥', 'nipetuś ca narāḥ sarve tena śabdena mohitāḥ
varjayitvā munivaraṃ rājānaṃ tau ca rāghavau', null, 1066019),
('ramayana-1-66-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 20', 'प्रत्याश्वस्ते जने तस्मिन्राजा विगतसाध्वसः।
उवाच प्राञ्जलिर्वाक्यं वाक्यज्ञो मुनिपुंगवम्॥', 'pratyāśvaste jane tasmin rājā vigatasādhvasaḥ
uvāca prāñjalir vākyaṃ vākyajño munipuṃgavam', null, 1066020),
('ramayana-1-66-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 21', 'भगवन्दृष्टवीर्यो मे रामो दशरथात्मजः।
अत्यद्भुतमचिन्त्यं च अतर्कितमिदं मया॥', 'bhagavan dṛṣṭavīryo me rāmo daśarathātmajaḥ
atyadbhutam acintyaṃ ca atarkitam idaṃ mayā', null, 1066021),
('ramayana-1-66-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 22', 'जनकानां कुले कीर्तिमाहरिष्यति मे सुता।
सीता भर्तारमासाद्य रामं दशरथात्मजम्॥', 'janakānāṃ kule kīrtim āhariṣyati me sutā
sītā bhartāram āsādya rāmaṃ daśarathātmajam', null, 1066022),
('ramayana-1-66-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 23', 'मम सत्या प्रतिज्ञा च वीर्यशुल्केति कौशिक।
सीता प्राणैर्बहुमता देया रामाय मे सुता॥', 'mama satyā pratijñā ca vīryaśulketi kauśika
sītā prāṇair bahumatā deyā rāmāya me sutā', null, 1066023),
('ramayana-1-66-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 24', 'भवतोऽनुमते ब्रह्मञ्शीघ्रं गच्छन्तु मन्त्रिणः।
मम कौशिक भद्रं ते अयोध्यां त्वरिता रथैः॥', 'bhavato ''numate brahmañ śīghraṃ gacchantu mantriṇaḥ
mama kauśika bhadraṃ te ayodhyāṃ tvaritā rathaiḥ', null, 1066024),
('ramayana-1-66-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 25', 'राजानं प्रश्रितैर्वाक्यैरानयन्तु पुरं मम।
प्रदानं वीर्यशुल्कायाः कथयन्तु च सर्वशः॥', 'rājānaṃ praśritair vākyair ānayantu puraṃ mama
pradānaṃ vīryaśulkāyāḥ kathayantu ca sarvaśaḥ', null, 1066025),
('ramayana-1-66-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 26', 'मुनिगुप्तौ च काकुत्स्थौ कथयन्तु नृपाय वै।
प्रीयमाणं तु राजानमानयन्तु सुशीघ्रगाः॥', 'muniguptau ca kākutsthau kathayantu nṛpāya vai
prīyamāṇaṃ tu rājānam ānayantu suśīghragāḥ', null, 1066026),
('ramayana-1-66-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 66, Verse 27', 'कौशिकश्च तथेत्याह राजा चाभाष्य मन्त्रिणः।
अयोध्यां प्रेषयामास धर्मात्मा कृतशासनात्॥', 'kauśikaś ca tathety āha rājā cābhāṣya mantriṇaḥ
ayodhyāṃ preṣayām āsa dharmātmā kṛtaśāsanāt', null, 1066027)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 67 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-67-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 1', 'जनकेन समादिष्टा दूतास्ते क्लान्तवाहनाः।
त्रिरात्रमुषित्वा मार्गे तेऽयोध्यां प्राविशन्पुरीम्॥', 'janakena samādiṣṭā dūtās te klāntavāhanāḥ
trirātram uṣitvā mārge te ''yodhyāṃ prāviśan purīm', null, 1067001),
('ramayana-1-67-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 2', 'ते राजवचनाद्दूता राजवेश्मप्रवेशिताः।
ददृशुर्देवसंकाशं वृद्धं दशरथं नृपम्॥', 'te rājavacanād dūtā rājaveśmapraveśitāḥ
dadṛśur devasaṃkāśaṃ vṛddhaṃ daśarathaṃ nṛpam', null, 1067002),
('ramayana-1-67-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 3', 'बद्धाञ्जलिपुटाः सर्वे दूता विगतसाध्वसाः।
राजानं प्रयता वाक्यमब्रुवन्मधुराक्षरम्॥', 'baddhāñjalipuṭāḥ sarve dūtā vigatasādhvasāḥ
rājānaṃ prayatā vākyam abruvan madhurākṣaram', null, 1067003),
('ramayana-1-67-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 4', 'मैथिलो जनको राजा साग्निहोत्रपुरस्कृतः।
कुशलं चाव्ययं चैव सोपाध्यायपुरोहितम्॥', 'maithilo janako rājā sāgnihotrapuraskṛtaḥ
kuśalaṃ cāvyayaṃ caiva sopādhyāyapurohitam', null, 1067004),
('ramayana-1-67-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 5', 'मुहुर्मुहुर्मधुरया स्नेहसंयुक्तया गिरा।
जनकस्त्वां महाराज पृच्छते सपुरःसरम्॥', 'muhur muhur madhurayā snehasaṃyuktayā girā
janakas tvāṃ mahārāja pṛcchate sapuraḥsaram', null, 1067005),
('ramayana-1-67-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 6', 'पृष्ट्वा कुशलमव्यग्रं वैदेहो मिथिलाधिपः।
कौशिकानुमते वाक्यं भवन्तमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'pṛṣṭvā kuśalam avyagraṃ vaideho mithilādhipaḥ
kauśikānumate vākyaṃ bhavantam idam abravīt', null, 1067006),
('ramayana-1-67-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 7', 'पूर्वं प्रतिज्ञा विदिता वीर्यशुल्का ममात्मजा।
राजानश्च कृतामर्षा निर्वीर्या विमुखीकृताः॥', 'pūrvaṃ pratijñā viditā vīryaśulkā mamātmajā
rājānaś ca kṛtāmarṣā nirvīryā vimukhīkṛtāḥ', null, 1067007),
('ramayana-1-67-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 8', 'सेयं मम सुता राजन्विश्वामित्र पुरःसरैः।
यदृच्छयागतैर्वीरैर्निर्जिता तव पुत्रकैः॥', 'seyaṃ mama sutā rājan viśvāmitra puraḥsaraiḥ
yadṛcchayāgatair vīrair nirjitā tava putrakaiḥ', null, 1067008),
('ramayana-1-67-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 9', 'तच्च राजन्धनुर्दिव्यं मध्ये भग्नं महात्मना।
रामेण हि महाराज महत्यां जनसंसदि॥', 'tac ca rājan dhanur divyaṃ madhye bhagnaṃ mahātmanā
rāmeṇa hi mahārāja mahatyāṃ janasaṃsadi', null, 1067009),
('ramayana-1-67-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 10', 'अस्मै देया मया सीता वीर्यशुल्का महात्मने।
प्रतिज्ञां तर्तुमिच्छामि तदनुज्ञातुमर्हसि॥', 'asmai deyā mayā sītā vīryaśulkā mahātmane
pratijñāṃ tartum icchāmi tad anujñātum arhasi', null, 1067010),
('ramayana-1-67-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 11', 'सोपाध्यायो महाराज पुरोहितपुरस्कृतः।
शीघ्रमागच्छ भद्रं ते द्रष्टुमर्हसि राघवौ॥', 'sopādhyāyo mahārāja purohitapuraskṛtaḥ
śīghram āgaccha bhadraṃ te draṣṭum arhasi rāghavau', null, 1067011),
('ramayana-1-67-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 12', 'प्रीतिं च मम राजेन्द्र निर्वर्तयितुमर्हसि।
पुत्रयोरुभयोरेव प्रीतिं त्वमपि लप्स्यसे॥', 'prītiṃ ca mama rājendra nirvartayitum arhasi
putrayor ubhayor eva prītiṃ tvam api lapsyase', null, 1067012),
('ramayana-1-67-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 13', 'एवं विदेहाधिपतिर्मधुरं वाक्यमब्रवीत्।
विश्वामित्राभ्यनुज्ञातः शतानन्दमते स्थितः॥', 'evaṃ videhādhipatir madhuraṃ vākyam abravīt
viśvāmitrābhyanujñātaḥ śatānandamate sthitaḥ', null, 1067013),
('ramayana-1-67-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 14', 'दूतवाक्यं तु तच्छ्रुत्वा राजा परमहर्षितः।
वसिष्ठं वामदेवं च मन्त्रिणोऽन्यांश्च सोऽब्रवीत्॥', 'dūtavākyaṃ tu tac chrutvā rājā paramaharṣitaḥ
vasiṣṭhaṃ vāmadevaṃ ca mantriṇo ''nyāṃś ca so ''bravīt', null, 1067014),
('ramayana-1-67-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 15', 'गुप्तः कुशिकपुत्रेण कौसल्यानन्दवर्धनः।
लक्ष्मणेन सह भ्रात्रा विदेहेषु वसत्यसौ॥', 'guptaḥ kuśikaputreṇa kausalyānandavardhanaḥ
lakṣmaṇena saha bhrātrā videheṣu vasaty asau', null, 1067015),
('ramayana-1-67-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 16', 'दृष्टवीर्यस्तु काकुत्स्थो जनकेन महात्मना।
संप्रदानं सुतायास्तु राघवे कर्तुमिच्छति॥', 'dṛṣṭavīryas tu kākutstho janakena mahātmanā
saṃpradānaṃ sutāyās tu rāghave kartum icchati', null, 1067016),
('ramayana-1-67-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 17', 'यदि वो रोचते वृत्तं जनकस्य महात्मनः।
पुरीं गच्छामहे शीघ्रं मा भूत्कालस्य पर्ययः॥', 'yadi vo rocate vṛttaṃ janakasya mahātmanaḥ
purīṃ gacchāmahe śīghraṃ mā bhūt kālasya paryayaḥ', null, 1067017),
('ramayana-1-67-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 18', 'मन्त्रिणो बाढमित्याहुः सह सर्वैर्महर्षिभिः।
सुप्रीतश्चाब्रवीद्राजा श्वो यात्रेति स मन्त्रिणः॥', 'mantriṇo bāḍham ity āhuḥ saha sarvair maharṣibhiḥ
suprītaś cābravīd rājā śvo yātreti sa mantriṇaḥ', null, 1067018),
('ramayana-1-67-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 67, Verse 19', 'मन्त्रिणस्तु नरेन्द्रस्य रात्रिं परमसत्कृताः।
ऊषुः प्रमुदिताः सर्वे गुणैः सर्वैः समन्विताः॥', 'mantriṇas tu narendrasya rātriṃ paramasatkṛtāḥ
ūṣuḥ pramuditāḥ sarve guṇaiḥ sarvaiḥ samanvitāḥ', null, 1067019)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 68 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-68-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 1', 'ततो रात्र्यां व्यतीतायां सोपाध्यायः सबान्धवः।
राजा दशरथो हृष्टः सुमन्त्रमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'tato rātryāṃ vyatītāyāṃ sopādhyāyaḥ sabāndhavaḥ
rājā daśaratho hṛṣṭaḥ sumantram idam abravīt', null, 1068001),
('ramayana-1-68-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 2', 'अद्य सर्वे धनाध्यक्षा धनमादाय पुष्कलम्।
व्रजन्त्वग्रे सुविहिता नानारत्नसमन्विताः॥', 'adya sarve dhanādhyakṣā dhanam ādāya puṣkalam
vrajantv agre suvihitā nānāratnasamanvitāḥ', null, 1068002),
('ramayana-1-68-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 3', 'चतुरङ्गबलं चापि शीघ्रं निर्यातु सर्वशः।
ममाज्ञासमकालं च यानयुग्यमनुत्तमम्॥', 'caturaṅgabalaṃ cāpi śīghraṃ niryātu sarvaśaḥ
mamājñāsamakālaṃ ca yānayugyam anuttamam', null, 1068003),
('ramayana-1-68-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 4', 'वसिष्ठो वामदेवश्च जाबालिरथ काश्यपः।
मार्कण्डेयश्च दीर्घायुरृषिः कात्यायनस्तथा॥', 'vasiṣṭho vāmadevaś ca jābālir atha kāśyapaḥ
mārkaṇḍeyaś ca dīrghāyur ṛṣiḥ kātyāyanas tathā', null, 1068004),
('ramayana-1-68-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 5', 'एते द्विजाः प्रयान्त्वग्रे स्यन्दनं योजयस्व मे।
यथा कालात्ययो न स्याद्दूता हि त्वरयन्ति माम्॥', 'ete dvijāḥ prayāntv agre syandanaṃ yojayasva me
yathā kālātyayo na syād dūtā hi tvarayanti mām', null, 1068005),
('ramayana-1-68-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 6', 'वचनाच्च नरेन्द्रस्य सा सेना चतुरङ्गिणी।
राजानमृषिभिः सार्धं व्रजन्तं पृष्ठतोऽन्वगात्॥', 'vacanāc ca narendrasya sā senā caturaṅgiṇī
rājānam ṛṣibhiḥ sārdhaṃ vrajantaṃ pṛṣṭhato ''nvagāt', null, 1068006),
('ramayana-1-68-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 7', 'गत्वा चतुरहं मार्गं विदेहानभ्युपेयिवान्।
राजा तु जनकः श्रीमाञ्श्रुत्वा पूजामकल्पयत्॥', 'gatvā caturahaṃ mārgaṃ videhān abhyupeyivān
rājā tu janakaḥ śrīmāñ śrutvā pūjām akalpayat', null, 1068007),
('ramayana-1-68-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 8', 'ततो राजानमासाद्य वृद्धं दशरथं नृपम्।
जनको मुदितो राजा हर्षं च परमं ययौ।
उवाच च नरश्रेष्ठो नरश्रेष्ठं मुदान्वितम्॥', 'tato rājānam āsādya vṛddhaṃ daśarathaṃ nṛpam
janako mudito rājā harṣaṃ ca paramaṃ yayau
uvāca ca naraśreṣṭho naraśreṣṭhaṃ mudānvitam', null, 1068008),
('ramayana-1-68-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 9', 'स्वागतं ते महाराज दिष्ट्या प्राप्तोऽसि राघव।
पुत्रयोरुभयोः प्रीतिं लप्स्यसे वीर्यनिर्जिताम्॥', 'svāgataṃ te mahārāja diṣṭyā prāpto ''si rāghava
putrayor ubhayoḥ prītiṃ lapsyase vīryanirjitām', null, 1068009),
('ramayana-1-68-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 10', 'दिष्ट्या प्राप्तो महातेजा वसिष्ठो भगवानृषिः।
सह सर्वैर्द्विजश्रेष्ठैर्देवैरिव शतक्रतुः॥', 'diṣṭyā prāpto mahātejā vasiṣṭho bhagavān ṛṣiḥ
saha sarvair dvijaśreṣṭhair devair iva śatakratuḥ', null, 1068010),
('ramayana-1-68-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 11', 'दिष्ट्या मे निर्जिता विघ्ना दिष्ट्या मे पूजितं कुलम्।
राघवैः सह संबन्धाद्वीर्यश्रेष्ठैर्महात्मभिः॥', 'diṣṭyā me nirjitā vighnā diṣṭyā me pūjitaṃ kulam
rāghavaiḥ saha saṃbandhād vīryaśreṣṭhair mahātmabhiḥ', null, 1068011),
('ramayana-1-68-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 12', 'श्वः प्रभाते नरेन्द्रेन्द्र निर्वर्तयितुमर्हसि।
यज्ञस्यान्ते नरश्रेष्ठ विवाहमृषिसंमतम्॥', 'śvaḥ prabhāte narendrendra nirvartayitum arhasi
yajñasyānte naraśreṣṭha vivāham ṛṣisaṃmatam', null, 1068012),
('ramayana-1-68-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 13', 'तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा ऋषिमध्ये नराधिपः।
वाक्यं वाक्यविदां श्रेष्ठः प्रत्युवाच महीपतिम्॥', 'tasya tad vacanaṃ śrutvā ṛṣimadhye narādhipaḥ
vākyaṃ vākyavidāṃ śreṣṭhaḥ pratyuvāca mahīpatim', null, 1068013),
('ramayana-1-68-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 14', 'प्रतिग्रहो दातृवशः श्रुतमेतन्मया पुरा।
यथा वक्ष्यसि धर्मज्ञ तत्करिष्यामहे वयम्॥', 'pratigraho dātṛvaśaḥ śrutam etan mayā purā
yathā vakṣyasi dharmajña tat kariṣyāmahe vayam', null, 1068014),
('ramayana-1-68-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 15', 'तद्धर्मिष्ठं यशस्यं च वचनं सत्यवादिनः।
श्रुत्वा विदेहाधिपतिः परं विस्मयमागतः॥', 'tad dharmiṣṭhaṃ yaśasyaṃ ca vacanaṃ satyavādinaḥ
śrutvā videhādhipatiḥ paraṃ vismayam āgataḥ', null, 1068015),
('ramayana-1-68-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 16', 'ततः सर्वे मुनिगणाः परस्परसमागमे।
हर्षेण महता युक्तास्तां निशामवसन्सुखम्॥', 'tataḥ sarve munigaṇāḥ parasparasamāgame
harṣeṇa mahatā yuktās tāṃ niśām avasan sukham', null, 1068016),
('ramayana-1-68-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 17', 'राजा च राघवौ पुत्रौ निशाम्य परिहर्षितः।
उवास परमप्रीतो जनकेन सुपूजितः॥', 'rājā ca rāghavau putrau niśāmya pariharṣitaḥ
uvāsa paramaprīto janakena supūjitaḥ', null, 1068017),
('ramayana-1-68-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 68, Verse 18', 'जनकोऽपि महातेजाः क्रिया धर्मेण तत्त्ववित्।
यज्ञस्य च सुताभ्यां च कृत्वा रात्रिमुवास ह॥', 'janako ''pi mahātejāḥ kriyā dharmeṇa tattvavit
yajñasya ca sutābhyāṃ ca kṛtvā rātrim uvāsa ha', null, 1068018)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 69 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-69-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 1', 'ततः प्रभाते जनकः कृतकर्मा महर्षिभिः।
उवाच वाक्यं वाक्यज्ञः शतानन्दं पुरोहितम्॥', 'tataḥ prabhāte janakaḥ kṛtakarmā maharṣibhiḥ
uvāca vākyaṃ vākyajñaḥ śatānandaṃ purohitam', null, 1069001),
('ramayana-1-69-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 2', 'भ्राता मम महातेजा यवीयानतिधार्मिकः।
कुशध्वज इति ख्यातः पुरीमध्यवसच्छुभाम्॥', 'bhrātā mama mahātejā yavīyān atidhārmikaḥ
kuśadhvaja iti khyātaḥ purīm adhyavasac chubhām', null, 1069002),
('ramayana-1-69-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 3', 'वार्याफलकपर्यन्तां पिबन्निक्षुमतीं नदीम्।
सांकाश्यां पुण्यसंकाशां विमानमिव पुष्पकम्॥', 'vāryāphalakaparyantāṃ pibann ikṣumatīṃ nadīm
sāṃkāśyāṃ puṇyasaṃkāśāṃ vimānam iva puṣpakam', null, 1069003),
('ramayana-1-69-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 4', 'तमहं द्रष्टुमिच्छामि यज्ञगोप्ता स मे मतः।
प्रीतिं सोऽपि महातेजा इंमां भोक्ता मया सह॥', 'tam ahaṃ draṣṭum icchāmi yajñagoptā sa me mataḥ
prītiṃ so ''pi mahātejā iṃmāṃ bhoktā mayā saha', null, 1069004),
('ramayana-1-69-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 5', 'शासनात्तु नरेन्द्रस्य प्रययुः शीघ्रवाजिभिः।
समानेतुं नरव्याघ्रं विष्णुमिन्द्राज्ञया यथा॥', 'śāsanāt tu narendrasya prayayuḥ śīghravājibhiḥ
samānetuṃ naravyāghraṃ viṣṇum indrājñayā yathā', null, 1069005),
('ramayana-1-69-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 6', 'आज्ञया तु नरेन्द्रस्य आजगाम कुशध्वजः॥', 'ājñayā tu narendrasya ājagāma kuśadhvajaḥ', null, 1069006),
('ramayana-1-69-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 7', 'स ददर्श महात्मानं जनकं धर्मवत्सलम्।
सोऽभिवाद्य शतानन्दं राजानं चापि धार्मिकम्॥', 'sa dadarśa mahātmānaṃ janakaṃ dharmavatsalam
so ''bhivādya śatānandaṃ rājānaṃ cāpi dhārmikam', null, 1069007),
('ramayana-1-69-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 8', 'राजार्हं परमं दिव्यमासनं चाध्यरोहत।
उपविष्टावुभौ तौ तु भ्रातरावमितौजसौ॥', 'rājārhaṃ paramaṃ divyam āsanaṃ cādhyarohata
upaviṣṭāv ubhau tau tu bhrātarāv amitaujasau', null, 1069008),
('ramayana-1-69-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 9', 'प्रेषयामासतुर्वीरौ मन्त्रिश्रेष्ठं सुदामनम्।
गच्छ मन्त्रिपते शीघ्रमैक्ष्वाकममितप्रभम्।
आत्मजैः सह दुर्धर्षमानयस्व समन्त्रिणम्॥', 'preṣayām āsatur vīrau mantriśreṣṭhaṃ sudāmanam
gaccha mantripate śīghram aikṣvākam amitaprabham
ātmajaiḥ saha durdharṣam ānayasva samantriṇam', null, 1069009),
('ramayana-1-69-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 10', 'औपकार्यां स गत्वा तु रघूणां कुलवर्धनम्।
ददर्श शिरसा चैनमभिवाद्येदमब्रवीत्॥', 'aupakāryāṃ sa gatvā tu raghūṇāṃ kulavardhanam
dadarśa śirasā cainam abhivādyedam abravīt', null, 1069010),
('ramayana-1-69-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 11', 'अयोध्याधिपते वीर वैदेहो मिथिलाधिपः।
स त्वां द्रष्टुं व्यवसितः सोपाध्यायपुरोहितम्॥', 'ayodhyādhipate vīra vaideho mithilādhipaḥ
sa tvāṃ draṣṭuṃ vyavasitaḥ sopādhyāyapurohitam', null, 1069011),
('ramayana-1-69-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 12', 'मन्त्रिश्रेष्ठवचः श्रुत्वा राजा सर्षिगणस्तदा।
सबन्धुरगमत्तत्र जनको यत्र वर्तते॥', 'mantriśreṣṭhavacaḥ śrutvā rājā sarṣigaṇas tadā
sabandhur agamat tatra janako yatra vartate', null, 1069012),
('ramayana-1-69-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 13', 'स राजा मन्त्रिसहितः सोपाध्यायः सबान्धवः।
वाक्यं वाक्यविदां श्रेष्ठो वैदेहमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'sa rājā mantrisahitaḥ sopādhyāyaḥ sabāndhavaḥ
vākyaṃ vākyavidāṃ śreṣṭho vaideham idam abravīt', null, 1069013),
('ramayana-1-69-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 14', 'विदितं ते महाराज इक्ष्वाकुकुलदैवतम्।
वक्ता सर्वेषु कृत्येषु वसिष्ठो भगवानृषिः॥', 'viditaṃ te mahārāja ikṣvākukuladaivatam
vaktā sarveṣu kṛtyeṣu vasiṣṭho bhagavān ṛṣiḥ', null, 1069014),
('ramayana-1-69-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 15', 'विश्वामित्राभ्यनुज्ञातः सह सर्वैर्महर्षिभिः।
एष वक्ष्यति धर्मात्मा वसिष्ठो मे यथाक्रमम्॥', 'viśvāmitrābhyanujñātaḥ saha sarvair maharṣibhiḥ
eṣa vakṣyati dharmātmā vasiṣṭho me yathākramam', null, 1069015),
('ramayana-1-69-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 16', 'तूष्णींभूते दशरथे वसिष्ठो भगवानृषिः।
उवाच वाक्यं वाक्यज्ञो वैदेहं सपुरोहितम्॥', 'tūṣṇīṃbhūte daśarathe vasiṣṭho bhagavān ṛṣiḥ
uvāca vākyaṃ vākyajño vaidehaṃ sapurohitam', null, 1069016),
('ramayana-1-69-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 17', 'अव्यक्तप्रभवो ब्रह्मा शाश्वतो नित्य अव्ययः।
तस्मान्मरीचिः संजज्ञे मरीचेः कश्यपः सुतः॥', 'avyaktaprabhavo brahmā śāśvato nitya avyayaḥ
tasmān marīciḥ saṃjajñe marīceḥ kaśyapaḥ sutaḥ', null, 1069017),
('ramayana-1-69-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 18', 'विवस्वान्कश्यपाज्जज्ञे मनुर्वैवैस्वतः स्मृतः।
मनुः प्रजापतिः पूर्वमिक्ष्वाकुस्तु मनोः सुतः॥', 'vivasvān kaśyapāj jajñe manur vaivaisvataḥ smṛtaḥ
manuḥ prajāpatiḥ pūrvam ikṣvākus tu manoḥ sutaḥ', null, 1069018),
('ramayana-1-69-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 19', 'तमिक्ष्वाकुमयोध्यायां राजानं विद्धि पूर्वकम्।
इक्ष्वाकोस्तु सुतः श्रीमान्विकुक्षिरुदपद्यत॥', 'tam ikṣvākum ayodhyāyāṃ rājānaṃ viddhi pūrvakam
ikṣvākos tu sutaḥ śrīmān vikukṣir udapadyata', null, 1069019),
('ramayana-1-69-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 20', 'विकुक्षेस्तु महातेजा बाणः पुत्रः प्रतापवान्।
बाणस्य तु महातेजा अनरण्यः प्रतापवान्॥', 'vikukṣes tu mahātejā bāṇaḥ putraḥ pratāpavān
bāṇasya tu mahātejā anaraṇyaḥ pratāpavān', null, 1069020),
('ramayana-1-69-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 21', 'अनरण्यात्पृथुर्जज्ञे त्रिशङ्कुस्तु पृथोः सुतः।
त्रिशङ्कोरभवत्पुत्रो धुन्धुमारो महायशाः॥', 'anaraṇyāt pṛthur jajñe triśaṅkus tu pṛthoḥ sutaḥ
triśaṅkor abhavat putro dhundhumāro mahāyaśāḥ', null, 1069021),
('ramayana-1-69-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 22', 'धुन्धुमारान्महातेजा युवनाश्वो महारथः।
युवनाश्वसुतः श्रीमान्मान्धाता पृथिवीपतिः॥', 'dhundhumārān mahātejā yuvanāśvo mahārathaḥ
yuvanāśvasutaḥ śrīmān māndhātā pṛthivīpatiḥ', null, 1069022),
('ramayana-1-69-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 23', 'मान्धातुस्तु सुतः श्रीमान्सुसंधिरुदपद्यत।
सुसंधेरपि पुत्रौ द्वौ ध्रुवसंधिः प्रसेनजित्॥', 'māndhātus tu sutaḥ śrīmān susaṃdhir udapadyata
susaṃdher api putrau dvau dhruvasaṃdhiḥ prasenajit', null, 1069023),
('ramayana-1-69-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 24', 'यशस्वी ध्रुवसंधेस्तु भरतो नाम नामतः।
भरतात्तु महातेजा असितो नाम जायत॥', 'yaśasvī dhruvasaṃdhes tu bharato nāma nāmataḥ
bharatāt tu mahātejā asito nāma jāyata', null, 1069024),
('ramayana-1-69-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 25', 'सह तेन गरेणैव जातः स सगरोऽभवत्।
सगरस्यासमञ्जस्तु असमञ्जादथांशुमान्॥', 'saha tena gareṇaiva jātaḥ sa sagaro ''bhavat
sagarasyāsamañjas tu asamañjād athāṃśumān', null, 1069025),
('ramayana-1-69-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 26', 'दिलीपोऽंशुमतः पुत्रो दिलीपस्य भगीरथः।
भगीरथात्ककुत्स्थश्च ककुत्स्थस्य रघुस्तथा॥', 'dilīpo ''ṃśumataḥ putro dilīpasya bhagīrathaḥ
bhagīrathāt kakutsthaś ca kakutsthasya raghus tathā', null, 1069026),
('ramayana-1-69-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 27', 'रघोस्तु पुत्रस्तेजस्वी प्रवृद्धः पुरुषादकः।
कल्माषपादो ह्यभवत्तस्माज्जातस्तु शङ्खणः॥', 'raghos tu putras tejasvī pravṛddhaḥ puruṣādakaḥ
kalmāṣapādo hy abhavat tasmāj jātas tu śaṅkhaṇaḥ', null, 1069027),
('ramayana-1-69-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 28', 'सुदर्शनः शङ्खणस्य अग्निवर्णः सुदर्शनात्।
शीघ्रगस्त्वग्निवर्णस्य शीघ्रगस्य मरुः सुतः॥', 'sudarśanaḥ śaṅkhaṇasya agnivarṇaḥ sudarśanāt
śīghragas tv agnivarṇasya śīghragasya maruḥ sutaḥ', null, 1069028),
('ramayana-1-69-29', 29, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 29', 'मरोः प्रशुश्रुकस्त्वासीदम्बरीषः प्रशुश्रुकात्।
अम्बरीषस्य पुत्रोऽभून्नहुषः पृथिवीपतिः॥', 'maroḥ praśuśrukas tv āsīd ambarīṣaḥ praśuśrukāt
ambarīṣasya putro ''bhūn nahuṣaḥ pṛthivīpatiḥ', null, 1069029),
('ramayana-1-69-30', 30, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 30', 'नहुषस्य ययातिस्तु नाभागस्तु ययातिजः।
नाभागस्य बभूवाज अजाद्दशरथोऽभवत्।
तस्माद्दशरथाज्जातौ भ्रातरौ रामलक्ष्मणौ॥', 'nahuṣasya yayātis tu nābhāgas tu yayātijaḥ
nābhāgasya babhūvāja ajād daśaratho ''bhavat
tasmād daśarathāj jātau bhrātarau rāmalakṣmaṇau', null, 1069030),
('ramayana-1-69-31', 31, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 31', 'आदिवंशविशुद्धानां राज्ञां परमधर्मिणाम्।
इक्ष्वाकुकुलजातानां वीराणां सत्यवादिनाम्॥', 'ādivaṃśaviśuddhānāṃ rājñāṃ paramadharmiṇām
ikṣvākukulajātānāṃ vīrāṇāṃ satyavādinām', null, 1069031),
('ramayana-1-69-32', 32, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 69, Verse 32', 'रामलक्ष्मणयोरर्थे त्वत्सुते वरये नृप।
सदृशाभ्यां नरश्रेष्ठ सदृशे दातुमर्हसि॥', 'rāmalakṣmaṇayor arthe tvatsute varaye nṛpa
sadṛśābhyāṃ naraśreṣṭha sadṛśe dātum arhasi', null, 1069032)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 70 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-70-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 1', 'एवं ब्रुवाणं जनकः प्रत्युवाच कृताञ्जलिः।
श्रोतुमर्हसि भद्रं ते कुलं नः कीर्तितं परम्॥', 'evaṃ bruvāṇaṃ janakaḥ pratyuvāca kṛtāñjaliḥ
śrotum arhasi bhadraṃ te kulaṃ naḥ kīrtitaṃ param', null, 1070001),
('ramayana-1-70-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 2', 'प्रदाने हि मुनिश्रेष्ठ कुलं निरवशेषतः।
वक्तव्यं कुलजातेन तन्निबोध महामुने॥', 'pradāne hi muniśreṣṭha kulaṃ niravaśeṣataḥ
vaktavyaṃ kulajātena tan nibodha mahāmune', null, 1070002),
('ramayana-1-70-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 3', 'राजाभूत्त्रिषु लोकेषु विश्रुतः स्वेन कर्मणा।
निमिः परमधर्मात्मा सर्वसत्त्ववतां वरः॥', 'rājābhūt triṣu lokeṣu viśrutaḥ svena karmaṇā
nimiḥ paramadharmātmā sarvasattvavatāṃ varaḥ', null, 1070003),
('ramayana-1-70-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 4', 'तस्य पुत्रो मिथिर्नाम जनको मिथि पुत्रकः।
प्रथमो जनको नाम जनकादप्युदावसुः॥', 'tasya putro mithir nāma janako mithi putrakaḥ
prathamo janako nāma janakād apy udāvasuḥ', null, 1070004),
('ramayana-1-70-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 5', 'उदावसोस्तु धर्मात्मा जातो वै नन्दिवर्धनः।
नन्दिवर्धन पुत्रस्तु सुकेतुर्नाम नामतः॥', 'udāvasos tu dharmātmā jāto vai nandivardhanaḥ
nandivardhana putras tu suketur nāma nāmataḥ', null, 1070005),
('ramayana-1-70-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 6', 'सुकेतोरपि धर्मात्मा देवरातो महाबलः।
देवरातस्य राजर्षेर्बृहद्रथ इति श्रुतः॥', 'suketor api dharmātmā devarāto mahābalaḥ
devarātasya rājarṣer bṛhadratha iti śrutaḥ', null, 1070006),
('ramayana-1-70-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 7', 'बृहद्रथस्य शूरोऽभून्महावीरः प्रतापवान्।
महावीरस्य धृतिमान्सुधृतिः सत्यविक्रमः॥', 'bṛhadrathasya śūro ''bhūn mahāvīraḥ pratāpavān
mahāvīrasya dhṛtimān sudhṛtiḥ satyavikramaḥ', null, 1070007),
('ramayana-1-70-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 8', 'सुधृतेरपि धर्मात्मा धृष्टकेतुः सुधार्मिकः।
धृष्टकेतोस्तु राजर्षेर्हर्यश्व इति विश्रुतः॥', 'sudhṛter api dharmātmā dhṛṣṭaketuḥ sudhārmikaḥ
dhṛṣṭaketos tu rājarṣer haryaśva iti viśrutaḥ', null, 1070008),
('ramayana-1-70-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 9', 'हर्यश्वस्य मरुः पुत्रो मरोः पुत्रः प्रतीन्धकः।
प्रतीन्धकस्य धर्मात्मा राजा कीर्तिरथः सुतः॥', 'haryaśvasya maruḥ putro maroḥ putraḥ pratīndhakaḥ
pratīndhakasya dharmātmā rājā kīrtirathaḥ sutaḥ', null, 1070009),
('ramayana-1-70-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 10', 'पुत्रः कीर्तिरथस्यापि देवमीढ इति स्मृतः।
देवमीढस्य विबुधो विबुधस्य महीध्रकः॥', 'putraḥ kīrtirathasyāpi devamīḍha iti smṛtaḥ
devamīḍhasya vibudho vibudhasya mahīdhrakaḥ', null, 1070010),
('ramayana-1-70-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 11', 'महीध्रकसुतो राजा कीर्तिरातो महाबलः।
कीर्तिरातस्य राजर्षेर्महारोमा व्यजायत॥', 'mahīdhrakasuto rājā kīrtirāto mahābalaḥ
kīrtirātasya rājarṣer mahāromā vyajāyata', null, 1070011),
('ramayana-1-70-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 12', 'महारोंणस्तु धर्मात्मा स्वर्णरोमा व्यजायत।
स्वर्णरोंणस्तु राजर्षेर्ह्रस्वरोमा व्यजायत॥', 'mahāroṃṇas tu dharmātmā svarṇaromā vyajāyata
svarṇaroṃṇas tu rājarṣer hrasvaromā vyajāyata', null, 1070012),
('ramayana-1-70-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 13', 'तस्य पुत्रद्वयं जज्ञे धर्मज्ञस्य महात्मनः।
ज्येष्ठोऽहमनुजो भ्राता मम वीरः कुशध्वजः॥', 'tasya putradvayaṃ jajñe dharmajñasya mahātmanaḥ
jyeṣṭho ''ham anujo bhrātā mama vīraḥ kuśadhvajaḥ', null, 1070013),
('ramayana-1-70-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 14', 'मां तु ज्येष्ठं पिता राज्ये सोऽभिषिच्य नराधिपः।
कुशध्वजं समावेश्य भारं मयि वनं गतः॥', 'māṃ tu jyeṣṭhaṃ pitā rājye so ''bhiṣicya narādhipaḥ
kuśadhvajaṃ samāveśya bhāraṃ mayi vanaṃ gataḥ', null, 1070014),
('ramayana-1-70-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 15', 'वृद्धे पितरि स्वर्याते धर्मेण धुरमावहम्।
भ्रातरं देवसंकाशं स्नेहात्पश्यन्कुशध्वजम्॥', 'vṛddhe pitari svaryāte dharmeṇa dhuram āvaham
bhrātaraṃ devasaṃkāśaṃ snehāt paśyan kuśadhvajam', null, 1070015),
('ramayana-1-70-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 16', 'कस्य चित्त्वथ कालस्य सांकाश्यादगमत्पुरात्।
सुधन्वा वीर्यवान्राजा मिथिलामवरोधकः॥', 'kasya cit tv atha kālasya sāṃkāśyād agamat purāt
sudhanvā vīryavān rājā mithilām avarodhakaḥ', null, 1070016),
('ramayana-1-70-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 17', 'स च मे प्रेषयामास शैवं धनुरनुत्तमम्।
सीता कन्या च पद्माक्षी मह्यं वै दीयतामिति॥', 'sa ca me preṣayām āsa śaivaṃ dhanur anuttamam
sītā kanyā ca padmākṣī mahyaṃ vai dīyatām iti', null, 1070017),
('ramayana-1-70-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 18', 'तस्याप्रदानाद्ब्रह्मर्षे युद्धमासीन्मया सह।
स हतोऽभिमुखो राजा सुधन्वा तु मया रणे॥', 'tasyāpradānād brahmarṣe yuddham āsīn mayā saha
sa hato ''bhimukho rājā sudhanvā tu mayā raṇe', null, 1070018),
('ramayana-1-70-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 19', 'निहत्य तं मुनिश्रेष्ठ सुधन्वानं नराधिपम्।
सांकाश्ये भ्रातरं शूरमभ्यषिञ्चं कुशध्वजम्॥', 'nihatya taṃ muniśreṣṭha sudhanvānaṃ narādhipam
sāṃkāśye bhrātaraṃ śūram abhyaṣiñcaṃ kuśadhvajam', null, 1070019),
('ramayana-1-70-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 20', 'कनीयानेष मे भ्राता अहं ज्येष्ठो महामुने।
ददामि परमप्रीतो वध्वौ ते मुनिपुंगव॥', 'kanīyān eṣa me bhrātā ahaṃ jyeṣṭho mahāmune
dadāmi paramaprīto vadhvau te munipuṃgava', null, 1070020),
('ramayana-1-70-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 21', 'सीतां रामाय भद्रं ते ऊर्मिलां लक्ष्मणाय च।
वीर्यशुल्कां मम सुतां सीतां सुरसुतोपमाम्॥', 'sītāṃ rāmāya bhadraṃ te ūrmilāṃ lakṣmaṇāya ca
vīryaśulkāṃ mama sutāṃ sītāṃ surasutopamām', null, 1070021),
('ramayana-1-70-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 22', 'द्वितीयामूर्मिलां चैव त्रिर्वदामि न संशयः।
ददामि परमप्रीतो वध्वौ ते रघुनन्दन॥', 'dvitīyām ūrmilāṃ caiva trir vadāmi na saṃśayaḥ
dadāmi paramaprīto vadhvau te raghunandana', null, 1070022),
('ramayana-1-70-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 23', 'रामलक्ष्मणयो राजन्गोदानं कारयस्व ह।
पितृकार्यं च भद्रं ते ततो वैवाहिकं कुरु॥', 'rāmalakṣmaṇayo rājan godānaṃ kārayasva ha
pitṛkāryaṃ ca bhadraṃ te tato vaivāhikaṃ kuru', null, 1070023),
('ramayana-1-70-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 70, Verse 24', 'मघा ह्यद्य महाबाहो तृतीये दिवसे प्रभो।
फल्गुन्यामुत्तरे राजंस्तस्मिन्वैवाहिकं कुरु।
रामलक्ष्मणयोरर्थे दानं कार्यं सुखोदयम्॥', 'maghā hy adya mahābāho tṛtīye divase prabho
phalgunyām uttare rājaṃs tasmin vaivāhikaṃ kuru
rāmalakṣmaṇayor arthe dānaṃ kāryaṃ sukhodayam', null, 1070024)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 71 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-71-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 1', 'तमुक्तवन्तं वैदेहं विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
उवाच वचनं वीरं वसिष्ठसहितो नृपम्॥', 'tam uktavantaṃ vaidehaṃ viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
uvāca vacanaṃ vīraṃ vasiṣṭhasahito nṛpam', null, 1071001),
('ramayana-1-71-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 2', 'अचिन्त्यान्यप्रमेयानि कुलानि नरपुंगव।
इक्ष्वाकूणां विदेहानां नैषां तुल्योऽस्ति कश्चन॥', 'acintyāny aprameyāni kulāni narapuṃgava
ikṣvākūṇāṃ videhānāṃ naiṣāṃ tulyo ''sti kaś cana', null, 1071002),
('ramayana-1-71-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 3', 'सदृशो धर्मसंबन्धः सदृशो रूपसंपदा।
रामलक्ष्मणयो राजन्सीता चोर्मिलया सह॥', 'sadṛśo dharmasaṃbandhaḥ sadṛśo rūpasaṃpadā
rāmalakṣmaṇayo rājan sītā cormilayā saha', null, 1071003),
('ramayana-1-71-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 4', 'वक्तव्यं च नरश्रेष्ठ श्रूयतां वचनं मम॥', 'vaktavyaṃ ca naraśreṣṭha śrūyatāṃ vacanaṃ mama', null, 1071004),
('ramayana-1-71-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 5', 'भ्राता यवीयान्धर्मज्ञ एष राजा कुशध्वजः।
अस्य धर्मात्मनो राजन्रूपेणाप्रतिमं भुवि।
सुताद्वयं नरश्रेष्ठ पत्न्यर्थं वरयामहे॥', 'bhrātā yavīyān dharmajña eṣa rājā kuśadhvajaḥ
asya dharmātmano rājan rūpeṇāpratimaṃ bhuvi
sutādvayaṃ naraśreṣṭha patnyarthaṃ varayāmahe', null, 1071005),
('ramayana-1-71-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 6', 'भरतस्य कुमारस्य शत्रुघ्नस्य च धीमतः।
वरयेम सुते राजंस्तयोरर्थे महात्मनोः॥', 'bharatasya kumārasya śatrughnasya ca dhīmataḥ
varayema sute rājaṃs tayor arthe mahātmanoḥ', null, 1071006),
('ramayana-1-71-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 7', 'पुत्रा दशरथस्येमे रूपयौवनशालिनः।
लोकपालोपमाः सर्वे देवतुल्यपराक्रमाः॥', 'putrā daśarathasyeme rūpayauvanaśālinaḥ
lokapālopamāḥ sarve devatulyaparākramāḥ', null, 1071007),
('ramayana-1-71-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 8', 'उभयोरपि राजेन्द्र संबन्धेनानुबध्यताम्।
इक्ष्वाकुकुलमव्यग्रं भवतः पुण्यकर्मणः॥', 'ubhayor api rājendra saṃbandhenānubadhyatām
ikṣvākukulam avyagraṃ bhavataḥ puṇyakarmaṇaḥ', null, 1071008),
('ramayana-1-71-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 9', 'विश्वामित्रवचः श्रुत्वा वसिष्ठस्य मते तदा।
जनकः प्राञ्जलिर्वाक्यमुवाच मुनिपुंगवौ॥', 'viśvāmitravacaḥ śrutvā vasiṣṭhasya mate tadā
janakaḥ prāñjalir vākyam uvāca munipuṃgavau', null, 1071009),
('ramayana-1-71-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 10', 'सदृशं कुलसंबन्धं यदाज्ञापयथः स्वयम्।
एवं भवतु भद्रं वः कुशध्वजसुते इमे।
पत्न्यौ भजेतां सहितौ शत्रुघ्नभरतावुभौ॥', 'sadṛśaṃ kulasaṃbandhaṃ yad ājñāpayathaḥ svayam
evaṃ bhavatu bhadraṃ vaḥ kuśadhvajasute ime
patnyau bhajetāṃ sahitau śatrughnabharatāv ubhau', null, 1071010),
('ramayana-1-71-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 11', 'एकाह्ना राजपुत्रीणां चतसृणां महामुने।
पाणीन्गृह्णन्तु चत्वारो राजपुत्रा महाबलाः॥', 'ekāhnā rājaputrīṇāṃ catasṛṇāṃ mahāmune
pāṇīn gṛhṇantu catvāro rājaputrā mahābalāḥ', null, 1071011),
('ramayana-1-71-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 12', 'उत्तरे दिवसे ब्रह्मन्फल्गुनीभ्यां मनीषिणः।
वैवाहिकं प्रशंसन्ति भगो यत्र प्रजापतिः॥', 'uttare divase brahman phalgunībhyāṃ manīṣiṇaḥ
vaivāhikaṃ praśaṃsanti bhago yatra prajāpatiḥ', null, 1071012),
('ramayana-1-71-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 13', 'एवमुक्त्वा वचः सौम्यं प्रत्युत्थाय कृताञ्जलिः।
उभौ मुनिवरौ राजा जनको वाक्यमब्रवीत्॥', 'evam uktvā vacaḥ saumyaṃ pratyutthāya kṛtāñjaliḥ
ubhau munivarau rājā janako vākyam abravīt', null, 1071013),
('ramayana-1-71-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 14', 'परो धर्मः कृतो मह्यं शिष्योऽस्मि भवतोः सदा।
इमान्यासनमुख्यानि आसेतां मुनिपुंगवौ॥', 'paro dharmaḥ kṛto mahyaṃ śiṣyo ''smi bhavatoḥ sadā
imāny āsanamukhyāni āsetāṃ munipuṃgavau', null, 1071014),
('ramayana-1-71-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 15', 'यथा दशरथस्येयं तथायोध्या पुरी मम।
प्रभुत्वे नासित्संदेहो यथार्हं कर्तुमर्हथः॥', 'yathā daśarathasyeyaṃ tathāyodhyā purī mama
prabhutve nāsit saṃdeho yathārhaṃ kartum arhathaḥ', null, 1071015),
('ramayana-1-71-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 16', 'तथा ब्रुवति वैदेहे जनके रघुनन्दनः।
राजा दशरथो हृष्टः प्रत्युवाच महीपतिम्॥', 'tathā bruvati vaidehe janake raghunandanaḥ
rājā daśaratho hṛṣṭaḥ pratyuvāca mahīpatim', null, 1071016),
('ramayana-1-71-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 17', 'युवामसंख्येय गुणौ भ्रातरौ मिथिलेश्वरौ।
ऋषयो राजसंघाश्च भवद्भ्यामभिपूजिताः॥', 'yuvām asaṃkhyeya guṇau bhrātarau mithileśvarau
ṛṣayo rājasaṃghāś ca bhavadbhyām abhipūjitāḥ', null, 1071017),
('ramayana-1-71-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 18', 'स्वस्ति प्राप्नुहि भद्रं ते गमिष्यामि स्वमालयम्।
श्राद्धकर्माणि सर्वाणि विधास्य इति चाब्रवीत्॥', 'svasti prāpnuhi bhadraṃ te gamiṣyāmi svam ālayam
śrāddhakarmāṇi sarvāṇi vidhāsya iti cābravīt', null, 1071018),
('ramayana-1-71-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 19', 'तमापृष्ट्वा नरपतिं राजा दशरथस्तदा।
मुनीन्द्रौ तौ पुरस्कृत्य जगामाशु महायशाः॥', 'tam āpṛṣṭvā narapatiṃ rājā daśarathas tadā
munīndrau tau puraskṛtya jagāmāśu mahāyaśāḥ', null, 1071019),
('ramayana-1-71-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 20', 'स गत्वा निलयं राजा श्राद्धं कृत्वा विधानतः।
प्रभाते काल्यमुत्थाय चक्रे गोदानमुत्तमम्॥', 'sa gatvā nilayaṃ rājā śrāddhaṃ kṛtvā vidhānataḥ
prabhāte kālyam utthāya cakre godānam uttamam', null, 1071020),
('ramayana-1-71-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 21', 'गवां शतसहस्राणि ब्राह्मणेभ्यो नराधिपः।
एकैकशो ददौ राजा पुत्रानुद्धिश्य धर्मतः॥', 'gavāṃ śatasahasrāṇi brāhmaṇebhyo narādhipaḥ
ekaikaśo dadau rājā putrān uddhiśya dharmataḥ', null, 1071021),
('ramayana-1-71-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 22', 'सुवर्णशृङ्गाः संपन्नाः सवत्साः कांस्यदोहनाः।
गवां शतसहस्राणि चत्वारि पुरुषर्षभः॥', 'suvarṇaśṛṅgāḥ saṃpannāḥ savatsāḥ kāṃsyadohanāḥ
gavāṃ śatasahasrāṇi catvāri puruṣarṣabhaḥ', null, 1071022),
('ramayana-1-71-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 23', 'वित्तमन्यच्च सुबहु द्विजेभ्यो रघुनन्दनः।
ददौ गोदानमुद्दिश्य पुत्राणां पुत्रवत्सलः॥', 'vittam anyac ca subahu dvijebhyo raghunandanaḥ
dadau godānam uddiśya putrāṇāṃ putravatsalaḥ', null, 1071023),
('ramayana-1-71-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 71, Verse 24', 'स सुतैः कृतगोदानैर्वृतश्च नृपतिस्तदा।
लोकपालैरिवाभाति वृतः सौम्यः प्रजापतिः॥', 'sa sutaiḥ kṛtagodānair vṛtaś ca nṛpatis tadā
lokapālair ivābhāti vṛtaḥ saumyaḥ prajāpatiḥ', null, 1071024)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 72 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-72-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 1', 'यस्मिंस्तु दिवसे राजा चक्रे गोदानमुत्तमम्।
तस्मिंस्तु दिवसे शूरो युधाजित्समुपेयिवान्॥', 'yasmiṃs tu divase rājā cakre godānam uttamam
tasmiṃs tu divase śūro yudhājit samupeyivān', null, 1072001),
('ramayana-1-72-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 2', 'पुत्रः केकयराजस्य साक्षाद्भरतमातुलः।
दृष्ट्वा पृष्ट्वा च कुशलं राजानमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'putraḥ kekayarājasya sākṣād bharatamātulaḥ
dṛṣṭvā pṛṣṭvā ca kuśalaṃ rājānam idam abravīt', null, 1072002),
('ramayana-1-72-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 3', 'केकयाधिपती राजा स्नेहात्कुशलमब्रवीत्।
येषां कुशलकामोऽसि तेषां संप्रत्यनामयम्॥', 'kekayādhipatī rājā snehāt kuśalam abravīt
yeṣāṃ kuśalakāmo ''si teṣāṃ saṃpraty anāmayam', null, 1072003),
('ramayana-1-72-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 4', 'स्वस्रीयं मम राजेन्द्र द्रष्टुकामो महीपते।
तदर्थमुपयातोऽहमयोध्यां रघुनन्दन॥', 'svasrīyaṃ mama rājendra draṣṭukāmo mahīpate
tadartham upayāto ''ham ayodhyāṃ raghunandana', null, 1072004),
('ramayana-1-72-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 5', 'श्रुत्वा त्वहमयोध्यायां विवाहार्थं तवात्मजान्।
मिथिलामुपयातास्तु त्वया सह महीपते।
त्वरयाभ्युपयातोऽहं द्रष्टुकामः स्वसुः सुतम्॥', 'śrutvā tv aham ayodhyāyāṃ vivāhārthaṃ tavātmajān
mithilām upayātās tu tvayā saha mahīpate
tvarayābhyupayāto ''haṃ draṣṭukāmaḥ svasuḥ sutam', null, 1072005),
('ramayana-1-72-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 6', 'अथ राजा दशरथः प्रियातिथिमुपस्थिम।
दृष्ट्वा परमसत्कारैः पूजार्हं समपूजयत्॥', 'atha rājā daśarathaḥ priyātithim upasthima
dṛṣṭvā paramasatkāraiḥ pūjārhaṃ samapūjayat', null, 1072006),
('ramayana-1-72-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 7', 'ततस्तामुषितो रात्रिं सह पुत्रैर्महात्मभिः।
ऋषींस्तदा पुरस्कृत्य यज्ञवाटमुपागमत्॥', 'tatas tām uṣito rātriṃ saha putrair mahātmabhiḥ
ṛṣīṃs tadā puraskṛtya yajñavāṭam upāgamat', null, 1072007),
('ramayana-1-72-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 8', 'युक्ते मुहूर्ते विजये सर्वाभरणभूषितैः।
भ्रातृभिः सहितो रामः कृतकौतुकमङ्गलः।
वसिष्ठं पुरतः कृत्वा महर्षीनपरानपि॥', 'yukte muhūrte vijaye sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaiḥ
bhrātṛbhiḥ sahito rāmaḥ kṛtakautukamaṅgalaḥ
vasiṣṭhaṃ purataḥ kṛtvā maharṣīn aparān api', null, 1072008),
('ramayana-1-72-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 9', 'वसिष्ठो भगवानेत्य वैदेहमिदमब्रवीत्॥', 'vasiṣṭho bhagavān etya vaideham idam abravīt', null, 1072009),
('ramayana-1-72-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 10', 'राजा दशरथो राजन्कृतकौतुकमङ्गलैः।
पुत्रैर्नरवरश्रेष्ठ दातारमभिकाङ्क्षते॥', 'rājā daśaratho rājan kṛtakautukamaṅgalaiḥ
putrair naravaraśreṣṭha dātāram abhikāṅkṣate', null, 1072010),
('ramayana-1-72-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 11', 'दातृप्रतिग्रहीतृभ्यां सर्वार्थाः प्रभवन्ति हि।
स्वधर्मं प्रतिपद्यस्व कृत्वा वैवाह्यमुत्तमम्॥', 'dātṛpratigrahītṛbhyāṃ sarvārthāḥ prabhavanti hi
svadharmaṃ pratipadyasva kṛtvā vaivāhyam uttamam', null, 1072011),
('ramayana-1-72-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 12', 'इत्युक्तः परमोदारो वसिष्ठेन महात्मना।
प्रत्युवाच महातेजा वाक्यं परमधर्मवित्॥', 'ity uktaḥ paramodāro vasiṣṭhena mahātmanā
pratyuvāca mahātejā vākyaṃ paramadharmavit', null, 1072012),
('ramayana-1-72-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 13', 'कः स्थितः प्रतिहारो मे कस्याज्ञा संप्रतीक्ष्यते।
स्वगृहे को विचारोऽस्ति यथा राज्यमिदं तव॥', 'kaḥ sthitaḥ pratihāro me kasyājñā saṃpratīkṣyate
svagṛhe ko vicāro ''sti yathā rājyam idaṃ tava', null, 1072013),
('ramayana-1-72-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 14', 'कृतकौतुकसर्वस्वा वेदिमूलमुपागताः।
मम कन्या मुनिश्रेष्ठ दीप्ता वह्नेरिवार्चिषः॥', 'kṛtakautukasarvasvā vedimūlam upāgatāḥ
mama kanyā muniśreṣṭha dīptā vahner ivārciṣaḥ', null, 1072014),
('ramayana-1-72-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 15', 'सज्जोऽहं त्वत्प्रतीक्षोऽस्मि वेद्यामस्यां प्रतिष्ठितः।
अविघ्नं कुरुतां राजा किमर्थं हि विलम्ब्यते॥', 'sajjo ''haṃ tvatpratīkṣo ''smi vedyām asyāṃ pratiṣṭhitaḥ
avighnaṃ kurutāṃ rājā kimarthaṃ hi vilambyate', null, 1072015),
('ramayana-1-72-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 16', 'तद्वाक्यं जनकेनोक्तं श्रुत्वा दशरथस्तदा।
प्रवेशयामास सुतान्सर्वानृषिगणानपि॥', 'tadvākyaṃ janakenoktaṃ śrutvā daśarathas tadā
praveśayām āsa sutān sarvān ṛṣigaṇān api', null, 1072016),
('ramayana-1-72-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 17', 'अब्रवीज्जनको राजा कौसल्यानन्दवर्धनम्।
इयं सीता मम सुता सहधर्मचरी तव।
प्रतीच्छ चैनां भद्रं ते पाणिं गृह्णीष्व पाणिना॥', 'abravīj janako rājā kausalyānandavardhanam
iyaṃ sītā mama sutā sahadharmacarī tava
pratīccha caināṃ bhadraṃ te pāṇiṃ gṛhṇīṣva pāṇinā', null, 1072017),
('ramayana-1-72-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 18', 'लक्ष्मणागच्छ भद्रं ते ऊर्मिलामुद्यतां मया।
प्रतीच्छ पाणिं गृह्णीष्व मा भूत्कालस्य पर्ययः॥', 'lakṣmaṇāgaccha bhadraṃ te ūrmilām udyatāṃ mayā
pratīccha pāṇiṃ gṛhṇīṣva mā bhūt kālasya paryayaḥ', null, 1072018),
('ramayana-1-72-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 19', 'तमेवमुक्त्वा जनको भरतं चाभ्यभाषत।
गृहाण पाणिं माण्डव्याः पाणिना रघुनन्दन॥', 'tam evam uktvā janako bharataṃ cābhyabhāṣata
gṛhāṇa pāṇiṃ māṇḍavyāḥ pāṇinā raghunandana', null, 1072019),
('ramayana-1-72-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 20', 'शत्रुघ्नं चापि धर्मात्मा अब्रवीज्जनकेश्वरः।
श्रुतकीर्त्या महाबाहो पाणिं गृह्णीष्व पाणिना॥', 'śatrughnaṃ cāpi dharmātmā abravīj janakeśvaraḥ
śrutakīrtyā mahābāho pāṇiṃ gṛhṇīṣva pāṇinā', null, 1072020),
('ramayana-1-72-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 21', 'सर्वे भवन्तः संयाश्च सर्वे सुचरितव्रताः।
पत्नीभिः सन्तु काकुत्स्था मा भूत्कालस्य पर्ययः॥', 'sarve bhavantaḥ saṃyāś ca sarve sucaritavratāḥ
patnībhiḥ santu kākutsthā mā bhūt kālasya paryayaḥ', null, 1072021),
('ramayana-1-72-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 22', 'जनकस्य वचः श्रुत्वा पाणीन्पाणिभिरस्पृशन्।
चत्वारस्ते चतसृणां वसिष्ठस्य मते स्थिताः॥', 'janakasya vacaḥ śrutvā pāṇīn pāṇibhir aspṛśan
catvāras te catasṛṇāṃ vasiṣṭhasya mate sthitāḥ', null, 1072022),
('ramayana-1-72-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 23', 'अग्निं प्रदक्षिणं कृत्वा वेदिं राजानमेव च।
ऋषींश्चैव महात्मानः सह भार्या रघूत्तमाः।
यथोक्तेन तथा चक्रुर्विवाहं विधिपूर्वकम्॥', 'agniṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā vediṃ rājānam eva ca
ṛṣīṃś caiva mahātmānaḥ saha bhāryā raghūttamāḥ
yathoktena tathā cakrur vivāhaṃ vidhipūrvakam', null, 1072023),
('ramayana-1-72-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 24', 'पुष्पवृष्टिर्महत्यासीदन्तरिक्षात्सुभास्वरा।
दिव्यदुन्दुभिनिर्घोषैर्गीतवादित्रनिस्वनैः॥', 'puṣpavṛṣṭir mahaty āsīd antarikṣāt subhāsvarā
divyadundubhinirghoṣair gītavāditranisvanaiḥ', null, 1072024),
('ramayana-1-72-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 25', 'ननृतुश्चाप्सरःसंघा गन्धर्वाश्च जगुः कलम्।
विवाहे रघुमुख्यानां तदद्भुतमिवाभवत्॥', 'nanṛtuś cāpsaraḥsaṃghā gandharvāś ca jaguḥ kalam
vivāhe raghumukhyānāṃ tad adbhutam ivābhavat', null, 1072025),
('ramayana-1-72-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 26', 'ईदृशे वर्तमाने तु तूर्योद्घुष्टनिनादिते।
त्रिरग्निं ते परिक्रम्य ऊहुर्भार्या महौजसः॥', 'īdṛśe vartamāne tu tūryodghuṣṭaninādite
trir agniṃ te parikramya ūhur bhāryā mahaujasaḥ', null, 1072026),
('ramayana-1-72-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 72, Verse 27', 'अथोपकार्यां जग्मुस्ते सदारा रघुनन्दनः।
राजाप्यनुययौ पश्यन्सर्षिसंघः सबान्धवः॥', 'athopakāryāṃ jagmus te sadārā raghunandanaḥ
rājāpy anuyayau paśyan sarṣisaṃghaḥ sabāndhavaḥ', null, 1072027)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 73 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-73-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 1', 'अथ रात्र्यां व्यतीतायां विश्वामित्रो महामुनिः।
आपृच्छ्य तौ च राजानौ जगामोत्तरपर्वतम्॥', 'atha rātryāṃ vyatītāyāṃ viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ
āpṛcchya tau ca rājānau jagāmottaraparvatam', null, 1073001),
('ramayana-1-73-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 2', 'विश्वामित्रो गते राजा वैदेहं मिथिलाधिपम्।
आपृच्छ्याथ जगामाशु राजा दशरथः पुरीम्॥', 'viśvāmitro gate rājā vaidehaṃ mithilādhipam
āpṛcchyātha jagāmāśu rājā daśarathaḥ purīm', null, 1073002),
('ramayana-1-73-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 3', 'अथ राजा विदेहानां ददौ कन्याधनं बहु।
गवां शतसहस्राणि बहूनि मिथिलेश्वरः॥', 'atha rājā videhānāṃ dadau kanyādhanaṃ bahu
gavāṃ śatasahasrāṇi bahūni mithileśvaraḥ', null, 1073003),
('ramayana-1-73-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 4', 'कम्बलानां च मुख्यानां क्षौमकोट्यम्बराणि च।
हस्त्यश्वरथपादातं दिव्यरूपं स्वलंकृतम्॥', 'kambalānāṃ ca mukhyānāṃ kṣaumakoṭyambarāṇi ca
hastyaśvarathapādātaṃ divyarūpaṃ svalaṃkṛtam', null, 1073004),
('ramayana-1-73-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 5', 'ददौ कन्या पिता तासां दासीदासमनुत्तमम्।
हिरण्यस्य सुवर्णस्य मुक्तानां विद्रुमस्य च॥', 'dadau kanyā pitā tāsāṃ dāsīdāsam anuttamam
hiraṇyasya suvarṇasya muktānāṃ vidrumasya ca', null, 1073005),
('ramayana-1-73-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 6', 'ददौ परमसंहृष्टः कन्याधनमनुत्तमम्।
दत्त्वा बहुधनं राजा समनुज्ञाप्य पार्थिवम्॥', 'dadau paramasaṃhṛṣṭaḥ kanyādhanam anuttamam
dattvā bahudhanaṃ rājā samanujñāpya pārthivam', null, 1073006),
('ramayana-1-73-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 7', 'प्रविवेश स्वनिलयं मिथिलां मिथिलेश्वरः।
राजाप्ययोध्याधिपतिः सह पुत्रैर्महात्मभिः॥', 'praviveśa svanilayaṃ mithilāṃ mithileśvaraḥ
rājāpy ayodhyādhipatiḥ saha putrair mahātmabhiḥ', null, 1073007),
('ramayana-1-73-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 8', 'ऋषीन्सर्वान्पुरस्कृत्य जगाम सबलानुगः।
गच्छन्तं तु नरव्याघ्रं सर्षिसंघं सराघवम्॥', 'ṛṣīn sarvān puraskṛtya jagāma sabalānugaḥ
gacchantaṃ tu naravyāghraṃ sarṣisaṃghaṃ sarāghavam', null, 1073008),
('ramayana-1-73-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 9', 'घोराः स्म पक्षिणो वाचो व्याहरन्ति ततस्ततः।
भौमाश्चैव मृगाः सर्वे गच्छन्ति स्म प्रदक्षिणम्॥', 'ghorāḥ sma pakṣiṇo vāco vyāharanti tatas tataḥ
bhaumāś caiva mṛgāḥ sarve gacchanti sma pradakṣiṇam', null, 1073009),
('ramayana-1-73-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 10', 'तान्दृष्ट्वा राजशार्दूलो वसिष्ठं पर्यपृच्छत।
असौम्याः पक्षिणो घोरा मृगाश्चापि प्रदक्षिणाः।
किमिदं हृदयोत्कम्पि मनो मम विषीदति॥', 'tān dṛṣṭvā rājaśārdūlo vasiṣṭhaṃ paryapṛcchata
asaumyāḥ pakṣiṇo ghorā mṛgāś cāpi pradakṣiṇāḥ
kim idaṃ hṛdayotkampi mano mama viṣīdati', null, 1073010),
('ramayana-1-73-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 11', 'राज्ञो दशरथस्यैतच्छ्रुत्वा वाक्यं महानृषिः।
उवाच मधुरां वाणीं श्रूयतामस्य यत्फलम्॥', 'rājño daśarathasyaitac chrutvā vākyaṃ mahān ṛṣiḥ
uvāca madhurāṃ vāṇīṃ śrūyatām asya yat phalam', null, 1073011),
('ramayana-1-73-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 12', 'उपस्थितं भयं घोरं दिव्यं पक्षिमुखाच्च्युतम्।
मृगाः प्रशमयन्त्येते संतापस्त्यज्यतामयम्॥', 'upasthitaṃ bhayaṃ ghoraṃ divyaṃ pakṣimukhāc cyutam
mṛgāḥ praśamayanty ete saṃtāpas tyajyatām ayam', null, 1073012),
('ramayana-1-73-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 13', 'तेषां संवदतां तत्र वायुः प्रादुर्बभूव ह।
कम्पयन्मेदिनीं सर्वां पातयंश्च द्रुमाञ्शुभान्॥', 'teṣāṃ saṃvadatāṃ tatra vāyuḥ prādur babhūva ha
kampayan medinīṃ sarvāṃ pātayaṃś ca drumāñ śubhān', null, 1073013),
('ramayana-1-73-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 14', 'तमसा संवृतः सूर्यः सर्वा न प्रबभुर्दिशः।
भस्मना चावृतं सर्वं संमूढमिव तद्बलम्॥', 'tamasā saṃvṛtaḥ sūryaḥ sarvā na prababhur diśaḥ
bhasmanā cāvṛtaṃ sarvaṃ saṃmūḍham iva tad balam', null, 1073014),
('ramayana-1-73-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 15', 'वसिष्ठ ऋषयश्चान्ये राजा च ससुतस्तदा।
ससंज्ञा इव तत्रासन्सर्वमन्यद्विचेतनम्॥', 'vasiṣṭha ṛṣayaś cānye rājā ca sasutas tadā
sasaṃjñā iva tatrāsan sarvam anyad vicetanam', null, 1073015),
('ramayana-1-73-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 16', 'तस्मिंस्तमसि घोरे तु भस्मच्छन्नेव सा चमूः।
ददर्श भीमसंकाशं जटामण्डलधारिणम्॥', 'tasmiṃs tamasi ghore tu bhasmacchanneva sā camūḥ
dadarśa bhīmasaṃkāśaṃ jaṭāmaṇḍaladhāriṇam', null, 1073016),
('ramayana-1-73-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 17', 'कैलासमिव दुर्धर्षं कालाग्निमिव दुःसहम्।
ज्वलन्तमिव तेजोभिर्दुर्निरीक्ष्यं पृथग्जनैः॥', 'kailāsam iva durdharṣaṃ kālāgnim iva duḥsaham
jvalantam iva tejobhir durnirīkṣyaṃ pṛthagjanaiḥ', null, 1073017),
('ramayana-1-73-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 18', 'स्कन्धे चासज्य परशुं धनुर्विद्युद्गणोपमम्।
प्रगृह्य शरमुख्यं च त्रिपुरघ्नं यथा हरम्॥', 'skandhe cāsajya paraśuṃ dhanur vidyudgaṇopamam
pragṛhya śaramukhyaṃ ca tripuraghnaṃ yathā haram', null, 1073018),
('ramayana-1-73-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 19', 'तं दृष्ट्वा भीमसंकाशं ज्वलन्तमिव पावकम्।
वसिष्ठप्रमुखा विप्रा जपहोमपरायणाः।
संगता मुनयः सर्वे संजजल्पुरथो मिथः॥', 'taṃ dṛṣṭvā bhīmasaṃkāśaṃ jvalantam iva pāvakam
vasiṣṭhapramukhā viprā japahomaparāyaṇāḥ
saṃgatā munayaḥ sarve saṃjajalpur atho mithaḥ', null, 1073019),
('ramayana-1-73-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 20', 'कच्चित्पितृवधामर्षी क्षत्रं नोत्सादयिष्यति।
पूर्वं क्षत्रवधं कृत्वा गतमन्युर्गतज्वरः।
क्षत्रस्योत्सादनं भूयो न खल्वस्य चिकीर्षितम्॥', 'kaccit pitṛvadhāmarṣī kṣatraṃ notsādayiṣyati
pūrvaṃ kṣatravadhaṃ kṛtvā gatamanyur gatajvaraḥ
kṣatrasyotsādanaṃ bhūyo na khalv asya cikīrṣitam', null, 1073020),
('ramayana-1-73-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 21', 'एवमुक्त्वार्घ्यमादाय भार्गवं भीमदर्शनम्।
ऋषयो राम रामेति मधुरां वाचमब्रुवन्॥', 'evam uktvārghyam ādāya bhārgavaṃ bhīmadarśanam
ṛṣayo rāma rāmeti madhurāṃ vācam abruvan', null, 1073021),
('ramayana-1-73-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 73, Verse 22', 'प्रतिगृह्य तु तां पूजामृषिदत्तां प्रतापवान्।
रामं दाशरथिं रामो जामदग्न्योऽभ्यभाषत॥', 'pratigṛhya tu tāṃ pūjām ṛṣidattāṃ pratāpavān
rāmaṃ dāśarathiṃ rāmo jāmadagnyo ''bhyabhāṣata', null, 1073022)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 74 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-74-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 1', 'राम दाशरथे वीर वीर्यं ते श्रूयतेऽधुतम्।
धनुषो भेदनं चैव निखिलेन मया श्रुतम्॥', 'rāma dāśarathe vīra vīryaṃ te śrūyate ''dhutam
dhanuṣo bhedanaṃ caiva nikhilena mayā śrutam', null, 1074001),
('ramayana-1-74-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 2', 'तदद्भुतमचिन्त्यं च भेदनं धनुषस्त्वया।
तच्छ्रुत्वाहमनुप्राप्तो धनुर्गृह्यापरं शुभम्॥', 'tad adbhutam acintyaṃ ca bhedanaṃ dhanuṣas tvayā
tac chrutvāham anuprāpto dhanur gṛhyāparaṃ śubham', null, 1074002),
('ramayana-1-74-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 3', 'तदिदं घोरसंकाशं जामदग्न्यं महद्धनुः।
पूरयस्व शरेणैव स्वबलं दर्शयस्व च॥', 'tad idaṃ ghorasaṃkāśaṃ jāmadagnyaṃ mahad dhanuḥ
pūrayasva śareṇaiva svabalaṃ darśayasva ca', null, 1074003),
('ramayana-1-74-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 4', 'तदहं ते बलं दृष्ट्वा धनुषोऽस्य प्रपूरणे।
द्वन्द्वयुद्धं प्रदास्यामि वीर्यश्लाघ्यमिदं तव॥', 'tad ahaṃ te balaṃ dṛṣṭvā dhanuṣo ''sya prapūraṇe
dvandvayuddhaṃ pradāsyāmi vīryaślāghyam idaṃ tava', null, 1074004),
('ramayana-1-74-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 5', 'तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा राजा दशरथस्तदा।
विषण्णवदनो दीनः प्राञ्जलिर्वाक्यमब्रवीत्॥', 'tasya tad vacanaṃ śrutvā rājā daśarathas tadā
viṣaṇṇavadano dīnaḥ prāñjalir vākyam abravīt', null, 1074005),
('ramayana-1-74-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 6', 'क्षत्ररोषात्प्रशान्तस्त्वं ब्राह्मणस्य महायशाः।
बालानां मम पुत्राणामभयं दातुमर्हसि॥', 'kṣatraroṣāt praśāntas tvaṃ brāhmaṇasya mahāyaśāḥ
bālānāṃ mama putrāṇām abhayaṃ dātum arhasi', null, 1074006),
('ramayana-1-74-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 7', 'भार्गवाणां कुले जातः स्वाध्यायव्रतशालिनाम्।
सहस्राक्षे प्रतिज्ञाय शस्त्रं निक्षिप्तवानसि॥', 'bhārgavāṇāṃ kule jātaḥ svādhyāyavrataśālinām
sahasrākṣe pratijñāya śastraṃ nikṣiptavān asi', null, 1074007),
('ramayana-1-74-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 8', 'स त्वं धर्मपरो भूत्वा काश्यपाय वसुंधराम्।
दत्त्वा वनमुपागम्य महेन्द्रकृतकेतनः॥', 'sa tvaṃ dharmaparo bhūtvā kāśyapāya vasuṃdharām
dattvā vanam upāgamya mahendrakṛtaketanaḥ', null, 1074008),
('ramayana-1-74-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 9', 'मम सर्वविनाशाय संप्राप्तस्त्वं महामुने।
न चैकस्मिन्हते रामे सर्वे जीवामहे वयम्॥', 'mama sarvavināśāya saṃprāptas tvaṃ mahāmune
na caikasmin hate rāme sarve jīvāmahe vayam', null, 1074009),
('ramayana-1-74-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 10', 'ब्रुवत्येवं दशरथे जामदग्न्यः प्रतापवान्।
अनादृत्यैव तद्वाक्यं राममेवाभ्यभाषत॥', 'bruvaty evaṃ daśarathe jāmadagnyaḥ pratāpavān
anādṛtyaiva tad vākyaṃ rāmam evābhyabhāṣata', null, 1074010),
('ramayana-1-74-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 11', 'इमे द्वे धनुषी श्रेष्ठे दिव्ये लोकाभिविश्रुते।
दृढे बलवती मुख्ये सुकृते विश्वकर्मणा॥', 'ime dve dhanuṣī śreṣṭhe divye lokābhiviśrute
dṛḍhe balavatī mukhye sukṛte viśvakarmaṇā', null, 1074011),
('ramayana-1-74-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 12', 'अतिसृष्टं सुरैरेकं त्र्यम्बकाय युयुत्सवे।
त्रिपुरघ्नं नरश्रेष्ठ भग्नं काकुत्स्थ यत्त्वया॥', 'atisṛṣṭaṃ surair ekaṃ tryambakāya yuyutsave
tripuraghnaṃ naraśreṣṭha bhagnaṃ kākutstha yat tvayā', null, 1074012),
('ramayana-1-74-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 13', 'इदं द्वितीयं दुर्धर्षं विष्णोर्दत्तं सुरोत्तमैः।
समानसारं काकुत्स्थ रौद्रेण धनुषा त्विदम्॥', 'idaṃ dvitīyaṃ durdharṣaṃ viṣṇor dattaṃ surottamaiḥ
samānasāraṃ kākutstha raudreṇa dhanuṣā tv idam', null, 1074013),
('ramayana-1-74-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 14', 'तदा तु देवताः सर्वाः पृच्छन्ति स्म पितामहम्।
शितिकण्ठस्य विष्णोश्च बलाबलनिरीक्षया॥', 'tadā tu devatāḥ sarvāḥ pṛcchanti sma pitāmaham
śitikaṇṭhasya viṣṇoś ca balābalanirīkṣayā', null, 1074014),
('ramayana-1-74-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 15', 'अभिप्रायं तु विज्ञाय देवतानां पितामहः।
विरोधं जनयामास तयोः सत्यवतां वरः॥', 'abhiprāyaṃ tu vijñāya devatānāṃ pitāmahaḥ
virodhaṃ janayām āsa tayoḥ satyavatāṃ varaḥ', null, 1074015),
('ramayana-1-74-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 16', 'विरोधे च महद्युद्धमभवद्रोमहर्षणम्।
शितिकण्ठस्य विष्णोश्च परस्परजयैषिणोः॥', 'virodhe ca mahad yuddham abhavad romaharṣaṇam
śitikaṇṭhasya viṣṇoś ca parasparajayaiṣiṇoḥ', null, 1074016),
('ramayana-1-74-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 17', 'तदा तज्जृम्भितं शैवं धनुर्भीमपराक्रमम्।
हुंकारेण महादेवः स्तम्भितोऽथ त्रिलोचनः॥', 'tadā taj jṛmbhitaṃ śaivaṃ dhanur bhīmaparākramam
huṃkāreṇa mahādevaḥ stambhito ''tha trilocanaḥ', null, 1074017),
('ramayana-1-74-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 18', 'देवैस्तदा समागम्य सर्षिसंघैः सचारणैः।
याचितौ प्रशमं तत्र जग्मतुस्तौ सुरोत्तमौ॥', 'devais tadā samāgamya sarṣisaṃghaiḥ sacāraṇaiḥ
yācitau praśamaṃ tatra jagmatus tau surottamau', null, 1074018),
('ramayana-1-74-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 19', 'जृम्भितं तद्धनुर्दृष्ट्वा शैवं विष्णुपराक्रमैः।
अधिकं मेनिरे विष्णुं देवाः सर्षिगणास्तदा॥', 'jṛmbhitaṃ tad dhanur dṛṣṭvā śaivaṃ viṣṇuparākramaiḥ
adhikaṃ menire viṣṇuṃ devāḥ sarṣigaṇās tadā', null, 1074019),
('ramayana-1-74-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 20', 'धनू रुद्रस्तु संक्रुद्धो विदेहेषु महायशाः।
देवरातस्य राजर्षेर्ददौ हस्ते ससायकम्॥', 'dhanū rudras tu saṃkruddho videheṣu mahāyaśāḥ
devarātasya rājarṣer dadau haste sasāyakam', null, 1074020),
('ramayana-1-74-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 21', 'इदं च विष्णवं राम धनुः परपुरंजयम्।
ऋचीके भार्गवे प्रादाद्विष्णुः स न्यासमुत्तमम्॥', 'idaṃ ca viṣṇavaṃ rāma dhanuḥ parapuraṃjayam
ṛcīke bhārgave prādād viṣṇuḥ sa nyāsam uttamam', null, 1074021),
('ramayana-1-74-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 22', 'ऋचीकस्तु महातेजाः पुत्रस्याप्रतिकर्मणः।
पितुर्मम ददौ दिव्यं जमदग्नेर्महात्मनः॥', 'ṛcīkas tu mahātejāḥ putrasyāpratikarmaṇaḥ
pitur mama dadau divyaṃ jamadagner mahātmanaḥ', null, 1074022),
('ramayana-1-74-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 23', 'न्यस्तशस्त्रे पितरि मे तपोबलसमन्विते।
अर्जुनो विदधे मृत्युं प्राकृतां बुद्धिमास्थितः॥', 'nyastaśastre pitari me tapobalasamanvite
arjuno vidadhe mṛtyuṃ prākṛtāṃ buddhim āsthitaḥ', null, 1074023),
('ramayana-1-74-24', 24, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 24', 'वधमप्रतिरूपं तु पितुः श्रुत्वा सुदारुणम्।
क्षत्रमुत्सादयं रोषाज्जातं जातमनेकशः॥', 'vadham apratirūpaṃ tu pituḥ śrutvā sudāruṇam
kṣatram utsādayaṃ roṣāj jātaṃ jātam anekaśaḥ', null, 1074024),
('ramayana-1-74-25', 25, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 25', 'पृथिवीं चाखिलां प्राप्य काश्यपाय महात्मने।
यज्ञस्यान्ते तदा राम दक्षिणां पुण्यकर्मणे॥', 'pṛthivīṃ cākhilāṃ prāpya kāśyapāya mahātmane
yajñasyānte tadā rāma dakṣiṇāṃ puṇyakarmaṇe', null, 1074025),
('ramayana-1-74-26', 26, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 26', 'दत्त्वा महेन्द्रनिलयस्तपोबलसमन्वितः।
श्रुतवान्धनुषो भेदं ततोऽहं द्रुतमागतः॥', 'dattvā mahendranilayas tapobalasamanvitaḥ
śrutavān dhanuṣo bhedaṃ tato ''haṃ drutam āgataḥ', null, 1074026),
('ramayana-1-74-27', 27, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 27', 'तदिदं वैष्णवं राम पितृपैतामहं महत्।
क्षत्रधर्मं पुरस्कृत्य गृह्णीष्व धनुरुत्तमम्॥', 'tad idaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ rāma pitṛpaitāmahaṃ mahat
kṣatradharmaṃ puraskṛtya gṛhṇīṣva dhanuruttamam', null, 1074027),
('ramayana-1-74-28', 28, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 74, Verse 28', 'योजयस्व धनुः श्रेष्ठे शरं परपुरंजयम्।
यदि शक्नोषि काकुत्स्थ द्वन्द्वं दास्यामि ते ततः॥', 'yojayasva dhanuḥ śreṣṭhe śaraṃ parapuraṃjayam
yadi śaknoṣi kākutstha dvandvaṃ dāsyāmi te tataḥ', null, 1074028)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 75 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-75-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 1', 'श्रुत्वा तज्जामदग्न्यस्य वाक्यं दाशरथिस्तदा।
गौरवाद्यन्त्रितकथः पितू राममथाब्रवीत्॥', 'śrutvā taj jāmadagnyasya vākyaṃ dāśarathis tadā
gauravād yantritakathaḥ pitū rāmam athābravīt', null, 1075001),
('ramayana-1-75-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 2', 'श्रुतवानस्मि यत्कर्म कृतवानसि भार्गव।
अनुरुन्ध्यामहे ब्रह्मन्पितुरानृण्यमास्थितः॥', 'śrutavān asmi yat karma kṛtavān asi bhārgava
anurundhyāmahe brahman pitur ānṛṇyam āsthitaḥ', null, 1075002),
('ramayana-1-75-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 3', 'वीर्यहीनमिवाशक्तं क्षत्रधर्मेण भार्गव।
अवजानामि मे तेजः पश्य मेऽद्य पराक्रमम्॥', 'vīryahīnam ivāśaktaṃ kṣatradharmeṇa bhārgava
avajānāmi me tejaḥ paśya me ''dya parākramam', null, 1075003),
('ramayana-1-75-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 4', 'इत्युक्त्वा राघवः क्रुद्धो भार्गवस्य वरायुधम्।
शरं च प्रतिसंगृह्य हस्ताल्लघुपराक्रमः॥', 'ity uktvā rāghavaḥ kruddho bhārgavasya varāyudham
śaraṃ ca pratisaṃgṛhya hastāl laghuparākramaḥ', null, 1075004),
('ramayana-1-75-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 5', 'आरोप्य स धनू रामः शरं सज्यं चकार ह।
जामदग्न्यं ततो रामं रामः क्रुद्धोऽब्रवीद्वचः॥', 'āropya sa dhanū rāmaḥ śaraṃ sajyaṃ cakāra ha
jāmadagnyaṃ tato rāmaṃ rāmaḥ kruddho ''bravīd vacaḥ', null, 1075005),
('ramayana-1-75-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 6', 'ब्राह्मणोऽसीति पूज्यो मे विश्वामित्रकृतेन च।
तस्माच्छक्तो न ते राम मोक्तुं प्राणहरं शरम्॥', 'brāhmaṇo ''sīti pūjyo me viśvāmitrakṛtena ca
tasmāc chakto na te rāma moktuṃ prāṇaharaṃ śaram', null, 1075006),
('ramayana-1-75-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 7', 'इमां वा त्वद्गतिं राम तपोबलसमार्जितान्।
लोकानप्रतिमान्वापि हनिष्यामि यदिच्छसि॥', 'imāṃ vā tvadgatiṃ rāma tapobalasamārjitān
lokān apratimān vāpi haniṣyāmi yad icchasi', null, 1075007),
('ramayana-1-75-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 8', 'न ह्ययं वैष्णवो दिव्यः शरः परपुरंजयः।
मोघः पतति वीर्येण बलदर्पविनाशनः॥', 'na hy ayaṃ vaiṣṇavo divyaḥ śaraḥ parapuraṃjayaḥ
moghaḥ patati vīryeṇa baladarpavināśanaḥ', null, 1075008),
('ramayana-1-75-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 9', 'वरायुधधरं राम द्रष्टुं सर्षिगणाः सुराः।
पितामहं पुरस्कृत्य समेतास्तत्र संघशः॥', 'varāyudhadharaṃ rāma draṣṭuṃ sarṣigaṇāḥ surāḥ
pitāmahaṃ puraskṛtya sametās tatra saṃghaśaḥ', null, 1075009),
('ramayana-1-75-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 10', 'गन्धर्वाप्सरसश्चैव सिद्धचारणकिंनराः।
यक्षराक्षसनागाश्च तद्द्रष्टुं महदद्भुतम्॥', 'gandharvāpsarasaś caiva siddhacāraṇakiṃnarāḥ
yakṣarākṣasanāgāś ca tad draṣṭuṃ mahad adbhutam', null, 1075010),
('ramayana-1-75-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 11', 'जडीकृते तदा लोके रामे वरधनुर्धरे।
निर्वीर्यो जामदग्न्योऽसौ रमो राममुदैक्षत॥', 'jaḍīkṛte tadā loke rāme varadhanurdhare
nirvīryo jāmadagnyo ''sau ramo rāmam udaikṣata', null, 1075011),
('ramayana-1-75-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 12', 'तेजोभिर्हतवीर्यत्वाज्जामदग्न्यो जडीकृतः।
रामं कमल पत्राक्षं मन्दं मन्दमुवाच ह॥', 'tejobhir hatavīryatvāj jāmadagnyo jaḍīkṛtaḥ
rāmaṃ kamala patrākṣaṃ mandaṃ mandam uvāca ha', null, 1075012),
('ramayana-1-75-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 13', 'काश्यपाय मया दत्ता यदा पूर्वं वसुंधरा।
विषये मे न वस्तव्यमिति मां काश्यपोऽब्रवीत्॥', 'kāśyapāya mayā dattā yadā pūrvaṃ vasuṃdharā
viṣaye me na vastavyam iti māṃ kāśyapo ''bravīt', null, 1075013),
('ramayana-1-75-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 14', 'सोऽहं गुरुवचः कुर्वन्पृथिव्यां न वसे निशाम्।
इति प्रतिज्ञा काकुत्स्थ कृता वै काश्यपस्य ह॥', 'so ''haṃ guruvacaḥ kurvan pṛthivyāṃ na vase niśām
iti pratijñā kākutstha kṛtā vai kāśyapasya ha', null, 1075014),
('ramayana-1-75-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 15', 'तदिमां त्वं गतिं वीर हन्तुं नार्हसि राघव।
मनोजवं गमिष्यामि महेन्द्रं पर्वतोत्तमम्॥', 'tad imāṃ tvaṃ gatiṃ vīra hantuṃ nārhasi rāghava
manojavaṃ gamiṣyāmi mahendraṃ parvatottamam', null, 1075015),
('ramayana-1-75-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 16', 'लोकास्त्वप्रतिमा राम निर्जितास्तपसा मया।
जहि ताञ्शरमुख्येन मा भूत्कालस्य पर्ययः॥', 'lokās tv apratimā rāma nirjitās tapasā mayā
jahi tāñ śaramukhyena mā bhūt kālasya paryayaḥ', null, 1075016),
('ramayana-1-75-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 17', 'अक्षय्यं मधुहन्तारं जानामि त्वां सुरेश्वरम्।
धनुषोऽस्य परामर्शात्स्वस्ति तेऽस्तु परंतप॥', 'akṣayyaṃ madhuhantāraṃ jānāmi tvāṃ sureśvaram
dhanuṣo ''sya parāmarśāt svasti te ''stu paraṃtapa', null, 1075017),
('ramayana-1-75-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 18', 'एते सुरगणाः सर्वे निरीक्षन्ते समागताः।
त्वामप्रतिमकर्माणमप्रतिद्वन्द्वमाहवे॥', 'ete suragaṇāḥ sarve nirīkṣante samāgatāḥ
tvām apratimakarmāṇam apratidvandvam āhave', null, 1075018),
('ramayana-1-75-19', 19, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 19', 'न चेयं मम काकुत्स्थ व्रीडा भवितुमर्हति।
त्वया त्रैलोक्यनाथेन यदहं विमुखीकृतः॥', 'na ceyaṃ mama kākutstha vrīḍā bhavitum arhati
tvayā trailokyanāthena yad ahaṃ vimukhīkṛtaḥ', null, 1075019),
('ramayana-1-75-20', 20, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 20', 'शरमप्रतिमं राम मोक्तुमर्हसि सुव्रत।
शरमोक्षे गमिष्यामि महेन्द्रं पर्वतोत्तमम्॥', 'śaram apratimaṃ rāma moktum arhasi suvrata
śaramokṣe gamiṣyāmi mahendraṃ parvatottamam', null, 1075020),
('ramayana-1-75-21', 21, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 21', 'तथा ब्रुवति रामे तु जामदग्न्ये प्रतापवान्।
रामो दाशरथिः श्रीमांश्चिक्षेप शरमुत्तमम्॥', 'tathā bruvati rāme tu jāmadagnye pratāpavān
rāmo dāśarathiḥ śrīmāṃś cikṣepa śaram uttamam', null, 1075021),
('ramayana-1-75-22', 22, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 22', 'ततो वितिमिराः सर्वा दिशा चोपदिशस्तथा।
सुराः सर्षिगणा रामं प्रशशंसुरुदायुधम्॥', 'tato vitimirāḥ sarvā diśā copadiśas tathā
surāḥ sarṣigaṇā rāmaṃ praśaśaṃsur udāyudham', null, 1075022),
('ramayana-1-75-23', 23, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 75, Verse 23', 'रामं दाशरथिं रामो जामदग्न्यः प्रशस्य च।
ततः प्रदक्षिणीकृत्य जगामात्मगतिं प्रभुः॥', 'rāmaṃ dāśarathiṃ rāmo jāmadagnyaḥ praśasya ca
tataḥ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya jagāmātmagatiṃ prabhuḥ', null, 1075023)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into verses (id, scripture_id, section_id, number, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key, is_featured, source_id, status)
select x.id, 'valmiki-ramayana', (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 2 and number = 76 and parent_id = (select id from sections where scripture_id = 'valmiki-ramayana' and level = 1 and number = 1 and parent_id is null)), x.n, x.reference, x.sanskrit, x.transliteration, x.speaker, x.sort_key, false, 'gretil-ramayana-ce', 'draft'
from (values
('ramayana-1-76-1', 1, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 1', 'गते रामे प्रशान्तात्मा रामो दाशरथिर्धनुः।
वरुणायाप्रमेयाय ददौ हस्ते ससायकम्॥', 'gate rāme praśāntātmā rāmo dāśarathir dhanuḥ
varuṇāyāprameyāya dadau haste sasāyakam', null, 1076001),
('ramayana-1-76-2', 2, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 2', 'अभिवाद्य ततो रामो वसिष्ठ प्रमुखानृषीन्।
पितरं विह्वलं दृष्ट्वा प्रोवाच रघुनन्दनः॥', 'abhivādya tato rāmo vasiṣṭha pramukhān ṛṣīn
pitaraṃ vihvalaṃ dṛṣṭvā provāca raghunandanaḥ', null, 1076002),
('ramayana-1-76-3', 3, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 3', 'जामदग्न्यो गतो रामः प्रयातु चतुरङ्गिणी।
अयोध्याभिमुखी सेना त्वया नाथेन पालिता॥', 'jāmadagnyo gato rāmaḥ prayātu caturaṅgiṇī
ayodhyābhimukhī senā tvayā nāthena pālitā', null, 1076003),
('ramayana-1-76-4', 4, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 4', 'रामस्य वचनं श्रुत्वा राजा दशरथः सुतम्।
बाहुभ्यां संपरिष्वज्य मूर्ध्नि चाघ्राय राघवम्॥', 'rāmasya vacanaṃ śrutvā rājā daśarathaḥ sutam
bāhubhyāṃ saṃpariṣvajya mūrdhni cāghrāya rāghavam', null, 1076004),
('ramayana-1-76-5', 5, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 5', 'गतो राम इति श्रुत्वा हृष्टः प्रमुदितो नृपः।
चोदयामास तां सेनां जगामाशु ततः पुरीम्॥', 'gato rāma iti śrutvā hṛṣṭaḥ pramudito nṛpaḥ
codayām āsa tāṃ senāṃ jagāmāśu tataḥ purīm', null, 1076005),
('ramayana-1-76-6', 6, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 6', 'पताकाध्वजिनीं रम्यां तूर्योद्घुष्टनिनादिताम्।
सिक्तराजपथां रम्यां प्रकीर्णकुसुमोत्कराम्॥', 'patākādhvajinīṃ ramyāṃ tūryodghuṣṭanināditām
siktarājapathāṃ ramyāṃ prakīrṇakusumotkarām', null, 1076006),
('ramayana-1-76-7', 7, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 7', 'राजप्रवेशसुमुखैः पौरैर्मङ्गलवादिभिः।
संपूर्णां प्राविशद्राजा जनौघैः समलंकृताम्॥', 'rājapraveśasumukhaiḥ paurair maṅgalavādibhiḥ
saṃpūrṇāṃ prāviśad rājā janaughaiḥ samalaṃkṛtām', null, 1076007),
('ramayana-1-76-8', 8, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 8', 'कौसल्या च सुमित्रा च कैकेयी च सुमध्यमा।
वधूप्रतिग्रहे युक्ता याश्चान्या राजयोषितः॥', 'kausalyā ca sumitrā ca kaikeyī ca sumadhyamā
vadhūpratigrahe yuktā yāś cānyā rājayoṣitaḥ', null, 1076008),
('ramayana-1-76-9', 9, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 9', 'ततः सीतां महाभागामूर्मिलां च यशस्विनीम्।
कुशध्वजसुते चोभे जगृहुर्नृपपत्नयः॥', 'tataḥ sītāṃ mahābhāgām ūrmilāṃ ca yaśasvinīm
kuśadhvajasute cobhe jagṛhur nṛpapatnayaḥ', null, 1076009),
('ramayana-1-76-10', 10, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 10', 'मङ्गलालापनैश्चैव शोभिताः क्षौमवाससः।
देवतायतनान्याशु सर्वास्ताः प्रत्यपूजयन्॥', 'maṅgalālāpanaiś caiva śobhitāḥ kṣaumavāsasaḥ
devatāyatanāny āśu sarvās tāḥ pratyapūjayan', null, 1076010),
('ramayana-1-76-11', 11, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 11', 'अभिवाद्याभिवाद्यांश्च सर्वा राजसुतास्तदा।
रेमिरे मुदिताः सर्वा भर्तृभिः सहिता रहः॥', 'abhivādyābhivādyāṃś ca sarvā rājasutās tadā
remire muditāḥ sarvā bhartṛbhiḥ sahitā rahaḥ', null, 1076011),
('ramayana-1-76-12', 12, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 12', 'कृतदाराः कृतास्त्राश्च सधनाः ससुहृज्जनाः।
शुश्रूषमाणाः पितरं वर्तयन्ति नरर्षभाः॥', 'kṛtadārāḥ kṛtāstrāś ca sadhanāḥ sasuhṛjjanāḥ
śuśrūṣamāṇāḥ pitaraṃ vartayanti nararṣabhāḥ', null, 1076012),
('ramayana-1-76-13', 13, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 13', 'तेषामतियशा लोके रामः सत्यपराक्रमः।
स्वयम्भूरिव भूतानां बभूव गुणवत्तरः॥', 'teṣām atiyaśā loke rāmaḥ satyaparākramaḥ
svayambhūr iva bhūtānāṃ babhūva guṇavattaraḥ', null, 1076013),
('ramayana-1-76-14', 14, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 14', 'रामस्तु सीतया सार्धं विजहार बहूनृतून्।
मनस्वी तद्गतस्तस्या नित्यं हृदि समर्पितः॥', 'rāmas tu sītayā sārdhaṃ vijahāra bahūn ṛtūn
manasvī tadgatas tasyā nityaṃ hṛdi samarpitaḥ', null, 1076014),
('ramayana-1-76-15', 15, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 15', 'प्रिया तु सीता रामस्य दाराः पितृकृता इति।
गुणाद्रूपगुणाच्चापि प्रीतिर्भूयो व्यवर्धत॥', 'priyā tu sītā rāmasya dārāḥ pitṛkṛtā iti
guṇād rūpaguṇāc cāpi prītir bhūyo vyavardhata', null, 1076015),
('ramayana-1-76-16', 16, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 16', 'तस्याश्च भर्ता द्विगुणं हृदये परिवर्तते।
अन्तर्जातमपि व्यक्तमाख्याति हृदयं हृदा॥', 'tasyāś ca bhartā dviguṇaṃ hṛdaye parivartate
antarjātam api vyaktam ākhyāti hṛdayaṃ hṛdā', null, 1076016),
('ramayana-1-76-17', 17, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 17', 'तस्य भूयो विशेषेण मैथिली जनकात्मजा।
देवताभिः समा रूपे सीता श्रीरिव रूपिणी॥', 'tasya bhūyo viśeṣeṇa maithilī janakātmajā
devatābhiḥ samā rūpe sītā śrīr iva rūpiṇī', null, 1076017),
('ramayana-1-76-18', 18, 'Bala Kanda, Sarga 76, Verse 18', 'तया स राजर्षिसुतोऽभिरामया समेयिवानुत्तमराजकन्यया।
अतीव रामः शुशुभेऽतिकामया विभुः श्रिया विष्णुरिवामरेश्वरः॥', 'tayā sa rājarṣisuto ''bhirāmayā sameyivān uttamarājakanyayā
atīva rāmaḥ śuśubhe ''tikāmayā vibhuḥ śriyā viṣṇur ivāmareśvaraḥ', null, 1076018)
) as x(id, n, reference, sanskrit, transliteration, speaker, sort_key);
insert into translations (verse_id, language, text, source_id, is_primary) values
('ramayana-1-1-1', 'en', 'Valmiki, the ascetic, asked Narada, the best of sages, who was devoted to austerity and study and the finest of those skilled in speech:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-2', 'en', '''Who in this world today is virtuous and brave, who knows dharma, is grateful, truthful and firm in his vows?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-3', 'en', '''Who has good character and cares for the welfare of all beings? Who is learned, capable, and a joy to look upon?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-4', 'en', '''Who is self-controlled, has conquered anger, is radiant and free of envy? Whom do even the gods fear when his anger is roused in battle?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-5', 'en', '''I want to hear this, for I am very curious. Great sage, you are able to know such a man.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-6', 'en', 'Narada, who knew the three worlds, heard Valmiki''s words and, delighted, said: ''Listen.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-7', 'en', '''The many qualities you have named are rare indeed. Sage, having thought it over, I will tell you of a man who has them. Listen.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-8', 'en', '''Born in the line of Ikshvaku, he is known to people as Rama. He is self-controlled, mighty, radiant, steadfast and master of himself.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-9', 'en', '''He is wise, knows statecraft, is eloquent, glorious and a destroyer of enemies. He has broad shoulders, strong arms, a neck lined like a conch and a strong jaw.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-10', 'en', '''He has a broad chest and a great bow, a well-set collarbone, and subdues his foes. His arms reach his knees; his head and forehead are fine and his stride is noble.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-11', 'en', '''He is well proportioned, with balanced limbs and a glowing complexion, full of power, with a deep chest, large eyes, grace and auspicious marks.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-12', 'en', '''He knows dharma, is true to his word and devoted to the good of his people. He is famous, full of knowledge, pure, disciplined and focused.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-13', 'en', '''He protects all living beings and guards dharma. He knows the truth of the Vedas and their branches, and is skilled in archery.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-14', 'en', '''He knows the meaning of all the sciences, has a good memory and quick wit. He is loved by all, good, never downcast, and discerning.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-15', 'en', '''The good always come to him as rivers flow to the sea. He is noble, treats all equally, and is always a joy to see.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-16', 'en', '''Endowed with every virtue, he increases the joy of Kausalya. He is like the ocean in depth and like the Himalaya in steadiness.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-17', 'en', '''He equals Vishnu in valour and is as lovely to see as the moon. In anger he is like the fire at the end of time; in patience he is like the earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-18', 'en', '''In giving he equals Kubera, the lord of wealth; in truth he is like a second Dharma. Rama, possessed of such virtues and of true valour,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-19', 'en', '''his eldest and beloved son, endowed with the best qualities, King Dasharatha lovingly wished to install as crown prince.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-20', 'en', '''Seeing the preparations for the coronation, his wife Queen Kaikeyi, who had been granted boons long before, asked for them now: the exile of Rama and the crowning of Bharata.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-21', 'en', '''Bound by his word and by the noose of dharma, King Dasharatha sent his beloved son Rama into exile.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-22', 'en', '''The hero went to the forest to keep the promise, at his father''s command and to please Kaikeyi.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-23', 'en', '''His loving brother Lakshmana, full of humility and the joy of Sumitra, followed him out of affection.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-24', 'en', '''Sita too, his wife, the best of women, with every good mark, followed Rama as Rohini follows the moon.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-25', 'en', '''Followed far by the townspeople and his father Dasharatha, at Shringaverapura on the bank of the Ganga he sent back his charioteer.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-26', 'en', '''Going from forest to forest and crossing deep rivers, they reached Chitrakuta on Bharadvaja''s advice.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-27', 'en', '''Building a pleasant dwelling, the three lived there happily in the forest, like gods and gandharvas.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-28', 'en', '''When Rama had gone to Chitrakuta, King Dasharatha, stricken with grief for his son, died lamenting him and went to heaven.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-29', 'en', '''When he died, Bharata, urged by Vasishtha and other priests to rule, did not want the kingdom. The mighty hero went to the forest to seek Rama''s favour.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-30', 'en', '''Rama gave him his sandals as a pledge for the kingdom, and again and again urged Bharata to return.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-31', 'en', '''Not getting his wish, Bharata touched Rama''s feet and ruled from Nandigrama, longing for Rama''s return.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-32', 'en', '''Rama, seeing that the people of the city might come there again, single-mindedly entered the Dandaka forest.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-33', 'en', '''Having killed the demon Viradha, he met Sharabhanga, Sutikshna, Agastya and Agastya''s brother.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-34', 'en', '''At Agastya''s word, and greatly pleased, he took Indra''s bow, a sword, and two quivers whose arrows never run out.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-35', 'en', '''While Rama lived in the forest with its dwellers, all the sages came to him asking him to destroy the demons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-36', 'en', '''While he lived there, the shape-shifting demoness Shurpanakha of Janasthana was disfigured.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-37', 'en', '''Then, at Shurpanakha''s urging, all the demons rose up: Khara, Trishiras and the demon Dushana,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-38', 'en', '''and Rama killed them in battle with their followers: fourteen thousand demons were slain.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-39', 'en', '''Hearing of the slaughter of his kin, Ravana, faint with rage, chose the demon Maricha as his helper.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-40', 'en', '''Maricha warned Ravana again and again: "Ravana, it is not wise for you to make an enemy of one so strong."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-41', 'en', '''But Ravana, driven by fate, ignored this advice and went with Maricha to Rama''s hermitage.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-42', 'en', '''With that magician luring the two princes far away, Ravana carried off Rama''s wife, killing the vulture Jatayu.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-43', 'en', '''Seeing the vulture slain and hearing that Sita had been taken, Rama, burning with grief, wept with his senses in turmoil.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-44', 'en', '''In that grief he cremated the vulture Jatayu. Searching the forest for Sita, he saw a demon', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-45', 'en', '''named Kabandha, misshapen and terrible to see. The mighty-armed one killed and burned him, and Kabandha went to heaven.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-46', 'en', '''Kabandha told him: "Rama, go to Shabari, the ascetic woman devoted to dharma." So the radiant destroyer of foes went to Shabari.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-47', 'en', '''Honoured fittingly by Shabari, Rama, son of Dasharatha, met the monkey Hanuman on the bank of Pampa.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-48', 'en', '''At Hanuman''s word he met Sugriva, and the mighty Rama told Sugriva everything.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-49', 'en', '''Then the monkey king, sad and trusting, told Rama all about his feud, and spoke of Vali''s strength.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-50', 'en', '''Rama promised to kill Vali. But Sugriva still doubted Rama''s strength.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-51', 'en', '''To give him confidence, Rama kicked the huge body of Dundubhi with his big toe a full ten leagues.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-52', 'en', '''Then with one great arrow he pierced seven sal trees, a mountain, and the underworld, winning his trust.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-53', 'en', '''Pleased and reassured, the great monkey went with Rama to the cave of Kishkindha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-54', 'en', '''There golden-tawny Sugriva roared, and at that great roar the lord of monkeys, Vali, came out.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-55', 'en', '''Then at Sugriva''s request Rama killed Vali in combat and placed Sugriva on the throne.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-56', 'en', '''That bull among monkeys gathered all the monkeys and sent them in every direction to find Sita, daughter of Janaka.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-57', 'en', '''Then, at the word of the vulture Sampati, mighty Hanuman leapt across the salt ocean a hundred leagues wide.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-58', 'en', '''Reaching Lanka, the city ruled by Ravana, he saw Sita in the Ashoka grove, lost in thought.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-59', 'en', '''He gave her the token of recognition and the news, comforted Sita, and then smashed the gateway.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-60', 'en', '''He killed five army commanders and seven ministers'' sons, crushed the hero Aksha, and then let himself be captured.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-61', 'en', '''Knowing that by Brahma''s boon he would be freed from the weapon, the hero bore with the demons who bound him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-62', 'en', '''Then, having burned the city of Lanka except for Sita, the great monkey returned to tell Rama the good news.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-63', 'en', '''Coming to the great-souled Rama and circling him in respect, he told him exactly: "I have seen Sita."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-64', 'en', '''Then with Sugriva he went to the shore of the great ocean and stirred the sea with arrows bright as the sun.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-65', 'en', '''The Ocean, lord of rivers, revealed himself, and at the Ocean''s word Rama had Nala build a bridge.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-66', 'en', '''Crossing by it to Lanka and killing Ravana in battle, he crowned Vibhishana king of the demons in Lanka.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-67', 'en', '''By that great deed the three worlds with all that moves and does not move, with the gods and sages, were pleased with the great-souled Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-68', 'en', '''Honoured by all the delighted gods, Rama, his task done, rejoiced, free from care.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-69', 'en', '''Receiving boons from the gods and bringing the fallen monkeys back to life, he mounted the Pushpaka chariot and went to Nandigrama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-70', 'en', '''At Nandigrama the sinless Rama put off his matted hair and, united with his brothers and with Sita, regained his kingdom.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-71', 'en', '''The people are joyful, content, well-fed and righteous, free from illness and disease, and without fear of famine.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-72', 'en', '''No one will ever see a son die. Women will never be widowed and will be devoted to their husbands.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-73', 'en', '''There is no fear from wind, no creatures drown, no fear from fire, just as in the golden age.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-74', 'en', '''Having performed a hundred horse sacrifices with much gold, and given millions of cows to the learned as the rules prescribe,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-75', 'en', '''Rama will establish royal lines a hundredfold and keep the four classes each in their own duty in this world.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-76', 'en', '''Having ruled for eleven thousand years, Rama will go to the world of Brahma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-77', 'en', '''This story of Rama is purifying, destroys sin, is holy and equal to the Vedas. Whoever reads it is freed from all sins.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-78', 'en', '''A person who reads this life-giving tale, the Ramayana, is honoured in heaven after death with sons, grandsons and followers.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-1-79', 'en', '''A priest who reads it gains mastery of speech; a warrior gains lordship of the land; a merchant gains profit from trade; and even a labourer gains greatness.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-1', 'en', 'Hearing Narada''s words, the great sage Valmiki, skilled in speech and devoted to dharma, honoured him together with his disciples.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-2', 'en', 'Duly honoured, the divine sage Narada took his leave and, given permission, went off through the sky.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-3', 'en', 'Shortly after Narada had gone to the world of the gods, the sage went to the bank of the Tamasa, not far from the Ganga.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-4', 'en', 'Reaching the bank of the Tamasa and seeing a bathing place free of mud, the great sage spoke to the disciple standing beside him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-5', 'en', '''Look, Bharadvaja, at this bathing place free of mud. It is lovely, with clear water like the mind of a good person.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-6', 'en', '''Set down the water pot, my son, and give me my bark garment. I will bathe here in this fine stretch of the Tamasa.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-7', 'en', 'Told this by the great Valmiki, Bharadvaja, attentive to his teacher, handed him the bark garment.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-8', 'en', 'Taking the garment from his disciple''s hand, the self-controlled sage wandered about, gazing at the wide forest on all sides.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-9', 'en', 'Nearby the holy man saw a pair of krauncha birds, never apart, wandering together and singing sweetly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-10', 'en', 'Before his eyes a hunter, full of malice and set on evil, killed the male of the pair.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-11', 'en', 'Seeing him lying on the ground, his body covered in blood and writhing, his mate cried out piteously.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-12', 'en', 'Seeing the bird struck down by the hunter, the righteous sage was filled with compassion.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-13', 'en', 'Feeling that pity and thinking ''this is wrong'', the sage, hearing the female krauncha weeping, spoke these words:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-14', 'en', '''Hunter, may you never find rest for endless years, since you killed one of this pair of kraunchas, lost in love.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-15', 'en', 'As he spoke, a thought arose in his heart as he looked on: ''Overcome by grief for this bird, what is this I have uttered?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-16', 'en', 'Reflecting, the wise and thoughtful sage made up his mind and said this to his disciple:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-17', 'en', '''Bound in metrical feet, with equal syllables, fit to be sung to the lute, this came from me in grief (śoka); let it be called a śloka and nothing else.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-18', 'en', 'The disciple joyfully took in the sage''s excellent words, and his teacher was pleased with him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-19', 'en', 'The sage then bathed properly at that bathing place and returned, still thinking over the matter.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-20', 'en', 'Then his humble and learned disciple Bharadvaja took the full water pot and followed behind his teacher.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-21', 'en', 'Entering the hermitage with his disciple, the knower of dharma sat down, spoke of other things, and then turned to meditation.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-22', 'en', 'Then Brahma himself, the four-faced creator of the worlds, the mighty lord, came to see the great sage.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-23', 'en', 'Seeing him, Valmiki rose at once, silent, and stood with folded hands, composed and full of wonder.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-24', 'en', 'He honoured the god with water for the feet, a guest offering, a seat and salutations, bowed to him duly and asked after his eternal well-being.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-25', 'en', 'The lord sat on the honoured seat and then gestured to the great sage Valmiki to take a seat.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-26', 'en', 'With the grandfather of the worlds sitting before him, Valmiki, his mind still on that event, fell into thought.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-27', 'en', '''What a cruel thing that evil-minded man did, full of hatred, killing such a sweet-voiced krauncha for no reason!''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-28', 'en', 'Grieving again and again for the female krauncha, he sang that verse once more, lost in sorrow.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-29', 'en', 'Brahma smiled and said to the great sage: ''It is a śloka that you have composed. Do not doubt it.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-30', 'en', '''This flow of speech came to you by my will, Brahmin. Best of sages, compose the whole story of Rama.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-31', 'en', '''Tell the life of the righteous, virtuous, wise and steadfast Rama, as you heard it from Narada.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-32', 'en', '''Whatever happened to wise Rama with Lakshmana and with the demons, hidden or known,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-33', 'en', '''and whatever happened to Sita, openly or in secret, all that is unknown will become known to you.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-34', 'en', '''No word of yours in this poem will be untrue. Compose the holy, delightful story of Rama in ślokas.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-35', 'en', '''As long as mountains stand and rivers flow on the earth, so long will the story of the Ramayana be told in the world.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-36', 'en', '''And as long as your story of Rama is told, you will live in my worlds, above and below.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-37', 'en', 'Having said this, Lord Brahma vanished on the spot, and Valmiki and his disciples were filled with wonder.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-38', 'en', 'Then all his disciples sang that verse again and again, delighted, and said in great amazement:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-39', 'en', '''The grief sung by the great sage in four feet of equal syllables has become a śloka by being repeated.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-40', 'en', 'Then this resolve arose in Valmiki, whose mind was purified: ''I will compose the whole Ramayana in such verses.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-2-41', 'en', 'The famous and noble-minded sage then made a poem bringing glory to glorious Rama, in hundreds of ślokas of equal syllables, with noble sounds, meanings and words.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-1', 'en', 'Having heard the whole story, full of dharma, the righteous sage sought once more to see clearly all that had happened to wise Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-2', 'en', 'Sipping water, the sage sat composed with folded hands on darbha grass pointing east, and through his inner discipline sought the course of events.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-3', 'en', 'Rama''s birth, his great valour, his kindness to all, how the people loved him, his patience, gentleness and truthfulness;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-4', 'en', 'many other wonderful tales on the journey with Vishvamitra, the marriage of Janaki and the breaking of the bow;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-5', 'en', 'the dispute between Rama and Rama (Parashurama), the virtues of Dasharatha''s son, Rama''s planned coronation and Kaikeyi''s wickedness;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-6', 'en', 'the halting of the coronation and Rama''s exile, the king''s grief and lament, and his passing to the next world;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-7', 'en', 'the sorrow of the people and their being sent back, the talk with the lord of the Nishadas, and the charioteer''s return;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-8', 'en', 'the crossing of the Ganga, the meeting with Bharadvaja, and, with Bharadvaja''s leave, the sight of Chitrakuta;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-9', 'en', 'the building of a dwelling, Bharata''s arrival, his pleading with Rama, and the water rites for their father;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-10', 'en', 'the consecration of the sandals, the stay at Nandigrama, the journey to the Dandaka forest and the meeting with Sutikshna;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-11', 'en', 'the meeting with Anasuya and her gift of ointment, the talk with Shurpanakha and her disfigurement;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-12', 'en', 'the slaying of Khara and Trishiras, Ravana''s rising up, the killing of Maricha and the abduction of Vaidehi;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-13', 'en', 'Raghava''s lament, the death of the king of vultures, the sight of Kabandha and of lake Pampa;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-14', 'en', 'the meeting with Shabari and with Hanuman, and the lament of great Raghava at Pampa;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-15', 'en', 'the journey to Rishyamuka, the meeting with Sugriva, the winning of trust, the friendship, and the fight between Vali and Sugriva;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-16', 'en', 'the crushing of Vali, the crowning of Sugriva, Tara''s lament and the stay through the rainy season;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-17', 'en', 'the anger of the lion of the Raghus, the gathering of the forces, the sending out in all directions and the description of the earth;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-18', 'en', 'the gift of the ring, the sight of the bear''s cave, the fast unto death, and the meeting with Sampati;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-19', 'en', 'climbing the mountain, the leap across the ocean, entering Lanka by night, and Hanuman searching alone;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-20', 'en', 'going to the drinking hall, seeing the women''s quarters, going to the Ashoka grove and seeing Sita;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-21', 'en', 'the giving of the token, Sita''s words, the threats of the demonesses and Trijata''s dream;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-22', 'en', 'Sita''s gift of a jewel, the breaking of the trees, the flight of the demonesses and the slaying of the servants;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-23', 'en', 'the capture of the son of the Wind, the burning of Lanka with roars, the leap back, and the taking of the honey;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-24', 'en', 'the comforting of Raghava, the handing over of the jewel, the meeting with the Ocean and the building of Nala''s bridge;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-25', 'en', 'the crossing of the ocean, the siege of Lanka by night, the alliance with Vibhishana and his telling of the way to kill Ravana;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-26', 'en', 'the death of Kumbhakarna, the slaying of Meghanada, the destruction of Ravana, and the recovery of Sita in the enemy''s city;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-27', 'en', 'Vibhishana''s coronation, the sight of the Pushpaka chariot, the journey to Ayodhya and the meeting with Bharata;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-28', 'en', 'Rama''s coronation and rise, the dismissal of the whole army, the pleasing of his kingdom, and the sending away of Vaidehi.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-3-29', 'en', 'Whatever was still to happen to Rama on earth, the holy sage Valmiki put into the last part of the poem.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-1', 'en', 'After Rama had regained his kingdom, the holy sage Valmiki, master of himself, composed his whole story in wonderful words.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-2', 'en', 'Having composed it, including what was to come and the final part, the wise lord thought: ''Who will perform this?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-3', 'en', 'As the great sage pondered this, Kusha and Lava, dressed as young sages, came and touched his feet.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-4', 'en', 'He saw the two brothers, Kusha and Lava, who lived in the hermitage: princes who knew dharma, glorious, and gifted with fine voices.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-5', 'en', 'Seeing that they were intelligent and well grounded in the Vedas, the lord taught them the poem to enrich the Vedas.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-6', 'en', 'The sage, true to his vow, made the whole poem, the Ramayana, the great story of Sita, also called the slaying of Paulastya.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-7', 'en', 'Sweet to recite and to sing, set in three tempos, bound to the seven notes, and fit to be sung to the lute,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-8', 'en', 'the poem was full of the moods of humour, love, compassion, fury, heroism, fear and disgust, and the brothers sang it.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-9', 'en', 'The two brothers knew the science of music and the scales and pitches, had fine voices, and looked like gandharvas in human form.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-10', 'en', 'Handsome and well formed, speaking with sweet voices, they were like two images drawn from Rama''s own body.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-11', 'en', 'The two blameless princes learned the whole of that excellent, righteous tale by heart.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-12', 'en', 'At gatherings of sages, Brahmins and good people, the two knowers of truth sang it with focus, as they had been taught: great-souled, fortunate, bearing every good mark.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-13', 'en', 'Once, standing near an assembly of sages with purified minds, they sang this poem.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-14', 'en', 'Hearing it, all the sages, eyes filled with tears and amazed, said: ''Excellent! Excellent!''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-15', 'en', 'All the sages, delighted and loving dharma, praised the singers Kusha and Lava, who deserved praise.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-16', 'en', '''How sweet the song, and especially the verses! Though this happened long ago, it is shown as if before our eyes.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-17', 'en', 'Entering into the feeling, the two sang together beautifully, sweetly and movingly, with rich voices.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-18', 'en', 'Praised thus by the great sages, worthy for their austerities, they sang ever more movingly and sweetly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-19', 'en', 'One delighted sage gave them a water pot; another famous one, pleased, gave them a bark garment.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-20', 'en', '''This wonderful tale told by the sage is a great foundation for poets, and it is complete in its proper order.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-21', 'en', 'Once, as the two singers were being praised everywhere, Bharata''s elder brother, Rama, saw them in the streets and royal roads.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-22', 'en', 'Rama, destroyer of foes, brought the brothers Kusha and Lava to his palace and honoured them as they deserved.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-23', 'en', 'The lord sat on a divine golden throne, with his ministers and brothers seated near him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-24', 'en', 'Seeing the two handsome youths with their lutes, Rama spoke to Lakshmana, Shatrughna and Bharata:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-25', 'en', '''Listen to this tale sung sweetly and well by these two, who shine like gods, full of wonderful meaning and words.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-26', 'en', '''These two, Kusha and Lava, are sages bearing the marks of kings, and great ascetics. They say this story brings me good fortune too. Hear this great story.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-4-27', 'en', 'Urged by Rama''s words, the two sang in the classical style, and Rama, sitting in the assembly, slowly became absorbed, wishing to hear.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-1', 'en', 'This whole earth once belonged to victorious kings, beginning with Prajapati,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-2', 'en', 'among whom was Sagara, who had the ocean dug, and who was surrounded by sixty thousand sons when he set out.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-3', 'en', 'In the line of these great Ikshvaku kings arose this great tale known as the Ramayana.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-4', 'en', 'I will tell it all from the beginning. It contains dharma, pleasure and wealth, and should be heard without envy.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-5', 'en', 'There was a large, happy and prosperous country named Kosala, on the bank of the Sarayu, rich in wealth and grain.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-6', 'en', 'In it was the city called Ayodhya, famous in the world, built by Manu himself, lord of men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-7', 'en', 'That great and splendid city was twelve leagues long and three wide, with well-laid-out main roads.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-8', 'en', 'It was adorned by a great, well-planned royal highway, always strewn with flowers and sprinkled with water.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-9', 'en', 'King Dasharatha, who enlarged the great kingdom, lived in that city as Indra, lord of the gods, lives in heaven.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-10', 'en', 'It had doors and arched gateways, well-arranged markets, every kind of machine and weapon, and craftsmen of every kind.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-11', 'en', 'It was crowded with bards and heralds, splendid and incomparably bright, with high towers and flags, and full of hundreds of shataghni weapons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-12', 'en', 'The city was full of troupes of actresses everywhere, with gardens and mango groves, great and girded by a wall.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-13', 'en', 'It had a deep, hard-to-cross moat, was impregnable to enemies, and was full of horses, elephants, cows, camels and donkeys.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-14', 'en', 'It was surrounded by groups of vassal kings bringing tribute, and graced by merchants from many lands.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-15', 'en', 'It was adorned with palaces made of jewels, like mountains, and full of upper chambers, like Amaravati, Indra''s city.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-16', 'en', 'Colourful, laid out like a chessboard, with many beautiful women, strewn with every kind of jewel and adorned with mansions,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-17', 'en', 'densely built without gaps on level ground, full of fine rice and with water as sweet as sugar-cane juice.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-18', 'en', 'It resounded loudly with drums, tabors, lutes and kettledrums; it was the finest city on earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-19', 'en', 'Like a heavenly palace of the perfected ones, won by austerity, with well-built houses and full of the best of men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-20', 'en', 'Its archers were skilled, quick-handed men who would not shoot at one who was alone or had no kin, but could hit by sound alone.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-21', 'en', 'They could kill lions, tigers and boars roaring wildly in the forest with sharp weapons or even with their bare arms.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-22', 'en', 'King Dasharatha settled that city, full of thousands of such great chariot-warriors.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-5-23', 'en', 'It was filled with the best of Brahmins who kept the sacred fires, had virtues, had mastered the Vedas and their six branches, gave away thousands, loved truth, and were great souls like great sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-1', 'en', 'In that city of Ayodhya lived the king, who knew the Vedas and gathered all to him, far-sighted, mighty and loved by city and country folk.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-2', 'en', 'He was a great chariot-warrior of the Ikshvakus, a performer of sacrifices, devoted to dharma, self-controlled, a royal sage like a great sage, famed in the three worlds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-3', 'en', 'Strong, with enemies slain and many friends, master of his senses, he equalled Indra and Kubera in wealth and stores.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-4', 'en', 'As mighty Manu protected the world, so King Dasharatha protected the world while he lived.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-5', 'en', 'Ruled by that king, true to his word and following the three aims of life, the city was protected as Amaravati is by Indra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-6', 'en', 'In that fine city the people were happy, righteous and learned, content with their own wealth, free of greed and truthful.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-7', 'en', 'In that best of cities no householder had only small savings, or lacked what he needed, or was without cows, horses, wealth and grain.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-8', 'en', 'Nowhere in Ayodhya could one see a lustful, miserly or cruel man, nor an ignorant one, nor an unbeliever.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-9', 'en', 'All the men and women were righteous and self-restrained, joyful in their character and conduct, and as pure as great sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-10', 'en', 'There was no one without earrings, crown or garland, with few comforts, unwashed, unperfumed or without fragrance.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-11', 'en', 'No one ate poor food or failed to give; no one was seen without armlets, neck ornaments or bracelets, or lacking self-control.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-12', 'en', 'In Ayodhya there was no Brahmin who did not keep the sacred fire or sacrifice or give generously, and none who mixed duties wrongly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-13', 'en', 'The Brahmins were always devoted to their own work and self-controlled, given to giving and study, and restrained in accepting gifts.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-14', 'en', 'There was then no unbeliever, no liar, no one without learning, no envious, incapable or ignorant person.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-15', 'en', 'In Ayodhya no man or woman was miserable, distracted or distressed, without good fortune or beauty, or lacking loyalty to the king.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-16', 'en', 'Among the four classes, all honoured the gods and guests, lived long, and held to dharma and truth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-17', 'en', 'The warriors followed the priests, the merchants followed the warriors, and the labourers, devoted to their own duty, served the other three classes.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-18', 'en', 'That city was well protected by the lord of the Ikshvakus, as it had been before by wise Manu, lord of men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-19', 'en', 'It was full of warriors like fire, refined yet fierce, fully trained, like lions in their caves,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-20', 'en', 'with the best horses born in Kamboja and Bahlika, from the forests and the rivers, like Indra''s horses,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-21', 'en', 'and full of rutting, mighty elephants like mountains, born in the Vindhya and the Himalaya,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-22', 'en', 'elephants of the lines of Anjana and Vamana, of the Bhadra, Mandra and Mriga breeds and their crosses.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-23', 'en', 'Always full of such ever-rutting elephants like mountains, the city shone for two more leagues, true to its name.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-6-24', 'en', 'That king, equal to Indra, ruled the city of Ayodhya, true to its name, with strong gates and bars, adorned with fine houses, auspicious and crowded with thousands of people.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-1', 'en', 'The hero had eight famous ministers, pure, loyal and always devoted to the king''s affairs:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-2', 'en', 'Dhrishti, Jayanta, Vijaya, Siddhartha, Arthasadhaka, Ashoka, Mantrapala, and the eighth, Sumantra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-3', 'en', 'He had two chosen priests, the best of sages, Vasishtha and Vamadeva, and other counsellors too.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-4', 'en', 'They were prosperous, great-souled, learned in the sciences, of firm courage, famous, attentive and did as they were told.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-5', 'en', 'They had energy, patience and fame, spoke with a smile, and would never speak a lie from anger, desire or gain.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-6', 'en', 'Nothing was unknown to them, among their own people or others, whether being done, done, or even planned, thanks to their spies.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-7', 'en', 'They were skilled in affairs, proven in friendship, and would punish when the time came, even their own sons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-8', 'en', 'They were careful in filling the treasury and maintaining the army, and would not harm even an enemy who had done no wrong.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-9', 'en', 'Brave and energetic, they followed the science of kingship and always protected the honest people of the land.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-10', 'en', 'They filled the treasury without oppressing priests or warriors, and punished firmly after weighing a person''s strength and weakness.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-11', 'en', 'Since they were all pure, of one mind and wise, there was no liar anywhere in the city or the country.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-12', 'en', 'There was no wicked man there who desired another''s wife; the whole kingdom and the city were at peace.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-13', 'en', 'Well dressed and well groomed, all of good character, they kept watch with the eye of policy for the king''s welfare.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-14', 'en', 'They had absorbed the virtues of their teacher, were famed for courage, and known even in foreign lands for sound judgement.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-15', 'en', 'With such virtuous ministers, the sinless King Dasharatha ruled the earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-16', 'en', 'Watching over his people through his envoys and pleasing them with righteous rule, he found no enemy greater than or equal to himself.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-7-17', 'en', 'Surrounded by those devoted, skilful and able counsellors, the king shone like the rising sun with its bright rays.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-1', 'en', 'But that powerful, righteous and great king, though he longed for a son, had no son to carry on his line.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-2', 'en', 'As he thought about it, the great king had an idea: ''Why should I not perform a horse sacrifice for a son?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-3', 'en', 'The wise and righteous king made a firm decision to sacrifice, together with all his self-possessed ministers.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-4', 'en', 'Then the king said to Sumantra, best of ministers: ''Quickly bring me all the teachers, with the royal priests.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-5', 'en', 'Hearing this, the charioteer said privately to the king: ''I have heard an ancient story told by the priests.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-6', 'en', '''Long ago, king, the holy Sanatkumara told a story, in the presence of sages, about the coming of your sons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-7', 'en', '''Kashyapa has a son famous as Vibhandaka. His son will be the well-known Rishyashringa.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-8', 'en', '''Growing up always in the forest, a sage forever roaming the woods, that best of Brahmins will know no one else, always following his father.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-9', 'en', '''That great soul''s celibacy will be of two kinds, famous in the world, and always spoken of by Brahmins.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-10', 'en', '''As he lives like this, tending the fire and his famous father, time will pass.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-11', 'en', '''At that very time, mighty Lomapada will be the famous and powerful king of the Angas.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-12', 'en', '''Because of that king''s transgression, a terrible drought will come, bringing fear to all beings.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-13', 'en', '''During the drought, the grieving king will gather Brahmins old in learning and say:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-14', 'en', '''"You know the sacred law and the ways of the world. Tell me a rule by which there may be atonement."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-15', 'en', '''The Brahmins, masters of the Vedas, will tell the king: "King, bring the son of Vibhandaka here by every means.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-16', 'en', '''"Having brought Rishyashringa and honoured him well, give him your daughter Shanta in marriage with due rites."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-17', 'en', '''Hearing them, the king will worry: "By what means can that powerful sage be brought here?"', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-18', 'en', '''Then, deciding with his ministers, the self-possessed king will send his priest and ministers, with honour.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-19', 'en', '''But hearing the king''s words, they will be distressed and hang their heads: "We dare not go; we fear the sage." They will plead with the king.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-20', 'en', '''After thinking, they will propose suitable means: "We will bring the Brahmin, and there will be no fault."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-21', 'en', '''So by the lord of Anga, with courtesans, the sage''s son was brought; the god rained, and Shanta was given to him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-22', 'en', '''Rishyashringa, your son-in-law, will bring about your sons.'' This is what Sanatkumara said, which I have told you.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-8-23', 'en', 'Delighted, Dasharatha said to Sumantra: ''Tell me in detail how Rishyashringa was brought.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-1', 'en', 'Urged by the king, Sumantra said: ''Hear with your ministers how Rishyashringa was brought.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-2', 'en', '''The priest and ministers said to Lomapada: "We have thought of a safe plan.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-3', 'en', '''"Rishyashringa lives in the forest, devoted to austerity and study. He knows nothing of women, of the pleasures of the senses or of comfort.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-4', 'en', '''"We will bring him to the city with pleasing things that delight the senses and stir men''s hearts. Let it be decided quickly."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-5', 'en', '''"Let beautiful, well-adorned courtesans go there. Tempting him by various means, they will bring him here, and they will be rewarded."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-6', 'en', '''Hearing this, the king said "So be it" to the priest, and the priest and ministers did so.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-7', 'en', '''Hearing this, the chief courtesans entered the great forest and tried to be seen near the hermitage by the stern sage''s son, who always stayed there.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-8', 'en', '''He was always content with his father and never went beyond the hermitage.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-9', 'en', '''Since his birth the ascetic had never seen a woman, or a man, or any other being from a city or kingdom.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-10', 'en', '''Then one day, by chance, Vibhandaka''s son came to that place and saw those lovely women.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-11', 'en', '''The women, in bright clothes, singing sweetly, approached the sage''s son and all said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-12', 'en', '''"Who are you, Brahmin? How do you live? We want to know. Tell us why you wander alone in this lonely, fearsome forest."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-13', 'en', '''Seeing for the first time these women of charming form in the forest, he felt affection and wanted to tell them of his father.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-14', 'en', '''"My father is Vibhandaka; I am his own son. My name, known on earth, is Rishyashringa, and so is my work.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-15', 'en', '''"Our hermitage is near here, lovely ones. I will honour all of you there with due rites."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-16', 'en', '''Hearing the sage''s son, they all agreed and went with him to see the hermitage.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-17', 'en', '''When they arrived, the sage''s son honoured them: "Here is a guest offering, here water for your feet, here are our roots and fruits."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-18', 'en', '''Accepting this, they were all eager but, fearing the sage, quickly decided to leave.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-19', 'en', '''"Brahmin, here are our own special fruits. Take them, bless you, and eat them without delay."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-20', 'en', '''Then, joyfully embracing him, they gave him sweets and many kinds of good food.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-21', 'en', '''Tasting them, the radiant youth thought they were fruits, never having tasted such things while living in the forest.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-22', 'en', '''Taking leave of the Brahmin, saying they had a vow to keep, the women went away on that pretext, afraid of his father.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-23', 'en', '''When they had all gone, Kashyapa''s grandson was uneasy in his heart and felt sad.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-24', 'en', '''The next day the strong youth came again to the place where he had seen those charming, well-adorned women.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-25', 'en', '''Seeing the Brahmin coming, they were delighted, approached him and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-26', 'en', '''"Come to our hermitage, gentle one. There the rites of hospitality will be even finer."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-27', 'en', '''Hearing their heart-touching words, he decided to go, and the women led him away.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-28', 'en', '''As that great Brahmin was being brought, the god suddenly rained, delighting the world.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-29', 'en', '''As the sage arrived with the rain in his kingdom, the king went out to meet him and bowed, touching the ground with his head.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-30', 'en', '''With full attention he offered him the guest offering properly, and asked the great Brahmin for grace, so that anger would not enter him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-31', 'en', '''Entering the inner palace, the king gave him his daughter Shanta in marriage with due rites, and with a peaceful mind he was glad.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-9-32', 'en', '''So the mighty Rishyashringa lived there with his wife Shanta, honoured with every comfort.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-1', 'en', '''Hear more of my helpful words, great king, as that best of gods told them in the story:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-2', 'en', '''"In the Ikshvaku line will be born a very righteous king named Dasharatha, glorious and true to his promises.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-3', 'en', '''"That king will be friends with the king of Anga, who will have a fortunate daughter named Shanta.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-4', 'en', '''"The son of the king of Anga will be known as Lomapada. Glorious Dasharatha will go to him and say:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-5', 'en', '''"Righteous one, I have no children. Let Shanta''s husband, at your command, perform my sacrifice for the continuance of my line."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-6', 'en', '''"Hearing this and thinking it over, the self-possessed king will send Shanta''s husband, who can bring sons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-7', 'en', '''"Receiving the Brahmin, the king, free of worry, will perform that sacrifice with a joyful heart.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-8', 'en', '''"King Dasharatha, wishing to sacrifice, will with folded hands choose Rishyashringa, best of Brahmins.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-9', 'en', '''"For the sacrifice, for offspring and for heaven, the lord of men will gain his wish from that chief of Brahmins.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-10', 'en', '''"He will have four sons of boundless valour, who will establish the line and be famous in all the worlds."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-11', 'en', '''So the holy Sanatkumara, best of gods, told this story long ago, in the age of the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-12', 'en', '''So, tiger among men, great king, go yourself with your army and vehicles and bring him with honour.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-13', 'en', 'With Vasishtha''s leave, having heard the charioteer''s words, the king set out with his queens and ministers to where the Brahmin was.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-14', 'en', 'Crossing forests and rivers slowly, he came to the land where the great sage lived.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-15', 'en', 'Reaching that best of Brahmins near Lomapada, he first saw the sage''s son, blazing like fire.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-16', 'en', 'Then the king honoured him duly and especially, out of friendship with Lomapada, with a joyful heart.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-17', 'en', 'Lomapada told the wise sage''s son of the friendship and the family tie, and he honoured the king in return.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-18', 'en', 'Well honoured, the bull among men stayed with Lomapada seven or eight days, then said to the king:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-19', 'en', '''King, let your daughter Shanta and her husband come to my city, for a great task is at hand.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-20', 'en', 'The king agreed to the wise sage going, and said to the Brahmin: ''Go with your wife.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-21', 'en', 'The sage''s son agreed and said ''So be it'' to the king; with the king''s leave he set off with his wife.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-22', 'en', 'Dasharatha and mighty Lomapada folded their hands to each other, embraced with affection, and rejoiced.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-23', 'en', 'Taking leave of his friend, the joy of the Raghus set out and sent swift messengers to the citizens: ''Have the whole city decorated at once.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-24', 'en', 'The delighted citizens, hearing the king was coming, did everything he had ordered.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-25', 'en', 'Then the king entered the decorated city to the sound of conches and drums, with the bull among Brahmins in front.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-26', 'en', 'All the townspeople rejoiced to see the Brahmin being honoured and brought in by the king, whose deeds were like Indra''s.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-27', 'en', 'Bringing him into the inner palace and honouring him as the scriptures direct, the king felt his task was done by bringing him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-28', 'en', 'All the women of the palace, seeing large-eyed Shanta arrive with her husband, were filled with love and joy.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-10-29', 'en', 'Honoured by them and especially by the king, she lived there happily for some time with the Brahmin.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-1', 'en', 'After a long time, when lovely spring had come, the king decided to sacrifice.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-2', 'en', 'Bowing his head to win the favour of the godlike Brahmin, he chose him for the sacrifice to continue his line.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-3', 'en', 'Well honoured, he said to the king: ''So be it. Let the materials be gathered and the horse released.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-4', 'en', 'Then the king said to Sumantra, best of ministers: ''Sumantra, quickly summon the priests who know the Vedas.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-5', 'en', 'Sumantra went swiftly and brought all those Brahmins, masters of the Vedas:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-6', 'en', 'Suyajna, Vamadeva, Jabali, Kashyapa, the family priest Vasishtha and other excellent Brahmins.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-7', 'en', 'Honouring them, righteous King Dasharatha spoke gentle words full of dharma and purpose:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-8', 'en', '''I have no happiness, longing for a son. So I have decided to perform the horse sacrifice.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-9', 'en', '''I wish to sacrifice by the rite the scriptures teach, and by the power of the sage''s son I will gain my desires.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-10', 'en', 'The Brahmins led by Vasishtha praised the king''s words, saying ''Excellent!''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-11', 'en', 'Led by Rishyashringa, they replied: ''Let the materials be gathered and the horse released.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-12', 'en', '''You will surely gain four sons of boundless valour, since your righteous mind has turned to this for sons.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-13', 'en', 'The king was pleased hearing the Brahmins, and joyfully told his ministers these auspicious words:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-14', 'en', '''At my teachers'' word, let the materials be gathered quickly, and let the horse be released, guarded by able men and with a priest.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-15', 'en', '''Let the sacrificial ground be prepared on the north bank of the Sarayu, and let peace rites be increased as prescribed.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-16', 'en', '''Any king can perform this sacrifice, provided no serious error occurs in this best of rites.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-17', 'en', '''Learned brahmarakshasas look for flaws here; one who sacrifices without proper rules is destroyed at once.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-18', 'en', '''So let arrangements be made so that my sacrifice is completed properly; you are capable in these matters.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-19', 'en', 'All the ministers agreed and did as the king commanded.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-20', 'en', 'The Brahmins praised the righteous king and, with his leave, went back the way they had come.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-11-21', 'en', 'When the Brahmins had gone, the radiant king dismissed his ministers and entered his own palace.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-1', 'en', 'When spring came again a full year had passed. Greeting Vasishtha and honouring him duly,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-2', 'en', 'he said humbly to that best of Brahmins, for the sake of offspring: ''Brahmin, best of sages, let my sacrifice be performed as prescribed.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-3', 'en', '''Arrange it so no obstacle arises in any part of the sacrifice. You are my affectionate friend and my great teacher.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-4', 'en', '''You must bear the burden of this sacrifice.'' ''So be it,'' said that best of Brahmins to the king.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-5', 'en', '''I will do all you have asked.'' Then he spoke to the elderly Brahmins skilled in sacrificial work,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-6', 'en', 'to the old and very righteous experts in building, to overseers, craftsmen, carpenters and diggers,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-7', 'en', 'to accountants and artisans, actors and dancers, and to pure, learned men well versed in the scriptures:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-8', 'en', '''By the king''s command, begin the work of the sacrifice. Bring many thousands of bricks quickly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-9', 'en', '''Build fine lodgings for the kings, with every comfort, and hundreds of good houses for the Brahmins,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-10', 'en', '''well stocked with plenty of food and drink. Also build spacious lodgings for the citizens,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-11', 'en', '''with lots of food and every comfort. And for the country people too, very fine ones.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-12', 'en', '''Give food properly and with respect, not carelessly, so that all classes receive honour and are well treated.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-13', 'en', '''Do not show disrespect even out of desire or anger. The workers and craftsmen who labour steadily at the sacrifice', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-14', 'en', '''should be honoured especially, in due order, so that everything is well done and nothing is neglected.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-15', 'en', '''Do all this with loving hearts.'' Then they all came together and said to Vasishtha:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-16', 'en', '''We will do as you say; nothing will be neglected.'' Then Vasishtha called Sumantra and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-17', 'en', '''Invite the righteous kings of the earth, and thousands of Brahmins, warriors, merchants and labourers.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-18', 'en', '''Bring people from every land with honour, and the brave Janaka, lord of Mithila, true in valour,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-19', 'en', '''learned in all the sciences and the Vedas. Bring that fortunate man yourself with honour. Knowing him to be an old relation, I mention him first.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-20', 'en', '''Likewise bring yourself the king of Kashi, affectionate and always kind-spoken, of good conduct and like a god.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-21', 'en', '''Bring here the aged and very righteous king of Kekaya, father-in-law of this lion among kings, with his son.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-22', 'en', '''Bring with honour the fortunate Lomapada, lord of Anga, the famous friend of this lion among kings.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-23', 'en', '''Bring all the kings of the east, of Sindhu-Sauvira, of Saurashtra, and of the south.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-24', 'en', '''And quickly bring the other friendly kings on earth, with their followers and kin.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-25', 'en', 'Hearing Vasishtha, Sumantra quickly sent good men to bring the kings.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-26', 'en', 'At the sage''s command, the righteous Sumantra himself hurried off to bring the kings.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-27', 'en', 'All the overseers reported to wise Vasishtha everything prepared for the sacrifice.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-28', 'en', 'Pleased, the best of Brahmins told them again: ''Nothing should be given to anyone with disrespect or carelessly. What is given with contempt destroys the giver, without doubt.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-29', 'en', 'Within a few days the kings arrived, bringing many jewels for King Dasharatha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-30', 'en', 'Then Vasishtha, well pleased, said to the king: ''Tiger among men, the kings have come at your command.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-31', 'en', '''I have honoured them all as they deserve, and the sacrificial preparations have been made by careful men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-32', 'en', '''Go out to sacrifice at the nearby sacrificial ground, which is supplied on all sides with every desired thing.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-33', 'en', 'At the word of Vasishtha and Rishyashringa, the king set out on an auspicious day under a good star.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-12-34', 'en', 'Then all the best Brahmins, led by Vasishtha and with Rishyashringa in front, began the sacrifice.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-1', 'en', 'When the year was complete and the horse had returned, the king''s sacrifice began on the north bank of the Sarayu.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-2', 'en', 'With Rishyashringa in front, the best of Brahmins performed the rites of that great horse sacrifice for the great-souled king.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-3', 'en', 'The priests, masters of the Vedas, performed the rites properly, moving about as the scriptures direct.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-4', 'en', 'The Brahmins performed the Pravargya and Upasad rites by the scriptures, and all the additional rites too.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-5', 'en', 'Then, with worship, the delighted sages performed the rites beginning with the morning pressing of Soma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-6', 'en', 'No offering was omitted and no slip occurred; everything was seen to be done by the sacred rule and with safety.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-7', 'en', 'In those days no one was seen tired or hungry; no Brahmin was unlearned, and none had fewer than a hundred followers.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-8', 'en', 'Brahmins ate every day, so did those with protectors, ascetics and wandering monks.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-9', 'en', 'The old, the sick, women and children ate without stop, and still there was no end to the feeding.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-10', 'en', '''Give food, give clothes of every kind!'' So urged, they gave again and again.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-11', 'en', 'Every day many mountains of properly cooked food could be seen there.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-12', 'en', 'The best of Brahmins praised the tasty food. Raghava heard them say: ''We are satisfied, bless you!''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-13', 'en', 'Well-dressed men served the Brahmins, and others wearing polished jewelled earrings waited on them.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-14', 'en', 'Between the rites the eloquent, steady Brahmins held many debates, each wishing to win.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-15', 'en', 'Day after day, the skilled Brahmins performed all the rites as the scriptures direct.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-16', 'en', 'None of the king''s assembly members did not know the six Vedic branches, keep vows, or have deep learning, and none lacked skill in debate.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-17', 'en', 'When the posts were raised, there were six of bilva wood, six of khadira, as many of palasha with bilva,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-18', 'en', 'one of shleshmataka wood as prescribed, and two of devadaru wood set an arm''s span apart.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-19', 'en', 'All these were made by experts in scripture and ritual and were decorated with gold to beautify the sacrifice.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-20', 'en', 'Placed properly by craftsmen, all were well made, firm, eight-sided and smooth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-21', 'en', 'Covered in cloth and adorned with flowers and perfumes, they shone like the bright Seven Sages in the sky.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-22', 'en', 'Bricks were made to the right measure, and the fire altar was built by Brahmins skilled in geometry.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-23', 'en', 'The altar for the lion among kings, built by skilled Brahmins, was in the shape of the eagle Garuda with golden wings, threefold and of eighteen parts.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-24', 'en', 'Animals were tied there, each for its deity, snakes and birds as the scriptures direct, and the horse and water creatures for the slaying rite.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-25', 'en', 'All this was arranged by the priests per scripture: three hundred animals bound to the posts, along with King Dasharatha''s jewel of a horse.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-26', 'en', 'Kausalya tended the horse on all sides and then, with great joy, struck it with three swords.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-27', 'en', 'With a steady mind, Kausalya, seeking merit, spent one night beside the horse.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-28', 'en', 'The hotr, adhvaryu and udgatr priests brought the chief queen, the neglected queen and the favourite queen into contact with the horse.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-29', 'en', 'The self-controlled and skilled priest took out the horse''s fat and cooked it as the scripture directs.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-30', 'en', 'At the right time and in the right way the king smelled the smoke of the fat, driving away his sins.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-31', 'en', 'All sixteen priests together offered the horse''s parts properly into the fire.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-32', 'en', 'In other sacrifices the oblation is placed on plaksha branches; in the horse sacrifice alone, the portion is on reed.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-33', 'en', 'Brahmins count the horse sacrifice as a three-day rite in the ritual manuals. Its first day is the Chatushtoma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-34', 'en', 'The second is called Ukthya, and the next Atiratra. Many other rites were performed there by scriptural rule,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-35', 'en', 'the Jyotishtoma and Ayus, two Atiratras, the Abhijit, Vishvajit and the great Aptoryama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-36', 'en', 'The king, increasing his line, gave the eastern quarter to the hotr, the west to the adhvaryu, the south to the brahman priest,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-37', 'en', 'and the north to the udgatr. This fee was fixed in the great horse sacrifice ordained by Brahma long ago.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-38', 'en', 'Completing the rite properly, the bull among men gave the earth to the priests.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-39', 'en', 'The priests said to the king, now cleansed of sin: ''You alone can protect the whole earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-40', 'en', '''We have no use for land and cannot govern it. We are always devoted to study, king. Give us something in exchange instead.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-41', 'en', 'The king gave them a million cows, a hundred million gold pieces and four times as much silver.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-42', 'en', 'The priests together gave the wealth to the sage Rishyashringa and to wise Vasishtha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-43', 'en', 'Then those best of Brahmins divided it fairly and, well pleased, thanked the king joyfully.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-44', 'en', 'The king rejoiced at having completed that supreme sacrifice, which removes sin, leads to heaven, and is hard even for great kings to accomplish.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-45', 'en', 'Then King Dasharatha said to Rishyashringa: ''Faithful one, please now bring about the growth of my line.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-13-46', 'en', '''So be it,'' said the best of Brahmins to the king. ''You will have four sons, king, who will carry on your line.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-1', 'en', 'The wise one meditated for a while, then, regaining outward awareness, the knower of the Vedas said to the king:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-2', 'en', '''I will perform for you the rite for sons, the putriya ishti, effective by the mantras in the Atharvashiras, done properly.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-3', 'en', 'Then the radiant one began that rite for sons and offered into the fire with mantra-guided action.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-4', 'en', 'The gods with the gandharvas, perfected ones and great sages gathered duly to receive their shares.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-5', 'en', 'Assembled in that hall, the gods spoke weighty words to Brahma, creator of the worlds:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-6', 'en', '''Lord, by your favour the demon named Ravana oppresses us all with his might. We cannot control him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-7', 'en', '''You gave him a boon, lord, when pleased with him long ago. Respecting that, we always endure everything from him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-8', 'en', '''The wicked one troubles the three worlds and hates the exalted; he wants to attack Indra, king of the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-9', 'en', '''Unassailable and deluded by the boon, he oppresses sages, yakshas, gandharvas, asuras and Brahmins.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-10', 'en', '''The sun does not burn him, the wind does not blow near him, and the ocean with its rolling waves does not stir when it sees him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-11', 'en', '''We are terribly afraid of that fearsome demon. Lord, please find a way to kill him.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-12', 'en', 'Told this by all the gods, Brahma thought and said: ''Ah, here is the way to kill that wicked one.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-13', 'en', '''He asked: "May I not be killed by gandharvas, yakshas, gods, danavas or demons," and I said "So be it."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-14', 'en', '''Out of contempt the demon did not mention humans. So he can be killed by a human; no other death exists for him.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-15', 'en', 'Hearing these welcome words from Brahma, all the gods and great sages rejoiced.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-16', 'en', 'Meanwhile radiant Vishnu arrived and, meeting Brahma, stood there attentively.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-17', 'en', 'All the gods, praising and bowing to him, said: ''Vishnu, for the good of the worlds we appoint you.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-18', 'en', '''Lord, become the son of King Dasharatha of Ayodhya, who knows dharma, is generous and shines like a great sage. Dividing yourself into four, be born as a son to his three wives, who are like Modesty, Fortune and Fame.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-19', 'en', '''There, becoming human, kill in battle Ravana, the swollen thorn of the worlds whom the gods cannot slay.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-20', 'en', '''For that foolish demon Ravana, proud of his strength, harms the gods, gandharvas, perfected ones and best of sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-14-21', 'en', '''Destroy that arrogant Ravana, of great power and swollen pride, enemy of the lord of the gods, who makes the good cry out and is a thorn to ascetics. Remove this terror of the ascetics.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-1', 'en', 'Then Narayana Vishnu, appointed by the best of gods, though he knew the answer, gently said to them:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-2', 'en', '''Gods, what is the way to kill the demon king? By what means shall I slay that thorn of the sages?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-3', 'en', 'All the gods answered the eternal Vishnu: ''Take on a human body and kill Ravana in battle.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-4', 'en', '''He practised fierce austerities for a long time, destroyer of foes, which pleased Brahma, creator of the worlds and honoured by them.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-5', 'en', '''Pleased, the lord gave the demon a boon: no fear from any kind of being except humans.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-6', 'en', '''He looked down on humans when he got the boon. So his death is seen to come from humans, scorcher of foes.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-7', 'en', 'Hearing the gods'' words, self-possessed Vishnu chose King Dasharatha as his father.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-8', 'en', 'At that time the radiant, childless king, slayer of foes, wishing for sons, was performing the rite for sons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-9', 'en', 'Then from the fire of the sacrificer arose a great being of incomparable splendour, mighty and powerful,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-10', 'en', 'dark, wearing red clothes, with a red face and a voice like a drum, with glossy lion-like body hair, beard and fine hair,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-11', 'en', 'with auspicious marks, adorned with divine ornaments, tall as a mountain peak, with the stride of a proud tiger,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-12', 'en', 'shining like the sun, like the flame of a blazing fire. He held a large vessel of refined gold with a silver lid,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-13', 'en', 'full of divine milk-rice, holding it in both arms like a beloved wife, as if it were made of magic.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-14', 'en', 'Looking at King Dasharatha, he said: ''King, know me as a being from Prajapati, who has come here.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-15', 'en', 'Then the king replied with folded hands: ''Welcome, lord. What may I do for you?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-16', 'en', 'The being from Prajapati spoke again: ''King, you have gained this today by worshipping the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-17', 'en', '''Tiger among men, take this milk-rice made by the gods, which brings children, wealth and health.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-18', 'en', '''Give it to your worthy wives, saying "Eat". Through them you will gain the sons for whom you sacrifice.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-19', 'en', 'Saying ''So be it'', the delighted king received on his head the golden vessel full of divine food, given by the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-20', 'en', 'Bowing to that wonderful, pleasant-looking being, he joyfully walked around him in reverence.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-21', 'en', 'Having received the divine milk-rice, Dasharatha was overjoyed, like a poor man who has gained wealth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-22', 'en', 'Then that wondrous, brilliant being, having completed his task, vanished on the spot.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-23', 'en', 'The inner palace shone with rays of joy, like the sky with the beams of the lovely autumn moon.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-24', 'en', 'Entering the inner palace, he said to Kausalya: ''Take this milk-rice, which will bring you a son.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-25', 'en', 'The king gave half the milk-rice to Kausalya, half of the remaining half to Sumitra, and half of what remained to Kaikeyi, for the sake of sons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-26', 'en', 'After thinking, the king gave the last remaining part of that nectar-like milk-rice again to Sumitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-27', 'en', 'In this way the king gave the milk-rice separately to his wives.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-15-28', 'en', 'Receiving the milk-rice, the king''s noble wives all felt honoured, their hearts lifted with joy.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-1', 'en', 'When Vishnu had become the son of that great king, the self-born lord Brahma said this to all the gods:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-2', 'en', '''Create mighty, shape-shifting helpers for Vishnu, who is true to his word, heroic and wishes good for us all,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-3', 'en', '''skilled in magic, brave, swift as the wind, wise in policy, intelligent, equal to Vishnu in valour,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-4', 'en', '''unconquerable, skilled in strategy, with divine bodies, masters of every weapon, as if they had drunk nectar.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-5', 'en', '''On the chief apsaras, on gandharva women, on daughters of yakshas and serpents, of bears and vidyadharas,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-6', 'en', '''on kinnara women and monkey females, beget sons in monkey form, equal in valour.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-7', 'en', 'Told this by the lord, they accepted the command and fathered sons in monkey form.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-8', 'en', 'Great sages, perfected ones, vidyadharas, serpents and charanas also produced heroic sons who roamed the forests.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-9', 'en', 'Many thousands were created, ready to kill ten-necked Ravana, heroes of measureless strength, valiant and shape-shifting.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-10', 'en', 'Like elephants and mountains, big-bodied and mighty, bears, monkeys and gopuccha apes were quickly born.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-11', 'en', 'Whatever form, dress and valour each god had, a son was born to him with all of it.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-12', 'en', 'Some of honoured valour were born to gopuccha females, others to bears, and monkeys to kinnara women.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-13', 'en', 'All fought with rocks and trees, all had nails and teeth as weapons, all knew every weapon.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-14', 'en', 'They could shake great mountains, split firm trees, and stir up with their speed the ocean, lord of rivers.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-15', 'en', 'They could split the earth with their feet, leap the great ocean, enter the sky and even seize the clouds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-16', 'en', 'They could catch rutting elephants roaming the forest and bring down birds with their roar.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-17', 'en', 'Of such shape-shifting monkeys, a hundred hundred thousand troop leaders were born, and these best leaders fathered heroic monkeys.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-18', 'en', 'Some, in thousands, lived on the slopes of Mount Rikshavat; others settled in various mountains and forests.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-19', 'en', 'All the monkey lords served the two brothers, Sugriva, son of the Sun, and Vali, son of Indra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-16-20', 'en', 'The earth was covered with those mighty monkey troop leaders, like masses of clouds and mountain peaks, with fearsome bodies, all to help Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-1', 'en', 'When the great one''s horse sacrifice was complete, the gods took their shares and went back the way they had come.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-2', 'en', 'Having completed his vows, the king entered the city with his wives, servants, army and vehicles.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-3', 'en', 'Honoured as they deserved by the king, the rulers of the earth joyfully left for their lands, bowing to the great sage.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-4', 'en', 'When the kings had gone, glorious King Dasharatha entered the city again with the best Brahmins in front.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-5', 'en', 'Well honoured, Rishyashringa left with Shanta, followed by the wise king and his retinue.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-6', 'en', 'Kausalya gave birth to Rama, with divine marks, a half of Vishnu, the greatly blessed son, joy of the Ikshvakus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-7', 'en', 'Kausalya shone with that son of boundless splendour, as Aditi did with Indra, wielder of the thunderbolt, best of gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-8', 'en', 'Bharata, true in valour, was born to Kaikeyi, a quarter of Vishnu himself, full of all virtues.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-9', 'en', 'Then Sumitra gave birth to Lakshmana and Shatrughna, heroes skilled in all weapons, sharing in Vishnu''s portion.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-10', 'en', 'The four great sons of the king were born separately, virtuous and well matched, bright as the stars of Proshthapada.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-11', 'en', 'After eleven days, the naming ceremony was held: the eldest, great Rama; Bharata, son of Kaikeyi;', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-12', 'en', 'Lakshmana, son of Sumitra, and Shatrughna. Vasishtha, delighted, gave the names and performed all their birth rites.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-13', 'en', 'Of them, the eldest, Rama, was like a banner, delighting his father, and was esteemed by all beings like Brahma himself.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-14', 'en', 'All knew the Vedas, were brave, devoted to the good of the world, full of knowledge and endowed with virtues.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-15', 'en', 'Among them, from childhood, Lakshmana, who increased fortune, was deeply devoted to the radiant Rama, true in valour.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-16', 'en', 'He always did everything to please his eldest brother Rama, the delight of the world, even at cost to his own body.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-17', 'en', 'Lakshmana was like Rama''s second life outside his body. The best of men could not sleep without him, nor eat fine food brought to him without him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-18', 'en', 'When Raghava rode out hunting, Lakshmana followed behind with his bow, guarding him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-19', 'en', 'Likewise Shatrughna, Lakshmana''s younger brother, was dearer to Bharata than life, and Bharata was as dear to him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-20', 'en', 'With his four dear and fortunate sons, Dasharatha was overjoyed, like Brahma with the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-21', 'en', 'When they were full of knowledge and virtue, modest, famous, all-knowing and far-sighted,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-22', 'en', 'righteous King Dasharatha, with his teachers and relatives, began to think about their marriages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-23', 'en', 'While the great one was considering this among his ministers, the radiant great sage Vishvamitra arrived.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-24', 'en', 'Wishing to see the king, he told the gatekeepers: ''Quickly announce that I, Kaushika, son of Gadhi, have come.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-25', 'en', 'Hearing this, they all ran to the palace, alarmed and urged on by his words.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-26', 'en', 'Going to the palace, they announced to the Ikshvaku king that the sage Vishvamitra had arrived.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-27', 'en', 'Hearing them, the king, composed and with his priest, went out joyfully to meet him, as Indra meets Brahma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-28', 'en', 'Seeing the ascetic of strict vows blazing with splendour, the king, his face beaming, had the guest offering brought.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-29', 'en', 'Receiving the king''s offering according to the scriptures, he asked after the king''s lasting welfare.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-30', 'en', 'Meeting Vasishtha, the great sage asked after his welfare too, and properly greeted the other fortunate sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-31', 'en', 'Honoured, they all entered the king''s palace with happy hearts and sat down in their proper places.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-32', 'en', 'Then the delighted and most generous king, honouring the great sage Vishvamitra, said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-33', 'en', '''Like gaining nectar, like rain in a dry land, like a son born to a childless man by a worthy wife, like recovering what was lost, like joy at a great festival: so I regard your coming. Welcome, great sage.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-34', 'en', '''What great wish of yours shall I gladly fulfil? You are worthy of gifts, Brahmin; by good fortune you have come, righteous one. Today my birth is fruitful and my life well lived.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-35', 'en', '''Once known as a royal sage, shining through austerity, you have become a brahmarshi. You deserve my honour in many ways.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-36', 'en', '''This is wonderful and most purifying for me, Brahmin. By seeing you, lord, I feel I have come to a holy place.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-37', 'en', '''Tell me what you want, the purpose of your coming. I wish to be favoured by helping your cause.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-38', 'en', '''Do not hesitate about the task, Kaushika. I will do it entirely, for you are a god to me.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-17-39', 'en', 'Hearing these words, pleasing to heart and ear, spoken humbly by a self-possessed man, the great sage, famous for his virtues, was filled with joy.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-1', 'en', 'Hearing the lion among kings'' wonderful, expansive words, the radiant Vishvamitra, his hair standing on end with delight, replied:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-2', 'en', '''This befits you alone on earth, tiger among kings, born in a great line and guided by Vasishtha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-3', 'en', '''Now carry out firmly the task I have in my heart, tiger among kings. Be true to your promise.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-4', 'en', '''I am undertaking a ritual vow for spiritual success, bull among men. Two shape-shifting demons obstruct it.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-5', 'en', '''Many times, when my vow was nearly complete, these two demons, Maricha and Subahu, strong and well trained, rained floods of flesh and blood on the altar.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-6', 'en', '''With my vow ruined like this, I left that place exhausted and disheartened.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-7', 'en', '''I do not wish to release my anger at them, king, for such is that discipline: no curse may be uttered during it.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-8', 'en', '''Tiger among kings, give me your own eldest son Rama, true in valour, a brave youth with side-locks.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-9', 'en', '''Protected by me and by his own divine power, he is able to destroy the demons who cause the harm.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-10', 'en', '''I will give him many kinds of blessings, without doubt, by which he will become famous in the three worlds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-11', 'en', '''Those two cannot stand against Rama at all, and no man but Raghava can kill them.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-12', 'en', '''Proud of their strength, those wicked two have fallen into the noose of death. They are no match for great Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-13', 'en', '''Do not let a father''s love hold you back, king. I promise you: consider those two demons already dead.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-14', 'en', '''I know great Rama, true in valour, and so does radiant Vasishtha and these sages established in austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-15', 'en', '''If you want merit and lasting fame on earth, lord of kings, give me Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-16', 'en', '''If your ministers, led by Vasishtha, give their consent, Kakutstha, then send Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-17', 'en', '''Give me your beloved, lotus-eyed son, who is free of attachment, for the ten nights of the sacrifice.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-18', 'en', '''Act so that the time of my sacrifice does not pass, Raghava. Bless you; do not give way to grief.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-19', 'en', 'Having said these words full of dharma and purpose, the righteous and radiant great sage Vishvamitra fell silent.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-18-20', 'en', 'Hearing those words of the sage, which tore at his heart and mind, the king was seized with great fear; distressed, he shook on his throne.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-1', 'en', 'Hearing Vishvamitra''s speech, the tiger among kings was stunned for a moment; then, recovering, he said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-2', 'en', '''My lotus-eyed Rama is not yet sixteen. I do not see him fit to fight demons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-3', 'en', '''Here is a full army division of which I am lord. Surrounded by it, I will go and fight those night-walkers.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-4', 'en', '''These brave, valiant servants of mine are skilled in weapons and fit to fight the demons. Do not take Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-5', 'en', '''I myself, bow in hand, will be your protector at the front of battle. As long as I live, I will fight the night-walkers.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-6', 'en', '''Your vow will proceed well protected and free of obstacles. I will go there. Do not take Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-7', 'en', '''He is a boy, his training is incomplete, he does not know strength and weakness, he has no divine weapons and is not skilled in war. He is no match for demons, who certainly fight with tricks.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-8', 'en', '''Separated from Rama even for a moment, I cannot live, tiger among sages. Do not take Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-9', 'en', '''Or if you must take Raghava, Brahmin of good vows, take him with me and the fourfold army.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-10', 'en', '''I am sixty thousand years old, Kaushika, and he was born to me with great difficulty. Do not take Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-11', 'en', '''Of my four sons, my love is greatest for the eldest, devoted to dharma. Do not take Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-12', 'en', '''What strength do these demons have? Whose sons are they and who are they? How big are they, and who protects them, best of sages?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-13', 'en', '''How can Rama, or my forces, or I, counter those demons who fight with tricks, Brahmin?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-14', 'en', '''Tell me everything, lord: how shall I stand in battle against those evil-minded ones? Demons are proud of their strength.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-15', 'en', 'Hearing this, Vishvamitra said: ''There is a demon named Ravana, born in the line of Pulastya.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-16', 'en', '''Given a boon by Brahma, he greatly torments the three worlds. He is mighty, powerful and surrounded by many demons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-17', 'en', '''Ravana, the mighty lord of demons, is said to be the brother of Vaishravana (Kubera) himself, and the son of the sage Vishravas.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-18', 'en', '''When the mighty one does not obstruct a sacrifice himself, two very strong demons urged by him, Maricha and Subahu, do the obstructing.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-19', 'en', 'Told this by the sage, the king said: ''I cannot stand in battle against that evil one.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-20', 'en', '''Show grace to my little son, knower of dharma. Gods, danavas, gandharvas, yakshas, birds and serpents', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-21', 'en', '''cannot withstand Ravana, let alone humans in battle. In battle that demon takes away the strength of the strong.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-22', 'en', '''So I cannot fight him or his forces, best of sages, whether with my army or with my sons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-23', 'en', '''In no way will I give my young, godlike son, who knows nothing of battle.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-24', 'en', '''Those two who obstruct your sacrifice are sons of Sunda and Upasunda, like Death in battle. I will not give my son.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-19-25', 'en', '''Maricha and Subahu are strong and well trained. I will fight one of them with my allies.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-1', 'en', 'Hearing his words, broken by love, Kaushika, filled with anger, answered the king:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-2', 'en', '''Having first promised, you now wish to break your promise. This reversal is unworthy of the Raghu line.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-3', 'en', '''If this suits you, king, I will go as I came. Be happy with your kin, Kakutstha, false to your promise.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-4', 'en', 'When wise Vishvamitra was overcome with rage, the whole earth shook and fear entered the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-5', 'en', 'Seeing the whole world frightened, the great sage Vasishtha, steady and of good vows, said to the king:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-6', 'en', '''Born in the Ikshvaku line, like a second Dharma, steadfast, of good vows and glorious, you must not abandon dharma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-7', 'en', '''Raghava is known in the three worlds as righteous. Keep to your own duty; do not take on unrighteousness.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-8', 'en', '''One who promises "I will do it" and then does not, loses the merit of all his sacrifices and good works. So send Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-9', 'en', '''Whether he knows weapons or not, demons cannot harm him while he is guarded by the son of Kushika, as nectar is guarded by fire.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-10', 'en', '''This man is dharma in bodily form, the best of the mighty, the wisest in the world, the highest refuge of austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-11', 'en', '''He knows the various weapons in the three worlds, moving and unmoving. No other man knows them, nor will anyone,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-12', 'en', '''not gods, sages, asuras, demons, nor the best of gandharvas and yakshas, kinnaras or great serpents.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-13', 'en', '''All the weapons, the most righteous sons of Krishashva, were given to Kaushika long ago, when he ruled a kingdom.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-14', 'en', '''Those sons of Krishashva, born of Prajapati''s daughters, are of many forms, very mighty, shining and bringing victory.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-15', 'en', '''Jaya and Suprabha, the slender-waisted daughters of Daksha, gave birth to a hundred most brilliant weapons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-16', 'en', '''Jaya bore fifty excellent sons, measureless and shape-shifting, to destroy the armies of the asuras.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-17', 'en', '''Suprabha bore another fifty sons called Samharas, invincible, hard to attack and very strong.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-18', 'en', '''The son of Kushika knows those weapons fully, and the knower of dharma can create new ones as well.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-20-19', 'en', '''Such is the power of radiant Vishvamitra, great in austerity. King, you need not doubt about Rama going.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-1', 'en', 'As Vasishtha spoke, King Dasharatha, his face brightening, called his son Rama with Lakshmana.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-2', 'en', 'Blessed for a safe journey by his mother and his father Dasharatha, and consecrated with auspicious mantras by the priest Vasishtha,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-3', 'en', 'King Dasharatha kissed his dear son on the head and gave him to Kushika''s son with a contented heart.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-4', 'en', 'Then a pleasant, dustless breeze blew as they saw lotus-eyed Rama going with Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-5', 'en', 'There was a great shower of flowers, the sound of divine drums, and the blare of conches and drums as the great one set out.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-6', 'en', 'Vishvamitra went first, then famous Rama with his side-locks and bow, and Lakshmana followed him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-7', 'en', 'With quivers and bows in hand, lighting up the ten directions, the two noble youths followed great Vishvamitra like three-headed serpents, like the Ashvins following Brahma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-8', 'en', 'With lizard-skin finger guards and swords, the radiant youths were like two sons of Agni following the inconceivable god Shiva.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-9', 'en', 'After going a league and a half, on the south bank of the Sarayu, Vishvamitra called sweetly: ''Rama!''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-10', 'en', '''Take water, my son; let no time be lost. Receive from me the group of mantras Bala and Atibala.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-11', 'en', '''You will feel no fatigue or fever, your form will not change, and demons will not attack you even when asleep or off guard.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-12', 'en', '''No one on earth will equal your arms in strength, Rama; none in the three worlds will be your equal.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-13', 'en', '''In charm, skill, knowledge, firm judgement or ready answers, no one in the world will equal you, sinless one.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-14', 'en', '''When you have these two sciences there will be none like you. Bala and Atibala are the mothers of all knowledge.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-15', 'en', '''Hunger and thirst will not touch you, best of men, as you recite Bala and Atibala on the road, and you will win matchless fame on earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-16', 'en', '''These two radiant sciences are Brahma''s daughters. You are fit to receive them, righteous Kakutstha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-17', 'en', '''All these virtues are surely in you already. Nurtured by austerity, these will take many forms.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-18', 'en', 'Then Rama, pure and beaming, touched water and received the two sciences from the great sage. Endowed with them, the mighty one shone.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-21-19', 'en', 'Having done every service for their teacher, the son of Kushika, the three spent that night very happily by the Sarayu.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-1', 'en', 'When the night had brightened into dawn, the great sage Vishvamitra spoke to Kakutstha, lying on a bed of leaves:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-2', 'en', '''Rama, blessed son of Kausalya, the morning twilight is beginning. Rise, tiger among men; the daily rites to the gods must be done.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-3', 'en', 'Hearing the sage''s noble words, the princes bathed, offered water and recited the highest prayer.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-4', 'en', 'Having done their daily rites, the mighty pair saluted Vishvamitra, rich in austerity, and joyfully stood ready to go.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-5', 'en', 'As they went, the two saw the divine river of three paths, the Ganga, at its lovely meeting with the Sarayu.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-6', 'en', 'There was a holy hermitage of fierce sages who had practised the highest austerity for many thousands of years.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-7', 'en', 'Seeing that holy hermitage, the delighted Raghavas said to great Vishvamitra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-8', 'en', '''Whose holy hermitage is this? Who lives here? We want to hear, lord; we are very curious.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-9', 'en', 'Hearing them, the sage laughed and said: ''Listen, Rama, to whose hermitage this was.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-10', 'en', '''Kandarpa had a body then; the wise call him Kama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-11', 'en', '''Here Shiva, lord of the gods, was practising austerity with discipline. When, after his marriage, he was going with the Maruts, foolish Kama attacked him, and the great one let out a roar.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-12', 'en', '''Burned by Shiva''s fierce eye, all the limbs of the foolish one fell from his body.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-13', 'en', '''His body was destroyed, burned by the great one; in anger the lord of gods made Kama bodiless.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-14', 'en', '''From then on he has been known as Ananga, the bodiless, and this fair land where he dropped his body is called Anga.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-15', 'en', '''This is his holy hermitage, and these sages were once his righteous disciples, heroes; there is no sin in them.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-16', 'en', '''Let us stay here tonight, Rama, between the two holy rivers. Tomorrow we will cross.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-17', 'en', 'As they talked, the sages there, knowing them by their long sight of austerity, were very pleased and rejoiced.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-18', 'en', 'They offered Kushika''s son the guest offering, foot water and hospitality, and then honoured Rama and Lakshmana.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-22-19', 'en', 'Receiving this welcome and delighting them with stories, they stayed very happily in Kama''s hermitage.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-1', 'en', 'In the clear morning, having done their daily rites, the two destroyers of foes, with Vishvamitra in front, came to the river bank.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-2', 'en', 'All the great sages of firm vows brought a fine boat and said to Vishvamitra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-3', 'en', '''Board the boat, lord, with the princes in front. Go safely on your way; let no time be lost.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-4', 'en', 'Saying ''So be it'' and honouring the sages, Vishvamitra crossed with the two the river that flows to the sea.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-5', 'en', 'In mid-river Rama asked the best of sages: ''What is this tumultuous sound of breaking water?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-6', 'en', 'Hearing Raghava''s curious words, the righteous one explained the cause of the sound:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-7', 'en', '''On Mount Kailasa, Rama, Brahma created a lake with his mind; so it is called Lake Manasa.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-8', 'en', '''From that lake flows the holy Sarayu, which embraces Ayodhya; it springs from Brahma''s lake.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-9', 'en', '''This incomparable sound is from the clash of waters as it meets the Ganga. Bow to it with reverence, Rama.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-10', 'en', 'The two very righteous youths bowed to both rivers, reached the south bank, and walked on with quick steps.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-11', 'en', 'Seeing a fearsome, untrodden forest, the Ikshvaku prince asked the best of sages:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-12', 'en', '''How impassable this forest is, ringing with crickets, full of terrible beasts and harsh-voiced birds,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-13', 'en', '''with many kinds of birds crying with fearful sounds, and with lions, tigers, boars and elephants,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-14', 'en', '''thick with dhava, ashvakarna, kakubha, bilva, tinduka, patala and jujube trees. What is this dreadful forest?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-15', 'en', 'The radiant great sage Vishvamitra said: ''Listen, my son Kakutstha, to whose dreadful forest this is.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-16', 'en', '''Once these were two prosperous lands, Malada and Karusha, made by the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-17', 'en', '''Long ago, after the killing of Vritra, Indra was covered in filth and hunger, for the sin of killing a Brahmin had entered him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-18', 'en', '''The gods and sages rich in austerity bathed Indra with pots of water and freed him from that filth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-19', 'en', '''Leaving in this land the filth (mala) and the impurity (karusha) from great Indra''s body, they rejoiced.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-20', 'en', '''When Indra was clean, free of impurity and pure, the delighted lord gave this land a supreme boon:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-21', 'en', '''"These two lands will be prosperous and famous in the world as Malada and Karusha, bearers of the filth of my body."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-22', 'en', '''Seeing the honour wise Indra had given the land, the gods said to him: "Excellent!"', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-23', 'en', '''These two lands, Malada and Karusha, long remained prosperous and happy with wealth and grain.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-24', 'en', '''Then, after some time, a shape-shifting yakshi arose, bearing the strength of a thousand elephants.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-25', 'en', '''Her name is Tataka, bless you, wife of wise Sunda. Her son is the demon Maricha, as mighty as Indra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-26', 'en', '''Wicked Tataka constantly ravages these two lands, Malada and Karusha, Raghava.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-27', 'en', '''She lives a league and a half away, blocking the road. That is why we must go through Tataka''s forest.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-28', 'en', '''Relying on the strength of your arms, kill this wicked one. At my command, rid this land of its thorn again.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-29', 'en', '''No one can come to this land, which has been laid waste by the fearsome, unbearable yakshi, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-23-30', 'en', '''I have told you all about this dreadful forest and how the yakshi has ravaged it; even now she does not stop.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-1', 'en', 'Hearing the excellent words of the immeasurable sage, the tiger among men replied gently:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-2', 'en', '''Yakshas are said to have little strength, best of sages. How does a woman bear the strength of a thousand elephants?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-3', 'en', 'Vishvamitra said: ''Hear how she became so strong. She bears this strength through a boon.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-4', 'en', '''There was once a mighty great yaksha named Suketu, childless and of good conduct, who practised great austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-5', 'en', '''Brahma, pleased with that lord of yakshas, gave him a jewel of a daughter named Tataka.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-6', 'en', '''Brahma gave her the strength of a thousand elephants, but did not give the yaksha a son.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-7', 'en', '''When she grew up, beautiful and youthful, he gave the famous girl as wife to Sunda, son of Jambha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-8', 'en', '''In time the yakshi bore a son, the invincible Maricha, who became a demon through a curse.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-9', 'en', '''When Sunda was killed, Rama, Tataka and her son wanted to attack the great sage Agastya.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-10', 'en', '''Agastya said to Maricha, "Become a demon!" and in great anger he cursed Tataka too:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-11', 'en', '''"Great yakshi, become a man-eater, misshapen, with a distorted face. Give up this form; let yours be dreadful."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-12', 'en', '''Enraged by the curse and maddened with anger, Tataka lays waste this lovely land where Agastya once lived.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-13', 'en', '''Raghava, kill this wicked, dreadful yakshi of evil power, for the good of cows and Brahmins.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-14', 'en', '''No man in the three worlds but you can kill her, bound as she is by the curse, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-15', 'en', '''Do not hesitate because she is a woman, best of men. A prince must act for the good of all four classes.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-16', 'en', '''This is the eternal duty of those charged with ruling. Kill the unrighteous one, Kakutstha; there is no dharma in her.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-17', 'en', '''It is said that long ago Indra killed Manthara, Virochana''s daughter, who wanted to destroy the earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-18', 'en', '''And Vishnu long ago killed the wife of Bhrigu, mother of Kavya, who wanted a world without Indra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-24-19', 'en', '''These and many other great princes and best of men have killed women devoted to unrighteousness.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-1', 'en', 'Hearing the sage''s resolute words, Raghava, firm in his vows, folded his hands and replied:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-2', 'en', '''By my father''s command and out of respect for his word, Kaushika''s word must be done without hesitation.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-3', 'en', '''In Ayodhya, among the elders, my great father Dasharatha instructed me so, and his word must not be ignored.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-4', 'en', '''Having heard my father''s words, at the command of one who knows Brahman, I will without doubt kill Tataka.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-5', 'en', '''For the good of cows and Brahmins, for the happiness of this land, and to do your word, immeasurable one, I am ready.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-6', 'en', 'So saying, the destroyer of foes gripped the middle of his bow and twanged the string fiercely, filling the directions with the sound.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-7', 'en', 'The forest dwellers of Tataka''s land were terrified by that sound, and Tataka, furious, was bewildered by it.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-8', 'en', 'Listening to that sound, the demoness, crazed with anger, rushed swiftly toward where it came from.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-9', 'en', 'Seeing her furious, deformed, with a distorted face and of huge size, Raghava said to Lakshmana:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-10', 'en', '''Look, Lakshmana, at the yakshi''s terrifying, dreadful body. The hearts of the timid would break at the sight.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-11', 'en', '''Look at her, hard to attack, full of magic and strength. Today I will turn her back by cutting off her ears and nose.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-12', 'en', '''I do not wish to kill her, protected as she is by being a woman. I intend to destroy her strength and her movement.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-13', 'en', 'As Rama spoke, Tataka, mad with rage, raised her arms and, roaring, rushed at Rama himself.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-14', 'en', 'As she charged swiftly like a thunderbolt, he struck her in the chest with an arrow; she fell and died.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-15', 'en', 'Seeing that terrible being slain, the lord of the gods and the gods honoured Kakutstha, saying ''Excellent!''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-16', 'en', 'The thousand-eyed Indra, destroyer of cities, very pleased, and all the delighted gods said to Vishvamitra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-17', 'en', '''Sage Kaushika, bless you. All the Maruts with Indra are pleased with this deed. Show your affection to Raghava.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-18', 'en', '''Give Raghava the sons of Prajapati Krishashva, true in valour, borne by the power of austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-19', 'en', '''He is a worthy recipient, Brahmin, devoted to following you, and the prince has a great task to do for the gods.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-20', 'en', 'Saying this, the delighted gods honoured Vishvamitra and left as they had come. Then evening fell.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-21', 'en', 'The great sage, pleased at the killing of Tataka, kissed Rama on the head and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-25-22', 'en', '''Let us stay here tonight, Rama, lovely to see. Tomorrow at dawn we will go to my hermitage.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-1', 'en', 'Having spent that night, famous Vishvamitra smiled and spoke sweet words to Raghava:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-2', 'en', '''I am very pleased with you, glorious prince, bless you. With great affection I give you all the weapons,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-3', 'en', '''by which you will overpower and conquer your enemies in battle, whether gods, asuras, gandharvas or serpents.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-4', 'en', '''I give you all those divine weapons. I will give you the great divine Danda discus, Raghava,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-5', 'en', '''the discus of Dharma, the discus of Time, the very fierce discus of Vishnu and the discus of Indra,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-6', 'en', '''the Vajra weapon, Shiva''s fine trident, the Brahmashiras and Aishika weapons, and the supreme weapon of Brahma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-7', 'en', '''I give you two blazing maces, Modaki and Shikhari, tiger among men, prince.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-8', 'en', '''I give you the noose of Dharma, the noose of Time, and Varuna''s noose, a supreme weapon.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-9', 'en', '''I give you two thunderbolts, the Dry and the Wet, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-10', 'en', '''I give you the Pinaka weapon, the Narayana weapon, and the beloved fire weapon named Shikhara.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-11', 'en', '''I give you the wind weapon named Prathama, the weapon Hayashiras and the Krauncha weapon.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-12', 'en', '''I give you two spears, sinless Kakutstha, and the terrible club Kankala, the Kapala and the Kankana,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-13', 'en', '''all those that the asuras bear. I give them all, and the great weapon of the vidyadharas named Nandana.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-14', 'en', '''I give you a jewel of a sword, mighty-armed prince, and the gandharvas'' beloved weapon named Manava.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-15', 'en', '''I give you Prasvapana and Prashamana, and the solar weapon, Raghava; Darpana, Shoshana, Santapana and Vilapana,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-16', 'en', '''and Madana, hard to resist, beloved of Kandarpa, and the beloved weapon of the pishachas named Mohana. Receive them, tiger among men, glorious prince.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-17', 'en', '''The Tamasa, tiger among men, the very strong Saumana, the irresistible Samvarta and the Mausala, prince,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-18', 'en', '''the Satya weapon, mighty-armed, the supreme Mayadhara, the fearsome Tejahprabha, which drains the enemy''s power,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-19', 'en', '''the Soma weapon named Shishira, Tvashtri''s weapon Sudamana, the dreadful weapon of Bhaga, and the cold-arrow Manava.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-20', 'en', '''Take these shape-shifting, mighty, noble weapons quickly, prince.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-21', 'en', 'Standing pure and facing east, the best of sages joyfully gave Rama the supreme group of mantras.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-22', 'en', 'As wise Vishvamitra recited them, all the precious weapons came and stood before Raghava.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-23', 'en', 'Joyful, they all said to Rama with folded hands: ''Noble Raghava, we are your servants.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-24', 'en', 'Kakutstha accepted them, touched them with his hand, and instructed them: ''Come to me when I think of you.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-26-25', 'en', 'Then radiant Rama, happy at heart, saluted the great sage Vishvamitra and prepared to go.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-1', 'en', 'Having received the weapons, pure Kakutstha, his face beaming, said to Vishvamitra as they walked:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-2', 'en', '''Lord, now that I have the weapons, even the gods cannot overpower me. But I want to know how to withdraw them, best of sages.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-3', 'en', 'At Kakutstha''s words, the great sage Vishvamitra, steadfast, of good vows and pure, taught the withdrawing weapons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-4', 'en', '''Satyavanta, Satyakirti, Dhrishta, Rabhasa, Pratiharatara, Paranmukha, Avanmukha,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-5', 'en', '''Lakshaksha and Vishama, Dridhanabha and Sunabhaka, Dashaksha and Shatavaktra, Dashashirsha and Shatodara,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-6', 'en', '''Padmanabha and Mahanabha, Dundunabha and Sunabhaka, Jyotisha, Krishana, Nairashya and Vimala,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-7', 'en', '''Yaugandhara and Haridra, Daitya and Pramathana, Pitrya, Saumanasa, Vidhuta and Makara,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-8', 'en', '''Karavirakara, Dhana and Dhanya, Raghava, Kamarupa, Kamaruchi, Moha and Avarana,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-9', 'en', '''Jrimbhaka, Sarvanabha, Santana and Varana: these radiant, shape-shifting sons of Krishashva, Rama,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-10', 'en', '''receive from me, bless you; you are worthy, Raghava.'' With divine, shining bodies, embodied and bringing joy,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-11', 'en', 'they folded their hands and said sweetly to Rama: ''Here we are, tiger among men. Command us; what shall we do?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-12', 'en', 'The joy of the Raghus told them: ''Go as you wish. When the time comes, appear in my mind and help me.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-13', 'en', 'Taking leave of Rama and walking around him, they said to Kakutstha, ''So be it'', and went as they had come.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-14', 'en', 'Having learned them, Raghava, as he walked, spoke sweetly and gently to the great sage Vishvamitra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-15', 'en', '''What is that grove of trees, like a cloud, near the mountain? I am very curious.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-16', 'en', '''It is lovely, full of deer and very charming, adorned with many kinds of sweet-voiced birds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-17', 'en', '''We have come out of the hair-raising wilderness, best of sages; I can tell from the pleasantness of this land.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-27-18', 'en', '''Tell me everything, lord. Whose hermitage is this, where those evil, Brahmin-killing wrongdoers come?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-1', 'en', 'As the immeasurable one asked about the forest, the radiant Vishvamitra began to explain:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-2', 'en', '''This was once the hermitage of great Vamana, Rama. It is known as Siddhashrama, for the great ascetic attained perfection here.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-3', 'en', '''At that time King Bali, son of Virochana, conquered the gods with Indra and the Maruts, and ruled over the three worlds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-4', 'en', '''While Bali was holding a sacrifice, the gods led by Agni came together here in this hermitage and spoke to Vishnu:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-5', 'en', '''"Vishnu, Bali son of Virochana is performing a great sacrifice. Before it is finished, accomplish your purpose.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-6', 'en', '''"Whoever comes to him begging, from anywhere, he gives them whatever they ask, properly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-7', 'en', '''"For the gods'' good, use your magic power, take the form of a dwarf, and do the highest good.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-8', 'en', '''"By your grace this will be called Siddhashrama. When the work is done, lord of gods, rise from here."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-9', 'en', '''Then radiant Vishnu was born of Aditi and, taking the form of a dwarf, went to Bali.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-10', 'en', '''He begged three steps of land and, receiving them respectfully, the soul of the worlds, devoted to all beings'' good, stepped across the worlds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-11', 'en', '''Restraining Bali with his power, he gave the three worlds back to great Indra and placed them again under his rule.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-12', 'en', '''This hermitage, which removes weariness, was first occupied by him; out of devotion to that Vamana, I now live in it.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-13', 'en', '''Demons come to this hermitage to obstruct us. Here, tiger among men, you must kill those wrongdoers.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-14', 'en', '''Today we go to the matchless Siddhashrama, Rama. That hermitage is yours as much as mine, dear one.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-15', 'en', 'Seeing him, all the sages who lived in Siddhashrama leapt up at once and honoured Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-16', 'en', 'They honoured wise Vishvamitra fittingly, and showed hospitality to the two princes as well.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-17', 'en', 'After resting a while, the princes, destroyers of foes, folded their hands and said to the tiger among sages:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-18', 'en', '''Begin your consecration today, bless you, best of sages. May this Siddhashrama be fulfilled and your words come true.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-19', 'en', 'Told this, the radiant great sage Vishvamitra, disciplined and self-controlled, entered into the consecration.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-28-20', 'en', 'The princes too, having spent the night attentively, rose at dawn and saluted Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-1', 'en', 'Then the two princes, who knew time and place and how to speak fittingly, said to Kaushika:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-2', 'en', '''Lord, we wish to hear at what time we must guard against the two night-walkers, so that the moment does not pass.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-3', 'en', 'As the two Kakutsthas spoke, eager for battle, all the sages were pleased and praised the princes.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-4', 'en', '''From today, guard for six nights, Raghavas. The sage has begun his consecration and will keep silence.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-5', 'en', 'Hearing this, the famous princes guarded the forest of austerity for six days and nights without sleeping.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-6', 'en', 'The heroes, great archers, stood alert and protected the great sage Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-7', 'en', 'When that time had passed and the sixth day came, Rama said to Lakshmana: ''Be ready and alert.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-8', 'en', 'As Rama spoke, eager for battle, the altar with its priests blazed up.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-9', 'en', 'The sacrifice proceeded properly with mantras, and in the sky a great, frightening sound arose.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-10', 'en', 'Like a monsoon cloud covering the sky, the two demons rushed in, spreading their magic.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-11', 'en', 'Maricha and Subahu and their followers came, fearsome-looking, and poured streams of blood.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-12', 'en', 'Seeing them rushing in suddenly, lotus-eyed Rama looked at Lakshmana and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-13', 'en', '''Look, Lakshmana: I will scatter these wicked, flesh-eating demons with the Manava weapon, as the wind scatters clouds.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-14', 'en', 'Furious, Raghava hurled the noble, shining Manava weapon at Maricha''s chest.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-15', 'en', 'Struck by that supreme weapon, Maricha was flung a full hundred leagues into the ocean.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-16', 'en', 'Seeing Maricha thrown far, unconscious, reeling and stricken by the cold-arrow, Rama said to Lakshmana:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-17', 'en', '''See, Lakshmana, the righteous Manava cold-arrow: it stuns him and carries him away, but does not take his life.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-18', 'en', '''But I will kill these merciless, wicked demons, set on evil, who wreck sacrifices and drink blood.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-19', 'en', 'Taking up the great fire weapon, the joy of the Raghus hurled it at Subahu''s chest; struck, he fell to the ground.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-20', 'en', 'Taking the wind weapon, the famous and noble Raghava killed the rest, bringing joy to the sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-21', 'en', 'Having killed all the sacrifice-wrecking demons, the joy of the Raghus was honoured by the sages, as Indra was after his victory.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-22', 'en', 'When the sacrifice was complete, the great sage Vishvamitra, seeing the directions free of trouble, said to Kakutstha:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-29-23', 'en', '''I have achieved my purpose, mighty-armed one; you have done your teacher''s word. You have truly made this Siddhashrama, famous Rama.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-1', 'en', 'That night Rama and Lakshmana, their purpose achieved, stayed there happily, glad at heart.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-2', 'en', 'When the night brightened into dawn, they did their morning rites and went together to Vishvamitra and the other sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-3', 'en', 'Saluting the best of sages, who blazed like fire, the sweet-spoken pair said sweet, noble words:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-4', 'en', '''Here we are, tiger among sages, your servants. Command us as you wish; what shall we do?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-5', 'en', 'Then all the great sages, with Vishvamitra in front, said to Rama:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-6', 'en', '''Best of men, Janaka of Mithila is going to hold a most righteous sacrifice. We will go there.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-7', 'en', '''You will come with us, tiger among men. There you should see a wonderful jewel of a bow.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-8', 'en', '''It was given long ago by the gods at an assembly: of measureless strength, fearsome, shining brightly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-9', 'en', '''Neither gods, gandharvas, asuras nor demons can string it, much less humans.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-10', 'en', '''Kings and mighty princes, wishing to test the bow''s power, could not string it.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-11', 'en', '''There, Kakutstha, you will see that bow of great Janaka, and his wonderful sacrifice.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-12', 'en', '''That excellent bow, with its fine grip, was asked of all the gods by the king of Mithila as the fruit of a sacrifice.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-13', 'en', 'So saying, the best of sages set out with the sages and Kakutstha, taking leave of the forest deities.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-14', 'en', '''Farewell. Having succeeded, I leave Siddhashrama for the Himalaya on the north bank of the Ganga.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-15', 'en', 'Walking reverently around the matchless Siddhashrama, he set out toward the north.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-16', 'en', 'As the best of sages went, a hundred carts of the Brahmin followers went behind him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-17', 'en', 'Even the deer and birds of Siddhashrama followed the great sage Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-18', 'en', 'Having gone a long way, as the sun was sinking, the sages camped attentively on the bank of the Shona.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-19', 'en', 'When the sun had set, having bathed and offered into the fire, the sages of boundless power sat down with Vishvamitra in front.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-20', 'en', 'Rama and Lakshmana honoured the sages and sat in front of wise Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-21', 'en', 'Then radiant Rama, full of curiosity, asked the great sage Vishvamitra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-22', 'en', '''Lord, what land is this, adorned with rich forests? I wish to hear; please tell me truly.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-30-23', 'en', 'Urged by Rama''s words, the sage of good vows told the whole story of that land among the sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-1', 'en', 'There was a great ascetic named Kusha, born of Brahma. By a princess of Vidarbha he had four worthy sons: Kushamba, Kushanabha, Adhurtarajasa and Vasu.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-2', 'en', 'Wishing them to follow the warrior''s duty, Kusha told his radiant, energetic, righteous and truthful sons: ''Rule and protect, my sons; you will gain much merit.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-3', 'en', 'Hearing Kusha, the four, esteemed by the world, founded cities.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-4', 'en', 'Radiant Kushamba made the city of Kaushambi, and righteous Kushanabha the great city Mahodaya.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-5', 'en', 'King Adhurtarajasa made the fine city Dharmaranya, Rama, and Vasu made Girivraja.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-6', 'en', 'This land is Vasumati, of great Vasu, Rama; these five great mountains shine all around.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-7', 'en', 'The lovely river Sumagadhi flows to the famous Magadhas, shining like a garland among the five great mountains.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-8', 'en', 'This is the Magadhi of great Vasu, Rama, lined with good fields and garlanded with crops.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-9', 'en', 'Righteous royal sage Kushanabha fathered a hundred matchless daughters by Ghritachi, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-10', 'en', 'Young, beautiful and adorned, they came to the garden, like lightning in the rains,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-11', 'en', 'singing, dancing and playing music, Raghava, and wearing fine ornaments, they were very happy.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-12', 'en', 'Lovely in every limb and unmatched in beauty on earth, they were in the garden like stars among clouds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-13', 'en', 'Seeing them, endowed with every virtue, youth and beauty, Vayu, the all-pervading wind, said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-14', 'en', '''I desire you all; you will be my wives. Give up your human state and you will gain long life.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-15', 'en', 'Hearing Vayu, whose deeds are effortless, the hundred maidens laughed at his words and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-16', 'en', '''You move within all beings, best of gods. We all know your power; why do you insult us?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-17', 'en', '''We daughters of Kushanabha are able to topple you from your place, god, but we preserve our austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-18', 'en', '''Foolish one, may that time never come when we disregard our truthful father and choose a husband ourselves.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-19', 'en', '''Our father is our lord and our highest deity. Whomever he gives us to will be our husband.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-20', 'en', 'Hearing them, Vayu became furious; entering all their limbs, the lord twisted them.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-21', 'en', 'The maidens, deformed by Vayu, entered the king''s house. Seeing them so, the king, alarmed, said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-31-22', 'en', '''What is this, daughters? Tell me. Who disregards dharma? Who made you all hunchbacked, that you writhe and do not speak?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-1', 'en', 'Hearing wise Kushanabha''s words, the hundred maidens touched his feet with their heads and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-2', 'en', '''King, Vayu, who is in all things, wished to assault us. Taking an evil path, he did not regard dharma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-3', 'en', '''We said: "We have a father, bless you; we are not free to choose. Ask our father whether he will give us to you."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-4', 'en', '''Saying this, we were all struck hard by Vayu, who was bound to evil and would not accept our words.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-5', 'en', 'Hearing them, the most righteous and radiant king answered his hundred matchless daughters:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-6', 'en', '''Daughters, you have shown the patience of the patient; you have done a great thing, acting as one and preserving my family''s honour.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-7', 'en', '''Forbearance is the ornament of women, and of men too. That you forgave is hard to do, especially toward the gods.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-8', 'en', '''Daughters, such forbearance as you all have equally: forbearance is giving, forbearance is sacrifice, forbearance is truth, my girls.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-9', 'en', '''Forbearance is glory, forbearance is dharma; the world rests on forbearance.'' Then the king, of godlike valour, dismissed his daughters, Kakutstha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-10', 'en', 'Skilled in counsel, he consulted with his ministers about giving them in marriage, and about a fitting place, time and match.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-11', 'en', 'At that very time a great sage named Chuli, celibate and of pure conduct, was practising Brahmic austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-12', 'en', 'A gandharva woman named Somada, daughter of Urmila, attended on that sage as he practised.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-13', 'en', 'Bowing to him and devoted to serving him, the righteous woman stayed there in time, and the teacher was pleased with her.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-14', 'en', 'In due course he said to her: ''I am very pleased, bless you. What may I do for you?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-15', 'en', 'Knowing the sage was pleased, the sweet-voiced gandharva woman, skilled in speech, happily said to him:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-16', 'en', '''You are endowed with Brahmic glory, one with Brahman and great in austerity. I want a righteous son endowed with Brahmic austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-17', 'en', '''I have no husband and am no one''s wife. Since I have come to you, a Brahmin, please give me a son.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-18', 'en', 'Pleased with her, the Brahmin sage gave her an excellent son born of his mind, known as Brahmadatta.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-19', 'en', 'King Brahmadatta lived in the city of Kampilya in great splendour, as the king of the gods lives in heaven.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-20', 'en', 'The righteous King Kushanabha decided to give his hundred daughters to Brahmadatta, Kakutstha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-21', 'en', 'Summoning radiant Brahmadatta, the king gave him the hundred daughters with a glad heart.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-22', 'en', 'Then King Brahmadatta took their hands one by one, like the lord of the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-23', 'en', 'As soon as he touched their hands, the hundred maidens were straightened, freed from pain, and shone with great beauty.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-24', 'en', 'Seeing them freed from Vayu''s harm, King Kushanabha was overjoyed again and again.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-25', 'en', 'The king sent off King Brahmadatta, now married, with his wives and his priests.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-32-26', 'en', 'Somada too, delighted at her son''s fitting marriage, welcomed her daughters-in-law properly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-1', 'en', 'When the married Brahmadatta had left, Raghava, childless Kushanabha held a rite to gain a son.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-2', 'en', 'During the rite, Kusha, son of Brahma, very pleased, said to King Kushanabha:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-3', 'en', '''Son, you will have a son like you, very righteous, named Gadhi. Through him you will gain lasting fame in the world.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-4', 'en', 'So saying to King Kushanabha, Kusha rose into the sky and went to the eternal world of Brahma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-5', 'en', 'In time, a very righteous son named Gadhi was born to wise Kushanabha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-6', 'en', 'That very righteous Gadhi is my father, Kakutstha. Born in Kusha''s line, I am Kaushika, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-7', 'en', 'And I had an elder sister of good vows, Raghava, named Satyavati, given in marriage to Richika.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-8', 'en', 'Following her husband, she went to heaven in her body, and the most noble Kaushiki became a great river.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-9', 'en', 'Divine, with holy waters, lovely, lying along the Himalaya, my sister flowed forth for the good of the world.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-10', 'en', 'So I live happily and disciplined on the Himalaya''s slopes, out of love for my sister Kaushiki, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-11', 'en', 'That holy Satyavati, established in truth and dharma, devoted to her husband and greatly blessed, is Kaushiki, best of rivers.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-12', 'en', 'For my vow I left her and came to Siddhashrama, Rama, and by your power I have succeeded.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-13', 'en', 'This, Rama, is my origin and the story of my line and this land, which you asked about, mighty-armed one.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-14', 'en', 'Half the night has passed as I told these stories, Kakutstha. Go to sleep, bless you, so our journey is not delayed.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-15', 'en', 'All the trees are still, the deer and birds are hidden, and the directions are filled with the dark of night, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-16', 'en', 'Twilight slowly fades; the sky, as if covered with eyes, shines with dense stars and lights.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-17', 'en', 'The cool-rayed moon rises, dispelling the world''s darkness and gladdening the minds of beings with its light.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-18', 'en', 'Night creatures roam here and there, hosts of yakshas and demons, fierce and flesh-eating.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-19', 'en', 'Saying this, the radiant great sage fell silent, and all the sages honoured him, saying ''Excellent!''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-33-20', 'en', 'Rama, with Lakshmana, somewhat amazed, praised the tiger among sages and went to sleep.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-1', 'en', 'Having spent the rest of the night with the great sages on the bank of the Shona, when dawn broke, Vishvamitra said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-2', 'en', '''The night has dawned, Rama; the morning twilight is here. Rise, rise, bless you, and prepare to go.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-3', 'en', 'Hearing him, Rama performed his morning rites, got ready to go, and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-4', 'en', '''This Shona has clear water, is fordable and lined with sandbanks. By which way shall we cross, Brahmin?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-5', 'en', 'Vishvamitra said: ''This is the path I have chosen, by which the great sages go.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-6', 'en', 'Having gone a long way, at midday they saw the Ganga, best of rivers, frequented by sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-7', 'en', 'Seeing her holy waters, frequented by swans and cranes, the sages and the Raghavas were delighted and camped on her bank.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-8', 'en', 'Then, having bathed properly, offered water to ancestors and gods, made their fire offerings and eaten the nectar-like offering,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-9', 'en', 'they sat on the pure bank of the Ganga, happy at heart, surrounding great Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-10', 'en', 'Delighted, Rama said to Vishvamitra: ''Lord, I wish to hear about the Ganga, the river of three paths. How did she cross the three worlds and reach the ocean?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-11', 'en', 'Urged by Rama''s words, the great sage Vishvamitra began to tell of the Ganga''s birth and growth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-12', 'en', '''The lord of mountains, Himavat, is a great mine of minerals. He had two daughters unmatched in beauty on earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-13', 'en', '''Their mother was slender-waisted Mena, daughter of Meru, the charming and beloved wife of Himavat.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-14', 'en', '''From her was born Ganga, Himavat''s elder daughter. The second daughter was named Uma, Raghava.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-15', 'en', '''Then all the gods, wishing to serve the gods'' cause, asked the lord of mountains for the elder daughter, Ganga, river of three paths.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-16', 'en', '''Himavat duly gave his daughter Ganga, purifier of the worlds and free-flowing, for the good of the three worlds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-17', 'en', '''Receiving her for the three worlds, the gods, doers of the worlds'' good, took Ganga and went away content.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-18', 'en', '''The other daughter of the mountain, joy of the Raghus, undertook a fierce vow and practised austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-19', 'en', '''The lord of mountains gave his daughter Uma, honoured by the world and endowed with fierce austerity, to the incomparable Rudra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-20', 'en', '''These are the two daughters of the mountain king, honoured by the world: Ganga, best of rivers, and the goddess Uma, Raghava.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-34-21', 'en', '''I have told you, dear one, how the river of three paths first went to the sky, best of travellers.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-1', 'en', 'When the sage had spoken, the heroes Rama and Lakshmana praised the story and said to the best of sages:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-2', 'en', '''You have told a righteous and excellent story, Brahmin. Please tell us about the elder daughter of the mountain king.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-3', 'en', '''You know the details: tell us at length of her divine and human origin. Why does the purifier of the world purify three paths?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-4', 'en', '''How did the Ganga become famous as the river of three paths, best of rivers, in the three worlds, knower of dharma, and by what deeds?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-5', 'en', 'As Kakutstha spoke, Vishvamitra, rich in austerity, told the whole story among the sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-6', 'en', '''Long ago, Rama, the blue-throated great ascetic Shiva, having married, looked on the goddess with desire and began to make love.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-7', 'en', '''A hundred divine years passed for the blue-throated god, yet no son was born of her, scorcher of foes.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-8', 'en', '''Then the gods, led by Brahma, became anxious: "Who could bear whatever being is born from this?"', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-9', 'en', '''All the gods approached, bowed and said: "God of gods, great god, devoted to the good of this world, be gracious at the gods'' prostration.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-10', 'en', '''"The worlds cannot bear your power, best of gods. With Brahmic austerity, practise austerity with the goddess.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-11', 'en', '''"For the good of the three worlds, hold your energy within yourself. Protect all these worlds; do not destroy them."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-12', 'en', '''Hearing the gods, the great lord of all worlds said "Very well" to all of them, and then said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-13', 'en', '''"With Uma I will hold my energy within myself. Let the gods and earth be at peace.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-14', 'en', '''"But this supreme energy of mine that has already been stirred from its place: tell me, best of gods, who will hold it?"', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-15', 'en', '''Told this, the gods replied to the bull-bannered god: "The earth will hold this energy that has been stirred."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-16', 'en', '''Told this, the lord of the gods released it on the earth, and the earth with its mountains and forests was pervaded by that energy.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-17', 'en', '''Then the gods said to Agni: "Enter this great, fierce energy together with Vayu."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-18', 'en', '''Pervaded again by fire, it became the White Mountain and a divine reed forest shining like fire and sun, where radiant Kartikeya, born of fire, was born.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-19', 'en', '''Then the gods and sages, very pleased, greatly honoured Uma and Shiva.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-20', 'en', '''But the mountain''s daughter, her eyes red with anger, in her wrath cursed all the gods, Rama:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-21', 'en', '''"Since you stopped me when I was united with my husband wishing for a son, you shall not beget children with your own wives. From today, your wives shall be childless."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-22', 'en', '''Having said this to all the gods, she cursed the earth too: "Earth, you will have many forms and many husbands.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-23', 'en', '''"Foolish one, clouded by my anger, since you did not want my son, you will never know the joy of having a son."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-24', 'en', '''Seeing all the gods ashamed, the lord of the gods set out toward the west, guarded by Varuna.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-25', 'en', '''There the great lord practised austerity with the goddess, on the northern side of a Himalayan peak.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-35-26', 'en', '''I have told you at length about the mountain''s daughter, Rama. Now hear with Lakshmana about the origin of the Ganga.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-1', 'en', 'Long ago, while the god practised austerity, the gods and sages, wanting a commander for their army, went to Brahma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-2', 'en', 'All the gods, with Indra and Agni in front, bowed to Lord Brahma and spoke auspicious words:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-3', 'en', '''The god whom you once gave us to bring forth our commander is now practising supreme austerity with Uma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-4', 'en', '''Arrange what must be done next for the good of the worlds, knower of ordinances; you are our highest refuge.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-5', 'en', 'Hearing the gods, the grandfather of all worlds comforted them with sweet words and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-6', 'en', '''What the mountain''s daughter said is true: you will not have children by your wives. Her word stands, without doubt.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-7', 'en', '''This Ganga of the sky: in her, Agni will beget a son, a commander for the gods, a destroyer of foes.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-8', 'en', '''The elder daughter of the mountain king will honour that son, and it will be highly pleasing to Uma, without doubt.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-9', 'en', 'Hearing this, Raghava, the gods felt their purpose was achieved; they bowed and honoured Brahma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-10', 'en', 'Going to Mount Kailasa, adorned with minerals, all the gods appointed Agni to beget a son.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-11', 'en', '''Accomplish this task of the gods, Agni. Release the great energy into Ganga, the mountain''s daughter.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-12', 'en', 'Agreeing with the gods, Agni approached Ganga: ''Goddess, bear this embryo; it is the gods'' wish.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-13', 'en', 'Hearing this, she took on a divine form. Seeing her greatness, he spread himself all around her.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-14', 'en', 'Agni poured himself over the goddess on all sides, and all Ganga''s streams were filled, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-15', 'en', 'Then Ganga said to Agni, priest of all the gods: ''I cannot bear your fierce energy, god. I am burning with that fire and my mind is in agony.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-16', 'en', 'Agni of all the gods said to Ganga: ''Place this embryo here at the foot of the Himalaya.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-17', 'en', 'Hearing Agni, the mighty Ganga released that very brilliant embryo from her streams, sinless one.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-18', 'en', 'What came forth from her, shining like refined gold, reached the earth as gold, pure and beautiful.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-19', 'en', 'From its sharpness copper and black iron were born; its dross became tin and lead.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-20', 'en', 'Reaching the earth, it grew into many minerals.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-21', 'en', 'As soon as the embryo was placed there, the whole forest on the mountain turned golden, coloured by its radiance.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-22', 'en', 'From then on, Raghava, gold, shining like fire, has been called jatarupa, ''native form''.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-23', 'en', 'Then Indra and the Maruts appointed the Krittikas to nurse the newborn boy with milk.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-24', 'en', 'Making an excellent agreement, ''This is the son of us all'', they gave milk to the newborn.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-25', 'en', 'Then all the gods said: ''Kartikeya will be a son famous in the three worlds, without doubt.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-26', 'en', 'Hearing them, they bathed the child, who had slipped out with the flow of the womb, shining like fire with great splendour.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-27', 'en', 'The gods called the fortunate Kartikeya, blazing like fire, Skanda, because he slipped (skanna) from the flow of the womb.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-28', 'en', 'Then the Krittikas'' excellent milk appeared; becoming six-faced, he drank the breast-milk of all six.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-29', 'en', 'Drinking milk for one day, the tender-bodied lord conquered the hosts of demon armies by his own might.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-30', 'en', 'Then the gods led by Agni came together and consecrated that one of spotless radiance as commander of the gods'' armies.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-36-31', 'en', 'This, Rama, is the full story of Ganga I have told you, and the birth of Kumara, blessed and holy.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-1', 'en', 'Having told that story sweetly to Rama, Kaushika said another thing to Kakutstha:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-2', 'en', '''Long ago there was a brave king of Ayodhya named Sagara, righteous, longing for children but childless.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-3', 'en', '''His elder wife, daughter of the king of Vidarbha, was named Keshini, Rama, most righteous and truthful.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-4', 'en', '''His second wife, Arishtanemi''s daughter, unmatched in beauty on earth, was named Sumati.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-5', 'en', '''With those two wives the king practised austerity on the Himalaya, on the mountain Bhriguprasravana.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-6', 'en', '''When a hundred years were complete, the sage Bhrigu, best of the truthful, won by austerity, gave Sagara a boon:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-7', 'en', '''"You will gain very many children, sinless one, and unmatched fame in the world, bull among men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-8', 'en', '''"One wife will bear a son to continue your line; the other will bear sixty thousand sons."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-9', 'en', '''As the tiger among men spoke, the two queens, delighted, folded their hands and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-10', 'en', '''"Brahmin, whose will be the one son, and who will bear many? We wish to hear. May your word be true."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-11', 'en', '''Hearing them, the most righteous Bhrigu said: "Choose for yourselves.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-12', 'en', '''"One line-continuer, or many very strong, famous, energetic sons: who wants which boon?"', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-13', 'en', '''Hearing the sage, Keshini chose the one son to continue the line, in the king''s presence.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-14', 'en', '''Sumati, sister of Suparna (Garuda), chose sixty thousand energetic and famous sons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-15', 'en', '''Circling the sage and bowing to him, the king went to his city with his wives.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-16', 'en', '''In time the elder, Keshini, bore a son of Sagara named Asamanja.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-17', 'en', '''Sumati, tiger among men, bore a gourd-like embryo; from the splitting of the gourd sixty thousand sons came out.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-18', 'en', '''Nurses raised them in jars full of ghee, and in time they all reached youth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-19', 'en', '''After a long time Sagara''s sixty thousand sons grew handsome and youthful.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-20', 'en', '''But Sagara''s own eldest son, best of men, used to seize children, throw them into the Sarayu, and laugh as he watched them drown.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-21', 'en', '''Bent on harming the citizens, he was banished from the city by his father.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-22', 'en', '''Asamanja''s son was the valiant Amshuman, esteemed by all and kind-spoken to everyone.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-23', 'en', '''After a long time, best of men, Sagara firmly resolved: "I will perform a sacrifice."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-37-24', 'en', '''Having decided, the king, who knew the Vedas, began the sacrifice with his priests.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-1', 'en', 'Hearing Vishvamitra''s words at the story''s end, the joy of the Raghus, delighted, said to the sage blazing like fire:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-2', 'en', '''I wish to hear this story in detail, bless you. How did my ancestor perform his sacrifice, Brahmin?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-3', 'en', 'Vishvamitra, as if smiling, said to Kakutstha: ''Hear in detail, Rama, about great Sagara.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-4', 'en', '''The Himalaya, best of mountains, father-in-law of Shankara, and the Vindhya mountain look at each other.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-5', 'en', '''Between them that sacrifice took place, best of men, for that land is praised for sacrifices.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-6', 'en', '''Kakutstha, the great chariot-warrior Amshuman with his firm bow guarded the horse''s wandering, as Sagara wished.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-7', 'en', '''On the festival day of the sacrifice, Indra, taking a demon''s form, stole the sacrificial horse.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-8', 'en', '''As the great one''s horse was stolen, all the priests said to the sacrificer:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-9', 'en', '''"On this festival day the horse is being swiftly taken away. Kill the thief and bring back the horse, Kakutstha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-10', 'en', '''"This is a flaw in the sacrifice, unlucky for us all. Act so the rite is without flaw, king."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-11', 'en', '''Hearing the priests in that assembly, the king said this to his sixty thousand sons:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-12', 'en', '''"Sons, I see no way for demons to enter here, for this great sacrifice is guarded by mantra-purified great sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-13', 'en', '''"So go and search, my sons, bless you. Go over the whole earth girdled by the sea.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-14', 'en', '''"Each of you, sons, cover one league of ground.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-15', 'en', '''"Dig up the earth until you see the horse, searching for that horse thief at my command.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-16', 'en', '''"Consecrated as I am, I will stay here with my grandson and priests until the horse is found. Bless you."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-17', 'en', '''Told this, the mighty princes, glad at heart, went over the earth, bound by their father''s word.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-18', 'en', '''Each split a league of the earth''s surface, tiger among men, with arms hard as thunderbolts,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-19', 'en', '''with spears like lightning and very fearsome ploughs. As she was torn, the earth cried out, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-20', 'en', 'Raghava, there arose the unbearable cry of serpents, asuras, demons and other beings being killed.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-21', 'en', 'The heroes split the earth for sixty thousand leagues down to the deep underworld, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-22', 'en', 'So, digging, the princes went all around Jambudvipa, crowded with mountains, tiger among kings.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-23', 'en', 'Then the gods with the gandharvas, asuras and serpents, all alarmed, went to Brahma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-24', 'en', 'With sad faces, very frightened, they appealed to the great one and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-25', 'en', '''Lord, the whole earth is being dug up by Sagara''s sons, and many great water creatures are being killed.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-38-26', 'en', '''Saying "This one wrecked our sacrifice; this one took the horse", Sagara''s sons are killing all beings.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-1', 'en', 'Hearing the gods, Lord Brahma answered them, terrified and bewildered by the force of fate:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-2', 'en', '''The wise Vasudeva, to whom this whole earth belongs, in the form of Kapila, always supports the earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-3', 'en', '''This splitting of the earth was foreseen long ago, and so was the destruction of Sagara''s short-lived sons.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-4', 'en', 'Hearing Brahma, the thirty-three gods, very glad, went back the way they had come.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-5', 'en', 'As the earth was being split by Sagara''s great sons, a sound like a thunderclap arose.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-6', 'en', 'Having split the whole earth and gone all around it, all the sons of Sagara came together and said to their father:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-7', 'en', '''We have gone over the whole earth and killed powerful beings: gods, danavas, demons, pishachas, serpents and kinnaras.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-8', 'en', '''But we do not see the horse or its thief. What shall we do, bless you? Think about it.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-9', 'en', 'Hearing his sons, Sagara, best of kings, said angrily, joy of the Raghus:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-10', 'en', '''Dig again, bless you, breaking through the earth''s surface. Find the horse thief and return successful.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-11', 'en', 'Following great Sagara''s word, the sixty thousand sons rushed down to the underworld.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-12', 'en', 'As they dug, they saw a quarter-elephant like a mountain, Virupaksha, holding up the earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-13', 'en', 'The great elephant Virupaksha held on his head the whole earth with its mountains and forests, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-14', 'en', 'When, at the turn of seasons, the great elephant shakes his head from weariness to rest, then there is an earthquake, Kakutstha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-15', 'en', 'Circling that great elephant, guardian of the quarter, and honouring him, Rama, they went on, splitting the underworld.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-16', 'en', 'Then, breaking through the east and then the south, they saw there the great elephant Mahapadma, like a huge mountain, holding up the earth with its head; they were filled with wonder.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-17', 'en', 'There they saw the great Mahapadma, huge as a mountain, holding the earth with his head, and they were greatly amazed.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-18', 'en', 'Then, circling him, the sixty thousand sons of great Sagara broke into the west.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-19', 'en', 'In the west too, the mighty ones saw a great quarter-elephant like a mountain, Saumanasa.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-20', 'en', 'Circling him and asking after his health, they went digging toward the north, the quarter of Soma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-21', 'en', 'In the north, best of Raghus, they saw Bhadra, white as snow, holding up this earth with his auspicious body.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-22', 'en', 'Touching him and circling him, the sixty thousand sons split the earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-23', 'en', 'Then, going to the famous north-east, all the sons of Sagara dug the earth in anger.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-24', 'en', 'There they saw the eternal Vasudeva as Kapila, and the god''s horse grazing not far off.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-25', 'en', 'Thinking him the wrecker of the sacrifice, their eyes clouded with anger, they rushed at him, shouting ''Stop! Stop!''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-26', 'en', '''You have stolen our sacrificial horse! Fool, know that we, the sons of Sagara, have come!''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-27', 'en', 'Hearing their words, Kapila, filled with great anger, let out the sound ''Hum!''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-39-28', 'en', 'Then, by that immeasurable great Kapila, all the sons of Sagara were turned into heaps of ash, Kakutstha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-1', 'en', 'Knowing his sons had been gone long, King Sagara said to his grandson, shining with his own power:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-2', 'en', '''You are brave and learned, equal in power to your forebears. Follow your fathers'' path and find the one who took the horse.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-3', 'en', '''There are mighty and great beings beneath the earth. To ward them off, take your bow and sword.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-4', 'en', '''Salute those who deserve salutation, kill those who obstruct, and return successful, bringing my sacrifice to completion.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-5', 'en', 'Told this by great Sagara, Amshuman took his bow and sword and went swiftly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-6', 'en', 'Urged by the king, he entered the underground path dug by his great uncles, best of men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-7', 'en', 'The radiant one saw the quarter-elephant being honoured by daityas, danavas, demons, pishachas, birds and serpents.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-8', 'en', 'Circling him and asking after his health, he asked about his uncles and the horse thief.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-9', 'en', 'Hearing this, the quarter-elephant said kindly: ''Son of Asamanja, you will succeed and soon return with the horse.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-10', 'en', 'Hearing him, he began to ask all the quarter-elephants in order and properly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-11', 'en', 'Honoured by all those guardians of the quarters, skilled in speech, he was told: ''You will go with the horse.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-12', 'en', 'Hearing them, he went swiftly to where his uncles, the sons of Sagara, had been turned into heaps of ash.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-13', 'en', 'Overcome by sorrow, the son of Asamanja cried out in deep grief at their death.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-14', 'en', 'Grief-stricken, the tiger among men saw the sacrificial horse grazing nearby.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-15', 'en', 'Wishing to perform the water rite for them, the radiant one looked for water but saw no lake.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-16', 'en', 'Looking around keenly, he saw the lord of birds, Suparna, swift as wind, his uncles'' maternal uncle, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-17', 'en', 'Mighty Vainateya said to him: ''Do not grieve, tiger among men. This killing was approved by the world.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-18', 'en', '''These mighty ones were burned by immeasurable Kapila. You should not give them ordinary water, wise one.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-19', 'en', '''Ganga, the elder daughter of the Himalaya, purifier of the world, can purify these heaps of ash.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-20', 'en', '''When this ash is wetted by Ganga, beloved of the world, she will lead the sixty thousand sons to heaven.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-21', 'en', '''Take the horse and go, fortunate one. Complete your grandfather''s sacrifice, hero.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-22', 'en', 'Hearing Suparna, the very powerful and famous Amshuman quickly took the horse and returned.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-23', 'en', 'Coming to the consecrated king, he reported what had happened and what Suparna had said.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-24', 'en', 'Hearing Amshuman''s dreadful report, the king completed the sacrifice according to rule.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-25', 'en', 'Having completed the sacrifice, the glorious king went to his city, but could find no way to bring down the Ganga.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-40-26', 'en', 'Without finding a way, the great king, after ruling for thirty thousand years, went to heaven.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-1', 'en', 'When Sagara had died, Rama, the people chose the very righteous Amshuman as king.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-2', 'en', 'Amshuman was a very great king, and his son was the great Dilipa, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-3', 'en', 'Placing the kingdom in Dilipa''s hands, he practised very harsh austerity on a lovely Himalayan peak.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-4', 'en', 'After thirty-two thousand years in the forest of austerity, the famous king, rich in austerity, gained heaven.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-5', 'en', 'Radiant Dilipa, hearing of his grandfathers'' death, his mind struck by sorrow, could find no solution.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-6', 'en', '''How can the Ganga be brought down? How can their water rite be done? How can I save them?'' He was absorbed in these thoughts.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-7', 'en', 'As he thought on this, a very righteous son named Bhagiratha was born to him, who knew himself through dharma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-8', 'en', 'Radiant Dilipa performed many sacrifices and ruled for thirty thousand years.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-9', 'en', 'Without finding a way to save them, the king died of illness, tiger among men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-10', 'en', 'Installing his son Bhagiratha as king, the bull among men went to Indra''s world by his own deeds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-11', 'en', 'Bhagiratha, a righteous royal sage, was radiant but childless, longing for children.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-12', 'en', 'He practised long austerity at Gokarna, joy of the Raghus: arms raised, between five fires, eating once a month, master of his senses.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-13', 'en', 'After thousands of years of fearsome austerity, Lord Brahma, lord of creatures, was very pleased.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-14', 'en', 'Coming with the gods, Brahma said to great Bhagiratha, who was practising austerity:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-15', 'en', '''Fortunate Bhagiratha, lord of men, I am pleased with your well-practised austerity. Choose a boon, man of good vows.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-16', 'en', 'Standing with folded hands, the radiant and fortunate Bhagiratha said to the grandfather of all worlds:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-17', 'en', '''If you are pleased with me, lord, and if my austerity has fruit, may all the sons of Sagara receive water from me.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-18', 'en', '''When the ashes of those great ones are wetted by Ganga''s water, may all my great-grandfathers go to heaven forever.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-19', 'en', '''And grant me offspring, lord, so our family does not perish. Let this be my supreme boon for the Ikshvaku line.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-20', 'en', 'When the king had spoken, the grandfather of all worlds replied in fair, sweet words:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-21', 'en', '''This is a great wish, Bhagiratha, great chariot-warrior. Let it be so, bless you, you who increase the Ikshvaku line.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-22', 'en', '''This is Ganga of the Himalaya, the mountain''s elder daughter. To bear her, king, Hara (Shiva) must be engaged.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-23', 'en', '''The earth cannot bear the Ganga''s fall, king. I see no one but the trident-bearer to hold her, hero.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-41-24', 'en', 'Having told this to the king and spoken to the Ganga, the creator of the world went to heaven with all the Maruts.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-1', 'en', 'When the god of gods had gone, Bhagiratha, pressing the earth with the tip of his big toe, worshipped for a year, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-2', 'en', 'When the year was complete, Uma''s husband, lord of creatures, honoured by all worlds, said to the king:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-3', 'en', '''I am pleased with you, best of men; I will do what you wish. I will bear the mountain king''s daughter on my head.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-4', 'en', 'Then the elder daughter of the Himalaya, honoured by all, took a huge form with unbearable force and fell from the sky onto Shiva''s auspicious head, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-5', 'en', 'Bewildered by the circle of his matted locks, the goddess could find no way out and wandered there for many years.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-6', 'en', 'Very pleased by Bhagiratha, Hara then released the Ganga toward Lake Bindu, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-7', 'en', 'From the sky to Shankara''s head and then to the earth she came; her water spread out with a fierce roar.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-8', 'en', 'The gods, sages, gandharvas, yakshas and perfected ones watched the river come down from the sky to the earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-9', 'en', 'The gods stood there in city-like aerial chariots, on horses and fine elephants, and on floating craft.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-10', 'en', 'Wishing to see that most wonderful descent of the Ganga, the gods of boundless power gathered.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-11', 'en', 'With the gods flying down and the brilliance of their ornaments, the cloudless sky shone as if with a hundred suns.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-12', 'en', 'With dolphins, serpents and darting fish, the sky looked as if lightning were flashing across it.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-13', 'en', 'With white bursts of spray scattered a thousandfold, the sky looked strewn with autumn clouds and flocks of swans.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-14', 'en', 'Here she ran fast, there crooked, here spread wide, there bent low, here leaping up, there flowing slowly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-15', 'en', 'In places water struck water again; rising again and again, it fell back to the earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-16', 'en', 'Fallen from Shankara''s head and then onto the earth, that water shone pure and free of taint.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-17', 'en', 'Sages, gandharvas and earth-dwellers touched the water that had fallen from Bhava''s body, thinking it holy.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-18', 'en', 'Those who had fallen from the sky to earth by a curse bathed there and were freed of their sins.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-19', 'en', 'With sins washed away by that shining water, they entered the sky again and reached their own worlds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-20', 'en', 'The world rejoiced in that shining water; bathing in the Ganga, people were freed from weariness.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-21', 'en', 'Royal sage Bhagiratha, mounted on a divine chariot, went ahead, and the Ganga followed behind him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-22', 'en', 'All the gods with the sages, daityas, danavas, demons, the best gandharvas and yakshas, kinnaras and great serpents,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-23', 'en', 'and all the apsaras, Rama, following Bhagiratha''s chariot, gladly followed the Ganga, with all the water creatures.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-42-24', 'en', 'Wherever King Bhagiratha went, there went the glorious Ganga, best of rivers, destroyer of all sins.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-1', 'en', 'The king, followed by the Ganga, went to the ocean and entered the depths of the earth where they had been turned to ash.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-2', 'en', 'When the ashes were flooded with Ganga''s water, Brahma, lord of all worlds, said to the king:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-3', 'en', '''Tiger among men, the sixty thousand sons of great Sagara are saved and have gone to heaven like gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-4', 'en', '''As long as the ocean''s water lasts in the world, king, so long will Sagara''s sons stay in heaven like gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-5', 'en', '''And Ganga will be your elder daughter, and will be famed in the world by a name you gave her:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-6', 'en', '''Ganga, the river of three paths, and the divine Bhagirathi. Because she makes three paths holy, she is called Tripathaga.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-7', 'en', '''Here, lord of men, offer water to all your forefathers, king. Fulfil your vow.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-8', 'en', '''Your famous ancestor Sagara, best of the righteous, did not achieve this wish.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-9', 'en', '''Nor did Amshuman, of matchless power, who asked to bring the Ganga, fulfil the vow.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-10', 'en', '''Nor did the royal sage, virtuous, as radiant as a great sage, equal to me in austerity and firm in the warrior''s duty,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-11', 'en', '''your very radiant father Dilipa, fortunate and sinless, succeed in bringing the Ganga, though he asked.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-12', 'en', '''You have fulfilled that vow, bull among men, and gained supreme, honoured fame in the world.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-13', 'en', '''By bringing the Ganga down, destroyer of foes, you have gained a great home of dharma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-14', 'en', '''Bathe yourself in this water, best of men, as is ever fitting. Be pure and gain the fruit of merit.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-15', 'en', '''Perform the water rites for all your forefathers. Farewell; I will go to my world. Go, king.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-16', 'en', 'Saying this, the famous lord of gods, grandfather of all worlds, returned to the world of the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-17', 'en', 'Royal sage Bhagiratha, having duly made the excellent water offering to the sons of Sagara, pure and his rites done, entered his own city.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-18', 'en', 'His purpose achieved, the best of men ruled his kingdom. The people rejoiced at having him, Raghava, and were free of sorrow, prosperous and untroubled.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-19', 'en', '''This, Rama, is the full story of the Ganga I have told you. Fare well, bless you; the time of twilight is passing.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-43-20', 'en', '''This story of the descent of the Ganga that I have told brings blessing, fame, long life, heaven and children.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-1', 'en', 'Hearing Vishvamitra''s words, Raghava with Lakshmana, filled with wonder, said to Vishvamitra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-2', 'en', '''Most wonderful is this holy story you have told, Brahmin, of the descent of the Ganga and the filling of the ocean.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-3', 'en', 'That whole night passed for him with Lakshmana as he thought about Vishvamitra''s auspicious story.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-4', 'en', 'In the clear morning, having done his daily rites, Raghava said to the great sage Vishvamitra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-5', 'en', '''The blessed night has passed; I have heard what is supremely worth hearing. The night seemed but a moment as I thought over your whole story, great ascetic.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-6', 'en', '''Let us cross the holy river of three paths. Here is a comfortable boat of the holy sages, which has come quickly knowing you are here.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-7', 'en', 'Hearing great Raghava, the sage with the sages and Raghavas had the crossing made.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-8', 'en', 'Reaching the north bank and honouring the sages, they settled on the Ganga''s bank and saw the city of Vishala.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-9', 'en', 'Then the best of sages quickly went with the Raghavas to lovely Vishala, divine and like heaven.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-10', 'en', 'Then very wise Rama, with folded hands, asked the great sage Vishvamitra about that fine city Vishala:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-11', 'en', '''Which royal line rules in Vishala, great sage? I wish to hear, bless you; I am very curious.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-12', 'en', 'Hearing Rama''s words, the best of sages began to tell the ancient history of Vishala.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-13', 'en', '''Listen, Rama, as I tell the fine story of Indra, of what happened in this land. Hear it truly, Raghava.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-14', 'en', '''Long ago, in the Krita age, Rama, the sons of Diti were very strong, and the sons of Aditi were fortunate, valiant and very righteous.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-15', 'en', '''Then the great ones thought: "How can we become immortal, ageless and free from sickness?"', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-16', 'en', '''As the wise ones thought, they decided: "By churning the ocean of milk we will obtain the elixir."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-17', 'en', '''So, resolved on churning, they made the serpent Vasuki the rope and Mount Mandara the churning stick, and churned with boundless strength.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-18', 'en', '''Then Dhanvantari and the radiant apsaras arose; since these fine women came from churning the waters (ap), they became apsaras.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-19', 'en', '''There were six hundred million of those radiant apsaras, and countless attendants, Kakutstha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-20', 'en', '''None of the gods or danavas accepted them as wives; because they were not taken, they are called common to all.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-21', 'en', '''Then Varuna''s daughter Varuni, goddess of wine, arose, seeking someone to take her.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-22', 'en', '''The sons of Diti did not take Varuna''s daughter, Rama, but the sons of Aditi took the blameless one.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-23', 'en', '''So the sons of Diti are called asuras, and the sons of Aditi suras; the suras were happy at taking Varuni.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-24', 'en', '''Then Uchchaihshravas, the best of horses, the jewel Kaustubha, and the supreme nectar rose up, best of men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-25', 'en', '''For that nectar a great destruction of the family took place, Rama: Aditi''s sons killed Diti''s sons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-26', 'en', '''The heroic sons of Aditi killed the sons of Diti in that terrible great war between them.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-44-27', 'en', '''Having killed the sons of Diti and gained the kingdom, Indra joyfully ruled the worlds with the sages and charanas.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-1', 'en', 'When those sons were killed, Diti, in great sorrow, said to her husband Kashyapa, son of Marichi, Rama:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-2', 'en', '''Lord, my sons have been killed by your mighty sons. I want a son, won by long austerity, who will kill Indra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-3', 'en', '''I will practise austerity; please give me a child. Please permit such a slayer of Indra.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-4', 'en', 'Hearing her, radiant Kashyapa, son of Marichi, answered the deeply grieving Diti:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-5', 'en', '''So be it, bless you. Stay pure, rich in austerity. You will bear a son who will kill Indra in battle.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-6', 'en', '''If you stay pure for a full thousand years, you will bear from me a son who can conquer the three worlds.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-7', 'en', 'Saying this, the radiant one stroked her with his hand, touched her, said ''Be well'', and went off to his austerities.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-8', 'en', 'When he had gone, best of men, Diti, overjoyed, went to Kushaplavana and practised very harsh austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-9', 'en', 'While she practised, the thousand-eyed Indra served her with great devotion, best of men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-10', 'en', 'Indra brought her fire, kusha grass, wood, water, fruits, roots and whatever else she wanted.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-11', 'en', 'With massaging her limbs and relieving her fatigue, Indra attended Diti at all times.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-12', 'en', 'When the thousand years were ten short, joy of the Raghus, Diti, very pleased, said to Indra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-13', 'en', '''Ten years of my austerity remain, best of the mighty, bless you. Then you will see a brother.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-14', 'en', '''For your sake, son, I will make him eager for victory; you will enjoy the conquest of the three worlds together, free of worry.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-15', 'en', 'Having said this to Indra, when the sun was at midday, the goddess was overcome by sleep, with her feet where her head should be.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-16', 'en', 'Seeing her impure, with her hair at her feet and her feet where her head should be, Indra laughed and rejoiced.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-17', 'en', 'Indra entered her body and, very self-possessed, split the embryo into seven, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-18', 'en', 'Pierced by the hundred-jointed thunderbolt, the embryo cried loudly, Rama, and Diti woke.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-19', 'en', '''Do not cry, do not cry (mā rudaḥ),'' Indra said to the embryo, and the radiant one split it even as it wept.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-20', 'en', '''Do not kill it, do not kill it!'' Diti cried. Out of respect for his mother''s words, Indra came out.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-21', 'en', 'With folded hands and his thunderbolt, Indra said to Diti: ''Goddess, you were asleep impure, with your hair at your feet.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-45-22', 'en', '''Finding that gap, I split into seven the one who would kill Indra in battle. Please forgive me.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-1', 'en', 'When the embryo had been made sevenfold, Diti, deeply grieved, spoke gently to the invincible Indra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-2', 'en', '''Through my fault this embryo was split into seven and made fruitless. You have no fault here, lord of gods, slayer of Bala.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-3', 'en', '''But I want some good to come from my lost embryo. Let these seven become guardians of the seven realms of the Maruts.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-4', 'en', '''Let these seven little sons roam the sky as the wind-layers, famed as Marutas, my sons of divine form.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-5', 'en', '''Let one roam Brahma''s world, another Indra''s world, and the third, very famous, be known in the sky as Vayu.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-6', 'en', '''The other four, best of gods, will roam the four quarters at your command, bless you, my sons become gods, known by the name you gave them: Marutas.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-7', 'en', 'Hearing her, thousand-eyed Indra, slayer of Bala, said with folded hands to Diti:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-8', 'en', '''All this will happen as you say, without doubt. Your sons, become gods, will roam about, bless you.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-9', 'en', 'Having agreed, mother and son both went to heaven from the forest of austerity, their aims achieved, so we have heard, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-10', 'en', 'This is the land, Kakutstha, where great Indra lived long ago and served Diti, perfected by austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-11', 'en', 'Tiger among men, Ikshvaku had a very righteous son born of Alambusha, known as Vishala.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-12', 'en', 'He built the city here called Vishala.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-13', 'en', 'Vishala''s son, Rama, was mighty Hemachandra; after Hemachandra came Suchandra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-14', 'en', 'Suchandra''s son, Rama, was famed as Dhumrashva, and Dhumrashva''s son was Srinjaya.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-15', 'en', 'Srinjaya''s son was glorious Sahadeva; Sahadeva''s son was very righteous Kushashva.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-16', 'en', 'Kushashva''s son was radiant Somadatta, and Somadatta''s son was known as Kakutstha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-17', 'en', 'His son, radiant, godlike and invincible, named Sumati, now lives in this city.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-18', 'en', 'By Ikshvaku''s grace, all the kings of Vishala are long-lived, great-souled, powerful and very righteous.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-19', 'en', 'We will stay here happily tonight, Rama. Tomorrow at dawn, best of men, you will see Janaka.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-20', 'en', 'Radiant Sumati, best of kings, hearing Vishvamitra had come, went out to meet him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-21', 'en', 'Honouring him greatly with his priests and kin, with folded hands he asked after his welfare and said to Vishvamitra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-46-22', 'en', '''I am blessed and favoured, sage, since you have come to my land and I see you. No one is more blessed than I.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-1', 'en', 'Having asked after each other''s welfare, at the end of their talk Sumati said to the great sage:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-2', 'en', '''These two youths, bless you, equal to gods in valour, walk like elephants and lions, heroes like tigers and bulls,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-3', 'en', '''with large eyes like lotus petals, carrying swords, quivers and bows, like the Ashvins in beauty, just reaching youth,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-4', 'en', '''as if immortals had come to earth from the gods'' world by chance: how did they come here on foot, for what reason, and whose sons are they, sage?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-5', 'en', '''They adorn this land like the moon and sun adorn the sky, alike in size, gestures and movements.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-6', 'en', '''Why have these two heroes with fine weapons come along this hard road? I wish to hear the truth.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-7', 'en', 'Hearing him, Vishvamitra told what had happened: the stay at Siddhashrama and the killing of the demons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-8', 'en', 'Hearing Vishvamitra, the king, overjoyed, honoured duly the two mighty sons of Dasharatha, his supreme guests, worthy of honour.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-9', 'en', 'Receiving great honour from Sumati, the Raghavas stayed one night there and went on to Mithila.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-10', 'en', 'Seeing Janaka''s lovely city, all the sages praised Mithila, saying ''Excellent!''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-11', 'en', 'In a grove near Mithila, Raghava saw an old, deserted, lovely hermitage and asked the best of sages:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-12', 'en', '''What is this, like a fine hermitage but without sages? I wish to hear, lord: whose hermitage was this?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-13', 'en', 'Hearing Raghava, the radiant great sage Vishvamitra, skilled in speech, replied:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-14', 'en', '''I will tell you; hear truly, Raghava, whose hermitage this is, cursed in anger by a great soul.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-15', 'en', '''Long ago it was the hermitage of great Gautama, best of men, divine-looking and honoured even by the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-16', 'en', '''Here he practised austerity long ago with Ahalya for many years, famous prince.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-17', 'en', '''Knowing his absence, Indra, husband of Shachi, disguised as the sage, said to Ahalya:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-18', 'en', '''"Those who desire do not wait for the proper season, attentive one. I want to be with you, slender one."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-19', 'en', '''Recognizing Indra in the sage''s disguise, the foolish one consented, out of curiosity about the king of gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-20', 'en', '''Then, her desire satisfied, she said to the best of gods: "You have what you wanted, best of gods. Go quickly from here, lord. Protect yourself and me always."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-21', 'en', '''Indra, laughing, said to Ahalya: "Lovely one, I am satisfied; I will go as I came."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-22', 'en', '''Having been with her, he came out of the hut hurriedly, Rama, anxious about Gautama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-23', 'en', '''He saw great Gautama entering, invincible to gods and demons, full of the power of austerity, wet with bathing water, blazing like fire, carrying fuel and kusha grass.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-24', 'en', '''Seeing him, the lord of gods was frightened and his face fell.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-25', 'en', '''Seeing Indra in the sage''s disguise, the sage, rich in good conduct, angrily said to the wrongdoer:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-26', 'en', '''"Fool, taking my form you have done what should not be done. Therefore you will lose your manhood."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-27', 'en', '''As soon as the great one spoke in anger, Indra''s testicles fell to the ground.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-28', 'en', '''Having cursed Indra, he cursed his wife too: "You will live here many thousands of years,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-29', 'en', '''"living on air, without food, doing penance, lying on ashes, invisible to all beings, you will live in this hermitage.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-30', 'en', '''"When Rama, son of Dasharatha, the invincible, comes to this dreadful forest, then you will be purified.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-31', 'en', '''"By receiving him as a guest, wicked one, free from greed and delusion, you will joyfully regain your own form beside me."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-47-32', 'en', '''Saying this to his wrongdoing wife, radiant Gautama left this hermitage and practised austerity on a lovely Himalayan peak, frequented by perfected ones and charanas.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-1', 'en', '''Indra, now emasculated, his face frightened, said to the gods led by Agni, with the sages and charanas:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-2', 'en', '''"By obstructing great Gautama''s austerity and rousing his anger, I have done this work for the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-3', 'en', '''"He has emasculated me in anger and rejected her; by his great curse I have taken away his austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-4', 'en', '''"So all of you, best of gods, with the sages and charanas, should restore me, who has helped the gods."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-5', 'en', '''Hearing Indra, the gods led by Agni, with all the Maruts, went to the ancestral gods and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-6', 'en', '''"This ram has testicles, while Indra has been deprived of his. Take the ram''s testicles and quickly give them to Indra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-7', 'en', '''"The castrated ram will give you great satisfaction, as will men who offer it to please you."', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-8', 'en', '''Hearing Agni, the ancestral gods gathered, took out the ram''s testicles and gave them to Indra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-9', 'en', 'From that time, Kakutstha, the gathered ancestral gods have accepted castrated rams, and gave their parts to Indra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-10', 'en', 'Since then, Raghava, Indra has had a ram''s testicles, by the power of great Gautama''s austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-11', 'en', '''So come, radiant one, to the hermitage of that holy man, and save the fortunate, godlike Ahalya.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-12', 'en', 'Hearing Vishvamitra, Raghava with Lakshmana entered the hermitage, with Vishvamitra in front.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-13', 'en', 'He saw the fortunate woman, shining with the power of austerity, whom even gods and asuras coming together could hardly look at,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-14', 'en', 'divine, as if made with care by the creator, like an illusion; like the full moon''s light wrapped in smoke,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-15', 'en', 'like the full moon behind mist and cloud, like the blazing sun''s light reflected in water, hard to approach.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-16', 'en', 'By Gautama''s word she had been invisible to the three worlds until she saw Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-17', 'en', 'The two Raghavas then touched her feet, and she, remembering Gautama''s words, received them.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-18', 'en', 'Attentively she offered them foot water, a guest offering and hospitality, and Kakutstha accepted them as the rites prescribe.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-19', 'en', 'There was a great shower of flowers, with the sound of divine drums, and a great gathering of gandharvas and apsaras.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-20', 'en', 'The gods honoured Ahalya, saying ''Excellent!'', her body purified by the power of austerity, devoted to Gautama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-21', 'en', 'Radiant Gautama too, happy and reunited with Ahalya, honoured Rama duly and continued his austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-48-22', 'en', 'Rama, having received great honour from the great sage Gautama, then went on to Mithila.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-1', 'en', 'Then, going north-east, Rama with Lakshmana, following Vishvamitra, came to the sacrificial ground.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-2', 'en', 'Rama and Lakshmana said to the tiger among sages: ''Great Janaka''s sacrifice is truly splendid.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-3', 'en', '''Here are many thousands of Brahmins from many lands, devoted to Vedic study, fortunate one.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-4', 'en', '''The sages'' camps are seen, crowded with hundreds of carts. Choose a place, Brahmin, where we can stay.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-5', 'en', 'Hearing Rama, the great sage Vishvamitra made camp in a secluded place with water.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-6', 'en', 'Hearing that Vishvamitra, best of sages, had come, the king, with his blameless priest Shatananda in front,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-7', 'en', 'and the great priests quickly brought the guest offering and gave it to Vishvamitra with mantras, as dharma requires.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-8', 'en', 'Receiving great Janaka''s welcome, he asked after the king''s welfare and the sacrifice''s smooth progress.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-9', 'en', 'Having asked the sages, the teachers and the priest, he gladly met them all properly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-10', 'en', 'Then the king, with folded hands, said to the best of sages: ''Please sit, lord, with these best of sages.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-11', 'en', 'Hearing Janaka, the great sage sat, as did the priest, the officiants and the king with his ministers.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-12', 'en', 'Seeing them seated properly all around, the king said to Vishvamitra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-13', 'en', '''Today the gods have made my sacrifice fruitful; today I have gained its fruit by seeing you, lord.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-14', 'en', '''I am blessed and favoured, best of sages, since you have come to my sacrifice with the sages, Brahmin.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-15', 'en', '''The wise say twelve days remain, brahmarshi. Then, Kaushika, you may see the gods who come for their shares.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-16', 'en', 'Saying this to the tiger among sages, the king, his face beaming, with folded hands and attentive, asked him again:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-17', 'en', '''These two youths, bless you, equal to gods in valour, walk like elephants and lions, heroes like tigers and bulls,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-18', 'en', '''with eyes like lotus petals, bearing swords, quivers and bows, like the Ashvins in beauty, just reaching youth,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-19', 'en', '''as if immortals had come to earth from heaven by chance: how did they come here on foot, for what, and whose are they, sage?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-20', 'en', '''Whose sons are these heroes with fine weapons, great sage, who adorn this land like the moon and sun the sky,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-21', 'en', '''alike in size, gestures and movements, with youthful side-locks? I wish to hear the truth.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-22', 'en', 'Hearing great Janaka, he told him that the two were the great sons of Dasharatha,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-23', 'en', 'their stay at Siddhashrama and the killing of the demons, their untroubled journey here and the visit to Vishala,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-24', 'en', 'the seeing of Ahalya and the meeting with Gautama, and their coming to test the great bow.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-49-25', 'en', 'Having told all this to great Janaka, the radiant great sage Vishvamitra fell silent.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-1', 'en', 'Hearing wise Vishvamitra, radiant Shatananda, great in austerity, his hair standing on end,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-2', 'en', 'the eldest son of Gautama, shining with austerity, was filled with wonder just at seeing Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-3', 'en', 'Seeing the two princes seated comfortably, Shatananda said to the best of sages, Vishvamitra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-4', 'en', '''Tiger among sages, was my famous mother, long in austerity, shown to the prince?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-5', 'en', '''Did my famous mother honour radiant Rama, worthy of all beings'' honour, with forest gifts?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-6', 'en', '''Was Rama told the ancient story of what was done wrongly to my mother by the god?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-7', 'en', '''Kaushika, bless you, has my mother been reunited with my father because of seeing Rama, best of sages?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-8', 'en', '''Was Rama honoured by my father, son of Kushika? Did radiant Rama come here having received the great one''s honour?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-9', 'en', '''Was my father saluted reverently by Rama when he came, son of Kushika, with a peaceful mind?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-10', 'en', 'Hearing him, the great sage Vishvamitra, skilled in speech, replied to Shatananda:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-11', 'en', '''Nothing was left undone, best of sages; I did what was needed. The wife is united with the sage, as Renuka with Bhargava.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-12', 'en', 'Hearing wise Vishvamitra, radiant Shatananda said to Rama:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-13', 'en', '''Welcome, best of men; fortunately you have come, Raghava, with the unconquered great sage Vishvamitra in front.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-14', 'en', '''Of inconceivable deeds and boundless radiance through austerity, radiant Vishvamitra is a brahmarshi. Know him as the highest refuge.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-15', 'en', '''No one on earth is more blessed than you, Rama, for the son of Kushika, who practised great austerity, is your protector.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-16', 'en', '''Listen: I will tell you as best I can the story of great Kaushika, just as it happened.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-17', 'en', '''He was long a righteous king, destroyer of foes, knowing dharma, learned and devoted to his people''s good.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-18', 'en', '''Kusha, son of Prajapati, was a king. Kusha''s son was mighty, very righteous Kushanabha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-19', 'en', '''Kushanabha''s son was the famous Gadhi, and Gadhi''s son is the radiant great sage Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-20', 'en', '''Radiant Vishvamitra protected the earth; the king ruled for many thousands of years.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-21', 'en', '''Once the radiant king, gathering his army, surrounded by a full division, toured the earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-22', 'en', '''Wandering through cities, kingdoms, rivers, mountains and hermitages in turn, the king came', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-23', 'en', '''to Vasishtha''s hermitage, with trees of many flowers and fruits, full of many kinds of animals, visited by perfected ones and charanas,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-24', 'en', '''adorned by gods, danavas, gandharvas and kinnaras, full of peaceful deer and frequented by Brahmins,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-25', 'en', '''crowded with brahmarshis, served by divine sages, and by great ones like fire, perfected by austerity,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-26', 'en', '''always full of glorious, Brahma-like great souls, some living on water, some on air, some on fallen leaves,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-27', 'en', '''eating fruits and roots, self-restrained, having conquered anger and the senses, sages and Valakhilyas devoted to prayer and offerings.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-50-28', 'en', '''Mighty Vishvamitra, best of conquerors, saw Vasishtha''s hermitage, like a second world of Brahma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-1', 'en', 'Seeing it, mighty Vishvamitra was very pleased and bowed humbly to Vasishtha, best of those who pray.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-2', 'en', 'Great Vasishtha said, ''Welcome to you,'' and the holy one directed a seat for him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-3', 'en', 'When wise Vishvamitra was seated, the best of sages duly offered him fruits and roots.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-4', 'en', 'Receiving Vasishtha''s honour, the best of kings asked about the welfare of his austerity, fire offerings and disciples.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-5', 'en', 'Radiant Vishvamitra also asked about the trees, and Vasishtha said to the best of kings that all was well everywhere.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-6', 'en', 'Vasishtha, son of Brahma, great in austerity and best of those who pray, asked Vishvamitra, seated at ease:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-7', 'en', '''Are you well, king? Righteous one, do you protect your people with dharma and kingly conduct, pleasing them?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-8', 'en', '''Are your servants well supported? Do they obey you? Have you defeated all your enemies, destroyer of foes?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-9', 'en', '''Is all well with your army, treasury and allies, scorcher of foes, and with your sons and grandsons, sinless one?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-10', 'en', 'The king replied to Vasishtha that all was well everywhere; radiant Vishvamitra spoke to Vasishtha humbly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-11', 'en', 'The two righteous ones talked of good things for a long time and, full of joy, were pleased with each other.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-12', 'en', 'Then, at the end of their talk, holy Vasishtha said to Vishvamitra, as if smiling, joy of the Raghus:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-13', 'en', '''I wish to offer hospitality to this army of yours, mighty one, and to you, immeasurable one. Please accept it as is fitting.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-14', 'en', '''Please accept this hospitality I offer. You are the best of guests, king, and must be honoured with care.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-15', 'en', 'Told this by Vasishtha, wise King Vishvamitra said: ''You have already done it with your words of honour,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-16', 'en', '''with the fruits and roots in your hermitage, lord, with water for my feet and to sip, and with the sight of you.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-17', 'en', '''I am fully honoured by you, who deserve honour, very wise one. I will go. Homage to you; look on me with a friendly eye.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-18', 'en', 'As the king spoke, the righteous and generous Vasishtha invited him again and again.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-19', 'en', '''Very well,'' the son of Gadhi said to Vasishtha. ''Let it be as you wish, best of sages.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-20', 'en', 'Told this, radiant Vasishtha, best of those who pray, pleased and free of sin, called his speckled cow:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-21', 'en', '''Come, come quickly, Shabala, and hear my words. I have resolved to entertain this royal sage and his army. Arrange a feast fit for him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-22', 'en', '''Whatever each wants of the six tastes, all of it, divine wish-granting cow, rain it down for me.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-51-23', 'en', '''Create quickly, Shabala, heaps of every kind of food, with savoury dishes, drinks, things to lick and suck.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-1', 'en', 'Told this by Vasishtha, the wish-granting Shabala produced whatever each person desired.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-2', 'en', 'Sugar cane, honey, parched grain, fine wines and liquors, costly drinks, and foods of every kind,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-3', 'en', 'mountains of hot rice, fine dishes, soups and rivers of curd,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-4', 'en', 'thousands of full vessels of many tasty flavours and sweets, and molasses.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-5', 'en', 'Vishvamitra''s whole army, Rama, crowded with happy, well-fed people, was fully satisfied by Vasishtha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-6', 'en', 'Royal sage Vishvamitra too was delighted and well fed, with his women, Brahmins and priests,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-7', 'en', 'with his ministers, counsellors and servants. Honoured, full of joy, he said to Vasishtha:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-8', 'en', '''I have been honoured and well treated by you, Brahmin worthy of honour. Listen, skilled speaker; I will say something.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-9', 'en', '''Give me Shabala for a hundred thousand cows. She is a jewel, lord, and a king takes jewels. So give me Shabala; by right she is mine, Brahmin.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-10', 'en', 'Told this by Vishvamitra, holy Vasishtha, best of sages, righteous, replied to the king:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-11', 'en', '''I will not give Shabala for a hundred thousand or even a billion cows, king, nor for heaps of silver.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-12', 'en', '''She does not deserve to be parted from me, destroyer of foes. Shabala is forever mine, as fame belongs to the self-possessed.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-13', 'en', '''On her depend my offerings to gods and ancestors, my livelihood, my fire offering, my bali and homa.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-14', 'en', '''The calls svaha and vashat, and the various sciences: all of this depends on her, royal sage, without doubt.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-15', 'en', '''Truly she is my everything and always gives me contentment. For many reasons, king, I will not give you Shabala.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-16', 'en', 'Told this by Vasishtha, Vishvamitra, skilled in speech, spoke even more vehemently:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-17', 'en', '''I will give you fourteen thousand elephants with golden girths and neck-ornaments, adorned with golden goads.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-18', 'en', '''I will give you eight hundred golden chariots with four white horses each, adorned with little bells.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-19', 'en', '''I will give you eleven thousand mighty horses of good breed and fine lands, man of good vows.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-20', 'en', '''I will give you ten million cows of various colours and ages. Give me Shabala.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-21', 'en', 'Told this by wise Vishvamitra, the holy one said: ''I will not give Shabala at all, king.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-22', 'en', '''She alone is my jewel, she alone is my wealth, she alone is my all, she alone is my life.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-23', 'en', '''She alone is my new-moon and full-moon rites, my sacrifices with their fees, king, and my various rituals.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-52-24', 'en', '''All my rites are rooted in her, king, without doubt. What use is much talk? I will not give the wish-granting cow.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-1', 'en', 'When the sage Vasishtha would not give up the wish-granting cow, Rama, Vishvamitra dragged Shabala away.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-2', 'en', 'Being led away by the great king, Rama, Shabala, sad, weeping and worn with grief, thought:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-3', 'en', '''Have I been abandoned by great Vasishtha, that I am carried off, miserable and grieving, by the king''s servants?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-4', 'en', '''What wrong have I done that great sage, that the righteous one abandons me, innocent, devoted and dear?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-5', 'en', 'Thinking this and sighing again and again, she ran swiftly back to the very powerful Vasishtha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-6', 'en', 'Shaking off hundreds of servants, destroyer of foes, she went with the speed of wind to the great one''s feet.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-7', 'en', 'Weeping and crying out, Shabala stood before Vasishtha and said, with a voice like thunder and drums:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-8', 'en', '''Lord, son of Brahma, why have you abandoned me, so that the king''s men take me away from you?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-9', 'en', 'Told this, the brahmarshi said to her, grieving and sorrowful like a sister:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-10', 'en', '''I do not abandon you, Shabala, and you have done me no wrong. This mighty king takes you from me by force.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-11', 'en', '''My strength is not equal to his, especially today. The king is strong, a warrior, and lord of the earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-12', 'en', '''This full army with horses and chariots, crowded with elephants and banners: that is why he is stronger.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-13', 'en', 'Told this by Vasishtha, she humbly replied to the brahmarshi of boundless radiance:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-14', 'en', '''They do not call the warrior''s power strength; a Brahmin is stronger. Brahmin, the divine power of Brahman is greater than the warrior''s.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-15', 'en', '''Your strength is measureless; Vishvamitra is not stronger than you, though very mighty. Your power is unassailable.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-16', 'en', '''Command me, radiant one, filled with your Brahmic power, and I will destroy the pride and strength of that wicked one.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-17', 'en', 'Told this, Rama, famous Vasishtha said: ''Create a force that will break the enemy''s army.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-18', 'en', 'From her lowing came hundreds of Pahlavas, king, who destroyed Vishvamitra''s whole army as he watched.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-19', 'en', 'The king, furious, his eyes wide with anger, destroyed the Pahlavas with weapons of all kinds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-20', 'en', 'Seeing hundreds of Pahlavas struck down by Vishvamitra, she created more fearsome Shakas mixed with Yavanas.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-21', 'en', 'The earth was covered with those Shakas and Yavanas, mighty and powerful, shining like golden filaments,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-22', 'en', 'bearing long swords and spears, clad in golden garments. They burned up his whole army as if with blazing fires.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-53-23', 'en', 'Then radiant Vishvamitra released his weapons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-1', 'en', 'Seeing them confused, bewildered by Vishvamitra''s weapons, Vasishtha urged: ''Wish-granting cow, create by your power.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-2', 'en', 'From her lowing were born Kambojas bright as the sun; from her udder Pahlavas with weapons in hand,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-3', 'en', 'from her womb Yavanas, from her dung Shakas, from her pores Mlecchas, Haritas and Kiratas.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-4', 'en', 'By them Vishvamitra''s army was destroyed at once, with infantry, elephants, horses and chariots, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-5', 'en', 'Seeing the army destroyed by great Vasishtha, a hundred of Vishvamitra''s sons with weapons of every kind', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-6', 'en', 'rushed in fury at Vasishtha, best of those who pray. The great sage burned them all with just the sound ''hum''.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-7', 'en', 'In a moment Vishvamitra''s sons, with their horses, chariots and foot soldiers, were turned to ash by great Vasishtha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-8', 'en', 'Seeing his sons and army destroyed, famous Vishvamitra was ashamed and lost in thought.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-9', 'en', 'Like the sea without waves, like a snake with broken fangs, like the eclipsed sun, he lost his lustre at once.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-10', 'en', 'Sons and army killed, miserable as a bird with clipped wings, his pride and energy broken, he fell into despair.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-11', 'en', 'Appointing one son to rule, saying ''Protect the earth by the warrior''s duty'', he went to the forest.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-12', 'en', 'Going to the Himalaya''s slopes, frequented by kinnaras and serpents, he practised great austerity to win Mahadeva''s grace.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-13', 'en', 'After some time, the bull-bannered lord of gods, giver of boons, showed himself to the great sage Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-14', 'en', '''Why are you practising austerity, king? Say what you wish. I am a giver of boons; tell me the boon you desire.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-15', 'en', 'Told this by the god, Vishvamitra, great in austerity, bowed to Mahadeva and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-16', 'en', '''If you are pleased, sinless Mahadeva, give me the science of archery with its branches, sub-branches, Upanishads and secrets.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-17', 'en', '''Let all the weapons of the gods, danavas, great sages, gandharvas, yakshas and demons be revealed to me, sinless one.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-18', 'en', '''By your grace, god of gods, let my wish come true.'' ''So be it,'' said the lord of gods, and went to heaven.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-19', 'en', 'Having gained the weapons, mighty royal sage Vishvamitra was filled with great pride.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-20', 'en', 'Swelling with power like the ocean at full moon, he thought Vasishtha, best of sages, already dead.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-21', 'en', 'Going to the hermitage, the king released the weapons, and with their power the whole forest of austerity was burned.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-22', 'en', 'Seeing wise Vishvamitra''s weapon unleashed, hundreds of sages fled frightened in all directions.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-23', 'en', 'Vasishtha''s disciples and the deer and birds fled in thousands from fear in every direction.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-24', 'en', 'Great Vasishtha''s hermitage became empty; for a moment it was silent, like a desert.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-25', 'en', 'Vasishtha kept saying, ''Do not fear! Today I will destroy Gadhi''s son as the sun destroys mist.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-26', 'en', 'Saying this, radiant Vasishtha, best of those who pray, angrily said to Vishvamitra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-27', 'en', '''Fool, since you have destroyed this long-tended hermitage, you are wicked; therefore you will perish.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-54-28', 'en', 'Saying this, in great anger, he quickly raised his staff, like the smokeless fire at the end of time, like a second staff of Yama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-1', 'en', 'Told this by Vasishtha, mighty Vishvamitra raised the fire weapon and cried, ''Stand! Stand!''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-2', 'en', 'Holy Vasishtha said angrily:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-3', 'en', '''Base warrior, here I stand. Show whatever strength you have. Son of Gadhi, I will destroy your pride in your weapons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-4', 'en', '''Where is your warrior''s might, and where the great power of Brahman? See my divine Brahmic power, disgrace of warriors!''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-5', 'en', 'That fearsome supreme fire weapon of Gadhi''s son was quenched by the Brahma-staff, as fire''s force is quenched by water.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-6', 'en', 'Enraged, Gadhi''s son hurled the weapons of Varuna, Rudra, Indra, Pashupati and the Aishika,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-7', 'en', 'the Manava, Mohana, Gandharva and Svapana, Jrimbhana, Mohana, Santapana and Vilapana,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-8', 'en', 'the Shoshana and Darana, the invincible Vajra, the noose of Brahma, the noose of Time, and Varuna''s noose,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-9', 'en', 'the beloved Pinaka weapon, the Dry and Wet thunderbolts, the Danda weapon, the Paishacha, and the Krauncha weapon,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-10', 'en', 'the discus of Dharma, of Time and of Vishnu, the wind weapon, the Mathana and the Hayashiras,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-11', 'en', 'he hurled two spears, the Kankala and the club, the great weapon of the vidyadharas and the dreadful weapon of Time,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-12', 'en', 'the fearsome trident weapon, the Kapala and the Kankana: all these weapons he hurled, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-13', 'en', 'Against Vasishtha, best of those who pray, it was a wonder: the son of Brahma swallowed them all with his staff.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-14', 'en', 'When they were quenched, Gadhi''s son released the Brahma weapon. Seeing it raised, the gods led by Agni,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-15', 'en', 'the divine sages, gandharvas and great serpents were alarmed; the three worlds trembled when the Brahma weapon was released.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-16', 'en', 'That very terrible Brahma weapon too Vasishtha swallowed entirely with his Brahma-staff, by Brahmic power, Raghava.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-17', 'en', 'As great Vasishtha swallowed the Brahma weapon, his form became fierce and terrible, bewildering the three worlds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-18', 'en', 'From all the pores of great Vasishtha shot out rays like smoky flames of fire.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-19', 'en', 'Vasishtha''s raised Brahma-staff blazed in his hand like the smokeless fire at the end of time, like a second staff of Yama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-20', 'en', 'Then the hosts of sages praised Vasishtha, best of those who pray: ''Your power is unfailing, Brahmin. Hold back your energy with your energy.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-21', 'en', '''You have subdued Vishvamitra, great in austerity, Brahmin. Be gracious, best of those who pray; let the worlds be free of distress.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-22', 'en', 'Told this, the radiant one became calm. Vishvamitra, humiliated, sighed and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-23', 'en', '''Shame on strength, the strength of warriors! The power of Brahmic energy is true strength. With one Brahma-staff all my weapons were destroyed.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-55-24', 'en', '''Seeing this, with clear senses and mind, I will undertake great austerity that will make me a Brahmin.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-1', 'en', 'Then, burning at heart, remembering his defeat, sighing again and again, having made an enemy of the great one,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-2', 'en', 'he went to the south with his queen, Raghava, and practised supreme, fearsome austerity, eating fruits and roots and self-controlled.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-3', 'en', 'Then sons were born to him, devoted to truth and dharma: Havishpanda, Madhushpanda, Dridhanetra and Maharatha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-4', 'en', 'When a thousand years were complete, Brahma, grandfather of the worlds, spoke sweetly to Vishvamitra, rich in austerity:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-5', 'en', '''You have won the worlds of royal sages by austerity, son of Kushika. By this austerity we know you as a royal sage.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-6', 'en', 'Saying this, the radiant supreme lord of the worlds went with the gods to heaven, to Brahma''s world.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-7', 'en', 'Hearing this, Vishvamitra hung his head a little in shame and, filled with great sorrow and anger, said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-8', 'en', '''I have practised great austerity, and all the gods and sages know me only as a royal sage. I think my austerity has no fruit.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-9', 'en', 'Deciding this in his mind, the self-possessed and great ascetic practised supreme austerity again, Kakutstha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-10', 'en', 'At that very time there was a truthful, self-controlled joy of the Ikshvaku line, famed as Trishanku.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-11', 'en', 'He resolved, Raghava: ''I will sacrifice and go in my own body to the highest state of the gods.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-12', 'en', 'He summoned Vasishtha and told him his plan, but great Vasishtha said it was impossible.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-13', 'en', 'Rejected by Vasishtha, he went south, where Vasishtha''s sons were practising long austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-14', 'en', 'Radiant Trishanku saw the hundred famous, very bright sons of Vasishtha practising austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-15', 'en', 'Approaching all the great sons of his teacher, saluting them in order, head bowed a little in shame, the radiant one said to them all with folded hands:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-16', 'en', '''I come to you for refuge, you who give refuge. I have been rejected by great Vasishtha, bless you.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-17', 'en', '''I wish to perform a great sacrifice; please permit it. I bow to all my teacher''s sons and seek your favour.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-18', 'en', '''Bowing my head, I ask you Brahmins established in austerity: perform the sacrifice for me attentively so that I may reach the world of the gods in this body.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-19', 'en', '''Rejected by Vasishtha, I see no other way, rich in austerity, except all of you, my teacher''s sons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-56-20', 'en', '''For all the Ikshvakus the family priest is the highest refuge; after him, all of you are my gods.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-1', 'en', 'Hearing Trishanku''s words, the hundred sons of the sage angrily said to the king, Rama:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-2', 'en', '''Foolish one, you were refused by your truthful teacher. How can you pass him over and come to another branch?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-3', 'en', '''For all the Ikshvakus the family priest is the highest refuge; the word of the truthful one cannot be overstepped.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-4', 'en', '''Holy sage Vasishtha said it was impossible. How can we perform your sacrifice?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-5', 'en', '''You are childish, best of men. Go back to your city. The holy one is able to sacrifice even for the three worlds, king.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-6', 'en', 'Hearing their words, choked with anger, the king said to them again:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-7', 'en', '''I have been refused by my teacher and by his sons too. I will go another way. Farewell, rich in austerity.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-8', 'en', 'Hearing these words with their dark intent, the sage''s sons, very angry, cursed him: ''You will become a chandala.'' Saying this, the great ones entered their hermitage.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-9', 'en', 'When the night had passed, the king had become a chandala: dark, in dark clothes, rough, with dishevelled hair, with garlands and ointment from the cremation ground, and iron ornaments.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-10', 'en', 'Seeing him in chandala form, all his ministers and the citizens who followed him abandoned him and fled together, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-11', 'en', 'Alone, the self-possessed king, burning day and night, went to Vishvamitra, rich in austerity, Kakutstha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-12', 'en', 'Seeing the king so ruined, in chandala form, the sage Vishvamitra was moved to pity, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-13', 'en', 'Out of pity, the radiant, very righteous one said to the fearsome-looking king: ''Bless you.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-14', 'en', '''Why have you come, mighty prince, heroic lord of Ayodhya, who have become a chandala by a curse?''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-15', 'en', 'Hearing this, the king who had become a chandala, skilled in speech, said with folded hands to the skilled speaker:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-16', 'en', '''I have been refused by my teacher and by his sons. Without gaining my wish, I have met with disaster.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-17', 'en', '''My gentle wish was to go to heaven in my body. I have performed a hundred sacrifices but do not gain the fruit.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-18', 'en', '''I have never spoken a lie and never will, even in hardship, gentle one. I swear to you by the warrior''s dharma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-19', 'en', '''I have performed many sacrifices, protected my people with dharma, and pleased my great teachers with good conduct.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-20', 'en', '''Yet though I strive in dharma and wish to sacrifice, my teachers are not pleased, best of sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-21', 'en', '''I think fate alone is supreme and human effort useless. Fate overruns everything; fate is the final course.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-22', 'en', '''I am deeply distressed and long for your grace. Please help me, whose efforts have been struck down by fate.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-57-23', 'en', '''I will go to no other; I have no other refuge. Please turn back fate by human effort.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-1', 'en', 'To the king who had spoken, in chandala form, the son of Kushika, out of compassion, said sweetly:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-2', 'en', '''Welcome, Ikshvaku, my son. I know you are very righteous. I will be your refuge; do not fear, best of kings.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-3', 'en', '''I will invite all the great sages of holy deeds to assist the sacrifice, king; then you will sacrifice in peace.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-4', 'en', '''With this form caused by your teacher''s curse, in this very form, you will go to heaven in your body.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-5', 'en', '''I think heaven is already in your hand, lord of men, since you have come to Kaushika, the giver of refuge.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-6', 'en', 'Saying this, the radiant one directed his very righteous and wise sons to gather materials for the sacrifice.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-7', 'en', 'Calling all his disciples, he said this:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-8', 'en', '''My children, at my command bring all the best sages, with their disciples, friends, priests and learned men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-9', 'en', '''If anyone, urged by the force of my words, says anything disrespectful, report it all to me in full.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-10', 'en', 'Hearing him, they went in all directions at his command, and the Brahmins came from every land.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-11', 'en', 'The disciples came back to the sage of blazing power and reported the words of all the Brahmins:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-12', 'en', '''Hearing your word, all the Brahmins are coming from every land, except Mahodaya.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-13', 'en', '''Hear, best of sages, all that the hundred sons of Vasishtha said, choked with anger:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-14', 'en', '''"How will the gods and sages eat the offering at the sacrifice of one whose priest is a warrior, especially a chandala?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-15', 'en', '''"How will great Brahmins go to heaven after eating a chandala''s food, even if protected by Vishvamitra?"', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-16', 'en', '''Best of sages, all the sons of Vasishtha, with Mahodaya, spoke these harsh words, their eyes red.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-17', 'en', 'Hearing all their words, the best of sages, eyes red with anger, said furiously:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-18', 'en', '''Since they slander me, who am blameless and engaged in fierce austerity, those wicked ones will be turned to ash, without doubt.''', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-19', 'en', 'Today you will be dragged by the noose of time to the realm of Yama. For seven hundred births may you all live as keepers of the dead.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-20', 'en', 'Eating dog''s flesh, known as Mushtikas, pitiless, deformed and ugly, may they wander through these worlds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-21', 'en', 'And the foolish Mahodaya, who slandered me though I was blameless, will be scorned in every world and become a Nishada.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-22', 'en', 'Devoted to killing living things and gone without pity, he will live in misery for a long time because of my anger.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-58-23', 'en', 'Having said this much, the great ascetic Vishvamitra, mighty and radiant, fell silent among the sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-1', 'en', 'Having struck down Vasishtha''s sons and Mahodaya by the power of his austerity, the radiant Vishvamitra spoke among the sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-2', 'en', 'This is Trishanku, the famous heir of the Ikshvakus, righteous and generous, who has come to me for refuge, wishing to win the world of the gods in this very body.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-3', 'en', 'Begin the sacrifice, you and I together, so that he may go to the world of the gods in his own body.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-4', 'en', 'Hearing Vishvamitra''s words, all the great sages gathered and, knowing dharma, spoke words in keeping with dharma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-5', 'en', 'This sage of Kushika''s line is very quick to anger. What he says must certainly be done properly; there is no doubt.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-6', 'en', 'The lord is like fire; if angered he will curse us. So let the sacrifice begin, so that the Ikshvaku heir may go to heaven in his body by Vishvamitra''s power.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-7', 'en', 'So let the sacrifice begin; let everyone take up his part.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-8', 'en', 'Having said this, the great sages gathered the rites, and the mighty Vishvamitra himself became the officiating priest of the sacrifice.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-9', 'en', 'The priests, skilled in mantras, performed all the rites in order, with mantras, according to rule and procedure.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-10', 'en', 'Then, after a long time, the great ascetic Vishvamitra invoked all the gods there to come for their share.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-11', 'en', 'But though invited, the gods did not come for their share. Then the great sage Vishvamitra was filled with anger.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-12', 'en', 'Raising the sacrificial ladle in anger, he said to Trishanku: See, lord of men, the power of the austerity I earned myself.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-13', 'en', 'By my own strength I lead you to heaven in your body. Go, ruler of men, to heaven, so hard to reach in the body.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-14', 'en', 'If I have earned any fruit of austerity at all, then by its power, O king, go to heaven in your body.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-15', 'en', 'As soon as the sage spoke, the king rose to heaven in his body, O Rama, while the sages watched.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-16', 'en', 'Seeing Trishanku arrived in the world of the gods, Indra, with all the hosts of gods, said this.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-17', 'en', 'Trishanku, go back again; you have no home in heaven. Struck by your guru''s curse, fool, fall to earth head first.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-18', 'en', 'Told this by great Indra, Trishanku fell again, crying out to the ascetic Vishvamitra, Save me!', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-19', 'en', 'Hearing the cry of the falling man, Kaushika grew fiercely angry and said, Stop! Stop!', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-20', 'en', 'There among the sages, the radiant one, like a second Creator, created another Seven Sages standing in the southern path.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-21', 'en', 'Overcome by anger, the famous one made another garland of stars, taking the southern quarter as his place, there among the sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-22', 'en', 'Having created a family of stars, clouded by anger, he said, I will make another Indra, or the world will have no Indra. And in his rage he began to create gods as well.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-23', 'en', 'Then the chief gods with the sages, greatly alarmed, spoke soothing words to great-souled Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-24', 'en', 'This king, fortunate one, wounded by his guru''s curse, does not deserve to go to heaven in his body, O ascetic.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-25', 'en', 'Hearing these words of the gods, Kaushika, the best of sages, spoke a weighty reply to all the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-26', 'en', 'Bless you all, but I promised this King Trishanku that he would rise in his body. I cannot make my word untrue.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-27', 'en', 'Let there be a heaven for Trishanku in his body for ever, and let all my stars be fixed and lasting.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-28', 'en', 'As long as the worlds endure, let all these things I have made remain. All you gods should agree to this.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-29', 'en', 'Thus addressed, all the gods replied to the best of sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-30', 'en', 'So be it, bless you. Let all these many stars stay in the sky, outside the path of the sun.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-31', 'en', 'Among those blazing lights, best of sages, let Trishanku stay head downward, shining like a god.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-32', 'en', 'Righteous Vishvamitra, praised by all the gods and sages, said to the gods, Very well.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-59-33', 'en', 'Then the great gods and the ascetic sages all went back as they had come, at the end of the sacrifice, best of men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-1', 'en', 'Then great-souled Vishvamitra, seeing those sages leave, said to all those forest-dwellers, tiger among men:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-2', 'en', 'A great obstacle has arisen here in the southern region. Let us go to another direction and practise austerity there.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-3', 'en', 'In the broad west, at the Pushkara lakes, we will practise austerity in peace, for that is the finest place of penance.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-4', 'en', 'Having said this, the mighty great sage practised fierce, unassailable austerity at Pushkara, living on roots and fruits.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-5', 'en', 'At that very time, the ruler of Ayodhya, a king named Ambarisha, began to perform a sacrifice.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-6', 'en', 'While he was sacrificing, Indra stole his sacrificial animal. When the animal was lost, the priest said to the king:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-7', 'en', 'The animal has been stolen today and lost through your bad management, O king. Faults destroy a king who does not protect.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-8', 'en', 'This needs great atonement. Bring back the animal quickly, or a man in its place, bull among men, while the rite is still going on.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-9', 'en', 'Hearing his teacher''s words, that wise king searched for the animal, offering thousands of cows.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-10', 'en', 'Searching lands and regions, cities and forests, and holy hermitages, the king went about.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-11', 'en', 'He saw Richika seated on the Bhrigu peak with his sons and his wife, dear Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-12', 'en', 'Bowing and pleasing him, the brilliant royal sage asked after his welfare and then said to the brahmin sage Richika, shining with austerity:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-13', 'en', 'If you will sell a son for a hundred thousand cows to serve as the animal, fortunate son of Bhrigu, my purpose will be fulfilled.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-14', 'en', 'I have searched all lands and cannot find a sacrificial animal. Please give me one son for a price.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-15', 'en', 'Thus addressed, mighty Richika said: I will never sell my eldest son, best of men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-16', 'en', 'Hearing Richika, the ascetic mother of those great sons spoke to Ambarisha, tiger among men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-17', 'en', 'Know, king, that the youngest, Shunaka, is dear to me.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-18', 'en', 'For usually, best of men, the eldest are dear to fathers and the youngest to mothers; so I protect the youngest.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-19', 'en', 'When the sage and his wife had spoken, Shunahshepa, the middle son, himself spoke, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-20', 'en', 'Father says the eldest cannot be sold, and mother says the youngest. I think the middle one is the one sold. Take me, king.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-21', 'en', 'Taking Shunahshepa for a hundred thousand cows, the king left, very pleased, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-60-22', 'en', 'Royal sage Ambarisha, mighty and famous, quickly put Shunahshepa on his chariot and hurried away.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-1', 'en', 'Taking Shunahshepa, best of men, the famous king rested at Pushkara at midday, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-2', 'en', 'While he rested, Shunahshepa went to the fine lake of Pushkara and saw Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-3', 'en', 'Downcast and wretched with thirst and weariness, he fell into the sage''s lap, Rama, and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-4', 'en', 'I have no mother, no father, so how could I have kin or friends? Kind best of sages, you should save me by dharma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-5', 'en', 'You are the saviour of all, best of sages, the one who sustains all. Let the king''s purpose be done, and let me live long and unharmed.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-6', 'en', 'Let me practise the highest austerity and reach heaven. Be the protector of me, who has none, with a kindly heart; righteous one, save me from harm as a father saves his son.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-7', 'en', 'Hearing his words, the great ascetic Vishvamitra comforted him in many ways and said to his sons:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-8', 'en', 'The reason fathers seeking good bring sons into the world, for good in the next world, that time has now come.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-9', 'en', 'This young son of a sage seeks refuge with me. Do him a kindness by saving his very life, my sons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-10', 'en', 'All of you have done good deeds and are devoted to dharma. Become the king''s sacrificial animal and satisfy the fire.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-11', 'en', 'Then Shunahshepa will have a protector, the sacrifice will go without obstacle, the gods will be satisfied, and my word will be kept.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-12', 'en', 'Hearing the sage, his sons led by Madhushyanda said this proudly and mockingly, best of men:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-13', 'en', 'How can you abandon your own sons to save another''s son, lord? We see this as wrong, like eating dog''s flesh.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-14', 'en', 'Hearing his sons'' words, the best of sages, eyes red with anger, began to speak.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-15', 'en', 'You have spoken shamelessly, words condemned even by dharma, overstepping my command, harsh and hair-raising.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-16', 'en', 'Like Vasishtha''s sons, you will all be born among dog-eaters and live on the earth for a full thousand years.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-17', 'en', 'Having cursed his sons, the great sage made a sure protection for the suffering Shunahshepa and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-18', 'en', 'Bound with sacred cords, wearing red garlands and paste, go to Vishnu''s sacrificial post and praise Agni with hymns.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-19', 'en', 'Sing these two divine verses, son of a sage, at Ambarisha''s sacrifice, and you will gain success.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-20', 'en', 'Shunahshepa, taking the two verses with full attention, quickly said to Ambarisha, lion among kings:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-21', 'en', 'Lion among kings, great one, let us go quickly to the assembly. Turn back, lord of kings, and take up your consecration.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-22', 'en', 'Hearing these words of the sage''s son, the king, eager and joyful, went quickly and tirelessly to the sacrificial ground.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-23', 'en', 'With the assembly''s consent, the king dressed the boy, marked with sacred signs, in red and bound him to the post as the animal.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-24', 'en', 'Bound there, the sage''s son duly praised the two gods, Indra and Indra''s younger brother Vishnu, with the finest words.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-25', 'en', 'Then thousand-eyed Indra, pleased and satisfied by the secret hymn, granted long life to Shunahshepa, Raghava.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-26', 'en', 'And the king, best of men, completed his sacrifice and received manifold fruit through the grace of thousand-eyed Indra, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-61-27', 'en', 'Righteous Vishvamitra, the great ascetic, again practised austerity at Pushkara for a thousand years, best of men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-1', 'en', 'When the thousand years were complete and the great sage had taken the bath that ends a vow, all the gods came to give him the fruit of his austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-2', 'en', 'Brahma, most radiant, spoke kindly: Bless you, you are now a rishi, by the good deeds you yourself have earned.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-3', 'en', 'Having said this, the lord of gods went back to heaven, and mighty Vishvamitra again practised great austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-4', 'en', 'Then after a long time, Menaka, the finest of the apsaras, came to bathe in the Pushkara lakes, best of men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-5', 'en', 'The mighty son of Kushika saw Menaka there, beautiful beyond compare, like lightning in a cloud.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-6', 'en', 'Seeing her, overcome by desire, the sage said: Welcome, apsara; live here in my hermitage. Be kind to me, bless you, for I am bewildered by love.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-7', 'en', 'Thus addressed, the lovely woman made her home there. A great obstacle to his austerity had come to Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-8', 'en', 'While she lived there, ten years passed happily in Vishvamitra''s hermitage, gentle Raghava.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-9', 'en', 'When that time had gone, the great sage Vishvamitra became as if ashamed, lost in worry and sorrow.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-10', 'en', 'A thought arose in the sage, full of indignation, joy of the Raghus: All this was the gods'' doing, a great theft of my austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-11', 'en', 'Ten years have gone as if a single day and night. This obstacle came upon me while I was overcome by desire and delusion.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-12', 'en', 'The best of sages sighed, pained by remorse.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-13', 'en', 'Seeing the apsara Menaka frightened, trembling and standing with folded hands, Kushika''s son sent her away with gentle words and went to the northern mountain, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-14', 'en', 'Making a firm resolve, the famous one, wanting to conquer desire, reached the bank of the Kaushiki river and practised very severe austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-15', 'en', 'As he practised terrible austerity for a thousand years on the northern mountain, Rama, the gods grew afraid.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-16', 'en', 'All the gods with the sages met and agreed: Let this son of Kushika rightly receive the title great sage.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-17', 'en', 'Hearing the gods, Brahma, grandfather of all worlds, spoke sweetly to the ascetic Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-18', 'en', 'Welcome, great sage, my child. I am pleased by your fierce austerity. I give you greatness and the rank of chief among sages, Kaushika.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-19', 'en', 'Hearing Brahma''s words, the ascetic Vishvamitra bowed with folded hands and replied to the Grandfather.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-20', 'en', 'If the lord would call me by the matchless title brahmarshi, earned by my own good deeds, then I would be one who has conquered his senses.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-21', 'en', 'Then Brahma said to him: You have not yet conquered your senses. Strive on, tiger among sages. Having said this he went to heaven.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-22', 'en', 'When the gods had gone, the great sage Vishvamitra practised austerity with arms raised, without support, living on air.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-23', 'en', 'In summer he practised the five fires, in the rains he stayed under the open sky, and in winter he stood in water day and night.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-24', 'en', 'Thus he undertook terrible austerity for a thousand years.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-25', 'en', 'While the great sage Vishvamitra burned with austerity, great alarm arose among the gods and Indra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-62-26', 'en', 'Indra, with all the Maruts, spoke to the apsara Rambha words that served himself and harmed Kaushika.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-1', 'en', 'Rambha, you must do this great task for the gods: tempt Kaushika here with desire and delusion.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-2', 'en', 'Thus told by wise thousand-eyed Indra, the apsara, embarrassed, folded her hands and answered the lord of gods, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-3', 'en', 'Lord of gods, this great sage Vishvamitra is fearsome; he will surely loose his terrible anger on me. That is why I am afraid, lord; please spare me.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-4', 'en', 'Thousand-eyed Indra said to her as she trembled with folded hands: Do not fear, Rambha; bless you, do as I command.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-5', 'en', 'In spring, among the lovely trees, I will stand beside you as a heart-stealing cuckoo, along with Kama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-6', 'en', 'Take on a dazzling, many-charmed form, Rambha, and break the ascetic sage Kaushika.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-7', 'en', 'Hearing him, she took on a matchless form and, graceful and sweetly smiling, tried to tempt Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-8', 'en', 'He heard the sweet song of the cuckoo and looked up with a glad heart; then he saw her.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-9', 'en', 'Through that sound, the matchless singing and the sight of Rambha, the sage grew suspicious.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-10', 'en', 'Knowing this to be Indra''s doing, the best of sages, Kushika''s son, filled with anger, cursed Rambha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-11', 'en', 'Because you tempt me, Rambha, who long to conquer desire and anger, you will stand as stone for ten thousand years, unlucky one.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-12', 'en', 'A mighty brahmin full of the power of austerity will free you, Rambha, who have been stained by my anger.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-13', 'en', 'Having said this, the mighty great sage Vishvamitra, unable to hold back his anger, fell into regret.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-14', 'en', 'By his great curse Rambha became stone at once, and Kama, hearing the sage''s words, slipped away.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-63-15', 'en', 'Since anger had robbed him of his austerity, the mighty one, his senses unconquered, found no peace within, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-1', 'en', 'Then the great sage left the Himalayan quarter, went to the east and practised very severe austerity, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-2', 'en', 'Taking the supreme vow of silence for a thousand years, he practised matchless, most difficult austerity, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-3', 'en', 'When the thousand years were complete, the great sage, still as a log, was assailed by many obstacles, yet anger did not enter him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-4', 'en', 'Then the gods, gandharvas, serpents, asuras and rakshasas, dazzled by his power and their own light dimmed by his austerity, all stricken, said to the Grandfather:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-5', 'en', 'Lord, the great sage Vishvamitra has been tempted and provoked in many ways, yet he grows ever stronger through austerity.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-6', 'en', 'Not even the slightest fault is seen in him. If what his mind desires is not given, he will destroy the three worlds with all that moves and stands. All directions are in turmoil and nothing shines.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-7', 'en', 'All the oceans are churning, the mountains crumble, the earth trembles and the wind blows wildly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-8', 'en', 'Before the great sage turns his mind to destruction, lord, the blessed one, fiery and radiant, must be appeased.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-9', 'en', 'As the world was once burned entirely by the fire of time, so it may be again. Even if he seeks the kingship of the gods, let him be given what he wants.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-10', 'en', 'Then all the gods, led by the Grandfather, spoke sweet words to great-souled Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-11', 'en', 'Welcome, brahmarshi. We are well pleased by your austerity. Through fierce austerity you have attained brahminhood, Kaushika.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-12', 'en', 'With the Maruts I give you long life, brahmin. Prosper, bless you; go as you please, gentle one.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-13', 'en', 'Hearing the words of the Grandfather and all the gods, the great sage bowed joyfully and spoke.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-14', 'en', 'If I have attained brahminhood and long life, then let the sacred Om, the Vashat call and the Vedas accept me.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-15', 'en', 'And let Vasishtha, son of Brahma, best of those who know the warrior lore and the sacred lore, say so to me, gods. If this highest wish is granted, then go, best of gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-16', 'en', 'Then Vasishtha, best of reciters, persuaded by the gods, made friends with him and said, So be it, brahmarshi.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-17', 'en', 'You are a brahmarshi without doubt; all will be accomplished for you. Having said this, the gods all went back as they had come.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-18', 'en', 'Righteous Vishvamitra, having gained the highest brahminhood, honoured the brahmarshi Vasishtha, best of reciters.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-19', 'en', 'His wish fulfilled, he wandered the whole earth, steadfast in austerity. This is how the great soul attained brahminhood, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-20', 'en', 'This, Rama, is the best of sages; he is austerity in bodily form. He is the highest dharma always, the final refuge of strength.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-21', 'en', 'Hearing Shatananda''s words, in the presence of Rama and Lakshmana, Janaka with folded hands spoke to the son of Kushika.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-22', 'en', 'I am blessed and favoured, best of sages, since you have come to my sacrifice with the Kakutstha princes, righteous one.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-23', 'en', 'I am purified by the sight of you, brahmin, great sage. Many blessings have come to me from seeing you.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-24', 'en', 'I and great Rama have heard in detail the telling of your great austerity, mighty brahmin.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-25', 'en', 'Coming to the assembly, the members heard of your many virtues.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-26', 'en', 'Your austerity is immeasurable, your strength immeasurable, and your virtues ever immeasurable, son of Kushika.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-27', 'en', 'I never tire of these wonderful stories, lord, but it is time for the rites, best of sages; the sun is sinking.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-28', 'en', 'Tomorrow at dawn, mighty one, please see me again. Welcome, best of ascetics; please give me leave.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-29', 'en', 'Having said this to the best of sages, the Videha lord of Mithila quickly walked around him respectfully, with his priest and kin.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-64-30', 'en', 'Righteous Vishvamitra, with Rama and Lakshmana, went to his own lodging, honoured by the great sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-1', 'en', 'Then at clear dawn, his rites done, the king summoned great-souled Vishvamitra with the Raghava princes.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-2', 'en', 'Honouring him with rites as the scriptures prescribe, the righteous king then spoke to him and the two great Raghavas.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-3', 'en', 'Lord, welcome. What can I do for you, sinless one? Command me, for I am yours to command.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-4', 'en', 'Thus addressed by great Janaka, the righteous sage, skilled in speech, replied to the hero.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-5', 'en', 'These two sons of Dasharatha, kshatriyas famous in the world, wish to see the finest of bows that is kept with you.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-6', 'en', 'Show it to them, bless you. Their wish fulfilled by seeing the bow, the princes will go back as they please.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-7', 'en', 'Thus addressed, Janaka replied to the great sage: Hear why this bow is kept here.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-8', 'en', 'There was a king named Devarata, sixth from Nimi. This bow was given into his hands as a trust by the great one, lord.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-9', 'en', 'Long ago, at the destruction of Daksha''s sacrifice, mighty Rudra bent this bow and in anger said playfully to the gods:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-10', 'en', 'Since you gods did not set aside my share when I sought it, I will cut off your precious heads with this bow.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-11', 'en', 'Then all the gods, dismayed, best of sages, appeased the lord of gods, and Bhava was pleased with them.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-12', 'en', 'Pleased with them all, he gave it to those great ones.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-13', 'en', 'So this jewel of a bow belonging to the god of gods was placed with our ancestor as a trust, lord.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-14', 'en', 'Then, while I was ploughing a field, a girl rose up from the plough. Found while I was clearing the field, she is known by the name Sita.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-15', 'en', 'Risen from the earth, she grew up as my daughter. I have set this daughter, not born of a womb, as a prize to be won by strength.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-16', 'en', 'Kings came and asked for the hand of my daughter, risen from the earth, as she grew up, best of sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-17', 'en', 'To all those kings who sought the girl I said, lord, I will not give my daughter except as the prize of strength.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-18', 'en', 'Then all the kings came together to Mithila, wanting to test their strength.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-19', 'en', 'The bow was brought to those testing their strength, but they could not grasp it or even lift it.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-20', 'en', 'Knowing the strength of those strong men to be small, great sage, I turned the kings away. Hear what followed, ascetic.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-21', 'en', 'Then the kings, in great anger, doubting their own strength, all besieged Mithila, best of sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-22', 'en', 'Knowing they had been rejected, best of sages, they were filled with great rage and harassed the city of Mithila.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-23', 'en', 'Then after a full year all my resources were exhausted, best of sages, and I was deeply distressed.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-24', 'en', 'Then I won over all the gods by austerity, and they, well pleased, gave me an army of four divisions.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-25', 'en', 'Then the kings, broken and being struck down, fled in all directions with their ministers, weak and wrongdoing, their strength now in doubt.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-26', 'en', 'This most radiant bow, tiger among sages, I will show to Rama and Lakshmana too, man of good vows.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-65-27', 'en', 'If Rama can string this bow, sage, I will give my daughter Sita, not born of a womb, to the son of Dasharatha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-1', 'en', 'Hearing Janaka, the great sage Vishvamitra said to the king, Show the bow to Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-2', 'en', 'Then King Janaka ordered his ministers: Bring the divine bow, adorned with perfume and garlands.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-3', 'en', 'At Janaka''s command the ministers entered the city and came out with the bow in front, by the king''s order.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-4', 'en', 'Five thousand tall, strong men somehow pulled that eight-wheeled chest.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-5', 'en', 'Bringing that iron chest in which the bow lay, the king''s ministers spoke to god-like Janaka.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-6', 'en', 'Here is the finest of bows, O king, honoured by all kings, lord of Mithila, if you wish it to be seen.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-7', 'en', 'Hearing them, the king folded his hands and spoke to great Vishvamitra and to Rama and Lakshmana.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-8', 'en', 'This finest bow, brahmin, is honoured by the Janakas, and mighty kings were unable to string it.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-9', 'en', 'Neither all the hosts of gods, nor asuras, nor rakshasas, nor the best of gandharvas and yakshas, with kinnaras and great serpents, could do it.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-10', 'en', 'What chance have humans of drawing, stringing, fitting an arrow to, bending or even lifting this bow?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-11', 'en', 'This best of bows has been brought, best of sages. Show it, fortunate one, to these two princes.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-12', 'en', 'Righteous Vishvamitra, hearing Janaka, said to Raghava, Child Rama, look at the bow.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-13', 'en', 'At the great sage''s word, Rama went to where the bow lay, opened the chest, looked at the bow and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-14', 'en', 'Brahmin, I will touch this fine bow with my hand, and I will try to lift it and draw it.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-15', 'en', 'Very well, said the king and the sage. At the sage''s word he took the bow by the middle with ease.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-16', 'en', 'While many thousands of men watched, the righteous joy of the Raghus strung the bow as if in play.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-17', 'en', 'Having strung it, the mighty one drew the string fully, and the famous best of men broke the bow in the middle.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-18', 'en', 'There was a great sound like a thunderclap, and a great quaking of the earth, as when a mountain splits.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-19', 'en', 'All the people fell down, stunned by the sound, except the great sage, the king and the two Raghavas.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-20', 'en', 'When the people recovered, the king, his fear gone, folded his hands and spoke to the best of sages, eloquent as he was.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-21', 'en', 'Lord, I have seen the strength of Rama, son of Dasharatha. This is most wonderful, beyond thought, beyond anything I imagined.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-22', 'en', 'My daughter Sita, gaining Rama, son of Dasharatha, as her husband, will bring glory to the family of the Janakas.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-23', 'en', 'And my promise, that she is the prize of strength, has proved true, Kaushika. My daughter Sita, dearer than my life, is to be given to Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-24', 'en', 'With your permission, brahmin, let my ministers go quickly to Ayodhya by chariot, Kaushika, bless you.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-25', 'en', 'Let them bring the king to my city with courteous words and tell him all about the giving of the bride won by strength.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-26', 'en', 'Let them tell the king that the Kakutstha princes are under the sage''s protection, and let them swiftly bring the delighted king here.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-66-27', 'en', 'Kaushika agreed, and the righteous king, having spoken to his ministers, sent them to Ayodhya with his instructions.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-1', 'en', 'Sent by Janaka, the messengers, their horses weary, stayed three nights on the way and entered the city of Ayodhya.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-2', 'en', 'Admitted into the palace by the king''s order, the messengers saw old King Dasharatha, like a god.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-3', 'en', 'With palms joined, all the messengers, free of fear, respectfully spoke sweet words to the king.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-4', 'en', 'King Janaka of Mithila, with his sacred fires before him, together with his teachers and priests, asks after your lasting welfare.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-5', 'en', 'Again and again, in sweet and loving words, Janaka asks after you and your attendants, great king.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-6', 'en', 'Having asked after your welfare, the Videha lord of Mithila, with Kaushika''s consent, sends you this message.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-7', 'en', 'My earlier vow is well known, that my daughter is the prize of strength; and angry kings, lacking strength, have been turned away.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-8', 'en', 'This daughter of mine has been won, O king, by your sons, the heroes who came here by chance, led by Vishvamitra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-9', 'en', 'And that divine bow, O king, was broken in the middle by great Rama, before a vast assembly of people.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-10', 'en', 'I must give Sita, prize of strength, to this great one. I wish to fulfil my promise; please give your consent.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-11', 'en', 'Come quickly, great king, with your teachers and priests, bless you; you should see the two Raghavas.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-12', 'en', 'Please make my joy complete, lord of kings; you too will share the joy of both your sons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-13', 'en', 'So the lord of Videha spoke sweetly, with Vishvamitra''s consent and following Shatananda''s advice.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-14', 'en', 'Hearing the messengers, the king was overjoyed and spoke to Vasishtha, Vamadeva and his other ministers.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-15', 'en', 'Protected by Kushika''s son, Kausalya''s joy lives among the Videhas with his brother Lakshmana.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-16', 'en', 'Great Janaka has seen Kakutstha''s strength and wants to give his daughter to Raghava.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-17', 'en', 'If great Janaka''s proposal pleases you, let us go quickly to his city; let no time be lost.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-18', 'en', 'The ministers and all the great sages said, Very well. The delighted king told the ministers, We set out tomorrow.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-67-19', 'en', 'The ministers of the king of men, all endowed with every virtue, stayed the night happily, highly honoured.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-1', 'en', 'When the night had passed, King Dasharatha, delighted, with his teachers and kin, said to Sumantra:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-2', 'en', 'Let all the treasurers go ahead today, well prepared, with abundant wealth and many kinds of jewels.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-3', 'en', 'Let the four-part army set out quickly, and the finest carriages and horses, the moment I command.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-4', 'en', 'Vasishtha, Vamadeva, Jabali, Kashyapa, long-lived Markandeya and the sage Katyayana:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-5', 'en', 'Let these brahmins go ahead. Yoke my chariot, so there is no delay, for the messengers are hurrying me.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-6', 'en', 'At the king''s word, the four-part army followed behind the king as he went with the sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-7', 'en', 'After four days'' journey he reached the Videhas, and glorious King Janaka, hearing of it, prepared to honour him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-8', 'en', 'Then, meeting old King Dasharatha, King Janaka was delighted and filled with joy, and the best of men spoke to the best of men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-9', 'en', 'Welcome, great king. Happily you have come, Raghava. You will rejoice in both your sons, won by their strength.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-10', 'en', 'Happily the mighty, blessed sage Vasishtha has come with all the best brahmins, like Indra with the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-11', 'en', 'Happily my obstacles are overcome; happily my family is honoured by this alliance with the great Raghavas, foremost in strength.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-12', 'en', 'Tomorrow morning, king of kings, at the end of the sacrifice, please hold the wedding approved by the sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-13', 'en', 'Hearing him, among the sages, the eloquent king replied to the lord of the earth:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-14', 'en', 'Receiving depends on the giver, I have long heard. We will do as you say, knower of dharma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-15', 'en', 'Hearing these righteous and noble words of the truthful king, the lord of Videha was greatly amazed.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-16', 'en', 'Then all the sages, meeting one another with great joy, spent that night happily.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-17', 'en', 'The king, seeing his two Raghava sons, was overjoyed and stayed, well pleased and honoured by Janaka.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-68-18', 'en', 'Mighty Janaka, who knew the truth, also performed the rites for the sacrifice and for his two daughters according to dharma, and spent the night.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-1', 'en', 'Then at dawn, having done his rites with the great sages, eloquent Janaka spoke to his priest Shatananda.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-2', 'en', 'My mighty younger brother, very righteous, known as Kushadhvaja, lives in a beautiful city,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-3', 'en', 'Sankashya, holy and lovely like the flying chariot Pushpaka, bounded by the river Ikshumati that it drinks from.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-4', 'en', 'I want to see him; I consider him a guardian of my sacrifice. Let the mighty one share this joy with me.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-5', 'en', 'At the king''s command they set out on swift horses to fetch the tiger among men, as Vishnu is fetched at Indra''s command.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-6', 'en', 'At the king''s command Kushadhvaja came.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-7', 'en', 'He saw great Janaka, devoted to dharma, and greeted Shatananda and the righteous king.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-8', 'en', 'He took a splendid, divine seat fit for a king. The two brothers of boundless strength sat down together.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-9', 'en', 'The two heroes sent Sudamana, the chief minister: Go quickly, lord of ministers, and bring the radiant, invincible Ikshvaku king with his sons and ministers.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-10', 'en', 'Going to the guest lodge, he saw the one who prospers the Raghu line, bowed his head and said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-11', 'en', 'Hero, lord of Ayodhya, the Videha lord of Mithila wishes to see you with your teachers and priests.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-12', 'en', 'Hearing the chief minister, the king with the sages and his kin went to where Janaka was.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-13', 'en', 'The king, with ministers, teachers and kin, best of speakers, said this to the Videha king:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-14', 'en', 'As you know, great king, the blessed sage Vasishtha is the family deity of the Ikshvakus and speaks for us in all matters.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-15', 'en', 'With Vishvamitra''s permission and with all the great sages, righteous Vasishtha will speak for me in due order.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-16', 'en', 'When Dasharatha fell silent, the blessed sage Vasishtha, skilled in speech, spoke to the Videha king and his priest.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-17', 'en', 'Brahma, born of the unmanifest, eternal, everlasting and unchanging; from him was born Marichi, and Kashyapa was Marichi''s son.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-18', 'en', 'From Kashyapa was born Vivasvan, the sun; his son is called Manu Vaivasvata. Manu was the first lord of creatures, and Ikshvaku was Manu''s son.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-19', 'en', 'Know that Ikshvaku was the first king in Ayodhya. From Ikshvaku was born glorious Vikukshi.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-20', 'en', 'Vikukshi''s son was mighty, valiant Bana; Bana''s son was mighty, valiant Anaranya.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-21', 'en', 'From Anaranya was born Prithu; Trishanku was Prithu''s son; Trishanku''s son was famous Dhundhumara.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-22', 'en', 'From Dhundhumara came mighty Yuvanashva, a great chariot warrior; Yuvanashva''s son was glorious Mandhata, lord of the earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-23', 'en', 'Mandhata''s son was glorious Susandhi; Susandhi had two sons, Dhruvasandhi and Prasenajit.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-24', 'en', 'Dhruvasandhi''s famous son was named Bharata; from Bharata was born mighty Asita.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-25', 'en', 'Sagara was born with poison, and so was called Sagara. Sagara''s son was Asamanja, and Asamanja''s son Amshuman.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-26', 'en', 'Dilipa was Amshuman''s son, Dilipa''s son Bhagiratha; from Bhagiratha came Kakutstha, and Kakutstha''s son was Raghu.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-27', 'en', 'Raghu''s son was radiant Pravriddha, who became a man-eater named Kalmashapada; from him was born Shankhana.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-28', 'en', 'Sudarshana was Shankhana''s son, Agnivarna Sudarshana''s; Shighraga was Agnivarna''s son, and Maru Shighraga''s.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-29', 'en', 'Maru''s son was Prashushruka, and from Prashushruka came Ambarisha; Ambarisha''s son was Nahusha, lord of the earth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-30', 'en', 'Nahusha''s son was Yayati, and Nabhaga was born of Yayati; Nabhaga''s son was Aja, and from Aja came Dasharatha. From this Dasharatha were born the brothers Rama and Lakshmana.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-31', 'en', 'They are of kings pure from the first line, supremely righteous, born in the Ikshvaku family, heroes and speakers of truth.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-69-32', 'en', 'On behalf of Rama and Lakshmana I ask for your daughters, O king. You should give equals to equals, best of men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-1', 'en', 'As he spoke, Janaka replied with folded hands: Please listen, bless you, as our family''s line is recited.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-2', 'en', 'When giving a daughter, best of sages, one born of a good family should declare the whole lineage. Hear it, great sage.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-3', 'en', 'There was a king famed in the three worlds for his deeds, Nimi, supremely righteous, best of the mighty.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-4', 'en', 'His son was named Mithi, and Mithi''s son was Janaka, the first to be called Janaka; from Janaka came Udavasu.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-5', 'en', 'From Udavasu was born righteous Nandivardhana; Nandivardhana''s son was named Suketu.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-6', 'en', 'From Suketu came righteous, mighty Devarata; the royal sage Devarata''s son was known as Brihadratha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-7', 'en', 'Brihadratha''s son was heroic, valiant Mahavira; Mahavira''s son was steadfast Sudhriti, true in valour.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-8', 'en', 'Sudhriti''s son was righteous Dhrishtaketu; the royal sage Dhrishtaketu''s son was known as Haryashva.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-9', 'en', 'Haryashva''s son was Maru, Maru''s son Pratindhaka; Pratindhaka''s son was the righteous King Kirtiratha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-10', 'en', 'Kirtiratha''s son is remembered as Devamidha; Devamidha''s son was Vibudha, and Vibudha''s Mahidhraka.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-11', 'en', 'Mahidhraka''s son was the mighty King Kirtirata; to the royal sage Kirtirata was born Maharoma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-12', 'en', 'To Maharoma was born righteous Svarnaroma; to the royal sage Svarnaroma was born Hrasvaroma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-13', 'en', 'Two sons were born to that righteous great soul: I am the elder, and my younger brother is heroic Kushadhvaja.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-14', 'en', 'My father, the king, crowned me, the elder, placed Kushadhvaja in my care, and went to the forest.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-15', 'en', 'When my old father went to heaven, I carried the burden rightly, looking on my god-like brother Kushadhvaja with love.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-16', 'en', 'Then after some time a mighty king, Sudhanva, came from the city of Sankashya and besieged Mithila.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-17', 'en', 'He sent me word: Give me Shiva''s matchless bow and the lotus-eyed maiden Sita.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-18', 'en', 'Because I refused, brahmin sage, there was a battle with me, and King Sudhanva, facing me, was killed by me in battle.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-19', 'en', 'Having killed King Sudhanva, best of sages, I crowned my heroic brother Kushadhvaja in Sankashya.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-20', 'en', 'This is my younger brother and I am the elder, great sage. Overjoyed, I give you two brides, best of sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-21', 'en', 'Sita to Rama, bless you, and Urmila to Lakshmana: my daughter Sita, won by strength, like a daughter of the gods,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-22', 'en', 'and the second, Urmila. I say it three times, without doubt: overjoyed, I give you two brides, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-23', 'en', 'Have the gift of cows performed for Rama and Lakshmana, O king, and the rites for the ancestors, bless you; then perform the wedding.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-70-24', 'en', 'Today the moon is in Magha, mighty one; on the third day, under Uttara Phalguni, hold the wedding, O king. Let gifts be made for Rama and Lakshmana that bring happiness.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-1', 'en', 'When the Videha king had spoken, the great sage Vishvamitra, with Vasishtha, spoke to the heroic king.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-2', 'en', 'The families of the Ikshvakus and the Videhas are beyond thought and measure, bull among men; there is none equal to them.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-3', 'en', 'This is a fitting union in dharma and in beauty, O king: Rama and Lakshmana with Sita and Urmila.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-4', 'en', 'I have something more to say, best of men; hear my words.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-5', 'en', 'This King Kushadhvaja is your righteous younger brother. We ask for his two daughters, unmatched in beauty on earth, as wives, best of men.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-6', 'en', 'We ask for the daughters, O king, for Prince Bharata and wise Shatrughna, those two great souls.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-7', 'en', 'These sons of Dasharatha are all endowed with beauty and youth, like guardians of the world, with god-like valour.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-8', 'en', 'Let the Ikshvaku family be bound by this alliance with both of you, lord of kings, who do holy deeds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-9', 'en', 'Hearing Vishvamitra, with Vasishtha agreeing, Janaka folded his hands and spoke to the two great sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-10', 'en', 'Since you yourselves command this fitting family union, so be it, bless you. Let these two daughters of Kushadhvaja be the wives of Shatrughna and Bharata together.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-11', 'en', 'On a single day, great sage, let the four mighty princes take the hands of the four princesses.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-12', 'en', 'The wise praise the next day, under the two Phalgunis, for weddings, brahmin, where Bhaga is lord.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-13', 'en', 'Having spoken these gentle words, King Janaka rose, folded his hands, and said to both great sages:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-14', 'en', 'You have done me the highest dharma; I am always your disciple. Let the two great sages take these chief seats.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-15', 'en', 'As this city is Dasharatha''s, so is Ayodhya mine. There is no doubt of your authority; act as is fitting.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-16', 'en', 'When the Videha Janaka said this, the joy of the Raghus, King Dasharatha, delighted, replied to the king.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-17', 'en', 'You two brothers, lords of Mithila, have countless virtues; sages and kings have been honoured by you.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-18', 'en', 'Prosper, bless you. I will go to my lodging and perform all the rites for the ancestors, he said.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-19', 'en', 'Taking leave of the king, famous King Dasharatha went quickly, with the two great sages in front.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-20', 'en', 'Reaching his lodging, the king performed the ancestral rite as prescribed; rising early in the morning he made the excellent gift of cows.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-21', 'en', 'The king gave hundreds of thousands of cows to brahmins, for each of his sons, according to dharma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-22', 'en', 'Four hundred thousand cows, with gold-tipped horns, healthy, with calves and with bronze milking pails, the bull among men gave.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-23', 'en', 'And much other wealth the joy of the Raghus, loving his sons, gave to the brahmins as the cow-gift for his sons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-71-24', 'en', 'Surrounded by his sons who had made their cow-gifts, the king shone like gentle Prajapati surrounded by the world guardians.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-1', 'en', 'On the very day the king made the great cow-gift, the hero Yudhajit arrived.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-2', 'en', 'He was the son of the Kekaya king, Bharata''s own maternal uncle. Seeing the king and asking after his welfare, he said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-3', 'en', 'The king of Kekaya asks lovingly after your welfare. Those whose welfare you wish for are now well.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-4', 'en', 'The king wishes to see my sister''s son, lord of kings; for that I came to Ayodhya, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-5', 'en', 'But hearing in Ayodhya that your sons had come to Mithila with you for their marriage, I hurried here, wishing to see my sister''s son.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-6', 'en', 'King Dasharatha, seeing his dear guest arrive, honoured him with the highest hospitality.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-7', 'en', 'After spending that night with his great sons, he went to the sacrificial ground with the sages in front.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-8', 'en', 'At the auspicious hour called Vijaya, Rama, with his brothers all adorned with jewels and with the wedding thread and blessings done, came with Vasishtha and the other great sages in front.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-9', 'en', 'Blessed Vasishtha came and said to the Videha king:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-10', 'en', 'King Dasharatha, with his sons whose wedding rites are done, best of men, awaits the giver.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-11', 'en', 'All purposes are fulfilled through giver and receiver. Fulfil your own duty and perform the great wedding.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-12', 'en', 'Thus addressed by great Vasishtha, the most generous and mighty king, who knew dharma well, replied:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-13', 'en', 'Who stands as doorkeeper for me? Whose order is awaited? What hesitation is there in one''s own home? This kingdom is yours.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-14', 'en', 'My daughters, with all wedding rites done, have come to the foot of the altar, best of sages, shining like flames of fire.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-15', 'en', 'I am ready and waiting for you, standing at this altar. Let the king proceed without delay; why wait?', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-16', 'en', 'Hearing Janaka''s words, Dasharatha brought in all his sons and the sages.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-17', 'en', 'King Janaka said to the joy of Kausalya: This is Sita, my daughter, your partner in dharma. Accept her, bless you; take her hand in your hand.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-18', 'en', 'Lakshmana, come, bless you, take the hand of Urmila whom I offer. Accept her; let no time be lost.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-19', 'en', 'Having said this, Janaka spoke to Bharata: Take Mandavi''s hand in your hand, joy of the Raghus.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-20', 'en', 'And the righteous lord Janaka said to Shatrughna: Mighty one, take Shrutakirti''s hand in your hand.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-21', 'en', 'All of you are gentle and of good conduct. Let the Kakutsthas be with their wives; let no time be lost.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-22', 'en', 'Hearing Janaka''s words, the four princes, following Vasishtha''s guidance, took the hands of the four brides in their hands.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-23', 'en', 'Circling the fire, the altar, the king and the great sages, the best of the Raghus with their wives performed the marriage as prescribed.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-24', 'en', 'A great, shining rain of flowers fell from the sky, with the sound of heavenly drums, songs and music.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-25', 'en', 'Troupes of apsaras danced and gandharvas sang sweetly; the wedding of the Raghu princes was a marvel.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-26', 'en', 'Amid this, with the sound of trumpets, the mighty princes walked three times round the fire and wedded their wives.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-72-27', 'en', 'Then the joys of the Raghus went with their wives to the guest lodge, and the king followed, watching, with the sages and kin.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-1', 'en', 'When the night had passed, the great sage Vishvamitra took leave of both kings and went to the northern mountain.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-2', 'en', 'When Vishvamitra had gone, King Dasharatha took leave of the Videha lord of Mithila and quickly set out for his city.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-3', 'en', 'Then the Videha king gave much bridal wealth, many hundreds of thousands of cows, the lord of Mithila.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-4', 'en', 'Fine blankets, millions of silk and linen garments, elephants, horses, chariots and foot soldiers, divine-looking and well adorned,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-5', 'en', 'the father of the brides gave excellent attendants, and gold, bullion, pearls and coral.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-6', 'en', 'Overjoyed, he gave the finest bridal wealth. Having given great riches, the king took leave of the other king,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-7', 'en', 'and the lord of Mithila entered his own home in Mithila. The lord of Ayodhya too, with his great sons,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-8', 'en', 'went with all the sages in front, with his army following. As the tiger among men went on with the sages and the Raghavas,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-9', 'en', 'fearsome birds cried out on all sides, while all the animals of the earth went round them to the right.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-10', 'en', 'Seeing them, the tiger among kings asked Vasishtha: The birds are ominous and fearsome, yet the animals go to the right. What is this? My heart trembles and my mind sinks.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-11', 'en', 'Hearing King Dasharatha, the great sage replied sweetly: Hear what this means.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-12', 'en', 'A terrible danger from the heavens is at hand, foretold by the birds; the animals show it will be calmed. Let go of this worry.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-13', 'en', 'As they spoke, a wind arose, shaking the whole earth and throwing down fine trees.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-14', 'en', 'The sun was covered by darkness, no direction could be seen, everything was covered in ash and the army was bewildered.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-15', 'en', 'Only Vasishtha, the other sages and the king with his sons stayed conscious; everyone else lost their senses.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-16', 'en', 'In that fearful darkness, the army, as if covered in ash, saw a terrifying figure wearing a crown of matted hair,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-17', 'en', 'unassailable as Mount Kailasa, unbearable as the fire at the end of time, blazing with power and hard for ordinary people to look upon,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-18', 'en', 'with an axe on his shoulder and a bow like a mass of lightning, holding a fine arrow, like Shiva who destroyed the three cities.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-19', 'en', 'Seeing him, terrible and blazing like fire, the brahmins led by Vasishtha, devoted to prayer and offerings, gathered and whispered among themselves:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-20', 'en', 'Surely, angry at his father''s killing, he will not wipe out the kshatriyas again? He already slew them before and his rage and fever are gone; he cannot mean to destroy the warriors once more.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-21', 'en', 'Saying this, the sages took water of welcome to the fearsome Bhargava and greeted him sweetly, Rama, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-73-22', 'en', 'Accepting the honour the sages gave, mighty Rama, son of Jamadagni, spoke to Rama, son of Dasharatha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-1', 'en', 'Rama, son of Dasharatha, hero, I hear your strength is wondrous; I have heard all about the breaking of the bow.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-2', 'en', 'That breaking of the bow by you is wondrous and beyond thought. Hearing of it I have come, bringing another fine bow.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-3', 'en', 'Here is the great, fearsome bow of Jamadagni''s line. Draw it with an arrow and show your own strength.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-4', 'en', 'Seeing your strength in drawing this bow, I will give you a duel worthy of your valour.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-5', 'en', 'Hearing his words, King Dasharatha, downcast and miserable, folded his hands and spoke:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-6', 'en', 'Your anger against the warriors is calmed, famous brahmin. Please give safety to my young sons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-7', 'en', 'You were born in the Bhargava family, devoted to study and vows; you promised Indra and laid down your weapons.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-8', 'en', 'Devoted to dharma, you gave the earth to Kashyapa and went to the forest, making your home on Mount Mahendra.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-9', 'en', 'Have you come, great sage, to destroy us all? If Rama alone is killed, none of us will live.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-10', 'en', 'While Dasharatha spoke, mighty Jamadagnya ignored him and spoke only to Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-11', 'en', 'These two bows were the finest, divine and famous in the world, strong, mighty and well made by Vishvakarma.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-12', 'en', 'One the gods gave to three-eyed Shiva when he wished to fight, the destroyer of the three cities, best of men; that is the one you broke, Kakutstha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-13', 'en', 'This second, invincible one the best of gods gave to Vishnu. It is equal in power to Shiva''s bow, Kakutstha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-14', 'en', 'Then all the gods asked the Grandfather, wanting to know who was stronger, blue-throated Shiva or Vishnu.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-15', 'en', 'Knowing the gods'' wish, the Grandfather, best of the truthful, stirred up a quarrel between them.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-16', 'en', 'In that quarrel there was a great, hair-raising battle between Shiva and Vishnu, each seeking to defeat the other.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-17', 'en', 'Then Shiva''s terrible bow was slackened, and three-eyed Mahadeva was stopped by a mere hum.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-18', 'en', 'Then the gods with the sages and charanas came and begged the two great gods for peace, and they calmed down.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-19', 'en', 'Seeing Shiva''s bow slackened by Vishnu''s might, the gods and sages then held Vishnu to be greater.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-20', 'en', 'Angry, famous Rudra gave his bow with its arrows into the hands of the royal sage Devarata among the Videhas.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-21', 'en', 'And this bow of Vishnu, Rama, conqueror of enemy cities, Vishnu gave to Richika of Bhrigu''s line as a great trust.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-22', 'en', 'Mighty Richika gave the divine bow to his son, my father, great Jamadagni, who did no harm.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-23', 'en', 'When my father had laid down his weapons and was strong in austerity, Arjuna, following a base mind, killed him.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-24', 'en', 'Hearing of my father''s terrible, unjust killing, in anger I wiped out the kshatriyas again and again, as they were born.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-25', 'en', 'Gaining the whole earth, Rama, I gave it to great Kashyapa, doer of holy deeds, as the fee at the end of a sacrifice,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-26', 'en', 'and lived on Mahendra, strong in austerity. Hearing of the breaking of the bow, I came quickly.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-27', 'en', 'So, Rama, take this great bow of Vishnu, of my father and grandfather, honouring the dharma of the warrior.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-74-28', 'en', 'Set on this finest bow an arrow that conquers enemy cities. If you can, Kakutstha, I will then give you a duel.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-1', 'en', 'Hearing Jamadagnya''s words, Dasharatha''s son, who had held back his speech out of respect for his father, spoke to Parashurama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-2', 'en', 'I have heard of what you did, Bhargava, and we respect it, brahmin, since you were repaying your debt to your father.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-3', 'en', 'You belittle me as weak and incapable in a warrior''s duty, Bhargava. See my strength and valour today.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-4', 'en', 'Saying this, Raghava, angered and swift, took the fine weapon and arrow from Bhargava''s hand.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-5', 'en', 'Rama strung the bow and set the arrow, then, angry, said to Rama son of Jamadagni:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-6', 'en', 'You are a brahmin and so worthy of my honour, and also for Vishvamitra''s sake; so I cannot release this life-taking arrow at you, Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-7', 'en', 'But I will destroy either your power to travel, Rama, or the matchless worlds you have earned by austerity, whichever you choose.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-8', 'en', 'For this divine arrow of Vishnu, conqueror of cities, which crushes strength and pride, does not fall in vain.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-9', 'en', 'To see Rama holding that great weapon, the gods and sages gathered in crowds, with the Grandfather in front,', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-10', 'en', 'and gandharvas, apsaras, siddhas, charanas, kinnaras, yakshas, rakshasas and nagas, to see that great wonder.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-11', 'en', 'While the world stood stunned and Rama held the great bow, Jamadagnya, his strength gone, gazed at Rama.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-12', 'en', 'Stunned, his strength drained by that power, Jamadagnya spoke slowly to lotus-eyed Rama:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-13', 'en', 'When long ago I gave the earth to Kashyapa, Kashyapa told me, You must not live in my realm.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-14', 'en', 'Following my guru''s word, I do not stay a night on the earth; this promise I made to Kashyapa, Kakutstha.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-15', 'en', 'So, hero Raghava, you should not destroy my power to travel; I will go swift as thought to Mahendra, the best of mountains.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-16', 'en', 'But the matchless worlds I won by austerity, Rama, destroy them with your fine arrow; let no time be lost.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-17', 'en', 'I know you are the imperishable lord of gods, slayer of Madhu, from your touch on this bow. May you prosper, scorcher of foes.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-18', 'en', 'All these gods have gathered and are watching you, matchless in deeds and without rival in battle.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-19', 'en', 'It is no shame to me, Kakutstha, that I am turned back by you, lord of the three worlds.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-20', 'en', 'Release your matchless arrow, Rama of good vows; when it is released I will go to Mahendra, best of mountains.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-21', 'en', 'As Jamadagnya said this, mighty, glorious Rama son of Dasharatha loosed the excellent arrow.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-22', 'en', 'Then all the directions and the spaces between grew clear of darkness, and the gods and sages praised Rama with his weapon raised.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-75-23', 'en', 'Rama Jamadagnya praised Rama son of Dasharatha, walked respectfully round him and went his own way.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-1', 'en', 'When Parashurama had gone, Rama son of Dasharatha, calm again, gave the bow and arrow into the hands of immeasurable Varuna.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-2', 'en', 'Then Rama greeted the sages led by Vasishtha, and seeing his father shaken, the joy of the Raghus said:', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-3', 'en', 'Jamadagnya Rama has gone. Let the four-part army, protected by you as lord, set out towards Ayodhya.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-4', 'en', 'Hearing Rama, King Dasharatha embraced his son with both arms and kissed Raghava on the head.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-5', 'en', 'Hearing that Parashurama had gone, the king, glad and delighted, urged the army on and went quickly to the city.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-6', 'en', 'The city was lovely with flags and banners, ringing with music, its royal road sprinkled and strewn with heaps of flowers.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-7', 'en', 'The king entered the city, filled with citizens eager to welcome him and speaking blessings, adorned by crowds of people.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-8', 'en', 'Kausalya, Sumitra, slender-waisted Kaikeyi and the other royal ladies were busy receiving the brides.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-9', 'en', 'The king''s wives received fortunate Sita, famous Urmila and the two daughters of Kushadhvaja.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-10', 'en', 'Wearing fine linen, graced with blessings, they all quickly worshipped at the temples of the gods.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-11', 'en', 'Greeting those worthy of greeting, all the princesses lived happily in private with their husbands.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-12', 'en', 'Married, skilled in arms, with wealth and friends, the bulls among men lived serving their father.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-13', 'en', 'Among them Rama, true in valour and most famous in the world, became the most virtuous, like Brahma among beings.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-14', 'en', 'Rama delighted with Sita through many seasons; high-minded, he was devoted to her, ever set in her heart.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-15', 'en', 'Sita was dear to Rama because his father had chosen her as his wife, and their love grew all the more through her virtues and beauty.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-16', 'en', 'And her husband lived twice over in her heart; heart spoke clearly to heart even what was hidden within.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-17', 'en', 'Maithili, Janaka''s daughter, was even more to him, equal to goddesses in beauty, like Shri herself in bodily form.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true),
('ramayana-1-76-18', 'en', 'United with that lovely, most loving, finest of princesses, Rama the royal sage''s son shone greatly, like Vishnu, lord of the immortals, with Shri.', 'veda-app-ai-draft', true);
insert into explanations (verse_id, language, meaning, explanation, keywords, source_id, status) values
('ramayana-1-1-1', 'en', 'The Ramayana begins with Valmiki questioning the sage Narada.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 1: the sage Narada tells Valmiki the whole story of Rama in brief. The poem opens with a teacher and a seeker, setting a tone of learning.', '[{"word":"vālmīki","meaning":"author of the Ramayana"},{"word":"nārada","meaning":"divine sage"},{"word":"tapas","meaning":"austerity"},{"word":"svādhyāya","meaning":"study"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-2', 'en', 'Valmiki asks: who is the ideal person alive today?', 'The questions list the qualities of an ideal human being. The answer will be Rama.', '[{"word":"guṇavān","meaning":"virtuous"},{"word":"dharmajña","meaning":"knower of right conduct"},{"word":"kṛtajña","meaning":"grateful"},{"word":"dṛḍhavrata","meaning":"firm in vows"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-3', 'en', 'Who is good, kind to all, wise and pleasing?', 'Character and care for all beings come first in Valmiki''s list.', '[{"word":"cāritra","meaning":"character"},{"word":"hita","meaning":"welfare"},{"word":"vidvān","meaning":"learned"},{"word":"priyadarśana","meaning":"pleasing to see"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-4', 'en', 'Who is calm and free of envy, yet mighty when roused?', 'The ideal person is gentle by nature but powerful when he must fight for what is right.', '[{"word":"jitakrodha","meaning":"anger conquered"},{"word":"anasūyaka","meaning":"free of envy"},{"word":"saṃyuga","meaning":"battle"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-5', 'en', 'Valmiki asks Narada to name such a person.', 'Valmiki trusts Narada, who travels the three worlds, to know the answer.', '[{"word":"kautūhala","meaning":"curiosity"},{"word":"maharṣi","meaning":"great sage"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-6', 'en', 'Narada happily agrees to answer.', 'Narada is pleased by the question because it lets him speak of Rama.', '[{"word":"triloka","meaning":"three worlds"},{"word":"prahṛṣṭa","meaning":"delighted"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-7', 'en', 'Such qualities are rare, but Narada knows one who has them all.', 'Narada stresses that these virtues seldom appear together.', '[{"word":"durlabha","meaning":"rare"},{"word":"guṇa","meaning":"quality"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-8', 'en', 'The ideal man is Rama of the Ikshvaku dynasty.', 'Rama is introduced. Ikshvaku was the founder of the solar dynasty of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"ikṣvāku","meaning":"royal solar dynasty"},{"word":"rāma","meaning":"the hero"},{"word":"dhṛtimān","meaning":"steadfast"},{"word":"vaśī","meaning":"self-mastered"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-9', 'en', 'Rama is wise and eloquent, and strong in body.', 'Narada describes Rama''s mind and his noble appearance.', '[{"word":"nītimān","meaning":"knower of statecraft"},{"word":"vāgmī","meaning":"eloquent"},{"word":"kambugrīva","meaning":"conch-like neck"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-10', 'en', 'More signs of Rama''s strength and fine form.', 'Arms reaching the knees was an ancient sign of a great person.', '[{"word":"maheṣvāsa","meaning":"great archer"},{"word":"ājānubāhu","meaning":"arms reaching the knees"},{"word":"ariṃdama","meaning":"subduer of foes"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-11', 'en', 'Rama''s form is balanced and auspicious.', 'The description follows the old tradition of reading a person''s nature from bodily signs.', '[{"word":"samavibhaktāṅga","meaning":"balanced limbs"},{"word":"viśālākṣa","meaning":"large-eyed"},{"word":"śubhalakṣaṇa","meaning":"auspicious marks"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-12', 'en', 'Rama is righteous, truthful and devoted to his people.', 'Here the description turns from body to character. Keeping his word becomes central to the whole story.', '[{"word":"satyasaṃdha","meaning":"true to his word"},{"word":"prajā","meaning":"people, subjects"},{"word":"śuci","meaning":"pure"},{"word":"samādhimān","meaning":"focused"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-13', 'en', 'Rama protects all life and is learned and skilled.', 'He is both scholar and warrior, the ideal of a just king.', '[{"word":"jīvaloka","meaning":"world of the living"},{"word":"vedāṅga","meaning":"branches of the Veda"},{"word":"dhanurveda","meaning":"science of archery"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-14', 'en', 'Rama is learned, sharp, loved by everyone and never despairs.', 'Never being downcast (adīnātmā) foreshadows how he faces exile and loss.', '[{"word":"smṛtimān","meaning":"with good memory"},{"word":"pratibhānavān","meaning":"quick-witted"},{"word":"adīnātmā","meaning":"never downcast"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-15', 'en', 'Good people are drawn to Rama as rivers to the ocean.', 'A famous image: Rama is like the ocean that all good things flow toward.', '[{"word":"sindhu","meaning":"river"},{"word":"samudra","meaning":"ocean"},{"word":"sarvasama","meaning":"equal to all"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-16', 'en', 'Rama is deep as the ocean and steady as the Himalaya.', 'Kausalya is Rama''s mother. The comparisons show his depth and firmness.', '[{"word":"kausalyā","meaning":"Rama''s mother"},{"word":"gāmbhīrya","meaning":"depth"},{"word":"himavān","meaning":"the Himalaya"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-17', 'en', 'Mighty as Vishnu, gentle as the moon, patient as the earth.', 'Rama holds opposite strengths in balance: fierce in battle, endlessly forgiving.', '[{"word":"viṣṇu","meaning":"the preserver god"},{"word":"soma","meaning":"moon"},{"word":"kālāgni","meaning":"fire at the end of time"},{"word":"kṣamā","meaning":"patience"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-18', 'en', 'Generous as Kubera and truthful as Dharma itself.', 'Kubera is the god of wealth; Dharma, personified, is righteousness itself.', '[{"word":"dhanada","meaning":"Kubera, giver of wealth"},{"word":"tyāga","meaning":"generosity"},{"word":"satyaparākrama","meaning":"of true valour"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-19', 'en', 'Dasharatha decided to make Rama the crown prince.', 'The plot begins. Dasharatha, king of Ayodhya, wants to hand power to his worthy eldest son.', '[{"word":"daśaratha","meaning":"Rama''s father, king of Ayodhya"},{"word":"yauvarājya","meaning":"position of crown prince"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-20', 'en', 'Kaikeyi used old promises to demand Rama''s exile and Bharata''s coronation.', 'Kaikeyi, Bharata''s mother, had once been promised two boons by Dasharatha. She uses them to turn everything around.', '[{"word":"kaikeyī","meaning":"Dasharatha''s wife"},{"word":"vara","meaning":"boon"},{"word":"vivāsana","meaning":"exile"},{"word":"bharata","meaning":"Rama''s brother"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-21', 'en', 'Bound by his promise, the king had to exile Rama.', 'The king''s tragedy: keeping his word costs him his son. Truthfulness is a key value of the epic.', '[{"word":"satyavacana","meaning":"true word"},{"word":"dharmapāśa","meaning":"noose of duty"},{"word":"vivāsayām āsa","meaning":"exiled"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-22', 'en', 'Rama obeyed and went to the forest without complaint.', 'Rama accepts exile willingly so that his father''s word is kept.', '[{"word":"pratijñā","meaning":"promise"},{"word":"vana","meaning":"forest"},{"word":"nirdeśa","meaning":"command"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-23', 'en', 'Lakshmana went with Rama out of love.', 'Lakshmana, son of Queen Sumitra, chooses to share Rama''s hardship: a model of brotherly devotion.', '[{"word":"lakṣmaṇa","meaning":"Rama''s brother"},{"word":"sumitrā","meaning":"Lakshmana''s mother"},{"word":"sneha","meaning":"affection"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-24', 'en', 'Sita followed Rama into exile as a star follows the moon.', 'Sita refuses to stay behind. Rohini, a star, is the moon''s beloved in Indian myth.', '[{"word":"sītā","meaning":"Rama''s wife"},{"word":"rohiṇī","meaning":"a star, the moon''s consort"},{"word":"śaśin","meaning":"moon"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-25', 'en', 'At the Ganga, Rama sent the charioteer home.', 'The people of Ayodhya follow Rama a long way. At the Ganga he dismisses his charioteer and continues on foot.', '[{"word":"paura","meaning":"townspeople"},{"word":"sūta","meaning":"charioteer"},{"word":"gaṅgā","meaning":"the Ganges"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-26', 'en', 'The three travelled through forests to Chitrakuta.', 'The sage Bharadvaja suggests Chitrakuta hill as a place to stay.', '[{"word":"citrakūṭa","meaning":"a hill in the forest"},{"word":"bharadvāja","meaning":"a sage"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-27', 'en', 'They lived happily in a simple forest home.', 'Even in exile they find contentment together.', '[{"word":"āvasatha","meaning":"dwelling"},{"word":"gandharva","meaning":"celestial musicians"},{"word":"sukham","meaning":"happily"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-28', 'en', 'Dasharatha died of grief for Rama.', 'The cost of the king''s promise is his own life.', '[{"word":"putraśoka","meaning":"grief for a son"},{"word":"svarga","meaning":"heaven"},{"word":"vilapan","meaning":"lamenting"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-29', 'en', 'Bharata refused the throne and went to bring Rama back.', 'Bharata, though the boons were for him, rejects the crown. His loyalty to Rama is one of the epic''s great examples.', '[{"word":"vasiṣṭha","meaning":"royal priest"},{"word":"rājya","meaning":"kingdom"},{"word":"prasāda","meaning":"favour"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-30', 'en', 'Rama sent Bharata back with his sandals as a symbol of his rule.', 'Rama will not break his father''s word by returning early. His sandals will stand for him on the throne.', '[{"word":"pāduke","meaning":"sandals"},{"word":"nyāsa","meaning":"pledge, trust"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-31', 'en', 'Bharata ruled from a village as Rama''s stand-in, awaiting his return.', 'Bharata does not live in the palace; he governs humbly from Nandigrama in Rama''s name.', '[{"word":"nandigrāma","meaning":"village near Ayodhya"},{"word":"kāṅkṣā","meaning":"longing"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-32', 'en', 'Rama moved deeper into the Dandaka forest.', 'To avoid more visits from Ayodhya, Rama goes deeper into the wild.', '[{"word":"daṇḍaka","meaning":"a great forest"},{"word":"ekāgra","meaning":"single-minded"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-33', 'en', 'Rama killed Viradha and met many forest sages.', 'In the forest Rama protects the hermits and visits great sages.', '[{"word":"virādha","meaning":"a demon"},{"word":"agastya","meaning":"great sage"},{"word":"rākṣasa","meaning":"demon"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-34', 'en', 'Agastya gave Rama divine weapons.', 'These gifts prepare Rama for the battles ahead.', '[{"word":"aindra śarāsana","meaning":"Indra''s bow"},{"word":"khaḍga","meaning":"sword"},{"word":"akṣaya","meaning":"inexhaustible"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-35', 'en', 'The sages asked Rama to protect them from demons.', 'Rama takes on the duty of protecting the forest hermits.', '[{"word":"ṛṣi","meaning":"sage"},{"word":"vadha","meaning":"destruction"},{"word":"asura-rakṣas","meaning":"demons"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-36', 'en', 'Shurpanakha was disfigured.', 'Shurpanakha, Ravana''s sister, approached Rama and was mutilated by Lakshmana. This sets the war in motion.', '[{"word":"śūrpaṇakhā","meaning":"Ravana''s sister"},{"word":"kāmarūpiṇī","meaning":"shape-shifting"},{"word":"virūpitā","meaning":"disfigured"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-37', 'en', 'Shurpanakha roused the demons to attack.', 'She calls on her kinsmen to take revenge.', '[{"word":"khara, triśiras, dūṣaṇa","meaning":"demon leaders"},{"word":"udyukta","meaning":"roused"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-38', 'en', 'Rama alone defeated fourteen thousand demons.', 'A sign of Rama''s extraordinary power.', '[{"word":"raṇa","meaning":"battle"},{"word":"caturdaśa sahasra","meaning":"fourteen thousand"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-39', 'en', 'Enraged, Ravana sought Maricha''s help.', 'Ravana, king of Lanka, enters the story.', '[{"word":"rāvaṇa","meaning":"demon king of Lanka"},{"word":"mārīca","meaning":"a demon"},{"word":"krodha","meaning":"rage"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-40', 'en', 'Maricha warned Ravana not to provoke Rama.', 'Maricha had felt Rama''s power before and knows the danger.', '[{"word":"virodha","meaning":"enmity"},{"word":"balavat","meaning":"strong"},{"word":"kṣama","meaning":"wise, fitting"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-41', 'en', 'Ravana ignored the warning and set out.', '''Driven by time'' (kālacodita) suggests he is heading to his doom.', '[{"word":"kālacodita","meaning":"driven by fate"},{"word":"āśrama","meaning":"hermitage"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-42', 'en', 'Ravana abducted Sita and struck down the vulture Jatayu.', 'Maricha takes the form of a golden deer to lure Rama and Lakshmana away. Jatayu, an old vulture, tries to save Sita.', '[{"word":"māyāvin","meaning":"magician"},{"word":"jaṭāyus","meaning":"heroic vulture"},{"word":"jahāra","meaning":"carried off"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-43', 'en', 'Rama was overcome with grief at losing Sita.', 'The ideal hero is also deeply human in sorrow.', '[{"word":"maithilī","meaning":"Sita, princess of Mithila"},{"word":"śoka","meaning":"grief"},{"word":"vilalāpa","meaning":"wept"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-44', 'en', 'Rama honoured Jatayu with cremation and kept searching.', 'Rama performs funeral rites for the bird as for a family member.', '[{"word":"dagdhvā","meaning":"having cremated"},{"word":"mārgamāṇa","meaning":"searching"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-45', 'en', 'Rama freed the cursed demon Kabandha.', 'Burning Kabandha''s body releases him from a curse.', '[{"word":"kabandha","meaning":"a headless demon"},{"word":"vikṛta","meaning":"misshapen"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-46', 'en', 'Kabandha sent Rama to the devoted woman Shabari.', 'Shabari, a humble forest ascetic, is a beloved example of pure devotion.', '[{"word":"śabarī","meaning":"a devoted forest ascetic"},{"word":"śramaṇī","meaning":"female ascetic"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-47', 'en', 'After Shabari''s welcome, Rama met Hanuman.', 'Hanuman enters the story, who will become Rama''s greatest devotee.', '[{"word":"pūjita","meaning":"honoured"},{"word":"pampā","meaning":"a lake"},{"word":"hanumān","meaning":"Hanuman"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-48', 'en', 'Hanuman brought Rama to Sugriva.', 'Sugriva, an exiled monkey prince, becomes Rama''s ally.', '[{"word":"sugrīva","meaning":"monkey prince"},{"word":"śaṃsat","meaning":"told"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-49', 'en', 'Sugriva shared his own sorrow and his brother Vali''s power.', 'Sugriva has also lost his wife and home, to his brother Vali.', '[{"word":"vālin","meaning":"Sugriva''s brother"},{"word":"vaira","meaning":"feud"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-50', 'en', 'Rama vowed to help, but Sugriva had doubts.', 'Sugriva needs proof before he will trust Rama against Vali.', '[{"word":"pratijñāta","meaning":"promised"},{"word":"śaṅkita","meaning":"doubtful"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-51', 'en', 'Rama tossed a giant''s corpse far with his toe.', 'Dundubhi was a demon Vali had killed. Rama''s feat shows his might.', '[{"word":"dundubhi","meaning":"a slain giant"},{"word":"pratyaya","meaning":"confidence"},{"word":"yojana","meaning":"a measure of distance"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-52', 'en', 'One arrow pierced seven trees and a mountain.', 'This removes Sugriva''s doubts.', '[{"word":"sāla","meaning":"sal tree"},{"word":"rasātala","meaning":"underworld"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-53', 'en', 'Convinced, Sugriva went with Rama to Kishkindha.', 'Kishkindha is the monkey kingdom ruled by Vali.', '[{"word":"kiṣkindhā","meaning":"the monkey kingdom"},{"word":"viśvasta","meaning":"reassured"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-54', 'en', 'Sugriva challenged Vali, who came out to fight.', 'The two brothers face each other in combat.', '[{"word":"garjat","meaning":"roared"},{"word":"harīśvara","meaning":"lord of monkeys"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-55', 'en', 'Rama killed Vali and made Sugriva king.', 'Rama keeps his promise to his ally.', '[{"word":"āhava","meaning":"combat"},{"word":"rājya","meaning":"kingdom"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-56', 'en', 'Sugriva sent the monkeys everywhere to search for Sita.', 'Now Sugriva repays Rama by organizing the search.', '[{"word":"janakātmajā","meaning":"daughter of Janaka, Sita"},{"word":"diśaḥ","meaning":"directions"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-57', 'en', 'Hanuman leapt across the ocean to Lanka.', 'Sampati, Jatayu''s brother, tells them Sita is in Lanka. Hanuman''s great leap is one of the epic''s best-known moments.', '[{"word":"saṃpāti","meaning":"Jatayu''s brother"},{"word":"pupluve","meaning":"leapt"},{"word":"lavaṇārṇava","meaning":"salt ocean"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-58', 'en', 'Hanuman found Sita in Ravana''s Ashoka grove.', 'Sita is held captive but remains faithful, thinking of Rama.', '[{"word":"laṅkā","meaning":"Ravana''s city"},{"word":"aśokavanikā","meaning":"Ashoka grove"},{"word":"dhyāyantī","meaning":"lost in thought"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-59', 'en', 'Hanuman comforted Sita with Rama''s ring and news, then wrecked the grove''s gate.', 'The token is Rama''s ring. After reassuring her, Hanuman shows Ravana''s people his strength.', '[{"word":"abhijñāna","meaning":"token of recognition"},{"word":"toraṇa","meaning":"gateway"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-60', 'en', 'Hanuman fought many demons and then allowed himself to be caught.', 'He lets himself be taken so that he can meet Ravana.', '[{"word":"senāgraga","meaning":"commander"},{"word":"akṣa","meaning":"Ravana''s son"},{"word":"grahaṇa","meaning":"capture"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-61', 'en', 'Protected by a boon, Hanuman patiently let them bind him.', 'He knows the binding weapon cannot hold him for long.', '[{"word":"paitāmaha vara","meaning":"Brahma''s boon"},{"word":"astra","meaning":"divine weapon"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-62', 'en', 'Hanuman burned Lanka, sparing Sita, and returned.', 'With his tail set on fire by the demons, Hanuman sets the city ablaze.', '[{"word":"dagdhvā","meaning":"having burned"},{"word":"priya","meaning":"good news"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-63', 'en', 'Hanuman told Rama: ''I have seen Sita.''', 'His famous report is short and direct, bringing Rama immediate relief.', '[{"word":"pradakṣiṇa","meaning":"respectful circling"},{"word":"dṛṣṭā sītā","meaning":"Sita has been seen"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-64', 'en', 'Rama went to the shore and challenged the ocean with his arrows.', 'The army needs a way to cross to Lanka.', '[{"word":"mahodadhi","meaning":"great ocean"},{"word":"kṣobhayām āsa","meaning":"stirred up"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-65', 'en', 'The Ocean appeared, and Nala built a bridge to Lanka.', 'The god of the sea advises Rama, and the monkey Nala builds the famous bridge (setu).', '[{"word":"samudra","meaning":"ocean god"},{"word":"nala","meaning":"monkey engineer"},{"word":"setu","meaning":"bridge"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-66', 'en', 'Rama killed Ravana and crowned Vibhishana king.', 'Vibhishana, Ravana''s righteous brother, had joined Rama. Rama does not take Lanka for himself.', '[{"word":"vibhīṣaṇa","meaning":"Ravana''s brother"},{"word":"abhyaṣiñcat","meaning":"crowned"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-67', 'en', 'All the worlds rejoiced at Rama''s victory.', 'Ravana had troubled gods and humans alike, so his end brings joy everywhere.', '[{"word":"trailokya","meaning":"three worlds"},{"word":"carācara","meaning":"moving and unmoving"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-68', 'en', 'Rama, his mission complete, was at peace.', 'His duty fulfilled, Rama''s sorrow lifts.', '[{"word":"kṛtakṛtya","meaning":"one whose task is done"},{"word":"vijvara","meaning":"free from fever, care"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-69', 'en', 'Rama revived the fallen monkeys and flew to Nandigrama.', 'Pushpaka is the flying chariot once owned by Ravana.', '[{"word":"puṣpaka","meaning":"flying chariot"},{"word":"samutthāpya","meaning":"raising up"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-70', 'en', 'Reunited with his family, Rama became king.', 'Taking off the matted hair of a hermit marks the end of exile.', '[{"word":"jaṭā","meaning":"matted hair"},{"word":"anagha","meaning":"sinless"},{"word":"rājya","meaning":"kingdom"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-71', 'en', 'Under Rama, the people are happy, healthy and good.', 'Narada now describes Rama''s rule, ''Rama Rajya'', the ideal reign.', '[{"word":"durbhikṣa","meaning":"famine"},{"word":"nirāmaya","meaning":"free of illness"},{"word":"dhārmika","meaning":"righteous"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-72', 'en', 'In Rama''s reign, untimely death is unknown.', 'The ideal kingdom is described as free from untimely loss.', '[{"word":"putramaraṇa","meaning":"death of a son"},{"word":"avidhavā","meaning":"not widowed"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-73', 'en', 'No disasters strike, as in the age of truth.', 'Kṛta Yuga is the first, perfect age in Hindu time-cycles.', '[{"word":"kṛtayuga","meaning":"golden age"},{"word":"bhaya","meaning":"fear"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-74', 'en', 'Rama performs great sacrifices and gives generously.', 'The ideal king supports learning and religion.', '[{"word":"aśvamedha","meaning":"horse sacrifice"},{"word":"koṭi","meaning":"ten million"},{"word":"vidvān","meaning":"learned person"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-75', 'en', 'Rama will strengthen royal families and keep social order.', 'This reflects the ancient ideal of a stable, orderly society.', '[{"word":"rājavaṃśa","meaning":"royal lineage"},{"word":"cāturvarṇya","meaning":"four social classes"},{"word":"sva dharma","meaning":"one''s own duty"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-76', 'en', 'Rama will rule for eleven thousand years and then reach heaven.', 'The vast span of years is the epic''s way of saying his reign was long and blessed.', '[{"word":"daśavarṣasahasra","meaning":"ten thousand years"},{"word":"brahmaloka","meaning":"world of Brahma"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-77', 'en', 'Reading Rama''s story purifies the heart.', 'The traditional promise of blessing for those who read the Ramayana.', '[{"word":"pavitra","meaning":"purifying"},{"word":"pāpaghna","meaning":"destroying sin"},{"word":"rāmacarita","meaning":"the deeds of Rama"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-78', 'en', 'The Ramayana brings long life and blessings.', 'The poem praises its own power to bless the reader and their family.', '[{"word":"āyuṣya","meaning":"giving long life"},{"word":"svarga","meaning":"heaven"},{"word":"mahīyate","meaning":"is honoured"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-1-79', 'en', 'The Ramayana benefits everyone who reads it.', 'The chapter closes by saying the story is for all people, of every walk of life.', '[{"word":"vāgṛṣabhatva","meaning":"mastery of speech"},{"word":"bhūmipati","meaning":"lord of land"},{"word":"mahattva","meaning":"greatness"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-1', 'en', 'Valmiki thanked and honoured Narada.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 2: how the first verse of poetry was born.', '[{"word":"pūjayām āsa","meaning":"honoured"},{"word":"śiṣya","meaning":"disciple"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-2', 'en', 'Narada departed through the sky.', 'Narada, the wandering sage, returns to the heavens.', '[{"word":"devarṣi","meaning":"divine sage"},{"word":"vihāyas","meaning":"sky"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-3', 'en', 'Valmiki went to the river Tamasa.', 'The setting moves to a quiet river near Valmiki''s hermitage.', '[{"word":"tamasā","meaning":"a river"},{"word":"jāhnavī","meaning":"the Ganga"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-4', 'en', 'He found a clear bathing spot.', 'Valmiki is about to bathe.', '[{"word":"tīrtha","meaning":"bathing place"},{"word":"akardama","meaning":"free of mud"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-5', 'en', 'The clear water is like a good person''s mind.', 'A gentle image: a pure heart is like clear, calm water.', '[{"word":"prasannāmbu","meaning":"clear water"},{"word":"sanmanuṣya","meaning":"good person"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-6', 'en', 'Valmiki prepares to bathe.', 'Hermits wore garments made of tree bark.', '[{"word":"kalaśa","meaning":"water pot"},{"word":"valkala","meaning":"bark garment"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-7', 'en', 'The disciple handed him his garment.', 'Bharadvaja here is Valmiki''s disciple, not the sage of the same name met later by Rama.', '[{"word":"guru","meaning":"teacher"},{"word":"niyata","meaning":"attentive"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-8', 'en', 'Valmiki walked and admired the forest.', 'A peaceful moment before the event that changes everything.', '[{"word":"vana","meaning":"forest"},{"word":"vipula","meaning":"wide"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-9', 'en', 'He saw a loving pair of birds.', 'The krauncha birds are a devoted pair, often understood as cranes.', '[{"word":"mithuna","meaning":"pair"},{"word":"krauñca","meaning":"a crane-like bird"},{"word":"anapāyin","meaning":"inseparable"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-10', 'en', 'A hunter shot the male bird.', 'A sudden act of cruelty.', '[{"word":"niṣāda","meaning":"hunter"},{"word":"jaghāna","meaning":"killed"},{"word":"pāpaniścaya","meaning":"bent on evil"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-11', 'en', 'The female cried over her dying mate.', 'Her grief mirrors the separation of Rama and Sita to come.', '[{"word":"śoṇita","meaning":"blood"},{"word":"karuṇa","meaning":"piteous"},{"word":"rurāva","meaning":"cried"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-12', 'en', 'Valmiki was moved to deep pity.', 'Compassion (karuṇā) is the emotional seed of the whole Ramayana.', '[{"word":"kāruṇya","meaning":"compassion"},{"word":"dharmātman","meaning":"righteous"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-13', 'en', 'He judged the act wrong and spoke out.', 'His words are about to become the first verse of poetry.', '[{"word":"adharma","meaning":"wrong"},{"word":"rudatī","meaning":"weeping"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-14', 'en', 'Valmiki''s grief burst out as a curse in verse.', 'This is traditionally called the first śloka, the first verse of classical Sanskrit poetry.', '[{"word":"mā","meaning":"may not"},{"word":"pratiṣṭhā","meaning":"rest, standing"},{"word":"śāśvatīḥ samāḥ","meaning":"endless years"},{"word":"kāmamohita","meaning":"lost in love"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-15', 'en', 'Valmiki wondered at what he had said.', 'He realizes his words came out in a new rhythmic form.', '[{"word":"cintā","meaning":"thought"},{"word":"vyāhṛta","meaning":"uttered"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-16', 'en', 'He reflected and spoke to his disciple.', 'He is beginning to understand what has happened.', '[{"word":"mati","meaning":"decision"},{"word":"munipuṃgava","meaning":"best of sages"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-17', 'en', 'Grief (śoka) gave birth to verse (śloka).', 'A famous wordplay: the poem''s verse form, the śloka, is born from śoka, sorrow.', '[{"word":"pādabaddha","meaning":"bound in feet"},{"word":"akṣarasama","meaning":"equal syllables"},{"word":"śloka","meaning":"verse"},{"word":"śoka","meaning":"grief"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-18', 'en', 'The disciple learned the verse by heart.', 'The verse is passed on immediately.', '[{"word":"pratijagrāha","meaning":"received"},{"word":"tuṣṭa","meaning":"pleased"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-19', 'en', 'Valmiki bathed and went home, still thinking.', 'The verse stays in his mind.', '[{"word":"abhiṣeka","meaning":"bathing"},{"word":"yathāvidhi","meaning":"properly"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-20', 'en', 'The disciple followed with the water pot.', 'A picture of respectful discipleship.', '[{"word":"vinīta","meaning":"humble"},{"word":"pūrṇa kalaśa","meaning":"full pot"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-21', 'en', 'Valmiki returned home and meditated.', 'He tries to go on with ordinary life, but turns inward.', '[{"word":"āśramapada","meaning":"hermitage"},{"word":"dhyāna","meaning":"meditation"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-22', 'en', 'Brahma, the creator, came to visit Valmiki.', 'The creator god''s visit shows how important the moment is.', '[{"word":"brahmā","meaning":"the creator god"},{"word":"caturmukha","meaning":"four-faced"},{"word":"lokakartā","meaning":"creator of worlds"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-23', 'en', 'Valmiki stood in awe before Brahma.', 'Folded hands (añjali) are a gesture of reverence.', '[{"word":"prāñjali","meaning":"with folded hands"},{"word":"vismita","meaning":"amazed"},{"word":"vāgyata","meaning":"silent"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-24', 'en', 'Valmiki welcomed Brahma as an honoured guest.', 'Traditional hospitality is offered even to a god.', '[{"word":"pādya","meaning":"water for feet"},{"word":"arghya","meaning":"guest offering"},{"word":"āsana","meaning":"seat"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-25', 'en', 'Brahma sat and invited Valmiki to sit.', 'The creator treats the sage with kindness.', '[{"word":"āsana","meaning":"seat"},{"word":"saṃdideśa","meaning":"directed"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-26', 'en', 'Even before Brahma, Valmiki kept thinking of the birds.', 'The image of the grieving bird will not leave him.', '[{"word":"lokapitāmaha","meaning":"grandfather of the worlds"},{"word":"dhyāna","meaning":"reflection"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-27', 'en', 'He grieved at the senseless cruelty.', 'Valmiki''s empathy for the bird is total.', '[{"word":"kaṣṭa","meaning":"cruel"},{"word":"akāraṇāt","meaning":"for no reason"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-28', 'en', 'He repeated the verse in sorrow.', 'The verse becomes a song.', '[{"word":"upaśloka","meaning":"verse"},{"word":"jagau","meaning":"sang"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-29', 'en', 'Brahma said: yes, you have created poetry.', 'Brahma confirms that this is a new form of verse.', '[{"word":"prahasan","meaning":"smiling"},{"word":"baddha","meaning":"composed"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-30', 'en', 'Brahma asked Valmiki to write the story of Rama.', 'Sarasvati, the goddess of speech, here means the gift of poetry.', '[{"word":"sarasvatī","meaning":"speech, poetry"},{"word":"carita","meaning":"story"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-31', 'en', 'Tell Rama''s story as Narada told it.', 'Narada''s summary will be the outline.', '[{"word":"vṛtta","meaning":"life story"},{"word":"dhīra","meaning":"steadfast"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-32', 'en', 'All of Rama''s deeds, public and private, will be known to you.', 'Brahma promises Valmiki full knowledge of events.', '[{"word":"rahasya","meaning":"secret"},{"word":"prakāśa","meaning":"known, public"},{"word":"saumitri","meaning":"Lakshmana"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-33', 'en', 'Valmiki will know even Sita''s private story.', 'This gives the poem its authority.', '[{"word":"vaidehī","meaning":"Sita"},{"word":"vidita","meaning":"known"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-34', 'en', 'Every word of your poem will be true.', 'Brahma blesses the poem with truthfulness.', '[{"word":"anṛta","meaning":"untrue"},{"word":"kāvya","meaning":"poem"},{"word":"manorama","meaning":"delightful"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-35', 'en', 'The Ramayana will last as long as mountains and rivers.', 'One of the best-known blessings in the epic, often recited.', '[{"word":"giri","meaning":"mountains"},{"word":"sarit","meaning":"rivers"},{"word":"pracariṣyati","meaning":"will spread"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-36', 'en', 'Valmiki will dwell in the heavens as long as his story is told.', 'The poet''s reward is linked to his poem''s life.', '[{"word":"nivatsyasi","meaning":"you will dwell"},{"word":"mal-loka","meaning":"my worlds"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-37', 'en', 'Brahma vanished, leaving all amazed.', 'The vision ends.', '[{"word":"antaradhīyata","meaning":"vanished"},{"word":"vismaya","meaning":"wonder"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-38', 'en', 'The disciples kept singing the verse.', 'The verse is shared and celebrated.', '[{"word":"jaguḥ","meaning":"sang"},{"word":"prīyamāṇa","meaning":"delighted"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-39', 'en', 'Grief turned into verse.', 'The disciples repeat the theme: sorrow transformed into art.', '[{"word":"pāda","meaning":"foot"},{"word":"śokaḥ ślokatvam āgataḥ","meaning":"grief became verse"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-40', 'en', 'Valmiki decided to compose the Ramayana in this form.', 'The epic is born.', '[{"word":"bhāvitātman","meaning":"purified mind"},{"word":"kṛtsna","meaning":"whole"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-2-41', 'en', 'Valmiki composed the Ramayana.', 'The chapter ends: the first poet, the ādikavi, has written the first poem.', '[{"word":"kīrtimān","meaning":"famous"},{"word":"yaśaskara","meaning":"bringing glory"},{"word":"udāra","meaning":"noble"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-1', 'en', 'Valmiki sought a clear inner vision of Rama''s life.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"samagra","meaning":"whole"},{"word":"vyakta","meaning":"clear"},{"word":"anveṣate","meaning":"seeks"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-2', 'en', 'Valmiki meditated to see the story clearly.', 'Through meditation he sees every event, as Brahma promised.', '[{"word":"darbha","meaning":"sacred grass"},{"word":"kṛtāñjali","meaning":"with folded hands"},{"word":"gati","meaning":"course of events"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-3', 'en', 'The poem will tell of Rama''s birth and character.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"janma","meaning":"birth"},{"word":"kṣānti","meaning":"patience"},{"word":"satyaśīlatā","meaning":"truthfulness"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-4', 'en', 'It will tell of Rama''s journey with Vishvamitra and his marriage to Sita.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"viśvāmitra","meaning":"a sage"},{"word":"jānakī","meaning":"Sita"},{"word":"dhanus","meaning":"bow"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-5', 'en', 'It will tell of Parashurama''s challenge and Kaikeyi''s scheming.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"rāma-rāma-vivāda","meaning":"dispute of the two Ramas"},{"word":"abhiṣeka","meaning":"coronation"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-6', 'en', 'It will tell of the exile and Dasharatha''s death.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"vivāsana","meaning":"exile"},{"word":"śoka","meaning":"grief"},{"word":"paraloka","meaning":"next world"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-7', 'en', 'It will tell of the people''s grief and Rama''s meeting with Guha.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"prakṛti","meaning":"the people"},{"word":"niṣādādhipa","meaning":"Guha, chief of the Nishadas"},{"word":"sūta","meaning":"charioteer"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-8', 'en', 'It will tell of crossing the Ganga and reaching Chitrakuta.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"saṃtāra","meaning":"crossing"},{"word":"citrakūṭa","meaning":"a hill"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-9', 'en', 'It will tell of Bharata''s visit and the rites for Dasharatha.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"bharatāgamana","meaning":"Bharata''s arrival"},{"word":"salilakriyā","meaning":"water offering for the dead"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-10', 'en', 'It will tell of Bharata ruling with Rama''s sandals and Rama entering Dandaka.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"pādukā","meaning":"sandals"},{"word":"daṇḍakāraṇya","meaning":"Dandaka forest"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-11', 'en', 'It will tell of Anasuya''s gift to Sita and the Shurpanakha episode.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"anasūyā","meaning":"sage Atri''s wife"},{"word":"aṅgarāga","meaning":"ointment"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-12', 'en', 'It will tell of the battles and Sita''s abduction.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"utthāna","meaning":"rising up"},{"word":"haraṇa","meaning":"abduction"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-13', 'en', 'It will tell of Rama''s grief and Jatayu''s death.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"gṛdhrarāja","meaning":"king of vultures"},{"word":"nibarhaṇa","meaning":"killing"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-14', 'en', 'It will tell of Shabari, Hanuman and Rama''s sorrow at Pampa.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"śabarī","meaning":"devoted ascetic"},{"word":"hanūmat","meaning":"Hanuman"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-15', 'en', 'It will tell of the alliance with Sugriva.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"ṛṣyamūka","meaning":"a mountain"},{"word":"sakhya","meaning":"friendship"},{"word":"vigraha","meaning":"fight"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-16', 'en', 'It will tell of Vali''s death and the monsoon wait.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"tārā","meaning":"Vali''s wife"},{"word":"varṣarātra","meaning":"rainy season"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-17', 'en', 'It will tell of the search parties sent across the earth.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"kopa","meaning":"anger"},{"word":"bala","meaning":"forces"},{"word":"diś","meaning":"directions"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-18', 'en', 'It will tell of the ring, the cave, the despair and Sampati''s help.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"aṅgulīyaka","meaning":"ring"},{"word":"prāyopaveśana","meaning":"fasting to death"},{"word":"saṃpāti","meaning":"Jatayu''s brother"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-19', 'en', 'It will tell of Hanuman''s leap and his night search in Lanka.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"laṅghana","meaning":"leap"},{"word":"praveśa","meaning":"entry"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-20', 'en', 'It will tell of Hanuman finding Sita.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"āpānabhūmi","meaning":"drinking hall"},{"word":"avarodha","meaning":"women''s quarters"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-21', 'en', 'It will tell of Hanuman meeting Sita and Trijata''s dream.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"trijaṭā","meaning":"a kind demoness"},{"word":"svapna","meaning":"dream"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-22', 'en', 'It will tell of Sita''s jewel and Hanuman''s fight.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"maṇi","meaning":"jewel"},{"word":"vṛkṣabhaṅga","meaning":"breaking trees"},{"word":"kiṃkara","meaning":"servants"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-23', 'en', 'It will tell of Lanka''s burning and the monkeys'' celebration.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"vāyusūnu","meaning":"son of the Wind, Hanuman"},{"word":"dāha","meaning":"burning"},{"word":"madhu","meaning":"honey"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-24', 'en', 'It will tell of the bridge to Lanka.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"āśvāsana","meaning":"comforting"},{"word":"setu","meaning":"bridge"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-25', 'en', 'It will tell of the siege and Vibhishana''s alliance.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"avarodhana","meaning":"siege"},{"word":"saṃsarga","meaning":"alliance"},{"word":"upāya","meaning":"means"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-26', 'en', 'It will tell of the great battle and Sita''s rescue.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"kumbhakarṇa","meaning":"Ravana''s brother"},{"word":"meghanāda","meaning":"Ravana''s son, Indrajit"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-27', 'en', 'It will tell of the return to Ayodhya.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"puṣpaka","meaning":"flying chariot"},{"word":"samāgama","meaning":"reunion"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-28', 'en', 'It will tell of Rama''s reign and Sita''s banishment.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"abhyudaya","meaning":"rise"},{"word":"rañjana","meaning":"pleasing"},{"word":"visarjana","meaning":"sending away"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-3-29', 'en', 'Later events are told in the final book.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 3 lists, like a table of contents, the episodes Valmiki will put into his poem.', '[{"word":"anāgata","meaning":"still to come"},{"word":"uttara kāvya","meaning":"last part of the poem"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-1', 'en', 'Valmiki composed the full epic.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 4: Rama''s twin sons, Kusha and Lava, first sing the Ramayana.', '[{"word":"carita","meaning":"life story"},{"word":"vicitrapada","meaning":"wonderful words"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-2', 'en', 'Valmiki wondered who would recite the poem.', 'An epic needs singers to carry it to people.', '[{"word":"prayuñjīyāt","meaning":"would perform"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-3', 'en', 'Kusha and Lava came to him.', 'Kusha and Lava are Rama and Sita''s twin sons, raised in Valmiki''s hermitage.', '[{"word":"kuśīlavau","meaning":"Kusha and Lava"},{"word":"muniveṣa","meaning":"dressed as sages"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-4', 'en', 'The twins were princes with lovely voices.', 'They do not yet know their father is Rama.', '[{"word":"rājaputra","meaning":"princes"},{"word":"svarasaṃpanna","meaning":"with fine voices"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-5', 'en', 'Valmiki taught them the poem.', 'The Ramayana is meant to carry the Vedas'' values in story form.', '[{"word":"medhāvin","meaning":"intelligent"},{"word":"upabṛṃhaṇa","meaning":"enriching"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-6', 'en', 'The epic is the Ramayana, Sita''s great story, and Ravana''s end.', 'Paulastya means Ravana, descendant of the sage Pulastya. The verse notes the poem''s other names.', '[{"word":"paulastya","meaning":"Ravana"},{"word":"vadha","meaning":"slaying"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-7', 'en', 'The poem is musical, meant to be sung.', 'Valmiki''s verses were composed to be performed with music.', '[{"word":"pāṭhya","meaning":"to recite"},{"word":"geya","meaning":"to sing"},{"word":"jāti","meaning":"musical modes"},{"word":"tantrī","meaning":"lute"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-8', 'en', 'It contains every emotion.', 'The ''rasas'' are the classic moods of Indian art.', '[{"word":"rasa","meaning":"mood, flavour"},{"word":"karuṇa","meaning":"compassion"},{"word":"vīra","meaning":"heroism"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-9', 'en', 'The twins were skilled musicians.', 'Gandharvas are celestial musicians.', '[{"word":"gāndharva","meaning":"music"},{"word":"mūrcchanā","meaning":"scale"},{"word":"sthāna","meaning":"pitch"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-10', 'en', 'The twins looked just like Rama.', 'A hint of who they really are.', '[{"word":"bimba","meaning":"image"},{"word":"rāmadeha","meaning":"Rama''s body"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-11', 'en', 'They memorized the entire poem.', 'The Ramayana was passed on orally.', '[{"word":"aninditau","meaning":"blameless"},{"word":"dharmya","meaning":"righteous"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-12', 'en', 'They sang it at gatherings of sages.', 'They begin performing for audiences.', '[{"word":"samāgama","meaning":"gathering"},{"word":"samāhita","meaning":"focused"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-13', 'en', 'They sang before an assembly of sages.', 'The first great performance.', '[{"word":"sameta","meaning":"assembled"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-14', 'en', 'The sages wept and praised them.', 'The poem''s power to move the heart is shown at once.', '[{"word":"bāṣpa","meaning":"tears"},{"word":"sādhu","meaning":"excellent"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-15', 'en', 'The sages praised the twins.', 'Their singing is as admired as the poem.', '[{"word":"praśaśaṃsuḥ","meaning":"praised"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-16', 'en', 'The poem makes the past feel present.', 'Good poetry brings old events to life.', '[{"word":"mādhurya","meaning":"sweetness"},{"word":"pratyakṣa","meaning":"before the eyes"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-17', 'en', 'They sang with deep feeling.', 'They give themselves fully to the emotion of the story.', '[{"word":"bhāva","meaning":"feeling"},{"word":"rakta","meaning":"moving"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-18', 'en', 'Encouraged, they sang even better.', 'Praise from the wise inspires them.', '[{"word":"ślāghya","meaning":"worthy of praise"},{"word":"saṃraktatara","meaning":"more moving"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-19', 'en', 'The sages gave them simple gifts.', 'Hermits give what little they have.', '[{"word":"kalaśa","meaning":"water pot"},{"word":"valkala","meaning":"bark garment"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-20', 'en', 'The Ramayana is a foundation for all later poets.', 'It is called the ādikāvya, the first poem.', '[{"word":"ādhāra","meaning":"foundation"},{"word":"kavi","meaning":"poet"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-21', 'en', 'Rama saw the twins singing in the streets.', 'Father and sons meet without knowing it.', '[{"word":"rathyā","meaning":"streets"},{"word":"rājamārga","meaning":"royal roads"},{"word":"bharatāgraja","meaning":"Bharata''s elder brother"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-22', 'en', 'Rama welcomed them to the palace.', 'He senses they are special.', '[{"word":"veśman","meaning":"palace"},{"word":"pūjārha","meaning":"worthy of honour"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-23', 'en', 'Rama sat on his throne with his court.', 'The scene is set for the performance.', '[{"word":"siṃhāsana","meaning":"throne"},{"word":"saciva","meaning":"minister"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-24', 'en', 'Rama addressed his brothers.', 'He invites the court to listen.', '[{"word":"vīṇin","meaning":"lute player"},{"word":"śatrughna","meaning":"Rama''s youngest brother"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-25', 'en', 'Rama asked everyone to listen.', 'Rama is about to hear his own story.', '[{"word":"devavarcas","meaning":"shining like gods"},{"word":"madhurasvara","meaning":"sweet-voiced"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-26', 'en', 'Rama noticed they had royal marks.', 'He does not yet realize they are his sons.', '[{"word":"pārthivalakṣaṇa","meaning":"marks of a king"},{"word":"bhūtikara","meaning":"bringing fortune"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-4-27', 'en', 'The twins sang, and Rama was drawn into the story.', 'The frame is now complete: the rest of the epic is the song Rama hears.', '[{"word":"mārga","meaning":"classical style"},{"word":"pariṣad","meaning":"assembly"},{"word":"āsakta","meaning":"absorbed"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-1', 'en', 'The earth was ruled by a line of great kings.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya. The Ikshvaku line traces back to the creator.', '[{"word":"pṛthivī","meaning":"earth"},{"word":"nṛpa","meaning":"king"},{"word":"jayaśālin","meaning":"victorious"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-2', 'en', 'King Sagara, ancestor of Rama, belonged to this line.', 'The ocean (sāgara) is said to take its name from King Sagara, whose sons dug it out. The story is told later in Bala Kanda.', '[{"word":"sagara","meaning":"an ancestor king"},{"word":"sāgara","meaning":"ocean"},{"word":"ṣaṣṭi sahasra","meaning":"sixty thousand"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-3', 'en', 'The Ramayana is the story of this royal family.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"vaṃśa","meaning":"lineage"},{"word":"ākhyāna","meaning":"tale"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-4', 'en', 'The poet asks us to listen with an open heart.', 'The three aims of life, dharma, artha and kāma, are all part of the story.', '[{"word":"dharma","meaning":"right conduct"},{"word":"kāma","meaning":"pleasure"},{"word":"artha","meaning":"wealth"},{"word":"anasūyā","meaning":"without envy"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-5', 'en', 'Kosala was a rich and happy land on the Sarayu river.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"kosala","meaning":"Rama''s kingdom"},{"word":"sarayū","meaning":"a river"},{"word":"dhānya","meaning":"grain"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-6', 'en', 'Ayodhya was founded by Manu, the first king.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"ayodhyā","meaning":"Rama''s capital"},{"word":"manu","meaning":"the first king and lawgiver"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-7', 'en', 'Ayodhya was vast and well planned.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"yojana","meaning":"a measure of distance"},{"word":"mahāpatha","meaning":"main road"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-8', 'en', 'Its streets were clean and decked with flowers.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"rājamārga","meaning":"royal road"},{"word":"jalasikta","meaning":"sprinkled with water"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-9', 'en', 'Dasharatha ruled Ayodhya like Indra in heaven.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"devapati","meaning":"lord of the gods, Indra"},{"word":"mahārāṣṭra","meaning":"great kingdom"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-10', 'en', 'The city had gates, markets, defences and skilled workers.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"toraṇa","meaning":"gateway"},{"word":"āpaṇa","meaning":"market"},{"word":"śilpin","meaning":"craftsman"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-11', 'en', 'Ayodhya was lively and well defended.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"sūta-māgadha","meaning":"bards and heralds"},{"word":"aṭṭāla","meaning":"towers"},{"word":"śataghnī","meaning":"a defensive weapon"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-12', 'en', 'The city had theatres, gardens and strong walls.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"nāṭaka","meaning":"drama"},{"word":"udyāna","meaning":"garden"},{"word":"sāla","meaning":"wall"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-13', 'en', 'Ayodhya was safe and full of animals.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"parikhā","meaning":"moat"},{"word":"durāsada","meaning":"impregnable"},{"word":"vāji","meaning":"horses"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-14', 'en', 'Kings paid tribute and traders came from afar.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"sāmanta","meaning":"vassal king"},{"word":"bali","meaning":"tribute"},{"word":"vaṇij","meaning":"merchant"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-15', 'en', 'Its palaces sparkled like the city of the gods.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"prāsāda","meaning":"palace"},{"word":"amarāvatī","meaning":"Indra''s city"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-16', 'en', 'The city was laid out in an orderly grid.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"aṣṭāpada","meaning":"chessboard"},{"word":"vimāna","meaning":"mansion"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-17', 'en', 'It had plenty of rice and sweet water.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"śāli","meaning":"fine rice"},{"word":"ikṣu","meaning":"sugar cane"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-18', 'en', 'Music filled the city.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"dundubhi","meaning":"drum"},{"word":"mṛdaṅga","meaning":"tabor"},{"word":"vīṇā","meaning":"lute"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-19', 'en', 'Ayodhya was like a heavenly abode.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"siddha","meaning":"perfected beings"},{"word":"tapas","meaning":"austerity"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-20', 'en', 'Its warriors were skilled and honourable.', 'They followed a warrior''s code, never attacking the defenceless.', '[{"word":"śabdavedhya","meaning":"hitting by sound"},{"word":"laghuhasta","meaning":"quick-handed"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-21', 'en', 'They were strong enough to face wild beasts.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"siṃha","meaning":"lion"},{"word":"vyāghra","meaning":"tiger"},{"word":"varāha","meaning":"boar"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-22', 'en', 'Dasharatha filled the city with brave warriors.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"mahāratha","meaning":"great chariot-warrior"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-5-23', 'en', 'Ayodhya was home to many learned and truthful sages.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 5: the poem begins with a description of the great city of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"agnimat","meaning":"keeper of sacred fires"},{"word":"ṣaḍaṅga","meaning":"six branches of the Vedas"},{"word":"satyarata","meaning":"devoted to truth"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-1', 'en', 'Dasharatha was wise, far-sighted and loved by his people.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"dīrghadarśin","meaning":"far-sighted"},{"word":"paura-jānapada","meaning":"city and country folk"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-2', 'en', 'Dasharatha was a righteous royal sage.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"rājarṣi","meaning":"royal sage"},{"word":"yajvan","meaning":"performer of sacrifices"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-3', 'en', 'He was strong, had many friends and great wealth.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"vijitendriya","meaning":"master of the senses"},{"word":"śakra","meaning":"Indra"},{"word":"vaiśravaṇa","meaning":"Kubera"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-4', 'en', 'Dasharatha protected his people like Manu.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"manu","meaning":"the first king"},{"word":"parirakṣitā","meaning":"protector"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-5', 'en', 'He ruled faithfully, balancing dharma, wealth and pleasure.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"trivarga","meaning":"the three aims of life"},{"word":"satyābhisaṃdha","meaning":"true to his word"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-6', 'en', 'The people were content, honest and wise.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"alubdha","meaning":"free of greed"},{"word":"satyavādin","meaning":"truthful"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-7', 'en', 'No one in Ayodhya was poor.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"kuṭumbin","meaning":"householder"},{"word":"dhana","meaning":"wealth"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-8', 'en', 'No one was greedy, cruel or ignorant.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"kadarya","meaning":"miser"},{"word":"nṛśaṃsa","meaning":"cruel"},{"word":"nāstika","meaning":"unbeliever"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-9', 'en', 'Everyone lived with goodness and joy.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"dharmaśīla","meaning":"righteous"},{"word":"śīla","meaning":"character"},{"word":"vṛtta","meaning":"conduct"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-10', 'en', 'Everyone lived in comfort and dignity.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"kuṇḍala","meaning":"earrings"},{"word":"mukuṭa","meaning":"crown"},{"word":"sragvin","meaning":"wearing garlands"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-11', 'en', 'All were well fed, generous and self-controlled.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"adātṛ","meaning":"one who does not give"},{"word":"anātmavat","meaning":"lacking self-control"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-12', 'en', 'Every priest lived up to his duties.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"āhitāgni","meaning":"keeper of sacred fire"},{"word":"saṃkara","meaning":"mixing of duties"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-13', 'en', 'The learned lived simply and gave freely.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"dāna","meaning":"giving"},{"word":"adhyayana","meaning":"study"},{"word":"pratigraha","meaning":"accepting gifts"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-14', 'en', 'Honesty and learning were everywhere.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"anṛtaka","meaning":"liar"},{"word":"asūyaka","meaning":"envious"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-15', 'en', 'No one was unhappy or disloyal.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"dīna","meaning":"miserable"},{"word":"vyathita","meaning":"distressed"},{"word":"bhakti","meaning":"loyalty"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-16', 'en', 'All honoured gods and guests and lived by truth.', 'Honouring guests is a deep value in Indian tradition.', '[{"word":"varṇa","meaning":"social class"},{"word":"atithi","meaning":"guest"},{"word":"dīrghāyus","meaning":"long-lived"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-17', 'en', 'Each group in society kept to its own role.', 'This describes the ancient ideal of social order as the poem''s world saw it. Modern readers view such hierarchy critically; the verse is given here as part of the text.', '[{"word":"kṣatra","meaning":"warriors"},{"word":"vaiśya","meaning":"merchants"},{"word":"śūdra","meaning":"labourers"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-18', 'en', 'Dasharatha protected the city as Manu had.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"suparirakṣita","meaning":"well protected"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-19', 'en', 'Its soldiers were fierce and well trained.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"yodha","meaning":"warrior"},{"word":"guhākesarin","meaning":"lion in a cave"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-20', 'en', 'It had fine horses from distant lands.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"kāmboja, bāhlīka","meaning":"regions famous for horses"},{"word":"haya","meaning":"horse"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-21', 'en', 'It had great elephants from the mountains.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"vindhya","meaning":"a mountain range"},{"word":"mātaṅga","meaning":"elephant"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-22', 'en', 'Many noble breeds of elephants lived there.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"dvipa","meaning":"elephant"},{"word":"bhadra, mandra, mṛga","meaning":"elephant breeds"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-23', 'en', 'Ayodhya, ''the unconquerable'', lived up to its name.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"satyanāmā","meaning":"true to its name"},{"word":"ayodhyā","meaning":"unconquerable"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-6-24', 'en', 'Dasharatha ruled a strong and happy city.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 6: King Dasharatha and the happy, virtuous people of Ayodhya.', '[{"word":"argala","meaning":"bars"},{"word":"śiva","meaning":"auspicious"},{"word":"śaśāsa","meaning":"ruled"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-1', 'en', 'Dasharatha had eight loyal ministers.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"amātya","meaning":"minister"},{"word":"anurakta","meaning":"loyal"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-2', 'en', 'The ministers are named; Sumantra is the eighth.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"sumantra","meaning":"chief minister and charioteer"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-3', 'en', 'Vasishtha and Vamadeva were his priests.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"ṛtvij","meaning":"priest"},{"word":"vasiṣṭha","meaning":"royal guru"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-4', 'en', 'The ministers were learned, brave and dutiful.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"śāstrajña","meaning":"learned in the sciences"},{"word":"dṛḍhavikrama","meaning":"firm in courage"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-5', 'en', 'They were honest and always spoke kindly.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"smitapūrvābhibhāṣin","meaning":"speaking with a smile"},{"word":"anṛta","meaning":"lie"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-6', 'en', 'They knew all that was happening.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"cāra","meaning":"spy"},{"word":"cikīrṣita","meaning":"planned"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-7', 'en', 'They were fair, even to their own children.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"daṇḍa","meaning":"punishment"},{"word":"vyavahāra","meaning":"affairs"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-8', 'en', 'They were careful and just, never harming the innocent.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"kośa","meaning":"treasury"},{"word":"bala","meaning":"army"},{"word":"adūṣaka","meaning":"innocent"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-9', 'en', 'They followed good government and protected the people.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"rājaśāstra","meaning":"science of kingship"},{"word":"viṣayavāsin","meaning":"people of the land"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-10', 'en', 'They taxed fairly and punished justly.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"saṃprekṣya","meaning":"having weighed"},{"word":"balābala","meaning":"strength and weakness"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-11', 'en', 'Their honesty set the tone for the kingdom.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"mṛṣāvādin","meaning":"liar"},{"word":"ekabuddhi","meaning":"of one mind"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-12', 'en', 'The kingdom was moral and peaceful.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"paradāra","meaning":"another''s wife"},{"word":"praśānta","meaning":"peaceful"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-13', 'en', 'They watched over the king''s interests.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"nayacakṣus","meaning":"eye of policy"},{"word":"hita","meaning":"welfare"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-14', 'en', 'They were respected even abroad.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"buddhiniścaya","meaning":"sound judgement"},{"word":"parākrama","meaning":"courage"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-15', 'en', 'Good ministers helped Dasharatha rule well.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"anagha","meaning":"sinless"},{"word":"vasuṃdharā","meaning":"earth"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-16', 'en', 'He ruled justly and had no equal.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"rañjayan","meaning":"pleasing"},{"word":"viśiṣṭa","meaning":"greater"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-7-17', 'en', 'With wise advisers the king shone like the sun.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 7: Dasharatha''s wise and honest ministers.', '[{"word":"arka","meaning":"sun"},{"word":"dīpti","meaning":"brilliance"},{"word":"go","meaning":"rays"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-1', 'en', 'Dasharatha had no son and heir.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"suta","meaning":"son"},{"word":"vaṃśakara","meaning":"one who continues the line"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-2', 'en', 'He decided to perform a horse sacrifice to gain a son.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"vājimedha","meaning":"horse sacrifice"},{"word":"yajāmi","meaning":"I sacrifice"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-3', 'en', 'He agreed on the plan with his ministers.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"niścitā mati","meaning":"firm decision"},{"word":"kṛtātman","meaning":"self-possessed"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-4', 'en', 'He sent Sumantra to call the priests.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"purohita","meaning":"royal priest"},{"word":"guru","meaning":"teacher"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-5', 'en', 'Sumantra remembered an old story.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"rahaḥ","meaning":"privately"},{"word":"purāvṛtta","meaning":"ancient story"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-6', 'en', 'A sage had once foretold the birth of Dasharatha''s sons.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"sanatkumāra","meaning":"an ancient sage"},{"word":"putrāgama","meaning":"coming of sons"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-7', 'en', 'The prophecy concerns Rishyashringa, Vibhandaka''s son.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"ṛśyaśṛṅga","meaning":"a sage, lit. ''deer-horned''"},{"word":"vibhāṇḍaka","meaning":"his father"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-8', 'en', 'Rishyashringa grew up alone in the forest with his father.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"vanacara","meaning":"forest-dweller"},{"word":"pitranuvartana","meaning":"following his father"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-9', 'en', 'He would be known for strict student life.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"brahmacarya","meaning":"celibate student life"},{"word":"dvaividhya","meaning":"twofold"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-10', 'en', 'He will spend years serving the fire and his father.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"śuśrūṣamāṇa","meaning":"serving"},{"word":"agni","meaning":"sacred fire"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-11', 'en', 'Lomapada will rule the land of Anga.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"lomapāda","meaning":"king of Anga"},{"word":"aṅga","meaning":"a kingdom"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-12', 'en', 'A wrong by King Lomapada will bring a drought.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"vyatikrama","meaning":"transgression"},{"word":"anāvṛṣṭi","meaning":"drought"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-13', 'en', 'The king will seek advice from wise priests.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"śrutavṛddha","meaning":"old in learning"},{"word":"duḥkha","meaning":"grief"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-14', 'en', 'He will ask how to atone.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"prāyaścitta","meaning":"atonement"},{"word":"niyama","meaning":"rule"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-15', 'en', 'The priests will say: bring Rishyashringa here.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"vedapāraga","meaning":"master of the Vedas"},{"word":"sarvopāya","meaning":"every means"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-16', 'en', 'They will advise marrying Shanta to him.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"śāntā","meaning":"Lomapada''s foster daughter"},{"word":"kanyā","meaning":"daughter"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-17', 'en', 'The king will wonder how to bring the sage.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"cintā","meaning":"worry"},{"word":"upāya","meaning":"means"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-8-18', 'en', 'The king will send his priest and ministers.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 8: childless Dasharatha plans a horse sacrifice, and Sumantra recalls an old prophecy about the sage Rishyashringa.', '[{"word":"preṣayiṣyati","meaning":"will send"},{"word":"satkṛta","meaning":"honoured"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
