('ramayana-1-42-19', 'en', 'They returned to heaven.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 42: Shiva catches the Ganga in his hair, and she follows Bhagiratha across the earth.', '[{"word":"dhūtapāpa","meaning":"sins washed away"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-42-20', 'en', 'People rejoiced and bathed.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 42: Shiva catches the Ganga in his hair, and she follows Bhagiratha across the earth.', '[{"word":"vigataklama","meaning":"free of weariness"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-42-21', 'en', 'Ganga followed Bhagiratha''s chariot.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 42: Shiva catches the Ganga in his hair, and she follows Bhagiratha across the earth.', '[{"word":"syandana","meaning":"chariot"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-42-22', 'en', 'All kinds of beings followed.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 42: Shiva catches the Ganga in his hair, and she follows Bhagiratha across the earth.', '[{"word":"mahoraga","meaning":"great serpent"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-42-23', 'en', 'Everyone followed joyfully.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 42: Shiva catches the Ganga in his hair, and she follows Bhagiratha across the earth.', '[{"word":"anvagaman","meaning":"followed"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-42-24', 'en', 'Ganga followed wherever he led.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 42: Shiva catches the Ganga in his hair, and she follows Bhagiratha across the earth.', '[{"word":"sarvapāpavināśinī","meaning":"destroyer of all sins"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-43-1', 'en', 'He led her to his ancestors'' ashes.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 43: the Ganga frees Sagara''s sons, and is named Bhagirathi.', '[{"word":"sāgara","meaning":"ocean"},{"word":"bhasmasāt","meaning":"turned to ash"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-43-2', 'en', 'Brahma spoke once the ashes were wet.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 43: the Ganga frees Sagara''s sons, and is named Bhagirathi.', '[{"word":"āpluta","meaning":"flooded"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-43-3', 'en', 'Sagara''s sons are freed.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 43: the Ganga frees Sagara''s sons, and is named Bhagirathi.', '[{"word":"tārita","meaning":"saved"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-43-4', 'en', 'They will stay in heaven forever.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 43: the Ganga frees Sagara''s sons, and is named Bhagirathi.', '[{"word":"sthāsyanti","meaning":"will remain"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
