('ramayana-1-43-20', 'en', 'Hearing this story brings blessings.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 43: the Ganga frees Sagara''s sons, and is named Bhagirathi.', '[{"word":"dhanya","meaning":"blessed"},{"word":"āyuṣya","meaning":"giving long life"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-44-1', 'en', 'Rama was amazed.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 44: they cross the Ganga to Vishala, and Vishvamitra tells of the churning of the ocean.', '[{"word":"vismaya","meaning":"wonder"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-44-2', 'en', 'What a wonderful story.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 44: they cross the Ganga to Vishala, and Vishvamitra tells of the churning of the ocean.', '[{"word":"pūraṇa","meaning":"filling"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
