('ramayana-1-44-21', 'en', 'Varuni, goddess of wine, appeared.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 44: they cross the Ganga to Vishala, and Vishvamitra tells of the churning of the ocean.', '[{"word":"vāruṇī","meaning":"goddess of wine"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
