('ramayana-1-45-15', 'en', 'Diti fell asleep in an impure posture.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 45: Diti''s austerity, and how Indra split her unborn child into seven.', '[{"word":"nidrā","meaning":"sleep"},{"word":"śīrṣa","meaning":"head"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-45-16', 'en', 'Indra saw his chance.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 45: Diti''s austerity, and how Indra split her unborn child into seven.', '[{"word":"aśuci","meaning":"impure"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-45-17', 'en', 'Indra split the unborn child into seven.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 45: Diti''s austerity, and how Indra split her unborn child into seven.', '[{"word":"saptadhā","meaning":"into seven"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-1-45-18', 'en', 'The child cried and Diti woke.', 'Bala Kanda, chapter 45: Diti''s austerity, and how Indra split her unborn child into seven.', '[{"word":"ruroda","meaning":"cried"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
