('ramayana-2-1-4', 'en', 'They say goodbye to the family.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"aklishtakarin","meaning":"acting without strain"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-5', 'en', 'They arrive in Kekaya.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-6', 'en', 'Bharata is loved in his mother''s home.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"Ashvapati","meaning":"king of Kekaya"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-7', 'en', 'They miss their father.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-8', 'en', 'Dasharatha misses them too.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"proshita","meaning":"absent"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-9', 'en', 'He loved all four sons as part of himself.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"bahu","meaning":"arm"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-10', 'en', 'Rama was his father''s special delight.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"ratikara","meaning":"giving joy"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-11', 'en', 'The two brothers serve their father.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-12', 'en', 'Rama helps govern well.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"paurakarya","meaning":"civic duties"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-13', 'en', 'He is attentive to every family member.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-14', 'en', 'Everyone is happy with Rama''s character.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"shila","meaning":"character"},{"word":"naigama","meaning":"merchant"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-15', 'en', 'Rama never returned harsh words.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"prashantatma","meaning":"calm-minded"},{"word":"parusha","meaning":"harsh"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-16', 'en', 'He remembered kindness and forgot injuries.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"upakara","meaning":"kindness"},{"word":"apakara","meaning":"wrong"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-17', 'en', 'He sought the company of the wise.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"sajjana","meaning":"good people"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-18', 'en', 'His upbringing shaped him.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"riju","meaning":"straightforward"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-19', 'en', 'He was wise in every part of life.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"dharma-artha-kama","meaning":"duty, wealth, pleasure"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-20', 'en', 'He was a fair judge of character.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"kritajna","meaning":"grateful"},{"word":"pragraha","meaning":"restraint"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-21', 'en', 'He was skilled in finance and learning.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"aya","meaning":"income"},{"word":"vyaya","meaning":"expense"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-22', 'en', 'He balanced enjoyment with duty.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"alasa","meaning":"lazy"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-23', 'en', 'He was a superb horseman and archer.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"dhanurveda","meaning":"science of archery"},{"word":"atiratha","meaning":"master warrior"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-24', 'en', 'He was a great general.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"senanaya","meaning":"army leadership"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-25', 'en', 'Inner qualities: no envy, anger or pride.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"anasuya","meaning":"free of envy"},{"word":"jitakrodha","meaning":"anger conquered"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-26', 'en', 'Rama combined patience, wisdom and courage.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[{"word":"kshama","meaning":"patience"},{"word":"Brihaspati","meaning":"teacher of the gods"}]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
('ramayana-2-1-27', 'en', 'He shone through his virtues.', 'Ayodhya Kanda, chapter 1: Bharata leaves to visit his uncle in Kekaya. Rama''s goodness, skill and gentle character are described at length, and Dasharatha, growing old, decides to make him crown prince.', '[]'::jsonb, 'veda-app-ai-draft', 'draft'),
