sāmnainam upāgād iti sādhunainam upāgād ity eva tad āhuḥ
asāmnainam upāgād ity eva tad āhuḥ', null, 2001002),
('chandogya-2-1-3', 3, 'Chapter 2, Section 1, Verse 3', 'अथोताप्याहुः।
